अ|अं|अः
अ The first letter of the alphabet, and inherent short vowel.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अ|अं|अः
अ ind.
	 1. NO, not.
	 2. A private, pr२ohibitive, and diminutive
particle.
	 3. An interjection of pity. It also implies degrees of
difference, and similarity. As a negative prefix to words
beginning with a vowel, अ is changed to अन्, as अ and अन्त
form अनन्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अ|अं|अः
अ m. (अः) A name of VIṢṆU.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अऋणिन्
अऋणिन् mfn. (-णी-णिणी-णि) Free from debt or obligation; also
अनृणिन्
 E. अ neg. ऋणिन् a debtor.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अंश|अंशः
अंश r. 10th cl. (अंशयति) To separate or divide. See अंस.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अंश|अंशः
अंश m. (-शः)
	 1. A share or portion.
	 2. A part.
	 3. A shoulder, the
shoulder blade.
	 4. (In arithmetic) a fraction.
	 5. The nume-
rator of a fraction.
	 6. A degree of latitude or longitude, &c.
See अंस.
 E. अंश to divide, अच् affix.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अंशक|अंशकं|अंशकः
अंशक m. (-कः) A kinsman, a relation, a co-heir.
	 n. (-कं) A day. E.
अंश to separate or divide, and वुन् affix.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अंशभाज्
अंशभाज् mfn. (भाक्) An heir, a co-heir, one who has a share or
portion.
 E. अंश and भाज् who possesses.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अंशन|अंशनं
अंशन n. (-नं) Dividing, sharing.
 E. अंश and युच् aff.
