अंशुमत्|अंशुमन्त्
अंशुमत् mfn. (-मान-मती-मत्)
	 1. Radiant, luminous.
	 2. Acuminated,
pointed.
	 m. (-मान्)
	 1. The sun.
	 2. A prince of the solar race, son
of ASAMANJAS, grandson of SĀGARA. (-ती) A plant, (Hedysarum
Gangeticum.)
 E. अंशु and मतुप् poss. aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=001-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
