अंस|अंसः
अंस m. (-सः)
	 1. A shoulder, a scapula.
	 2. A part, a portion.
 E. अंस to
divide, अच् aff. it is also written अंश.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=001-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
