अंसकूट|अंसकूटः
अंसकूट m. (-टः) A bull's hump, the protuberance between the shoul-
ders of the Indian ox.
 E. अंस the shoulder, and कूट a peak.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=001-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अंसल|अंसलः
अंसल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Strong, stout, lusty.
 E. अंस the shoulder, and
लच् aff. also written अंशल.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=001-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अंहति|अंहतिः
अंहति f. (-तिः)
	 1. A gift, a donation.
	 2. Sickness, disease.
	 3. Leaving,
abandoning.
	 4. A gift.
 E. अहि to go, क्तिन् affix or अंह for हन to kill,
and अति Uṇādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=001-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अंहती
अंहती f. (-ती) A gift or donation. E. See अंहति, इ being made long.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=001-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अंहस्
अंहस् n. (-हः) Sin. See अङ्घस्.
 E. अम to go, and the Uṇādi affix. असुन्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=001-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अंहिति|अंहितिः
अंहिति f. (-तिः) A gift or donation. E. See अंहति, इट् being inserted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=001-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अंह्रि|अंह्रिः
अंह्रि m. (-ह्रिः)
	 1. A foot.
	 2. The root of a tree.
 E. अहि to go, and क्रिण्
Uṇādi affix: also अङ्घ्रि.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=001-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अंह्रिप|अंह्रिपः
अंह्रिप m. (-पः) A tree.
 E. अंह्रि the root, and प from पा to drink.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=001-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अंह्रिस्कन्ध|अंह्रिस्कंध|अंह्रिस्कन्धः
अंह्रिस्कन्ध m. (-न्धः) The heel.
 E. अंह्रि the foot, and स्कन्ध the shoulder.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक|अकं
अक r. 1st. cl. (अकति)
	 1. To wind or move tortuously. With an in-
dicatory इ. अकि (अंकते)
	 1. To mark or bespot.
	 2. To go. See अङ्क.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक|अकं
अक m. (-कः)
	 1. Moving tortuously.
	 2. One who goes crookedly.
	 3. Pain,
affliction.
	 4. Sin.
 E. अ priv. and क happiness, or अक to move
crookedly, aff. अच्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकच|अकचः
अकच m. (-चः) Name of KETU, the dragon's tail, or descending node.
mfn. (-चः-चा-चं) Bald, destitute of hair.
 E. अ priv. and कच hair;
this applies to KETU, as the symbol of the asterism is a headless
trunk.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकण्टक
अकण्टक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Free from thorns, literally or metaphorically.
E. अ priv. कण्टक a thorn.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकथ्य|अकथ्यः
अकथ्य mfn. (-थ्यः-थ्या-थ्यं) Not to be mentioned or spoken of; also
similar forms as अकथनीय &c.
 E. अ neg. कथ to speak, with the
participle affixes यत् अनीयर् &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकनिष्ठ|अकनिष्ठः
अकनिष्ठ m. (-ष्ठः) A deified saint according to the Bauddhas.
	 mfn.
(-ष्ठः-ष्ठा-ष्ठं) Elder, superior.
 E. अ priv. and कनिष्ठ youngest.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकनिष्ठग|अकनिष्ठगः
अकनिष्ठग m. (-ग) A deified saint according to the Bauddhas. E.
अकनिष्ठ superior and गम to go affix ड.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकम्पित|अकंपित|अकम्पितः
अकम्पित m. (-तः) The name of a Jaina saint, one of the pupils of the
last Tīrthaṅkara.
	 mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Firm, unshaken, not agitated or
trembling.
 E. अ priv. कपि to tremble; the participial affix क्त. and
इट् inserted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकर
अकर mfn. (-रः-रा-री-रं)
	 1. Maimed, handless.
	 2. Privileged, exempt
from tax or duty.
	 3. One who does not act.
 E. अ priv. and कर the
hand, tax, duty.
	 f. (-रा) Emblic myrobalan, (Phyllanthus
emblica.)
 E. अ priv. and कृञ to injure, अन् affix.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकरणि|अकरणिः
अकरणि m. (-णिः) Failure, disappointment, (it is used only as an
imprecation,) as तस्याकरणिरेवास्तु may he fail.
 E. अ priv. कृञ to do,
and अनि affix.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकरणीय
अकरणीय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Not to be done, improper or impracticable.
E. अ neg. करणीय to be done.
