 E. अक्षत and योनि pudendum.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्षदर्शक|अक्षदर्शकः
अक्षदर्शक m. (-कः) A judge.
 E. अक्ष a lawsuit, दर्शक who sees; from
दृश to see.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

