अक्षदृश्
अक्षदृश् m. (-दृक्) A judge.
 E. अक्ष a lawsuit, and दृश् who sees.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्षदेविन्
अक्षदेविन् m. (-वी) A gamester.
 E. अक्ष a dice, and देविन् a player.
