<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्षपाद|अक्षपादः
अक्षपाद m. (-दः) A follower of the Nyaya system of philosophy.
 E. अक्ष
contest, and पाद who goes; the Nyaya is the logical school; also
