<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्षम|अक्षमः
अक्षम mfn. (-मः-मा-मं)
	 1. Impatient, intolerant.
	 2. Unable, incompet-
ent, impotent f. (-मा)
	 1. Impatience, intolerance.
	 2. Envy,
impatience of another's success.
	 3. Inability, incapacity.
 E. अ neg.
क्षमा patience.
