<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्षमाला
अक्षमाला f. (-ला)
	 1. A rosary, a string of beads, especially of the seeds
of the Eleocarpus.
	 2. The name of ARUNDHATĪ, wife of VASIṢṬHA,
(from her wearing a rosary.)
 E. अक्ष a kind of seed or bead,
and माला a necklace.
