अक्षय|अक्षयः
अक्षय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Durable, permanent, imperishable.
	 f. (-या)
The seventh day of a lunar month, which happens on a Sunday
or Monday, and the fourth, which falls on a Wednesday.
 E. अ
neg. and क्ष to waste or decay, aff. अच्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्षयता
अक्षयता f. (-ता) Durability, imperishableness.
 E. ता added to the
preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्षयतृतीया
अक्षयतृतीया f. (-या) The third day of the lunar half of the month of
Vaiśākha. (April-May.)
 E. अक्षय durable, and तृतीया the third
day: the consequences of meritorious actions performed on this
day being permanent, as it is the first day of the Satya Yuga or
the anniversary of creation.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्षयत्व
अक्षयत्व n. (-त्वं) Imperishableness.
 E. त्व added to अक्षय.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्षयलोक|अक्षयलोकः
अक्षयलोक m. (-कः) Heaven, the imperishable world or region.
 E. अक्षय
and लोक world.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्षर|अक्षरं|अक्षरः
अक्षर m. (-रः)
	 1. A name of ŚIVA.
	 2. A name of VIṢṆU.
	 n. (-रं)
BRAHMĀ the supreme being, (in this sense it is sometimes mas.)
2. Eternal beatitude, or exemption from further transmigration.
	 3.
Religious austerity.
	 4. Moral merit.
	 5. The sky or atmosphere.
6. A letter of the alphabet.
	 7. A plant. (Achyranthes aspera.)
	 8.
Water (in the dialect of the Vedas.)
	 mfn. (-रः-रा-रं)
	 1. Unal-
terable.
	 2. Unperishable, undecayable.
 E. अशू to pervade, and सर
Uṇādi affix.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्षरचञ्च|अक्षरचञ्चः
अक्षरचञ्च m. (ञ्चः) A scribe, a writer.
 E. अक्षर letter, and चञ्च affix.
