<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्षरचन|अक्षरचनः
अक्षरचन m. (-नः) A scribe. E. See the last word.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=004-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

