अगद|अगदः
अगद m. (-दः) A medicament, a medicine, a drug.
	 mfn. (-दः-दा-दं)
1. Well, healthy, free from disease.
	 2. Wholesome, salubrious. E.
अ neg. and गद disease.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=004-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

