अगम्य|अगम्यं
अगम्य mfn. (-म्यः-म्या-म्यं)
	 1. Not to be visited or approached.
	 2. Difficult
of acquirement, unattainable.
	 3. Unequalled, unsurpassable.
 E. अ
neg. गम्य to be gone to.
