अग्नायी
अग्नायी f. (-यी)
	 1. A goddess, the wife of AGNI, the deity of fire, and
presiding over prayers accompanied with burnt offerings.
	 2. The
Treta or second age of the Hindus.
 E. अग्नि fire, and fem. aff. ङीप,
with आय substituted for ऐ inserted.
