<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निवर्ण|अग्निवर्ण्ण
अग्निवर्ण mfn. (-र्णः-र्णा-र्णं) Hot, scalding, scorching.
 E. अग्नि and वर्ण
quality; of the property of fire.
