अग्निशिख m. (-खः)
	 1. A lamp.
	 2. An arrow.
	 3. A fiery arrow, a rocket.
E. The Safflower plant, (Carthamus tinctorius.)
	 mn. (-खः-खं)
Safforn, the plant and die.
	 f. (-खा)
	 1. Flame.
	 2. A plant. (Gloriosa
superba.)
	 3. A medicinal plant, (Menispermum cordifolium.) E.
अग्नि and. शिखा a crest or flame or splendor.
