अग्निसम्भव m. (-वः) Wild safflower.
	 mfn. (-वः-वा-वं) Originating from fire.
E. अग्नि and सम्भव born.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=006-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निसहाय|अग्निसहायः
अग्निसहाय m. (-यः)
	 1. A pigeon.
	 2. The wind.
 E. अग्नि and सहाय a friend.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=006-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निसार|अग्निसारं|अग्निसारः
