<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्नीध्
अग्नीध् m. (-ग्नीत्) A priest who attends the fire.
 E. अग्नि, इन्ध to excite,
क्विप् aff.
