<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्नीध्र|अग्नीध्रः
अग्नीध्र m. (-ध्रः) Officiating priest, whose duty is to attend the fire.
	 f.
(-ध्रा) Exciting the sacrificial fire
 E. अग्नि and इन्ध, to light or kindle;
and the aff. रन्; the न of इन्ध being dropped.
