अग्न्यभाव
अग्न्यभाव m. (-वः)
	 1. Loss or extinction of the sacred fire.
	 2. Loss of
appetite.
 E. अग्नि, अभाव nonexistence.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=006-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्न्यस्त्र|अग्न्यस्त्रं
अग्न्यस्त्र n. (-स्त्रं) Firearms; in poetry, it is usually applied to a super-
human power over the element of fire, but occasionally indicates,
apparently, a rocket.
 E. अग्नि, अस्त्र a weapon.
