अग्न्यागार|अग्न्यागारः
अग्न्यागार m. (-रः) A fire-temple; a chamber or building where the
sacred fire is kept.
 E. अग्नि, आगार house.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=006-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्न्याधान|अग्न्याधानं
अग्न्याधान n. (-नं) Maintenance of a perpetual and sacred fire.
	 n. अग्नि
and आधान preserving.
