<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्न्याधेय|अग्न्याधेयः
अग्न्याधेय n. (-यं) Consecration of a perpetual fire.
 E. अग्नि, आधेय placing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=006-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्न्यालय|अग्न्यालयः
अग्न्यालय m. (-यः)
	 1. A place in which consecrated fire is kept.
	 2. A hole
with compartments of prescribed dimensions and shape, for the
several sacred fires.
 E. अग्नि and आलय asylum.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=006-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्न्याहित
अग्न्याहित m. (-तः) A householder who maintains a perpetual fire; also
आहिताग्नि,
 E. अग्नि, आहित preserved by whom.
