अङ्गुल|अंगुल|अंगुलः|अङ्गुलः
अङ्गुल m. (-लः)
	 1. The thumb.
	 2. A finger.
	 3. A measure of eight barley
corns.
	 4. The name of a saint. See वात्स्यायन.
	 5. A digit, or one-
twelvth part of any dimension.
 E. अङ्ग to count and उल aff.
