अङ्गुलित्र n. (-त्रं) A guard for the finger, applied to the bow-string used
by archers.
 E. अङ्गुलि and त्र what protects.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=009-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

