<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अच्युतवास|अच्युतवासः
अच्युतवास m. (-सः) The religious fig tree, (Ficus religiosa.)
 E. अच्युत
VIṢṆU वास abode.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=010-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अच्युताग्रज|अच्युताग्रजः
अच्युताग्रज m. (जः)
	 1. A name of BALARĀMA, the elder brother of KṚṢṆA.
2. A name of INDRA.
 E. अच्युत KṚṢṆA, as VIṢṆU, and अग्रज elder
born.
