अच्छ|अच्छं|अच्छः|अछ
अच्छ mfn. (-च्छः-च्छा-च्छं) Clear, transparent.
	 m. (च्छ)
	 1. A bear.
	 2. Crystal.
ind. Fronting, before, in presence of.
 E. अ neg. or comparative,
and च्छो to cut, aff. ड.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=010-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अच्छभल्ल|अच्छभल्लः
अच्छभल्ल m. (-ल्लः) A bear. This is sometimes considered as two words.
See अच्छ and भल्ल
 E. अच्छ in front of, and भल्ल to kill.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=010-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
