<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अज|अजः
अज r. 1st cl. (अजति)
	 1. To go.
	 2. To blame. or censure: the root is
irregular, वी being substituted for it before many of the inflecti-
ons, as विवाय, वीयात् &c. with an indicatory इ अजि r. 10th cl.
(अञ्जयति) To shine.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=010-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अज|अजः
अज m. (-जः) A name of BRAHMĀ 2. Also of VIṢṆU 3. A name of ŚIVA.
4. Also of KĀMA. CUPID.
	 5. A proper name, the son of RAGHU,
and father of DĀSARATHA.
	 6. A he-goat.
	 7. A sheep.
	 8. A mineral
substance. See माक्षिक f. (-जा)
	 1. A she-goat.
	 2. Illusion, the
unreality of the universe, personified as Śakti.
	 mfn. (-जः-जा-जं)
Unborn.
 E. अ neg. and ज born. unborn; or अज to go, aff. अच्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=010-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजकर्ण|अजकर्णः
अजकर्ण m. (-र्णः)
	 1. The ear of a goat.
	 2. A tree, (Terminalia alata
tomentosa, Rox.) See असन.
 E. अज a goat. कर्ण an ear; the leaf
being compared to the ear of a goat.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=010-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजकर्णक|अजकर्णकः|अजकर्ण्णक
अजकर्णक m. (-कः) A tree, vulg. Sāl (Shorea robusta, Rox.) See शाल E.
क affixed to the preceding, denoting resemblance.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=010-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजकव|अजकवं|अजकवः
अजकव m. (वः) The bow of ŚIVA, See अजकाव अजगव &c.
 E. अज VIṢṆU,
and क BRAHMĀ with व aff. BRAHMĀ being placed in the centre,
and VIṢṆU on the upper part.
