<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजगन्धा
अजगन्धा f. (न्धा) A plant, (Ocymum gratissimum.)
 E. अज a goat, and गन्ध
smell; smelling like a goat.
