अजन्त
अजन्त m. (-न्त) (In grammar) A noun ending in a vowel.
 E. अच् the
syllable including all the vowels, and अन्त end.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=010-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजन्मन्
अजन्मन् mfn. (-न्मा-न्मा-न्म) Unborn.
 E. अ neg. जन्मन् birth.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=010-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजन्य|अजन्यं
अजन्य n. (-न्यं) A portent, an omen; any natural phenomenon, as an
earthquake, &c. so considered.
	 mfn. (-न्यः-न्या-न्यं) Not to be born or
produced.
 E. अ neg. and जन्य birth.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=010-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजप|अजपः
अजप m. (-पः)
	 1. A reader of works considered heterodox.
	 2. A goatherd.
f. (पा)
	 1. A particular mantra or mystical formula employed by
the Tantrikas, the essence of which is in the letters H and S,
whence it is termed the Hansa mantra 2. ŚIVA and SAKTI com-
bined, to which form, the mantra is particularly, addressed.
	 mfn.
(-पः-पा-पं)
	 1. Who or what does not perform the Japa.
	 1. Cherishing
or feeding goats.
 E. अ not; and जप silent prayer; or अज a goat,
and प who protects.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=010-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजमीढ|अजमीढः
अजमीढ m. (ढः) A name of YUDHIṢṬHIRA; the friend of AJA, i. e. E.
अज VIṢṆU or KṚṢṆA, and ईह to seek, to love, with the parti-
cipial क्त, the termination of the accusative is retained.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=011-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजमोदा
अजमोदा f. (-दा)
	 1. Common carroway, (Carum carui.)
	 2. A kind of
lovage, (Ligusticum ajwaen, Rox.)
	 3. A sort of parsley, (Apium
involucratum;) this latter application is the one used in the
dialects.
 E. अज a goat, and मोद what pleases, from मुद.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=011-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजम्भ|अजंभ|अजम्भः
अजम्भ m. (-म्भः) A frog.
