<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजय|अजयः
अजय m. (-यः) Defeat.
	 mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Unsurpassed, unsubdued, over
whom or which no triumph is obtained.
	 f. (-या) Hemp.
 E. अ neg.
जय victory.
