<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजर्य्य|अजर्य|अजर्य्यं
अजर्य्य n. (-र्य्यं)
	 1. Friendship.
	 2. Imperishableness, exemption from
infirmity or decay.
	 mfn. (-र्य्यः-र्य्या-र्य्यं) Imperishable, undecaying. E.
