<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजलोमन्
अजलोमन् m. (-मा) Cowach, (Carpopogon pruriens.)
 E. अज, and लोमन्
the hair of the body, hair, wool.
