अजित|अजितं|अजितः
अजित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Unconquered.
	 2. Unexcelled, unsurpassed.
	 m.
(-तः)
	 1. The second of the twenty-four principal Jaina Tīrthakaras
or deified sages.
	 2. A name of VIṢṆU.
	 3. A name of BUDDHA.
4. A name of ŚIVA.
 E. अ neg. and जित, participle of जि to conquer.
