अञ्चित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Worshipped, revered.
	 2. Admired.
	 3. Gone.
E. the participial derivative cf अञ्च to worship, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=011-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
