<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अञ्जनिका|अंजनिका
अञ्जनिका f. (-का)
	 1. A species of lizard, (Lacerta anjaneya.)
	 2. A small
mouse.
 E. अञ्जन, and इकन् affix, with the fem. termination; also
read अञ्जलिका.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
