<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अञ्जलिकारिका
अञ्जलिकारिका f. (-का)
	 1. A kind of sensitive plant, (Mimosa natans,) or
according to some, a different plant, (Lycopodium imbricatum) E.
अञ्जलि, and कारिका making; from the shape or closing of the
petals, like the hollowed palms of the hand.
	 2. A doll, a puppet. E.
as before.
