अञ्जलिकर्म्मन् n. (-र्म्म) Making salutations, civility, respect.
 E. अञ्जलि, and
कर्म्मन् act.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अञ्जलिबन्धन
अञ्जलिबन्धन n. (-नं) Making a salutation with the hands joined and
