अञ्जस|अंजस|अञ्जसः
अञ्जस mfn. (-सः-सा-सं) Straight, even, upright, (in morals.)
 E. अञ्ज to
make clear, असच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अञ्जसा|अंजसा
अञ्जसा ind.
	 1. Soon, instantly.
	 2. Truly, justly.
 E. अञ्ज as before, षै to
destroy, and क्विप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अञ्जि|अंजि|अञ्जिः
अञ्जि m. (-ञ्जिः) A superior, a commander, a sender.
 E. अजि to go, and
कि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अञ्जिष्ठ|अंजिष्ठः|अञ्जिष्ठः
अञ्जिष्ठ m. (-ष्ठः) The sun.
 E. अञ्ज to make manifest, and इष्ठन् Uṇādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अञ्जीर|अंजीर|अंजीरं|अञ्जीरं|अंजीरः|अञ्जीरः
अञ्जीर n. (-रं) The fig tree, also its fruit. In Bengal, the word derived
from this implies the Guava; the term has, possibly, been
borrowed from a Persian word.
 E. अञ्ज to make clear, and ईरन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अट
अट r. 1st cl. (अटति) To move, to go or approach: with पार prefixed,
to go round about, to roam, to rove, to ramble, to wander about,
especially as a religious mendicant. 10th cl. (अटयति) To slight.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अट
अट mf. (-टः-टा)
	 1. Going 2. Roaming, wandering
 E. अट, and अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अटन|अटनं
अटन n. (-नं)
	 1. Going, 2. Roaming about, leading a vagrant life. E.
अट, and ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अटनि|अटनिः
अटनि f. (-निः or नी) The notched extremity of a bow.
 E. अट to go, अनि
affix, also with ङीष् fem. termination.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अटरुष|अटरुषः
अटरुष m. (-षः) A tree, (Justicia adhatoda.)
 E. अट here, disease, from
अट to go, and रुष to destroy; destroying disease.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अटरूष|अटरूषः
अटरूष m. (-षः) See the last word.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अटवि|अटविः
अटवि f. (-विः) A forest, or wood.
 E. अट to go, and अटि affix, or ङीष्
being added अटवी ut infra; birds, &c. resting there.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अटविक|अटविकः
अटविक m. (-कः) A woodman, a forester.
 E. अटवि a wood, वक aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अटल
अटल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Immoveable, unchangeable.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अटवी
अटवी f. (-वी) A forest, or grove. See अटवि.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अटाट्या
अटाट्या f. (-ट्या) Roaming about as a devotee or religious mendicant. E.
अट to go, frequentative form, affs अच् and यप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अट्ट|अट्टं|अट्टः
अट्ट r. 1st cl. (उ.) (अट्टते) 1. To surpass or excel, to transgress or exceed.
2. To kill or hurt. 10th cl. (अट्टयति)
	 1. To slight.
	 2. To be small.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अट्ट|अट्टं|अट्टः
अट्ट m. (-ट्ट)
	 1. A room on the top of the house; but it is also applic-
cable to other structures; as the black of an edifice, a fortified
place in front of a building, a room on the top of a temporary
hall, or a particular kind of building.
	 2. Much, excessive.
	 n. (-ट्टं)
Food, boiled rice especially.
	 mfn. (-ट्टः-ट्टा-ट्टं) Dry, dried.
 E. अट्ट to
go, surpass or transcend and घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अट्टट्ट
अट्टट्ट ind. Very lofty.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अट्टन|अट्टनं
अट्टन n. (-नं) A circular weapon, a kind of discus.
 E. अट्ट to kill or hurt,
ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अट्टहास|अट्टहासः
अट्टहास m. (-सः) Violent laughter, a horselaugh.
 E. अट्ट excessive, and
हास a laugh.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अट्टहासक|अट्टहासकः
अट्टहासक m. (-कः) A plant, (Jasminum multiflorum.)
 E. अट्टहास, and
कन्; resembling a laugh or smile on beauty's countenance; the
comparison is common to the poets.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अट्टहासिन्
अट्टहासिन् mfn. (-सी-सिनी-सि) Laughing, loudly and violently.
	 m. (-सी) A
name of ŚIVA.
 E. अट्टहास, and णिनि poss. aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अट्टाल|अट्टालः
अट्टाल m. (-लः) An upper room or pavilion, on the flat roof of an
Indian house.
 E. अट्ट much, and अल to adorn.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अट्टालक|अट्टालकः
अट्टालक m. (-कः) A room on the top of the house.
 E. अट्ट much, अल to
adorn, and कन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अट्टालिका
अट्टालिका f. (-का) A palace, an upper-roomed house. E. as before, fem.
form.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अट्टालिकाकार|अट्टालिकाकारः
अट्टालिकाकार m. (-रः) A bricklayer, a mason, a builder; born of a Śūdra
mother and painter father.
 E. अट्टालिका, and कार who enables.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अट्टा
अट्टा f. (-ट्टा) Wandering as a beggar or devotee.
 E. अट्ट to go. See अटा.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अठ
अठ r. 1st cl. (अठति) with a redundant इ. अठि (अंठते) To go, to go to or
towards.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अड
अड r. 1st cl. (अडति) To strive or endeavour. 5th cl. (अडोति) To occupy
or possess, (peculiar to the Vedas.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अड्ड
अड्ड r. 1st cl. (अड्डति)
	 1. To connect.
	 2. To solve, or demonstrate.
	 3. To
strive, to endeavour. The radical penultimate is द, and the root
is also written by VOPADEVA, अद्द.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अण
अण r. 1st. cl. (अणति) To sound. (ङ,) 4th cl. (अण्यते) To breathe, to live;
with प्र, to exist, to live. See अन.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अणक|अणकः
अणक mfn. (कः-का-कं) Inferior, low.
 E. अण to sound, अच् affix; and कन्
affix of depreciation; also written अण्णक, and आणक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अणव्य|अणव्यं
अणव्य n. (-व्यं) A field bearing panic,
 E. अणु panic. and यत् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अणि|अणिः
अणि m. (-णिः)
	 1. A pin or bolt at the extremity of the pole of a
carriage, the pin of the axle.
	 2. The edge or point of a sharp
weapon.
	 3. A limit, a boundary; also अणी.
 E. अण to sound, and
इन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अणिमन्
अणिमन् m. (-मा)
	 1. Subtility, infinite minuteness, moleculism.
	 2. The
same considered as a superhuman faculty, to be acquired by
austere devotion and the performance of magical rites, or as
possessed by a deity.
 E. अण an atom, and इमनिच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अणीयस्
अणीयस् mfn. (-यान्-यसी-यः) Very small.
 E. अणु small, and इयसुन्
comparative aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अणु|अणुः
अणु m. (-णुः)
	 1. An atom, a minute and elementary particle of matter.
2. A sort of grain, (Panicum miliaceum, Rox.)
	 m. or mfn. (-णुः-ण्वी-णु)
1. Atomic, small, minute.
 E. अण to sound, and उ Unādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अणुक|अणुकः
अणुक mfn. (-कः-का-कं)
	 1. Skilful, clever.
	 2. Small, minute.
 E. अणु small,
and कन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अणुत्व
अणुत्व n. (-त्वं) The state or being of an atom, also अणुता.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अणुभा
अणुभा f. (-भा) Lightning.
 E. अणु minute, and भा light.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अणुरेणु|अणुरेणुः
अणुरेणु f. (-णुः) Small particles of dust, a dust of atoms.
 E. अणु, and
रेणु dust.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=013-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अणुरेणुजाल
अणुरेणुजाल n. (लं) The motes in a sunbeam.
 E. अणुरेणु, and जाल as-
semblage.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=013-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अणुरेवती
अणुरेवती f. (-ती) A tree. (Croton polyandrum.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=013-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अणुव्रीहि|अणुव्रीहिः
अणुव्रीहि m. (-हिः) Small grain.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=013-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अण्ड|अंडं|अण्डं|अंडः|अण्डः
अण्ड n. (-ण्डं)
	 1. An egg.
	 2. A testicle or the scrotum.
	 3. Semen geni-
tale.
	 4. The musk bag, regarded as the scrotum of the deer.
E. अम to go, and ड Uṇādi aff.
