<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अण्डज|अण्डजः
अण्डज mfn. (-जः-जा-जं) Oviparous.
	 m. (-जः)
	 1. A serpent.
	 2. A fish
3. A bird.
	 4. A lizard.
	 f. (जा Musk.
 E. अण्ड and egg, &c. and
