<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतट|अतटः
अतट m. (-टः) A precipice.
 E. अ neg. and तट a back.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=013-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतथ्य
अतथ्य mfn. (-थ्यः-थ्या-थ्यं) Untrue, false, unreal.
 E. अ neg. तथ्य true.
