<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतप
अतप mfn. (-पः-पा-पं)
	 1. Cool.
	 2. Unanxious.
	 3. Unemployed.
	 4. Unos-
tentatious.
 E. अ neg. तप ardor.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=013-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

