<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतर्कित
अतर्कित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Unconsidered.
	 2. Unexpected, unweighed.
adv.
	 n. (-तं) Unexpectedly, suddenly
 E. अ neg. अकित considered.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=013-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतर्क्य
अतर्क्य mfn. (-र्क्यः-र्क्या-र्क्यं) Unsearchable, incomprehensible, inscrutable. E.
अ neg. तर्क्य to be investigated.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=013-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतर्पणीय
अतर्पणीय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Insatiable.
 E. अ neg. तर्पणीय to be satisfied.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=013-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतर्पित
अतर्पित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Unsatisfied.
 E. अ neg. तर्पित satisfied.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=013-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतल|अतलं|अतलः
अतल n. (-लं) A particular hell or division of the infernal regions, the
portion immediately below the earth.
 E. अ neg. and तल bottom.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=013-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतलस्पर्श|अतलस्पर्शः
अतलस्पर्श mfn. (-र्शः-र्शा-र्शं) Very deep, bottomless.
 E. अ neg. तल bottom,
and स्पर्श the touch.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=013-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतलस्पृश्
अतलस्पृश् mfn. (स्पृक्) See the preceding.
