<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=013-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिकाय|अतिकायः
अतिकाय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Gigantic.
 E. अति, and काय body.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=013-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिकृच्छ्र|अतिकृच्छ्रः
अतिकृच्छ्र n. (-च्छ्र)
	 1. A kind of penance, eating a handful of food a day
for six days, and fasting three.
	 2. Extreme pain or suffering. E.
अति, and कृच्छ्र penance.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=013-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिकृति|अतिकृतिः
अतिकृति f. (-तिः) A kind of metre, a stanza of four lines, with twenty-
five syllables to each line.
 E. अति, and कृति another metre.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=013-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिकृश
अतिकृश mfn. (-शः-शा-शी-शं) Very thin, emaciated.
 E. अति, and कृश thin.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=013-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिक्रम|अतिक्रमः
अतिक्रम m. (-मः)
	 1. Going over or beyond, lit. or fig.
	 2. Surpassing,
excelling.
	 3. Transgressing.
	 4. Contrariety, opposition.
	 5. Neglect,
aversion, disregard.
	 6. Privation.
	 7. A groundless demand.
	 8. A
gallant attack, advance of an army in front of an enemy. See अति-
क्रम
 E. अति over, beyond, and क्रम to go; going beyond duty or
daring.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=013-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिक्रमिन्
अतिक्रमिन् mfn. (-मी-मिणी-मि)
	 1. Transgressing.
	 2. Exceeding, surpassing.
E. अतिक्रम, and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=013-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिक्रम्य
अतिक्रम्य ind. Having gone over or beyond. i. e. Exceeded, transgressed,
surpassed, overcome, &c.
 E. अति before, क्रम to go, यत् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=013-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिक्रश
अतिक्रश mfn. (-शः-शा-शी-शं) Thin, emaciated.
 E. अति, and क्रश spare; ऋ
changed to र.
