अतिक्रान्त mfn. (-न्तः-न्ता-न्तं)
	 1. Transgressed, exceeded, passed the proper
bounds.
	 2. Excelled, surpassed.
	 3. Passed in time.
	 4. Attacked,
assaulted.
	 5. Excessive, unlimited.
	 6. Prolix, diffuse.
	 7. Disregarded,
disliked.
 E. अति, and क्रम to go, aff.
