<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिक्रामक|अतिक्रामकः
अतिक्रामक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Exceeding, one who oversteps due bounds.
E. अति, and क्रम to go, स्खुल् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=013-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिगण्ड|अतिगंडः|अतिगण्डः
