	 2. Champac, (Michelia champaca.)
	 3. A kind of
bean, (Phaseolus mungo)
	 4. Sulphur.
	 mfn. (-न्धः-न्धा-न्धं) Of strong
or exceeding odour.
 E. अति, and गन्ध smell.
