अतिजव mfn. (-वः-वा-वं) Marching fast or fleet.
 E. अति, and जव quick.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=013-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

