अतिथिद्वेष
अतिथिद्वेष m. (-षः) Inhospitality.
 E. अतिथि, and द्वेष dislike.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिथिपूजन|अतिथिपूजनं
अतिथिपूजन n. (-नं) Hospitality considered as one of the principal
sacraments of the Hindus.
 E. अतिथि a guest, and पूजन worshipping.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिथिसत्कार|अतिथिसत्कारः
अतिथिसत्कार m. (-रः) The rite of hospitality, hospitality.
 E. अतिथि, and
सत्कार pious rite.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिथिसेवा
अतिथिसेवा f. (-वा) Service of a guest, hospitality.
 E. अतिथि, and सेवा
service.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिदातृ
अतिदातृ m. (-ता) A liberal man.
 E. अति, and दातृ who gives.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिदान|अतिदानं
अतिदान n. (-नं) Munificence, giving largely.
 E. अति and दान gift.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिदाह|अतिदाहः
अतिदाह m. (-हः)
	 1. Great heat.
	 2. Violent inflammation.
 E. अति and
दाह burning.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिदिष्ट|अतिदिष्टः
अतिदिष्ट mfn. (-ष्टः-ष्टा-ष्टं) Substituted, supplementary.
 E. अति over, and
दिष्ट enjoined.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिदुःसह
अतिदुःसह mfn. (-हः-हा-हं) Intolerable, unbearable, not to be borne or
endured.
 E. अति and दुःसह painful.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिदुर्गत
अतिदुर्गत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) In great difficulty or distress.
 E. अति and दुर्गत
badly off.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिदुष्कर
अतिदुष्कर mfn. (-रः-रा-री-रं) Very arduous, very difficult.
 E. अति and
दुष्कर difficult.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिदूर
अतिदूर n. (-रं) A great distance, afar off.
 E. अति, and दूर afar.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिदेश|अतिदेशः
अतिदेश m. (-शः) Substitution, supplement.
 E. अति, and देश direction.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिदोष
अतिदोष m. (-षः) A great fault.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिधृति|अतिधृतिः
अतिधृति f. (-तिः) A kind of metre, a stanza of four lines, with nineteen
syllables in each line.
 E. अति and धृति another metre.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिनौ
अतिनौ mfn. (-नौः-नौः-नु) Landed from a boat.
 E. अति over, beyond, and
नौ a boat.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिपतन|अतिपतनं
अतिपतन n. (-नं) Exceeding, going beyond bounds.
 E. अति beyond and
पत to go, ल्यट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिपथिन्
अतिपथिन् m. (-पन्था) A good road.
 E. अति, and पथिन् a road; a very
road.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिपर|अतिपरः
अतिपर m. (-रः)
	 1. A great enemy.
	 2. One who has conquered his
enemy.
 E. अति and परः a foe.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिपात|अतिपातः
अतिपात m. (-तः)
	 1. Neglect of duty.
	 2. Transgression, deviation from
laws or customs.
	 3. Contrariety, opposition.
	 4. Going beyond
bounds. अति beyond, and पात from पत to go.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिपातक|अतिपातकं
अतिपातक n. (-कं) Heinous sin, the worst of the great sins.
 E. अति,
and पातक crime.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिपातकिन्
अतिपातकिन् mfn. (-की-किनी-कि) A great sinner, flagrantly criminal. E.
अतिपातक and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिपारक
अतिपारक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Very capable, of great abilities.
 E. अति, and
पारक who traverses.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिपेशल
अतिपेशल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Very dexterous or clever.
 E. अति and पेशल
clever.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिप्रसङ्ग|अतिप्रसंग|अतिप्रसंगः|अतिप्रसङ्गः
अतिप्रसङ्ग m. (-ङ्गः) Frequent repetition, uninterrupted continuance. E.
अति, and प्रसाद connexion.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिबल|अतिबलः
अतिबल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Strong, powerful.
	 m. (-लः) An active soldier.
	 f.
(-ला) A plant, (Sida cordifolia, and rhombifolia.) See वाट्यपुष्पी E.
अति and बल strong.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिभार|अतिभारः
अतिभार m. (-रः) A great or excessive burden.
 E. अति, and भार a load.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिभारग|अतिभारगः
अतिभारग m. (-गः) A mule.
 E. अतिभार, and ग who goes with.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिभी
अतिभी m. (-भीः) Lightning, the flash accompanying thunder.
 E. अति,
and भी dread.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिभूमि|अतिभूमिः
अतिभूमि f. (-मिः)
	 1. Something more than was expected or aimed at.
2. Extensive land or limits.
	 3. Improper conduct, exceeding proper
bounds.
 E. अति, and भूमि land.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिभृत
अतिभृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Carefully cherished or protected.
 E. अति and
भृत cherished.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमङ्गल्य|अतिमंगल्य|अतिमङ्गल्यः
अतिमङ्गल्य mfn. (-ल्यः-ल्या-ल्यं) Very auspicious.
	 m. (ल्यः) A fruit,
(Ægle, or Cratœva marmelos) See विल्व.
 E. अत्ति, and मङ्गल
auspicious.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमर्य्याद|अतिमर्याद|अतिमर्य्यादः
अतिमर्य्याद mfn. (-दः-दा-दं) or adverb n. (दं) Much, excessive, unlimited,
unbounded.
 E. अति, and मर्य्यादा a limit.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमर्त्त्य
अतिमर्त्त्य mfn. (र्त्त्यः-र्त्त्य-र्त्त्यं) Superhuman, divine.
 E. अति and मत, mortal.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमात्र|अतिमात्रं
अतिमात्र mfn. (त्रः-त्रा-त्रं) or adverb.
	 n. त्रं Much, excessive.
 E. अति, and मात्रा
a minute quantity.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमानुष
अतिमानुष mfn. (-ष-षी-षं)
	 1. Superhuman, more than mortal.
	 2. Immortal,
divine.
 E. अति, and मानुष human.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमाय
अतिमाय mfn. (-यः-या-यं)
	 1. Free from illusion.
	 2. Entirely liberated, or
freed.
 E. अति and माया delusion.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमित
अतिमित mfn. (तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Dry, not wet.
	 2. Over measured, exceeding.
E. अ neg. तिमित moist, or अति and मित meted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमुक्त|अतिमुक्तः
अतिमुक्त mfn. (-क्त-क्ता-क्तं)
	 1. Seedless, barren.
	 2. Entirely liberated or
freed.
	 m. (क्तः)
	 1. A creeping plant, (Gœrtnera racemosa.) See
माधवीलता 2. A tree, (Dalbergia oujeiniensis)
 E. अति, and मुक्त
liberated.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमुक्तक|अतिमुक्तकः
अतिमुक्तक m. (-कः)
	 1. A tree, (Dalbergia oujeiniensis.)
	 2. Mountain
ebony. See तिन्दुक.
	 3. A creeper. (Gœrtnera racemosa, &c.) E. See
अतिमुक्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमोदा
अतिमोदा f. (-दा) A tree, (Jasmimum arboreum.)
 E. अति, and मोद
delight.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिरथ|अतिरथः
अतिरथ m. (-थः) A warrior of a particular order fighting in a car. E.
अति, and रथ a chariot.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिरथिन्
अतिरथिन् m. (-थी) A warrior of a particular class, fighting in a car. E.
अति before रथ a car. and इनि aff. also अतिरथ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिरसा
अतिरसा f. (-सा) A creeper.
 E. अति, and रस flavour.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिरिक्त|अतिरिक्तः
अतिरिक्त mfn. (-क्तः-क्ता-क्तं) Excessive, exceeding,
 E. अति, and रिव to flow,
with the participial affix क्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिरिक्तता
अतिरिक्तता f. (-ता) Increase of bulk or quantity, expansion, enlargement,
elevation, &c.
 E. ता added to the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिरेक|अतिरेकः
अतिरेक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Much, excessive.
 E. अति, and रिच to flow,
affix घञ्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिरेकिन्
अतिरेकिन् mfn. (-की-किणी-कि) More, superior.
 E. अतिरेक and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिरोग|अतिरोगः
अतिरोग m. (-गः) Consumption, (Phthisis pulmonalis)
 E. अति and रोग
