<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिरोमश|अतिरोमशः
अतिरोमश m. (-शः) A wild goat, or according to some, a large monkey.
mfn. (-शः-शा-शं) Very hairy.
 E. अति, and रोमश hairy.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिलुब्ध
अतिलुब्ध mfn. (-ब्धः-ब्धा-ब्धं) Very covetous.
 E. अति, and लुब्ध covetous.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिलोमश
अतिलोमश mfn. (-शः-शा-शं) Very hairy.
 E. अति, and लोमश hairy.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवर्त्तन|अतिवर्तन|अतिवर्तनं
अतिवर्त्तन n. (-न) An accident, a circumstance not capable of being
prevented or guarded against.
 E. अति, and वर्त्तन being.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवर्त्तुल|अतिवर्तुल|अतिवर्तुलः|अतिवर्त्तुलः
अतिवर्त्तुल m. (-लः) A kind of grain.
 E. अति, and वर्त्तूल round.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवात|अतिवातः
अतिवात m. (-तः) A storm, a hurricane.
 E. अति, and वात wind.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवाद|अतिवादः
अतिवाद m. (-दः) Opprobrious or unfriendly speech. See अभिवाद.
 E. अति
