<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिविकट|अतिविकटः
अतिविकट m. (-टः) A vicious elephant.
	 mfn. (-टः-टा-टं) Very fierce, very
formidable.
 E. अति, and विकट large or formidable.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=014-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिविष
अतिविष mfn. (-षः-षा-षं) Antidote, exceeding or subduing poison.
	 f. (-षा)
A tree used in medicine, the bark is also employed in dyeing; it
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=015-a" target="_blank">Page015-a+ 60</a>]
is of three kinds; white, red, and black. (Atis or Betula.)
 E. अति
overcoming, and विष poison.
