<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवृष्टि|अतिवृष्टिः
अतिवृष्टि f. (-ष्टिः) Heavy rain.
 E. अति, and वृष्टि rain.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=015-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवेल|अतिवेलं
अतिवेल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) or adverb n. (-लं) Much, excessive, unlimited.
