अदिति|अदितिः
अदिति f. (-तिः)
	 1. The daughter of DAKṢA, wife of KAŚYAPA, and
mother of the gods.
	 2. The earth.
	 3. Being entire.
 E. अ neg. दा to
give, and दिति affix, not giving pain; or अ, दो to cut or break.
क्तिच् aff.
