अदृश्य mfn. (-श्य-श्या-श्यं)
	 1. Invisible, not be to seen.
	 2. Improper to be-
hold.
 E. अ neg. दृश्य to be seen.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=017-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अदृष्ट|अदृष्टं|अदृष्टः
अदृष्ट n. (-ष्टं)
	 1. Casual and unseen danger, (as from conflagration,
inundation, &c.)
	 2. Fortune, destiny, fate.
	 3. (In logic) Virtue or
vice, as the eventual cause of pleasure or pain.
	 mfn. (-ष्टः-ष्टा-ष्टं)
1. Unseen, unforeseen.
	 2. Unknown, unfelt, not experienced.
 E. अ
neg. and दृष्ट seen.
