<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्यतन|अद्यतनः
अद्यतन m. (-नः) The period of a current day, from midnight to midnight
in the usual acceptation, but sometimes considered to begin and
end with sunset.
	 mfn. (-नः-नी-नं) Of or belonging to the current
day, of today.
 E. अद्य, and द्युल् aff.
