<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्रिज|अद्रिजं
अद्रिज mfn. (-जः-जा-जं) Produced or found in the hills.
	 n. (जं) Red chalk.
f. (-जा) A name of PĀRVATĪ or DURGĀ, the daughter of HIMĀLAYA,
ruler of Himālaya mountain, and hence this her appellation,
mountain-born.
 E. अद्रि, and ज, from जन to be born.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=017-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्रितनया
अद्रितनया f. (-या) A name of PĀRVATĪ, the daughter of the mountain
HIMĀLAYA.
 E. अद्रि, and तनया daughter.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=017-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्रिनन्दिनी
अद्रिनन्दिनी f. (-नी) PĀRVATĪ. See the last.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=017-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्रिपति|अद्रिपतिः
अद्रिपति m. (-तिः) Himālaya, lord of mountains: also similar compounds,
as अद्रीन्द्र, अद्रिराज् &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=017-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्रिभिद्
अद्रिभिद् m. (-भित्) A name of INDRA.
 E. अद्रि, and भिद् who breaks;
the splitter of mountains, (with his thunderbolt.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=017-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्रिभू
अद्रिभू mfn. (-भूः-भूः-भु) Mountaineer, mountain-born.
	 m. (भूः) A Plant,
(Salvinea cucullata.)
 E. अद्रि, and भू born.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=017-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्रिराज्
अद्रिराज् m. (-राट्) The king of mountains, the HIMĀLAYA mountains;
the snowy range on the north of Hindustan, confounded with the
mythological ruler of them, and the father of PĀRVATĪ.
 E. अद्रि,
and राज् a king, the king of mountains, deservedly so called, being
the loftiest in the world.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=017-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्रिवह्नि|अद्रिवह्निः
अद्रिवह्नि m. (-ह्निः) Fire on a mountain, a volcano.
 E. अद्रि, and वह्नि fire.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=017-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्रिशृङ्ग|अद्रिशृंग
अद्रिशृङ्ग n. (-ङ्गम्) A peak, the horn or summit of a mountain.
 E. अद्रि,
and शृङ्ग a horn.
