<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्रिसार|अद्रिसारः
अद्रिसार m. (-रः) Iron.
 E. अद्रि, and सार essence.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=017-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्रीश|अद्रीशः
अद्रीश m. (-शः)
	 1. A name of ŚIVA.
	 2. Also of HIMĀLAYA, as king of
mountains.
 E. अद्रि, and ईश a master.
