<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्वैतवादिन्
अद्वैतवादिन् m. (-दी) A unitarian, one who maintains the existence of but
one principle in the universe.
 E. अद्वैत unity, and वादिन् who speaks.
