अधमर्ण|अधमर्णः
अधमर्ण mfn. (-र्णः-र्णा-र्णं) A debtor.
 E. अधम low, and ऋण debt.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=018-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
