अधमर्णिक|अधमर्णिकः
अधमर्णिक m. (-कः) A debtor.
 E. अधम, and ऋण debt, with ठक् added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=018-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
