 E. अधम, and ऋण debt, with इनि added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=018-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधमाङ्ग|अधमांग|अधमाङ्गं
अधमाङ्ग n. (-ङ्गं) A foot.
 E. अधम low, and अङ्ग a limb.
