<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधर|अधरं|अधरः
अधर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं)
	 1. Low, inferior, below.
	 2. Low, vile.
	 3. Silenced,
refuted, overcome in abuse or controversy.
	 f. (-रा) The lower region.
m. (-रः) The lower lip. (dual. रौ) The lips.
	 mn. (-रः or रं) Puden-
dum muliebre.
 E. अ neg. धृ to have or hold, and अच् aff.
