<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधरस्तात्
अधरस्तात् ind. Below, behind.
 E. स्तात् added to अधर.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=018-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधरस्मात्
अधरस्मात् ind. Below, underneath. E. the form of the ablative.
