अधिकारित्व|अधिकारित्वं
अधिकारित्व n. (-त्वं)
	 1. Ownership.
	 2. Right, title. E. See the last, affix त्व.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=018-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिकारिन्
अधिकारिन् m. (-री)
	 1. A superintendent, a ruler, a director.
	 2. A master,
an owner.
	 3. A sage, one who is perfect in principles and practice
of the Vedānta.
	 mf. (-री-रिणी) (In law) The possessor of a right
or title, as. धनाधिकारी heir to property; संस्काराधिकारी one who has
a right to the essential ceremonies of the Hindu religion.
 E. अधिकार,
and इनि aff.
