	 2. Place, situation.
	 3. Continuance,
perseverance.
	 4. Perfuming the person, &c.
	 5. A neighbour.
6. Neighbourhood.
 E. अधि, and वस to dwell, with घञ् affix; or
वास to fumigate, with अच्
