अननुज्ञात
अननुज्ञात mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Denied, refused, not assented to.
 E. अन् neg.
अनुज्ञात assented to.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्त|अनंत|अनन्तं|अनन्तः
अनन्त mfn. (-न्तः-न्ता-न्तं)
	 1. Eternal, endless.
	 2. Unbounded, illimitable.
3. Infinite, innumerable.
	 m. (-न्तः)
	 1. A name of VIṢṆU or
KṚṢṆA.
	 2. BALADEVA, the brother of KRISHNĀ.
	 3. The chief of the
NĀGAS or serpent race, that inhabit the infernal regions: the
couch and constant attendant of VIṢṆU.
	 4. The king of ser-
pents, confounded with VĀSUKI. See वासुकि.
	 5. The fourteenth
of the Jaina Tīrthakaras or deified Saints: also called अनन्तजित्.
	 f.
(-न्ता)
	 1. A name of PĀRVATĪ, the wife of SIVĀ.
	 2. The earth.
	 3.
A synonym of several plants, (as Hedysarum alhagi.)
	 4. A kind
of potherb. See विशल्या.
	 5. Bent grass, (Agrostis linearis.)
	 6. Ano-
ther plant, (Echites frutescens, Rox.) See श्यामा. Or according to
others, (Asclepias pseudosarsa, Rox.) See शारिवा.
	 7. Yellow myro-
balan, (Terminalia citrina.)
	 8. Emblic myrobalan, (Phyllanthus
emblica).
	 9. Another plant, (Menispermum glabrum.) See गुडुची.
10. Long pepper. See कणा.
	 n. (-न्तं) Sky or atmosphere, æther.
 E. अन्
neg. and अन्त end.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्तक|अनंतक
अनन्तक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Endless, eternal.
 E. कन् added to the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्तचतुर्दशी|अनन्तचतुर्द्दशी
अनन्तचतुर्दशी f. (-शी) The fourteenth lunation of the light half of
BHĀDRA, when ANANTA is worshipped.
 E. अनन्त, and चतुर्दशी the
fourteenth.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्तजित्
अनन्तजित् m. (-जित्) The fourteenth of the twenty-four Jaina defied
Saints: also called अनन्त.
 E. अनन्त endless, and जित् who con-
quers, who gains eternity.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्तता
अनन्तता f. (-ता) Eternity: also अनन्तत्व n. (-त्वं)
 E. ता or त्व added to
अनन्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्ततीर्थकृत्
अनन्ततीर्थकृत् m. (-कृत्) The fourteenth Jaina Saint, also अनन्त, &c.
 E. अनन्त
endless, तीर्थ pilgrimage or virtue, and कृत् who has made.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्तमूल|अनन्तमूलः
अनन्तमूल m. (-लः) A plant, (Periploca Indica.)
 E. अनन्त, and मूल root.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्तर|अनंतर|अनन्तरं
अनन्तर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं)
	 1. Next, immediately following.
	 2. Next of kin or
in succession.
	 3. Close, compact.
	 n. (-रं) Extreme propinquity E.
अन् neg. and अन्तर between; having nothing intermediate.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्तरज|अनन्तरजः
अनन्तरज mfn. (-जः-जा-जं) Born of the next in order; as of a Kṣatriya
woman, by a Brahman; of a Vaiśya woman, by a Kṣatriya. E.
अनन्तर, and ज born.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्तराशि|अनन्तराशिः
अनन्तराशि f. (-शिः) In arithmetic; infinite quantity.
 E. अनन्त endless,
राशि quantity.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्तरूप
अनन्तरूप mfn. (-पः-पा-पं) Multiform.
 E. अनन्त, and रूप form.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्तवात|अनन्तवातः
अनन्तवात m. (-तः) Rigidity or paralysis of the muscles of the face and
neck.
 E. अनन्त, and वात wind.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्तविजय|अनन्तविजयः
अनन्तविजय m. (-यः) The shell of YUDHIṢṬHIRA.
 E. अनन्त, and विजय
victory.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्तवीर्य्य|अनन्तवीर्य|अनन्तवीर्यः|अनन्तवीर्य्यः
अनन्तवीर्य्य m. (-र्य्यः) The twenty third Jaina Tīrthakara of a future age.
E. अनन्त endless, and वीर्य्य power.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्तव्रत|अनन्तव्रतं
अनन्तव्रत n. (-तं) A ceremony performed in honour of VIṢṆU, on the
day of the full moon in Bhādra.
 E. अनन्त, and व्रत a religious ob-
servance.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्तशीर्षा
अनन्तशीर्षा f. (-र्षा) The wife of VĀSUKI, the king of serpents.
 E. अनन्त
many, and शीर्ष a head; many headed.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्त्य|अनंत्य
अनन्त्य mfn. (-न्त्यः-न्त्या-न्त्यं) Infinite, unbounded, eternal n. (-न्त्यं)
	 1. Im-
mortality.
	 2. Eternity.
	 3. Infinity.
 E. अन् neg. अन्त्य final.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्य
अनन्य mfn. (-न्यः-न्या-न्यं)
	 1. One, sole, without any other.
	 2. Same, iden-
tical.
 E. अन् neg. अन्य other.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यगति|अनन्यगतिः
अनन्यगति mfn. (-तिः-तिः-ति) Having but one refuge.
	 f. (-तिः) One only
refuge or asylum.
 E. अनन्य, and गति motion.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यगतिक|अनन्यगतिकः
अनन्यगतिक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Having one refuge or hope alone.
 E. कन्
added to the last.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यज|अनन्यजः
अनन्यज m. (-जः) A name of KĀMA or love.
 E. अन् neg. अन्य other, and ज
born; produced only in the heart.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यता
अनन्यता f. (-ता)
	 1. Singleness.
	 2. Identity.
 E. अनन्य, and ता or त्व affix;
also अनन्यत्वं.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यपूर्व्व|अनन्यपूर्व|अनन्यपूर्वः
अनन्यपूर्व्व mfn. (-र्व्वः-र्व्वा-र्व्वं) Intact, virgin, never in the prior possession
of another.
	 f. (-र्व्वा) A virgin, a girl not previously wedded.
E. अन् neg. अन्य another, पूर्व्व prior; also with कन् added
अनन्यपूर्व्वक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यभव
अनन्यभव mfn. (-वः-वा-वं) Produced or effected by one particular person or
thing.
 E. अनन्य, and भव born.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यमनस्
अनन्यमनस् mfn. (-नः-नाः-नः) See the next.
