<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यमनस्क
अनन्यमनस्क mfn. (-स्कः-स्का-स्कं) Intent, attentive, having the mind fixed
on one subject, not absent.
 E. अन् neg. अन्यमनस् or अन्यमनस्क think-
ing of some thing else.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यवृत्ति|अनन्यवृत्तिः
अनन्यवृत्ति mfn. (-त्तिः-त्तिः-त्ति) Closely attentive, having the mind fixed on
one object.
 E. अन् neg. अन्य other, वृत्ति profession.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यहृत
अनन्यहृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Not stolen or taken, safe.
 E. अन् neg. अन्य ano-
ther, हृत taken.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यहार्य्य
अनन्यहार्य्य mfn. (-र्य्यः-र्य्या-र्य्यं) Incapable of being taken or stolen.
 E. अन्
neg. अन्य another, हार्य्य to be taken.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्वित
अनन्वित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Unconnected with, irrelevant.
	 2. Devoid of,
not possessing.
 E. अन् neg. अन्वित possessed of.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपकरण|अनपकरणं
अनपकरण n. (-णं)
	 1. Non-requital, not retaliating.
	 2. Non-resumption.
3. Not doing ill.
 E. अन् before अपकरण evil doing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपकर्म्मन्|अनपकर्मन्
अनपकर्म्मन् n. (-र्म्म)
	 1. Non-retaliation. Non-resumption, (of a thing given
or paid, &c.)
	 3. Abstaining from evil.
 E. अन् before अपकर्म्मन्; also
अनपाकर्म्मन्, अनपक्रिया, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपकार|अनपकारः
अनपकार m. (-रः) Harmlessness, freedom from hatred and malice. E.
अन् neg. अपकार evil doing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपकारिन्
अनपकारिन् mfn. (-री-रिणी-रि) Innocuous.
 E. अनपकार, and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपक्रिया
अनपक्रिया f. (-या)
	 1. Non-requital, non-retaliation.
	 2. Non-acquittance
(as of debt, &c.)
	 3. Non-resumption.
	 4. Abstaining from offence or
evil.
 E. अन् before अपक्रिया offence, &c.
