<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपायिन्
अनपायिन् mfn. (-यी-यिनी-यि)
	 1. Firm, constant, durable, imperishable.
2. Increasing.
 E. अनपाय permanence, इनि aff.
