अनवस्थ
अनवस्थ mfn. (-स्थः-स्था-स्थं) Unstable, unsteady.
	 2. Incontinent.
	 f. (-स्था)
1. Instability, absence of fixed state or condition.
	 2. Uncertainty,
doubt.
	 3. Incontinence, dissoluteness.
	 4. (In logic,) the abstract
nature of a thing, independent of its existence.
 E. अन् neg. अवस्था
