<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनित्यसम|अनित्यसमः
अनित्यसम m. (-मः) Arguing by illustration, not by logical rule.
 E. अनित्य
unusual, and सम same.
