<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिन्दित|अनिन्दितः
अनिन्दित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Pious, virtuous, free, unreproachable.
 E. अ neg.
and निन्दित reproached.
