अनिभृत
अनिभृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Unsteady (as the mind), agitated.
	 2. Tremulous,
moving.
 E. अ neg. निभृत held firmly.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=025-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिमिष|अनिमिषं|अनिमिषः
अनिमिष m. (-षः)
	 1. A god.
	 2. A fish.
	 3. A person whose eyes are fixed,
(as in disease), &c.
 E. अ neg. and निमिष what twinkles; the eyes
being always fixed.
