<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिमिषाचार्य्य|अनिमिषाचार्य|अनिमिषाचार्यः|अनिमिषाचार्य्यः
अनिमिषाचार्य्य m. (-र्य्यः) A name of VṚHASPATI.
 E. अनिमिष a deity, and
आचार्य्य a teacher; the preceptor of the gods.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=025-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
