<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिराकृत|अनिराकृतः
अनिराकृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Unchecked, unobstructed.
 E. अ neg. निराकृत
opposed.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=025-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिरुद्ध|अनिरुद्धं|अनिरुद्धः
अनिरुद्ध mfn. (-द्धः-द्धा-द्धं)
	 1. A spy, a secret emissary.
	 2. Self willed, un-
governable, headstrong.
	 3. Unobstructed, unrestrained.
	 m. (-द्धः)
The son of PRADYUMNA, a form of KĀMA, and husband of
UṢĀ.
	 n. (-द्धं) The rope for fastening cattle.
 E. अ neg. निरुद्ध
restrained.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=025-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

