अनिलसख m. (-खः) A name of fire.
 E. अनिल, and सखि a friend, the
friend of the wind.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=025-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिलात्मज|अनिलात्मजः
