अनीकिनी
अनीकिनी f. (-नी)
	 1. An army, a host, forces.
	 2. A certain force;
one-tenth of an Akṣauhiṇī, containing two thousand, one hundred
and eighty-seven elephants, and as many cars, six thousand, five
hundred and sixty-seven horses, and ten thousand, nine hundred
and thirty-five foot.
	 3. A lotus.
 E. अनीक an army, इनि aff.
