अनीहित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Disagreeable, displeasing, unwished.
	 n. (-तं)
Displeasure.
 E. अन्, and ईहित desired.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=026-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनु|अनुः
अनु ind. A preposition and prefix, implying 1. After.
	 2. Like, in same
manner.
	 3. Under, inferior to.
	 4. Along, lengthwise.
	 5. With, to-
gether with.
	 6. In part of.
	 7. Severally, each, by each.
	 8. Near to.
9 In regard to.
	 10. To, out to, (calling.)
	 11. Orderly, methodical.
As अनुकर्त्तुं to act like; अनुगन्तुं to follow; अनुक्रमितुं to proceed in
order; अनुशयितुं to repent, &c.; also, अनुरूपं according to the form;
अनुविष्णु according to VIṢṆU; अनुगङ्गं upon or along the Ganges.
See also the following words.
 E. अन् to live and ज aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=026-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

