<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभव|अनुभवः
अनुभव m. (-वः)
	 1. Conclusive judgment, understanding, impression,
the exercise of the intellect, independent of memory; also अनुभूति.
2. Result, consequence.
 E. अनु, भू to be, and अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=028-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभाव|अनुभावः
अनुभाव m. (-वः)
	 1. Indication of passion, by look or gesture.
	 2. Dig-
nity, authority, consequence.
	 4. Firm opinion, belief, knowledge.
4. Certainty, ascertainment.
 E. अनु, and भाव the essence or
being; according to the internal feelings.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=028-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभाविन्
अनुभाविन् mfn. (-वी-विनी-वि)
	 1. Judging, knowing, understanding.
	 2.
Indicative of passion or feeling.
 E. अनु and भाविन् perceiving, or
अनुभाव and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=028-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभूत
अनुभूत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Understood, judged, apprehended.
	 2. Result-
ed, followed as a consequence.
	 3. Perceiving, understanding. E.
अनु, and भूत been.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=028-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभूति|अनुभूतिः
अनुभूति f. (-तिः)
	 1. Judgment; knowledge, from four sources, percep-
tion, inference, comparison and verbal information; or any source
except memory.
	 2. Dignity, consequence.
 E. अनु, and भूति
being.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=028-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमत|अनुमतः
अनुमत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Accepted, assented to.
	 2. Agreeable,
pleasant.
	 3. Loved, beloved.
	 4. Concurred with, being of one
opinion.
 E. अनु, and मत minded.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=028-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमति|अनुमतिः
अनुमति f. (-तिः)
	 1. Order or command.
	 2. Assent, permission.
	 3. A
fifteenth day of the moon's age, on which she rises one digit
less than full.
 E. अनु with, before मन to respect, and क्तिन् affix;
in the last acceptation, because offerings made to the manes on
this day are especially accepted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=028-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमन्तृ|अनुमंतृ
अनुमन्तृ mfn. (-न्ता-न्त्री-न्तृ) Consenting to, concurring in, permitting. E.
अनु, and मन् to mind, तृच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=028-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमरण|अनुमरणं
अनुमरण n. (-णं) Dying with or following in death; the term usually
denotes the cremation of a Hindu widow, whose husband's corpse
is not on the spot, and with part of whose dress she, therefore,
ascends the pile: this is prohibited to Brahman women. It is
also synonimous with सहमरण burning with the body.
 E. अनु with
or after, and मरण dying: dying with her husband.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=028-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमा
अनुमा f. (-मा) Inference (in logic,) drawing a conclusion from given
premises.
 E. अनु after or according to, मा from माङ् to measure,
affix अङ् and टाप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=028-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमान|अनुमानं
अनुमान n. (-नं) See अनुमा.
 E. अनु, and मा to measure, affix ल्युट्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=028-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमानोक्ति|अनुमानोक्तिः
अनुमानोक्ति f. (-क्तिः) Reasoning, logic.
 E. अनुमान, and उक्ति saying, speak
ing from inference.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=029-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमित
अनुमित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Inferred.
 E. अनु, and मित measured.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=029-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमिति|अनुमितिः
अनुमिति f. (-तिः) Inference, conclusion from given premises.
 E. अनु,
and मिति measuring.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=029-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमृता
अनुमृता f. (-ता) The woman who burns with a part of her husband's
dress.
 E. अनु, and मृता deceased.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=029-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमेय
अनुमेय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Inferable.
 E. अनु, and मेय to be measured.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=029-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमोदन|अनुमोदनं
अनुमोदन n. (-नं)
	 1. Pleasing.
	 2. Assent, acceptance.
	 3. Sympathetic joy.
E. अनु with, मोदन rejoicing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=029-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमोदित|अनुमोदितं
अनुमोदित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Pleased, delighted.
	 2. Agreeable, accept-
able.
 E. अनु, and मोदित pleased.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=029-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयात
अनुयात mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Followed, pursued.
	 2. Practised.
 E. अनु after,
यात gone.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=029-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयायित्व
अनुयायित्व n. (-त्वं)
	 1. Succession.
	 2. Subsequence.
 E. अनुयायिन्, and त्व
added.
