अनुलोम mfn. (-मः-मा-मं) Regular, successive, with the hair or grain. E.
अनु, and लोमन् hair of the body.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=029-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुलोमज|अनुलोमजः
अनुलोमज mfn. (-जः-जा-जं) Produced or born in due gradation; applied
especially to the mixed tribes; as the offspring of a Brahman
man and Kṣatriya woman, a Kṣatriya man and Vaiśya woman,
and so on. See प्रतिलोमज.
 E. अनुलोमन्, and ज born.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=029-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुलोमन|अनुलोमनं
अनुलोमन n. (-नं) (In medicine) Following the natural course or direc-
tion.
 E. अनुलोम used as a nominal verb, and ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=029-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवचन|अनुवचनं
अनुवचन n. (-नं)
	 1. Concordance, conformity to or concurrence with a
previous text or authority.
	 2. Subsidiary or similar doctrine.
 E. अनु,
and वचन speech.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=029-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवत्सर|अनुवत्सरं|अनुवत्सरः
अनुवत्सर m. (-रः) A year.
 E. अनु, and वत्सर a year.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=029-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवर्त्तन|अनुवर्तन|अनुवर्तनं|अनुवर्त्तनं
अनुवर्त्तन n. (-नं)
	 1. Obliging or serving another.
	 2. Consequence, result.
E. अनु, and वर्त्तन profession.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=029-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवाक|अनुवाकः
अनुवाक m. (-कः)
	 1. A chapter of the Vedas, a subdivision or section.
2. A compilation from the Ṛc, or Yajur Vedas.
 E. अनु, वच to
speak, affix घञ्.
