<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवाक्या
अनुवाक्या f. (-क्या) A prayer or formula from the Vedas,
 E. अनु, and वाक्या
a formula.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=029-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवाद|अनुवादः
अनुवाद m. (-दः)
	 1. Abuse, reviling.
	 2. Tautology, repetition.
	 3. Confor-
mity to what has been previously said or explained.
 E. अनु low, or
after, and वाद from वद् to speak, with घञ् aff.
