<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवादक
अनुवादक mfn. (-कः-का-कं)
	 1. Consenting to, replying.
	 2. Conformable to,
concurrent, corroborative.
 E. अनु, and वादक what says.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=029-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवादत्व
अनुवादत्व n. (-त्वं) Consent, conformity, concurrence.
 E. त्व or ता added
to अनुवाद; also अनुवादता.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=029-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवादिन्
अनुवादिन् mfn. (-दी-दिनी-दि) Consenting to, concurring with, conform-
able to.
 E. अनुवाद and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=029-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवाद्य
अनुवाद्य mfn. (-द्यः-द्या-द्यं) To be conformable or correspondent to.
	 n. (-द्यं)
The subject of a predicate.
 E. अनु before वद् to speak, ण्यत् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=029-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवारम्
अनुवारम् ind. Repeatedly.
 E. अनु, and वार time.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=029-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवास|अनुवासः
अनुवास m. (-सः)
	 1. Scenting, perfuming.
	 2. An oily enema.
 E. अनु and
वास to perfume, affix घञ्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=029-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवासन|अनुवासनं
अनुवासन n. (-नं)
	 1. Affection, attachment.
	 2. Perfuming the clothes,
especially dipping the ends of the cloth in perfumes.
	 3. Perfuming,
scenting in general.
	 4. An oily enema.
	 5. Administering oily
enemata.
 E. अनु after, वास to fumigate, and ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=029-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवासित
अनुवासित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Scented, perfumed.
	 2. Fumigated.
	 3.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=030-a" target="_blank">Page030-a+ 60</a>]
Prepared or administered as an enema.
 E. अनु before, वास to
fumigate, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=029-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवास्य
अनुवास्य mfn. (-स्यः-स्या-स्यं)
	 1. To be scented or fumigated.
	 2. Requiring
an enema.
 E. अनु before, वास and य aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=030-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुविद्ध
अनुविद्ध mfn. (-द्धः-द्धा-द्धं)
	 1. Variegated, ornamented.
	 2. Obstructed,
checked.
	 3. Full of, abounding in.
	 4. Set (as a jewel.)
 E. अनु, and
विद्ध penetrated.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=030-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुविधायिन्
अनुविधायिन् mfn. (-यी-यिनी-यि) Conformable, compliant, obedient, atten-
tive to.
 E. अनु and विधायिन् observing rules.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=030-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवृत्ति|अनुवृत्तिः
अनुवृत्ति f. (-त्तिः)
	 1. Complaisance, obliging or serving another. See
अनुरोध.
	 2. A subsequent or supplementary rule, completing what a
preceding one has left to be explained.
	 3. Imitating, doing or
acting in like manner.
 E. अनु before, वृत् to serve, and क्तिन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=030-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवेल्लित
