<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुव्रजन|अनुव्रजनं
अनुव्रजन n. (-नं) Complimentary attendance on a departing guest, fol-
lowing him to a given distance; also अनुव्रज्या.
 E. अनु after and व्रजन
or व्रज्या going.
