अनुशर|अनुशरः
अनुशर m. (-रः) A Rākshasa, a sort of demon.
 E. अनु repeatedly, शृ to
injure, and अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=030-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशस्त्र|अनुशस्त्रं
अनुशस्त्र n. (-स्त्रं) A supplementary or subsidiary weapon or instrument.
E. अनु, and शस्त्र a weapon.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=030-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

