अनुशीलन|अनुशीलनं
अनुशीलन n. (-नं) Repeated and devoted service.
 E. अनु according to,
शीलन behaving.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=030-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

