<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुष्ठेय
अनुष्ठेय mfn. (-यः-या-यं)
	 1. To be proved or established, demonstrable.
2. To be effected or accomplished.
 E. अनु before स्था to stay,
य aff.
