<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसन्धेय|अनुसंधेय
अनुसन्धेय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Investigable, worthy of inquiry or scrutiny. E.
अनु, and सम् before धा to have, य aff.
