<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसारिन्
अनुसारिन् mfn. (-री-रिणी-रि)
	 1. Following.
	 2. According with or to. E.
अनुसार, and इनि aff.
