<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुहार|अनुहारः
अनुहार m. (-रः)
	 1. Imitation.
	 2. Resemblance.
 E. अनु like, हृञ् to convey,
and घञ् aff.
