अनूद्य mfn. (-द्यः-द्या-द्यं)
	 1. Not to be addressed or spoken to.
	 2. To be
spoken to afterwards or in reply to.
	 m. (-द्यः) A spiritual teacher,
&c.
 E. अ before वद् to speak, यत् affix, form irregular, it is improper
