<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तःशरीर
अन्तःशरीर n. (-रं) The internal and spiritual part of man, the con-
science, the soul.
 E. अन्तर् within, शरीर the body.
