अन्तरिक्ष|अंतरिक्षं|अन्तरिक्षं
अन्तरिक्ष n. (-क्षं) The sky or atmosphere.
 E. अन्तर् within, and ऋक्ष a star;
in which are the stars: or ईक्ष to see; seen by the world; the
word is properly written with the long vowel, as अन्तरीक्ष, but the
short is substituted in poetry.
