अन्तशय्या
अन्तशय्या f. (-य्या)
	 1. Death.
	 2. A bed or mat on the ground.
	 3. The
place for burial or burning.
 E. अन्त end, and शय्या a sleeping place.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=032-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
