<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तिकतम|अन्तिकतमः
अन्तिकतम mfn. (-मः-मा-मत्) Very near.
 E. अन्तिक, and डतम superlative aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=032-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तिकता
अन्तिकता f. (-ता) Nearness, vicinity, contiguity: also अन्तिकत्वं.
 E. अन्तिक
with, ता or त्व aff.
