अन्तेवासिन्
अन्तेवासिन् m. (-सी)
	 1. A pupil.
	 2. A Caṇḍāla, or man of a low caste.
mfn. (-सी-सिनी-सि) Final, ultimate.
 E. अन्त in the locative case, near
or final; वस to abide, and णिनि affix: who dwells near his teacher,
&c. See अन्तवासिन्.
