अन्त्यज|अन्त्यजः
अन्त्यज mfn. (-जः-जा-जं) Younger, latest born.
	 m. (-जः)
	 1. A Śūdra or
man of the fourth tribe.
	 2. A man of one of seven inferior
tribes; a washerman, currier, mimic, Varuḍa, fisherman, Meda
or attendant on women, and mountaineer or forester.
 E. अन्त्य in-
ferior, and ज who is born: born from the feet of BRAHMĀ; also
अन्त्यजात.
