अन्त्यावसायिन्
अन्त्यावसायिन् mf. (-यी-यिनी) A man or woman of low caste, especially one
of seven classes: a Caṇḍāla, a Śvapaca or executioner, a Kṣattā
or insect hunter, a charioteer, a bard, and a Vaideha or attendant
on women.
	 2. A man or a woman of a particular caste living by
the chase. See अन्तावसायिन्.
