अन्धतमस|अन्धतमसं
अन्धतमस n. (-सं) Great darkness.
 E. अन्ध to make blind, and तमस dark-
ness: also written अन्धतामसं, अ being made long.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्धता
अन्धता f. (-ता) Blindness. Also n. अन्धत्वं.
 E. ता or त्व added to अन्ध.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्धतामिश्र|अन्धतामिश्रः
अन्धतामिश्र n. (-श्रं)
	 1. A division of Tartarus, the second of the twenty-one hells.
2. The doctrine of annihilation after death.
 E. अन्ध blind,
great, and तामिश्र darkness.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्धमूषा
अन्धमूषा f. (-षा) A small covered crucible, with a hole in the side. E.
अन्ध, and मूषा a crucible.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्धमूषिका
अन्धमूषिका f. (-का) The name of a grass. See देवताड.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्धस्|अंधस्
अन्धस् n. (-न्धः) Boiled rice.
 E. अद to eat, नम् inserted, and असुन् Unādi
affix, द changed to ध.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्धालजी
अन्धालजी f. (-जी) A blind boil, one that does not suppurate.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्धाहि|अन्धाहिः
अन्धाहि mf. (-हिः-हिः) A kind of fish, vulg. kūñciyā; a species of eel?
E. अन्ध blind, and अहि a snake: from its form and the smallness of
its eyes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्धिका|अंधिका
अन्धिका f. (-का)
	 1. Night.
	 2. Gambling.
	 3. A small kind of mustard. See
सर्षप.
	 4. A woman.
	 5. A disease of the eye.
 E. अन्ध dark or blind,
and कन् affix in the fem. form.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्धीकृत
अन्धीकृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Made or become blind.
 E. अन्ध, and कृत made, च्वि
augment.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्धीभूत
अन्धीभूत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Become blind.
 E. अन्ध, and भूत become, च्वि
augment.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्धु|अंधुः|अन्धुः
अन्धु m. (-न्धुः) A Well.
 E. अम to go, and तुक् Unādi affix; ध is substituted
for त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्धुल|अंधुलः|अन्धुलः
अन्धुल m. (-लः) A tree, (Mimosa sirisa, Rox.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्ध्र|अंध्र|अंध्रः|अन्ध्रः
अन्ध्र m. (-न्ध्रः) A hunter, one who lives by killing game; a man of low
caste, the offspring of a Vaideha father and Kārāvara mother; not
allowed to reside within a village or town.
	 2. A country, modern
Telingana; also आन्ध्र.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्न|अन्नं|अन्नः
अन्न mfn. (-न्नः-न्ना-न्नं) Eaten.
	 n. (-न्नं)
	 1. Boiled rice.
	 2. Food in general.
3. Corn.
 E. अद to eat, and क्त affix of the part. past, त becoming न.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्नकाल|अन्नकालः
अन्नकाल m. (-लः) Meal time, proper hour for eating.
 E. अन्न, and काल
time.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्नकोष्ठ
अन्नकोष्ठ m. (-ष्ठः) A cupboard, a granary.
 E. अन्न, and कोष्ठ or receptacle.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्नकोष्ठक|अन्नकोष्ठकः
अन्नकोष्ठक m. (-कः)
	 1. VIṢṆU.
	 2. The sun.
	 m. (-कः) A granary, a cupboard.
E. अन्न food, कोष्ठक a repository.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्नगन्धि|अन्नगन्धिः
अन्नगन्धि m. (-न्धिः) Dysentery, diarrhœa.
 E. अन्न food, गन्ध smell.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्नज
अन्नज mfn. (-जः-जा-जं) Springing from or occasioned by food.
 E. अन्न, and
ज born.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्नजल
अन्नजल n. (-लं) Support, subsistence.
 E. अन्न, and जल water, meat and
drink.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्नद
अन्नद mfn. (-दः-दा-दं) One who gives food.
	 f. (-दा) A goddess, a form of
DURGĀ.
 E. अन्न, and द who gives.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्नदातृ
अन्नदातृ m. (-ता) One who gives food, a charitable man.
 E. अन्न, and दातृ
donor.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्नदान
अन्नदान n. (-नं) The giving of rice or food, the maintenance of a person.
E. अन्न, and दान giving.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्नद्वेष|अन्नद्वेषः
अन्नद्वेष m. (-षः) Want of appetite, dislike of food.
 E. अन्न, and द्वेष dislike.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्नपरिवर्त्त|अन्नपरिवर्त
अन्नपरिवर्त्त m. (-र्त्तः) Change of diet.
 E. अन्न, and परिवर्त्त revolution.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्नपूर्णा|अन्नपूर्ण्णा
अन्नपूर्णा f. (-र्णा) A goddess, a form of DURGĀ.
 E. अन्न, and पूर्ण who fills
with.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्नपूर्व्वा|अन्नपूर्वा
अन्नपूर्व्वा f. (-र्व्वा) A goddess, a form of DURGĀ.
 E. अन्न, and पूर्व्व prior.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्नप्राशन|अन्नप्राशनं
अन्नप्राशन n. (-नं) A religious ceremony, in which after presenting obla-
tions to fire, a little rice is, for the first time, put into the child's
mouth; it should take place between the fifth and eighth month. E.
अन्न, and प्राशन feeding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्नब्रह्मन्
अन्नब्रह्मन् n. (-ह्म) The deification of food, considering it in the light of
BRAHMĀ, as the pervader and supporter of existence.
 E. अन्न, and
ब्रह्म the Supreme.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्नभूमि
अन्नभूमि f. (-मिः) A large collection of food.
 E. अन्न, and भूमि a heap.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्नमय
अन्नमय mfn. (-यः-यी-यं)
	 1. Composed of food, containing food.
	 2. Derived
or made from food.
	 m. (-यः) The body.
 E. अन्न and मयट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्नमयकोष|अन्नमयकोषः
अन्नमयकोष m. (-षः) The gross material body, that which is sustained by
food.
 E. अन्नमय, and कोष sheath, (of the spirit.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्नमल|अन्नमलं
अन्नमल n. (-लं) Spirituous liquor, the excrement or ferment of rice, &c.
E. अन्न, and मल fœcula.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्नरस|अन्नरसः
अन्नरस m. (-सः) Chyle.
 E. अन्न, and रस juice.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्नलिप्सा
अन्नलिप्सा f. (-प्सा) Hunger, craving.
 E. अन्न, and लिप्सा desire.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्नवाहिस्रोतस्
अन्नवाहिस्रोतस् n. (-तः) The œsophagus.
 E. अन्न, and वाहि what conveys,
स्रोतस् canal.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्नविकार|अन्नविकारः
अन्नविकार m. (-रः) The seminal secretion
 E. अन्न, and विकार change of
form.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्नशेष|अन्नशेषः
अन्नशेष m. (-षः) Leavings, offal.
 E. अन्न, and शेष remainder.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्नाद|अन्नादः
अन्नाद mfn. (-दः-दा-दं)
	 1. Feeding, eating.
	 2. The partaker or eater of
another's food.
	 m. (-दः) VIṢṆU.
 E. अन्न, and अद who eats.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्नायिन्
अन्नायिन् mfn. (-यी-यिनी-यि) Hungry; desiring food.
 E. अन्न nominal verb
to want food, णिनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्नाहारिन्
अन्नाहारिन् mfn. (-री-रिणी-रि) Eating, feeding.
 E. अन्न, and आहारिन् who
eats.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्य|अन्यः
अन्य mfn. (-न्यः-न्या-न्यत्)
	 1. Other, different.
	 2. Unlike.
 E. अन्य to live, and
यक् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्यत्
अन्यत् ind. Otherwise. E. See the last.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्यगामिन्
अन्यगामिन् mfn. (-मी-मिनी-मि)
	 1. Adulterous.
	 2. Going to another (place,
&c.)
 E. अन्य another (husband or wife,) गामिन् who goes to.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=033-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्यच्च
अन्यच्च ind.
	 1. Again, moreover.
	 2. On the contrary
 E. अन्यत्, and च added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्यज
अन्यज mfn. (-जः-जा-जं) Born of another (family, &c.) of a different origin.
E. अन्य, and ज born.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्यजन्मन्
अन्यजन्मन् n. (-न्म) Another birth, being born again, the metempsychosis.
E. अन्य, and जन्मन् birth.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्यतम|अन्यतमः
अन्यतम mfn. (-मः-मा-मत्)
	 1. Either, any, any one of many.
	 2. Different,
distinct from many.
 E. अन्य, and डतम aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्यतर|अन्यतरः
अन्यतर mfn. (-रः-रा-रत्)
	 1. Other, different.
	 2. Either of two.
 E. अन्य other,
and डतर affix; applied to words that refer to but two things.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्यतरेद्युस्
अन्यतरेद्युस् ind. Either of two days.
 E. अन्यतर, and एद्युस् affix, derived
from द्युस् a day.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्यतस्
अन्यतस् ind. Elsewhere.
 E. अन्य, and तसि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्यत्र
अन्यत्र ind.
	 1. Elsewhere, in another place.
	 2. Except, unless, without. E.
अन्य, and त्रल् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्यथा
अन्यथा ind.
	 1. Otherwise, in a different manner.
	 2. Inaccurately, untruly.
3. Badly.
 E. अन्य, and थाल् affix, referring to manner.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्यथाख्याति|अन्यथाख्यातिः
अन्यथाख्याति f. (-तिः) Erroneous conception of spirit.
 E. अन्यथा and ख्याति
declaring.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्यथात्व
अन्यथात्व n. (-त्वं) An opposite or different state of the case.
 E. अन्यथा and
त्व aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्यथासिद्धि|अन्यथासिद्धिः
अन्यथासिद्धि f. (-द्धिः) Disproving a cause or argument, by giving it a
different effect or application, coming to a different conclusion
from the same premises.
 E. अन्यथा otherwise, and सिद्धि proving,
establishing.
