<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्यपुष्ट|अन्यपुष्टः
अन्यपुष्ट m. (-ष्टः) The koil or Indian cuckoo, supposed to be reared by
the crow.
 E. अन्य, and पुष्ट nourished.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्यपूर्व्वा|अन्यपूर्वा
अन्यपूर्व्वा f. (-र्व्वा) A girl previously promised or betrothed to one and
married to another.
 E. अन्य, and पूर्व्व prior.
