<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्यभृत्
अन्यभृत् m. (-त्) A crow.
 E. अन्य another, भृत् who nourishes: the crow is
supposed to sit upon the eggs of the kokila: from भृ root, and क्विप्
aff.
