<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्यभृत|अन्यभृतः
अन्यभृत m. (-तः) The kokila or Indian cuckoo.
 E. अन्य, and भृत nourished,
from भृ with part. affix क्त; this bird, like the English cuckoo, being
supposed to leave its eggs in the nests of other birds.
