	 1. Research, investigation of duty by reasoning.
2. Research, enquiry in general.
 E. अनु, इष to desire and ल्यु aff. and
in the fem. टाप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्वेषित|अन्वेषितः
अन्वेषित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Sought. E. The part. past of इष, with अनु prefixed,
and इ inserted before क्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्वेषिन्
अन्वेषिन् mfn. (-षी-षिणी-षि) Seeking, inquiring after.
 E. अनु before, इष to
wish, णिनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्वेष्टृ
अन्वेष्टृ mfn. (-ष्टा-ष्ट्री-ष्टृ) An enquirer, a searcher.
 E. अनु before इष, and
तृच् affix of agency.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपःसान्त
अपःसान्त n. (-न्तं) The offering or performance of sacrifice.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्
अप् f. pl. only, (आपः) Water.
 E. आप to obtain, and क्विप् Unādi affix;
the vowel of the radical becomes short.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप|अपः
अप ind. A particle and preposition implying.
	 1. Inferiority, (below,
worse.)
	 2. Privation, (from.)
	 3. Separation, (away, from.)
	 4. Con-
trariety, (against, opposite to.)
	 5. Difference, (from.)
	 6. Dis-
honesty.
	 7. Exultation: as अपकृष्टुं to revile, अपहर्त्तुं to take away,
अपकर्त्तुं to do wrong, अपवक्तुं to contradict, अपकीर्त्ति infamy, &c.
 E. अ
neg. and प from पा to preserve.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपकरण|अपकरणं
अपकरण n. (-णं)
	 1. Acting improperly, doing wrong.
	 2. Ill-treating,
offending, injuring.
 E. अप before, कृ to do, ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपकर्तृ|अपकर्त्तृ
अपकर्तृ mfn. (-र्ता-र्त्री-र्तृ) Injurious, offensive, hostile, inimical, an enemy.
E. अप before, कृ to do, तृक् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपकर्म्मन्|अपकर्मन्
अपकर्म्मन् n. (-र्म्म)
	 1. Evil doing, wickedness.
	 2. Oppression, violence.
	 3.
Laziness, incompetence.
	 4. Any impure or degrading act or rite. E.
अप before, कर्म्मन् act.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपकलङ्क|अपकलंक|अपकलंकः|अपकलङ्कः
अपकलङ्क m. (-ङ्कः) An indelible disgrace.
 E. अप before, कलङ्क a stain.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपकर्ष|अपकर्षः
अपकर्ष m. (-र्षः)
	 1. Pulling down, bringing low, lowering, depressing.
	 2.
Inferiority, infamy, degradation. So अपकर्षण n. (-णं)
 E. अप before, कृष
to attack, घञ् or ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपकार|अपकारः
अपकार m. (-रः)
	 1. Injury, offence, wrong, mischief.
	 2. Wickedness.
	 3.
Tyranny, oppression.
	 4. Hatred, enmity.
 E. अप ill, and कार what
does.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपकारक|अपकारकः
अपकारक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Injuring, pernicious.
 E. अप before, कृ to do,
ण्वुल् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपकारगिर्
अपकारगिर् f. (-गीः) Reproach and menace.
 E. अपकार hatred, and गिर्
speech.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपकारिन्
अपकारिन् mfn. (-री-रिणी-रि)
	 1. Offensive, oppressive.
	 2. Wicked, doing
ill.
	 3. Mischievous, malicious.
	 4. Inimical.
 E. अपकार, and
इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपकारार्थिन्
अपकारार्थिन् mfn. (-र्थी-र्थिनी-र्थि) Malicious, malevolent.
 E. अपकार and
अर्थिन् who aims at.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपकीर्त्ति|अपकीर्ति|अपकीर्तिः
अपकीर्त्ति f. (-र्त्तिः) Infamy, disgrace.
 E. अप before, कीर्त्ति fame.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपकृत
अपकृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Done wrong, maliciously, offensively, or
wickedly committed.
	 2. Who does wrong.
	 3. Ill-treated.
	 4. Ob-
served or practised as a degrading or impure act, as servile
duties, funeral rites, &c.
 E. अप before, कृ to do, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपकृति|अपकृतिः
अपकृति f. (-तिः)
	 1. Oppression, wrong, injury.
	 2. Enmity, opposition.
3. Any degrading or impure act or rite.
 E. अप before, कृ to do,
क्तिन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपकृष्ट|अपकृष्टं|अपकृष्टः
अपकृष्ट mfn. (-ष्टः-ष्टा-ष्टं)
	 1. Low, vile, inferior.
	 2. Perplexed, distressed.
3. Depressed, lowered, brought down. E. part. past of कृष्, with अप
prefixed.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपकृष्टता
अपकृष्टता f. (-ता) Inferiorty, vileness. So अपकृष्टत्व n. (-त्वं)
 E. तल् or त्व
added to the last.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपक्ति|अपक्तिः
अपक्ति f. (-क्तिः)
	 1. Immaturity.
	 2. Indigestion.
 E. अ neg. पक्ति ripeness.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपक्व|अपक्वः
अपक्व mfn. (-क्वः-क्वा-क्वं) Unripe, immature.
 E. अ neg. पक्व ripe.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपक्वता
अपक्वता f. (-ता) Immaturity.
 E. अपक्व, and तल् affix: also with त्व, अपक्वत्वं.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपक्रम|अपक्रमः
अपक्रम m. (-मः)
	 1. Flight, retreat.
	 2. Passing off or away.
 E. अप from,
and क्रम to go, with अच् aff.
