<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपक्रमण|अपक्रमणं
अपक्रमण n. (-णं) Retiring, passing off or away.
 E. अप before, क्रम to go,
ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपक्रिया
अपक्रिया f. (-या)
	 1. Oppression, offence.
	 2. Evil doing, wickedness.
	 3.
Any impure act or rite.
 E. अप, and क्रिया action.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपक्रोश|अपक्रोशः
अपक्रोश m. (-शः) Reviling, abusing.
 E. अप against, क्रुश to call out, and
घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपक्ष
अपक्ष mfn. (-क्षः-क्षा-क्षं) Adverse, opposed to, not of the same side or
party.
 E. अ neg. पक्ष a party.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपक्षता
अपक्षता f. (-ता) Opposition, hostility.
 E. अपक्ष, and तल् affix: or with त्व
affix अपक्षत्वं.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपगत|अपगतः
अपगत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Dead, deceased.
	 2. Gone, departed, remote,
gone off.
 E. अप away, and गत gone.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपगम|अपगमः
अपगम m. (-मः) Departure, separation, death.
 E. अप, and गम to go,
affix अच्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपगा
अपगा f. (-गा) A river.
 E. अप down, below, or अप् water, and thence the
sea; and गा what goes downward or into the sea; also आपगा.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपघन|अपघनः
अपघन m. (-नः) A limb or member.
 E. अप, and घन from हन् to kill or
hurt.
