<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपघात|अपघातः
अपघात m. (-तः) Striking or cutting off, killing.
 E. अप, and घात striking.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपघातिन्
अपघातिन् mfn. (-ती-तिनी-ति) Murderous, killing.
 E. अपघात, and इनि aff.
