<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपचय|अपचयः
अपचय m. (-यः)
	 1. Loss, privation.
	 2. Respect, obeisance.
 E. अप opposite
to, and चय from चि to collect, with अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपचायित|अपचायितः
अपचायित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Saluted, reverenced.
 E. अप here implying
much or highly; and चायित part. past of चाय to reverence.
