अपचार|अपचारः
अपचार m. (-रः)
	 1. Impropriety, defect, wickedness.
	 2. Observing
unwholesome or improper regimen.
 E. अप before, चर to go, घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपचारिन्
अपचारिन् mfn. (-रि-रिणी-रि) Wicked, bad, one who acts wickedly. E.
अपचार, and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपचित|अपचितः
अपचित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Saluted, honoured.
	 2. Diminished, expended,
wasted.
 E. अप before, चाय to reverence, or चि to collect, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपचिति|अपचितिः
अपचिति f. (-तिः)
	 1. Loss.
	 2. Expense.
	 3. Annihilation.
	 4. Worship,
reverence.
 E. अप before चाय or चि, and क्तिन् aff.
