<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपचेतृ
अपचेतृ m. (-ता) A spendthrift.
 E. अप, चि to collect, तृच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपच्छाय|अपच्छायः
अपच्छाय mfn. (-यः-या-यं)
	 1. Shadowless, having no shadow, as a deity or
