 E. अ neg. पञ्च five, कृत made, च्वि augment.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपटान्तर|अपटांतर|अपटान्तरं
