<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपटीक्षेप|अपटीक्षेपः
अपटीक्षेप m. (-पः) Precipitate entrance on the stage, indicating hurry
and agitation; also read अपटाक्षेप.
 E. अपटी curtain, and क्षेप tossing.
