<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपटु|अपटुः
अपटु mfn. (-टुः-टुः-ट्वी-टु)
	 1. Sick, diseased.
	 2. Awkward, not clever,
uncouth.
	 3. Ineloquent.
 E. अ neg. पटु clever.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपटुकरण
अपटुकरण n. (-णं) A defect in any of the senses.
 E. अपटु, and करण doing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपण्डित|अपंडित
अपण्डित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Unlearned, ignorant.
 E. अ neg. पण्डित learned.
