<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपतर्पण|अपतर्पणं
अपतर्पण n. (-णं) Fasting, (in sickness.)
 E. अप bad, and तर्पण satisfaction.
