<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपतानक|अपतानकः
अपतानक m. (-कः) Spasmodic contraction: see the last.
 E. अप down, तन
to spread, ण्वुल् aff.
