<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपत्य|अपत्यं
अपत्य n. (-त्यं) Offspring, male or female.
 E. अ neg. पत to fall, and यत्
affix; the family being upheld by them.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपत्यदा
अपत्यदा f. (-दा) A midwife.
 E. अपत्य offspring, and दा fem. deriv. who
gives.
