<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपत्यपथ|अपत्यपथः
अपत्यपथ m. (-थः) The vulva.
 E. अपत्य, and पथ the road.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपत्यविक्रयिन्
अपत्यविक्रयिन् m. (-यी) A father who receives a gratuity from his son-in-law,
a seller of his offspring.
 E. अपत्य, and विक्रयिन् who sells.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपत्यशत्रु|अपत्यशत्रुः
अपत्यशत्रु m. (-त्रुः) A crab.
 E. अपत्य offspring, and शत्रु an enemy. The crab
being said to perish on producing young.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपत्रप|अपत्रपः
अपत्रप mfn. (-पः-पा-पं)
	 1. Bashful, modest.
	 2. Immodest.
	 f. (-पा)
	 1. Bashful-
ness.
	 2. Want of shame, immodesty.
 E. अप, and त्रपा shame.
