<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपथ्य|अपथ्यं
अपथ्य mfn. (-थ्यः-थ्या-थ्यं)
	 1. Unsuitable, inconsistent.
	 2. (In medicine)
Contraindicated, unfit as food or drink in particular complaints.
E. अ neg. पथ्य suitable.
