अपद|अपदः
अपद mfn. (-द-दा or -दी-दं)
	 1. Footless, having no feet.
	 2. Having no
place, no station. adv.
	 n. (-दं) Unseasonably, inopportunely.
	 m.
(-दः) A reptile.
 E. अ neg. पद a foot.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपदान|अपदानं
अपदान n. (-नं)
	 1. Approved occupation.
	 2. Work well or completely
done.
 E. अप before, दा to give, and ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपदानक|अपदानकं
अपदानक n. (-कं) See the above.
 E. कन् added.
