<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपदान्तर|अपदान्तरः
अपदान्तर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Adjoining, contiguous.
	 n. (-रं) Proximity, close,
contiguity.
 E. अ neg. पद a foot, and अन्तर between.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपदार्थ|अपदार्थः
अपदार्थ m. (-र्थः) Nonentity.
 E. अ neg. पदार्थ a thing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपदिश|अपदिशं
अपदिश n. or ind. (-शं) Intermediate space, half of a point of the com-
pass.
 E. अप, and दिश to show, क aff.
