<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपदिश्य
अपदिश्य ind.
	 1. Dispersing, going or having gone to various quarters.
2. Having shown or stated.
 E. अप before, दिश to show, य aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपदेवता
अपदेवता f. (-ता) An evil spirit, a goblin.
 E. अप, and देवता a deity.
