<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपदेश|अपदेशः
अपदेश m. (-शः)
	 1. Evasion, prevarication.
	 2. Disguise by dress, &c.
	 3.
Place, quarter.
	 4. A butt or mark.
	 5. Cause.
	 6. Fame, reputation.
7. A contrivance, a pretence, a pretext.
 E. अप ill, badly, &c. and
दिश to show. with घञ् aff.
