अपध्वस्त mfn. (-स्तः-स्ता-स्तं)
	 1. Cursed, reviled.
	 2. Abandoned.
	 3. Pounded.
E. अप implying contempt, &c. part. past of ध्वस to go, also अवध्वस्त.
