<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपनुत्ति|अपनुत्तिः
अपनुत्ति f. (-त्तिः) Removing, taking or sending away.
 E. अप, नुद to send,
क्तिन् aff.
