<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपनोदन|अपनोदनं
अपनोदन n. (-नं)
	 1. Removing, destroying.
	 2. Expiating.
 E. अप before,
नुद to send, ल्युट् aff.
