<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपपात्रित|अपपात्रितः
अपपात्रित m. (-तः) A person who has lost caste, one with whom his
kindred will not eat or drink, from a common pātra or vessel. E.
अपपात्र, and इतच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपभी
अपभी mfn. (-भीः-भीः-भि) Fearless, undaunted.
 E. अप away, भी fear.
