<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपमान्य
अपमान्य mfn. (-न्यः-न्या-न्यं) Disreputable, dishonourable.
 E. अप before,
मन to mind, ण्यत् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपमित
अपमित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Neglect in dress or person, unadorned.
	 2.
Disrespected, disgraced.
 E. अप before, मा to measure, क्त aff.
