<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपरत्व|अपरत्वं
अपरत्व n. (-त्वं)
	 1. Opposition, contrariety.
	 2. Posteriorly, (in place or
time;) also अपरता f. (-ता.)
 E. त्व or तल् added to अपर.
