<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपररात्र|अपररात्रः
अपररात्र m. (-त्रः) The end of the night, the last watch.
 E. अपर the end,
रात्र from रात्रि a night.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपरलोक|अपरलोकः
