<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपरवोज्झित
अपरवोज्झित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Undisturbed, undisputed.
 E. अपरव, and उज्झित
free from.
