अपराजित|अपराजितः
अपराजित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Unconquered, unsurpassed.
	 m. (-तः)
	 1. A name
of ŚIVA.
	 2. Also of VIṢṆU.
	 3. A sage.
	 f. (-ता)
	 1. A name applied to
several plants.
	 2. (Clitoria ternatea,) see गिरिकर्णी.
	 3. Æschynomene
sesban, see जया. and, 4. Another plant, see अशनपर्णी.
	 5. A name of
the goddess DURGĀ.
	 6. A species of the शर्कर metre of four lines,
with fourteen syllables in each line.
	 7. The north-east quarter. E.
अपर another, अ neg. and जित conquered, excelled, &c.
