<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवरण|अपवरणं
अपवरण n. (-णं)
	 1. Covering, screening.
	 2. A garment, a mantle.
 E. अप
before, वृ to screen, ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवर्ग|अपवर्गः
अपवर्ग m. (-र्गः)
	 1. Final beatitude, the delivery of the soul from the body,
and exemption from farther transmigration.
	 2. Abandoning, quit-
ting.
	 3. The fruit or consequences of any completed act.
	 4. The
completion of any act.
	 5. Any act brought to a conclusion.
	 6.
End, completion.
 E. अप from, वृज् to forsake, घञ् affix, and ग
substituted for ज.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवर्गद
अपवर्गद mfn. (-दः-दा-दं) Conferring final beatitude.
 E. अपवर्ग, and द who
gives.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवर्जन|अपवर्जनं|अपवर्ज्जन|अपवर्ज्जनं
अपवर्जन n. (-नं)
	 1. Gift or donation.
	 2. Final emancipation or beatitude.
3. Abandoning, abandonment.
 E. अप before, वृज् to forsake, and
ल्युट् aff. See अपवर्ग.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवर्ज्जित|अपवर्जित
अपवर्ज्जित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Abandoned, quitted, got rid of, given cast
away.
 E. अप before, वृज् to forsake, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवर्त्त|अपवर्त|अपवर्तः
अपवर्त्त m. (-र्त्तः)
	 1. Taking away.
	 2. A common measure in algebra. E.
अप away, वृत to be, घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवर्त्तन|अपवर्तन|अपवर्तनं
अपवर्त्तन n. (-नं)
	 1. Agitating, shaking.
	 2. Taking away, removal, resump-
tion.
	 3. Transferring, removing from one place to another.
	 4.
Abbreviation, abridging.
	 5. Division by a common measure, re-
duction of a fraction to its lowest terms.
 E. अप away, वृत to be,
ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवाद|अपवादः
अपवाद m. (-दः)
	 1. Censure, blame.
	 2. An order, a command.
	 3. Differ-
ence, distinction, exception.
	 4. Contradiction, opposition, denial.
E. अप implying aversion, and वाद speech, from वद with घञ्; also
अववाद.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवादक
अपवादक mfn. (-कः-का-कं)
	 1. Censuring, accusing.
	 2. Opposing, object-
ing to.
	 3. Excepting, excluding.
 E. अप before, वद to speak, ण्वुल्
aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवादित
अपवादित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Accused, censured.
	 2. Opposed, objected to.
E. अप before, वद to speak, causal form, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवादिन्
अपवादिन् mfn. (-दी-दिनी-दि)
	 1. Accusing, defaming.
	 2. Opposing, object-
ing to.
 E. अपवाद and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवारण|अपवारणं
अपवारण n. (-णं) Disappearance, concealment, covering.
 E. अप before,
वृञ् to hide, in the causal form, ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवारित|अपवारितं
अपवारित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Covered, concealed, disappeared.
 E. अप before, वृञ्
to hide, क्त affix, and the vowel is made long.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवार्य्य|अपवार्य
अपवार्य्य ind.
	 1. (In theatrical language) Apart, aside.
	 2. Having con-
cealed.
 E. अप before, वृञ् to hide, ण्यत् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवाह|अपवाहः
अपवाह m. (-हः) An inference or deduction.
 E. अप before, वह to bear,
घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवित्र|अपवित्रं
अपवित्र mfn. (-त्रः-त्रा-त्रं) Impure, unclean.
 E. अ neg. पवित्र pure.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवित्रता
अपवित्रता f. (-ता) Impurity, uncleanness. So अपवित्रत्व n. (-त्रं)
 E. तल् or त्व
added to the last.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपविद्ध|अपविद्धः
अपविद्ध mfn. (-द्धः-द्धा-द्धं)
	 1. Rejected, dismissed, removed.
	 2. Thrown,
sent.
	 3. Broken to pieces.
 E. अप before. व्यध to strike, क्त the part.
affix, and the semivowel changed to its corresponding vowel इ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपविद्धपुत्र|अपविद्धपुत्रः
अपविद्धपुत्र m. (-त्रः) A son rejected by his natural parents, and adopted
by a stranger; one of the twelve objects of filiation in Hindu
law.
 E. अपविद्ध as before and पुत्र a son.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपविषा
अपविषा f. (-षा) A species of grass, (Kyllingia monocephala.)
 E. अप, and
विष poison.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवृत्त
अपवृत्त mfn. (-त्तः-त्ता-त्तं)
	 1. Reversed, inverted, overturned.
	 2. Deprived
of 3. Uncovered
 E. अप, and वृत्त established.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवेध|अपवेधः
अपवेध m. (-धः) Piercing any thing in the wrong direction.
 E. अप, and
वेध perforating.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपव्यय|अपव्ययः
अपव्यय m. (-यः) Prodigality.
 E. अप, and व्यय expense.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपव्ययमान
अपव्ययमान mfn. (-नः-ना-नं)
	 1. Squandering.
	 2. Denying a debt.
 E. अप
away, व्यय expenditure, used as a verb, शानच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपव्ययिन्
अपव्ययिन् mfn. (-यी-यिनी-यि) Squandering, wasting, prodigal.
 E. अपव्यय
and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपशङ्क|अपशंक
अपशङ्क mfn. (-ङ्कः-ङ्का-ङ्कं) Fearless, having no fear or hesitation. adv.
	 n.
(-ङ्कं) Fearlessly.
 E. अप, and शङ्क fear.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपशद|अपशदः
अपशद m. (-दः) A low man. See अपसद.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपशब्द|अपशब्दः
अपशब्द m. (-ब्दः)
	 1. Ungrammatical language.
	 2. Common or vulgar
speech, any form of language not Sanskrit.
 E. अप bad, and शब्द
sound.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपशुच्
अपशुच् m. (-शुक्) The soul.
 E. अप, and शुच् sorrow.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपशोक|अपशोकः
अपशोक m. (-कः) A tree, (Jonesia asoca.)
 E. अप, and शोक sorrow.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपष्ट
अपष्ट n. (-ष्टं) The end or point of the hook for driving an elephant. E.
अप before, ष्टे to surround, and ड aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपष्टम
अपष्टम m. (-मः) The point of the hook by which elephants are driven.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपष्ठु|अपष्ठुः
अपष्ठु m. (-ष्ठुः) Time.
	 mfn. (-ष्ठुः-ष्ठुः-ष्ठु)
	 1. Contrary, opposite.
	 2. Left,
(not right.) ind.
	 1. Well, properly.
	 2. Handsomely.
	 3. Contrary,
perversely.
 E. अप badly, स्थ what stays, with कु Unādi affix; स्थ
becomes ष्ठ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपष्ठुर|अपष्ठुरं
अपष्ठुर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Opposite, contrary.
 E. अपष्ठु contrary, and र
from रा to obtain, affix ड.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपष्ठुल|अपष्ठुलं
अपष्ठुल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Opposite, contrary, E. As before, ल substituted
for र
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपस्
अपस् n. (-पः) Sacrificing.
 E. आप to obtain, अमुन् Unādi aff.; the radical
vowel made short.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपसद|अपसदः
अपसद m. (-दः) A low man, an outcaste; it especially applies to the
children of six degrading connexions, or of a Brāhman with the
women of the three lower classes; of a Kṣatriya with
women of two, the Vaiśya, and Śūdra; and of a Vaiśya with one
of a lower class or a Śūdra.
 E. अप low, सद to abide, and अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपसर|अपसरः
अपसर m. (-रः) The removal of any thing from one place to another.
E. अप before सृ to go, अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपसर्जन|अपसर्जनं|अपसर्ज्जन|अपसर्ज्जनं
अपसर्जन n. (-नं)
	 1. A gift or donation.
	 2. Killing.
	 3. Final emancipa-
tion.
	 4. Abandonment.
 E. अप before, सृज to leave, and ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपसरण|अपसरणं
अपसरण n. (-णं) Going out, egress.
 E. अप before, सरणं going.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपसर्प|अपसर्पः
अपसर्प m. (-र्पः) A secret emissary or agent, a spy. So अपसर्पक m. (-कः) E.
अप bad, &c. सर्प who goes; from सृप with अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपसलवि
अपसलवि ind. The space between the thumb and the forefinger.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपसव्य|अपसव्यं|अपसव्यः
अपसव्य mfn. (-व्यः-व्या-व्यं)
	 1. Opposite, contrary.
	 2. Right, (not left.)
	 n.
(-व्यं) The space between the thumb and the forefinger.
 E. अप, and
सव्य left.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपसव्यक
अपसव्यक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) See the above.
 E. कन् added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपसार|अपसारः
अपसार m. (-रः)
	 1. Egress, passage for going forth.
	 2. Going out or away.
E. अप before, सार a going.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपसारित
अपसारित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Gone out, got out, escaped, fled.
 E. अप before,
सारित gone.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपस्कर|अपस्करः
अपस्कर m. (-रः)
	 1. Any part of a carriage.
	 2. The anus.
	 3. Fæces.
 E. अप,
and कर from कृष to furrow, or कृ to do; स is inserted for the sake of
euphony.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपस्नात|अपस्नातः
अपस्नात mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Bathed or bathing after mourning, or upon the
death of a connexion.
	 2. Bathed after death. (the corpse,) prepara-
tory to other ceremonies.
 E. अप, and स्नात bathed, from ष्णा, and
क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपस्नान|अपस्नानं
अपस्नान n. (-नं)
	 1. Funereal bathing, upon the death of a connexion,
after mourning, &c.
	 2. Impure bathing, or bathing in water with
which a person has previously washed.
 E. अप, and स्नान bathing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपस्पश
अपस्पश mfn. (-शः-शा-शं)
	 1. Being without spies or emissaries.
	 2. Want-
ing the introduction or explanation, (grammar.)
 E. अप with स्पश
a spy, or अ and पस्पश the first section of the Bhāṣya.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपस्मार|अपस्मारः
अपस्मार m. (-रः) Epilepsy, falling sickness.
 E. अप privation, स्मृ to re-
member, and घञ् affix; loss of memory or sense.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपस्मारिन्
अपस्मारिन् mfn. (-री-रिणी-रि) Epileptic, convulsed.
 E. इनि added to the last.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपहत
अपहत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Destroyed.
 E. अप, and हत killed.
