<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपावृति|अपावृतिः
अपावृति f. (-तिः)
	 1. Enclosing, surrounding.
	 2. Covering, screening. E.
अप and आङ् before, वृ to hide, क्तिन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपावृत्त|अपावृत्तं
अपावृत्त mfn. (-त्तः-त्ता-त्तं)
	 1. Rolling on the ground, (as a horse.)
	 2. Un-
covered.
	 3. Driven back or to the rear, repelled.
 E. अप before, वृत
to stand, and क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपावृत्ति|अपावृत्तिः
अपावृत्ति f. (-त्तिः)
	 1. Retreat, repulse.
	 2. Returning.
 E. अप and आङ् before.
वृत to be, क्तिन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाश्रय|अपाश्रयः
अपाश्रय m. (-यः) An awning spread over a court or yard.
	 mfn. (-यः-या-यं)
Helpless, destitute.
 E. अप, and आश्रय protection.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपासङ्ग|अपासंग|अपासंगः|अपासङ्गः
अपासङ्ग m. (-ङ्गः) A quiver; also उपासङ्ग.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपासन|अपासनं
अपासन n. (-नं)
	 1. Quitting, foregoing, discarding.
	 2. Killing, slaughter.
E. अप, अस to be, and ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपासरण|अपासरणं
अपासरण n. (-णं) Departing, departure, removal.
 E. अप and आङ् before, सृ
to go, ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपासित
अपासित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Thrown or cut down, injured, destroyed.
 E. अप
with अस to throw, क्त affix and इट् augment.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपासृत
अपासृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Gone, departed, gone away.
 E. अप, and आङ्
before, सृ to go, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपास्त|अपास्तं
अपास्त mfn. (-स्तः-स्ता-स्तं)
	 1. Thrown off, set aside.
	 2. Driven away, expell-
ed.
	 3. Discarded, abandoned.
	 4. Disregarded, contemned.
 E. अप
and अस to throw, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपास्य
अपास्य ind.
	 1. Having quitted or left.
	 2. Having thrown away.
	 3. Dis-
regarding.
 E. अप, and अस to throw, य aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपि
अपि ind. A preposition and particle corresponding to even, though,
yet, assuredly, &c. and implying.
	 1. Interrogation.
	 2. Earnest inter-
rogation or enquiry.
	 3. Doubt.
	 4. Possibility.
	 5. Reproof; and.
	 6.
Conjunction.
	 7. It is often an expletive.
 E. अ neg. and पि to go,
with क्विप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिगीर्ण|अपिगीर्णं
अपिगीर्ण mfn. (-र्णः-र्णा-र्णं) Praised.
 E. अपि before, गीर्ण part. past, irregular-
ly formed from गॄ to sound.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिच
अपिच ind. Moreover, also.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिच्छल
अपिच्छल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Clear, free from sediment or soil.
 E. अ neg.
पिच्छल muddy.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपितु
अपितु ind. If, if indeed, yet, but yet.
 E. अपि, and तु but, and, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपितृक
अपितृक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) See the next.
 E. अ neg. पितृ a father, कन् added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपित्र्य
अपित्र्य mfn. (-त्र्यः-त्रा-त्र्यं) Uninherited, acquired, not ancestral or pater-
nal.
 E. अ neg. पितृ a father, क्यप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिधान|अपिधानं
अपिधान n. (-नं) Covering, concealment, disappearance.
 E. अपि before धा
to have or hold, and ल्युट् aff. See पिधान.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिनद्ध|अपिनद्धं
अपिनद्ध mfn. (-द्धः-द्धा-द्धं) Clothed, accoutred.
 E. अपि, and नद्ध part. past
of नह to bind.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिशुन
अपिशुन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Upright, honest.
 E. अ neg. पिशुन dishonest.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपीडन
अपीडन n. (-नं) Gentleness, kindness, giving pain to nothing.
 E. अ neg.
पीडन paining.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपीनस|अपीनसं|अपीनसः
अपीनस m. (-सः) Dryness of the nose, want of the pituitary secretion
and loss of smell, cold.
 E. अ neg. पीनस the mucus of the nose.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपीव्य|अपीव्यं
अपीव्य mfn. (-व्यः-व्या-व्यं) Very handsome.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपुच्छ
अपुच्छ mfn. (-च्छः-च्छा-च्छं) Tailless.
	 f. (-च्छा) A tree, (Dalbergia sisu.)
See शिंशपा.
 E. अ neg. पुच्छ a tail.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपुण्य
अपुण्य mfn. (-ण्यः-ण्या-ण्यं) Wicked, bad.
 E. अ, and पुण्य virtuous. So अपुण्यशील.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपुण्यकृत्
अपुण्यकृत् mfn. (-त्) Acting wickedly, wicked, bad.
 E. कृत् who does, with
अपुण्य. So अपुण्यवत्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपुत्र|अपुत्रः
अपुत्र m. (-त्रः) A man who has no son.
 E. अ neg. पुत्र a son, also with
कन् added, अपुत्रकः.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपुनरावृत्ति|अपुनरावृत्तिः
अपुनरावृत्ति f. (-त्तिः) Final exemption from life.
 E. अ neg. पुनरावृत्ति re-
newed practice.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपुनर्भव|अपुनर्भवः
अपुनर्भव m. (-वः) Final beatitude, exemption of the soul from further
transmigration.
 E. अ neg. पुनर् again, and भव being.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपुराण
अपुराण mfn. (-णः-णा-णं) Modern, new. So अपुरातन.
 E. अ neg. पुराण old.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपुरुष
अपुरुष mfn. (-षः-षा-षं) Unmanly.
 E. अ neg. पुरुष a man.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपुष्ट
अपुष्ट mfn. (-ष्टः-ष्टा-ष्टं) Lean.
 E. अ neg. पुष्ट nourished.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपुष्प|अपुष्पः
अपुष्प mfn. (-ष्पः-ष्पा-ष्पं) Not flowering.
 E. अ neg. पुष्प a flower. So अपुष्पक
and अपुष्पित.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपुष्पफलद|अपुष्पफलदः
अपुष्पफलद m. (-दः) Any tree which bears fruit, without flowering, as
the jack tree.
 E. अपुष्प, फल fruit, and द what gives.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपूजक
अपूजक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Irreligious, irreverent.
 E. अ neg. पूजक a wor-
shipper.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपूजा
अपूजा f. (-जा) Irreverence, disrespect.
 E. अ neg. पूजा worship.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपूजित
अपूजित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Contemned, disregarded, not reverenced or
worshipped.
 E. अ neg. पूजित worshipped.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपूत
अपूत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Impure.
	 2. Not having received the invocatory
rite.
 E. अ neg. पूत pure.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपूप|अपूपः
अपूप m. (-पः)
	 1. Cake of flour, meal, &c.
	 2. Wheat.
 E. पूय to split with
अ neg. prefixed; प affixed, and य dropped.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपूप्य|अपूप्यः
अपूप्य m. (-प्यः) Flour, meal.
 E. अपूप a cake, and यत् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपूरणी
अपूरणी f. (-णी) The silk-cotton tree, (Bombax heptaphyllum.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपूर्ण
अपूर्ण mfn. (-र्णः-र्णा-र्णं) Incomplete, not full or entire.
	 m. (-णः) A fraction.
2. An incomplete number.
 E. अ neg. पूर्ण full.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपूर्णकाल|अपूर्णकालः
अपूर्णकाल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Premature.
	 m. (-लः) Incomplete time.
 E. अपूर्ण,
and काल time.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपूर्णकालज
अपूर्णकालज mfn. (-जः-जा-जं) Abortive, born before the proper time. E.
अपूर्ण, and काल time, and ज born.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपूर्णता
अपूर्णता f. (-ता) Incompleteness.
 E. अपूर्ण and तल् affix also with त्व, अपूर्णत्वं.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपूर्व्व|अपूर्व|अपूर्वः|अपूर्व्वं
अपूर्व्व mfn. (-र्व्वः-र्व्वा-र्व्वं)
	 1. Wonderful, extraordinary.
	 2. Unprecedented,
unpreceded.
	 3. Excellent, not exceeded.
	 4. Not easterly.
	 n. (-र्व्वं)
The remote or unforeseen consequence of an act, as heaven of
religious rites, a consequence not immediately preceded by its
cause.
 E. अ neg. पूर्व्व prior.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपूर्व्ववत्|अपूर्ववत्
अपूर्व्ववत् ind. Singularly, unlike any thing else.
 E. अपूर्व्व and वति aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपृक्त|अपृक्तः
अपृक्त mfn. (-क्तः-क्ता-क्तं) Unmixed, uncombined.
	 m. (-क्तः) (In grammar) an
affix of a single letter.
 E. अ neg. पृक्त combined.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपृथक्
अपृथक् ind. With, together with, collectively.
 E. अ not, पृथक् severally.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपृष्ट
अपृष्ट mfn. (-ष्टः-ष्टा-ष्टं) Unasked, unaddressed, not spoken to.
 E. अ neg.
पृष्ट asked.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपेक्षक
अपेक्षक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Expecting.
 E. अप before, ईक्ष to see, ण्वुल् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपेक्षणीय|अपेक्षणीयं
अपेक्षणीय mfn. (-यः-या-यं)
	 1. To be regarded or considered.
	 2. Desirable.
E. अप before, ईक्ष to see, अनीयर् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपेक्षा
अपेक्षा f. (-क्षा)
	 1. Expectation, hope.
	 2. Regard, reference, consideration.
3. Connexion of cause and effect.
	 4. Absolute connexion, as of an
individual with its species.
	 5. Necessity, need, occasion.
 E. अप, ईक्ष
to see, अङ्, and टाप् affs.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपेक्षाबुद्धि|अपेक्षाबुद्धिः
अपेक्षाबुद्धि f. (-द्धिः) Clearness of understanding, the faculty of arranging
and methodising a variety of considerations.
 E. अपेक्षा, and बुद्धि
intellect.
