अप्राप्ति|अप्राप्तिः
अप्राप्ति f. (-प्तिः) Non-attainment, non-acquisition.
 E. अ neg. प्राप्ति acqui-
sition.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=042-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्राथ
अप्राथ mfn. (-थः-था-थं) Unobtainable, unattainable. ind. Not having
obtained.
 E. अ neg. प्राथ future or past part.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=042-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रामाणिक|अप्रामाणिकः
अप्रामाणिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Unauthentic, unauthoritative.
 E. अ neg.
प्रामाणिक of authority.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=042-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रामाण्य|अप्रामाण्यं
अप्रामाण्य n. (-ण्यं) Absence, or insufficiency of proof or authority.
 E. अ
neg. प्रामाण्य proof.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=042-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रावृत
अप्रावृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Uncovered, unclothed.
 E. अ neg. प्रावृत covered.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=042-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रिय|अप्रियं|अप्रियः
अप्रिय mfn. (-यः-या-यं)
	 1. Disliked, disagreeable.
	 2. Unkind, unfriendly.
m. (-यः) A foe, an enemy.
	 f. (-या) A sort of skeat fish, (Silurus
pungentissimus.)
 E. अ neg. प्रिय beloved.
