<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रियकर
अप्रियकर mfn. (-रः-रा-री-रं)
	 1. Unfriendly, ill-disposed.
	 2. Disagreeable.
E. अप्रिय, and कर what makes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=042-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रियंवद
अप्रियंवद mfn. (-दः-दा-दं) One who speaks harshly or unkindly.
 E. अ
neg. प्रियंवद kind spoken.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=042-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रियवादिन्
अप्रियवादिन् mfn. (-दी-दिनी-दि) Speaking unkindly.
 E. अप्रिय, and वादिन्
who speaks; also अप्रियभाषिन्, &c.
