<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रीति|अप्रीतिः
अप्रीति f. (-तिः)
	 1. Dislike, aversion.
	 2. Unfriendliness, enmity.
 E. अ neg.
प्रीति love.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=042-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रीतिकर
अप्रीतिकर mfn. (-रः-रा-री-रं)
	 1. Unkind, adverse.
	 2. Disagreeable, offen-
sive.
 E. अप्रीति and कर what makes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=042-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रेमन्
अप्रेमन् n. (-म) Dislike, aversion.
 E. अ neg. प्रेमन् affection.
