<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रौढ
अप्रौढ mfn. (-ढः-ढा-ढं)
	 1. Timid, gentle.
	 2. Immature.
	 f. (-ढा) An un-
married girl, or one very recently married, and not come to woman-
hood
 E. अ neg. प्रौढ arrogant.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=042-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्सरस्
अप्सरस् f. plur. always (-राः) The nymphs of Svarga, attendants on INDRA.
E. अप् water, सृ to go, and असि Unādi affix: or अप्स in the waters,
and रस flavour: from their fondness for bathing, or from their
being produced at the churning of the ocean.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=042-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्सरा
अप्सरा f. (-रा) an Apsarā or heavenly nymph.
 E. अप् and सृ as before,
with अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=042-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अफल|अफलः
अफल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं)
	 1. Unfruitful, barren.
	 2. Vain, unproductive.
	 f.
(-ला)
	 1. The aloe plant, (Aloes perfoliata.)
	 2. Another plant,
(Flacoartia cataphracta.)
 E. अ neg. फल fruit.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=042-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अफलता
अफलता f. (-ता) Barrenness, unprofitableness.
 E. अफल with तल् affix; also
अफलत्वं.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=042-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अफलाकाङ्क्षिन्|अफलाकांक्षिन्
अफलाकाङ्क्षिन् mfn. (-क्षी-क्षिणी-क्षि) Disinterested, indifferent, not looking
to beneficial consequences.
 E. अ neg. फल fruit, and आकाङ्क्षिन् who
desires.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=042-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अफल्गु
अफल्गु mfn. (-ल्गुः-ल्गुः-ल्गु) Productive, profitable.
 E. अ neg. फल्गु worthless.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=042-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अफुल्ल
अफुल्ल mfn. (-ल्लः-ल्ला-ल्लं) Unblown.
 E. अ neg. फुल्ल flowered.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=042-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अफेन|अफेनं
अफेन n. (-नं) Opium.
	 mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Frothless, without scum or foam.
E. अ dim. and फेन froth; the word in the first sense is, no doubt,
of modern date and foreign introduction.
