अबद्ध mfn. (-द्धः-द्धा-द्धं) Unmeaning or nonsensical discourse.
	 2. Unbound,
at liberty.
 E. अ neg. बद्ध bound, connected.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=042-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अबद्धक|अबद्धकं
अबद्धक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) See the preceding.
 E. वुन् being added, which
leaves क.
