<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अबद्धमुख|अबद्धमुखः
अबद्धमुख mfn. (-खः-खा-खं) Foul-mouthed, scurrilous.
 E. अबद्ध unbound, and
मुख the mouth.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=042-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अबध
अबध m. (-धः) Not killing.
	 f. (-धा) The segment of the base of a triangle.
E. अ neg. बध what kills.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=042-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

