अबध्य mfn. (-ध्यः-ध्या-ध्यं)
	 1. Unmeaning or nonsensical, (as discourse.)
	 2.
Sacred, not to be put to death.
 E. अ neg. बन्ध to bind, or बध to kill,
and यत् aff.
