<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अबल|अबलं|अबलः
अबल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Weak, feeble, infirm.
	 m. (-लः) A plant (Tapia
cratœva.) See वरुण.
	 f. (-ला) A woman.
 E. अ neg. and बल strong.
