<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अबाध्य
अबाध्य mfn. (-ध्यः-ध्या-ध्यं) Improper to be pained or opposed.
 E. अ neg. बाध
to oppose, यत् part. affix, also with अनीयर् and तव्य, अबाधनीय and
अबाधितव्य.
