<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अबान्धव|अबांधव
अबान्धव mfn. (-वः-वी-वं) Having no relation or kindred, lone, unacknow-
ledged, unowned.
 E. अ neg. बन्धु kindred, अण् aff.
