<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अबोध|अबोधः
अबोध m. (-धः) Ignorance, stupidity.
	 mfn. (-धः-धा-धं)
	 1. Ignorant, stupid.
2. Puzzled, perplexed.
 E. अ neg. बोध knowledge.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=042-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अबोधगम्य
अबोधगम्य mfn. (-म्यः-म्या-म्यं) Incomprehensible.
 E. अ neg. बोध knowledge,
गम्य to be attained by.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=042-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अबोधनीय
अबोधनीय mfn. (-यः-या-यं)
	 1. Unintelligible.
	 2. Not to be awakened or
aroused.
 E. अ neg. बोधनीय to be understood, &c. also अबोधितव्य and
अबोध्य.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=042-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्ज|अब्जः
अब्ज m. (-ब्जः)
	 1. The moon.
	 2. A kind of tree, (Barringtonia acutangula.)
3. The physician of the gods. See धन्वन्तरि.
	 mn. (-ब्जः-ब्जं) A conch.
	 n.
(-ब्जं)
	 1. A lotus.
	 2. A large number, a million of millions.
 E. अब् for
अप् water, and ज who is born; from the situation of the things
named, or their production at the churning of the ocean.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=042-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्जज|अब्जजः
अब्जज m. (-जः) A name of Brahma.
 E. अब्ज a lotus, and ज born; BRAHMĀ,
being said to have sprung at the creation from the lotus, which
arose from the navel of VIṢṆU.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=042-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्जनयन
अब्जनयन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Having fine eyes.
 E. अब्ज, and नयन the eye.
