<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्जनेत्र
अब्जनेत्र mfn. (-त्रः-त्रा-त्रं) Having fine eyes.
 E. अब्ज and नेत्र eye.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्जदृश्
अब्जदृश् mfn. (-दृक्) Lotus-eyed, having large fine eyes.
 E. अब्ज, and दृश् eye.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्जभोग|अब्जभोगः
अब्जभोग m. (-गः) The root of a lotus.
 E. अब्ज, and भोग enjoyment.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्जयोनि|अब्जयोनिः
अब्जयोनि m. (-निः) A name of BRAHMAN (m.).
 E. अब्ज, and योनि the vulva; see
अब्जज.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्जवाहन|अब्जवाहनः
अब्जवाहन m. (-नः) A name of ŚIVA.
 E. अब्ज the moon, and वाहन a vehicle:
carrying or wearing the moon on his forehead.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्जहस्त|अब्जहस्तः
अब्जहस्त m. (-स्तः) The sun.
 E. अब्ज a lotus, and हस्त a hand: SŪRYA is re-
presented holding this flower in one hand.
