<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्जिनी
अब्जिनी f. (-नी) A multitude of lotus flowers.
 E. अब्ज and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्जिनीपति|अब्जिनीपतिः
अब्जिनीपति m. (-तिः) The sun.
 E. अब्जिनी, and पति a lord.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्द|अब्दः
अब्द m. (-ब्दः)
	 1. A cloud.
	 2. A year.
	 3. A fragrant grass, (Cyperus
rotundus.)
	 4. The name of a mountain.
 E. अप् water, प changed to
ब, and द what gives; or अब to preserve, &c. and दन् Unādi affix;
hence the word is also written अब्द.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्दशत
अब्दशत n. (-तं) A century.
 E. अब्द, and शत a hundred.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्दसहस्र
अब्दसहस्र n. (-स्रं) A thousand years.
 E. अब्द, सहस्र a thousand.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्दार्द्ध
अब्दार्द्ध n. (-र्द्धं) A half year.
 E. अब्द, and अर्द्ध half.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्दिक
अब्दिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Annual, yearly.
 E. अब्द and ठन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्दुर्ग|अब्दुर्गः
अब्दुर्ग n. (-र्गं) A fortress surrounded by a moat or lake.
 E. अप् water, and
दुर्ग fort.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्धि|अब्धिः
अब्धि m. (-ब्धिः) The ocean.
 E. अब् substituted for अप् water; धि from धा
to have, and कि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्धिकफ|अब्धिकफः
अब्धिकफ m. (-फः) Cuttlefish bone.
 E. अब्धि, and कफ phlegm; being
considered as the froth of the sea.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्धिज|अब्धिजः
अब्धिज m. du. (-जौ) The two sons of SŪRYA, and physicians of Svarga.
f. (-जा) Wine.
 E. अब्धि, and ज born: the former are more usually
termed the sons of AŚVINĪ, see आश्विनेय.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्धिद्वीपा
अब्धिद्वीपा f. (-पा) The earth.
 E. अब्धि, and द्वीप in the fem. form; an island
surrounded by the ocean.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्धिनगरी
अब्धिनगरी f. (-री) A name of Dvārakā, the capital of KṚṢṆA, see
द्वारका.
 E. अब्धि, and नगरी a city: the ocean-city.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्धिनवनीतक|अब्धिनवनीतकः
अब्धिनवनीतक m. (-कः) The moon.
 E. अब्धि, नवनीत fresh butter and क affix;
produced by churning the ocean.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्धिमण्डूकी
अब्धिमण्डूकी f. (-की) A pearl oyster.
 E. अब्धि the ocean, and मण्डूकी a female
frog.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्धिशयन|अब्धिशयनः
अब्धिशयन m. (-नः) A name of VIṢṆU.
 E. अब्धि, and शयन sleeping;
sleeping on the ocean at the periods of the destruction and renova-
tion of the world, having the serpent ANANTA for his couch.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्ध्यग्नि|अब्ध्यग्निः
अब्ध्यग्नि m. (-ग्निः) Submarine fire.
 E. अब्धि, and अग्नि fire. See और्व्वस्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्भक्ष|अब्भक्षः
अब्भक्ष m. (-क्षः) A snake.
 E. अब् for अप् water, and भक्ष to eat: living
upon water.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्भ्र|अब्भ्रं
अब्भ्र m. (-ब्भ्रः) The ocean. See अभ्र.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्भ्रि|अब्भ्रिः
अब्भ्रि n. (-ब्भ्रि)
	 1. A baling vessel.
	 2. An iron hoe.
	 3. A stick tipped or
shod with iron. See अभ्रि.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्रह्मचर्य्य|अब्रह्मचर्य
अब्रह्मचर्य्य n. (-र्य्यं)
	 1. Incontinence.
	 2. Coition.
 E. अ neg. and ब्रह्मचर्य्य the
duty of the religious student, i. e. chastity; also with कन् added
अब्रह्मचर्य्यक n. (-कं.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्रह्मण्य|अब्रह्मण्यं
अब्रह्मण्य n. (-ण्यं) Sacred, not to be killed, (in theatrical language.)
 E. अ
not, ब्रह्मण्य proper for a Brahman, i. e. death; also अब्राह्मण्य.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
