<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभक्तच्छन्द
अभक्तच्छन्द m. (-न्दः) Want of appetite.
 E. अ neg. भक्त food, छन्द inclination.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभक्तरुच्
अभक्तरुच् f. (-रुक्) Want of appetite.
 E. अ neg. भक्त food, रुच् inclination.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभक्ति|अभक्तिः
अभक्ति f. (-क्तिः) Incredulity, unbelief, want of devotion to.
 E. अ neg. भक्ति
faith.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभक्तिमत्
अभक्तिमत् mfn. (-मान्-मती-मत्) Unbelieving, undevoted to.
 E. अ neg. भक्तिमत्
believing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभक्षण|अभक्षणं
अभक्षण n. (-णं)
	 1. Abstaining from, not eating any thing.
	 2. Fasting. E.
अ neg. भक्षण eating.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभक्ष्य|अभक्ष्यं
अभक्ष्य mfn. (-क्ष्यः-क्ष्या-क्ष्यं) Not to be eaten.
 E. अ neg. भक्ष्य to be eaten.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभक्ष्यत्व
अभक्ष्यत्व n. (-त्वं) Unfitness as food.
 E. अभक्ष्य and त्व affix; also अभक्ष्यता.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभग्न
अभग्न mfn. (-ग्नः-ग्ना-ग्नं) Entire, unbroken.
	 2. Uninturrupted.
 E. अ neg.
भग्न broken.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभङ्गुर|अभंगुर
अभङ्गुर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं)
	 1. Unbroken, entire.
	 2. Undisturbed, un-
interrupted.
 E. अ neg. भङ्गुर what breaks.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभय|अभयं|अभयः
अभय n. (-यं)
	 1. Absence or removal of fear.
	 2. The root of a fragrant
grass, (Andropogon muricatum.)
	 f. (-या) Yellow myrobalan,
(Terminalia citrina.)
	 mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Fearless, undaunted.
 E. अ neg.
and भय fear; the plant removing the dread of disease.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभयडिण्डिम|अभयडिंडिम|अभयडिण्डिमः
अभयडिण्डिम m. (-मः) A war-drum.
 E. अभय, and डिण्डिम a drum: inspiring
courage.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभयद|अभयदः
अभयद m. (-दः) A protector, a defender.
	 mfn. (-दः-दा-दं) Removing fear
or danger.
 E. अभय fearlessness, द who gives; also with प्र prefix
अभयप्रद.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभयदक्षिणा
अभयदक्षिणा f. (-णा) Promise or present of protection from danger. E.
अभय, and दक्षिणा a gift to a Brahman, which, in this case he may
receive from even a Śūdra.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभयदान
अभयदान n. (-नं) Assurance of safety or protection.
 E. अभय and दान gift.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभयप्रद
अभयप्रद mfn. (-दः-दा-दं) One who grants safety.
 E. अभय fearlessness. प्रद
who gives.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभयप्रदान
अभयप्रदान n. (-नं) Assurance of safety or protection.
 E. अभय, and प्रदान
giving.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभयवाच्
अभयवाच् f. (-वाक्) Assurance of safety, encouragement.
 E. अभय, and वाच्
speech.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभव|अभवः
अभव m. (-वः)
	 1. End of the world, liberation from the world.
	 2. Non-
existence.
	 mfn. (-वः-वा-वं) Nonexistent.
 E. अ neg. भव being.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभवितव्य
अभवितव्य mfn. (-व्यः-व्या-व्यं) What is not to be, what will not be.
 E. अ
neg. भवितव्य to be.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभवितव्यता
अभवितव्यता f. (-ता) Fate, predestined non-occurrence.
 E. अ neg. भवितव्य
what is to be, तल् affix; also अभवितव्यत्वं.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभव्य
अभव्य mfn. (-व्यः-व्या-व्यं)
	 1. Not to be, not predestined.
	 2. Improper, what
ought not to be.
 E. अ neg. भव्य what is to be, also अभवनीय, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभाग
अभाग mfn. (-गः-गा-गं) Not sharing or dividing.
 E. अ neg. भाग a share.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभाग्य
अभाग्य mfn. (-ग्यः-ग्या-ग्यं) Unfortunate, wretched.
 E. अ neg. भाग्य fortunate.
So अभाग्यवत् mfn. (-वान्-वती-वत्.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभाव|अभावः
अभाव m. (-वः)
	 1. Nonexistence, annihilation.
	 2. Death.
	 3. (In logic)
Negation of two kinds, संसर्गाभाव universal negation, and अन्योन्याभाव
relative or mutual negation.
	 4. (In rhetoric) Absence of the essen-
tial parts of poetical description of character, want of the pro-
perties or temperaments.
 E. अ priv. भाव being.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभावना
अभावना f. (-ना)
	 1. Absence of judgement or right perception.
	 2. Ab-
sence of religious meditation or contemplation.
 E. अ neg. भावना
perceiving.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभावनीय|अभावनीयः
अभावनीय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Not to be contemplated or inferred, uninfer-
rible, inconceivable, unintelligible.
 E. अ neg. भावनीय to be perceived.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभाविन्
अभाविन् mfn. (-वी-विनी-वि)
	 1. What is not to be, what will not be.
	 2.
Void of temperament or natural disposition.
 E. अ neg. भाविन् future,
or having disposition.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभाषण|अभाषणं
अभाषण n. (-णं) Silence.
 E. अ neg. and भाषण speaking.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभि
अभि ind. A preposition and particle implying.
	 1. Superiority in place,
rank, or power, (over, upon, against, above:)
	 2. Proximity,
(near:)
	 3. Separation, (severally:)
	 4. Wish, desire: 5. Conjunction,
particularizing, (to, with respect to.) Thus अभिक्रमितुं to overpower;
अभिगन्तुं to approach; अभिख्यातुं to speak to; अभिभव disgrace; अभिलाष
desire; अभ्यग्निं on the fire, &c.
 E. अ neg. भा to shine, and कि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिक|अभिकः
अभिक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Lustful, libidinous.
 E. अभि and क from कम to
desire.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=043-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
