अभियाति|अभियातिः
अभियाति m. (-तिः) An enemy.
 E. अभि against, या to go, with अति affix,
see अभियातिन्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभियातिन्
अभियातिन् m. (-ती) An enemy.
 E. अभि against, यत् to strive, and णिनि affix,
see अभिघातिन्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभियुक्त|अभियुक्तः
अभियुक्त mfn. (-क्तः-क्ता-क्तं) Attacked by an enemy, assaulted, assailed.
	 2.
Diligent, intent.
	 3. Said, spoken.
	 4. Blamed, rebuked.
	 5. (In law)
Charged, prosecuted, defendant.
 E. अभि, and युक्त joined.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभियुक्तता
अभियुक्तता f. (-ता)
	 1. Diligence, application.
	 2. Accusation, prosecution.
E. अभियुक्त and तल् affix, also with त्व, अभियुक्तत्वं.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभियोक्तव्य
अभियोक्तव्य mfn. (-व्यः-व्या-व्यं)
	 1. Blamable, to be reproved or rebuked.
2. To be prevented or prohibited.
	 3. To be prosecuted, indictable.
4. To be pursued diligently.
 E. अभि before युज to join, तव्य aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभियोक्तृ
अभियोक्तृ m. (-क्ता) A plaintiff, an accuser.
	 mfn. (-क्ता-क्त्री-क्तृ) One who
assails another in any way.
 E. अभि before युज to join, तृच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभियोग|अभियोगः
अभियोग m. (-गः)
	 1. Attack, assault.
	 2. Challenging to fight.
	 3. War,
battle.
	 4. Energetic effort, exertion, perseverance.
	 5. Reprimand,
reproof.
	 6. Prohibition, prevention.
	 7. Contact, conjunction.
	 8. (In
law) A plaint, a charge, an accusation.
 E. अभि, युज to join, and
घञ् affix, ज being changed to ग.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभियोगिन्
अभियोगिन् m. (-गी) A plaintiff, a prosecutor.
	 mfn. (-गी-गिनी-गि) One who
assails another in any way.
 E. अभियोग and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिरक्षा
अभिरक्षा f. (-क्षा) Universal protection, wide benevolence.
 E. अभि, and रक्षा
preserving.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिरक्षित
अभिरक्षित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Guarded, preserved, kept.
 E. अभि, and रक्षित
preserved.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिरक्षितृ
अभिरक्षितृ m. (-ता)
	 1. A guardian.
	 2. A controller.
	 mfn. (-ता-त्री-तृ) Who
or what keeps or preserves.
 E. अभि, रक्षितृ who preserves.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिरत
अभिरत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Pleased or contended with, satisfied.
	 2. Per-
forming, practicing, engaged in, attentive to.
 E. अभिरम to sport,
क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिरति|अभिरतिः
अभिरति f. (-तिः)
	 1. Pleasure, delight.
	 2. Practice, occupation.
 E. अभि,
and रति pleasure.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिराद्ध
अभिराद्ध mfn. (-द्धः-द्धा-द्धं) Propitiated, (by penance, &c.)
 E. अभि, and राद्ध
accomplished.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिराम|अभिरामः
अभिराम mfn. (-मः-मा-मं) Beautiful.
 E. अभि before रम to sport, and घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिरामता
अभिरामता f. (-ता) Beauty, splendour.
 E. तल् added to the last: also
अभिरामत्वं.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिरुचि|अभिरुचिः
अभिरुचि f. (-चिः)
	 1. Ambition, desire of fame.
	 2. Desire in general.
	 3.
Taste, relish.
	 4. Splendour.
 E. अभि, and रुचि light.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिरूप|अभिरूपः
अभिरूप m. (-पः)
	 1. A learned Brahman, a Pandit.
	 2. A name of KĀMA.
3. Of the moon.
	 4. Of ŚIVA.
	 5. Also of VIṢṆU.
	 mfn. (-पः-पा-पी-पं)
1. Learned.
	 2. Pleasing.
	 3. Handsome.
 E. अभि before रूप to have
form, affix क.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिलषणीय
अभिलषणीय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Desirable.
 E. अभि before लष to wish, अनीयर्
aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिलषित
अभिलषित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Desired, wished.
	 n. (-तं) Desire.
 E. अभि before
लष with क्त part. aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिलाप|अभिलापः
अभिलाप m. (-पः)
	 1. Speech, speaking.
	 2. Declaration of the object of a
vow or religious obligation.
 E. अभि before लप to speak, घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिलाव|अभिलावः
अभिलाव m. (-वः)
	 1. Reaping.
	 2. Cutting.
 E. अभि, and लूञ to cut, aff. घञ्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिलाष|अभिलाषः
अभिलाष m. (-षः) Wish, desire.
 E. अभि, and लष् to like, घञ् aff.; also
अभिलास.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिलाषिन्
अभिलाषिन् mfn. (-षी-षिणी-षि) Wishing, desiring.
 E. अभिलाष and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिलाषुक|अभिलाषुकः
अभिलाषुक mfn. (-कः-का-की-कं)
	 1. Covetous, greedy.
	 2. Desirous, wishing.
E. अभिलष to desire, उकन् affix, and the antepen. lengthened.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिलास|अभिलासः
अभिलास m. (-सः) Wish, desire. E. See अभिलाष; the root being लष, or लस.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिलिखित
अभिलिखित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Inserted in writing.
 E. अभि, and लिखित
written.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिलेखन
अभिलेखन n. (-नं) Writing or inscribing.
 E. अभि, and लेखन writing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवन्दन|अभिवंदनं
अभिवन्दन n. (-नं) Saluting respectfully.
 E. अभि before वदि to praise, affix
युच्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवाद|अभिवादः
अभिवाद m. (-दः)
	 1. Reverential salutation.
	 2. Opprobrious, or unfriendly
speech, abuse.
 E. अभि against, or adverse, and वाद speech.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवादक|अभिवादकः
अभिवादक mfn. (-कः-का-कं)
	 1. Civil, polite.
	 2. Uncivil, abusive.
 E. अभि
to, or against, वादक who speaks.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवादन|अभिवादनं
अभिवादन n. (-नं)
	 1. Respectful salutation, a bow or prostration; includ-
ing sometimes the name or title of the person so addressed, and
followed by the declaration of the person's own name.
	 2. Saluta-
tion of a superior or elder, by a junior or inferior, and especially of
the teacher by his disciple.
	 3. In general it is merely lifting the
joined hands to the forehead, and saying, अहमभिवादये I salute. E.
अभि in presence of, and वादन speaking.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवाद्य|अभिवाद्यः
अभिवाद्य mfn. (-द्यः-द्या-द्यं) To be saluted.
 E. अभि, and वाद्य to be ad-
dressed.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवाह्य
अभिवाह्य n. (-ह्यं)
	 1. Presentation, offering.
	 2. Conveyance, transmission.
E. अभि to, वाह्य to be borne.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिविनीत
अभिविनीत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Pious, pure, devout.
 E. अभि, and विनीत well-
behaved.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिव्यक्त
अभिव्यक्त mfn. (-क्तः-क्ता-क्तं)
	 1. Plain, distinct, evident, manifest.
	 2. De-
clared, revealed.
 E. अभि, and व्यक्त plain.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिव्याप्ति|अभिव्याप्तिः
अभिव्याप्ति f. (-प्तिः) Co-extending, pervading, omnipresence.
 E. अभि every
where, and व्याप्ति spreading.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिव्याहार|अभिव्याहारः
अभिव्याहार m. (-रः) An articulate and significant word or phrase.
 E. अभि,
and व्याहार speech.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिशङ्कित|अभिशंकित
अभिशङ्कित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Frightened, alarmed.
 E. अभि, and शङ्कित alarmed.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिशपन|अभिशपनं
अभिशपन n. (-नं) False accusation, calumny. See अभिशाप.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिशप्त|अभिशप्तः
अभिशप्त mfn. (-प्तः-प्ता-प्तं)
	 1. Falsely accused, calumniated.
	 2. Cursed,
accursed.
 E. अभि before शप with क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिशंसन|अभिशंसनं
अभिशंसन n. (-नं)
	 1. Calumny, abuse, calumniating, abusing.
 E. अभि re-
verse, शंस to praise, ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिशस्त|अभिशस्तः
अभिशस्त mfn. (-स्तः-स्ता-स्तं)
	 1. Calumniated, falsely accused.
	 2. Defamed,
infamous.
	 3. Sinful, wicked.
	 4. Asked, wanted.
 E. अभि implying
opposition, शंस to praise, and affix of the part. past क्त; the nasal
being dropped.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिशस्तक
अभिशस्तक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Calumniating, a calumniator.
 E. अभिशस्त,
and कृ to make, affix अच् or ट.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिशस्ताङ्क
अभिशस्ताङ्क m. (-ङ्कः) A brand, a mark of infamy on a criminal.
 E. अभिशस्त
infamous, अङ्क mark.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिशस्ति|अभिशस्तिः
अभिशस्ति f. (-स्तिः)
	 1. Calumny, scandal, defamation.
	 2. Asking, begging.
E. अभि before शंस to praise or ask, and क्तिन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिशब्दित
अभिशब्दित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Declared, announced.
 E. अभि, and शब्दित
sounded.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिशाप|अभिशापः
अभिशाप m. (-पः)
	 1. False accusation, calumny.
	 2. Charge accusation.
3. Suffering from anger or passion.
	 4. Curse, imprecation.
 E. अभि,
and शप to curse or swear, affix घञ्; or with ल्युट् affix अभिशपन.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिशापन|अभिशापनं
अभिशापन n. (-नं) Pronouncing a curse or malediction.
 E. अभि with शप
causal form, affix ल्युट्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषङ्ग|अभिषंग|अभिषंगः|अभिषङ्गः
अभिषङ्ग m. (-ङ्गः)
	 1. Curse or imprecation.
	 2. An oath.
	 3. Defeat.
	 4.
False accusation, calumny.
	 5. Association, company, connexion.
	 6.
Embracing.
	 7. Possession by evil spirits.
	 8. Accession of passion. E.
अभि against, along with, &c. षञ्ज to embrace, to unite, and घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषव|अभिषवं|अभिषवः
अभिषव m. (-वः)
	 1. Religious bathing, ablution preparatory to religious
rites.
	 2. Sacrifice.
	 3. Bathing in general.
	 4. Drinking the juice of
the acid Asclepias.
	 5. Ferment, yeast, any substance producing
vinous fermentation.
	 n. (-वं) Sour gruel. See काञ्जिका.
 E. अभि, and मु
to mix, to stir, अप् affix; and स is changed to ष.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषवण|अभिषवणं
अभिषवण n. (-णं)
	 1. Bathing, ablution.
	 2. Sacrificing, &c. See अभिषव. E.
As before, ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषह्य
अभिषह्य ind. Insolently, violently, by force.
 E. अभि, षह to bear, यत् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषिक्त
अभिषिक्त mfn. (-क्तः-क्ता-क्तं)
	 1. Sprinkled.
	 2. Anointed, installed, inaugu-
rated, enthroned.
 E. अभि before सिच् to sprinkle, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषुत|अभिषुतं
अभिषुत n. (-तं)
	 1. Sour gruel. See काञ्जिका.
	 2. The juice of the acid As-
clepias.
 E. अभि before सु to mix, affix क्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषेक|अभिषेकः
अभिषेक m. (-कः) Bathing, sprinkling.
 E. अभि before सिच् to sprinkle,
and घञ् affix; the word is often used for initiation, royal unction,
&c. sprinkling with the water of the Ganges, or water in which
various articles have been immersed, being an essential part of the
rites; also for a religious ceremony, including the presentation of
a variety of articles, fruits, gems, &c. along with water or fluid
substances for the bathing of the deity to whom worship is offered.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषेकशाला
अभिषेकशाला f. (-ला) The hall of coronation.
 E. अभिषेक, and शाला a hall.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषेचन|अभिषेचनं
अभिषेचन n. (-नं)
	 1. Initiation, inauguration.
	 2. Sprinkling.
 E. अभि before
षिच् to sprinkle, affix ल्युट्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषेणन|अभिषेणनं
अभिषेणन n. (-नं) March to repel an enemy.
 E. अभि against, सेना an army,
used as a verb, and ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिष्टुत|अभिष्टुतं
अभिष्टुत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Praised.
 E. अभि before स्तु to praise, and क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिष्यन्द|अभिष्यंदः|अभिष्यन्दः
अभिष्यन्द m. (-न्दः)
	 1. Great increase or enlargement.
	 2. Oozing or flow-
ing.
	 3. Weakness of, or running at the eyes.
 E. अभि before स्यन्द to
ooze or drop as a liquid, affix घञ्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिष्यन्दिन्|अभिष्यंदिन्
अभिष्यन्दिन् mfn. (-न्दी-न्दिनी-न्दि)
	 1. Oozing, trickling.
	 2. Having weak
eyes.
	 3. Causing defluxions or serious effusion.
 E. अभिष्यन्द and इनि
aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिष्यन्दिरमण|अभिष्यन्दिरमणं
अभिष्यन्दिरमण n. (-णं) A suburb, a smaller city appended to a larger.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसंहित
अभिसंहित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Attached to, interested, following any object
eagerly.
	 2. Agreed, contracted.
 E. अभि, and सम् before धा to have,
क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसन्ताप|अभिसंताप|अभिसंतापः|अभिसन्तापः
अभिसन्ताप m. (-पः) War, battle.
 E. अभि much, and सन्ताप pain, heat, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसन्धान|अभिसंधान|अभिसंधानं|अभिसन्धानं
अभिसन्धान n. (-नं)
	 1. Cheating, deceiving.
	 2. Attachment or interest in
any object.
	 3. Special agreement.
	 4. Making peace or alliance. E.
अभि, and सम् before, धा to have, affix ल्युट्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसन्धि|अभिसंधि|अभिसंधिः|अभिसन्धिः
अभिसन्धि f. (-न्धिः)
	 1. Cheating, deceit.
	 2. Purpose, object.
	 3. Special
agreement.
	 4. Making peace or alliance.
	 5. Joint, junction.
 E. अभि,
and सन्धि agreement, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=047-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसम्पात|अभिसंपात|अभिसंपातः|अभिसम्पातः
अभिसम्पात m. (-तः)
	 1. War, battle.
	 2. Curse, imprecation.
 E. अभि before
सम्पात going or falling; from पत to fall, with सं prefix, घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=047-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसर|अभिसरः
अभिसर m. (-रः) A companion, a follower.
 E. अभि after or near, and सर
who goes; from सृ to go, and अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=047-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसम्बन्ध|अभिसंबन्ध|अभिसंबंधः|अभिसंबन्धः
अभिसम्बन्ध m. (-न्धः)
	 1. Relation, connexion.
	 2. Sexual connexion.
	 3.
Contact, conjunction.
 E. अभि intensitive, सम्बन्ध connexion.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=047-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसर्ज्जन|अभिसर्जन|अभिसर्जनं|अभिसर्ज्जनं
अभिसर्ज्जन n. (-नं)
	 1. Gift, donation.
	 2. Killing. See अतिसर्ज्जन.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=047-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसायम्
अभिसायम् ind. About evening, at sunset.
 E. अभि towards, सायम् evening.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=047-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसार|अभिसारः
अभिसार m. (-रः)
	 1. Strength.
	 2. War, battle.
	 3. A companion, a follower.
4. The instrument or agent.
	 5. An assignation, an appointment. E.
अभि before सृ to go, affix घञ्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=047-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसारण|अभिसारणं
अभिसारण n. (-णं)
	 1. Coming to or near, visiting, attending, following.
2. Importuning.
 E. अभि, and सारण going.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=047-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसारिका
अभिसारिका f. (-का) A woman who makes or keeps an assignation. E.
अभि before सृ to go, वुन् affix which leaves क, and टाप् fem. do. also
अभिसारिणी.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=047-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसारिन्
अभिसारिन् mfn. (-री-रिणी-रि)
	 1. Going to or near to, visiting, attending.
2. Going to an appointment or assignation.
 E. अभि, and सारिन्
who goes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=047-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिहत
अभिहत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Humbled, subdued, broken down.
	 2. Killed. E.
अभि and हत part. past of हन् to kill or hurt.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=047-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिहार|अभिहारः
अभिहार m. (-रः)
	 1. Robbing, seizing any thing in the owner's pre-
sence.
	 2. A brisk attack.
	 3. Arming, taking up arms.
 E. अभि before
हृ to take, and घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=047-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिहित|अभिहितं
अभिहित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Spoken, said, declared.
 E. अभि before धा to have,
the part. affix क्त, and हि substituted for the root.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=047-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिहितत्व
अभिहितत्व n. (-त्वं) Text, authority, declaration.
 E. अभिहित said, त्व aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=047-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभीक|अभीकः
अभीक m. (-कः)
	 1. A poet.
	 2. A husband.
	 mfn. (-कः-का-कं)
	 1. Lustful,
libidinous.
	 2. Anxious, desirous.
	 3. Cruel.
	 4. Fearless.
 E. अभि before
क, from कम to desire: the इ being made long irregularly.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=047-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभीक्ष्ण|अभीक्ष्णं
अभीक्ष्ण mfn. (-क्ष्णः-क्ष्णा-क्ष्णं)
	 1. Repeated, frequent.
	 2. Constant, perpetual.
ind. (-क्ष्णम्)
	 1. Repeatedly, again and again.
	 3. Perpetually, con-
stantly.
 E. अभि before क्ष्णा to whet, डम् affix, and the इ of अभि made
long.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=047-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभीत
अभीत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Fearless, undaunted.
 E. अ neg. भीत afraid.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=047-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभीति|अभीतिः
अभीति f. (-तिः) Fearlessness.
 E. अ neg. भीति fear.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=047-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभीप्सित|अभीप्सितं
अभीप्सित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Wished, desired.
 E. अभि, आप to obtain, in the
desiderative form, and क्त affix, इट् inserted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=047-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभीप्सु
अभीप्सु mfn. (-प्सुः-प्सुः-प्सु) Wishing, desirous.
 E. अभि before ईप्सु wishing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=047-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभीम|अभीमः
अभीम mfn. (-मः-मा-मं) Causing no fear or terror, unterrific. So अभीषण
and अभीष्म and अभैरव.
 E. अ neg. भीम fearful, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=047-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभीमान
अभीमान n. (-नं) Pride. E. See अभिमान, the इ being made long.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=047-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभीर|अभीरः
अभीर m. (-रः) A cowherd.
 E. अभि and ईर to send, अच् affix; also आभीर.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=047-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभीरु|अभीरुः
अभीरु mfn. (-रुः-रुः-रु) Fearless, undaunted.
	 m. (-रुः) A name of
BHAIRAVA.
	 f. (-रुः) A plant, (Asparagus recemosus.) See शतमूली. E.
अ neg. भीरु timid: as applied to the plant, not fearful of breaking,
from the number of its roots.
