<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभीरुपत्री
अभीरुपत्री f. (-त्री) A plant. See the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=047-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभीलु
अभीलु mfn. (-लुः-लुः-लु) Fearless.
 E. अभीरु, र being changed to ल. Also
अभीलुक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=047-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभीशु|अभीशुः
अभीशु m. (-शुः)
	 1. A ray of light.
	 2. A rein.
	 f. (-शुः) A finger.
 E. अभि
before अशू to pervade, उ affix, derivative irregular. See अभीषु.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=047-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभीषङ्ग|अभीषंग|अभीषङ्गः
अभीषङ्ग m. (-ङ्गः) Curse, imprecation. See अभिषङ्ग. E. As before, the इ
being here long.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=047-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभीषु|अभीषुः
अभीषु m. (-षुः)
	 1. A ray of light.
	 2. A rein.
	 3. Love, lust.
	 4. Passion. E.
अभि before इष to desire, and उ affix or अश to pervade, &c. whence,
अभिशु.
