<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम|अमं|अमः
अम ind. (-मं)
	 1. Quickly.
	 2. Little.
	 mfn. (-मः-मा-मं) Unripe, (as fruit,
&c.)
	 m. (-मः) Sickness.
 E. अम to go or to be sick, अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

