अमङ्गल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Inauspicious, unlucky, evil.
	 n. (-लं) Inauspicious-
ness, ill luck.
	 m. (-लः) The castor oil plant.
 E. अ neg. and मङ्गल
auspicious: the wood has no sap, and is useless.
