<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमति|अमतिः
अमति m. (-तिः)
	 1. Time.
	 2. The moon.
	 3. A cheat, a rogue.
	 f. (-तिः) Un-
consciousness, ignorance, absence of knowledge or intention.
 E. अम
to go, and अति Unādi affix, or अ neg. मति understanding.
