<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमर्ष|अमर्षः
अमर्ष m. (-र्षः)
	 1. Anger, passion.
	 2. Impatience, impetuosity.
 E. अ neg.
मृष to bear with, घञ् aff.
