<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमर्षवत्
अमर्षवत् mfn. (-वान्-वती-वत्)
	 1. Hasty, impetuous, impatient.
	 2. Wrathful,
passionate.
 E. अमर्ष and मतुप् aff.
