<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमर्षिन्
अमर्षिन् mfn. (-र्षी-र्षिणी-र्षि)
	 1. Passionate, wrathful.
	 2. Impetuous.
 E. अमर्ष
and इनि aff.
