<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमल|अमलं
अमल n. (-लं) Talc.
	 f. (-ला)
	 1. The goddess LAKṢMĪ.
	 2. Emblic myroba-
lan, (Phyllanthus emblica.)
	 3. The umbilical cord.
	 mfn. (-लः-ला-लं)
	 1.
Clean, pure.
	 2. White.
 E. अ neg. and मल dirt.
