अमाय
अमाय mfn. (-यः-या-यं)
	 1. True, wise.
	 2. Sincere, guileless, free from error
or deceit.
	 f. (-या)
	 1. Absence of delusion, knowledge of the truth.
2. Sincerity, honesty.
 E. अ neg. माया deceit, delusion.
