<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमुक्तहस्त
अमुक्तहस्त mfn. (-स्तः-स्ता-स्तं) Sparing, frugal, prudent.
 E. अमुक्त not loosed,
हस्त the hand.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमुक्ति|अमुक्तिः
अमुक्ति f. (-क्तिः) Confinement, want of freedom or liberty.
 E. अ neg. मुक्ति
liberation.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमुख्य
अमुख्य mfn. (-ख्यः-ख्या-ख्यं) Inferior, ordinary.
 E. अ neg. मुख्य principal.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमुतस्
अमुतस् ind. Hence, from this.
 E. अमु for अदस् and तसिल् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमुत्र
अमुत्र ind. In the next life.
 E. अमु from अदस् this or that, and त्रल् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमुत्रत्य
अमुत्रत्य mfn. (-त्यः-त्या-त्यं) Belonging to a future state, being of the next
world.
 E. अमुत्र and त्य aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमुष्यपुत्र|अमुष्यपुत्रः
अमुष्यपुत्र mf. (-त्रः-त्री)
	 1. Of a good family, of known origin.
	 2. The son
or daughter of such a one.
 E. अमुष्य the irr. gen. of अदस् this, and पुत्र
a son, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=051-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमुष्यायण
अमुष्यायण mf. (-णः-णा)
	 1. Of respectable birth, of known origin.
	 2. The
offspring of such a one, of a certain person, &c.
 E. अमुष्य as in the
last, and फक् affix, also आमुष्यायण.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=051-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमूदृश्
अमूदृश् mfn. (-दृक्) Of such form or kind.
 E. अमू for अदस् this, and क्विप्
affix; also अमूदृश and अमूदृक्ष
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=051-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमूदृश|अमूदृशः
अमूदृश mfn. (-शः-शा-शं) Of such a form or kind. E. See the last.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=051-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमूदृक्ष
अमूदृक्ष mfn. (-क्षः-क्षा-क्षं) Such, like of such form or kind. E. See अमूदृश.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=051-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमूर्त्त|अमूर्त|अमूर्तः|अमूर्त्तः
अमूर्त्त mfn. (-र्त्तः-र्त्ता-र्त्तं) Formless, shapeless, unembodied.
 E. अ neg. मूर्त्ति
form; the final changed.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=051-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमूर्त्ति|अमूर्ति|अमूर्तिः
अमूर्त्ति f. (-र्त्तिः) Shapelessness, absence of shape or form.
 E. अ. neg. मूर्त्ति
form.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=051-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमूल
अमूल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Having no root. Also अमूलक.
	 f. (-ला) A plant. See
अग्निशिखा.
 E. अ neg. and मूल a root.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=051-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमूल्य
अमूल्य mfn. (-ल्यः-ल्या-ल्यं) Invaluable, not to be purchased.
 E. अ neg. मूल्य
price.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=051-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमृणाल|अमृणालं
अमृणाल n. (-लं) The root of a fragrant grass, used in India for taties or
screens against the hot winds, commonly called Kaskas,
(Andropogon muricatum.)
 E. अ like, as it were, and मृणाल a fibrous
root; also मृणाल.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=051-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमृत|अमृतं|अमृतः
अमृत n. (-तं)
	 1. The food of the gods, Ambrosia or Nectar.
	 2. Water.
3. Butter, rice, &c. the residue of a sacrifice.
	 4. Oiled butter or
ghee.
	 5. Unsolicited alms.
	 6. Boiled rice.
	 7. Food.
	 8. Wealth,
property.
	 9. Gold.
	 10. Buttermilk.
	 11. Any thing sweet, a sweet-
meat.
	 12. Milk.
	 13. Poison.
	 14. A drug or medicament.
	 15. Quick-
silver.
	 16. Final emancipation.
	 m. (-तः)
	 1. A god, an immortal.
2. DHANWANTARI, the physician of the gods.
	 f. (-ता)
	 1. Emblic
myrobalan, (phyllanthus emblica.)
	 2. The yellow sort., (Terminalia
citrina.)
	 3. Another plant, (Menispermum glabrum.)
	 4. Long
pepper.
	 5. Holy basil, (Ocymum sanctum.)
	 6. Spirituous liquor. It
also occurs amongst the synonyms of several plants besides those
enumerated.
	 mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Beloved, desired.
	 2. Beautiful.
3. Immortal, imperishable.
 E. अ neg. मृङ् to die, and क्त affix; what
is immortal or what makes so; what supports life, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=051-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमृतकुण्ड
अमृतकुण्ड m. (-ण्डः) A vessel of nectar.
 E. अमृत and कुण्ड a hole.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=051-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमृतता
अमृतता f. (-ता) Immortality.
 E. अमृत and तल् affix; also with त्व, अमृतत्वं.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=051-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमृततरङ्गिणी|अमृततरंगिणी
अमृततरङ्गिणी f. (-णी) Moonlight.
 E. अमृत, and तरङ्गिणी a sea.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=051-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमृतदीधिति|अमृतदीधितिः
अमृतदीधिति m. (-तिः) The moon.
 E. अमृत ambrosia, and दीधिति a ray.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=051-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमृतद्रव|अमृतद्रवः
अमृतद्रव mfn. (-वः-वा-वं) Shedding ambrosia.
 E. अमृत, and द्रव dropping.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=051-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमृतधार
अमृतधार mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Shedding or distilling ambrosia.
 E. अमृत, and धारा
a drop.
