<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमृतप|अमृतपः
अमृतप mfn. (-पः-पा-पं) Drinking ambrosia.
	 m. (-पः) A deity.
 E. अमृत, and
प who drinks.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=051-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमृतरस|अमृतरसः
अमृतरस m. (-सः) Nectar, ambrosia.
 E. अमृत, and रस juice.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=051-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमृतवर्ष
अमृतवर्ष m. (-र्षः) A fall of ambrosia from heaven.
 E. अमृत, and वर्ष rain.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=051-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमृतवल्ली
अमृतवल्ली f. (-ल्ली) A species moonseed, (Menispermun glabrum.) See
