<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमृतसोदर|अमृतसोदरः
अमृतसोदर m. (-रः) A horse.
 E. अमृत, and सोदर brother: born with nectar
at the churning of the ocean.
