 E. अ neg. मृत्यु death.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=051-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमेघ
अमेघ mfn. (-घः-घा-घं) Cloudless.
 E. अ. neg. मेघ a cloud.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=051-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमेधस्
अमेधस् m. (-धाः) A food, an idiot.
 E. अ neg. मेध to understand, and असुन्
aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=051-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

