अमेध्य mfn. (-ध्यः-ध्या-ध्यं) Impure, foul.
	 n. (-ध्यं) Fæces, excrement.
 E. अ
neg. and मेध्य pure.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=051-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमेध्यत्व
अमेध्यत्व n. (-त्वं) Foulness, filthiness.
 E. त्व added to अमेध्य, also with तल्,
अमेध्यता.
