<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमोक्ष|अमोक्षः
अमोक्ष m. (-क्षः)
	 1. Bondage, confinement.
	 2. Confinement to life.
	 mfn.
(-क्षः-क्षा-क्षं) Unliberated, unloosed.
 E. अ neg. मोक्ष liberation.
