अमोघ|अमोघः
अमोघ mfn. (-घः-घा-घं) Productive, fruitful, not vain or barren.
	 m. (-घः)
The name of a river.
	 f. (-घा)
	 1. Trumpet flower, (Bignonia suave-
olens.)
	 2. A plant of which the seed is used as a vermifuge, (Erycibe
paniculata, Rox.) See विडङ्ग.
	 3. Yellow myrobalan. See हरीतकी. E.
अ not, मोघ vain, barren.
