	 1. A sort of jasmine, (Jasminum auriculatum.)
	 2. A plant,
(Cissampelos hexandra.) See वनतिक्तिका.
	 3. Woodsorrel, (Oxalis
corniculata, Rox.)
 E. अम्बा a mother, स्था to stand, and क affix, what
cherishes like a mother.
