<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुसेचनी
अम्बुसेचनी f. (-नी) A vessel used for baling water out of a boat. E.
अम्बु, षिच् to sprinkle, णिनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुकृत
अम्बुकृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Sputtered, (speech, discourse.)
 E. अम्बु water, and
कृत made.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्ब्ल|अम्ब्लः
अम्ब्ल m. (-ब्लः) Sourness.
 E. अम्ब to go, and क्ल Unādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्भस्|अंभस्
अम्भस् n. (-म्भः) Water.
 E. अप् water, before असुन् Unādi affix; नुम् is
inserted, and प becomes भ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्भस्स्थ
अम्भस्स्थ mfn. (-स्थः-स्था-स्थं)
	 1. What holds or contains water.
	 2. Abiding
in water.
 E. अम्भस् and स्थ what abides or where it abides.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्भस्सू
अम्भस्सू m. (-स्सूः) Smoke, cloudiness.
 E. अम्भस् water, and सू what produces.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्भोज|अम्भोजं|अम्भोजः
अम्भोज n. (-जं) A lotus.
	 m. (-जः)
	 1. The moon.
	 2. The Sārasa or Indian
crane.
	 mfn. (-जः-जा-जं) Aquatic, water-born.
 E. अम्भस्, and ज produced.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्भोजजनि
अम्भोजजनि m. (-निः) BRAHMĀ, being born secondarily from a lotus. E.
अम्भोज, and जनि birth.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्भोजयोनि|अम्भोजयोनिः
अम्भोजयोनि m. (-निः) A name of BRAHMĀ.
 E. अम्भोज, and योनि womb.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्भोजिनी|अंभोजिनी
अम्भोजिनी f. (-नी) An assemblage of lotus flowers, or a place where they
abound.
 E. अम्भोज a lotus, णिनि and ङीप् affs.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्भोद|अम्भोदः
अम्भोद m. (-दः) A cloud.
 E. अम्भस्, and द what gives.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्भोधर|अम्भोधरः
अम्भोधर m. (-रः) A cloud.
 E. अम्भस् water, and धर what has.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्भोधि|अम्भोधिः
अम्भोधि m. (-धिः) The ocean.
 E. अम्भस्, and धि what possesses, from धा
with the affix कि.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्भोनिधि|अम्भोनिधिः
अम्भोनिधि m. (-धिः) The ocean.
 E. अम्भस्, and निधि a treasure.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्भोराशि|अम्भोराशिः
अम्भोराशि m. (-शिः) The ocean.
 E. अम्भस्, and राशि a heap.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्भोरुह|अम्भोरुहं
अम्भोरुह n. (-हं) A lotus.
 E. अम्भस्, and रुह what rises or grows from रुह्
with अच् affix; also with क्विप् affix; अम्भोरुह् nom. (-रुट्)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्मय|अम्मयं
अम्मय mfn. (-यः-यी-यं) Watery, formed from, or consisting of water, (as
froth, &c.)
 E. अप् water, and मयट् affix; प is changed to म, and the
fem. takes ङीप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्र|अम्रः
अम्र m. (-म्रः) The mango tree, (Mangifera Indica.)
	 n. (-म्रं) A mango. E.
अम to eat, and र aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्रात|अम्रातः
अम्रात m. (-तः) A species of spondias or hog plum, (Spondias mangi-
fera.)
 E. अम्र the mango, and अत to go, अच् affix; resembling that
fruit, also अम्रातक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्रातक|अम्रातकः
अम्रातक m. (-कः) A tree. See the preceding.
 E. कन् being added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्ल|अम्लं|अम्लः
अम्ल mfn. (-म्लः-म्ला-म्लं) Sour, acid.
	 m. (-म्लः) Sourness, acidity.
	 f. (-म्ली)
Wood sorrel, (Oxalis monadelpha.)
	 n. (-म्लं) Sour curds.
 E. अम to be
sick, क्ल Unādi affix, and ङीप् for the fem.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्लक|अम्लकः
अम्लक m. (-कः) A plant, (Artocarpus lacucha.) See लकुच.
 E. अम्ल sourness,
and क affix; having a sour taste.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्लकेशर|अम्लकेशरः
अम्लकेशर m. (-रः) The citron.
 E. अम्ल, and केशर a filament.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्लता
अम्लता f. (-ता) Sourness.
 E. अम्ल and तल् affix, also with त्व aff. अम्लत्व n.
