<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्लवेतस|अम्लवेतसः
अम्लवेतस m. (-सः) A kind of dock or sorrel, (Rumex vesicarius.)
 E. अम्ल
