<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्लवृक्ष|अम्लवृक्षं|अम्लवृक्षः
अम्लवृक्ष m. (-क्षः) The tamarind tree.
 E. अम्ल, and वृक्ष a tree.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्लशाक|अम्लशाकं|अम्लशाकः
अम्लशाक n. (-कं) A sort of sorrel, (Rumex vesicarius,) commonly used
