<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्लान|अम्लानः
अम्लान mfn. (-नः-ना-नं)
	 1. Clean, clear.
	 2. Bright, unclouded.
	 m. (-नः)
Globe amaranth, (Gomphrena globosa.)
 E. अ neg. and म्लान dirty.
