<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्लानिन्
अम्लानिन् mfn. (-नी-निनी-नि) Clean, clear.
	 f. (-नी) An assemblage of lotus
flowers.
 E. अ neg. म्लानिन् soiled.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्लिका
अम्लिका f. (-का)
	 1. The tamarind tree.
	 2. Wood sorrel, (Oxalis corniculata.)
3. A sour taste in the mouth, acidity of stomach.
 E. अम्ल sour, कन्
and टाप् affixes; इ being substituted for अ; also अम्लीका and आम्लका.
