अम्लीका
अम्लीका f. (-का) See the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्लोद्गार|अम्लोद्गारः
अम्लोद्गार m. (-रः) Sour eructation.
 E. अम्ल, and उद्गार bringing up.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अय|अयः
अय r. 1st cl. (अयते) To go, to go to or towards. With प्रति to believe, to
rely on. A preposition containing र substitutes ल before this root,
as प्र and पर make प्लायते, पलायते to fly, to run away.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अय|अयः
अय m. (-यः) Good luck, favourable fortune.
 E. इण to go, and अच् affix;
happiness proceeding by it.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयज्ञ|अयज्ञः
अयज्ञ mfn. (-ज्ञः-ज्ञा-ज्ञं) Not offering sacrifice.
 E. अ neg. यज्ञ sacrifice.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयज्ञक
अयज्ञक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Unfit for sacrifice.
 E. अ neg. यज्ञक sacrificial.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयज्ञिय
अयज्ञिय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Not sacrificial, common, profane.
 E. अ neg. यज्ञिय
sacrificial.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयतिन्
अयतिन् mfn. (-ती-तिनी-ति) Incontinent, of unsubdued appetite.
 E. अ neg.
यतिन् self-restraining.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयत्न|अयत्नः
अयत्न m. (-त्नः) Absence of effort or exertion.
 E. अ neg. यत्न effort.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयत्नकारिन्
अयत्नकारिन् mfn. (-री-रिणी-रि) Idle, indifferent, making no exertion.
 E. अ
neg. यत्न effort, and कारिन् who makes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयत्नकृत
अयत्नकृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Spontaneous, readily or easily produced.
 E. अयत्न,
and कृत done. So अयत्नभूत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं.)
