<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथा
अयथा ind. Unsuitably, unfitly, inconsistently, incongruously.
 E. अ neg.
and यथा as, (it should be.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथातथ
अयथातथ mfn. (-थः-था-थं)
	 1. Unprofitable, useless, vain.
	 2. Unfit, unsuitable,
incompatible.
 E. अ neg. यथा as, तथा so.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथातथ्य
अयथातथ्य n. (-थ्यं) Unprofitableness, unsuitableness, incompatibility. E.
अयथातथ and ष्यञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=053-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथार्थ
अयथार्थ mfn. (-र्थः-र्था-र्थं)
	 1. Not according to the sense or object, incongru-
ous, nonsensical, unmeaning.
	 2. Improper, unfitting.
	 3. False, un-
true.
 E. अ neg. यथा as, अर्थ sense.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=053-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथावत्
अयथावत् ind. Inaccurately, erroneously.
 E. अ neg. यथा as, and वति aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=053-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथाबलम्
अयथाबलम् ind. Unsuitably, imperfectly.
 E. अयथा, and बल strength.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=053-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथाशास्त्रकारिन्
अयथाशास्त्रकारिन् mfn. (-री-रिणी-रि) Irreligious.
 E. अ neg. यथा according to,
शास्त्र scripture, and कारिन् who acts.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=053-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथेष्ट
अयथेष्ट mfn. (-ष्टः-ष्टा-ष्टं)
	 1. Insufficient, not enough.
	 2. Disliked, dis-
approved of.
 E. अ neg. यथेष्ट wished.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=053-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयन|अयनं
अयन n. (-नं)
	 1. A road, a path.
	 2. The half year, that is, the sun's road
north and south of the equator. See उत्तरायण, &c.
	 3. The equinoctial
and solstitial points.
	 4. A Śāstra or inspired writing.
 E. इण to
go, and ल्युट् aff.
