<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयनकाल|अयनकालः
अयनकाल m. (-लः) The interval between the equinoxes.
 E. अयन, and
काल time.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=053-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयनभाग|अयनभागः
