<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयोघन|अयोघनः
अयोघन m. (-नः) A hammer, a forge hammer.
 E. अयस्, and घन what strikes,
from हन् to kill or strike.
