<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयोध्य
अयोध्य mfn. (-ध्यः-ध्या-ध्यं) Not to be warred against.
	 f. (-ध्या) The capital
of RĀMA, Ayodhyā, the modern Oude.
 E. अ neg. युद्ध to make war,
and ण्यत् aff.
