अर|अरं|अरः
अर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Swift, speedy.
	 n. (-रं)
	 1. The spoke or radius of a
wheel.
	 2. adv. Swiftly.
	 m. (-रः)
	 1. A Jaina division of time, the sixth
of an Avasarpiṇī or Utsarpiṇī. See अवसर्पिणी, &c.
	 2. The eighteenth
Jaina Tīrthakara, or deified saint.
 E. ऋ to go, अप् aff.
