अराल|अरालं|अरालः
अराल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Crooked.
	 m. (-लः)
	 1. Resin.
	 2. An elephant in rut.
3. A bent or crooked arm.
	 f. (-ला)
	 1. A modest woman.
	 2. A
disloyal or unchaste one.
 E. अर what goes. आ before ला to take or
give, and क aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरि|अरिः
अरि m. (-रिः)
	 1. An enemy.
	 2. A wheel.
	 3. A species of Khadira or
Mimosa.
 E. ऋ to go, अच् affix, and इ substituted for अ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरिकुल
अरिकुल n. (-लं) Family of an enemy.
 E. अरि, and कुल family.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरिक्थभाज्
अरिक्थभाज् mfn. (-भाक्) Not entitled to a share of the property, a non-
heir.
 E. अ neg. रिक्थभाज् a co-heir.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरिता
अरिता f. (-ता) Enmity, hostility.
 E. अरि and तल् affix, also with त्व, अरित्वं.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरित्र|अरित्रं|अरित्रः
अरित्र n. (-त्रं) A rudder.
 E. ऋ to go, and इत्रन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरिनन्दन
अरिनन्दन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Gratifying an enemy, affording triumph to an
enemy.
 E. अरि, and नन्दन what delights.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरिन्दम|अरिंदम|अरिन्दमः
अरिन्दम mfn. (-मः-मा-मं) Conquering, victorious,
 E. अरि, and दम to tame,
affix खच्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरिपुर
अरिपुर n. (-रं) An enemy's town or country.
 E. अरि, and पुर a city.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरिमित्र
अरिमित्र m. (-त्रः) An ally or friend of an enemy.
 E. अरि, and मित्र a
friend.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरिमेद|अरिमेदः
अरिमेद m. (-दः) A fetid Mimosa, (M. Farnesiana.)
 E. अरि an enemy,
and मेद what injures.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरिराष्ट्र
अरिराष्ट्र n. (-ष्ट्रं) An enemy's country.
 E. अरि, and राष्ट्र a country.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरिलोक
अरिलोक m. (-कः) A hostile tribe or an enemy's country.
 E. अरि, and लोक
a country.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरिष|अरिषं|अरिषः
अरिष m. (-षः)
	 1. Disease arising from meat and drink.
	 2. A stream of
water from the clouds.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरिष्ट|अरिष्टं|अरिष्टः
अरिष्ट m. (-ष्टः)
	 1. The soap-berry plant, (Sapindus saponaria, &c.)
	 2.
Garlick.
	 3. The Nimb tree, (Melia azadaracta.)
	 4. A crow.
	 5. A
heron.
	 6. The name of an Asura or infernal spirit.
	 n. (-ष्टं)
	 1. A
woman's apartment, the lying-in chamber.
	 2. Good fortune, happi-
ness.
	 3. Bad or ill luck, misfortune.
	 4. Buttermilk.
	 5. Vinous spirit.
6. Sign or symptom of approaching death.
	 7. A portent, some
natural phenomenon considered as indicating calamity.
 E. अ neg.
and रिष्ट bad or good fortune.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरिष्टक|अरिष्टकः
अरिष्टक m. (-कः) The soap-berry plant, (Sapindus saponaria, &c.)
 E. अ
neg. and रिष्ट affliction, क affix; relieving sickness, &c. See the
preceding, of which it may have all the meanings.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरिष्टताति|अरिष्टतातिः
अरिष्टताति mfn. (-तिः-तिः-ति) Auspicious, making fortunate or happy. E.
अरिष्ट, तन to spread, and डाति aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरिष्टदुष्टधी
अरिष्टदुष्टधी mfn. (-धीः-धीः-धि) Apprehensive of death, alarmed at its
approach.
 E. अरिष्ट sign of death, दुष्ट disturbed, and धी under-
standing, mind; whose is so.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरिष्टनेमि|अरिष्टनेमिः
अरिष्टनेमि m. (-मिः) The twenty-second of the twenty-four Jaina Tīrthakaras
or saints. Also नेमि.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरिष्टसूदन|अरिष्टसूदनः
अरिष्टसूदन m. (-नः) A name of KṚṢṆA or VIṢṆU.
 E. अरिष्ट the Asura so
named, and सूदन who destroys; having killed the demon ARIṢṬA.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरिष्टानक
अरिष्टानक m. (-कं) Consternation, defeat.
 E. अरि, and स्थानक being in place.
