<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरुग्ण
अरुग्ण mfn. (-ग्णः-ग्णा-ग्णं) Healthy, well.
 E. अ neg. रुग्ण sick.
