<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरुणात्मज|अरुणात्मजः
अरुणात्मज m. (-जः) A name of JAṬĀYU, a fabulous bird: said by some to
be the son of ARUṆA, but more generally of GARUḌA.
 E. अरुण, and
आत्मज the son.
