<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरुणावरज|अरुणावरजः
अरुणावरज m. (-जः) A name of GARUḌA.
 E. अरुण, अवर after, and ज born;
the younger brother of ARUṆA.
