<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरुणीकृत
अरुणीकृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Reddened, turning or become red.
 E. अरुण, and
कृत made, च्वि augment.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरुणोदय|अरुणोदयः
अरुणोदय m. (-यः) Break of day, dawn, the period preceding sunset. E.
