अरुदित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Unwept, unlamented.
	 2. Not weeping.
 E. अ neg.
रुदित wept.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरुद्ध
अरुद्ध mfn. (-द्धः-द्धा-द्धं) Free, unobstructed.
 E. अ neg. रुद्ध obstructed.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरुन्तुद|अरुंतुद|अरुन्तुदः
अरुन्तुद mfn. (-दः-दा-दं)
	 1. Sharp, corrosive.
	 2. Acrimonious, sharp, sour,
(as disposition.)
 E. अरुस् a sore, and तुद what torments, from तुद
and खश् affix; the final of अरुस् is dropped, and नुम् inserted.
