<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरुष्ट
अरुष्ट mfn. (-ष्टः-ष्टा-ष्टं) Calm, not angry.
 E. अ neg. रुष्ट angry.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरुस्
अरुस् mn. (-रुः) A sore or wound.
	 m. (-रुः) The sun. ind. A joint.
 E. ऋ
to go, and उसि Unādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरुसिका
अरुसिका f. (-का) Eruptions on the scalp, with acute pain.
 E. अरुस् a sore,
कन् added.
