<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्क|अर्कः|अर्क्क
अर्क m. (-र्कः)
	 1. The sun.
	 2. Crystal.
	 3. Swallow wort, (Calotropis
gigantea)
	 4. Copper.
	 5. A name of INDRA.
	 6. A Pandit or learned
man.
	 7. An elder brother.
	 8. Sunday.
 E. अर्च to worship or respect,
क Unādi affix, and the च is dropped; what is worshipped or res-
pected: or अर्क to heat, affix अच्.
