<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कज|अर्कजः
अर्कज du.
	 m. (-जौ) The two sons of SŪRYA and AŚVINĪ, and physicians
of Svarga
 E. अर्क the sun, and ज who is born.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कतनय|अर्कतनयः
अर्कतनय m. (-यः) The sons of SŪRYA or the sun, applicable to YAMA, to
SANI, to the Munis VAIVASWATA and SAVARNI, to REVANTA, and
to KARṆA.
	 f. (-या) The daughter of the sun, applied to the river
goddesses JAMUNA and TAPTI.
 E. अर्क, and तनय a son.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

