	 1. A ray of light.
	 2. The light of the sun.
 E. अर्क, and
त्विष् radiance.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कदिन
अर्कदिन n. (-नं) A solar day.
 E. अर्क, and दिन a day: also अर्कदिवसं, &c.
