अर्कपत्र m. (-त्रः) Swallow wort, (Calotropis gigantea.)
	 f. (-त्रा) A kind of
birth wort, (Aristolochia Indica.)
 E. अर्क the swallow wort, and पत्र
a leaf: the leaves of the two plants being similar.
