अर्चक|अर्चकः|अर्च्चक|अर्च्चकः
अर्चक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) A worshipper, one who worships.
 E. अर्च and वुन्.
aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्चन|अर्च्चनं
अर्चन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) An article of worship.
	 nf. (-नं-ना) Worship, the
homage paid to deities and to superiors.
 E. अर्च to worship, युच्
affix, and टाप् fem. do.
