<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्चा|अर्च्चा
अर्चा f. (-र्चा)
	 1. Worship, see अर्चन.
	 2. An image.
 E. अर्च to worship, अच्
affix, and टाप् fem. do.
