<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्च्य
अर्च्य mfn. (-र्च्यः-र्च्या-र्च्यं) Reverend, respectable, worshipful.
 E. अर्च to
worship, and यत् aff.
