अर्थ|अर्थः
अर्थ mfn. (-र्थः-र्था-र्थं)
	 1. Rich.
	 2. Learned.
	 m. (-र्थः)
	 1. Wealth, property,
substance.
	 2. Meaning, signification.
	 3. Thing.
	 4. fruit, conse-
quence.
	 5. Prohibition.
	 6. A material substance or object of sense.
7. Cause, origin.
	 8. Request, asking, begging.
	 9. Kind, sort, man-
ner.
	 10. Well, well-being.
	 11. (In law) A suit, an action.
 E. ऋ to
go, and थन् Unādi aff.
