<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्थगरीयस्
अर्थगरीयस् mfn. (-यान्-यसी-यः) Significant, meaning.
 E. अर्थ with गुरु heavy,
ईयसुन् superlative aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्थघ्न
अर्थघ्न mfn. (-घ्नः-घ्नी-घ्नं) Wasteful, extravagant.
 E. अर्थ, and घ्न who or what
destroys.
