अर्द्धचन्द्र
अर्द्धचन्द्र m. (-न्द्रः)
	 1. A crescent or half moon.
	 2. The hand bent into a
semicircle or the shape of a claw, as for the purpose of seizing or
clutching any thing.
	 3. The semicircular marks on a peacock's
tail.
	 4. An arrow, with a head like a crescent.
	 5. The semicircular
scratch of the fingernail.
	 f. (-न्द्रा) A plant, vulgarly Teori, the
black kind.
 E. अर्द्ध half, and चन्द्र moon, or with कन् added अर्द्धचन्द्रकः.
