<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्द्धनारीश
अर्द्धनारीश m. (-शः) A name of MAHĀDEVA.
 E. अर्द्ध, and नारी a woman, an
ईश master; one of the forms of ŚIVA, to which this name applies
being half male and half female.
