<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्पित
अर्पित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Delivered, consigned.
	 2. Placed in or upon.
E. ऋ to go, in the causal form, क्त aff.
