अर्म्मन्|अर्मन्
अर्म्मन् n. (-र्म्म) A disease of the eyes.
 E. ऋ to go, मनिन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=059-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्य्य|अर्य|अर्यः|अर्य्यः
अर्य्य mfn. (-र्य्यः-र्य्या-र्य्यं) Excellent.
	 m. (-र्य्यः)
	 1. A master.
	 2. A man of the
third tribe, the Vaiśya.
	 f. (-र्य्या)
	 1. A woman of the third tribe.
	 2. The
wife of a Vaiśya.
 E. ऋ to go, यत् affix, and टाप् or ङीप् for the fem.;
ङीप् is affixed, when the word is fem. with reference to the male.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=059-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्य्यमन्|अर्यमन्
अर्य्यमन् m. (-मा)
	 1. The sun.
	 2. A class of the Manes or deified proge-
nitors.
	 3. The asclepias plant.
 E. ऋ to go, कनिन् Unādi affix, and
माङ् inserted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=059-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्य्यर्य्याणी
अर्य्यर्य्याणी f. (-णी) A multitude of woman of the Vaiśya tribe.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=059-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्य्याणी|अर्याणी
अर्य्याणी f. (-णी) A woman of the Vaiśya tribe.
 E. अर्य्य, ङीप् affix, and
आनुक् inserted. See अर्य्य.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=059-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्व्व|अर्व
अर्व्व r. 1st cl. (अर्व्वति) To kill or hurt, also written अर्ब्ब.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=059-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्व्वट|अर्वट|अर्वटं
अर्व्वट n. (-टं) Ashes.
 E. अर्व्व or अर्ब्ब to injure, hence the word may be
also written अर्ब्बट.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=059-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्व्वन्|अर्वन्
अर्व्वन् mfn. (-र्व्वा-र्व्वती-र्व्वत्) Low, inferior, vile.
	 m. (-र्व्वा)
	 1. A horse.
	 2. A
name of INDRA.
	 3. A short span.
	 f. (-र्व्वती)
	 1. A mare.
	 2. A bawd, a
procuress.
 E. ऋ to go, and वनिप् Unādi affix; it is sometimes derived
from अर्ब्ब to go, and is then written अर्ब्बन्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=059-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्व्वाच्|अर्वाच्
अर्व्वाच् mfn. (-र्व्वाङ्-र्व्वाची-र्व्वाक्) Following, subsequent. ind. (-र्व्वाच् or -र्व्वाक्)
1. After, in time.
	 2. Behind, in place.
	 3. Near.
 E. अवर behind, अञ्च
to go, क्विप् affix; the formation is irregular.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=059-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्व्वाचीन|अर्वाचीन|अर्व्वाचीनः
अर्व्वाचीन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं)
	 1. Reverse, contrary.
	 2. Recent, modern. E.
अर्व्वाच् and ख aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=059-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्व्वाचीनत्व
अर्व्वाचीनत्व n. (-त्वं) State of reverse.
 E. त्व added to the last; also with
तल्, अर्व्वाचीनता.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=059-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्श|अर्शं|अर्शः
अर्श n. (-र्शं) Hœmorrhoids, piles. Also अर्शस्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=059-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्शस्
अर्शस् n. (-र्शः) Hœmorrhoids, piles.
 E. ऋ to go, असुन् Unādi affix, and
शुट् inserted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=059-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्शस|अर्शसः
अर्शस mfn. (-सः-सा-सं) Afflicted with hœmorrhoids.
 E. अर्शस् and अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=059-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्शसान|अर्शसानः
अर्शसान m. (-नः) Fire.
 E. ऋ to go, शानच् affix, and शुट् inserted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=059-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्शिन्
अर्शिन् mfn. (-र्शी-र्शिनी-र्शि) Afflicted with hœmorrhoids.
 E. अर्श, and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=059-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्शोघ्न|अर्शोघ्नः
अर्शोघ्न mfn. (-घ्नः-घ्ना-घ्नं) Destroying the hœmorrhoids.
	 m. (-घ्नः) An es-
culent root, (Arum campanulatum.)
	 f. (-घ्नी) A plant, (Curculigo
orchioides.)
 E. अर्शस्, and घ्न what destroys, from हन to kill.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=059-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्शोरोग
अर्शोरोग m. (-गः) The piles or hœmorrhoids.
 E. अर्शस्, and रोग disease.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=059-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्शोरोगयुत
अर्शोरोगयुत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Afflicted with hœmorrhoids.
 E. अर्शोरोग and
युत affected by.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=059-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्शोरोगिन्
अर्शोरोगिन् mfn. (-गी-गिणी-गि) Having hœmorrhoids.
 E. अर्शोरोग and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=059-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्शोहित|अर्शोहितः
अर्शोहित m. (-तः) The marking-nut plant, (Semecarpus anacardium.) E.
अर्शस्, and हित proper.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=059-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्सस्
अर्सस् m. (-र्सः) Hœmorrhoids. See अर्शस्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=059-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्ह|अर्हः
अर्ह r. 1st cl. (अर्हति)
	 1. To worship or honour.
	 2. To be fit or worthy:
in the first sense it is also. r. 10th cl. (अर्हयति.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=059-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्ह|अर्हः
अर्ह mfn. (-र्हः-र्हा-र्हं)
	 1. Proper, fit, becoming.
	 2. Deserving, entitled to,
worthy, m. (-र्हः) INDRA.
	 f. (-र्हा) Worship.
 E. अर्ह to worship, to be
fit, अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=059-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्हण|अर्हणं
अर्हण nf. (-णं-णा) Worship, adoration, respect, courtesy, treating with
veneration or respect.
 E. अर्ह to worship, and युच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=059-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्हत्|अर्हन्त्
अर्हत् mfn. (-र्हन्-र्हन्ती-र्हत्)
	 1. Venerable, respectable.
	 2. Praised, celebrated.
m. (-र्हन्)
	 1. A Jina or Jaina saint and teacher.
	 2. A Jaina, or follow-
er of the doctrines of Jaina.
	 3. A religious mendicant of that sect.
E. अर्ह to worship, &c. and शतृ affix, of the present participle.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=059-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्हत्तम
अर्हत्तम mfn. (-मः-मा-मं) Best, most worthy.
 E. अर्हत् respectable, डतम aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=060-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्हत्तर
अर्हत्तर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) More worthy, better.
 E. अर्हत् and डतर aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=060-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्हन्त|अर्हंत|अर्हन्तः
अर्हन्त m. (-न्तः)
	 1. A Saugata or follower of the doctrines of Buddha.
	 2.
A religious mendicant of the same sect.
	 3. A name of ŚIVA.
 E. अर्ह
to worship, &c. and अन्त irregular aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=060-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्हित|अर्हितः
अर्हित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Saluted, honoured, worshipped.
 E. अर्ह to worship,
&c. and क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=060-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्ह्य
अर्ह्य mfn. (-र्ह्यः-र्ह्या-र्ह्यं) Venerable, respectable, right, fit.
 E. अर्ह and यत्
affix: also with अनीयर् affix, अर्हणीय.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=060-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल|अलं
अल r. 1st. cl. also read अलं (अलति-ते) 1. To adorn.
	 2. To be competent
or able.
	 3. To prevent.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=060-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल|अलं
अल n. (-लं)
	 1. The sting in the tail of the scorpion.
	 2. Yellow orpiment.
E. अल to adorn, &c. and अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=060-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक|अलकं|अलकः
अलक mn. (-कः-कं) A curl.
	 m. (-कः) A mad dog. See अलर्क f. (-का)
	 1.
Alaka, the capital of KUVERA.
	 2. A young girl from eight to ten
years of age.
 E. अल to adorn, &c. वुन् affix, and fem. टाप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=060-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलकनन्दा
अलकनन्दा f. (-न्दा)
	 1. A young girl from eight to ten years old.
	 2. A
river, the Alakanandā, a stream that runs from the Himālaya
mountains, and falls into the Ganges near Srinagara. It is also a
name of the terrestrial Ganges.
 E. अलका, and नन्दा who delights,
the final of the first dropped.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=060-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलकप्रभा
अलकप्रभा f. (-भा) The capital of KUVERA.
 E. अलका, and प्रभा what shines.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=060-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलकप्रिय|अलकप्रियः
अलकप्रिय m. (-यः) A plant, (Pentaptera tomentosa.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=060-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलकसंहति|अलकसंहतिः
अलकसंहति f. (-तिः) Rows of curls.
 E. अलक, and संहति collection. So
अलकावली.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=060-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलकाधिप|अलकाधिपः
अलकाधिप m. (-पः) A name of KUVERA.
 E. अलका the city, and अधिप a
ruler.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=060-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलकाधिपति|अलकाधिपतिः
अलकाधिपति m. (-तिः) KUVERA.
 E. अलका, and अधिपति ruler.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=060-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलकान्त|अलकान्तः
अलकान्त m. (-न्तः) A ringlet, the end of a curl.
 E. अलक, and अन्त end.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=060-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक्त|अलक्तः
अलक्त m. (-क्तः) Lac, the red animal dye so called.
 E. अ neg. रक्त red, र
being changed to ल; than what nothing is redder.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=060-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक्तक|अलक्तकः
अलक्तक n. (-कं) Lac, the dye; see the preceding. E. As before, कन्
being added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=060-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक्तरस|अलक्तरसः
अलक्तरस m. (-सः) Liquefied lac dye.
 E. अलक्त, and रस juice.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=060-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक्षण|अलक्षणं
अलक्षण mfn. (-णः-णा-णं)
	 1. Unfortunate, ill fated, having no good marks
on the person.
	 2. Undefined.
	 n. (-णं)
	 1. The absence of auspicious
marks.
	 2. Misfortune.
	 3. The want of any predicate or definition.
E. अ priv. and लक्षण a mark.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=060-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक्षित
अलक्षित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Unmarked, having no particular mark.
	 2.
Unobserved, unseen.
	 3. Undefined.
 E. अ neg. and लक्षित marked.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=060-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक्ष्मी
अलक्ष्मी f. (-क्ष्मीः) Misfortune, poverty.
 E. अ priv. and लक्ष्मी fortune.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=060-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक्ष्य
अलक्ष्य mfn. (-क्ष्यः-क्ष्या-क्ष्यं) Undistinguishable, undefinable. So अलक्षणीय.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=060-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलगर्दः|अलगर्द|अलगर्द्द
अलगर्दः m. (-र्दः)
	 1. The black variety of the Cobra de Capello, (Colu-
ber naga.)
	 2. A large black leech.
 E. अ neg. लग to be with or near,
and क्विप् affix अलक; again, अर्द to go, and अच् affix; not trailing
its whole length upon the ground: also अलगर्द्ध.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=060-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलग्न
अलग्न mfn. (-ग्नः-ग्ना-ग्नं) Not joined or connected.
 E. अ neg. लग्न attached
to.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=060-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलघु
अलघु mfn. (-घुः-घुः-घ्वी-घु)
	 1. Heavy, weighty.
	 2. Serious, solemn.
	 3.
Violent, intense.
 E. अ neg. लघु light.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=060-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलघुप्रतिज्ञ
अलघुप्रतिज्ञ mfn. (-ज्ञः-ज्ञा-ज्ञं) Solemnly pledged or promised.
 E. अलघु, and
प्रतिज्ञा agreement.
