अलङ्घनीय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Impassable, not to be crossed.
	 2. Venerable,
inviolable, not to be transgressed.
 E. अ neg. लङ्घनीय to be passed,
also अलङ्घ्यः.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=060-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
