<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलङ्घ्यता
अलङ्घ्यता f. (-ता)
	 1. Impassability, inaccessibility.
	 2. Superiority.
	 3.
Authoritative or absolute rule.
 E. अलङ्घ्य not to crossed or trans-
gressed, तल् affix, also अलङ्घ्यत्वं.
