<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलभ्य
अलभ्य mfn. (-भ्यः-भ्या-भ्यं) Unattainable, unobtainable.
 E. अ neg. लभ्य to
be got.
