<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलम्
अलम् ind. Ornament.
	 2. Enough, abundance.
	 3. Able, adequate or
equal to.
	 4. Prohibition, no not.
	 5. Unnecessary, no need of. It is
chiefly used in composition, as अलञ्जीविकः having enough for sub-
sistence; अलन्दत्त्वा refusing to give; इत्यलम् enough; अलङ्कार orna-
ment, &c.
 E. अल to adorn. &c. and अम् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=060-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलम्पुरुषीण|अलंपुरुषीण|अलम्पुरुषीणः
अलम्पुरुषीण mfn. (-णः-णा-णं) Fit for a man, becoming a man.
 E. अलम्,
पुरुष a man, and ख aff.
