<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलम्बुष|अलंबुष|अलंबुषः|अलम्बुषः
अलम्बुष m. (-षः)
	 1. The palm of the hand with the fingers extended.
2. Vomiting, sickness.
	 3. The name of a Rākshasa or goblin.
	 f.
(-षा)
	 1. One of the Apsarās or nymphs of Svarga.
	 2. Madder,
(Rubia manjith.)
	 3. A sort of sensitive plant.
	 4. A barrier, a
line or any thing not to be crossed.
 E. अलम्, and बुस to injure,
affix क.
