<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलय|अलयः
अलय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Houseless, homeless.
 E. अ neg. and लय place of
refuge.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=060-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलर्क|अलर्कः
अलर्क m. (-र्कः)
	 1. White swallow wort, (Calotropis gigantea alba.)
	 2.
A mad dog or one rendered furious.
	 3. A fabulous animal, like a
hog with eight legs.
	 4. An Asura changed to such an animal. Also
अलर्क्क.
 E. अल् to adorn, &c. क्विप् affix, and अर्क to inflame or heat.
