<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलवाल|अलवालं
अलवाल n. (-लं) A basin for water at the root of a tree.
 E. अ neg. लू to
cut, and आल affix; also आलवाल.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=060-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
