<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलस|अलसः
अलस mfn. (-सः-सा-सं) Lazy, idle, indolent.
	 m. (-सः)
	 1. Swelling of the
feet in elephantiasis.
	 2. Chaps between the toes.
	 3. Name of a
tree.
	 f. (-सा) A creeping plant, (Cissus pedata.)
 E. अ neg. लस to
work, affix अच्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=060-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलसक|अलसकः
अलसक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Indolent.
	 m. (-कः) Flatulence, Tympanitis, in-
tumescence of the abdomen, with constipation and wind.
 E. कन्
added to the last.
