<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलसता
अलसता f. (-ता) Idleness.
 E. अलस and तल् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलसत्व
अलसत्व n. (-त्वं) Idleness.
 E. अलस and त्वं aff.
