<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलात|अलातं|अलातः
अलात n. (-तं) A firebrand, whether burning or extinguished.
 E. अ neg.
ला to take, and क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलाबु|अलाबुः
अलाबु f. (-बुः) A long gourd. See the next word.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलाबू
अलाबू f. (-बूः) The bottle gourd, (Cucurbita lagenaris.)
 E. अ neg. लब to
sink, ऊ Unādi affix, म् is dropped, and the preceding vowel length-
ened: what does not sink in water; floats, &c. are made of this
gourd, especially when hollowed: also अलबु and आलाबु.
