अलिकुल n. (-लं) A flight or a number of bees.
 E. अलि, and कुल a
number.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिगर्द्ध
अलिगर्द्ध m. (-र्द्धः) A snake, the black Cobra.
 E. अलि, and गर्द्ध to sound, affix
अच्; hissing like the scorpion.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

