अलिङ्गिन् mfn. (-ङ्गी-ङ्गिनी-ङ्गि) An impostor, a pretended ascetic or student,
one wearing the usual marks, as the frontal marks, skin, staff, &c.
without belonging in reality to a religious order.
 E. अ neg. लिङ्ग
sectarial mark, इनि aff.
