	 1. A large black bee.
	 2. A scorpion.
 E. अल a sting, and
इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिन्द|अलिंदः|अलिन्दः
अलिन्द m. (-न्दः) A terrace before a house.
 E. अल to adorn, &c. and किन्दच्
affix; also आलिन्द.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिपक|अलिपकः
अलिपक m. (-कः)
	 1. A large black bee.
	 2. A scorpion.
	 3. A dog. Also
read अलिम्पक and अलिमक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिपिज्ञ
अलिपिज्ञ mfn. (-ज्ञः-ज्ञा-ज्ञं) Ignorant of reading and writing.
 E. अ neg. लिपि
writing, ज्ञ who knows.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिप्रिय|अलिप्रियं|अलिप्रियः
अलिप्रिय n. (-यं) The red lotus, (Nymphœa rubra.)
	 f. (-या) The trumpet
flower, (Bignonia suave-olens.)
 E. अलि a bee, and प्रिय beloved, the
object of the bee's affections: the lotus especially is so described by
the poets.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिप्सा
अलिप्सा f. (-प्सा) Freedom from desire or cupidity.
 E. अ neg. and लिप्सा
wish.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिमक|अलिमकः
अलिमक m. (-कः)
	 1. A frog.
	 2. The Kokila or Indian cuckoo.
	 3. A large
black bee.
	 4. The filaments of the lotus.
	 5. A tree, (Bassia latifolia.)
E. अलि from अल to adorn, मकच् affix; also अलिपक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिमाला
अलिमाला f. (-ला) A flight of bees.
 E. अलि and माला a necklace.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिम्पक|अलिंपक
अलिम्पक m. (-कः)
	 1. A bee.
	 2. The Kokila.
	 3. A dog.
	 4. The filaments
of the lotus.
 E. अ neg. लिपि to smear, वुन् affix: also read अलिवकः
and अलिम्बकः.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिविराव|अलिविरावः
अलिविराव m. (-वः) The hum of bees.
 E. अलि, and विराव sound.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिविरुत
अलिविरुत n. (-तं) The song or hum of the bee.
 E. अलि, and विरुत sound.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलीक|अलीकं
अलीक mfn. (-कः-का-कं)
	 1. False.
	 2. Unpleasing.
	 3. Small, little.
	 n. (-कं)
1. Falsehood, untruth.
	 2. Any thing displeasing.
	 3. Heaven.
	 4.
The forehead.
 E. अल to adorn, &c. and कीकच् Unādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलीकता
अलीकता f. (-ता) Falsehood, vanity: also अलीकत्व.
 E. तल् or त्व added to
to the last.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलीकमत्स्य|अलीकमत्स्यः
अलीकमत्स्य m. (-त्स्यः) A cake of beans fried with Sesamum oil.
 E. अलीक
unreal, मत्स्य fish.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलु|अलुः
अलु f. (-लुः) A small water pot.
 E. ऋ to go, and उच् affix, र becomes ल;
also आलु.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलुब्ध|अलुब्धः
अलुब्ध mfn. (-ब्धः-ब्धा-ब्धं) Moderated, content, not covetous.
 E. अ neg. and
लुब्ध covetous.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलून
अलून mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Uncut, unshorn.
 E. अ neg. लून cut.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अले
अले ind. An unmeaning word in the dialect of the demons or Pisāchas,
when they are introduced in plays, &c. also अलले.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलेले
अलेले ind. See the preceding word.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलेश
अलेश mfn. (-शः-शा-शं) Much, large adv.
	 n. (-शं) Not at all.
 E. अ neg. लेश
small.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलेशैज
अलेशैज mfn. (-जः-जा-जं) Firm, steady.
 E. अलेश not at all, एज what
shakes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलोकन|अलोकनं
अलोकन n. (-नं) Disappearance, invisibility, imperceptible.
 E. अ neg. लोकन
seeing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलोकनीय
अलोकनीय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Invisible.
 E. अ neg. लोकनीय visible.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलोकित
अलोकित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Unseen.
 E. अ neg. लोकित seen.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलोभ|अलोभः
अलोभ m. (-भः) Moderation, content, absence of cupidity.
 E. अ neg. and
लोभ desire.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलोभिन्
अलोभिन् mfn. (-भी-भिनी-भि) Not wanting or desiring any thing, free
from desire.
 E. अ neg. and लोभिन् desirous.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलोल
अलोल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Firm, steady, tranquil, unagitated.
 E. अ neg.
लोल moving.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलोलु
अलोलु mfn. (-लुः-लुः-लु) Indifferent to sensual objects.
 E. अ neg. लोल to
desire, affix उ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलोलुप
अलोलुप mfn. (-पः-पा-पं) Free from desire.
 E. अ neg, लोलुप libidinous.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलोलुत्व
अलोलुत्व n. (-त्वं) Indifference to sensual objects.
 E. अलोलु and त्व affix: also
अलोलुता.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलोहित|अलोहितं
अलोहित n. (-तं) The red lotus.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलौकिक|अलौकिकः
अलौकिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं)
	 1. Supernatural, not relating to this world.
	 2.
Not common, not current in the world.
	 3. Indifferent to the world,
unworldly.
 E. अ neg. लौकिक mundane.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्क|अल्कः
अल्क n. (-ल्कं)
	 1. A tree.
	 2. A member of the body.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्प|अल्पं|अल्पः
अल्प mfn. (-ल्पः-ल्पा-ल्पं)
	 1. Little, small.
	 2. Inferior, low.
 E. अल् to be able.
&c. प affix or with कन् added अल्पक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पक|अल्पकः
अल्पक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Small, minute.
 E. अल्प and कन् added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पकेशी
अल्पकेशी f. (-शी) The root of sweet flag.
 E. अल्प small, and केशी having
filaments, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पगन्ध|अल्पगन्धं
अल्पगन्ध n. (-न्धं) The red lotus.
 E. अल्प and गन्ध smell.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पज्ञ
अल्पज्ञ mfn. (-ज्ञः-ज्ञा-ज्ञं) Ignorant, shallow, superficial.
 E. अल्प, and ज्ञ who
knows.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पतनु|अल्पतनुः
अल्पतनु mfn. (-नुः-नुः-नु) Small, short, thin, pigmy, having a little body.
E. अल्प, and तनु the body.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पता
अल्पता f. (ता)
	 1. Smallness, minuteness.
	 2. Inferiority, insignificance. E.
अल्प and तल् affix, or with त्व, अल्पत्वं.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पदक्षिण
अल्पदक्षिण mfn. (-णः-णा-णं) Defective in present, (any ceremony, &c.)
E. अल्प, and दक्षिणा gift to Brahmans.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पधन
अल्पधन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Of little wealth, not affluent.
 E. अल्प, and धन wealth.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पधी
अल्पधी mfn. (-धीः-धीः-धि) Ignorant, foolish, of little sense.
 E. अल्प, and धी
understanding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पपत्र|अल्पपत्रः
अल्पपत्र m. (-त्रः) A species of the Tulasi.
 E. अल्प, and पत्र a leaf.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पपद्म|अल्पपद्मं
अल्पपद्म n. (-द्मं) The red lotus.
 E. अल्प small, and पद्म lotus.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पप्रभाव
अल्पप्रभाव mfn. (-वः-वा-वं) Insignificant, of little weight or consequence.
E. अल्प, and प्रभाव authority.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पप्रमाण|अल्पप्रमाणः
अल्पप्रमाण mfn. (-णः-णा-णं)
	 1. Of little authority.
	 2. Of little weight or
measure.
 E. अल्प, and प्रमाण authority, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=062-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पप्रमाणक|अल्पप्रमाणकः
अल्पप्रमाणक mfn. (-कः-का-कं)
	 1. Credulous, resting on little evidence.
	 2.
Of little weight or authority.
	 3. Of short measure.
	 m. (-कः) Common
cucumber, (Cucumis sativus.)
 E. अल्प, and प्रमाण authority, &c. कन्
added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=062-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पबल
अल्पबल mfn. (-लः-लाः-लं) Feeble, of little strength.
 E. अल्प, and बल
strength.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=062-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पबाध
अल्पबाध mfn. (-धः-धा-धं) Causing little annoyance or inconvenience. E.
अल्प, and बाधा pain.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=062-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पबुद्धि
अल्पबुद्धि mfn. (-द्धिः-द्धिः-द्धि) Ignorant, silly, unwise.
 E. अल्प, बुद्धि understand-
ing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=062-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पमात्र
अल्पमात्र n. (-त्रं)
	 1. A little, a little only.
	 2. A short time, a few moments.
E. अल्प, and मात्र only.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=062-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पमारिष|अल्पमारिषः
अल्पमारिष m. (-षः) A kind of amaranth, (Amaranthus polygamus.) E.
अल्प, मृष to hurt, and इमच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=062-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पमूर्त्ति|अल्पमूर्ति|अल्पमूर्तिः
अल्पमूर्त्ति mfn. (-र्त्तिः-र्त्तिः-र्त्ति) Small, diminutive.
	 f. (-र्त्तिः) A small figure
or object.
 E. अल्प, and मूर्त्ति form.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=062-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पमेधस्
अल्पमेधस् mfn. (-धाः-धाः-धः) Ignorant, silly, of little understanding. E.
अल्प, and मेधस् apprehension.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=062-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पवयस्
अल्पवयस् mfn. (-याः-याः-यः) Young, of few years.
 E. अल्प, and वयस् life.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=062-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पवादिन्
अल्पवादिन् mfn. (-दी-दिनी-दि) Taciturn: also अल्पभाषिन्.
 E. अल्प, and वादिन्
or भाषिन् who speaks.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=062-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पविषय
अल्पविषय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Meaning or directing a little.
 E. अल्प, and विषय
object.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=062-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पविद्य
अल्पविद्य mfn. (-द्यः-द्या-द्यं) Ill-taught, uneducated, ignorant.
 E. अल्प, and
विद्या knowledge.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=062-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पशक्ति
अल्पशक्ति mfn. (-क्तिः-क्तिः-क्ति) Weak, feeble,
 E. अल्प, and शक्ति power.
