<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पसरस्
अल्पसरस् n. (-रः) A basin, a small pond, one which is shallow or dry in
the hot season.
 E. अल्प, and सरस् a pool.
