<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पाकाङ्क्षिन्|अल्पाकांक्षिन्
अल्पाकाङ्क्षिन् mfn. (-ङ्क्षी-ङ्क्षिणी-ङ्क्षि) Contented, satisfied with little.
 E. अल्प,
and आकाङ्क्षिन् who desires.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=062-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पायुस्
अल्पायुस् mfn. (-युः-युः-युः)
	 1. Short lived.
	 2. Young of few years.
	 m. (-युः)
A goat.
 E. अल्प, and आयुस् life.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=062-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पाल्प
अल्पाल्प mfn. (-ल्पः-ल्पा-ल्पं)
	 1. Very little, minute.
	 2. Gradual, little at a
time.
 E. अल्प repeated.
