<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पाहारिन्
अल्पाहारिन् mfn. (-री-रिणी-रि) Abstemious, moderate.
 E. अल्प, and आहारिन्
who feeds.
