<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पिष्ठ|अल्पिष्ठः
अल्पिष्ठ mfn. (-ष्ठः-ष्ठा-ष्ठं) Least, smallest, very small.
 E. अल्प, and इष्ठच् of
the superlative.
