अल्पीकृत
अल्पीकृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Reduced, comminuted, made little or few. E.
अल्प and कृत with च्वि inserted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=062-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पीभूत
अल्पीभूत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Reduced, diminished, become little or few. E.
अल्प, and भूत become, च्वि inserted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=062-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पीयस्
अल्पीयस् mfn. (-यान्-यसी-यः) Very small.
 E. अल्प and ईयसुन् affix. Also अल्पिष्ठ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=062-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पोन
अल्पोन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Defective, not quite finished, not wholly entire.
E. अल्प a little, ऊन less.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=062-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्ला
अल्ला f. (-ल्ला) A mother, in dramatic language.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=062-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव|अवः
अव r. 1st. cl. अवति 1. To keep, protect or defend.
	 2. To please. (The
following meanings, although found in lists of roots, are rarely
used:)
	 3. To move.
	 4. To excite affection or be lovely.
	 5. To
satisfy.
	 6. To know or apprehend.
	 7. To enter.
	 8. To be near.
	 9. To
own, to have a right.
	 10. To obey.
	 11. To act.
	 12. To desire.
	 13.
To shine or be splendid.
	 14. To obtain.
	 15. To embrace.
	 16. To
kill or hurt.
	 17. To take.
	 18. To be.
	 19. To grow. In place of 9,
17, and 18. as above, some read; 9. To be able.
	 17. To burn, and
18. To divide or share.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=062-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव|अवः
अव ind. A preposition and prefix to words, corresponding to off, from,
down from, out, away, &c. and implying; 1. Diminution.
	 2. Depre-
ciation.
	 3. Diffusion.
	 4. Support, resting.
	 5. Commanding.
	 6.
Purifying, correcting.
	 7. Knowledge.
	 8. Disrespect.
	 9. Nourishing.
As अवगन्तु To go away; अवज्ञातुं To disrespect; अवतरितुं To come
down, to descend; अवस्थातुं To remain in or on; अवहर्त्तुं To take
off or away; also अवमः a low man; अवाक् reverse, behind; अवकोकिलः
a koil with a bad voice, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=062-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवकट|अवकटं
अवकट mfn. (-टः-टा-टं)
	 1. Opposite, contrary.
	 2. Backwards.
	 3. Down-
wards.
	 n. (-टं) Opposition, contrariety, reverse.
 E. अव down, and
कटच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=062-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवकम्पित
अवकम्पित m. (-तः) A Buddha.
 E. अव, and कम्पित shaken.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=062-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवकर|अवकरः
अवकर m. (-रः) Dust or sweepings.
 E. अव spreading, and कर what
makes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=062-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवकर्त्तन|अवकर्तन|अवकर्तनं
अवकर्त्तन n. (-नं) Excision, cutting off.
 E. अव and कर्त्तन cutting.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=062-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवकर्षण|अवकर्षणं
अवकर्षण n. (-णं)
	 1. Taking or pulling out, extraction, expulsion.
	 2.
Pulling, dragging.
 E. अव, and कर्षण pulling.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=062-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवकलित|अवकलितः
अवकलित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Seen.
 E. अव and कलित part. past of कल to sound,
&c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=062-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवकाश|अवकाशः
अवकाश m. (-शः)
	 1. Leisure, opportunity.
	 2. Interval, space.
	 3. An open
or wide space.
	 4. A receptacle, a repository, a place in which any
thing is kept.
	 5. A place, a spot, a situation.
 E. अव between, &c.
काश to shine, अच् aff.
