<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवकीर्ण|अवकीर्णः
अवकीर्ण mfn. (-र्णः-र्णा-र्णं) I. Coarsely pounded.
	 2. Scattered.
	 3. Dis-
regarded, violated.
 E. अव implying separation, कॄ to scatter in the
irregular part. past.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=062-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवकीर्णिन्|अवकीर्ण्णिन्
अवकीर्णिन् mfn. (-र्णी-र्णिनी-र्णि) Violating a vow or engagement to be
chaste, abstemious, &c.
	 m. (-र्णी) The religious student who has com-
mitted an act of incontinency.
 E. अव before, कॄ to scatter, क्त the
part. past, and इनि aff.
