<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवकुटार|अवकुटारं
अवकुटार mfn. (-रः-रा-रं)
	 1. Opposite, contrary.
	 2. Backwards.
	 3. Down-
wards.
	 n. (-रं) Reverse, contrariety.
 E. अव and कुटार aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=062-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवकुट्टित
अवकुट्टित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Vexed.
	 2. Inflamed.
	 3. Cut off.
 E. अव, and
कुट्ट to heat, &c. क्त aff.
