अवकुण्ठित|अवकुंठित
अवकुण्ठित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Affected.
	 2. Surrounded, attracted.
 E. अव
before कुठ to surround, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=062-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवकृष्ट|अवकृष्टः
अवकृष्ट mfn. (-ष्टः-ष्टा-ष्टं)
	 1. Expelled, turned out.
	 2. Removed, sent away,
drawn aside.
	 3. Extracted.
	 4. Pulled.
	 5. Inferior, low.
	 6. Degraded,
outcaste.
	 m. (-ष्टः) A servant who performs the lowest office, a
sweeper, a waterman, &c.
 E. अव out of, and कृष्ट drawn.
