<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवकृष्य
अवकृष्य ind.
	 1. Having drawn out or extracted.
	 2. Having drawn to-
gether or contracted.
 E. अव, and कृष to draw, यत् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=062-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवकेशिन्
अवकेशिन् mfn. (-शी-शिनी-शि) Barren.
 E. अव privative, केश properly hair,
in this instance fruit, and इनि aff.
