<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवगथ|अवगथः
अवगथ mfn. (-थः-था-थं) Bathing or bathed early in the morning.
 E. अव, ग
from गम to go, and थक् aff.
