अवधूत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Compelled.
	 2. Discarded.
	 3. Shaken, removed,
tossed.
	 4. Trodden upon.
	 5. Separated from worldly feeling and
obligation.
 E. अव, and धूत shaken.
