अवधूनन|अवधूननं
अवधूनन n. (-नं)
	 1. Shaking, causing to shake.
	 2. Expelling.
	 3. Being in
agitation, trembling.
	 4. Trembling on, treading on.
 E. अव before
धूनन shaking.
