अवन|अवनं
अवन n. (-नं)
	 1. Satisfaction, (given or received.)
	 2. Preserving, protecting.
3. Kindness.
	 4. Speed.
	 5. Going.
	 6. Obtaining.
	 7. Asking.
	 8. Seizing.
9. Killing.
	 10. Strength, power.
	 11. Increase.
	 12. Existence, being.
13. Doing.
	 14. Desire.
	 15. Beautifying, adorning.
	 16. Embracing.
17. Bearing.
	 18. Entrance.
 E. अव to go, to preserve, &c. ल्युट्
aff.
