अवमर्द्द|अवमर्द|अवमर्दः
अवमर्द्द m. (-र्द्दः)
	 1. Devastation, inflicting pain or punishment on an
enemy, by laying his country waste, &c.
	 2. Giving pain.
 E. अव, मृद
to tread down, घञ् aff.
