<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमर्षण|अवमर्षणं
अवमर्षण n. (-णं)
	 1. Intolerance, impatience.
	 2. Effacing, obliterating.
	 3.
Banishing from recollection.
 E. अव away, &c. मृष to endure, ल्युट् aff.
