<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमानता
अवमानता f. (-ता)
	 1. Dishonourableness.
	 2. Contempt.
 E. तल् added to the
last; also with त्व, अवमानत्वं.
