	 1. Posterior, hinder, last.
	 2. Younger.
	 3. Inferior.
	 n.
(-रं) The hind thigh of an elephant.
	 f. (-रा) A name of DURGĀ.
 E. अ
neg. and वर preferable; not the best, or than which nothing is better.
