<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरोध|अवरोधः
अवरोध m. (-धः)
	 1. The seraglio of a palace, the queen's apartment.
	 2. A
queen.
	 3. A palace.
	 4. A covering.
	 5. Hindrance, obstruction.
	 6. A
fence, a pen, an inclosure, confinement.
	 7. Restraint.
 E. अव, रुध to
inclose or shut up, घञ् aff.
