<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरोधिक|अवरोधिकः
अवरोधिक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Obstructive, impeding.
	 m. (-कः) A guard of
the queen's apartments.
 E. अवरोध with ठक् aff.
