<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरोपण|अवरोपणं
अवरोपण n. (-णं)
	 1. Taking away, depriving, diminishing.
	 2. Descending.
3. Setting, (as of the sun.)
 E. अव affix, and रोपण placing.
