	 1. Asylum, dependence, support.
	 2. Depending,
hanging on or from.
	 3. A prop, a stay.
	 4. A suspender.
	 5. A perpen-
dicular.
 E. अव before लवि to go, &c. अच् affix; also अवलम्बनं
