अवश्य|अवश्यं
अवश्य mfn. (-श्यः-श्या-श्यं) Untameable, ungovernable. ind. (-श्य) Certainly,
necessarily.
 E. अव, श्यै to go, डम् affix; irregularly formed: it occurs
in composition with or without the nasal, as अवश्यङ्कारी who does
what is necessary, अवश्यपाच्यः to be necessarily cooked, &c.
 E. अ neg.
वश to subdue, affix यत्.
