अवसन्न|अवसन्नः
अवसन्न mfn. (-न्नः-न्ना-न्नं)
	 1. Melancholy, dispirited, unhappy.
	 2. Ended,
terminated.
	 3. Languid, enervated.
	 4. Separated.
	 5. Bowed, bent.
6. Non-suited.
 E. अव before सन to faint, क्त aff.
