अवसर|अवसरः
अवसर m. (-रः)
	 1. Occasion, opportunity.
	 2. Rain, raining.
	 3. Consulta-
tion in private.
	 4. A year.
	 5. A moment.
 E. अव, सृ to go, अप् aff.
