<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवसान|अवसानं
अवसान n. (-नं)
	 1. Conclusion, termination, cessation.
	 2. Death.
	 3.
Boundary, limit.
	 4. (In grammar,) Disjunction of letters.
 E. अव, षो
