<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशित्र|अशित्रः
अशित्र m. (-त्रः) A thief.
 E. अशू to pervade, इत्र Unādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=072-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशिथिल
अशिथिल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Firm, tight, hard.
 E. अ neg. शिथिल loose.
