<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशिर|अशिरं|अशिरः
अशिर m. (-रः)
	 1. A name of the sun.
	 2. Fire.
	 3. A goblin or demon.
	 f.
(-रा) The wife of a goblin.
	 n. (-रं) A diamond.
 E. अश to eat, and
इर affix; what eats sacrifices, &c.
