<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशिरःस्नान
अशिरःस्नान n. (-नं) Bathing the body with exception of the head.
 E. अ
neg. शिरस् the head, स्नान bathing.
