अशिष्टाचार
अशिष्टाचार m. (-रः) Rudeness, profligacy.
 E. अशिष्ट, and आचार practice.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=073-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशीत|अशीतः
अशीत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Warm, hot.
 E. अ not, शीत cold.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=073-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशीतकर|अशीतकरः
अशीतकर m. (-रः) The sun.
 E. अ neg. शीत cold, and कर a ray, and similar
compounds, as अशीतदीधितिः, अशीतमरीचिः, &c.
