<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशोधित
अशोधित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Unclean, uncleansed.
	 2. Inaccurate, unrevised,
uncorrected.
 E. अ neg. शोधित purified.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=073-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशोष्य
अशोष्य mfn. (-ष्यः-ष्या-ष्यं) Not to be dried up.
 E. अ neg. शोष्य to be dried
up; so अशोषणीय, &c.
