<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशौच|अशौचं
अशौच n. (-चं)
	 1. Foulness, impurity.
	 2. Legal impurity, contamination,
defilement contracted by the death of a relation, the commission of
prohibited acts, &c.
 E. अ neg. शौच purification.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=073-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशौचत्व
अशौचत्व n. (-त्वं)
	 1. Impure or abandoned nature or diposition.
	 2. Defile-
ment, contamination.
 E. त्व added to अशौच.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=073-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशौर्य्य|अशौर्य
अशौर्य्य n. (-र्य्यं) Want of heroism, cowardice.
 E. अ neg. शौर्य्य valour.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=073-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्म|अश्मः
अश्म m. (-श्मः)
	 1. A mountain, a rock.
	 2. A cloud, (in the language of
the Vedas:) see अश्मन्.
