<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्मकुट्ट|अश्मकुट्टः
अश्मकुट्ट mfn. (-ट्टः-ट्टा-ट्टं) Who or what breaks with a stone.
	 2. Bruised or
broken by stones.
 E. अश्म and कुट्ट what bruises or breaks.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=073-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्मकुट्टक|अश्मकुट्टकः
अश्मकुट्टक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Breaking or bruising any thing with a stone.
E. अश्म and कुट्टक who breaks.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=073-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्मगर्भ|अश्मगर्भः
अश्मगर्भ m. (-र्भः) An emerald.
 E. अश्मन् a stone, and गर्भ the womb; the
primary stone.
