<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्मदारण|अश्मदारणः
अश्मदारण m. (-णः) An axe or crow for breaking stones, &c.
	 n. (-णं) Split-
ting stones or rocks.
 E. अश्मन् a stone, &c. दॄ to split. ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=073-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्मन्
अश्मन् m. (-श्मा) A stone or rock.
 E. अश to spread, &c. मनिन् Unādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=073-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्मन्त|अश्मंत|अश्मन्तं|अश्मन्तः
अश्मन्त mfn. (-न्तः-न्ता-न्तं)
	 1. Unbounded, unlimited.
	 2. Inauspicious, un-
lucky.
	 n. (-न्तं)
	 1. A fireplace.
	 2. Death.
	 3. A field, a plain.
 E. अश्मन्
a stone, &c. and अन्त the end; it is also written अश्वन्त and अस्मन्त.
