<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्मपुष्प|अश्मपुष्पं
अश्मपुष्प n. (-ष्पं) Benzoin, (Styrax benzoin.)
 E. अश्मन् stone, and पुष्प a
flower: supposed to exude from rocks.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=073-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्मभाल|अश्मभालं
अश्मभाल m. (-लः) A mortar of stone or iron.
 E. अश्मन् a stone, and भाल
the skull.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=073-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्मभिद्
अश्मभिद् m. (-द्) The name of a plant, (Plectranthus scutellaroides, Rox.)
E. अश्मन् a stone, and भिद् what breaks.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=073-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्मभेद|अश्मभेदः
अश्मभेद m. (-दः) See the preceding. E. As before, अश्मन् and भेद.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=073-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्ममय
अश्ममय mfn. (-यः-यी-यं) Made or consisting of stone, stony.
	 n. (-यं) A
mineral.
 E. अश्म and मयट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=073-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्मयोनि|अश्मयोनिः
अश्मयोनि m. (-निः) An emerald. E. See अश्मगर्भ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=073-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्मर|अश्मरः
अश्मर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Stony, rocky, appertaining to stone or rock. E.
अश्मन् and र aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=073-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्मरी
अश्मरी f. (-री)
	 1. Strangury.
	 2. Stone or gravel, (the disease.)
 E. अश्मर
stony, and ङीप् fem. aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=073-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्मरीघ्न|अश्मरीघ्नः
अश्मरीघ्न m. (-घ्नः) A tree, (Tapia cratœva.)
 E. अश्मरी gravel, and घ्न what
destroys; a lithonthriptic.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=073-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्मरीहर|अश्मरीहरः
अश्मरीहर m. (-रः) A tree, (Pentaptera arjuna.) E. See the last word, हर
from हृ to carry away.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=073-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्मसार|अश्मसारः
अश्मसार mn. (-रः-रं) Iron.
 E. अश्मन् a stone, and सार essence, &c. the
hardest stone, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=073-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्मान्तक
अश्मान्तक m. (-कः) A plant, from the fibres of which the girdle of a
Brahman may be made; also अश्मन्तक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=073-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्मीर|अश्मीरं|अश्मीरः
अश्मीर mn. (-रः-रं) Stone or gravel, (the disease.)
 E. अश्मन् a stone, ईर
aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=073-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्र|अश्रं|अश्रः
अश्र n. (-श्रं)
	 1. A tear.
	 2. Blood.
 E. अशू to spread, &c. and र affix; see
अश्रु and अस्र.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=073-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रद्ध
अश्रद्ध mfn. (-द्धः-द्धा-द्धं) Unbelieving.
	 f. (-द्धा) Unbelief.
 E. अ neg. श्रद्धा faith.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=073-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रद्दधान|अश्रद्दधानः
अश्रद्दधान mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Unbelieving, incredulous, having no faith.
 E. अ
neg. श्रद्दधान believing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=073-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रद्धेय|अश्रद्धेयं
अश्रद्धेय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Incredible, not to be believed.
 E. अ neg. and श्रद्धेय
worthy of faith.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=073-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रप|अश्रपः
अश्रप m. (-पः) A fiend, a cannibal.
 E. अश्र blood, and प who drinks.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=073-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रवण|अश्रवणः
अश्रवण n. (-णं) Deafness, loss of hearing.
 E. अ neg. श्रवण hearing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=074-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रम|अश्रमः
अश्रम m. (-मः)
	 1. Freshness, freedom from fatigue.
	 2. Laziness, want of
exertion.
 E. अ neg. श्रम fatigue.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=074-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्राद्ध|अश्राद्धः
अश्राद्ध mfn. (-द्धः-द्धा-द्धं)
	 1. Not performing exequial rites, not entitled
to them, not belonging or relating to them.
	 m. (-द्धः) Non-perform-
ance of exequial rites.
 E. अ neg. श्राद्ध funereal ceremony.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=074-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रान्त|अश्रांत|अश्रान्तं|अश्रान्तः
अश्रान्त adv.
	 n. (-न्तं) adj.
	 mfn. (-न्तः-न्ता-न्तं)
	 1. Eternal, continual.
	 2.
Unwearied.
 E. अ neg. and श्रान्त wearied, part. past of श्रम.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=074-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रि|अश्रिः
अश्रि f. (-श्रिः)
	 1. The edge of a sword.
	 2. A corner, the angle of a room
or house.
 E. श्रिञ् to serve, आङ् prefixed, आ becomes अ; also अश्री
and आश्रि.
