<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रीक
अश्रीक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Unlucky, unpropitious.
 E. अ neg. श्री fortune,
and कन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=074-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रीमत्|अश्रीमन्त्
अश्रीमत् mfn. (-मान्-मती-मत्) Inglorious, unfortunate.
 E. अ neg. श्रीमत्
fortunate.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=074-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रील
अश्रील mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Unlucky, unprosperous.
 E. अ neg. श्री prosperity,
ला to have, affix क.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=074-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रु
अश्रु n. (-श्रु) A tear.
 E. अ neg. श्रि to serve, डुन् Unādi affix; it is also
written अश्र.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=074-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रुत|अश्रुतं
अश्रुत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Unheard.
	 2. Not directed by or contrary to the
Vedas.
 E. अ neg. and श्रुत heard, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=074-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रुनाली
अश्रुनाली f. (-ली) Fistula lachrymalis.
 E. अश्रु and नाली a channel.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=074-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रुपात|अश्रुपातः
अश्रुपात m. (-तः) A flow of tears.
 E. अश्रु, and पात fall.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=074-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रेयस्
अश्रेयस् mfn. (-यान्-यसी-यः)
	 1. Worthless, useless, unprofitable, bad.
	 2.
Inferior, worse.
 E. अ neg. श्रेयस् excellent.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=074-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रेष्ठ
अश्रेष्ठ mfn. (-ष्ठः-ष्ठा-ष्ठं)
	 1. Inferior, worse.
	 2. Bad, vile.
 E. अ neg. श्रेष्ठ
best.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=074-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रोत्रिय
अश्रोत्रिय m. (-यः) A Brahman who has not read the Vedas.
 E. अ neg.
श्रोत्रिय a learned Brahman.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=074-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्लाघ्य
अश्लाघ्य mfn. (-घ्यः-घ्या-घ्यं) Worthless, undeserving of honour or praise. E.
अ neg. श्लाघ्य to be praised.
