<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्लाघनीय
अश्लाघनीय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Undeserving of honour or praise, base, mean,
worthless.
 E. अ neg. श्लाघनीय to be praised.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=074-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्लीक
अश्लीक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Unlucky, unpropitious. E. As अश्रीक, the र being
changed to ल.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=074-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्लील
अश्लील mfn. (-लः-ला-लं)
	 1. Coarse, vulgar.
	 2. Abusive, blackguard.
	 n. (-लं)
1. Rustic language.
	 2. Untruth.
	 3. Low abuse.
 E. अ neg. श्लील
elegant.
