<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्लेषा
अश्लेषा f. (-षा)
	 1. The ninth Nakshatra or lunar mansion, containing
five stars.
	 2. Disunion, disjunction.
 E. अ neg. and श्लेष union.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=074-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्लेषाभव|अश्लेषाभवः
अश्लेषाभव m. (-वः) A mane of KETU or the dragon's head: see केतु. E.
अश्लेषा the asterism, and भव born, born under the sign Aslehā; or
अश्लेषा disjunction, and भव produced; as KETU was formed of the
lower extremities which had been sundered by VIṢṆU from RĀHU.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=074-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्लेषाभू
अश्लेषाभू m. (-भूः) A name of KETU. E. As the preceding, भू to be born,
with क्विप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=074-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्व|अश्वः
अश्व m. (-श्वः)
	 1. A horse.
	 2. A set or cast of men horse-like in strength.
du. (-श्वौ) A horse and a mare.
	 f. (-श्वा) A mare.
 E. अश to pervade, क्वन्
Unādi affix, and टाप् fem. aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=074-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वक|अश्वकः
अश्वक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Horse-like, acting like a horse, &c.
	 m. (-कः)
	 1. A
bad horse, a hack.
	 2. A stray horse, one whose owner is not known.
3. Any horse.
 E. अश्व and कन् added in different senses.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=074-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वकन्दिका
अश्वकन्दिका f. (-का) A plant, (Physalis flexuosa.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=074-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वकर्ण|अश्वकर्णः|अश्वकर्ण्ण
अश्वकर्ण m. (-र्णः) A timber tree, commonly Sakwa or Sal (Shorea robusta.)
E. अश्व a. horse, and कर्ण an ear, the leaves being compared to the
ears of a horse.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=074-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वकर्णक|अश्वकर्णकः
अश्वकर्णक m. (-कः) The Sal-tree, (Shorea robusta.)
 E. कन् added to
अश्वकर्ण.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=074-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वकिनी
अश्वकिनी f. (-नी) The first Nakshatra or lunar mansion.
 E. अश्वक a horse,
इनि and ङीप् affixes: see अश्विनी.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=074-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वखुर|अश्वखुरः
अश्वखुर m. (-रः)
	 1. A horse's hoof.
	 2. A perfume, apparently a dried
shell-fish: see नखी.
	 f. (-रा-री) A plant, (Clitoria ternatea.)
 E. अश्व and
खुर his hoof: which the perfume and leaves of the plant are sup-
posed to resemble.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=074-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वगन्धा
अश्वगन्धा f. (-न्धा) A plant, (Physalis flexuosa.)
 E. अश्व, and गन्ध smell;
having the smell of a horse.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=074-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वगोयुग|अश्वगोयुगं|अश्वगोयुगः
अश्वगोयुग n. (-गं) A pair of horses.
 E. अश्व and गोयुगच् affix implying a pair,
a brace. &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=074-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वगोष्ठ|अश्वगोष्ठं
अश्वगोष्ठ n. (-ष्ठं) A stable.
 E. अश्व, and गोष्ठ abode, place.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=074-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वग्रीव|अश्वग्रीवः
अश्वग्रीव m. (-वः) The name of a demon, more commonly named Hayagrīva.
 E. अश्व and ग्रीवा a neck; horse-necked.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=074-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वघ्न|अश्वघ्नः
अश्वघ्न m. (-घ्नः) Oleander, (Nerium odorum.)
 E. अश्व and घ्न what kills or
hurts, from हन; horse-destroying.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=074-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वचिकित्सक|अश्वचिकित्सकः
अश्वचिकित्सक m. (-कः) A farrier.
 E. अश्व and चिकित्सक who heals.
