<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्विनीकुमार
अश्विनीकुमार m. du. (-रौ) The twin sons of SŪRYA the sun, by his wife
SANJNA transformed to a mare; they are endowed with perpetual
youth and beauty, and are the physicians of the gods.
 E. अश्विनी the
wife of SŪRYA, and कुमार a youth.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=075-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

