अषडक्षीण|अषडक्षीणः
अषडक्षीण m. (-णः) A secret.
 E. अ neg. षट् six, अक्षि in eye, and ख affix;
what is not seen by six eyes, that is known or determined by two
persons to the exclusion of a third.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=075-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
