अषाढ|अषाढः
अषाढ mfn. (-ढः-ढा-ढं) Produced or occurring in the month Āshāḍha.
	 m.
(-ढः)
	 1. The month Āshāḍha, commencing with the sun's entrance
into Gemini, (June-July.)
	 2. A student's staff.
	 f. (-ढा) A name com-
mon to the twentieth and twenty-first lunar mansion: see पूर्व्वाषाढा
and उत्तराषाढा. E. See आषाढ, the initial being made short.
