<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अष्टक|अष्टकः
अष्टक mfn. (-कः-का-कं)
	 1. Eight.
	 2. Eighth.
	 n. (-कं) The eight sections
of PĀṆINI'S Grammar.
	 m. (-कः)
	 1. The formulæ of the Rig Veda
as collected into eight portions, thence called Ashtakas.
	 2. One
acquainted with PĀṆINI'S rules or the formulæ of the Veda.
 E. कन्
added to अष्ट.
