<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अष्टदिक्पाल
अष्टदिक्पाल m. plu. (-लाः) The regents of the cardinal points, as INDRA of
the East; VAHNI of the S. E.; YAMA of the South; NAIRRIT of
the S. W.; VARUṆA of the West; MARUT of the N. W.; KUVERA
of the North; and ISA of the N. E.
 E. अष्टदिश् the eight points, and
पाल who protects.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=075-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अष्टदिश्
अष्टदिश् f. (-दिक्) The eight cardinal points of the compass collectively.
E. अष्ट eight, दिश् quarter.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=075-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अष्टधा
अष्टधा ind. Eightfold, eight times.
 E. अष्ट eight, धा aff.
