<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अष्टधातु|अष्टधातुः
अष्टधातु n. (-तु) The eight metals collectively, as gold, silver, copper, tin,
lead, brass, iron and steel.
 E. अष्ट and धातु a mineral.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=075-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अष्टन्
अष्टन् mfn. plu. only (अष्ट or अष्टौ) Eight.
 E. असू to pervade, कनिन्
Unādi affix, and तुद् inserted.
