अष्टी
अष्टी f. (-ष्टी) A metre consisting of four lines, and having sixteen sylla-
bles in each; there are nine species of it.
 E. अष्टन् eight, ङीप् fem. aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=075-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
