अष्टमङ्गल m. (-लः) A horse with a white face, tail, mane, breast, and
hoofs.
	 n. (-लं) A Collection of eight lucky things to be assembled
on certain occasions, as at a coronation, &c. as a lion, a bull, an
elephant, a water-jar, a fan, a flag, a trumpet, and a lamp; or a
Brahman, a cow, fire, gold, ghee, the sun, water, and a king. E.
अष्ट eight, and मङ्गल auspicious.
