<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अष्टमांश|अष्टमांशः
अष्टमांश m. (-शः) An eighth.
 E. अष्टम and अंश a part.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=076-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अष्टमान|अष्टमानं
अष्टमान n. (-नं) A measure, one Kuḍava.
 E. अष्ट eight, and मान measure.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=076-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अष्टमिका
अष्टमिका f. (-का) A weight of four tolas.
 E. अष्टम eighth, कन् added, fem.
form.
