अष्टमूर्त्ति m. (-र्त्तिः) A name of ŚIVA.
 E. अष्ट eight, and मूर्त्ति form: evident
in the earth, water, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=076-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अष्टमूर्त्तिधर|अष्टमूर्तिधर
अष्टमूर्त्तिधर m. (-रः) A name of ŚIVA.
 E. अष्टमूर्त्ति an assemblage of eight
forms, and धर who has, being identical with the five elements and
with the mind, individuality and crude matter.
