अष्टविध
अष्टविध mfn. (-धः-धा-धं) Eightfold, of eight kinds.
 E. अष्ट eight, and विध
sort.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=076-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अष्टश्रवस्
अष्टश्रवस् m. (-वाः) A name of BRAHMĀ.
 E. अष्ट and श्रवस् an ear; eight-
eared.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=076-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
