अष्टाङ्गप्रणाम m. (-मः) Profound reverence, prostration with the hands,
feet, thighs, breast, eyes, head, words and mind.
 E. अष्टाङ्ग and
प्रणाम bowing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=076-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

