अष्टादशन्
अष्टादशन् mfn. plu. only (-दश) Eighteen.
 E. अष्ट eight, and दशन् ten.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=076-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अष्टापद|अष्टापदं|अष्टापदः
अष्टापद mn. (-दः-दं)
	 1. A kind of chequered cloth or board for drafts,
