अस्ताद्रि m. (-द्रिः) The western mountain.
 E. अस्त and अद्रि a mountain.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=080-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अस्तावलम्बन|अस्तावलंबन
अस्तावलम्बन n. (-नं) The resting of a heavenly body on the western part
of the horizon.
 E. अस्त and अवलम्बन depending.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=080-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अस्तावलम्बिन्
अस्तावलम्बिन् mfn. (-म्बी-म्बिनी-म्बि) Setting as the sun, on the point of
setting.
 E. अस्त and अवलम्बिन् impending.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=080-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अस्ति|अस्तिः
अस्ति ind. Now being, existent, present.
 E. अस to be, and क्तिन् affix, or
the third person sing. present tense, it is, used as a particle.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=080-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अस्तिनास्ति
अस्तिनास्ति ind.
	 1. Doubtful.
	 2. Partly true and partly not.
 E. अस्ति and
नास्ति it is not.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=080-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अस्तिनास्तित्व
अस्तिनास्तित्व n. (-त्वं)
	 1. Uncertain or doubtful existence.
	 2. Partial
existence.
 E. त्व added to the last; also अस्तिनास्तिता.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=080-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अस्तिमत्|अस्तिमन्त्
अस्तिमत् mfn. (-मान् मती-मत्) Wealthy, opulent.
 E. अस्ति what is, and मतुप्
poss. aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=080-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अस्तु
अस्तु ind. Be it so, let it be, implying assent, also reluctance and pain. E.
अस to be, तुम् affix or the third person sing. imperative used as a
particle.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=080-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अस्तुत
अस्तुत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Not praised.
 E. अ neg. स्तुत praised.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=080-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अस्तेन
अस्तेन n. (-नं) Honesty.
 E. अ neg. स्तेन theft.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=080-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अस्तेय|अस्तेयं
अस्तेय n. (-यं) Honesty.
 E. अ neg. स्तेय theft.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=080-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अस्त्यान|अस्त्यानं
अस्त्यान n. (-नं) Reproach, blame.
 E. अ deteriorative and स्त्यै to sound,
ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=080-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अस्त्र|अस्त्रं
अस्त्र n. (-स्त्रं)
	 1. A weapon in general.
	 2. A sword.
	 3. A bow.
	 4. A missile
weapon.
 E. अस to throw, ष्ट्रन् Unādi aff.
