<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अस्थाग|अस्थागं
अस्थाग mfn. (-गः-गा-गं) Very deep.
 E. अ neg. स्था to stand, with क्विप्
affix, and ग from गम to go; where there is no proceeding to an
end; it is also written अस्ताग, अस्थाघ, अस्थान and अस्थार.
