<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अस्थिर|अस्थिरः
अस्थिर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं)
	 1. Trembling, shaken, unsteady.
	 2. Uncertain,
unascertained.
	 3. Unworthy of confidence.
 E. अ neg. and स्थिर firm.
