अस्मार्त्त mfn. (-र्त्तः-र्त्ती-र्त्तं)
	 1. Immemorial, not within memory.
	 2. Illegal,
not according to law.
	 3. Not belonging to Hindu institutes.
 E. अ
neg. स्मार्त्त relating to law, &c. from स्मृति with अण् aff.
