<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अस्मृति|अस्मृतिः
अस्मृति f. (-तिः)
	 1. Want of memory, forgetfulness.
	 2. Not being part of
the institutes.
 E. अ neg. स्मृति memory or code of law.
