<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अस्वाध्याय|अस्वाध्यायः
अस्वाध्याय m. (-यः)
	 1. A Brahman who has not made his studies, who
has not read the Vedas previous to his investiture.
	 2. Interrup-
tion or interval of study, prohibited on certain days of the
moon, at eclipses, &c.
 E. अ neg. स्व own, and अध्याय a lecture.
