<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अस्वामिक|अस्वामिकं
अस्वामिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Unowned, unclaimed.
 E. अ neg. स्वामिन् a mas-
ter, ठक् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अस्वामिन्
अस्वामिन् mfn. (-मी-मिनी-मि)
	 1. Having no right or title to any thing,
not being master of it.
	 2. That which has no master or owner.
E. अ neg. स्वामिन् a master.
