अह|अहं|अहः
अह ind. A particle and interjection implying; 1. Commendation: 2.
Rejecting, sending: 3. Deviation from custom, (improperly:)
	 4.
Certainty, ascertainment.
 E. अ neg. ह from हन् to hurt, affix ड.
