<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अहंयु|अहंयुः
अहंयु mfn. (-युः-युः-यु) Proud.
	 m. (-युः) A warrior.
 E. अहम् I, and युस्
affix: self-opinioned.
