<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकर|आकरः
आकर m. (-रः)
	 1. A mine.
	 2. A multitude.
	 3. Best, excellent.
 E. आङ्
prefixed, कृ to make, &c. अप् aff.
