<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकर्ष|आकर्षः
आकर्ष m. (-र्षः)
	 1. Pulling, hawling.
	 2. Pulling to or towards, dragging,
attracting.
	 3. Attraction, fascination.
	 4. Magnetic attraction.
	 5. A
magnet, a loadstone.
	 6. A dice or die.
	 7. Playing with dice.
	 8. A
board of such a game.
	 9. Drawing the bow.
	 10. An organ of sense.
11. Spasm.
 E. आङ्, कृष् to draw or make furrows, घञ् aff.
