आकर्षक|आकर्षकः
आकर्षक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Attractive, what draws or attracts.
	 m. (-कः) A
magnet or loadstone.
 E. आकर्ष attraction, and वुन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=084-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकर्षण|आकर्षणं
आकर्षण n. (-णं) Pulling, drawing, attracting.
	 f. (-णी)
	 1. A crooked stick,
for pulling down fruit, &c.
	 2. Any instrument for pulling.
 E. आङ्
before कृष् to pull, ल्युट् aff.
