<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकर्षिक
आकर्षिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Magnetic, attractive.
 E. आकर्ष and ष्ठल् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=084-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकर्षित
आकर्षित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Drawn, attracted.
 E. आङ् before कृष् to draw, क्त
aff.
