<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकल्प|आकल्पः
आकल्प m. (-ल्पः)
	 1. Ornament, decoration.
	 2. Increasing, adding to,
improving.
	 3. Sickness, disease.
 E. आङ् before कृप् to be able, to
be weak, &c. घञ् aff.
