आकल्पक|आकल्पकः
आकल्पक m. (-कः)
	 1. Remembering with regret, missing.
	 2. Fainting,
loss of sense or perception.
	 3. Darkness.
	 4. A knot or joint.
 E. आङ्,
कल्प from कृप् to be able, to be weak, &c. and ण्वुल् aff.
