आकाङ्क्षा f. (-ङ्क्षा)
	 1. Wish, desire.
	 2. Purpose, intention.
	 3. Looking at,
to, or towards.
	 4. Enquiry, asking.
	 5. The presence of a word in
a sentence indispensable to the sense.
	 6. The significancy of a
word.
 E. आङ् prefixed to काङ्क्षि to desire, अच् and टाप् affs.
