<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकाशदीप
अकाशदीप m. (-पः)
	 1. A lamp or torch lighted in honour of LAKṢMĪ or
VIṢṆU, and elevated on a pole in the open air at the Dewali
festival, in the month Kartik.
	 2. A beacon, a lantern on a pole.
E. आकाश and दीप a lamp; also आकाशप्रदीपः.
