	 m. (-न्दः)
	 1. Crying,
crying out.
	 2. Calling.
	 3. Weeping, sobbing.
	 4. Sound.
	 5. Vio-
lence.
	 6. Furious or violent combat.
	 7. A friend.
	 8. A brother.
	 9. A
king, a lord.
	 10. A usurper.
	 11. A king who prevents an ally from
aiding another.
 E. आङ्, क्रन्द to cry, to sound, &c. अच् aff.
