	 1. Going over or beyond.
	 2. Surpassing.
	 3. Spreading
over or upon.
	 4. Overleading.
	 5. Attaining, overcoming, obtaining.
6. Invading, attacking, falling upon.
	 7. Might, valour.
 E. आङ् be-
fore क्रम to go, to mount, ascend, surpass, &c. affix अच्.
