आक्षेप|आक्षेपः
आक्षेप m. (-पः)
	 1. Throw, toss.
	 2. Abuse, reviling.
	 3. Censure, blame, re-
proach.
	 4. Attraction.
	 5. A figure in rhetoric, (irony.)
 E. आङ्, क्षिप्
to throw or send, घञ् aff.
