आक्षेपक|आक्षेपकः
आक्षेपक m. (-कः)
	 1. Sickness, disease.
	 2. Convulsion, spasm.
	 3. A de-
tractor, a calumniator or accuser.
	 4. A thrower.
 E. आङ् before क्षिप्
to toss, ण्वुल् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

