<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आखु|आखुः
आखु m. (-खुः)
	 1. A rat, a mouse.
	 2. A hog.
	 3. A thief.
	 4. A sort of tree:
see देवताड.
 E. आङ्, खन् to dig, and कु Unādi aff.
