आखुरथ|आखुरथः
आखुरथ m. (-थः) A name of GANESA.
 E. आखु, and रथ a carriage; whose
vehicle is a rat.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आखुविषहा
आखुविषहा f. (-हा) A kind of grass, (Andropogon serratum.)
 E. आखु, विष
venom, and हा what destroys; considered as a remedy for the bite
of a rat.
