आखेट|आखेटः
आखेट m. (-टः)
	 1. Chase, hunting.
	 2. Terror, fright.
 E. आङ्, खिट to
alarm, घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आखेटक|आखेटकः
आखेटक mfn. (-कः-का-कं)
	 1. Hunting, a hunter.
	 2. Frightening, fright-
ful.
	 n. (-कं) Hunting.
 E. आखेट and कन् pleonastic affix; or आङ्
with खिट and ण्वुल् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
