आखेटशीर्षक|आखेटशीर्षकं
आखेटशीर्षक n. (-कं) A cavern, a mine.
 E. आखेट terrifying, and शीर्ष the
head or principal, क affix: very gloomy and terrifying.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आखेटिक|आखेटिकः
आखेटिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं)
	 1. Who or what hunts.
	 2. Terrible, frightful.
m. (-कः)
	 1. A hound.
	 2. A hunter.
 E. आखेट chase, and ठक् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आखोट|आखोटः
आखोट m. (-टः) The walnut tree. E. See अक्षोट. &c.
