<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आगामिन्
आगामिन् mfn. (-मी-मिनी-मि)
	 1. Arriving, coming.
	 2. Future.
 E. आङ्
before गम् to go, णिनि aff.
