<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आगुरव
आगुरव mfn. (-वः-वी-वं)
	 1. Consisting of or containing Agallochum.
	 2.
Very heavy.
 E. अगुरु and अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आगू
आगू f. (-गूः) An agreement.
 E. आगम to come, डू affix or आङ् prefixed to
गू to come and क्विन् affix; also आगुर्.
