<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आग्रह|आग्रहः
आग्रह m. (-हः)
	 1. Favour, patronage.
	 2. Seizing, taking.
	 3. Surpassing,
surmounting.
	 4. Power, ability.
 E. आङ्, ग्रह to take, अप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आग्रहायण|आग्रहायणः
आग्रहायण m. (-णः) A month so called, the first of the Hindu year ac-
cording to some systems, (November-December.)
 E. अग्र beginning,
and हायन a year; also अग्रहायण, the अ being unchanged.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आग्रहायणिक|आग्रहायणिकः
आग्रहायणिक m. (-कः) The month Āgrahayana.
 E. अग्रहायण and ठक् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आग्रहायणी
आग्रहायणी f. (-णी)
	 1. The name of a constellation consisting of three
stars, one of which is Orionis, figured by an antelope's head,
hence also मृगशिरस्.
	 2. The day of full moon in the month
Āgrahayana.
 E. अग्रहायण and ङीप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आग्रायण
आग्रायण n. (-णं) A sacrifice offered when the new rice or wheat ripens.
E. अग्र chief, अयन coming, अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आग्रायणेष्टि
आग्रायणेष्टि f. (-ष्टिः) A particular ceremony: see the last.
 E. आग्रायण and
इष्टि a sacrifice.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आघट्टक|आघट्टकः
आघट्टक m. (-कः)
	 1. A tree, (the red sort of Achyranthes.)
	 2. A rubber,
what effects friction.
 E. आङ् before घट्ट to move, and वुन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आघट्टन
आघट्टन n. (-नं)
	 1. Friction, rubbing, contact.
	 2. Shaking.
 E. आङ् before
घट्ट to move, ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आघट्टित
आघट्टित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Touched, rubbed.
	 2. Shaken.
 E. आङ् before
घट्ट to move, affix क्त.
