<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आघर्षण|आघर्षणं
आघर्षण n. (-णं) Rubbing, friction.
	 f. (-णी) A brush, a rubber.
 E. आङ्
before घृष् to rub, affix ल्युट्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आघर्षित
आघर्षित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Rubbed.
 E. आङ् before घृष् to rub, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आघाट|आघाटः
आघाट m. (-टः)
	 1. A limit, a boundary.
	 2. A tree, (Achyranthes aspera.)
E. आङ्, घट to endeavour, घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आघात|आघातः
आघात m. (-तः)
	 1. Killing, striking.
