आघातन|आघातनं
आघातन n. (-नं)
	 1. Striking, killing.
	 2. A slaughter-house.
 E. आङ्, हन to
kill or injure, ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आघार|आघारः
आघार m. (-रः)
	 1. Ghee or boiled butter.
	 2. Sprinkling.
	 3. Sprinkling
ghee at certain sacrifices.
 E. आङ्, घृ to sprinkle, घञ् aff.
