<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आघ्राण|आघ्राणं
आघ्राण m. (-णः)
	 1. Smelling.
	 2. Satisfaction, satiety.
 E. आङ्, घ्रा to
smell, युट् aff.
