<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आघ्रात|आघ्रातः
आघ्रात mfn. (-ताः-ता-तं)
	 1. Smelled, scented.
	 2. Surmounted, surpassed.
	 3.
Satisfied, satiated.
 E. क्त participial affix after आघ्रा to smell, &c.
