<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आङ्ग|आंग|आङ्गं|आङ्गः
आङ्ग mfn. (-ङ्गः-ङ्गी-ङ्गं)
	 1. Bodily, corporeal.
	 2. Having limbs or parts,
or relating to them.
	 3. Relating to the inferior persons of a drama,
to a portion of the Vedas, &c.: see अङ्ग m. (-ङ्गः) A soft delicate
form or body.
 E. अङ्ग a body, अण् aff.
