<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आङ्गक|आंगक|आङ्गकः
आङ्गक m. (-कः)
	 1. The ruler of the country Anga.
	 2. An inhabitant of
the same.
 E. अङ्ग and वुञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आङ्गार|आंगार|आंगारं|आङ्गारं
आङ्गार n. (-रं) A multitude of firebrands.
 E. आङ्गार a torch, अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आङ्गिक|आंगिक|आङ्गिकः
आङ्गिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं)
	 1. Bodily, corporeal.
	 2. Gesticulated, expressed
by bodily action, (dramatic sentiment, passion, &c. exhibited by
attitude, gesture, &c.)
	 m. (-कः) A player on a tabor or drum. E.
अङ्ग the body, ठञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आङ्गिरस|आंगिरस|आङ्गिरसः
आङ्गिरस m. (-सः) A name of VṚHASPATI, preceptor of the gods. E.
