<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचक्षमाण
आचक्षमाण mfn. (-णः-णा-णं) Saying, declaring.
 E. आङ् before चक्ष to speak,
शानच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचक्षुस्
आचक्षुस् m. (-क्षुः) A learned man, a Pandit.
 E. आङ् before चक्ष् to speak,
उसि Unādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचतुर्य्य|आचतुर्य
आचतुर्य्य n. (-र्य्यं) Clumsiness, stupidity.
 E. अचतुर and यञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचम|आचमः
आचम m. (-मः) Rincing the mouth: see the next.
