आचमनक|आचमनकं|आचमनकः
आचमनक m. (-कः) A spitting pot.
 E. आचमन, वुन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचमनीय|आचमनीयं
आचमनीय n. (-यं)
	 1. Water for rinsing the mouth.
	 2. A gargle.
 E. आङ्
before चम् to eat, affix अनीयर्.
