<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचरण|आचरणं
आचरण n. (-णं)
	 1. Following, observing, usage, practice.
	 2. An insti-
tuted rite or rule of conduct.
 E. आङ् before चर् to go, ल्युट् aff.
