<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचरित|आचरितं
आचरित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Observed, practised, either as a rite or usage.
2. Usual, customary.
	 3. Enjoined, fixed by rule.
 E. आङ् before चर
to go, affix क्त.
