<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचर्य्य|आचर्य
आचर्य्य mfn. (-र्य्यः-र्य्या-र्य्यं) To be gone to or approached.
 E. आङ् before चर्
to go, यत् aff.
