<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचान्त|आचांत|आचान्तः
आचान्त mfn. (-न्तः-न्ता-न्तं)
	 1. Sipped and ejected, (as water.)
	 2. One who has
rinsed his mouth, &c.
 E. आङ् before चम् to eat, affix क्त.
