<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचाम|आचामः
आचाम m. (-मः) Sipping water, rincing the mouth.
 E. आङ् before चम्
to eat, affix. घञ्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचाम्य
आचाम्य n. (-म्यं)
	 1. Rincing the mouth, &c.
	 2. Water so used.
	 3. A gar-
gle.
 E. आङ् before चम् to eat, ण्यत् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचार|आचारः
आचार m. (-रः)
	 1. An established rule of conduct, an ordinance, an in-
stitute, a precept.
	 2. Custom, practice, usage.
 E. आङ् before चर्
to go, घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचारवर्ज्जित|आचारवर्जित|आचारवर्ज्जितः
आचारवर्ज्जित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Irregular, out or rule.
	 2. Outcaste. E.
आचार an institute, and वर्ज्जित abandoned.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचारहीन
आचारहीन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Outcaste, void of decent or established
practices, unauthorised.
 E. आचार and हीन deprived of.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचारिक
आचारिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं)
	 1. Conformable to rule or practice.
	 2. Pre-
scriptive.
 E. आचार and ठक् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचारिन्
आचारिन् mfn. (-री-रिणी-रि) Following established rites or practice. E.
आचार and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचार्य्य|आचार्य|आचार्यः|आचार्य्यः
आचार्य्य m. (-र्य्यः)
	 1. A spiritual guide or teacher; he who invests the
student with the sacrificial thread, and instructs him in the Vedas,
the law of sacrifice, and religious mysteries.
	 2. A name of DRONA,
the teacher of the Pandus.
	 f. (-र्य्या) A spiritual preceptress.
	 f.
(-र्य्याणी) The wife of an Ācharya or holy teacher.
 E. आङ् before चर्
to go, ण्यत् affix, in the fem. टाप् or ङीप् with आनुक् inserted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचार्य्यत्व|आचार्यत्व|आचार्यत्वं
आचार्य्यत्व n. (-त्वं) The office or proficiency of a holy teacher.
 E. आचार्य्य
and त्व affix; also with तल्, आचार्य्यता.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचार्य्यमिश्र|आचार्यमिश्र
आचार्य्यमिश्र mfn. (-श्रः-श्रा-श्रं) Venerable, honourable.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=088-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचार्य्योपासन|आचार्योपासन
आचार्य्योपासन n. (-नं) Waiting upon or serving the spiritual preceptor. E.
आचार्य्य and उपासना worship.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=088-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचित|आचितं|आचितः
आचित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Heaped, accumulated.
	 2. Covered.
	 3. Spread,
diffused.
	 mn. (-तः-तं)
	 1. A measure of ten Bhāras.
	 2. A cart-load.
E. आङ् and the past participle of चिञ् to collect.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=088-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचितिक
आचितिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Holding an Āchita.
 E. आचित and ठक् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=088-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचितीन
आचितीन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Holding or equal to an Āchita.
 E. आचित and ख
aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=088-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचूषण|आचूषणं
आचूषण n. (-णं)
	 1. Suction.
	 2. Application of cupping glasses or horns
to the skin, &c.
 E. आङ् before चूष to suck, ल्युट्. aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=088-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आच्छ|आछ
आच्छ r. 1st. cl. (-इ) आच्छि (आच्छति) To lengthen or stretch.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=088-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आच्छन्न|आच्छन्नं
आच्छन्न mfn. (-न्नः-न्ना-न्नं)
	 1. Covered.
	 2. Clothed.
 E. आङ् before छद to cover,
affix क्त.
