आच्छाक|आच्छाकः
आच्छाक m. (-कः) A tree, (Morinda tinctoria.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=088-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आच्छाद|आच्छादः|आछाद
