<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आच्छुरित|आच्छुरितं|आछुरित
आच्छुरित n. (-तं)
	 1. A horselaugh.
	 2. Making a noise with the finger
nails by rubbing them on one another.
 E. आङ् before छुर to cut, क्त
affix; also आच्छुरितक.
