<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजगव|आजगवं
आजगव n. (-वं) The bow of ŚIVA. E. See अजकाव.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=088-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजानेय|आजानेयः
आजानेय m. (-यः) A horse of a good breed.
 E. अज to go, घञ् affix, आज
going: आनेय to be taken: who carries the rider through all opposi-
tion, &c.
