<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजि|आजिः
आजि f. (-जिः)
	 1. War, battle.
	 2. Level ground.
	 3. An instant.
	 4. Abuse,
reviling.
	 5. Going.
 E. अज to go, इन् Unādi affix, and आङ् prefixed
or अज with इण् aff.
