<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आटोप|आटोपः
आटोप m. (-पः)
	 1. Pride.
	 2. Flatulence, borborygmi.
 E. आङ् before टुप
a Sautra root, to be proud, and घञ् aff.
