आढकिक|आढकिकः
आढकिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं)
	 1. Sown with an Āḍhaka of seed, (a field,
&c.)
	 2. Holding or containing the same.
 E. आढक the measure, and
ठञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=089-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

