आतङ्क m. (-ङ्कः)
	 1. Fear, apprehension.
	 2. Disease, sickness.
	 3. Afflic-
tion, pain.
	 4. Fever.
	 5. The sound of a drum or tabor.
 E. आङ्,
तकि to live in distress, घञ् aff.
