आतञ्चन|आतंचनं|आतञ्चनं
आतञ्चन n. (-नं)
	 1. Calcining, adding a powder or flux to metals in fusion.
2. The flux so used.
	 3. Casting any thing into another to effect
some change, as butter milk into fresh milk to turn it.
	 4. Casting
away, destroying.
	 5. Danger, calamity, as a pestilence or epidemic.
6. Speed, velocity.
	 7. Gratifying, satisfying.
 E. आङ्, तञ्चु to go,
and ल्युट् aff.
