<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आतन|आतनं
आतन n. (-नं)
	 1. Sight, view.
	 2. Spreading, expanding.
 E. आङ् be-
fore तन to spread, अच् aff.
