आत्महन्
आत्महन् m. (-हा)
	 1. A suicide, a self-murderer.
	 2. A heretic, an unbeliever.
3. A priest in a temple, a servant or attendant upon an idol. E.
आत्मन् and हन् who kills or destroys, self-destroying; the priest
subsisting by appropriating to himself offerings to deities, for
which future punishment is assigned.
