<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आद्यवीज|आद्यवीजं
आद्यवीज n. (-जं) A primary cause.
 E. आद्य and वीज seed, cause.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=091-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आद्यून|आद्यूनः
आद्यून mfn. (-नः-ना-नं)
	 1. Shamelessly voracious.
	 2. Without the begin-
ning.
 E. आङ्, दिव to play or enjoy in the part. past, or आदि first,
and ऊन minus.
