<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आधर्म्मिक|आधर्मिक
आधर्म्मिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Unjust, unrighteous.
 E. अ neg. धर्म्म virtue, &c. ठक् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=091-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आधर्षण|आधर्षणं
आधर्षण n. (-णं)
	 1. Conviction, (of crime or of error.)
	 2. Sentence,
refutation.
	 3. Injuring, annoying.
 E. आङ् before धृष to be bold,
ल्युट् aff.
