<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आधान|आधानं
आधान n. (-नं)
	 1. Taking, having.
	 2. Receiving, recovering.
	 3. A cere-
mony performed with consecrated fire.
	 4. A pledge, a deposit.
	 5. A
surety.
	 6. A ceremony performed pervious to conception: see
गर्भाधान.
 E. आङ् before धा to have, affix ल्युट्.
