आधानिक|आधानिकं|आधानिकः
आधानिक n. (-कं) A ceremony performed after cohabitation to procure
or favour conception.
 E. आधान and ठक् affix: see the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=091-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आधाय|आधायः
आधाय ind. Having deposited or placed.
 E. आङ् before धा to have, ल्यप्
aff.
