<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आधार|आधारः
आधार m. (-रः)
	 1. Support, prop, stay.
	 2. Receptacle.
	 3. Comprehension,
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=092-a" target="_blank">Page092-a+ 60</a>]
location, the sense of the locative in or on.
	 4. A dike, a
canal.
	 5. A basin round the foot of a tree.
 E. आङ् and धृ to hold
or contain, घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=091-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आधाराधेयभाव|आधाराधेयभावः
आधाराधेयभाव m. (-वः) The influence or action of the support or recipi-
ent upon the thing received or supported.
 E. आधार support,
&c. आधेय what is to be held, and भाव quality.
