<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आधिक्य|आधिक्यं
आधिक्य n. (-क्यं) Excess.
 E. अधिक more, ष्यञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=092-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आधिज
आधिज mfn. (-जः-जा-जं) Produced by pain, &c.
 E. आधि pain, and ज
produced.
