आधिज्ञ mfn. (-ज्ञः-ज्ञा-ज्ञं)
	 1. Crooked.
	 2. Pained, distressed.
 E. आधि
pain, &c. and ज्ञ who knows.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=092-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आधिकारण्य|आधिकारण्यं
आधिकारण्य n. (-ण्यं)
	 1. Possession.
	 2. Location.
 E. अधिकरण, and ष्यञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=092-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आधिकारिक
आधिकारिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं)
	 1. Supreme, superior, relating or belong-
ing to any thing or person of importance or sway.
	 2. Official, re-
lating to any office or duty.
 E. अधिकार and ठञ् aff.
