	 2. BHIMA. E.
अनिल the wind, patronymic affix इञ्; HANUMAN and BHIMA being
the sons of ANILA or the wind.
	 f. (-लिः) A name of SWATI, the
fifteenth Nakshatra or lunar mansion.
 E. अनिल and अण् affix, fem.
ङीप्; ANILA being the ruling deity of the asterism.
