<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आप्लाव|आप्लावः
आप्लाव m. (-वः)
	 1. Bathing.
	 2. Sprinkling, wetting.
	 3. A submerging.
4. A flood, an inundation.
 E. आङ् before प्लुङ् to swim, घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=094-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आप्लावित
आप्लावित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Inundated, overflowed.
 E. आङ् before प्लुङ् to
bathe, causal form, affix क्त.
