आप्लुत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Bathed.
	 2. Wetted, sprinkled.
	 m. (-तः) An ini-
tiated householder: see आप्लवव्रतिन्.
	 n. (-तं) Bathing.
 E. आङ् before
प्लुङ् to bathe, affix of the participle past.
