	 m. (-न्धः)
	 1. The tie of a
yoke, that which fastens the ox to the yoke, or the latter to the
plough.
	 2. Affection.
	 3. Ornament, decoration.
	 4. A tie or bound.
E. आङ्, बन्ध a binding.
