<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आलान|आलानं
आलान n. (-नं)
	 1. The post to which an elephant is lied.
	 2. The rope that
ties him.
	 3. A fetter, a tie.
	 4. Tying, binding.
	 5. A rope or string.
E. आङ् before ला to take, आला to tie or fasten, affix ल्युट.
