आलि|आलिः
आलि mfn. sub. (-लिः-लिः or ली-लि)
	 1. Pure, honest, sincere.
	 2. Useless,
idle, unmeaning.
	 f. (-लिः-ली)
	 1. A woman's female friend.
	 2. A row
or range, a continuous line.
	 3. A ridge or mound of earth, crossing
ditches, dividing fields, &c.
	 2. A line, a race or family.
	 m. (-लिः)
1. A scorpion.
	 2. A bee; see अलि.
 E. अल to adorn, to be able, &c.
affix इण् and the pen. made long; also आली, affix ङीप.
