	 4. Melting metals together, alligation.
	 5. The time
when shadows are cast in an opposite direction.
	 6. Repeating, doing
over again.
	 7. Study, practicing.
	 f. (-नी) A crucible.
 E. आवर्त्त, ल्युट्
affix; and ङीप् for the fem.
