<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आविष्ट|आविष्टः
आविष्ट mfn. (-ष्टः-ष्टा-ष्टं)
	 1. Entered.
	 2. Possessed, (by a demon, &c.)
	 3.
Possessed, engrossed, (by any sentiment or feeling.)
 E. आविश to
enter, affix क्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=101-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आविस्
आविस् ind. Manifest, evident.
 E. आङ् before उङ् to sound, इर् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=101-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवी
आवी f. (-वी) Pain of child-birth.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=101-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवीत
आवीत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Passed, gone.
	 2. Placed, hung.
	 m. (-तः) The
sacrificial cord worn in any particular manner.
 E. आङ् before वीत
gone.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=101-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवीतिन्
आवीतिन् m. (-ती) A Brahman who wears the cord in any particular
manner.
 E. इनि added to the last: see प्राचीनावीतिन्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=101-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवूक
आवूक m. (-कः) A father, (in theatrical language.)
 E. अव to preserve,
ऊकन् affix, and the initial lengthened.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=101-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवृत्
आवृत् f. (-वृत्) Order, method.
 E. आङ् before वृत् to choose, affix क्विप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=101-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवृत|आवृतः
आवृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Enclosed, surrounded, (by a ditch, wall, &c.)
2. Covered, screened.
	 3. Invested, inclosed, involved.
	 4. Spread,
overspread, overcast.
	 5. Filled with, abounding with.
	 m. (-तः) A
man of mixed origin, the son of a Brahman, by a woman of the
Ugra caste.
 E. आङ् before वृञ् to screen, affix क्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=101-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवृत्त|आवृत्तः
आवृत्त mfn. (-त्तः-त्ता-त्तं)
	 1. Whirled, stirred, turned round.
	 2. Reverted,
averted.
	 3. Retreated, fled.
 E. आङ् before वृत् to be, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=101-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवृत्ति|आवृत्तिः
आवृत्ति f. (-त्तिः)
	 1. Reversion, turning back or from.
	 2. Flight, retreat.
3. Revolving, going round.
	 4. Worldly existence, the revolution of
births.
	 5. Use, employment, application.
 E. आङ् before वृत् to be,
क्तिन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=101-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवेग|आवेगः
आवेग m. (-गः)
	 1. Hurry, haste.
	 2. Flurry, agitation.
	 f. (-गी) A potherb,
(Convulvulus argenteus.)
 E. आङ् before विज् to be alarmed, घञ्
and ङीप् affs.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=101-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवेदक|आवेदकः
आवेदक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) One who makes known.
	 m. (-कः)
	 1. An ap-
pellant, a suitor.
	 2. An informer.
 E. आङ् before विद् to know,
causal form, वुन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=101-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवेदन|आवेदनं
आवेदन n. (-नं) Representing, addressing or apprising respectfully.
 E. आङ् and वेदन informing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=101-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवेदित|आवेदितः
आवेदित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Made known, communicated, represented. E.
आङ् before विद् to know, causal form, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=101-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवेद्य
आवेद्य mfn. (-द्यः-द्या-द्यं) To be represented or made known. ind. Having
made known.
 E. आङ् before विद् to know, causal form, यत् or ल्यप्
affix.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=101-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवेद्यमान
आवेद्यमान mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Stating, representing.
 E. आङ् before विद् to
know, causal form, शानच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=101-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवेश|आवेशः
आवेश m. (-शः)
	 1. Entrance, entering.
	 2. Pride, arrogance.
	 3. Indis-
tinctness of idea, apoplectic or epileptic giddiness.
	 4. Absorp-
tion of the faculties in one wish or idea, devotedness to an ob-
ject.
	 5. Demoniac frenzy, possession, &c.
 E. आङ् before विश् to
enter, घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=101-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवेशन|आवेशनं
आवेशन n. (-नं)
	 1. Entrance, entering.
	 2. A house in which work is
carried on, a workshop, a manufactory, &c.
	 3. Possession by devils,
&c.
	 4. Passion, fury.
	 5. The disk of the sun.
 E. आङ् before विश् to
enter, ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=101-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवेशिक|आवेशिकः
आवेशिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं)
	 1. A guest, a visitor.
	 2. Entering into.
	 3.
Own, peculiar, unparticipated.
	 4. Inherent.
 E. आङ् before विश् to
enter, ठक् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=101-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवेष्टक|आवेष्टकः
आवेष्टक m. (-कः) A wall, a fence, an enclosure.
 E. आङ् before वेष्ट to sur-
round, वुन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=101-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवेष्टन|आवेष्टनं
आवेष्टन n. (-नं)
	 1. Wrapping round, binding, tying.
	 2. A wrapper, an
envelope, a bandage.
	 3. An inclosure.
 E. आङ् before वेष्ट to surround,
ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=101-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवेष्टित
आवेष्टित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Surrounded, enveloped, inclosed, bound or tied.
E. आङ् before वेष्ट to inclose, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=101-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशंसन|आशंसनं
आशंसन n. (-नं)
	 1. Expecting, wishing.
	 2. Declaring, asserting.
 E. आङ्
before शसि to wish, &c. ल्युट् aff.
