<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशंसित
आशंसित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Wished, expected.
	 2. Declared, said.
 E. आङ् be-
fore शसि to desire, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=101-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशंसितृ
आशंसितृ mfn. (-ता-त्री-तृ)
	 1. Wishing, desiring.
	 2. Asserting.
 E. आङ्
before शसि to wish, तृच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=101-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशंसु|आशंसुः
आशंसु mfn. (-सुः-सुः-सु) Wishing, desiring.
 E. आङ् before शसि to wish,
and उ aff.
