	 1. Afraid.
	 2. Doubting, uncertain.
 E. आशङ्का
and अन्वित having.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=101-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशङ्कित|आशंकित
आशङ्कित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Feared, dreaded.
	 2. Doubted.
 E. आङ् before
शकि to doubt, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=101-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशन|आशनः
आशन m. (-नः) A tree, (Pentaptera tomentosa.) See असन and आसन.
