<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशय|आशयः
आशय m. (-यः)
	 1. Meaning, intention.
	 2. Free will or pleasure.
	 3. An
asylum, an abode or retreat.
	 4. receptacle, a recipient.
	 5. Any re-
cipient or containing vessel or viscus of the body, as रक्ताशय the
heart, आमाशय the stomach, &c.
	 6. The stomach in particular.
7. The mind.
	 8. Property, possessions.
	 9. A miser, a niggard.
	 10.
Virtue and vice.
	 11. Fate, fortune.
	 12. The Jack, a kind of bread-
fruit tree.
 E. आङ् before शीङ् to rest, अच् aff.
