<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशयितृ
आशयितृ mfn. (-ता-त्री-तृ)
	 1. Feeding, a feeder, one who gives food.
	 2. Pro-
tecting, a protector.
	 3. Recipient, a receiver.
 E. अश् to eat, causal
form, affix शतृ or आङ् before शीङ् to rest, with the same aff.
