<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशितम्भव|आशितंभव|आशितम्भवं
आशितम्भव n. (-वं) Food, victuals.
	 m. (-वः) Satisfaction, satiety.
 E. आशित
and भव produced by, from भ and खश् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशितृ
आशितृ mfn. (-ता-त्री-तृ) Voracious, gluttonous, eating excessively.
 E. अश्
to eat, and तृच् affix, इ inserted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशिर|आशिरः
आशिर m. (-रः)
	 1. Fire.
	 2. A goblin or imp.
 E. आङ् before अश् to eat,
किरच् Unādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशिस्
आशिस् f. (-शीः)
	 1. Blessing, benediction, bestowing or wishing, a bles-
sing upon others.
	 2. A serpent's fang.
 E. आङ् before शास् to rule,
क्विप् affix, and आ is changed to इ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशी
आशी f. (-शीः)
	 1. Wishing or bestowing a blessing.
	 2. A serpent's fang.
3. A kind of venom, the venom of a snake.
 E. आङ् before अश् to
eat, अच् and ङीप् affixes: see the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशीर्वचन
आशीर्वचन n. (-नं) A blessing, a benediction.
 E. आशिस् and वचन speech.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशीर्वाद|आशीर्वादः|आशीर्व्वादः
आशीर्वाद m. (-दः) A blessing, a benediction.
 E. आशिस् and वाद speech.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशीविष|आशीविषः
आशीविष m. (-षः) A snake.
 E. आशी a fang, and विष poison; in whose
fang is venom.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशु|आशुः
आशु mfn. (-शुः-शुः-शु) Going quickly, fleet, fast.
	 mn. (-शुः-शु) Rice ripen-
ing in the rainy season.
	 n. adv. (-शु) Quick, quickly.
 E. अशू to per-
vade, उण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशुकारिन्
आशुकारिन् mfn. (-री-रिणी-रि)
	 1. Doing anything quickly, smart, active.
2. (In medicine) Operating speedily.
 E. आशु quick and कारिन् what
acts.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशुग|आशुगः
आशुग mfn. (-गः-गा-गं) Going or moving quickly, swift, fleet.
	 m. (-गः)
	 1.
The wind.
	 2. An arrow.
 E. आशु quick, and ग who goes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशुपत्री
आशुपत्री f. (-त्री) A tree which yields frankincense, (Boswellia serrata.)
See शल्लकी.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशुव्रीहि|आशुव्रीहिः
आशुव्रीहि m. (-हिः) Rice ripening in the rainy season.
 E. आशु quick, and
व्रीहि rice; that is, of rapid growth; also आशु. So आशुधान्य n. (-न्यं) and
other compounds.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशुशुक्षणि|आशुशुक्षणिः
आशुशुक्षणि m. (-णिः)
	 1. Fire.
	 2. Wind, air.
 E. आशु before शुष् to dry in
the reiterative form, and अनि Unādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशेकुटिन्
आशेकुटिन् m. (-टी) A mountain.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशौच|आशौचं
आशौच n. (-चं) Impurity.
 E. अशुचि impure, अञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्चर्य्य|आश्चर्य|आश्चर्य्यं
आश्चर्य्य mfn. (-र्य्यः-र्य्या-र्य्यं) Astonishing, wonderful.
	 m. (-र्य्यः) Surprise, as-
tonishment.
 E. आङ् before चर् to go, deriv. irregular.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्चर्य्यत्व|आश्चर्यत्व|आश्चर्यत्वं
आश्चर्य्यत्व n. (-त्वं)
	 1. Wonderfulness.
	 2. Wonder, astonishment.
 E. आश्चर्य्य
and त्व affix; or with ता, आश्चर्य्यता.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्चोतन
आश्चोतन n. (-नं)
	 1. Aspersion, sprinkling.
	 2. Applying ghee, &c. to the
eyelids.
 E. आङ् before श्चुत् to sprinkle, affix ल्युट्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्म|आश्मः
आश्म mfn. (-श्मः-श्मा-श्मं) Stony, made of stone, &c.
 E. अश्मन् stone, and
अण् affix: with the final rejected.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्मन|आश्मनः
आश्मन mfn. (-नः-नी-नं) Made of stone, stony, stone.
 E. अश्मन् and अञ् aff.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-b" target="_blank">Page102-b+ 60</a>]
m. (-नः) A name of ARUṆA, the charioteer of the sun.
 E. अश्मन्
stone, अण् affix: immoveable as a stone, having no legs.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्मिक
आश्मिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Made of stone, consisting of stone, &c.
 E. अश्मन्
and ठक् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्यान
आश्यान mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Dried partially, consolidated, coagulated.
 E. आङ्
dimin. श्यान dry.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रम|आश्रमं|आश्रमः
आश्रम m. (-मः)
	 1. A religious order, of which there are four kinds re-
ferable to the different periods of life; 1st, that of the student or
Brahmachari; 2d, that of the householder or Grihastha; 3d, that
of the anchorite or Vanaprastha; and 4th, that of the beggar or
Bhikshu; see ब्रह्मचारी, &c.
	 2. A college, a school.
	 3. A hermitage,
the abode of retired saints or sages.
	 4. A wood or thicket.
 E. आङ्
before श्रम to perform religious austerities, affix घञ्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रमगुरु|आश्रमगुरुः
आश्रमगुरु m. (-रुः) The head of a religious order, a preceptor, a principal.
E. आश्रम a convent, and गुरु senior.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रमधर्म्म|आश्रमधर्म|आश्रमधर्मः
आश्रमधर्म्म m. (-र्म्मः) The special duty or duties of each order of life. E.
आश्रम and धर्म्म duty.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रमिक|आश्रमिकः
आश्रमिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Belonging to one of the four orders, see आश्रम.
E. आश्रम as above, and ठक् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रमिन्
आश्रमिन् mfn. (-मी-मिणी-मि)
	 1. Belonging to one of the four orders.
	 2.
Belonging to a hermitage, a hermit, an anchorite, &c.
 E. आश्रम and
इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रय|आश्रयः
आश्रय m. (-यः)
	 1. Being inclined or addicted to following, practising.
	 2.
A recipient, the person or thing in which any quality or article
is inherent, retained or received.
	 3. An asylum, a place of refuge.
4. A patron, a protector.
	 5. Having recourse to a protector or
asylum.
	 6. A dwelling.
	 7. Contiguity, vicinity.
	 8. Source, origin.
9. A plea, an excuse.
	 10. Appropriate act, one consistent with the
character of the agent.
 E. आङ् before श्रि to serve, अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रयण
आश्रयण n. (-णं) Refuge, asylum, means of protection or security.
 E. आङ्
before श्रि to serve, ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रयणीय
आश्रयणीय mfn. (-यः-या-यं)
	 1. To be had recourse to.
	 2. To be practised or
followed.
 E. आङ् before श्रि to serve, affix अनीयर्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रयभूत
आश्रयभूत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Protecting, supporting, one who is the refuge
of any other.
 E. आश्रय and भूत become.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रयाश|आश्रयाशः
आश्रयाश mfn. (-शः-शा-शं) A forfeiter of an asylum, one who by misconduct
&c loses patronage or protection.
	 m. (-शः) A name of fire.
 E. आश्रय
a house, &c. अश् to eat or consume, and अण् affix: similar com-
pounds occur frequently, as आश्रयध्वंसिन्, आश्रयभज्, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रव|आश्रवं|आश्रवः
आश्रव mfn. (-वः-वा-वं) Compliant, obedient.
	 m. (-वः)
	 1. A promise, an
engagement.
	 2. Distress, fatigue.
	 3. Fault, transgression.
 E. आङ्
before श्रु to hear, अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रि|आश्रिः
आश्रि f. (-श्रिः) The edge of a sword: see अश्रि.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रित|आश्रितः
आश्रित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Inhabiting, dwelling in, resorting to as a re-
treat or asylum.
	 2. Following, practising, observing.
	 3. Using,
employing, having recourse to.
	 4. Receiving anything, as an in-
herent or integral part.
	 5. Taking one's station at or on, as at win-
dow or a seat, &c.
	 6. A dependent.
 E. आङ् before श्रि to serve, क्त
affix.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रित्य
आश्रित्य ind.
	 1. Having sought or obtained an asylum.
	 2. Having re-
course to, employing, practising.
 E. आङ् before श्रि to serve, ल्यप्
affix, तुक् augment.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रुत|आश्रुतः
आश्रुत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Promised, agreed.
	 2. Heard.
 E. आङ् before श्रु to hear, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्लिष्ट
आश्लिष्ट mfn. (-ष्टः-ष्टा-ष्टं)
	 1. Embraced.
	 2. Embracing, who or what em-
braces.
	 3. Connected, interwoven, blended.
	 4. Attaching to, joining,
who or what adheres to.
	 5. Invested, spread.
	 6. Connected as a
consequence, deduced, concluded.
 E. आङ् before श्लिष् to fold. क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्लेष|आश्लेषः
आश्लेष m. (-षः)
	 1. Embracing, an embrace.
	 2. Site of any act.
	 3. Intimate
connexion.
 E. आङ् before श्लिष् to fold, घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्व|आश्वं
आश्व mfn. (-श्वः-श्वी-श्वं) Relating to a horse, drawn by horses, equestrian,
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=103-a" target="_blank">Page103-a+ 60</a>]
&c.
	 n. (-श्वं)
	 1. A number of horses.
	 2. A chariot drawn by horses. E.
अश्व a horse, and अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=102-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्वत्थ|आश्वत्थं
आश्वत्थ m. (-त्थः) The fruit of the holy fig tree.
 E. अश्वत्थ and अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=103-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्वत्थिक
आश्वत्थिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Relating to or produced by the Aswattha
tree.
	 2. Flowering of the Aswattha (the time when.)
 E. अश्वत्थ and
ठक् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=103-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्वयुज|आश्वयुजः
आश्वयुज mfn. (-जः-जी-जं) Belonging to or occurring in the same month
of Aswin.
	 m. (-जः) The month Aswin, (September-October.)
	 f. (-जी)
The day of full moon in Aswin.
 E. अश्वयुज the first lunar mansion,
affix अण् and fem. ङीप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=103-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्वरथ
आश्वरथ mfn. (-थः-थी-थं) Belonging to a chariot.
 E. अश्वरथ and अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=103-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्वलक्षणिक|आश्वलक्षणिकः
आश्वलक्षणिक m. (-कः) A farrier, a groom.
 E. अश्व, लक्षण a mark, ठक् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=103-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्वलायन|आश्वलायनः
आश्वलायन m. (-नः) The name of a sage and legislator, &c.
 E. अश्वलायन
and अण् patronymic aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=103-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
