आश्विनेय|आश्विनेयः
आश्विनेय m. du. (-यौ) The two twin sons of AŚVINĪ by SŪRYA, and
physicians of Svarga; one of them is named NĀSATYA, the other
DASRA. or the patronymic may be used in the singular to designate
either one of them.
 E. अश्विनी and ठक् aff.
