आस|आसः
आस r. 2d cl. (आस्ते or आस्स्ते)
	 1. To sit.
	 2. To be present.
	 3. To be or
exist. With अधि prefixed.
	 1. To inhabit, to dwell in.
	 2. To sit over
or upon.
	 3. To mistake or err by taking one thing for another from
similarity of appearance. With अभि, to sit or apply to, to study, to
learn. With उत्, 1. To leave, to abandon.
	 2. To shake, agitate, &c.
(as wind.) With उप, to worship, to do homage. With निर्, to
expel. With प्र and निर्, to reject, to refute, to invalidate.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=103-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आस्
आस् ind. (-आः) An interjection, ah! oh! &c. implying.
	 1. Recollection.
2. Anger.
	 3. Menace.
	 4. Pain.
	 5. Affliction.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=103-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आस|आसः
आस m. (-सः) A bow.
 E. अस् to send or throw, affix घञ्.
