	 1. Zealously following or pursuing, intent or
attached strongly to.
	 2. Trusting to, confiding in.
	 3. Eternal. adv.
n. (-क्तं) Eternally.
 E. आङ् before षञ्ज् to embrace, to move, parti-
cipial affix क्त.
