	 2. Association, connexion.
3. Proximity, contact. adv.
	 n. (-ङ्गं) Eternally. adj.
	 mfn. (-ङ्गः-ङ्गा-ङ्गं)
Eternal.
 E. आङ् always, षञ्ज् to move, अच् aff.
