आसन|आसनं|आसनः
आसन n. (-नं)
	 1. A stool, a seat.
	 2. Maintaining a post against an
enemy.
	 3. The withers of an elephant, the part where the driver
sits.
	 4. Halting, stopping.
	 5. Sitting in some peculiar posture,
as is the custom of devotees, &c. eighty-four kinds are enumerated:
see पद्मासन, &c.
	 m. (-नः) A tree, (Pentapheca tomentosa.) Also
असन.
	 f. (-ना-नी) Stay, abiding, sitting. (-नी)
	 1. A shop, a stall.
2. A small seat, a stool.
 E. आस् to abide, and युच or ल्युट् aff.
