आस्था
आस्था f. (-स्था)
	 1. Prop, stay, place or means of abiding.
	 2. An assembly.
3. Effort, pains, care.
	 4. Consideration, regard.
 E. आङ् before स्था
to stay, to stand, अङ् and टाप् affs.
