आस्फोटन|आस्फोटनं
आस्फोटन n. (-नं)
	 1. Blowing, expanding.
	 2. Contracting, closing.
	 3.
Slapping the arms, or the noise made by it.
	 f. (-नी) A gimlet or
auger.
 E. आङ् before स्फुट् to blow or expand, and ल्युट् aff.
