आस्फोत|आस्फोतः
आस्फोत m. (-तः)
	 1. Swallow wort, (Asclepias gigantea.)
	 2. Mountain
ebony, (Bauhinia variegata, &c.)
	 3. A kind of echites or savanna
flower, (E. dichotoma, Rox.)
	 f. (-ता)
	 1. A wild variety of jasmine.
	 2.
Clitoria ternatea.
 E. आङ् before स्फुट् to blow or expand, अच् affix
and ट changed to त; or स्फै to increase, with क्त affix, and आ con-
verted to ओ; also sometimes आस्फोट and आस्फोटा.
