<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आस्यपत्र|आस्यपत्रं
आस्यपत्र n. (-त्रं) A lotus.
 E. आस्य a face, पत्र a leaf; this flower is com-
monly compared to a beautiful face.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=104-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

