इच्छु|इच्छुः
इच्छु mfn. (-च्छुः-च्छुः-च्छु) Wishing, desiring.
 E. इष् to wish, and उस् affix,
deriv. irr.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=106-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इच्छुक|इच्छुकः
इच्छुक mfn. (-कः-का-की-कं) Wishing, desirous.
 E. कन् added to the last,
or इच्छु and उकन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=106-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इज्जल|इज्जलः
इज्जल m. (-लः) A small tree growing in wet and saline soil, or on low
grounds near the sea, (Barringtonia acutangula.) See हिज्जल.
 E. इण्
to go, क्विप् affix, and जल water.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=106-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इज्य|इज्यः
इज्य mfn. (-ज्यः-ज्या-ज्यं) A teacher.
	 m. (-ज्यः) VṚHASPATI, the teacher
or Guru of the gods.
	 f. (-ज्या)
	 1. A gift, a donation.
	 2. Sacrificing,
making offerings to the gods or manes.
	 3. Worship, reverence.
	 4.
Meeting, union.
	 5. A cow.
	 6. A bawd or procuress. R. यज् to sacri-
fice, &c. क्यप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=107-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इज्याशील|इज्याशीलः
इज्याशील m. (-लः) A frequent sacrificer.
 E. इज्या sacrifice, and शील to be
frequent, अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=107-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इञ्चाक|इंचाकः|इञ्चाकः
इञ्चाक m. (-कः) A shrimp or prawn.
 E. इ love, चक् to satisfy, and घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=107-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इट|इटः
इट r. 1st cl. (एटति) To go, to go to or towards.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=107-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इट्चर|इट्चरः
इट्चर m. (-रः) A bull or steer allowed to go at liberty.
 E. इष to wish, क्विप्
affix, and चर् who goes, going at will; also इड्वर.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=107-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इडा
इडा f. (-डा)
	 1. The wife of BUDDHA, daughter of IKSHAKU.
	 2. The earth.
3. A cow.
	 4. Speed.
	 5. A tubular vessel, one of the principal
channels of the vital spirit, that which is on the right side of the
body.
	 6. Heaven.
	 7. The goddess of speech.
 E. इल् to direct or send,
क affix, and टाप् fem. ल and ड are interchangeable: see इला.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=107-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इडाचिका
इडाचिका f. (-का) A wasp.
 E. इडा the earth, चर् to go, and ड्वन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=107-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इडिका
इडिका f. (-का) The earth.
 E. इल् to direct, and वुन् affix; ल becomes ड.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=107-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इडिक्क|इडिक्कः
इडिक्क m. (-कः) A wild goat.
 E. इडिक् an imitative sound, and क who
utters, from कै, aff. ड.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=107-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इड्वर|इड्वरः
इड्वर m. (-रः) A bull fit to be let at liberty.
 E. इष् to wish, affix क्विप्,
and वृ to choose, अप् affix: see इट्चर.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=107-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इण्यीन्थ
इण्यीन्थ m. (-न्थः) A knife.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=107-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इण्वीन्दु
इण्वीन्दु m. (-न्दुः) A tree, (Trochis aspera.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=107-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इत्
इत् ind. A grammatical term, implying a letter in the inflective par-
ticles that is to be rejected.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=107-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इत|इतः
इत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Gone.
	 2. Remembered.
	 3. Obtained.
 E. इण् to go,
affix क्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=107-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतःइतस्
इतःइतस् ind. Here here, come here.
 E. इतस् repeated.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=107-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतर|इतरः
इतर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं)
	 1. Other, different.
	 2. Low, vile.
 E. इ desire, तृ to
pass over, and अप aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=107-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतरथा
इतरथा ind. In another manner, otherwise, differently.
 E. था added to
इतर.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=107-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतरेतर|इतरेतरं
इतरेतर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं)
	 1. Mutual, one with another.
	 2. Respective,
several.
 E. इतर repeated.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=107-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतरेतरकाम्या
इतरेतरकाम्या f. (-म्या) Respective or several fancies or inclinations. E.
इतरेतर and काम्य to be desired.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=107-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतरेतराश्रय
इतरेतराश्रय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Affecting or concerning mutually.
 E. इतरेतर
and आश्रय object or receptacle.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=107-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतरेद्युस्
इतरेद्युस् ind. Another or different day.
 E. इतर and एद्युस् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=107-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतश्चेतस्
इतश्चेतस् ind. Hither and thither.
 E. इतस् repeated, with च and, inserted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=107-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतस्
इतस् ind. Hence, from hence. E. irr. deriv. from इदम् this, with तसिल
aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=107-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतस्ततस्
इतस्ततस् ind. Here and there, hither and thither.
 E. इतस् hence, ततस् thence.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=107-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इति|इतिः
इति ind. A particle implying, 1. Cause, (thus, therefore.)
	 2. Manifesta-
tion, (lo! behold!)
	 3. Something additional, (etcetera.)
	 4. The
meanings of एवम्^1, (so, thus, even, in this manner.)
	 5. Conclusion,
enough, (finis.)
	 6. Reference, (so says, this is, &c.) It also implies,
7. Order, arrangement, specific or distinctive, and 8. Identity
(of this or similar form.)
	 9. A grammatical copulative, indicating a
preceding sound or sense, to be again intented.
 E. इ to go, क्तिच् aff.
[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20260703. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/285.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=107-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतिकथ|इतिकथं
इतिकथ mfn. (-थः-था-थं)
	 1. Unworthy of trust, not fit to be credited.
	 2.
Wicked, lost.
	 f. (-था) Unmeaning or nonsensical discourse.
 E. इति
this, so, and कथा a saying.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=107-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतिकर्त्तव्य|इतिकर्तव्य
इतिकर्त्तव्य mfn. (-व्यः-व्या-व्यं) What is proper or necessary to be done. E.
इति so, कर्त्तव्य to be done.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=107-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतिकर्त्तव्यता|इतिकर्तव्यता
इतिकर्त्तव्यता f. (-ता) Proper and right measures.
 E. इतिकर्त्तव्य with तल्
added, or with त्व, इतिकर्त्तव्यत्वं.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=107-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतिह
इतिह ind. Traditional instruction, advice, &c. mutually imparted. E.
इति so, thus, and ह tidings.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=107-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतिहास|इतिहासः
इतिहास m. (-सः) History, traditional accounts of former events, heroic
history, as the Mahabharata and Rāmāyaṇa.
 E. इतिह traditional
instruction, अस् to be, and घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=107-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इत्कट|इत्कटः
इत्कट mf. (-टः-टा) A kind of reed or grass; also बहुमूल.
 E. उत् and कट
to go, उ is changed to इ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=107-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इत्किला
इत्किला f. (-ला) A perfume: see रोचना.
 E. इत obtained, and किल to play.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=107-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इत्थम्
इत्थम् ind. Thus.
 E. इदम् this, deriv. irr. with थमु aff.
