<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इत्थम्भूत|इत्थंभूत
इत्थम्भूत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Become thus or in such manner.
 E. इत्थम् and
भूत become.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=107-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इत्य|इत्यः
इत्य mfn. (-त्यः-त्या-त्यं) To be gone to or towards.
	 f. (-त्या) A litter, a
palankeen.
 E. इत् to go, क्यप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=107-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इत्यादि
इत्यादि ind. Etcetera, and so forth.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=107-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इत्वर|इत्वरः
इत्वर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं)
	 1. Low, vile.
	 2. Cruel, harsh.
	 3. A traveller.
	 4.
Poor, indigent.
	 5. Going, moving, what goes.
	 f. (-री) A disloyal or
unchaste woman.
 E. इत and क्वरप् aff.
