<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्दिरा|इंदिरा
इन्दिरा f. (-रा) A name of LAKṢMĪ, the wife of VIṢṆU.
 E. इदि as above,
