इन्दुव्रत|इन्दुव्रतं
इन्दुव्रत n. (-तं) A religious observance depending on the age of the
moon; diminishing the quantity of food by a certain portion
daily, for a fortnight or a month, &c.
 E. इन्दु and व्रत a religious
obligation.
