इभ|इभः
इभ m. (-भः)
	 1. An elephant.
	 2. Best (in composition.)
 E. इण् to go, भन्
Unādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=109-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इभकणा
इभकणा f. (-णा) A plant with an arometic seed, (Pothos officinalis,) E.
