<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इभनिमीलिका
इभनिमीलिका f. (-का) Smartness, shrewdness, wittiness.
 E. इभ and निमी-
लिका winking; winking knowingly like an elephant.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=109-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इभपालक|इभपालकः
इभपालक m. (-कः) The driver or keeper of an elephant.
 E. इभ, पालक a
nourisher.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=109-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इभपोटा
इभपोटा f. (-टा) A young elephant, a cub.
 E. इभ and पोटा any young
animal.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=109-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इभमाचल|इभमाचलः
इभमाचल m. (-लः) A lion.
 E. इभ an elephant, in the second case, आ and
चल who attacks.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=109-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इभयुवति|इभयुवतिः
इभयुवति f. (-तिः) An elephant's cub.
 E. इभ and युवति young.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=109-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इभाख्य|इभाख्यः
इभाख्य m. (-ख्यः) A plant, (Mesua ferrea:) see नागकेशर.
 E. इभ and आख्या
an appellation; named from the elephant.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इभोषणा
इभोषणा f. (-णा) A kind of aromatic plant: see इभकणा.
 E. इभ and उषणा
pepper.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इभ्य|इभ्यः
इभ्य mfn. (-भ्यः-भ्या-भ्यं) Wealthy, opulent.
	 f. (-भ्या)
	 1. A female elephant.
2. The olibanum tree, (Boswellia thurifera.)
 E. इभ an elephant;
here also implying excellence, and यत् affix of appropriation or
fitness.
