<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इयत्|इयन्त्
इयत् mfn. (-यान्-यती-यत्) So much, this much.
 E. इदम् this, and वतुप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इयत्ता
इयत्ता f. (-त्ता) Fixed measure or quantity, so much.
 E. इयत् and तल्
affix; also with त्व, इयत्त्वं.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इरण|इरणं
इरण mfn. (-णः-णा-णं)
	 1. Desert.
	 2. Salt or barren, (soil.) E. See इरिण.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इरम्मद|इरंमद|इरम्मदः
इरम्मद m. (-दः)
	 1. A flash of lightning, or the fire attending the fall of
a thunderbolt.
	 2. Submarine fire.
 E. इरा water, here also watery
clouds, and मद what plays or shines.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इरा
इरा f. (-रा)
	 1. The earth.
	 2. Water.
	 3. Speech.
	 4. The goddess of
speech, &c.
	 5. Ardent spirits.
 E. इण् to go, and रन् Unādi affix, fem.
affix टाप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इराचर|इराचरं
इराचर m. (-रः) Hail.
	 mfn. (-रः-रा-री-रं)
	 1. Earth-born, terrestrial.
	 2.
Aquatic.
 E. इरा water, &c. and चर what goes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इराज|इराजः
इराज m. (-जः) A name of KANDARPA the Hindu CUPID.
 E. इरा water,
and ज born.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इरावत्|इरावन्त्
इरावत् m. (-वान्)
	 1. The ocean.
	 2. A cloud.
	 3. A king.
	 mfn. (-वान्-वती-
वत्) Watery, having or yielding water, &c.
 E. इरा and मतुप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इरावेल्लिका
इरावेल्लिका f. (-का) Pimples or pustules on the head.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इरिण|इरिणं|इरिणः
इरिण n. (-णं)
	 1. A desert, an inhospitable region.
	 2. Salt or barren soil.
E. ऋ to go, इनन् Unādi affix, and the initial changed to इ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इरिमेद|इरिमेदः
इरिमेद m. (-दः) A fetid mimosa: see विट्खदिर. E. See अरिमेद, अ being
changed to इ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इरु
इरु m. (-रुः) Seed.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इरेश|इरेशः
इरेश m. (-शः)
	 1. A name of VIṢṆU.
	 2. A king, a sovereign.
	 3.
VARUṆA.
 E. इरा SARASWATI, &c. ईश lord.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इर्व्वारु|इर्वारु|इर्वारुः|इर्व्वारुः
इर्व्वारु mf. (-रुः-रुः)
	 1. A cucumber, (Cumumis utilatissimus, Rox.)
2. Another kind, (Cucumis colocynthis.)
 E. इरु a seed, and आरु
what goes to or gets, from ऋ and उण् affix, or आलु, र becoming ल;
also written इर्व्वालु, ईर्व्वारु, उर्व्वारु, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इर्व्वारुशुक्तिका|इर्वारुशुक्तिका
इर्व्वारुशुक्तिका f. (-का) A kind of melon; commonly Sphuti or Sphut,
(Cucumis momordica.)
 E. इर्व्वारु and शुक्तिका an oyster-shaped cu-
cumber.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इर्व्वालु|इर्वालु|इर्व्वालुः
इर्व्वालु m. (-लुः) See इर्व्वारु.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इल
इल r. 6th cl. (इलति)
	 1. To sleep.
	 2. To go.
	 3. To throw, send or direct:
in this last sense, it is also r. 10th cl. (एलयति.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इलविला
इलविला f. (-ला) The mother of KUVERA.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इला
इला f. (-ला)
	 1. The wife of BUDDHA, and daughter of IKSHWAKU.
	 2.
The earth.
	 3. A cow.
	 4. Speech.
 E. इल् to send, क and टाप् affixes;
also इडा.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इलागोल
इलागोल n. (-लं) The earth, the globe.
 E. इला and गोल a sphere.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इलातल
इलातल n. (-लं)
	 1. The fourth place in the circle of the zodiac.
	 2. The
surface of the earth.
 E. इला and तल below.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इलावृत|इलावृतं
इलावृत n. (-तं) One of the nine Varṣas or divisions of the known world,
comprehending the highest and most centrical part of the old
continent.
 E. इला the earth, and आवृत chosen: the fairest part of the
globe.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इलिका
इलिका f. (-का) The earth.
 E. इल् to go, कन् and टाप् affixes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इली
इली f. (-ली) A cudgel, a stick shaped like a sword or a short sword: see ईली.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इलीश|इलीशः
इलीश m. (-शः) A fish, commonly the Hilsa or Sable, (Clupea alosa.) E.
इल् to go, (in the water,) and ईश chief, principal. The fish being
one of high flavour, and very abundant at certain seasons, it is
generally eaten both by the natives of Bengal, and by Europeans
residing there.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इल्लल|इल्ललः
इल्लल m. (-लः) A bird.
 E. इल् to go, and अल who is able.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इल्लिश|इल्लिशः
इल्लिश m. (-शः) The Hilsa fish: see इलीश also ईल्लीश.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इल्वका
इल्वका f. plu. (-काः) Stars in Orion's head: see इल्वल.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इल्वड
इल्वड m. (-डः) See the next.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इल्वल|इल्वलः
इल्वल m. (-लः)
	 1. The name of a demon.
	 2. Of a fish.
	 f. plu. (-लाः) Stars
in Orin's head.
 E. इल् to send or go, and वल Unādi affix; the last
is also written इल्वका.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इव
इव r. 1st cl. (इ) इवि (इंवति) 1. To pervade.
	 2. (According to some,) to
please.
	 3. To be satisfied.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इव
इव ind. So, even, as, like, in the same manner.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इशीका
इशीका f. (-का) An elephant's eyeball: see इषीका.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष|इषः
इष r. 4th cl. (इष्यति) To go. r. 6th cl. (इच्छति)
	 1. To wish, to desire.
	 2.
To accept, to receive. With अभि, to desire: with प्रति, to engage,
to promise. r. 9th cl. (इष्णाति) To repeat an act, to do anything
again and again. With अनु prefixed, to search after, to investigate
or enquire.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष|इषः
इष m. (-षः) The month Āswin, (September-October.)
 E. इष् to go, क
affix; also ईष.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इषिका
इषिका f. (-का)
	 1. An elephant's eyeball.
	 2. A painter's brush, &c. also
इषीका.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इषिर|इषिरः
इषिर m. (-रः) Fire.
 E. इष् to go, किरच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इषीका
इषीका f. (-का)
	 1. An elephant's eyeball.
	 2. A painter's brush, &c. also
इषिका.
	 3. A kind of reed, (Saccharum spontaneum.)
 E. इष् to go,
ईकन् Unādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इषु|इषुः
इषु mf. (-षुः-षुः)
	 1. An arrow.
	 2. A versed sine.
 E. इष् to go, and उ Unādi
aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इषुधर|इषुधरः
इषुधर m. (-रः) An archer.
 E. इषु and धर who bears.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इषुधि|इषुधिः
इषुधि mf. (-धिः-धिः) A quiver.
 E. इषु and धि what holds, from धा root,
and कि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्ट|इष्टं|इष्टः
इष्ट mfn. (-ष्टः-ष्टा-ष्टं)
	 1. Wished, desired.
	 2. Cherished, beloved.
	 3. Wor-
shipped, reverenced, respected.
	 m. (-ष्टः)
	 1. A lover, a husband.
	 2.
The Castor-oil tree.
	 n. (-ष्टं)
	 1. An act of sacrifice, an oblation, &c.
2. An essential ceremony, as ablution, investiture, &c. ind. (-ष्टम्)
Voluntarily.
 E. इष् to desire, or इष् substituted for यज् to sacrifice,
and क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्टकर्म्मन्|इष्टकर्मन्
इष्टकर्म्मन् n. (-र्म्म) (In arithmetic,) Rule of supposition, operation with an
assumed number.
 E. इष्ट wished, and कर्म्मन् act.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्टका
इष्टका f. (-का) A brick; also इष्टिका.
 E. इष् to wish, तकक् Unādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्टकान्यास|इष्टकान्यासः
इष्टकान्यास m. (-सः) Laying the foundation of a house.
 E. इष्टका and न्यास
order.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्टकापथ|इष्टकापथं|इष्टकापथः
इष्टकापथ n. (-थं) The root of a fragrant grass, (Andropogon muricatum.)
E. इष्ट wished, and कापथ a bad road, growing in or preferring
unfrequented places: this word is sometimes divided, कापथ being
one name, and इष्ट added to अवदाह, another name: see अवदाहेष्ट and
अवदाह.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्टकाराशि|इष्टकाराशिः
इष्टकाराशि f. (-शिः) A pile of bricks.
 E. इष्टका and राशि a heap.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्टगन्ध|इष्टगन्धं|इष्टगन्धः
इष्टगन्ध mfn. (-न्धः-न्धा-न्धं) Fragrant, any fragrant substance.
	 n. (-न्धं) Sand.
E. इष्ट and गन्ध a smell; of a desirable odor.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्टतम
इष्टतम mfn. (-मः-मा-मं) Beloved, best beloved, dearest, most desired. E.
इष्ट and तमप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्टतर
इष्टतर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Dearer, more dear, more desired.
 E. इष्ट and तरप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्टत्व
इष्टत्व n. (-त्वं)
	 1. Desirableness.
	 2. Reverence, &c. also इष्टता.
 E. तल् or त्व
added to इष्ट.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्टदेव|इष्टदेवः
इष्टदेव m. (-वः) A tutelary deity, one particularly worshipped.
 E. इष्ट and
देव a deity.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्टदेवता
इष्टदेवता f. (-ता) A person's chosen or tutelary.
	 2. divinity.
 E. इष्ट and
देवता divinity.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्टापूर्त्त|इष्टापूर्त|इष्टापूर्तं|इष्टापूर्त्तं
इष्टापूर्त्त n. (-र्त्तं) Any religious duty, as oblation, sacrifice, penance, holy
study, digging a well, planting a tree, &c.
 E. इष्ट a sacrifice, and
पूर्त्त liberal act, religiously considered; आङ् prefixed to the latter.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्टार्थोद्युक्त|इष्टार्थोद्युक्तः
इष्टार्थोद्युक्त mfn. (-क्तः-क्ता-क्तं) Zealously active, diligent for a desired object.
E. इष्ट wished, अर्थ intention, and उद्युक्त diligent.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्टि|इष्टिः
इष्टि f. (-ष्टिः)
	 1. Wish, desire.
	 2. A sacrifice, any sacrificial rite.
	 3. A
compendious verse easily committed to memory.
 E. इष् to wish, or
इष् substituted for यज्, to sacrifice; affix क्तिन्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्टिका
इष्टिका f. (-का) A brick. E. More usually इष्टका.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्टिन्
इष्टिन् mfn. (-ष्टी-ष्टिनी-ष्टि) Who wishes or desires, desirous, wishing. E.
इष्ट and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्टिपच|इष्टिपचः
इष्टिपच m. (-चः) A demon.
 E. इष्टि a sacrifice or oblation, and पच who
digests: stealing oblations to the deities, and eating them.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्टिमुष्
इष्टिमुष् m. (-मुट्) A demon.
 E. इष्टि an oblation, and मुष् who steals; from
मुष root, and क्विप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्टु|इष्टुः
इष्टु f. (-ष्टुः) Desire, wish.
 E. इष् to wish, तु aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्ट्वा
इष्ट्वा ind.
	 1. Having sacrificed or worshipped.
	 2. Having wished.
 E. इष
with क्त्वाच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्म|इष्मः
इष्म m. (-ष्मः)
	 1. Love or the deity KĀMA^1.
	 2. Spring.
 E. इष् to desire, and मक् Unādi aff.
[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20260617. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/264.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्य|इष्यं|इष्यः
इष्य m. (-ष्यः) The spring season.
 E. इष् to wish, and क्यप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्व|इष्वः
इष्व m. (-ष्वः) A spiritual preceptor.
 E. इष् to wish, वुन् Unādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्वास|इष्वासं|इष्वासः
इष्वास mfn. (-सः-सा-सं) A thrower of arrows.
	 m. (-सः)
	 1. A bow.
	 2. An
archer, a warrior.
 E. इषु an arrow, and आस who throws.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इस्
इस् ind. (इः) An interjection of anger, pain, or sorrow.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इह
इह ind.
	 1. Here, in this place.
	 2. Now, at this time.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इहकाल|इहकालः
इहकाल m. (-लः) This life.
 E. इह and काल time.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इहलोक|इहलोकः
इहलोक m. (-कः) This life, the world.
 E. इह and लोक world.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इहामूत्र
इहामूत्र ind. Here and there, in this world and in the next.
 E. इह here,
अमूत्र there or in that.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ई
ई The fourth letter of the alphabet, corresponding to I long, having
the sound of ee in feel, and distinguished by an accent from the
former, as ī.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ई
ई m. (ईः) A name of KANDARPA.
	 f. (ईः) A name of LAKṢMĪ. ind.
An interjection of, 1. Pain.
	 2. Anger.
	 3. Consciousness or percep-
tion.
	 4. Consideration.
	 5. Compassion.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ई
ई r. 2nd cl. (एति)
	 1. To go.
	 2. To pervade.
	 3. To conceive or become
pregnant.
	 4. To desire.
	 5. To throw or direct.
	 6. To eat. This root
is not generally admitted, though it occurs in composition, as with
उत् (उदीते) To appear. r. 4th cl. (ङ) ईङ् (ईयते) To go.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईक्ष
ईक्ष r. 1st cl. (ईक्षते) To see. It most usually occurs compounded with
one or other of the prepositions, as with अप, to expect; with अभि,
to gaze at; with अव, to inspect; with उत् or उप, to expect or
await; with उप, to abandon; with निर्, to see; with परि, to try,
to test, to assay; with प्र, to see, to resemble, or look like; with
वि, to inspect; with प्रति, 1. to look for, to expect, 2. to venerate;
with सम्, to compare, to contrast, to select; with प्रति and उत्, to
look up at.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईक्षण|ईक्षणं
ईक्षण n. (-णं)
	 1. Sight, seeing.
	 2. An eye.
 E. ईक्ष् to see, ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईक्षणिका
ईक्षणिका f. (-का) A female fortuneteller.
 E. ईक्षण seeing, वुन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईक्षमाण
ईक्षमाण mfn. (-णः-णा-णं) Looking at, surveying.
 E. ईक्ष् to see, शानच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईक्षित
ईक्षित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Seen, beheld.
 E. ईक्ष् and क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईख
ईख r. 1st cl. (ङ) (ईखति) To go.; also (इ) ईखि (ईंखति.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईज
ईज r. 1st cl. (ङ) (ईजते) 1. To go.
	 2. To blame or censure; also (इञ्)
ईजिञ् (ईंजति-ते.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईड
ईड r. 2nd cl. (ईट्टे) also 10th cl. (ईडयति) To praise.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईडन|ईडनं
ईडन n. (-नं) Praising.
 E. ईड and ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईडा
ईडा f. (-डा) Praise.
 E. ईड् to praise, क and टाप affs.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईडित|ईडितः
ईडित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Praised, commended.
 E. ईड् to praise, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=111-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईड्य
ईड्य mfn. (-ड्यः-ड्या-ड्यं) To be praised, to be glorified.
 E. ईड् to praise,
क्यप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=111-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईढ
ईढ mfn. (-ढः-ढा-ढं) Sought.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=111-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईत
ईत r. 1st cl. (इ) ईति (ईंतति) To bind.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=111-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईत
ईत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Gone.
 E. ई to go, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=111-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईति|ईतिः
ईति f. (-तिः)
	 1. Calamity of season, as drought, excessive rain, rats,
foreign invasion, &c.
	 2. Travelling in foreign countries, sojourning.
3. An affray.
 E. ईङ् to go. affix क्तिन्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=111-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईदृक्ष|ईदृक्षः
ईदृक्ष mfn. (-क्षः-क्षा-क्षं) Such.
 E. ई for इदम् this, दृश् to see, क्विन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=111-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईदृश्
ईदृश् mfn. (-दृक्) Such, so like.
 E. ई for इदम् this, दृश् with क्विप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=111-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईदृश|ईदृशः
ईदृश mfn. (-शः-शी-शं) Such, so like. E. As the last, with कञ् aff.
