ईलित|ईलितः
ईलित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Praised.
 E. इड् to praise, affix क्त, and ड changed to ल.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=111-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
