ईली
ईली f. (-ली) A weapon, sometimes considered as a cudgel, and some-
times as a short sword, or a stick shaped like a sword.
 E. ईर् to go,
&c. क and ङीप् affixes, and र changed to ल; see इली; also ईलि, &c.
