<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उक्त|उक्तं|उक्तः
उक्त n. (-क्तं) A sentence.
	 nf. (-क्तं-क्ता) A stanza of four lines with one
syllabic instant, one long or two short syllables in each.
	 mfn.
(-क्तः-क्ता-क्तं) Spoken, said.
 E. वच् to speak, affix क्त and व changed
to उ.
