उक्तवत्|उक्तवन्त्
उक्तवत् mfn. (-वान्-वती-वत्) Said, was saying.
 E. वच् to speak, क्तवतु affix
of the past part.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=112-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उक्तवाक्य
उक्तवाक्य mfn. (-क्यः-क्या-क्यं) One who has borne testimony or given an
opinion.
	 n. (-क्यं) A dictum, a decree.
 E. उक्त and वाक्य dictum.
