<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उक्तोपसंहार|उक्तोपसंहारः
उक्तोपसंहार m. (-रः) Any brief or compendious phrase or description. E.
उक्त what is said, उपसंहार compendiousness.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=112-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
