a stanza of four lines of one syllable each, the syllable may be
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=112-b" target="_blank">Page112-b+ 60</a>]
one long or two short in quantity.
 E. वच् to speak, and थक् Uṇādi
affix.
