उत्
उत् ind. An interjection of, 1. asking, (how, what?)
	 2. of deliberation,
(either, or;)
	 3. of extreme doubt, (hey! what!)
	 4. Up, above, on,
upon; see उद्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=114-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत|उतं
उत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Sewn, woven.
 E. ऊय to sew, affix क्त. Ind. A particle
of, 1. doubt, (what!)
	 2. of interrogation, (what, how?)
	 3. of con-
nexion, (also, and;)
	 4. of deliberation, (either, or.)
	 5. It is also an
expletive.
 E. ऊङ् to sound, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=114-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उतथ्य|उतथ्यः
