उत्थापित
उत्थापित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Raised, lifted up, elevated.
	 2. Made to get
up, aroused from a seat, a bed, &c.
	 3. Instigated.
 E. उत् and स्था
causal form, क्त aff.
