<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्थाप्य
उत्थाप्य ind.
	 1. Having raised or caused to rise.
	 2. Having roused or
instigated.
 E. उत् before स्था to stay, causal form, ल्यप् aff.
