<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्थाय
उत्थाय ind.
	 1. Having risen (from a seat, &c.)
	 2. Having risen (in
rank, &c.)
 E. उत् before स्था to stand, affix ल्यप्.
