उत्पलपत्र|उत्पलपत्रं
उत्पलपत्र n. (-त्रं)
	 1. The leaf of the lotus.
	 2. The impression of a female
nail.
	 3. The Tilaka or mark on the forehead, made with sandal,
&c. by the Hindus.
	 4. A broad-bladed knife or lancet.
 E. उत्पल a
lotus, and पत्र a leaf; similarly shaped, &c. also कन् added उत्पल-
पत्रक.
