उत्पवन|उत्पवनं
उत्पवन n. (-नं)
	 1. Straining liquids before using for domestic or religious
purposes.
	 2. Sprinkling ghee or other fluids on the sacrificial fire,
with two blades of Kusa grass, the ends of which are held in
either hand, and the centre dipped into the liquid, which is then
dropped upon the fire.
 E. उत् above, &c. पुङ् to purify, affix ल्युट्.
