उत्पिष्ट
उत्पिष्ट mfn. (-ष्टः-ष्टा-ष्टं) Ground, rubbed.
	 n. (-ष्टं) A disease, a grating of
the bones of the joints upon each other.
 E. उत् and पिष्ट ground.
