<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पीड|उत्पीडः
उत्पीड m. (-डः) Froth.
 E. उत् on, पीड् to go, क aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=118-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्प्रासन|उत्प्रासनं
उत्प्रासन n. (-नं)
	 1. Ridicule, derision.
	 2. Hurling, throwing afar.
 E. उत
and प्र before अस् to throw, affix ल्युट.
