उत्प्रेक्षा
उत्प्रेक्षा f. (-क्षा)
	 1. Indifference, carelessness.
	 2. Ironical comparison.
	 3.
Comparison in general, poetical or rhetorical.
 E. उत् and प्र prefixed
to ईक्ष् to see, अङ् and टाप् affs.
