<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्प्लवन|उत्प्लवनं
उत्प्लवन n. (-नं)
	 1. Taking up oil or ghee when it has been defiled in
any way, by dipping a blade of Kusa grass into it, and dropping
it from them upon the fire.
	 2. Jumping, springing upon.
 E. उत्
over, प्लवन jumping.
