<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्प्लवा
उत्प्लवा f. (-वा) A boat.
 E. उत् over, प्लु to go, अच् and टाप् affs.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=118-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्प्लुत
उत्प्लुत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Jumped upon, approached suddenly.
 E. उत् before
प्लु to go, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=118-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्प्लुत्य
उत्प्लुत्य ind. Having sprung or jumped upon.
 E. उत् before प्लु to go, ल्यप् aff.
