<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्फल|उत्फलं
उत्फल n. (-लं) Excellent fruit.
 E. उत् and फल fruit.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=118-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्फाल|उत्फालः
उत्फाल m. (-लः) A jump, a leap.
 E. उत् before स्फुल् to move, affix घञ्
the vowel and final changed.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=118-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्फुल्ल|उत्फुल्लः
उत्फुल्ल mfn. (-ल्लः-ल्ला-ल्लं)
	 1. Blown as a flower.
	 2. Swollen, increased in
bulk.
	 3. Sleeping supinely.
 E. उत् and फुल्ल blown.
