<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्सङ्ग|उत्संग|उत्संगः|उत्सङ्गः
उत्सङ्ग m. (-ङ्गः)
	 1. The haunch or part above the hip.
	 2. The acclivity
or slope of a hill.
	 3. Association, union.
	 4. Embrace.
	 5. The bot-
tom or deep part of an ulcer.
 E. उत् before षञ्ज् to embrace, affix घञ्.
