<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्सङ्गित|उत्संगित
उत्सङ्गित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Associated, combined, joined.
 E. उत् before षञ्ज्
to be joined with, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=118-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्सङ्गिन्|उत्संगिन्
उत्सङ्गिन् mfn. (-ङ्गी-ङ्गिनी-ङ्गि) Associating or combining with, an associate,
a partner.
	 m. (-ङ्गी) An ulcer, a deep sore.
	 f. (-ङ्गिनी) Pimples on
the inner edge of the eyelids.
 E. उत्सङ्ग and इनि aff.
