उत्सर्प्प m. (-र्प्पः)
	 1. Going or gliding upwards.
	 2. Swelling, heaving. E.
उत् before सृप् to go, घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=118-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्सर्प्पण|उत्सर्पण|उत्सर्पणं
उत्सर्प्पण n. (-णं)
	 1. Gliding upwards.
	 2. Swelling, heaving.
 E. उत् before
सृप् to go gently, ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=118-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

