<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्सव|उत्सवः
उत्सव m. (-वः)
	 1. A festival, a jubilee.
	 2. Height, elevation.
	 3. Impa-
tience.
	 4. Wish.
	 5. Passion, wrath.
 E. उत्, षू to bear, to bring
forth, affix अच; happiness, &c. is produced by it.
