उत्सादित|उत्सादितं
उत्सादित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Risen, ascended.
	 2. Raised, elevated.
	 3. De-
stroyed.
	 4. Cleansed, purified with oil, perfumes, &c. E. As above,
affix क्त.
