<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्सारक|उत्सारकः
उत्सारक m. (-कः)
	 1. A doorkeeper, a porter.
	 2. A guard, a guardian. E.
उत्, सृ to go, in the causal form and वुन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=119-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्सारण|उत्सारणं
उत्सारण n. (-णं)
	 1. Removing, keeping at a distance.
	 2. Moving, causing
to move.
 E. उत्, सृ to go, causal form, ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=119-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्साह|उत्साहः
उत्साह m. (-हः)
	 1. Effort, perseverance, strenuous and continued exer-
tion.
	 2. A thread.
	 3. Happiness.
	 4. Firmness, fortitude.
 E. उत्
much, सह् to bear, to be able, affix घञ्.
