<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्सिक्त|उत्सिक्तः
उत्सिक्त mfn. (-क्तः-क्ता-क्तं)
	 1. Haughty, proud, rude.
	 2. Elevated, raised.
3. Enlarged, increased.
	 4. Sprinkled.
	 5. Disordered, disturbed (in
mind, &c.)
	 m. (-क्तः) A king's wrestler.
 E. उत् before षिच् to
sprinkle, and क्त aff.
