<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्सृष्ट|उत्सृष्टः
उत्सृष्ट mfn. (-ष्टः-ष्टा-ष्टं)
	 1. Left, abandoned.
	 2. Given, presented.
	 3.
Cast into or upon.
 E. उत् and सृज् so leave, affix क्त, deriv. irr.
