उत्सेध m. (-धः)
	 1. Height, elevation.
	 2. The body.
	 3. Fatness, obesity.
4. Intumescence 5. Thickness.
	 n. (-धं) Killing, slaughter.
 E. उत्
up, षिध् to go, affix घञ्.
