उत्स्मय|उत्स्मयः
उत्स्मय m. (-यः) A smile.
 E. उत् and स्मय a smile.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=119-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्
उद् or उत् ind. A particle and prefix to words implying, 1. Superiority
in degree; (over, above.)
	 2. In place, (over, above, on, upon.)
3. Pride.
	 4. Publicity.
	 5. Power.
	 6. Separation, disjunction,
(off, from, out of.)
	 7. Emancipation.
	 8. Binding.
	 9. Helplessness,
weakness.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=119-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्
उद् or उत् ind. A particle and prefix to words implying, 1. Superiority
in degree; (over, above.)
	 2. In place, (over, above, on, upon.)
3. Pride.
	 4. Publicity.
	 5. Power.
	 6. Separation, disjunction,
(off, from, out of.)
	 7. Emancipation.
	 8. Binding.
	 9. Helplessness,
weakness.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=119-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद|उदं
उद n. (-दं) Water.
 E. उन्द् to wet, deriv. irr.: see उदक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=119-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदक्
उदक् ind. Northern, upper, subsequent: see उदच्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=119-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदक|उदकं
उदक n. (-कं) Water.
 E. उन्द् to wet, deriv. irr.; this is sometimes con-
sidered as two words, उद and क, each having the same meaning.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=119-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदकक्रिया
उदकक्रिया f. (-या) Presentation of water to ancestors as far as the four-
teenth degree.
 E. उदक and क्रिया rite; so उदकर्म्म, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=119-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदकद|उदकदः
उदकद mfn. (-दः-दा-दं) A giver of water, yielding water, offering
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=119-b" target="_blank">Page119-b+ 60</a>]
water to the manes, &c.
	 m. (-दः) An heir, a near kinsman.
 E. उदक
and द who gives; also उदकदातृ and उदकदायिन्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=119-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदकदान
उदकदान n. (-नं) Gift of water, especially to the manes, as a religious
or obsequial rite.
 E. उदक् and दान giving.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=119-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदकदायिन्
उदकदायिन् mfn. (-यी-यिनी-यि) Giving water.
	 m. (-यी) An heir or kins-
man, one who presents libations of water.
 E. उदक् and दायिन् who
gives.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=119-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदकपूर्व्वकम्|उदकपूर्वकम्
उदकपूर्व्वकम् ind. Pouring water on the hand as preparatory to or con-
firmatory of a gift or promise.
 E. उदक and पूर्व्वक prior.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=119-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदकप्रतीकाश
उदकप्रतीकाश mfn. (-शः-शा-शं) Watery, fluid like water.
 E. उदक and
प्रतीकाश what resembles.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=119-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदकमेह|उदकमेहः
उदकमेह m. (-हः) A variety of Diabetes, passing watery urine.
 E. उदक् and मेह urining.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=119-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदकशाक
उदकशाक n. (-कं) Any aquatic herb.
 E. उदक and शाक a potherb.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=119-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदकस्पर्श|उदकस्पर्शः
उदकस्पर्श m. (-र्शः)
	 1. Touching different parts of the body with
water.
	 2. Touching water in confirmation of a promise, &c. F. उदक
and स्पर्श touch.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=119-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदकाधार|उदकाधारः
उदकाधार m. (-रः) A reservoir, a cistern, a well, &c.
 E. उदक and आधार receptacle.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=119-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदकार्थिन्
उदकार्थिन् mfn. (-र्थी-र्थिनी-र्थि) Thirsty, desirous of water.
 E. उदक and
अर्थिन् who seeks.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=119-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदकीर्य्य|उदकीर्य|उदकीर्यः|उदकीर्य्यः
उदकीर्य्य m. (-र्य्यः) A plant, (Galedupa, arborea &c.) See करञ्जक.
 E. उद्
water, and कॄ to scatter, अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=119-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदकुम्भ|उदकुंभ|उदकुम्भः
उदकुम्भ m. (-म्भः) A water-jar.
 E. उद् and कुम्भ a jar; also उदककुम्भ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=119-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
