उदग्र|उदग्रं
उदग्र mfn. (-ग्रः-ग्रा-ग्रं)
	 1. High, tall.
	 2. Large, vast.
	 3. Projecting.
	 4.
Pointing upwards.
	 5. Fierce, intense.
 E. उत् up, and अग्र end,
point.
