उदञ्च्|उदंच्
उदच् or उदञ्च् mfn. (उदङ् उदीची उदक्)
	 1. North, northern.
	 2. Upper,
upwards.
	 3. Subsequent, posterior.
	 f. (-दीची) The north.
 E. उद् up,
अञ्च् to go, affix क्विप्; the neuter is used as a particle: see उदक्;
the noun is irregular.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=119-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदज|उदजः
उदज mfn. (-जः-जा-जं) Aquatic, watery, produced in or by water.
