उदञ्चन n. (-नं)
	 1. A lid or cover.
	 2. Directing or throwing upwards.
	 3.
Rising, ascending.
 E. उत् above, अञ्च् to go, and ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=119-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
