उदय|उदयः
उदय m. (-यः)
	 1. The rising of the sun and planets in general.
	 2. The
eastern mountain, behind which the sun is supposed to rise.
	 3.
Rising, ascending.
	 4. Light, splendor.
	 5. Prosperity, good fortune.
6. Creation, the rising of the world.
	 7. (In law) Income.
 E. उद् up,
इण् to go, and अच् aff.
