उपकण्ठ mfn. (-ण्ठः-ण्ठा-ण्ठं) Near, proximate.
	 n. (-ण्ठं)
	 1. Space near a vil-
lage or its boundary.
	 2. One of a horse's paces, his walk. ind. (-ण्ठं)
Upon the neck, near the throat.
 E. उप near, कण्ठ the neck.
