	 3. The insignia of
royalty.
	 4. Sauces, condiments.
	 5. Helping, assisting.
	 6. Object of
art or science, fabricating, composing, &c.
	 7. Means of subsistence,
any thing supporting life.
 E. उप implying command or help, कृ to
make, ल्युट् aff.
