	 1. Morbid heat.
	 2. Any cause of heat, burning or inflam-
mation.
 E. उप excess, तप् to heat, तृच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=126-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपताप|उपतापः
उपताप m. (-पः)
	 1. Disease.
	 2. Haste, hurry.
	 3. Heat, heatedness.
	 4.
Pain.
	 5. Misfortune.
 E. उप much, तप् to heat, घञ् aff.
