<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपतापिन्
उपतापिन् mfn. (-पी-पिनी-पि)
	 1. Inflaming, exciting.
	 2. Heating.
	 3. Suffer-
ing heat or pain.
	 4. Sick.
 E. उपताप and इनि affix, or उप before तप
with णिनि aff.
