उपदंश|उपदंशः
उपदंश m. (-शः)
	 1. A relish, or something to promote drinking.
	 2. The
venereal disease, chancre.
	 3. Biting, stinging.
	 4. A tree, the scraped
root of which is used for horse-radish, (Morunga hyperanthera.) E.
उप much, &c. दंश biting.
