उपदेशन|उपदेशनं
उपदेशन n. (-नं) Advising, instructing.
 E. उप before दिश् to show, aff. ल्युट्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=127-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपदेशिन्
उपदेशिन् mfn. (-शी-शिनी-शि) Advising, an adviser.
 E. उपदेश advice, and
इनि affix.
