उपदेह m. (-हः)
	 1. Liniment, ointment.
	 2. A minor or secondary body.
E. उप and दिह plaster, or देह the body.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=127-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

