उपद्रविन्
उपद्रविन् mfn. (-वी-विणी-वि)
	 1. Tyrannical.
	 2. Violent, factious.
	 m. (-वी)
1. A tyrant, an oppressor.
	 2. A rebel.
 E. उपद्रव and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=127-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपद्रष्टृ
उपद्रष्टृ mfn. (-ष्टा-ष्ट्री-ष्टृ) Supervisor, inspector, overseeing, overlooking.
E. उप before दृश् to see, तृच् affix, the vowel changed to र.
