<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपद्रुत
उपद्रुत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Tyrannized over, oppressed, visited by calamities,
&c.
 E. उप before द्रु to go, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=127-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपधर्म्म|उपधर्म|उपधर्मः|उपधर्म्मः
उपधर्म्म m. (-र्म्मः)
	 1. A heretic, a schismatic.
	 2. A minor or inferior duty.
E. उप and धर्म्म duty.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=127-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपधा
उपधा f. (-धा)
	 1. A false pretence.
	 2. Trial or test of honesty, &c. of four
kinds, of loyalty, disinterestedness, continence, and courage.
	 3. A
penultimate letter.
 E. उप, धा having, from धा to have, with अङ्
and टाप् affs.
