<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपधान|उपधानं
उपधान n. (-नं)
	 1. A pillow.
	 2. Kindness, affection.
	 3. Poison.
	 4. Reli-
gious observance or obligation.
	 5. Excellence, excellent quality.
	 6.
Resting or placing upon.
 E. उप, धा to have or hold, ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=127-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपधानीय|उपधानीयं
उपधानीय n. (-यं) A pillow.
 E. उपधान a pillow, and छ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=127-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपधाय
उपधाय ind. Having placed or rested upon.
 E. उप before धा to hold, ल्यप्
affix.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=127-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपधाशुचि
उपधाशुचि mfn. (-चिः-चिः-चि) Approved, tried, of approved loyalty, &c.
E. उपधा and शुचि pure.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=127-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपधि|उपधिः
उपधि m. (-धिः)
	 1. Fraud, circumvention.
	 2. The wheel of a carriage.
	 3.
Fear, terror.
 E. उप, धा to have, and कि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=127-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपधिक|उपधिकः
उपधिक m. (-कः)
	 1. A cheat, a knave, especially one who extorts money
by threats.
	 2. Fraud.
 E. उपधि and कृ to make, ड affix or कन्
pleonasm.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=127-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपधूपित|उपधूपितः
उपधूपित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Being at the point of death.
	 2. Suffering
extreme pain.
 E. उप near or much, धूपित pained.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=127-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपधृति|उपधृतिः
उपधृति f. (-तिः) A ray of light.
 E. उप much, धृ to have, क्तिन् affix.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=127-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपनत|उपनतः
उपनत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Approached, approximate, near, (either in time
or place.)
 E. उप near, नम् to bow, affix क्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=127-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपनय|उपनयः
उपनय m. (-यः) The initiation of the three first classes; investiture
with a peculiar thread or cord worn over the left shoulder, and
under the right: the cord of the Brahman is of cotton, Munja, or
Kusa grass; of the Kṣatriya, of Sana or flax; and of the Vaiśya,
of wool: the youths should be invested respectively, from eight to
sixteen, from eleven to twenty-two, and from twelve to twenty-four
years of age.
	 n. (-नं)
	 1. Attaining, gaining.
	 2. Bringing to E.
उप over, नीञ् to obtain, अच् affix; also with घञ् affix उपनाय, and
with ल्युट् affix उपनयन.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=127-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपनयन|उपनयनं
उपनयन n. (-नं) See the preceding. E. As before, affix ल्युट्; also with
अण् added उपनायन.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=127-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपनाय|उपनायः
उपनाय m. (-यः) See उपनय.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=127-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
