उपनाह|उपनाहः
उपनाह m. (-हः)
	 1. A plaster, an unguent applied to a wound or sore.
2. The tie of a lute, the lower part of the tail piece where the wires
are fixed.
	 3. Inflammation of the ciliary glands, stye.
 E. उप, नह् to
bind, घञ् aff.
