<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपनाहन|उपनाहनं
उपनाहन n. (-नं) Unction, anointing, plastering.
 E. उप before नह् to tie, ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=127-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपनिक्षेप|उपनिक्षेपः
उपनिक्षेप m. (-पः) A deposit, sealed or in a cover so that the contents
are unknown.
 E. उप and निक्षेप the same.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=127-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपनिधान|उपनिधानं
उपनिधान n. (-नं) A deposit: see the next.
 E. उप and नि before धा to have,
ल्युट् affix.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=127-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपनिधि|उपनिधिः
उपनिधि m. (-धिः) A deposit, a pledge, property put into the care of a
creditor, friend, &c.
 E. उप and नि before धा to have, क affix; in law
this word ordinarily implies more especially a sealed or enclosed
deposit, but according to some, it is any article entrusted to a
friend which he may use whilst in his keeping.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=127-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपनिषद्
उपनिषद् f. (-षद् or -षत्)
	 1. A portion of the religious writings of the
Hindus; the theological part, and the Vedanta or argumentative
part of the Vedas, either detached from or comprised in the princi-
pal work.
	 2. Virtue, moral merit.
	 3. Truth as the principle of
divine being.
	 4. A neighbouring mansion.
	 5. A lonely place.
 E. उप
and नि prefixed to षद् to go, affix क्विप्; in which abide the essential
parts of religion, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=127-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपनिष्कर|उपनिष्करं|उपनिष्करः
उपनिष्कर n. (-रं)
	 1. A street.
	 2. A principal or royal road.
 E. उप and नि
before कृ to make, affix अप्, and स inserted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=127-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपनिष्क्रमण|उपनिष्क्रमणं
उपनिष्क्रमण n. (-णं)
	 1. A main or royal road.
	 2. An instituted observance
or Sanskara, taking a child in the fourth month of its age into the
open air.
	 3. Going forth.
 E. उप and नि before क्रम् to go, affix ल्युट्,
and स inserted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=127-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपनिहित
उपनिहित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Deposited with, entrusted to.
	 2. Placed
near to.
	 3. Offered, presented.
 E. उप and नि before धा to to have,
क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=127-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपनीत|उपनीतः
उपनीत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Brought near to, approximated.
	 2. Obtained,
attained.
	 3. Citing, adducing.
	 4. Presented.
	 5. Known.
	 m. (-तः) The
youth invested with the characteristic string; see उपनय.
 E. उप be-
fore नी to obtain, affix क्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=127-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपनीय
उपनीय ind.
	 1. Having brought.
	 2. Having invested.
 E. उप before नी
to bring, ल्यप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=127-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपनुन्न
उपनुन्न mfn. (-न्नः-न्ना-न्नं)
	 1. Sent or dispatched.
	 2. Wafted, driven, (by
the wind.)
 E. उप before नुद् to send, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=127-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपन्यस्त
उपन्यस्त mfn. (-स्तः-स्ता-स्तं)
	 1. Pledged, deposited.
	 2. Given, communicated.
3. Brought forward, (as an example, &c.) adduced.
	 4. Placed near
to, or in, or upon.
 E. उप and नि before अस् to throw, affix क्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=127-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपन्यास|उपन्यासः
उपन्यास m. (-सः)
	 1. A pledge, a pawn, a hostage.
	 2. An exordium or in-
troduction.
	 3. A precept, a law.
	 4. Giving, imparting.
	 5. Juxta-
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=128-a" target="_blank">Page128-a+ 60</a>]
position.
	 6. A suggestion, a hint.
 E. उप and नि prefixed to अस् to
throw or send, affix घञ्.
