<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपपादुक|उपपादुकः
उपपादुक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Shod.
	 m. (-कः)
	 1. A superhuman being,
a god, a demon, &c.
	 2. Hell.
 E. उप before पद् to go, उकञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=128-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपपाप|उपपापं
उपपाप m. (-पः) A heinous crime, as killing a cow, &c.
 E. उप excess,
and पाप sin.
