उपप्लव|उपप्लवः
उपप्लव m. (-वः)
	 1. Rahu, the ascending node.
	 2. A portent or natural
phænomenon so considered.
	 3. An affray, or assault, a conflict
without weapons.
	 4. Eclipse.
	 5. Misfortune.
 E. उप over, &c. प्लु to
go, अप् aff.
