<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपेक्षा
उपेक्षा f. (-क्षा)
	 1. Trick, deceit, one of the minor expedients in war.
	 2.
Abandoning, leaving.
	 3. Dissent.
	 4. Negligence, neglect.
	 5. En-
durance, patience.
	 6. Contempt, disdain.
 E. उप before ईक्ष् to see,
अङ् and टाप् affs.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=132-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपेक्षित
उपेक्षित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Disregarded, disesteemed, neglected, disdained.
E. उप before ईक्ष् to see, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=132-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपेत
उपेत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Endowed with, possessed of, having, possessing.
2. Arrived at, come to, come near to.
	 3. Invested.
 E. उप and इत
gone.
