<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपेतृ
उपेतृ mfn. (-ता-त्री-तृ)
	 1. Contriving, contriver, one who employs expedi-
ents.
	 2. Approaching, going near to.
 E. उप before इण् to go, तृच्
aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=132-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपेन्द्र|उपेंद्र|उपेंद्रः|उपेन्द्रः
उपेन्द्र m. (-न्द्रः) A name of VIṢṆU or KṚṢṆA.
 E. उप after, इन्द्र INDRA:
born subsequently to INDRA.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=132-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपेन्द्रवज्रा
उपेन्द्रवज्रा f. (-ज्रा) A species of the Trishtubh metre.
