<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपेय|उपेयः
उपेय mfn. (-यः-या-यं)
	 1. To be sought, to be had recourse to.
	 2. To be
gone to or approached.
	 3. To be effected by any means.
 E. उप be-
fore इण् to go, यत् aff.
