<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपेयुस्
उपेयुस् mfn. (-यूः-यूः-युः) Arrived at, gone to.
 E. उप before इण् to go, उस् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=132-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपोढ|उपोढः
उपोढ mfn. (-ढः-ढा-ढं)
	 1. Near, proximate.
	 2. Married.
	 3. Arrayed, ar-
ranged.
 E. उप before वह् to bear, aff. क्त.
