उपोद्घात|उपोद्घातः
उपोद्घात m. (-तः)
	 1. A beginning, a thing begun.
	 2. An introduction,
a preface.
	 3. An example, an apposite argument or illustration.
4. Analysis, the ascertainment of the elements of which a thing
consists.
 E. उप before हन् to injure, aff. घञ्.
