<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उप्तिविद्
उप्तिविद् m. (-वित् or -विद्) An agriculturist.
 E. उप्ति and विद् who knows.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=132-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उप्त्रिम
उप्त्रिम mfn. (-मः-मा-मं) Sown, cultivated.
 E. वप् to sow, क्त्रि aff. and मप्
