उभयभागहर
उभयभागहर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं)
	 1. Applicable to two purposes.
	 2. Taking
two shares or parts.
	 n. (-रं) A medicine that acts in two ways, as
an emetic and a purge.
 E. उभय, भाग a part, and हर what takes.
