उभयानुमत
उभयानुमत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Agreed to or accepted mutually, or on both
sides.
 E. उभय and अनुमत assented to.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=133-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
