 E. उमा and पति master; the husband
of UMA.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=133-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उमावन|उमावनं
उमावन n. (-नं) A name of Vanapura or Devi Kota, (Devi Cote.)
 E. उमा
and वन a grove; the residence of UMA.
