<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उरण|उरणः
उरण m. (-णः)
	 1. A ram.
	 2. A cloud.
	 f. (-णी) A ewe.
 E. ऋ to go, क्यु affix,
leaving ण, and उ substituted for the antepenultimate.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=133-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उरणाक्ष|उरणाक्षः
उरणाक्ष m. (-क्षः) Cassia, (Alata.)
 E. उरण ram, अक्ष an eye: the flower
being so compared: क being added, also उरणाक्षक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=133-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उरणाख्य|उरणाख्यः
उरणाख्य m. (-ख्यः) Cassia: see the preceding.
 E. उरण and आख्या a name;
named from the ram; also उरणाख्यक, क being added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=133-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उरभ्र|उरभ्रः
उरभ्र m. (-भ्रः) A ram.
 E. उरु much, भ्रम् to wander, ड affix, and the final
of उरु dropped.
