उलप|उलपः
उलप mn. (-पः-पं)
	 1. A creeping plant, a spreading creeper.
	 m. (-पः) A
kind of grass or reed, (Saccharum cylindricum.)
 E. बल् to be strong,
अपच् affix; also उलुप.
