उलूक|उलूकं|उलूकः
उलूक m. (-कः)
	 1. An owl.
	 2. A name of INDRA.
	 3. One of the heroes
of the Mahabharata.
	 n. (-कं) A kind of reed, (Saccharum cylindri-
cum.)
 E. बल् to be strong, ऊक aff.
