उलूखल|उलूखलं|उलूखलः
उलूखल n. (-लं)
	 1. A wooden mortar used for cleaning rice.
	 2. Bdel-
lium, a gummy substance.
 E. उद् up, ख empty, and ल what takes:
or उदू for उद्, and खल what goes; द is changed to लः see उदूखल.
