<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उलूप
उलूप m. (-पः) A spreading creeper.
	 n. (-पं) A sort of grass.
	 f. (-पी) A
nymph of Pātāla married to ARJUNA. E. See उलुप.
