उल्कामुख|उल्कामुखः
उल्कामुख m. (-खः) A ghost or goblin, with a face of fire, who eats what
is vomited, and who was a negligent Brahman in his life-time.
	 f.
(-खी) A fox.
 E. उल्का a flame, मुख a mouth, ङीष् affix; the latter
from the redness of his mouth.
