	 1. Early morning, dawn, day-break.
	 2. A libidinous man.
3. Bdellium.
	 4. Saline earth.
	 f. (-षा)
	 1. A cow.
	 2. Burning, scorch-
ing.
	 3. A proper name, the wife of ANIRUDDHA.
	 4. Night.
	 5. A
pot; also उखा. ind. The end of night or day-break.
