उष्ण|उष्णः
उष्ण mfn. (-णः-णा-णं)
	 1. Hot, warm.
	 2. Pungent, acrid.
	 3. Sharp, active.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=135-b" target="_blank">Page135-b+ 56</a>]
4. Impetuous, warm, passionate.
	 m. (-ष्णः)
	 1. The hot season, (June
and July.)
	 2. Heat, warmth.
	 3. Sunshine.
	 4. An onion.
	 5. A sigh.
f. (-णा)
	 1. Consumption.
	 2. Bile.
 E. उष् to burn, णक् aff.
