	 1. Sharp, smart, active.
	 2. Suffering pain.
2. Bent, inclining, stooping.
	 4. Warming, heating.
	 m. (-कः)
	 1. The
hot season, two months about June and July.
	 2. Revolving, turn-
ing round.
 E. वुन् added to the preceding.
