ऊ
ऊ The sixth vowel of the Sanskrit alphabet, corresponding to U long,
and having the sound of that letter in the word rule.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=135-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊ
ऊ ind.
	 1. An incipient particle.
	 2. An interjection of compassion.
	 3. Of
regard.
	 m. (ऊः) The moon.
 E. अव् to go, क्विप् affix, व becomes ऊ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=135-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊढ|ऊढः
ऊढ mfn. (-ढः-ढा-ढं)
	 1. Married.
	 2. Carried as load or burthen.
	 f. (-ढा) A
bride, a wife espoused according to the ritual.
 E. वह् to bear, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=135-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊढकङ्कट|ऊढकंकट|ऊढकङ्कटः
ऊढकङ्कट mfn. (-टः-टा-टं) Armed, mailed.
 E. ऊढ borne, कङ्गट armour.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=135-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊत|ऊतं
ऊत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Woven.
 E. वेञ् to weave, affix क्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊति|ऊतिः
ऊति f. (-तिः)
	 1. Preserving, protecting.
	 2. Sewing, weaving.
	 3. Distil-
ling.
	 4. Speed.
	 5. Sport, play.
 E. वेञ् to weave, &c. affix क्तिन्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊधन्य|ऊधन्यं
ऊधन्य mfn. (-न्यः-न्या-न्यं) Produced from the udder, milk, &c.
 E. ऊधस्, यत्
affix, and न substituted for स.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊधस्
ऊधस् n. (-धः) An udder.
 E. वह् to bear, असि affix, deriv. irr.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊधस्य|ऊधस्यं
ऊधस्य n. (-स्यं) Milk.
 E. ऊधस् and यत् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊन|ऊनं
ऊन r. 10th cl. (न) ऊनत् (ऊनयति) 1. To deduct or lessen.
	 2. To mete out
in small quantities.
	 3. To measure.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊन|ऊनं
ऊन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Less in number, size or degree, as fewer, smaller,
inferior, &c.
 E. ऊन to deduct, &c. affix क.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊम्
ऊम् ind. An interjection of, 1. Interrogation.
	 2. Anger.
	 3. Reproach,
abuse.
	 4. Arrogance.
	 n. (-मं) A city.
 E. अव् to preserve, &c. मन्
Unādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊय
ऊय r. 1st cl. (ई) ऊयी (ऊयते) To sew, to weave.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊररी
ऊररी ind.
	 1. A particle of assent.
	 2. Of expansion.
 E. ऊय् to sew, &c.
ररीक् affix: see उररी.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊरव्य|ऊरव्यः
ऊरव्य m. (-व्यः) A man of the third caste or tribe, the merchant or hus-
bandman, the Vaiśya.
 E. ऊरु a thigh, and यत् affix; being born
from the thighs of BRAHMĀ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊरी
ऊरी ind. A particle of, 1. Assent.
	 2. Of expansion: see उरी.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊरीकृत|ऊरीकृतः
ऊरीकृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Promised.
	 2. Expanded.
 E. ऊरी and कृत made:
see उरीकृत.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊरु|ऊरुः
ऊरु m. (-रुः) The thigh.
 E. ऊर्णु to cover, कु aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊरुग्लानि|ऊरुग्लानिः
ऊरुग्लानि f. (-निः) Weakness of the thigh.
 E. ऊरु and ग्लानि debility.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊरुज|ऊरुजः
ऊरुज m. (-जः) A Vaiśya or man of the third tribe.
 E. ऊरु and ज born;
from the thigh of BRAHMĀ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊरुदघ्न
ऊरुदघ्न mfn. (-घ्नः-घ्ना-घ्नं) As high as the thigh.
 E. ऊरु and दघ्नच् affix; also
ऊरुद्वयस and ऊरुमात्र, with द्वयसच् and मात्रच् affs.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊरुपर्व्वन्|ऊरुपर्वन्
ऊरुपर्व्वन् n. (-र्व्व) The knee.
 E. ऊरु and पर्व्वन् a joint.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊरुरी
ऊरुरी ind. A particle of, 1. Promise.
	 2. Of expansion: see ऊररी.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊरुस्तम्भ|ऊरुस्तम्भः
ऊरुस्तम्भ m. (-म्भः)
	 1. Paralysis of the lower extremities.
	 2. Rheumatism
of the thigh.
	 f. (-म्भा) The plantain tree.
 E. ऊरु and स्तम्भ a post.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्ज्
ऊर्ज् f. (-ऊर्क्) Strength, vigour.
 E. ऊर्ज् to be strong, क्विप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्ज|ऊर्जः|ऊर्ज्ज|ऊर्ज्जं|ऊर्ज्जः
ऊर्ज r. 10th cl. (ऊर्जयति)
	 1. To be strong.
	 2. To live.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्ज|ऊर्जः|ऊर्ज्ज|ऊर्ज्जं|ऊर्ज्जः
ऊर्ज m. (-र्जः)
	 1. The month Kartik, (Oct.-Nov.)
	 2. Effort, exertion.
	 3.
Power, strength.
	 4. Breath, breathing.
	 5. Procreative power.
	 n.
(-र्जं) Water.
 E. ऊर्ज to live, क aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्जस्वत्|ऊर्जस्वन्त्|ऊर्ज्जस्वत्
ऊर्जस्वत् mfn. (-स्वान्-स्वती-स्वत्) Strong, vigorous.
 E. ऊर्ज and मतुप् affix,
with स inserted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्जस्वल|ऊर्ज्जस्वलः
ऊर्जस्वल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Strong, powerful.
 E. ऊर्ज strength, वलच् affix,
and स inserted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्जस्विन्
ऊर्जस्विन् mfn. (-स्वी-स्विनी-स्वि) Very strong.
	 n. (-स्वि) Speaking of any
thing with disdain, (a figure of rhetoric.)
 E. ऊर्ज and विनि affix, स
inserted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्जित|ऊर्ज्जित
ऊर्जित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Powerful, mighty, great, excellent.
	 2. Exceed-
ing, much.
 E. ऊर्ज to be strong, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्जिताश्रय|ऊर्ज्जिताश्रय
ऊर्जिताश्रय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Spirited, magnanimous.
 E. ऊर्जित great,
आश्रय receptacle.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्णनाभ|ऊर्णनाभः|ऊर्ण्णनाभ
ऊर्णनाभ m. (-भः) A spider.
 E. ऊर्ण wool, नाभि the navel, ड affix; also
ऊर्णनाभि, the final being retained.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्णा
ऊर्णा f. (-र्णा)
	 1. Wool, felt, &c., the hair of sheep, deer, camels, &c.
	 2.
A circle of the hair between the eyebrows, considered as a token
of greatness.
 E. ऊर्णु to cover, ड and टाप् affs.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्णामय|ऊर्ण्णामय
ऊर्णामय mfn. (-यः-यी-यं) Woolen, made of wool.
 E. ऊर्णा and मयट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्णायु|ऊर्णायुः|ऊर्ण्णायु
ऊर्णायु m. (-युः)
	 1. A woollen blanket.
	 2. A ram.
	 3. A spider.
 E. ऊर्णा
wool, युस् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्णु|ऊर्ण्णु
ऊर्णु r. 2nd cl. (ञ) ऊर्णुञ् (ऊर्णौति ऊर्णोति or ऊर्णुते) To cover, hide, con-
ceal, &c. with प्र prefixed प्रोर्णौति.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्णुत
ऊर्णुत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Covered.
 E. ऊर्णु and क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्द्दर|ऊर्दर|ऊर्दरं|ऊर्दरः|ऊर्द्दरः
ऊर्द्दर m. (-रः)
	 1. A hero, a champion.
	 2. A Rākṣasa, a goblin or fiend.
E. ऊर्ज to be strong, दरल Unādi affix; ज is dropped.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्द्ध
ऊर्द्ध mfn. (-र्द्धः-र्द्धा-र्द्धं)
	 1. Above, upper.
	 2. High, elevated.
	 3. Abandoned:
see ऊर्द्ध्व.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्द्धक
ऊर्द्धक m. (-कः) A kind of drum: see ऊर्द्ध्वक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्द्ध्व
ऊर्द्ध्व mfn. (-र्द्ध्वः-र्द्ध्वा-र्द्ध्वं)
	 1. Above, superior, upper.
	 2. High.
	 3. Aban-
doned.
	 4. After, subsequent.
 E. ऊर् substituted for उद्
above, हा to leave, and ड्व affix, or with ड only ऊर्द्ध.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्द्ध्वक
ऊर्द्ध्वक m. (-कः) A kind of drum.
 E. ऊर्द्ध्व or ऊर्द्ध्व up, and क what sounds;
from its making a loud noise, or being elevated in playing; also
ऊर्द्धक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्द्ध्वकाय
ऊर्द्ध्वकाय m. (-यः) The upper part of the body.
 E. ऊर्द्ध्व and काय body.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्द्ध्वग
ऊर्द्ध्वग mfn. (-गः-गा-गं) Going up or above; ascending, hovering.
 E. ऊर्द्ध्व
and ग what goes; also ऊर्द्ध्वगामिन्, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्द्ध्वगत
ऊर्द्ध्वगत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Gone up, risen, ascended.
 E. ऊर्द्ध्व, गत gone.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्द्ध्वगति
ऊर्द्ध्वगति f. (-तिः) Ascent, elevation.
 E. ऊर्द्ध्व and गति going.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्द्ध्वगपुर
ऊर्द्ध्वगपुर n. (-रं) The city of HARISCHANDRA, who with his subjects is
supposed to be suspended in the atmosphere.
 E. ऊर्द्ध्वग going above,
and पुर a city: see हरिश्चन्द्रपुर.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्द्ध्वगम
ऊर्द्ध्वगम m. (-मः) Upward motion of any kind
 E. ऊर्द्ध्व and गम going;
also ऊर्द्ध्वगति.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्द्ध्वचरण
ऊर्द्ध्वचरण mfn. (-णः-णा-णं) Supine, heels upwards.
 E. ऊर्द्ध्व and चरण the
foot; also ऊर्द्ध्वपाद, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्द्ध्वजानु
ऊर्द्ध्वजानु mfn. (-नुः-नुः-नु)
	 1. Thick-kneed, long-shanked.
	 2. Sitting on the
hams.
 E. ऊर्द्ध्व high, large, जानु the knee, and with कन् added
ऊर्द्ध्वजानुक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्द्ध्वज्ञ
ऊर्द्ध्वज्ञ mfn. (-ज्ञः-ज्ञा-ज्ञं) Thick-kneed: see the preceding.
 E. ऊर्द्ध्व and
ज्ञ substituted for जानु; also ऊर्द्ध्वज्ञु.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्द्ध्वज्ञु
ऊर्द्ध्वज्ञु mfn. (-ज्ञुः-ज्ञुः-ज्ञु) See the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=136-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्द्ध्वत्व
ऊर्द्ध्वत्व n. (-त्वं) Height, elevation.
 E. त्व added to ऊर्द्ध्व; also with तल् ऊर्द्ध्वता.
