ऊर्द्ध्वस्थिति
ऊर्द्ध्वस्थिति f. (-तिः)
	 1. A horse's back, the part where the rider sits.
	 2.
Elevation, superiority.
 E. ऊर्द्ध्व above, and स्थिति being, staying.
