ऊर्द्ध्वासित
ऊर्द्ध्वासित m. (-तः) The name of a vegetable, (Momordica charantia.) E.
ऊर्द्ध्व above, आसित thrown: raised above other fruits.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
