<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊषण|ऊषणं|ऊषणः
ऊषण n. (-णं) Black pepper.
	 f. (-णा) Long pepper: see उषण.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊषर|ऊषरः
ऊषर mfn. (-रः-रा-री-रं) A spot with saline soil.
 E. ऊष such soil, रच् aff.
