<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊह|ऊहः
ऊह r. 1st cl. (ऊहते) To reason, to apprehend and infer: with प्र and वि
to intermit; with वि, to array in order of battle; with सम् prefixed,
(समूहति or -ते) to assemble or to be assembled.
