ऊह|ऊहः
ऊह mfn. (-हः-हा-हं)
	 1. Reasoning.
	 2. Completing a defective sentence
or verse, supplying an ellipsis.
 E. ऊह् to deliberate, घञ् affix, or
with ल्युट् affix, ऊहन.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊहन|ऊहनं
ऊहन n. (-नं) Reasoning, inferring, concluding.
 E. ऊह् to deliberate,
affix ल्युट्.
