<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊहनी
ऊहनी f. (-नी) A broom.
 E. वह् to carry, ल्युट् and ङीष् affixes; व is chang-
ed to ऊ.
