ऊहिन्
ऊहिन् mfn. (-ही-हिनी-हि)
	 1. Who or what reasons.
	 2. Who or what
assembles.
	 f. (-णी) An assemblage, a collection.
 E. ऊह reasoning,
इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊह्य
ऊह्य mfn. (-ह्यः-ह्या-ह्यं) To be investigated, to be supplied.
 E. ऊह् to
reason, यत् aff.
