ऋक्थग्राह mfn. (-हः-हा-हं) Who inherits or takes property.
	 m. (-हः) in-
heriting or receiving property.
 E. ऋक्थ and ग्रह् to take, with घञ्
affix; also with णिनि, ऋक्थग्राहिन् mfn. (-ही-हिणी-हि.)
