ऋक्थहर mfn. (-रः-री-रं) An heir, a coheir.
 E. ऋक्थ and हर who takes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्थहारिन्
