<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्संहिता
ऋक्संहिता f. (-ता) The collection of the prayers and hymns of the Rik
Veda.
 E. ऋच् and संहिता compendium.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
