ऋज
ऋज r. 1st cl. (अर्जते)
	 1. To go.
	 2. To stand or be firm.
	 3. To be strong.
4. To acquire, to gain or earn.
	 5. To live. With a prefix ending in
अ, the radical vowel is changed to आर्, as in the pass. voice,
(प्रार्ज्यते) (इ) ऋनि (ऋजते) To fry.
