ऋतु|ऋतुः
ऋतु m. (-तुः)
	 1. A season, (the Hindu year is divided into six seasons,
each consisting of two months.)
	 2. The menstrual evacuation.
3. The time favourable for procreation, or sixteen days in each
month.
	 4. A month.
	 5. A kind of collyrium.
	 6. Light.
 E. ऋ to go,
तु Unādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतुकाल|ऋतुकालः
ऋतुकाल m. (-लः)
	 1. The duration of a season.
	 2. The period of menstru-
ation.
	 3. The period favourable for procreation, sixteen days in
each month.
 E. ऋतु and काल time.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतुगण|ऋतुगणः
ऋतुगण m. (-णः) The seasons collectively.
 E. ऋतु and गण a class.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतुपर्य्याय|ऋतुपर्याय|ऋतुपर्यायः
ऋतुपर्य्याय m. (-यः) The revolution of the season.
 E. ऋतु and पर्य्याय
revolution.
