<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतुसात्म्य
ऋतुसात्म्य n. (-त्म्यं) Diet, &c. suited to the season.
 E. ऋतु and सात्म्य suitableness.
