ऋत्वन्त|ऋत्वन्तः
ऋत्वन्त m. (-न्तः) The close of a season.
	 2. The termination of menstru-
ation.
 E. ऋतु and अन्त term.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋत्विज्
ऋत्विज् m. (-त्विक्)
	 1. A domestic chaplain, a family priest.
 E. ऋतु a
season, यज् to worship, affix क्विन्, deriv. irr.
