ऋद्ध|ऋद्धं|ऋद्धः
ऋद्ध mfn. (-द्धः-द्धा-द्धं) Prosperous, thriving, rising, &c.
	 n. (-द्धं)
	 1. Stored
grain.
	 2. A demonstrated conclusion, a distinct result.
 E. ऋघ् to
grow, &c. affix क्त.
