ऋद्धि|ऋद्धिः
ऋद्धि f. (-द्धिः)
	 1. A medicinal plant; also सिद्धि.
	 2. Increase, growth.
3. Fortune, prosperity.
	 4. A name of the goddess PARVATI.
 E. ऋध
to grow, &c., क्तिन् aff.
