<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋध
ऋध r. 4th cl. (उ) ऋधु (ऋध्यति) To increase, to grow, to flourish, to
prosper. r. 5th cl. (ऋध्नोति)
	 1. To increase, &c.
	 2. To augment or
make increase.
	 3. To please.
