<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋभु|ऋभुः
ऋभु m. (-भुः)
	 1. A deity.
	 2. A divinity of a particular order.
 E. ऋ the
mother of the gods, भू to be, डु affix; also रिभु.
