ऋभुक्ष|ऋभुक्षः
ऋभुक्ष m. (-क्षः)
	 1. A name of INDRA.
	 2. INDRA'S heaven or paradise.
	 3.
The thunderbolt of INDRA.
 E. ऋभु a deity, क्षि to waste, to go, ड aff.
