<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऌ
ऌ aptote.
	 1. The divine nature.
	 2. The earth.
	 3. A mountain. ind. A
mystical letter.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=139-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ॡ
ॡ The long vowel corresponding to the preceding short one, Lri or Li.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=139-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ॡ
ॡ aptote.
	 1. A divine female.
	 2. The female nature.
	 3. A mother.
	 m.
(ॡः) A name of ŚIVA.
	 f. (ॡः)
	 1. The mother of the demons.
	 2.
The mother of the all-bestowing cow. ind. A mystical letter used
once or repeatedly in many Mantras or mystical formulæ. The
letters ॠ and ॡ are employed in the same manner: they have ap-
parently no signification, but are personified and invested with
marvellous properties in the Tantras.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=139-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ए
ए The eleventh vowel of the alphabet, corresponding to the letter E
as pronounced in most languages except the English, and having
the sound of A in amiable.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=139-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ए
ए ind. An interjection of, 1. Remembering, (ha.)
	 2. Censure or con-
tempt.
	 3. Compassion, (ah!)
	 4. Addressing, (eh! hey.)
	 5. Calling,
(hey, ho.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=139-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ए
ए m. (-एः) A name of VIṢṆU.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=139-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एक|एकं|एकः
एक mfn. (-कः-का-कं)
	 1. One.
	 2. Alone, solitary.
	 3. Other, different.
	 4.
Chief, pre-eminent.
 E. इण् to go, Unādi affix कन्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=139-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकऋक्थिन्
एकऋक्थिन् m. (-थी) A coheir.
 E. एक one (father,) ऋक्थिन् heir.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=139-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकक|एककः
एकक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Alone, solitary.
 E. एक one, &c. कन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=139-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एककर
एककर mfn. (-रः-रा-री-रं)
	 1. Making one.
	 2. One-handed.
	 3. One-rayed.
E. एक and कर making, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=139-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एककार्य्य|एककार्य
एककार्य्य mfn. (-र्य्यः-र्य्या-र्य्यं) Performing the same office, answering the
same end.
 E. एक and कार्य्य act.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=139-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एककाल|एककालः
एककाल m. (-लः) One or the same time.
 E. एक and काल time.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=139-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एककालभोजन
एककालभोजन n. (-नं) Eating but one meal in any given time.
 E. एककाल
and भोजन food.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=139-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एककालीन
एककालीन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Coeval, contemporary.
 E. एक and कालीन relating to time.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=139-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एककुण्डल|एककुण्डलः
एककुण्डल m. (-लः)
	 1. A name of BALARĀMA.
	 2. An epithet of KUVERA.
E. एक and कुण्डल an ear-ring: wearing it in one ear.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=139-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकक्षीर
एकक्षीर n. (-रं) The milk of one (nurse; &c.)
 E. एक and क्षीर milk.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=139-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकगुरु|एकगुरुः
एकगुरु m. (-रुः) A spiritual brother, pupil of the same preceptor.
 E. एक
and गुरु a religious preceptor; also with कन् added एकगुरुक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=139-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकग्रामीण
एकग्रामीण mfn. (-णः-णा-णं) Of the same town or village.
 E. एक one,
ग्रामीण villager.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=139-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकचक्र|एकचक्रं|एकचक्रः
एकचक्र m. (-क्रः) The name of a city: see हरिगृह.
 E. एक, चक्र a circle.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=139-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकचर|एकचरः
एकचर mfn. (-रः-रा-री-रं)
	 1. Solitary, alone.
	 2. Having one follower.
	 m.
(-रः) A rhinoceros.
 E. एक alone, and चर who goes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=139-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकचारिन्
एकचारिन् mfn. (-री-रिणी-रि) Going alone or with one follower only.
	 m.
(-री) A follower of BUDDHA.
 E. एक one, चर् to go, णिनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=139-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकचित्त
एकचित्त mfn. (-त्तः-त्ता-त्तं)
	 1. Thinking of one thing only, intent upon,
absorbed in.
	 2. Of one mind, agreeing, concurring.
 E. एक one, चित्त
the mind.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=139-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकजन्मन्
एकजन्मन् m. (-न्मा)
	 1. A king, a sovereign.
	 2. A Śūdra.
 E. एक best or one,
जन्मन् birth.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकजात
एकजात mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Of one parentage, born of the same parents. E.
एक and जात born.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकजाति|एकजातिः
एकजाति mfn. (-तिः-तिः-ति)
	 1. Of the same caste.
	 2. Once born.
	 m. (-तः)
A Śūdra.
 E. एक one, and जाति birth or caste: not being regenerat-
ed by investiture, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकज्या
एकज्या f. (-ज्या)
	 1. The chord of an arc.
	 2. Sine of 30° or of the radius.
E. एक and ज्या a cord.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकतम|एकतमः
एकतम mfn. (-मः-मा-मं) One of many.
 E. एक and डतमच् affix of the
superlative.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकतर|एकतरः
एकतर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं)
	 1. Either, one of two.
	 2. Other, different.
 E. एक
and डतरच् affix of the comparative.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकतस्
एकतस् ind. On one side, on one part.
 E. एक and तसिल् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकता
एकता f. (-ता) Unity, oneness.
 E. एक and तल् affix. or with त्व aff. एकत्व n. (-त्वं)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकतान|एकतानः
एकतान mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Closely attentive, having the mind fixed on one
only object.
	 m. (-नः) Musical unison: see the next.
 E. एक, तन् to
stretch or spread, घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकताल|एकतालः
एकताल m. (-लः) Harmony, unison, the accurate adjustment of song,
dance, and instrumental music.
	 f. (-ली) An instrument for beating
time, any instrument having but one note.
 E. एक one, uniform,
and ताल musical measure or time.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकतीर्थिन्
एकतीर्थिन् m. (-र्थी) A spiritual brother, an associate in religious offices
or objects.
 E. एक one, the same, तीर्थ place of pilgrimage, इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकत्र
एकत्र ind. Together, in one, in one place.
 E. एक and त्रल् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकदंष्ट्र|एकदंष्ट्रः
एकदंष्ट्र m. (-ष्ट्रः) A name of GANESA.
 E. एक and दंष्ट्र a tooth, single
toothed or tusked; the fellow being broken off in a scuffle by
KARTIKEYA, or according to another legend by PARSURAMA; also
एकदन्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकदन्त|एकदंत|एकदन्तः
एकदन्त m. (-न्तः) A name of GANESA: see the preceding.
 E. एक and दन्त a tooth.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकदा
एकदा ind. At the same time, at once.
 E. एक and दाच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकदुःखसुख
एकदुःखसुख mfn. (-खः-खा-खं) Sympathizing, having the same joys and
sorrows.
 E. एक, and दुःख pain, सुख pleasure.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकदृश्
एकदृश् mfn. (-दृक्) One-eyed.
	 m. (-दृक्)
	 1. A name of MAHADEVA.
	 2. A
crow.
 E. एक and दृश् an eye: ŚIVA is termed one-eyed, from the eye
in his forehead.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकदेश|एकदेशः
एकदेश m. (-शः) A part, a portion, a division.
 E. एक and देश place.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकदेह|एकदेहः
एकदेह mfn. (-हः-हा-हं)
	 1. Elegatnly formed.
	 2. Single bodied.
	 m. (-हः)
The planet MERCURY.
 E. एक best or one, and देह body.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकधा
एकधा ind. In one way.
 E. एक and धाच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकधुर्
एकधुर् f. (-धूः) A particular burthen or conveyance.
 E. एक and धुर् a load.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकधुर|एकधुरः
एकधुर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Cattle for special burthen, fit for but one kind of
labour. E. See एकधुरीण.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकधुरावह|एकधुरावहः
एकधुरावह mfn. (-हः-हा-हं) See the preceding.
 E. एक, धुर burthen, and
आवह who bears.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकधुरीण|एकधुरीणः
एकधुरीण mfn. (-णः-णा-णं) Cattle of special burthen.
 E. एक, धुर a burthen,
ख affix which leaves ईण, or with अ affix forming एकधुर.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकनट|एकनटः
एकनट m. (-टः) The principal actor in a drama, the manager.
 E. एक
chief, and नट an actor.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकनाथ|एकनाथः
एकनाथ mfn. (-थः-था-थं) Having one master.
	 m. (-थः) Sole master or lord.
E. एक and नाथ lord.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपक्ष|एकपक्षः
एकपक्ष mfn. (-क्षः-क्षा-क्षं) An associate, a firm ally or partizan.
 E. एक one,
पक्ष part: of the same side or party.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपत्नी
एकपत्नी f. (-त्नी)
	 1. A faithful wife, one devoted to her husband.
	 2. The
wife of a man who has no other wives.
 E. एक one or excellent, पति
a husband, न substituted for the final, and ङीप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपत्रिका
एकपत्रिका f. (-का) A plant, white basil,
 E. एक end, पत्र a leaf.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपद|एकपदं|एकपदः
एकपद adv.
	 n. (-दं) Then, at that time, at once.
	 m. (-दः) A single inflec-
tion of a verb or noun.
	 f. (-दी) A road, a path or way.
 E. एक one,
पद a foot, fem. affix ङीप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपरि
एकपरि ind. One over, a term at dice.
 E. एक and परि over, against.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपात
एकपात mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Sudden, rapid, coming suddenly or at once. E.
एक and पात falling upon.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपाद्
एकपाद् m. (-त्) A name of ŚIVA.
 E. एक best, and पाद् a ray.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपिङ्ग|एकपिंग|एकपिङ्गः
एकपिङ्ग m. (-ङ्गः) A name of KUVERA.
 E. एक one, and पिङ्ग tawny: hav-
ing a yellow mark in the place of one of his eyes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपिङ्गल|एकपिंगल|एकपिङ्गलः
एकपिङ्गल m. (-लः) See the preceding. E. As before.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपिण्ड|एकपिंड
एकपिण्ड mfn. (-ण्डः-ण्डा-ण्डं) Related, near of kin, united by the offering
of the funeral cake.
 E. एक and पिण्ड a funeral cake.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपिण्डता
एकपिण्डता f. (-ता) Connexion by the funeral cake, consanguinity.
 E. एक-
पिण्ड and तल् affix; also with त्व, एकपिण्डत्वं.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकफल
एकफल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Having one or a principal result or object. E.
