<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकान्तस्थित
एकान्तस्थित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Staying alone or apart.
 E. एकान्त and स्थित
staying.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाब्दा
एकाब्दा f. (-ब्दा) A heifer one year old.
 E. एक and अब्द a year.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकायन|एकायनः
एकायन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Closely attentive, intent.
 E. एक, अयन going.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकायनगत|एकायनगतः
एकायनगत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) See the preceding.
 E. एकायन and गत being,
having gone.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकावली
एकावली f. (-ली) A single string of beads, flowers, &c.
 E. एक and आवली a row.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकार्थ|एकार्थः
एकार्थ mfn. (-र्थः-र्था-र्थं)
	 1. Having one sense or meaning.
	 2. Having one
or the same object.
 E. एक and अर्थ meaning.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाश्रितगुण|एकाश्रितगुणः
एकाश्रितगुण m. (-णः) A simple attribute or predicate, as form, taste,
smell, &c.
 E. एक one, आश्रित invested, गुण property.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाष्टी
एकाष्टी f. (-ष्टी) A pod or seed of cotton.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाष्टील
एकाष्टील m. (-लः) A plant: see वकपुष्प; the flowers are sacred to ŚIVA.
f. (-ली) A medicinal plant, (Cissampelos hexandra.)
 E. एक best,
अष्टि seed, and ल what gives or takes, from ला with क aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाह|एकाहः
एकाह n. (-हं) The period of one day.
 E. एक and अहन् a day.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाहगम
एकाहगम m. (-मः) A day's journey.
 E. एकाह and गम going.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकीभाव|एकीभावः
एकीभाव m. (-वः) Common nature or property.
 E. एक with च्वि augment,
and भाव nature.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकीय|एकीयः
एकीय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) A companion, a partizan or associate.
 E. एक one,
and छण् affix. also एकपक्ष.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकैक
एकैक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Single, one by one
 E. एक repeated.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकैकशस्
एकैकशस् ind. One by one, severally, seriatim.
 E. एक repeated, with
शसि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकोद्दिष्ट|एकोद्दिष्टं
एकोद्दिष्ट n. (-ष्टं) The Sraddha or funeral rite offered to one person
only.
 E. एक and उद्दिष्ट addressed to.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकोशिका
एकोशिका f. (-का) A plant, (Cissampelos hexandra:) see एकाष्टील.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकौघभूत
एकौघभूत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Heaped, crowded together.
 E. एक one, ओघ
quantity, भूत become.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एज
एज r. 1st cl. (ऋ) (एजृ) (एजते) To shine. (एजति) To shake or tremble.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एजन|एजनं
एजन n. (-नं) Shaking, trembling.
 E. एज् and ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एजयत्
एजयत् mfn. (-यन्-यन्ती-यत्) Causing to shake or tremble.
 E. एज् to shake,
causal form, शतृ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एजित
एजित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Shaken, trembling.
 E. एज् to shake, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एजितव्य
एजितव्य mfn. (-व्यः-व्या-व्यं) To be shaken.
 E. एज and तव्य aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एजितृ
एजितृ mfn. (-ता-त्री-तृ) Shaking, trembling.
 E. एज् and तृच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एठ
एठ r. 1st cl. (एठते) To annoy, to resist or oppose.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एड|एडः
एड mfn. (-डः-डा-डं) Deaf.
 E. ईड् to praise, आङ् prefixed, अच् or घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एडक|एडकः
एडक m. (-कः)
	 1. A ram.
	 2. A wild goat.
	 f. (-का) A ewe.
 E. ईल् to go,
ण्वुल् affix; and ल changed to ड.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एडगज|एडगजः
एडगज m. (-जः) A medicinal plant, used for the cure of ring-worms,
(Cassia tora.)
 E. एड a sheep, गज to sound, अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एडमूक|एडमूकः
एडमूक mfn. (-कः-का-कं)
	 1. Deaf and dumb.
	 2. Wicked, perverse.
 E. एड
deaf, and मूक dumb.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एडुक|एडुकं|एडुकः
एडुक n. (-कं)
	 1. A building constructed of rubbish, bones, &c.
	 2. A
wall enclosing bones, a tomb, &c.
	 3. A building of hard subs-
tances resembling bones.
 E. ईड to throw or send, deriv. irr.; also
एडूक and एडोक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एण|एणः
एण mf. (-णः-णी) A kind of deer or antelope, described as being of a
black colour, with beautiful eyes, and short legs.
 E. इण् to go,
ण aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एणक|एणकः
एणक m. (-कः) A species of deer or antelope: see the preceding.
 E. कन्
added to एण.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एणतिलक|एणतिलकः
एणतिलक m. (-कः) The moon.
 E. एण an antelope, and तिलक the secta-
rial mark; a deer being fancifully visible in the moon.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एणभृत्
एणभृत् m. (-त्) The moon.
 E. एण and भृत् who nourishes: see the
preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एणाजिन
एणाजिन n. (-नं) A deer-skin.
 E. एण and अजिन the same.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एत|एतं|एतः
एत mfn. (-तः-ता or -ती-तं) Of a variegated colour. (-तः-ता-तं) Arrived,
come.
	 m. (-तः)
	 1. A deer or antelope.
	 2. A variegated colour.
 E. इण्
to go, तन् affix; when signifying colour, the fem. affix is either
टाप् or ङीप्, and before the latter, त is changed to न.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतद्
एतद् pron.
	 mfn. (एषः एषा एतद् or एतत्) This.
 E. एत derived from इण् to
go, and तद् Unādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतन|एतनः
एतन m. (-नः) Expiration, breathing out, discharging air from the
lungs.
 E. इण् to go, तनन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतर्हि
एतर्हि ind. Now, at this time.
 E. एत substituted for इदम्. and र्हिल् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतश|एतशः
एतश m. (-शः) A Brahman.
 E. इण् to go, and तश Unādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतशस्
एतशस् m. (-शाः) A Brahman or man of the first class.
 E. इण् to go, तशस् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतादृश्
एतादृश् mfn. (-दृक्) Such, such like.
 E. एतद् this. दृश् to see, क्विप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतादृश
एतादृश mfn. (-शः-शी-शं) Such, such like.
 E. एतद् this, दृश् to see, कञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतावत्|एतावन्त्
एतावत् mfn. (-वान्-वती-वत्) So many, so much, so far. ind. (-वत्) So far,
thus far, so much, &c.
 E. एतद्, and मतुप् or वति aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एत्य
एत्य ind. Having gone to or approached.
 E. इण् to go, ल्यप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एध|एधः
एध r. 1st cl. (एधते) To grow or increase.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एध|एधः
एध m. (-धः) Fuel, as wood, grass, &c.
 E. एध् to increase, घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एधतु|एधतुः
एधतु mfn. (-तुः-तुः-तु) Increased, grown.
	 m. (-तुः)
	 1. Man.
	 2. Fire.
 E. एध्
to increase, तु Unādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एधनीय
एधनीय mfn. (-तः-या-यं) To be enlarged or increased.
 E. एध् to grow, and
अनीयर् affix; also एधितव्य and एध्य.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एधस्
एधस् n. (-धः) Fuel: see एध.
 E. एध् to grow, Unādi affix असुन्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एधित|एधितः
एधित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Increased, grown.
 E. एध् to increase, affix क्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एधितृ
एधितृ mfn. (-ता-त्री-तृ) Increasing, growing, enlarging.
 E. एध् to grow,
and तृच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एनस्
एनस् n. (एनः)
	 1. Sin, fault, offence.
	 2. Censure, blame.
 E. इण् to go,
असुन् Unādi affix, and नुम् inserted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एनस्विन्
एनस्विन् mfn. (-स्वी-स्विनी-स्वि) Sinful, a sinner.
 E. एनस् and विनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एरका
एरका f. (-का) A sort of grass of emollient and diluent properties.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एरङ्ग|एरंगः|एरङ्गः
एरङ्ग m. (-ङ्गः) A kind of fish; also एलङ्ग.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एरण्ड|एरंडः|एरण्डः
एरण्ड m. (-ण्डः) The castor-oil plant, (Palma christi or Ricinus com-
munis. )
	 f. (-ण्डी) Long pepper.
 E. इर् to go, &c. आङ् prefixed, अण्डच्
affix, fem. affix ङीष्; also with कन् added एरण्डक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एरण्डक|एरंडकः|एरण्डकः
एरण्डक m. (-कः) Palma christi: see the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एरण्डपत्रिका
एरण्डपत्रिका f. (-का) A plant, commonly Danti.
 E. एरण्ड, and पत्र leaf,
having similar leaves.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एरण्डफला
एरण्डफला f. (-ला) A plant: see the preceding.
 E. एरण्ड, and फल fruit.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एर्वारु|एर्वारुः|एर्व्वारुः
एर्वारु m. (-रुः) A kind of cucumber, (Cucumis utilatissimus.) E. See
ईर्व्वारु.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एलक|एलकः
एलक m. (-कः) A ram: see एडक.
 E. ड and ल being interchanged.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एलङ्ग|एलंगः|एलङ्गः
एलङ्ग m. (-ङ्गः) A sort of fish, (Cyprinus marginatus, BUCH.) Also एरङ्ग.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एलवालु
एलवालु n. (-लु) The name of a perfume: see the next word.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एलवालुक
एलवालुक n. (-कं) A granular substance apparently vegetable, of a red-
dish brown colour, and used as a drug and as a perfume.
 E. एला
cardamoms, वल् to breathe, उण् affix, and कन् added, or without
कन्, एलवालु.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एलविल|एलविलः
एलविल m. (-लः) A name of KUVERA: see ऐलविल.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एला
एला f. (-ला) Cardamoms, the seed of the Eletteria cardamomum, or
Alpinia Cardamomum: it applies to both the large and small
cardamom, but most commonly to the former.
 E. इल् to send, &c.
अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एलापत्र|एलापत्रः
एलापत्र m. (-त्रः) One of the chiefs of the Nagas or serpent-race.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एलापर्णी|एलापर्ण्णी
एलापर्णी f. (-र्णी) A plant, (Mimosa octandra.)
 E. एला cardamoms, and
पर्ण a leaf, ङीष् fem. aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एलीका
एलीका f. (-का) Small cardamoms.
 E. एला, and ईकन् added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एव|एवं|एवः
एव mfn. (एवः एवा एवं) Going, moving. ind. As, like, &c.: see एवम्.
 E. इण्
to go, Uṇādi affix वन्: see the next.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एवम्
एवम् ind. A particle implying, 1. Likeness, (as, so, like.)
	 2. Assent,
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-b" target="_blank">Page142-b+ 55</a>]
(yes, verily.)
	 3. Sameness of manner, (thus, in this way.)
	 4.
Certainly, (indeed, assuredly, even so.)
	 5. Command, (so, thus,
&c.)
	 6. An expletive.
 E. इण् to go, वम् affix; also एव.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एवम्भूत|एवंभूत
एवम्भूत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) So such, in such manner.
 E. एवम्, and भूत been.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एवम्विध
एवम्विध mfn. (-धः-धा-धं) Such, in such form or manner, of such a kind
E. एवम्, and विध sort, way.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एष|एषः
एष r. 1st. cl. (ऋ) एषृ (एषते) To go or approach.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एषण|एषणः
एषण m. (-णः) An iron arrow.
	 f. (-णी)
	 1. A goldsmith's balance, assay
scales.
	 2. An iron or steel probe.
 E. एष् to go, ल्युट् and ङीष् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एषणिका
एषणिका f. (-का) A goldsmith's balance. E. As before, with कन् and टाप्
added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एषणीय
एषणीय mfn. (-यः-या-यं)
	 1. To be desired, desirable.
	 2. To be aimed at.
E. इष् to wish, affix अनीयर्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एषा
एषा f. (-षा) Desire.
 E. इष् to wish, अङ् and टाप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एषितृ
एषितृ mfn. (-ता-त्री-तृ) Wishing, desirous.
 E. इष् to wish, तृच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एष्टृ
एष्टृ mfn. (-ष्टा-ष्ट्री-ष्टृ) Wishing, desirous.
 E. इष् to wish, तृच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐ
ऐ The twelfth vowel of the Nagari alphabet, or more properly a
diphthong; corresponding in sound to Ei in height.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐ
ऐ ind. An interjection of, 1. Remembering, (aye, ha)
	 2. Calling,
summoning, (hola, ho, heigh.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐ
ऐ m. (ऐः) A name of ŚIVA.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐकध्य|ऐकध्यं
ऐकध्य n. (-ध्यं) Singleness of time or occurrence.
 E. एक, and ध्यमुञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐकमत्य|ऐकमत्यं
ऐकमत्य n. (-त्यं) Consent, concurrence, sameness of doctrine or opinion.
E. एक one, मत minded, ष्यञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐकशफ
ऐकशफ mfn. (-फः-फा-फं) Produced by or belonging to animals with
single hoofs.
 E. एकशफ, and अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐकागारिक|ऐकागारिकः
ऐकागारिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं)
	 1. A thief, a robber.
	 2. The possessor of one
residence.
 E. एक one, अगार a house, affix ठक्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐकाग्र्य|ऐकाग्र्यं
ऐकाग्र्य n. (-ग्र्यं) Intentness on one object.
 E. एकाग्र, and ष्यञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐकान्यिक|ऐकान्यिकः
ऐकान्यिक m. (-कः) One who commits a single error in reading.
 E. एक
and अन्य other, ठक् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐकाहिक|ऐकाहिकं
ऐकाहिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Ephemeral, quotidian, of one day, of the
same day.
 E. एक and अहन् a day, ठञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐक्य|ऐक्यं
ऐक्य n. (-क्यं)
	 1. Unity, oneness.
	 2. A whole of various parts, an aggre-
gate, a total.
 E. एक, and ष्यञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐक्षव|ऐक्षवं
ऐक्षव mfn. (-वः-वी-वं) Sugar, sugary, produced from or relating to the
sugar-cane.
 E. इक्षु sugar-cane, अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐक्षुक|ऐक्षुकः
ऐक्षुक m. (-कः) A carrier of sugar-canes.
 E. इक्षु, and ठञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐक्षुभारिक
ऐक्षुभारिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Carrying sugar-canes.
 E. इक्षु, and भार a load,
ठञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐक्ष्वाक|ऐक्ष्वाकः
ऐक्ष्वाक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Of the family of IKSHWAKU.
 E. ईक्ष्वाकु, and अञ्
affix, the final rejected.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐक्ष्वाकव
ऐक्ष्वाकव mfn. (-वः-वी-वं) Of the family of IKSHWAKU.
 E. ईक्ष्वाकु, and
अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐङ्गुद|ऐंगुद|ऐङ्गुदं
ऐङ्गुद n. (-दं) The fruit of the plant called Inguda.
 E. इङ्गुद the plant,
affix अण्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐच्छिक
ऐच्छिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Optional, voluntary, at will.
 E. इच्छा wish, ठञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐडुक|ऐडुकं
ऐडुक n. (-कं) A wall, &c. of bones and rubbish: see एडुक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐण|ऐणं
ऐण mfn. (-णः-णी-णं) Belonging to a male antelope.
 E. एण an antelope,
अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐणिक|ऐणिकः
ऐणिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Belonging to a deer, &c.
	 m. (-कः) A hunter, a
deer-killer.
 E. एण, and ठञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐणेय|ऐणेयं|ऐणेयः
ऐणेय mfn. (-यः-यी-यं) Appertaining to a doe or the female antelope. E.
एणी a doe, affix ढक्.
