<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐन्दव|ऐंदव|ऐन्दवं|ऐन्दवः
ऐन्दव mfn. (-वः-वी-वं) Lunar.
	 n. (-वं) The asterism Mrigasiras.
	 f. (-वी) A
plant, (Serratula anthelmintica.)
 E. इन्दु the moon, अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐन्द्र|ऐंद्र|ऐन्द्रं|ऐन्द्रः
ऐन्द्र mfn. (-न्द्रः-न्द्रा-न्द्रं) Sacred, or relating to the god INDRA.
	 m. (-न्द्रः)
1. A name of the monkey king BALI.
	 2. A name of ARJUNA.
	 f.
(-न्द्री)
	 1. The wife of INDRA.
	 2. The goddess DURGĀ.
	 3. Misfortune,
misery, (personified.)
	 4. The name of a plant, a kind of cucumber,
(Cucumis madraspatanus.)
	 5. The constellation Jyeṣṭha.
	 6. The
east quarter, of which INDRA is regent.
 E. इन्द्र, and अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐन्द्रजालिक|ऐंद्रजालिक|ऐन्द्रजालिकः
ऐन्द्रजालिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Deceptive, illusory.
	 m. (-कः) A juggler. E.
इन्द्रजाल Deception, and ठक् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

