ऐन्द्रियक|ऐंद्रियक|ऐन्द्रियकं
ऐन्द्रियक mfn. (-कः-की-कं)
	 1. Perceptible, perceived, present.
	 2. Of or
belonging to the sense.
 E. इन्द्रिय an organ of sense, and वुञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐरावण|ऐरावणः
ऐरावण m. (-णः) INDRA'S elephant.
 E. इरावत् the ocean, अण् affix of
descent; ocean-born: न is changed irregularly to ण.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐरावत|ऐरावतं|ऐरावतः
ऐरावत m. (-तः)
	 1. INDRA'S elephant.
	 2. The same, considered as the
elephant of the north quarter.
	 3. An orange.
	 4. A fruit, (Arto-
carpus lacucha.)
	 5. A serpent, one of the chiefs of the Naga or
serpent race, inhabiting the infernal regions.
	 f. (-ती)
	 1. Lightning.
2. A particular kind of it.
	 3. The female of INDRA'S elephant.
	 4.
The Ravi river in the Panjab.
	 n. (-तं) INDRA'S bow unbent, the
rainbow.
 E. इरावत् water-having; that is, the ocean, a cloud, &c.
अण् affix implying origin or descent; born from the ocean, (the
elephant,) proceeding from watery clouds, (lightning, &c.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐरिण|ऐरिणं
ऐरिण n. (-णं) Fossil or rock salt.
 E. इरिन् earthly, अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐरेय|ऐरेयं
ऐरेय n. (-यं) A spirituous liquor.
 E. इरा wine, ढक् affix: see मैरेय.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐल|ऐलः
ऐल m. (-लः) The name of a king, also PURURAVA.
 E. इला the wife of
BUDDHA, अण् patronymick affix; the son of ILA.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐलवालुक|ऐलवालुकः
ऐलवालुक n. (-कं) A perfume: see एलवालुक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐलविल|ऐलविलः
ऐलविल m. (-लः) A title of KUVERA.
 E. इलविला the wife of PULASTYA,
and the paternal grand-mother of the deity, affix अण्; also ऐड-
विल, ऐडविड, एलविल, &c. ल and ड being interchanged.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐलेय|ऐलेयं|ऐलेयः
ऐलेय n. (-यं) A perfume: see एलवालुक.
 E. एला cardamoms, ढक् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐश
ऐश mfn. (-शः-शी-शं)
	 1. Divine.
	 2. Regal.
 E. ईश, and अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐशानी
ऐशानी f. (-नी) The north-east quarter.
 E. ईशान ŚIVA, as regent of the
north-east, अण् and ङीष् affs.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐशिक|ऐशिकः
ऐशिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं)
	 1. Divine, heavenly.
	 2. Regal, royal.
 E. ईश,
and ठक् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐश्वर
ऐश्वर mfn. (-रः-री-रं)
	 1. Divine, relating to god, &c.
	 2. Royal, supreme.
E. ईश्वर, and अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐश्वर्य्य|ऐश्वर्य|ऐश्वर्यं|ऐश्वर्य्यं
ऐश्वर्य्य n. (-र्य्यं)
	 1. Super-human power, the divine faculties of omni-
presence, omnipotence, invisibility, &c.
	 2. Supremacy, dominion,
sway, power, might.
 E. ईश्वर a master, a deity, ष्यञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐषमस्
ऐषमस् ind. The present year.
 E. इदम् this, समसण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐषमस्त्य|ऐषमस्त्यः
ऐषमस्त्य mfn. (-स्त्यः-स्त्या-स्त्यं) Of or belonging to the present year. E.
ऐषमस्, and त्यय affix; or with द्यु affix, ऐषमस्तन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐष्टिक
ऐष्टिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Sacrificial, ceremonial.
 E. इष्टि a sacrifice, ठञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐष्टिकपौर्त्तिक|ऐष्टिकपौर्तिक
ऐष्टिकपौर्त्तिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Ceremonial and meritorious, (any act,
&c.)
 E. इष्टापूर्त्त any pious act, ठञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐहलौकिक
ऐहलौकिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Of this world, terrestrial, sublunary. E.
इह here, लोक world, ठञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐहिक|ऐहिकं
ऐहिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Worldly, local, of this world, of this place. E.
इह here, and ठञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओ
ओ The vowel O, and the thirteenth of the Nagari alphabet.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओ
ओ ind.
	 1. A vocative particle, (ho.)
	 2. An interjection of calling, (ho,
hola.)
	 3. Of reminiscence, (ho, ah.)
	 4. Of compassionating,
(ah, oh.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओ
ओ m. (ओः) BRAHMĀ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओं
ॐ ind. The mystical monosyllable Om: see ओम्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओक|ओकं|ओकः
ओक m. (-कः)
	 1. A house.
	 2. An asylum, a refuge: see ओकस्.
	 3. A bird
E. उच् to assemble, क aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओकण|ओकणः
ओकण m. (-णः) A bug; also ओकणि.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओकस्
ओकस् n. (-कः)
	 1. An asylum, a place of refuge.
	 2. A house.
 E. उच् to
collect, असुन् Uṇādi affix, च becomes क.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओकुल|ओकुलः
ओकुल m. (-लः) A cake of flour.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओकोदनी
ओकोदनी f. (-नी) A bug.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओक्कणी
ओक्कणी f. (-णी) A bug.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओख
ओख r. 1st. cl. (ऋ) ओखृ (ओखति) and with a prefix, as प्र प्रोखति)
	 1. To
dry or arid.
	 2. To adorn.
	 3. To be able or competent, to suffice.
4. To refuse or prevent.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओघ|ओघः
ओघ m. (-घः)
	 1. A heap or quantity, flock or multitude.
	 2. A stream,
a torrent, rapid flow of water, an inundation.
	 3. Quick time in
music.
	 4. Tradition.
	 5. Advice, instruction.
 E. उच् to collect, घञ्
affix, and च is changed to घ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओङ्कार|ओंकार|ओंकारः|ओङ्कारः
ओङ्कार m. (-रः) The mysterious name of the deity: see ओम्.
	 f. (-रा) A
Bauddha Śakti, or female personification of divine energy.
 E. ओम्
and कार affix implying a letter, the compound letter ओ; other-
wise ओम्, signifying assent, and कार who makes; what complies
with our wishes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओज|ओजः
ओज (त) r. 1st. cl. (ओजति)
	 1. To live, to have the vital faculties and
organs.
	 2. To be strong or able.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओज|ओजः
ओज m. (-जः) See the following.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओजस्
ओजस् n. (-जः)
	 1. Light, splendor.
	 2. Manifestaion, appearance.
	 3.
Strength.
	 4. Support, stay.
	 5. Metallic lustre.
	 6. Vitality, the
principle of vital warmth and action diffused throughout the
body.
	 7. Virility, the generative faculty.
	 8. A form of style, elabo-
rate style, abounding with compounds.
	 9. (In astrology,) Each
alternate sign of the zodiac, first, third, fifth, &c.
 E. ओज to live,
and असुन् affix; or with अच् affix ओज.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओजस्विन्
ओजस्विन् mfn. (-स्वि-स्विनी-स्वि)
	 1. Mighty, powerful, strong.
	 2. Splendid,
bright.
 E. ओजस् and विनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओडक
ओडक m. (-कः) A musical mode, which omits two of the notes of the
scale, Ri and Pa.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओडिका
ओडिका f. (-का) Wild rice.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओडी
ओडी f. (-डी) Wild rice.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओड्र|ओड्रः
ओड्र m. (-ड्रः)
	 1. The China rose, (Hibiscus mutabilis.)
	 2. The name of
of a country, the northern part of Orissa.
 E. उड to embrace, रक
affix, and उ is changed to ओ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओड्रपुष्प|ओड्रपुष्पं
ओड्रपुष्प n. (-ष्पं) The China rose, the plant or its flower.
 E. ओड्र China
rose, and पुष्प a flower.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=143-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओण
ओण r. 1st cl. (ऋ) ओणृ (ओणति) To remove, to take away or abstract.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=144-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओतु|ओतुः
ओतु m. (-तुः) A cat.
 E. अव् to go, &c. and तु Uṇādi affix, the radical is
changed to ओ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=144-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओदन|ओदनं|ओदनः
ओदन mn. (-नः-नं) Boiled rice.
	 f. (-निका-नी) A plant, (Sida cordifolia,
&c.) see वला
 E. उन्द् to be wet, ल्युट् Uṇādi affix, and न dropped.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=144-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओद्म|ओद्मः
ओद्म m. (-द्मः) Wetting, moistening.
 E. उन्द् to be wet, मम् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=144-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओम्
ओम् ind.
	 1. The mystic name of the deity, prefacing all the prayers
and most of the writings of the Hindus.
 E. अ a name of VIṢṆU,
उ of ŚIVA, and म of BRAHMĀ; it therefore implies the Indian triad,
and expresses the three in one.
	 2. A particle of command or in-
junction.
	 3. Of assent, (verily, amen.)
	 4. Of auspiciousness.
	 5. Of
removal, (away, hence,) and, 6. It is an inceptive particle.
 E. अव्
to go, to preserve, &c. मन् Uṇādi affix, the radical being convert-
ed into ओ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=144-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओल|ओलं|ओलः
ओल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Wet, damp; also ओल्ल.
	 m. (-लः) An esculent root,
(Arum campanulatum.)
 E. वल or वल्ल to destroy, (complaints, es-
pecially hœmorrhoids,) अच् affix, व changed to ओ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=144-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओलड
ओलड r. 1st and 10th cls. (इ) ओलडि (ओलण्डति or ओलण्डयति) To dart or
throw up: some consider the initial vowel to be indicatory, and
make the root लडि q. v.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=144-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओष|ओषं|ओषः
ओष m. (-षः) Burning, combustion.
 E. उष् to burn, घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=144-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओषण|ओषणः
ओषण m. (-णः) Pungency, pungent taste or flavour.
	 f. (-णी) A potherb,
commonly Purya.
 E. उष् to burn, and ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=144-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओषधि|ओषधिः
ओषधि f. (-धिः) An annual plant or herb, one that dies after becoming
ripe.
 E. ओष heat, and धा to have, कि affix; or with ङीष्, ओषधी;
or with इञ् affix, औषधि.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=144-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओषधी
ओषधी f. (-धी) An annual plant or deciduous herb: see the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=144-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओषधीपति|ओषधीपतिः
ओषधीपति m. (-तिः) The moon.
 E. ओषधी and पति lord: presiding over
annual plants.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=144-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओषधीश|ओषधीशः
ओषधीश m. (-शः) The moon. E. See the preceding; ईश meaning lord.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=144-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओष्ठ|ओष्ठः
ओष्ठ m. (-ष्ठः) The lip, especially the upper, &c. du.
	 m. (ओष्ठौ or ओष्ठाधरौ)
The lips: see अधर.
	 f. (-ष्ठी) A creeper, bearing a red flower, to
which the lip is commonly compared, (Bryonia grandis.)
 E. उष् to
burn, थन् Uṇādi affix, fem. affix ङीष्: see विम्ब.
