ओष्ठपल्लव|ओष्ठपल्लवः
ओष्ठपल्लव n. (-वं) A lip or the lips.
 E. ओष्ठ and पल्लव a new shoot.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=144-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओष्ठरोग|ओष्ठरोगः
ओष्ठरोग m. (-गः) Any morbid affection of the lips.
 E. ओष्ठ and रोग
disease.
