<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओष्ठोपमफला
ओष्ठोपमफला f. (-ला) The creeper, (Bryonia grandis:) see ओष्ठी.
 E. ओष्ठ a
lip, उपम like, फल a flower, अच् and टाप् affixes; whose flower
resembles a lip.
