औपानह्य
औपानह्य mfn. (-ह्यः-ह्या-ह्यं) To be tied or bound on (grass, leather, &c.)
E. उपानह्, and ञ्य aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=145-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपासन|औपासनः
औपासन mfn. (-नः-नी-नं) Devotional, holy, connected with or belonging
to worship or service.
 E. उपासना, and अण् aff.
