<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औमक
औमक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Flaxen, made of flax, &c.
 E. उमा and वुञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=145-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औमीन|औमीनं
औमीन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Flax, (a field of, &c.)
 E. उमा flax, and ख aff.
