औरग|औरगं
औरग mfn. (-गः-गी-गं) Serpent, serpentine, relating or belonging to a
snake.
	 n. (-गं) The constellation Aslesha.
 E. उरग a snake, and अण्
affix; a serpent in the regent of this constellation.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=145-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औरभ्र|औरभ्रः
औरभ्र mfn. (-भ्रः-भ्रा-भ्रं) Belonging to, &c., a sheep.
	 m. (-भ्रः) A coarse
woollen blanket.
	 n. (-भ्रं)
	 1. Mutton, the flesh of sheep.
	 2. Woollen
cloth.
 E. उरभ्र a sheep, अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=145-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औरभ्रक|औरभ्रकं
औरभ्रक n. (-कं) A flock of sheep.
 E. उरभ्र and वुञ् affix of multitude.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=145-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औरभ्रिक|औरभ्रिकः
औरभ्रिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Relating to, produced by, &c. sheep.
	 m. (-कः)
A shepherd.
 E. उरभ्र a sheep, and ठञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=145-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औरस|औरसः
औरस mf. (-सः-सी) A legitimate child, i. e. by a wife of the same tribe.
E. उरस् the best, and अण affix; the best of the twelve sons; also
उरस्य and औरस्य.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=145-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औरस्य|औरस्यः
औरस्य mf. (-स्यः-स्यं) See the preceding.
