<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

और्ण|और्ण्ण
और्ण mfn. (-र्णः-र्णी-र्णं) Woollen (cloth, &c.)
 E. ऊर्णा wool, अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=145-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

और्णक|और्ण्णक
और्णक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Made woollen, &c.
 E. ऊर्णा, and वुञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=145-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

और्द्धदेहिक
और्द्धदेहिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Obsequial, funeral.
	 n. (-कं) Obsequies of a
deceased person; whatever is given or performed on a person's
decease, as burning, offering cakes, giving alms, &c.
 E. ऊर्द्ध or
ऊर्द्ध्व above, देह the body, and ठक् affix; hence also और्द्ध्वदेहिक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=145-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

और्द्धश्रोतसिक
और्द्धश्रोतसिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) A Saiva or adherent of that doctrine,
which gives ŚIVA the pre-eminence in the Hindu triad.
 E. ऊर्द्धश्रोतस्
a name of ŚIVA, viz. above whom or in whose head is the river,
(श्रीतस्) (the Ganges,) and ठक् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=145-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

और्व्व|और्व|और्वः|और्व्वं|और्व्वः
और्व्व m. (-र्व्वः) Submarine fire.
 E. उर्व्व a saint so named, from whose
thighs sprang a being of flame, which was received by the ocean;
the affix is अण्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=145-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

और्व्वशेय|और्वशेय|और्वशेयः|और्व्वशेयः
और्व्वशेय m. (-यः) A name of the saint AGASTYA.
 E. उर्व्वशी the celestial
courtezan, and ठक् affix; his birth being ascribed indirectly to
this lady.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=145-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

और्व्वानल|और्वानल
और्व्वानल m. (-लः) Submarine fire.
 E. और्व्व, and अनल fire.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=145-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औलूक|औलूकं
औलूक n. (-कं) A flock of owls.
 E. उलूक, and अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=145-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औलूक्य|औलूक्यः
औलूक्य m. (-क्यः) A follower of the Vaiseshika doctrine.
 E. उलूक an
owl, and ष्यञ् affix, like an owl: this etymology, and perhaps the
word, owes its origin probably to controversial animosity.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=145-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औलूखल
औलूखल mfn. (-लः-ली-लं) Ground or pounded in a mortar.
 E. उलूखल, and
अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=145-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औशनस
औशनस n. (-सं) The code, &c. of USANAS.
 E. उशनस्, and अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=145-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औशीर|औशीरं|औशीरः
औशीर mn. (-रः-रं)
	 1. The cow's tail used as a fan, the Chowri.
	 2. A
stick, or, according to some, the stick which serves as a handle to
the preceding.
	 3. A bed.
	 4. A seat, a chair or stool.
	 5. The root
of a fragrant grass, (Andropogon muricatum.)
 E. उशीर the root of
the Andropogon muricatum, अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=145-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औषण|औषणं
औषण n. (-णं) Pungency.
 E. उषण pepper, &c. अण् affix; also उषण.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=145-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औषध|औषधं
औषध n. (-धं) A medicament, a drug, any herb, mineral, &c. used in
medicine.
 E. औषधि an annual plant, and अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=145-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औषधि|औषधिः
औषधि f. (-धि) A deciduous plant, an annual as grass, &c. E. See ओषधि.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=145-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औषधीय
औषधीय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Medicinal.
 E. औषध and छ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=145-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औषर|औषरं
औषर n. (-रं)
	 1. Fossile salt.
	 2. Iron stone.
 E. ऊषरा desert soil, अण् affix;
also with कन् added औषरक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=145-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औषस
औषस mfn. (-सः-सी-सं) Early, matutinal.
 E. उषस् the dawn, अण् aff.
