<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औषिक
औषिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Early, morning, &c. with the dawn.
 E. उषा,
and ठक् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=145-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औष्ट्र
औष्ट्र mfn. (-ष्ट्रः-ष्ट्री-ष्ट्रं) Derived from or relating to a camel.
	 n. (-ष्ट्रं) The
camel genus or species.
 E. उष्ट्र and अञ् aff.
