<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कङ्कुष्ठ|कंकुष्ठं|कङ्कुष्ठं|कंकुष्ठः|कङ्कुष्ठः
कङ्कुष्ठ n. (-ष्टं) A medicinal earth, described as of two colours, one of a
