कङ्केरु|कंकेरुः|कङ्केरुः
कङ्केरु m. (-रुः) A kind of crow.
 E. कङ्क an imitative sound, ईर् to send,
to utter, उ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कङ्केलि|कंकेलि|कङ्केलिः
कङ्केलि m. (-लिः) The Asoka tree, (Jonesia asoca;) also कङ्केल्लि.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कङ्केल्ल|कंकेल्लः|कङ्केल्लः
कङ्केल्ल m. (-ल्लः) A kind of potherb, (Chenopodium esculentum, Rox.)
See वास्तुक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कङ्केल्लि|कंकेल्लिः|कङ्केल्लिः
कङ्केल्लि m. (-ल्लिः) A tree (Jonesia asoca, Rox.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कङ्ख|कंखं|कङ्खं
कङ्ख m. (-ङ्खः) Enjoyment, fruition.
 E. कखि to deride, अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कङ्गु|कंगु|कङ्गुः
कङ्गु f. (-ङ्गुः) A kind of Panick seed, (Panicum Italicum;) several
varieties of it are cultivated, and form articles of food for the poor.
E. क water, अनि to go, कु affix; also with ऊङ् affix कङ्गू, and with
कन् added कङ्गुका.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कङ्गुनी
कङ्गुनी f. (-नी) A sort of Panick; see the last.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कङ्गुनीपत्रा
कङ्गुनीपत्रा f. (-त्रा) A kind of grass.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कङ्गुल|कंगुल|कंगुलः|कङ्गुलः
कङ्गुल m. (-लः) The hand.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच|कचः
कच r. 1st cl. (कचते)
	 1. To bind.
	 2. To shine.
	 3. To sound. (इ) कचि r.
1st cl. (कञ्चते)
	 1. To shine.
	 2. To bind; also काचि.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच|कचः
कच m. (-चः)
	 1. The hair.
	 2. A proper name, the son of VṚHASPATI.
3. Binding or a binding.
	 4. A cicatrix, a dry or healed sore.
	 5. A
cloud.
	 f. (-चा)
	 1. A female elephant.
	 2. Beauty, brilliance.
 E. कच् to
bind, &c. अच् affix, fem. टाप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कचङ्गन|कचंगन|कचंगनं|कचङ्गनं
कचङ्गन n. (-नं) A free market, a place of sale that pays no duty or custom.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कचङ्गल|कचंगल|कचंगलः|कचङ्गलः
कचङ्गल m. (-लः) The ocean.
 E. कच a cloud, अङ्ग the body, and ल what
takes or receives.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कचप|कचपं|कचपः
कचप m. (-पः)
	 1. Grass.
	 2. A leaf.
 E. कच a cloud, and प what drinks.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कचपक्ष|कचपक्षः
कचपक्ष m. (-क्षः) Much or ornamented hair, and कच hair, and पक्ष, in this
combination, abundance; similar compounds are made with पाश
and हस्त, कचपाश, कचहस्त; also with केश hair, as केशपक्ष.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कचपाश|कचपाशः
कचपाश m. (-शः) See the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कचमाल|कचमालः
कचमाल m. (-लः) Smoke.
 E. कच a cloud, and माला a necklace, ड affix;
also खतमाल.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कचरिपुफला
कचरिपुफला f. (-ला) The Sami tree.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कचहस्त|कचहस्तः
कचहस्त m. (-स्तः) See कचपक्ष.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कचाकु|कचाकुः
कचाकु mfn. (-कुः-कुः-कु)
	 1. Ill disposed, wicked.
	 2. Intolerable, difficult
to be borne.
	 m. (-कुः) A snake.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कचाचित
कचाचित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Having long or dishevelled hair.
 E. कच, and
अचित not gathered.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कचाटुर|कचाटुरः
कचाटुर m. (-रः) A gallinule.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कचु|कचुः
कचु f. (-चुः) An esculent root, (Arum colocasia and other kinds, many
of which are cultivated for food:) see कच्वी.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच्चट|कच्चटं
कच्चट n. (-टं) An aquatic plant.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच्चर|कच्चरं
कच्चर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं)
	 1. Dirty, foul.
	 2. Soiled, spoiled by dirt.
	 3. Vile,
wicked, bad.
	 n. (-रं) Buttermilk diluted with water.
 E. कुत् bad,
vile, चर what goes or is, from चर with अच् affix; कत् is substituted
for कुत्, and the त changed.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच्चित्
कच्चित् ind.
	 1. A particle implying wish or desire, (may it be so;) also
introducing a kind enquiry, (I hope that it is so, &c.)
	 2. A particle
implying an alternative, whether, whether or not.
 E. कत् for कुत्
bad, and चित् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच्छ|कच्छं|कच्छः
कच्छ mfn. (-च्छः-च्छा-च्छं) Contiguous to water, (land, &c.)
	 m. (-च्छः)
	 1.
Marshy ground, a marsh, a morass.
	 2. Ground bordering water or
watery soil, as the bank of a river, the margin of a lake or tank,
a mound or causeway, &c.
	 3. Level land skirting mountains.
	 4. A
tree, the timber of which is used for making furniture, &c. com-
monly Tun, (Cedrela Tuna, Rox.)
	 5. Another tree, (Hibiscus
Populneoides.)
	 6. A part of a boat.
	 mf. (-च्छः-च्छा) The hem of a
garment tucked into the waistband: see कक्ष.
	 f. (-च्छा)
	 1. A plant,
(Lycopodium imbricatum, Rox.) See वाराही.
	 2. A cricket.
 E. क
water, छो to cut or break, क affix; or कच् to bind, छ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच्छटिका
कच्छटिका f. (-का) The end or hem of a lower garment or cloth gather-
ed up behind, and tucked into the waistband; also कक्षा and
कच्छाटिका.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच्छप|कच्छपः
कच्छप m. (-पः)
	 1. A turtle, a tortoise.
	 2. One of KUVERA'S Nidhis or
treasures.
	 2. An attitude in wrestling.
	 4. A flat kind of still.
	 f.
(-पी)
	 1. A female tortoise, also a small one.
	 2. A kind of lute, also
the lute of SARASWATI.
	 3. A cutaneous disease, wart or blotch. E.
कच्छ a morass, and प who cherishes, who inhabits watery places:
the lute, &c. are so named from being similar in shape to the
tortoise.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच्छपिका
कच्छपिका f. (-का)
	 1. A pimple, a blotch or wart.
	 2. A wart accompany-
ing gonorrhœa.
 E. कच्छप a tortoise, कन् added, fem. form.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच्छभू
कच्छभू f. (-भूः) Marshy ground, a swamp, a morass.
 E. कच्छ, and
भू land.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच्छरुहा
कच्छरुहा f. (-हा) A kind of grass, Durva or Dub, (Agrostis linearis
Lin. Panicus dactilon, Rox.)
 E. कच्छ marshy ground, and रुह who
grows.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच्छाटिका
कच्छाटिका f. (-का) See कच्छटिका.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच्छान्त|कच्छांत|कच्छान्तः
कच्छान्त m. (-न्तः) The border of a lake or stream.
 E. कच्छ, and अन्त term.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच्छु|कच्छुः
कच्छु f. (-च्छुः) Itch, formation of watery pustules on the hands, &c. E.
कष् to hurt, उ affix; also कच्छू.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच्छुघ्नी
कच्छुघ्नी f. (-घ्नी) A vegetable, (Trichosanthes.)
 E. कच्छु, and घ्नी what
removes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच्छुर|कच्छुरः
कच्छुर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं)
	 1. Scabby, itchy.
	 2. Unchaste, libidinous.
	 f. (-रा)
1. A plant, (a species of Hedysarum?)
	 2. Cowach, (Dolichos car-
popogon.)
	 3. Another plant: see शठु.
 E. कच्छु itch or scab,
and र aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच्छू
कच्छू f. (-च्छूः) Scab or itch.
 E. कष् to injure, ऊ Uṇādi affix, and छ
substituted for ष.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच्छूमती
कच्छूमती f. (-ती) Cowach, (Dolichos carpopogon.)
 E. कच्छू itch, and
मतुप् affix; producing an itching upon application to the skin.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच्छोटिका
कच्छोटिका f. (-का) The fastening of the lower garment: see कच्छटिका.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच्वी
कच्वी f. (-च्वी) An esculent root, (Arum colocasia and other kinds,
several of which are cultivated for food;) also written कचु.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कज|कजं
कज r. 1st cl. (कजति) To be disturbed or confused with joy, pride, or
sorrow.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कज|कजं
कज mfn. (-जः-जा-जं) Watery, aquatic, produced in or by water.
	 n. (-जं)
A lotus.
 E. क water, and ज born.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=148-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कज्जल|कज्जलं|कज्जलः
कज्जल m. (-लः)
	 1. A cloud.
	 n. (-लं) Lampblack, considered as a colly-
rium, being applied upon the eyelashes or eyelids, medicinally
or ornamentatively; also sulphuret of lead or antimony, when so
used.
	 f. (-ली) Sulphuret of mercury, Æthiop's mineral.
	 f. (-ला or
-ली) A kind of fish, (Cyprinus atratus,) or any kind peculiar to
stagnant waters, whence the name.
 E. कत् for कुत् bad, and जल water
or juice, as the moisture of the collyrium, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=148-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कज्ज्वल|कज्ज्वलं
कज्ज्वल n. (-लं) Lampblack, especially considered as an application to
the eyes: see the preceding.
 E. कत् bad, and ज्वल flame.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=148-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कज्ज्वलध्वज
कज्ज्वलध्वज m. (-जः) A lamp.
 E. कज्ज्वल, and ध्वज a sign; also कज्जलध्वज.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=148-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कज्ज्वलरोचक
कज्ज्वलरोचक mn. (-कः-कं) The wooden stand or tripod on which the
lamp is placed, a candlestick.
 E. कज्ज्वल and रुच् to shine; affixes
घञ् and कन्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=148-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कञ्चट|कञ्चटं|कञ्चटः
कञ्चट m. (-टः) A plant: see लाङ्गली, (Commelina salicifolia.)
	 n. (-टं) An-
other species of the same, (Commedina Bengalensis.)
 E. कं water,
and चट् to divide; alluding to the habits of the plant.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=148-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कञ्चड|कञ्चडः
कञ्चड m. (-डः) A plant, (Commelina Bengalensis:) see the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=148-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कञ्चार|कंचार|कंचारः|कञ्चारः
कञ्चार m. (-रः) The sun.
 E. कं heaven, and चर् to go, affix अण्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=148-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कञ्चिका|कंचिका
कञ्चिका f. (-का)
	 1. The branch of a bamboo.
	 2. A small boil.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=148-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कञ्चुक|कंचुक|कंचुकः|कञ्चुकः
कञ्चुक m. (-कः)
	 1. The skin of a snake.
	 2. Armour, mail.
	 3. A bodice or
jacket.
	 4. Cloth, clothes.
	 5. A kind of drawers or short breeches.
f. (-की) The name of a plant.
 E. कचि to bind or shine, affix उकन्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=148-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कञ्चुकालु|कंचुकालु|कंचुकालुः|कञ्चुकालुः
