कञ्चुकिन्|कंचुकिन्
कञ्चुकिन् m. (-की)
	 1. An attendant on the women's apartments.
	 2. A
libidinous man, a debauchee.
	 3. A serpent.
	 4. Agallochum.
	 5. Bar-
ley.
	 6. A sort of pulse, (Chenna.)
 E. कञ्चुक armour, &c. इनि aff.
