कञ्ज|कंज|कञ्जं|कंजः|कञ्जः
कञ्ज mfn. (-ञ्जः-ञ्जा-ञ्जं) Produce in or from water.
	 m. (-ञ्जः)
	 1. A name
of BRAHMĀ.
	 2. The hair.
	 n. (-ञ्जं)
	 1. Nectar, the food of the
immortals.
	 3. A lotus.
 E. कं happiness, water, &c. and ज what is
born or produced.
