<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कञ्जज|कंजज|कञ्जजः
कञ्जज m. (-जः) A name of BRAHMĀ.
 E. कञ्ज a lotus, and ज born.
