कञ्जन|कंजन|कंजनः|कञ्जनः
कञ्जन m. (-नः)
	 1. The Mayana or Maina, (Gracula religiosa.)
	 2. A name
of KANDARPA, the deity of love.
 E. कचि to go, युच् aff.
