कटीर|कटीरं|कटीरः
कटीर mn. (-रः-रं)
	 1. The cavity of the loins, or the iliac regions.
	 m. (-रः)
1. Mons veneris.
	 2. A cave.
 E. कट् to go, and ईर् Uṇādi aff.
