कठ|कठः
कठ r. 1st cl. (कठति) To live in distress. (इ) कठि r. 1st and 10th cls.
(कण्ठति-ते, कण्ठयति)
	 1. To grieve.
	 2. To recollect. With उद् prefixed,
to regret or miss, to lament, to bewail.
