कडङ्ग|कडंगः|कडङ्गः
कडङ्ग m. (-ङ्गः) A spirituous liquor, a kind of rum.
 E. कड् to be intoxi-
cated, अङ्ग aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=150-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कडङ्गर|कडंगर|कडंगरः|कडङ्गरः
कडङ्गर m. (-रः) Straw, chaff.
 E. कड, रक affix, अङ्गच् inserted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=150-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कडत्र|कडत्रं
कडत्र n. (-त्रं) A vessel.
 E. गड् to distil, अत्रन् Uṇādi affix, and क substi-
tuted for ग; also कलत्र.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=150-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
