<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कडार|कडारः
कडार mfn. (-रः-री-रं) Tawny.
	 m. (-रः)
	 1. Tawny, (the colour.)
	 2. A
servant.
 E. कड् to be confused, आरण् aff.
