<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कडितुल|कडितुलः
कडितुल m. (-लः) A sword, a scymitar, a sacrificial knife.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=150-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कड्ड
कड्ड r. 1st cl. (कड्डति) To be rough, to be harsh or severe: the pen.
is originally द.
