कणजीर|कणजीरः
कणजीर n. (-रं) A white kind of cummin seed.
 E. कण small, जीर
cummin.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=150-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कणजीरक|कणजीरकं
कणजीरक n. (-कं) Small cummin seed.
 E. कण minute, and जीरक
cummin.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=150-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कणभक्षक|कणभक्षकः
कणभक्षक m. (-कः) A kind of bird.
 E. कण pepper, and भक्षक who eats.
