 E. कण्टक and श्रेणी a row.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=150-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्टकागार|कण्टकागारः
कण्टकागार m. (-रः) A porcupine.
 E. कण्टक and अगार or आगार a house.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=150-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्टकारिका|कंटकारिका
कण्टकारिका f. (-का) A sort of prickly nightshade, (Solanum jacquini.)
