कण्टकारी
कण्टकारी f. (-री)
	 1. A prickly nightshade: see the preceding.
	 2. The
silk-cotton tree, (Bombax heptaphyllum.)
	 3. Another plant, com-
monly Buinchhi, (Flacourtia sapida, Rox.) E. As before.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=150-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्टकाल|कंटकालः|कण्टकालः
कण्टकाल m. (-लः)
	 1. The bread-fruit tree or Jaka: see कण्टकफल.
	 2.
Species of the coral tree, (Erythrina Indica.)
 E. कण्टक a thorn,
आला to take, affix ड.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=150-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्टकाशन|कंटकाशन|कण्टकाशनः
कण्टकाशन m. (-नः) A camel.
 E. कण्टक, and अशन food; whose food is of
thorns, thistles, &c.; also कण्टकभुज्, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=150-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्टकाष्ठील|कण्टकाष्ठीलः
कण्टकाष्ठील m. (-लः) A kind of fish, one which has many bones.
 E. कण्टक,
अस्थि a bone, and ईलच् aff.
