<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्टकिज
कण्टकिज mfn. (-जः-जा-जं)
	 1. Produced from a fish.
	 2. Borne by the mi-
mosa tree.
 E. कण्टकिन्, and ज born.
