<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्टकिन्|कंटकिन्
कण्टकिन् mfn. (-की-किनी-कि)
	 1. Thorny, prickly.
	 2. Vexatious, annoying.
m. (-की)
	 1. A fish.
	 2. A tree, (Mimosa catechu.)
	 3. A plant. (Van-
gueria spinosa.)
	 4. A bamboo.
	 5. The jujube.
 E. कण्टक a thorn or
