	 2. The clearing nut plant.
E. कै to sound, अत Uṇādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=151-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कतक|कतकः
कतक m. (-कः) The clearing nut plant, (Strychnos potatorum:) one of
the seeds of this plant being rubbed upon the inside of the water
jars used in Bengal, occasions a precipitation of the earthy par-
ticles diffused through the water.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=151-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कतम
कतम mfn. (-मः-मा-मत्) Which, (of many.)
 E. किम् and डतमच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=151-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कतमाल|कतमालः
कतमाल m. (-लः) A name of AGNI or fire; this word is perhaps a
corruption: see कचमाल and खतमाल.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=151-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कतर
कतर mfn. (-रः-रा-रत्) Which, (of two,) whether.
 E. किम् and डतरच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=151-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कति
कति mfn. (-ति-ति-ति)
	 1. How many.
	 2. How much.
 E. किम् what, and
डति aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=151-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कतिचित्
कतिचित् ind.
	 1. In any way, in some way.
	 2. For some time.
 E. कति
how many, and चित् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=151-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कतिथ
कतिथ mfn. (-थः-था-थं) What, how much.
 E. थुक् added to कति.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=151-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कतिपय|कतिपयः
कतिपय mfn. (-यः-या-यं)
	 1. How many.
	 2. A certain number, so many.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=151-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कतिपयथ
कतिपयथ mfn. (-थः-था-थं) What, how much.
 E. थक् added to कतिपय.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=151-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कतिविध
कतिविध mfn. (-धः-धा-धं)
	 1. Of how many sorts.
	 2. Of various kinds. E.
कति, and विध sort.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कत्तृण|कत्तृणं
कत्तृण n. (-णं)
	 1. A fragrant grass.
	 2. A plant, commonly Chakulia
(Hemionites cordifolia, Rox.)
 E. कत् for कुत् bad, तृण grass.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कत्तोय|कत्तोयं
कत्तोय n. (-यं) Wine or vinous spirit.
 E. कत् for कुत् bad, and तोय water.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कत्थ
कत्थ r. 1st cl. (कत्थते)
	 1. To praise or celebrate.
	 2. To flatter or coax.
3. To boast.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कत्र
कत्र r. 10th cl. (कत्रयति) To loosen, to slacken, to remove.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कत्सवर|कत्सवरं
कत्सवर n. (-रं) The shoulder, the shoulder blade.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथ|कथं
कथ r. 10th cl. (कथयति) To speak, to tell.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथक|कथकः
कथक mfn. (-कः-का-कं)
	 1. A narrator, a relator, one who recites a story,
or who publicly reads and expounds the Puranas, &c.
	 2. One who
speaks or tells.
	 mf. (-कः-का) The speaker of a prologue or a mono-
logue.
	 3. A professional story teller.
 E. कथ to speak, to relate,
वुन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथङ्कथिक|कथंकथिक|कथङ्कथिकः
कथङ्कथिक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) An interrogant, one who asks or questions.
E. कथम् how, कथ to speak, ठक् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथङ्कथिकता|कथंकथिकता
कथङ्कथिकता f. (-ता) A question, asking, enquiring.
 E. तल् affix of the
abstract added to the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथङ्कथित
कथङ्कथित m. (-तः) An interrogant, one who questions.
 E. कथम् how,
कथित said.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथञ्चन
कथञ्चन ind. In some way, in any way, by any means.
 E. कथम् and चन
aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथञ्चित्
कथञ्चित् ind. In any way, by some means or other.
 E. कथम् and चित् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथन|कथनं
कथन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Talkative.
	 n. (-नं) Saying, narrating, relating. E.
कथ to say, &c. युच् or ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथनीय
कथनीय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) To be said, to be told or declared.
 E. कथ to
tell, अनीयर् affix; also with तव्य कथितव्य and with यत् कथ्य.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथन्ता|कथंता
कथन्ता f. (-न्ता) Enquiry, question, demand.
 E. कथ to speak, झश् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथम्
कथम् ind.
	 1. A particle of interrogation, (how, what.)
	 2. Also imply-
ing mode, (how, in what manner.)
	 3. A particle of amazement or
surprise.
	 4. Of pleasure.
	 5. Of abuse.
	 6. Of interrogation, implying
doubt.
 E. किम् what, and थमु aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथा
कथा f. (-था) A feigned story, a tale or fable.
 E. कथ to tell, &c. अङ् and टाप् affs.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथानुराग|कथानुरागः
कथानुराग m. (-गः) Attention, taking pleasure in a discourse.
 E. कथा, and
अनुराग inclination.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथाप्रबन्ध|कथाप्रबंध|कथाप्रबन्धः
कथाप्रबन्ध m. (-न्धः) A narrative, a tale, a fiction.
 E. कथा, and प्रबन्ध
connexion.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथाप्रसङ्ग|कथाप्रसंग|कथाप्रसङ्गः
कथाप्रसङ्ग mfn. (-ङ्गः-ङ्गा-ङ्गं)
	 1. Talkative, talking much and foolishly.
2. Half-witted, foolish.
	 3. A conjuror, a dealer in antidotes, &c.
m. (-ङ्गः)
	 1. Talking, conversation, speaking to or with.
	 2.
Rumour, report.
 E. कथा a fable, and प्रसङ्ग who relates.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथाप्राण|कथाप्राणः
कथाप्राण m. (-णः)
	 1. An actor, the speaker of a prologue or monologue,
the introducer of a drama.
	 2. A professed story teller.
 E. कथा and
प्राण life, livelihood.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथायोग|कथायोगः
कथायोग m. (-गः) Conversation, talk, discourse.
 E. कथा, and योग uniting.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथारम्भ|कथारंभ|कथारम्भः
कथारम्भ m. (-म्भः)
	 1. Narration, narrative, story telling.
	 2. Beginning of
a story.
 E. कथा, and आरम्भ beginning, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथाविरक्त
कथाविरक्त mfn. (-क्तः-क्ता-क्तं) Reserved, taciturn, disliking conversation.
E. कथा, and विरक्त disliking.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथासंग्रह
कथासंग्रह m. (-हः) A collection of tales or fables.
 E. कथा, and संग्रह collection.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथिक|कथिकः
कथिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) A story-teller by profession, a narrator, a relator.
E. कथा a tale, and ठक् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथित|कथितः
कथित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Said, told, related.
 E. कथ to tell, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथितपद
कथितपद n. (-दं) Repetition, tautology.
 E. कथित said, पद a word.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथोद्घात|कथोद्घातः
कथोद्घात m. (-तः) The opening of a drama, by the character that first
enters overhearing and repeating the last words of the prelude. E.
कथा, and उद्घात beginning.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथोपकथन
कथोपकथन n. (-नं)
	 1. Conversation, conference.
	 2. Narration.
 E. कथा,
and उपकथन speaking.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथोपाख्यान
कथोपाख्यान n. (-नं) Narration, narrative, relation, telling a story. E.
कथा, and उपाख्यान telling.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथ्य
कथ्य mfn. (-थ्यः-थ्या-थ्यं) To be spoken or said.
 E. कथ and यत् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कद|कदः
कद or (इ) कदि r. 1st. cl. (कदते and कन्दते)
	 1. To be confused, to suffer
mentally, to grieve.
	 2. To confound.
	 3. To kill or hurt; also कदि
(कंदति) 1. To call.
	 2. To cry or shed tears.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कद|कदः
कद m. (-दः) A cloud.
 E. क water, and द what gives.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदक|कदकं|कदकः
कदक m. (-कः) An awning.
 E. कद a cloud, and क what makes; yielding
a shade as a cloud; also fem. कदका and कदकी.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदक्षर|कदक्षरं
कदक्षर n. (-रं) A bad letter.
 E. कत् for कुत् bad and अक्षर a letter.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदध्वन्
कदध्वन् m. (-ध्वा) A bad road.
 E. कत् for कुत् bad, and अध्वन् a road.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदन|कदनं
कदन n. (-नं)
	 1. Killing, destroying.
	 2. Sin.
	 3. War.
 E. कद् to kill or
injure, affix ल्युट्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदन्न|कदन्नं
कदन्न n. (-न्नं) Bad food.
 E. कत् for कुत् bad, अन्न food.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदम्ब|कदंब|कदम्बं|कदंबः|कदम्बः
कदम्ब m. (-म्बः)
	 1. A plant, commonly Kadamba (Nauclea kadamba.)
2. The mustard seed plant, (Sinapis dichotoma.)
	 3. A kind of grass,
(Andropogon serratum:) see देवताडक.
	 4. Turmeric.
	 n. (-म्बं) A multi-
tude, an assemblage or collection.
 E. कद् to confound, &c. अम्बच
Uṇādi affix; also with कन् added कदम्बक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदम्बक|कदंबक|कदम्बकं|कदंबकः|कदम्बकः
कदम्बक mn. (-कः-कं) See the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदम्बद|कदंबदः|कदम्बदः
कदम्बद m. (-दः) Mustard seed plant: it seems to be a variety of read-
ing for कदम्बक, q. v.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदम्बपुष्पी
कदम्बपुष्पी f. (-ष्पी) A plant, the flowers of which resemble those of the
Kadamba, commonly called Mundiri.
 E. कदम्ब, and पुष्प a flower,
fem. affix ङीष्; also with टाप् कदम्बपुष्पा.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदम्बवायु|कदंबवायु|कदम्बवायुः
कदम्बवायु m. (-युः) A fragrant breeze.
 E. कदम्ब the plant, and वायु wind.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदम्बानिल|कदंबानिल|कदम्बानिलः
कदम्बानिल m. (-लः)
	 1. A fragrant breeze.
	 2. Spring.
 E. कदम्ब and
अनिल wind.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदर|कदरं|कदरः
कदर m. (-रः)
	 1. A white sort of mimosa.
	 2. A corn, a callosity.
	 3. A
saw.
	 4. An iron goad for an elephant.
	 n. (-रं) Coagulated milk.
E. क water, &c. दृ to tear, अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदर्थ|कदर्थः
कदर्थ mfn. (-र्थः-र्था-र्थं)
	 1. Useless.
	 2. Unmeaning.
 E. कत् for कुत्, and
अर्थ object.
