<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदलक|कदलकः
कदलक m. (-कः) The plantain or banana tree: see the preceding. E.
कन् added to कदल.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=152-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदलीक्षता
कदलीक्षता f. (-ता)
	 1. A sort of cucumber.
	 2. A fine woman.
