<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदाचार|कदाचारः
कदाचार mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Wicked, abandoned, following evil practices.
E. कत् for कुत्, आचार observance.
