<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदुष्ण|कदुष्णं
कदुष्ण mfn. (-ष्णः-ष्णा-ष्णं) Tepid, warm.
	 n. (-ष्णं) Warmth, gentle warmth.
E. कत् instead of कुत् bad, inferior, उष्ण heat.
