कद्रु|कद्रुः
कद्रु mfn. (-द्रुः-द्रुः-द्रूः-द्रु) Tawny.
	 f. (-द्रूः) The wife of CASYAPA the
saint, and mother of the Nāgas or the serpent race, inhabiting
the regions below the earth.
	 m. (-द्रुः) Tawny, (the colour.)
 E. कम्
to desire, डु affix, and र inserted; the final of the radical is
irregularly changed to द; fem. affix ऊञ्.
