	 1. The name of a tree which bears red
flowers, (Butea frondosa:) see पलाश.
	 2. Thorn apple, (Datura
metel, &c.)
	 3. Another plant, (Mesua ferrea:) see नागकेशर.
	 4.
Mountain ebony, (Bauhinia variegata, &c.) see काञ्चनाल.
	 5. A
black sort of agallochum.
	 6. A shrub yielding a yellow fragrant
flower, (Michelia champaca.)
 E. कन to shine, अक Unādi aff.
