कन्या
कन्या f. (-न्या)
	 1. A girl nine years old, a virgin.
	 2. A name of DURGĀ.
	 3.
The sign of the zodiac, Virgo.
	 4. The socotrine aloe (Aloes per-
foliata.)
	 6. Large cardamoms.
	 7. A species of metre of four lines,
with four syllables in each.
	 3. A parasite plant.
 E. कन् to shine,
Uṇādi affix यक्, fem. टाप्.
