<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्युष|कन्युषं
कन्युष n. (-षं) The hand below the wrist.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=154-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कप
कप(इ)कपि r. 1st cl. (कंपते) To shake, to tremble: with अनु prefixed, to
feel tenderness or compassion, to pity.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=154-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपट|कपटं|कपटः
कपट mn. (-टः-टं) Fraud, deceit, cheating, circumvention.
 E. क BRAHMĀ,
पट् to go, अच् affix; what extends even to BRAHMĀ,; or क the head,
and पट a covering, screening the head as it were.
	 f. (-टी) A
measure equal to the capacity of the hollows of the two hands
joined.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=154-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपटता
कपटता f. (-ता) Deceitfulness.
 E. तल् added to कपटः also with त्व कपटत्वं.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=154-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपटप्रबन्ध|कपटप्रबंध|कपटप्रबन्धः
कपटप्रबन्ध m. (-न्धः) Fraud, trick, fraudulent plot or contrivance.
 E. कपट,
and प्रबन्ध procedure.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=154-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपटलेख्य
कपटलेख्य n. (-ख्यं) A forged document, a false or fraudulent statement.
E. कपट, and लेख्य a writing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=154-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपटवेश|कपटवेशः
कपटवेश mfn. (-शः-शा-शं) Masked, disguised, assuming a false dress or
appearance.
	 m. (-शः) Disguise.
 E. कपट, and वेश costume.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=154-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपटवेशिन्
कपटवेशिन् mfn. (-शी-शिनी-शि) Disguised, in masquerade.
 E. कपटवेश and
इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=154-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपटिक|कपटिकः
कपटिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) A rogue, a cheat, fraudulent, dishonest. E.
कपट and ठक aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=154-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपटिन्
कपटिन् mfn. (-टी-टिनी-टि) Fraudulent, dishonest, a cheat, &c.
 E. कपट
and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=154-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपर्द्द|कपर्द|कपर्दः|कपर्द्दः
कपर्द्द m. (-र्द्दः)
	 1. The braided hair of ŚIVA.
	 2. A small shell used as
a coin, a Cowri.
	 3. A name of ŚIVA.
 E. क water, (that of the
Ganges,) पृ in the deriv. form, nourishing, and द from दा to give;
or क happiness, &c. which will apply to both senses; also with
कन् added कपर्द्दक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=154-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
