<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपर्द्दिन्|कपर्दिन्
कपर्द्दिन् m. (-र्द्दी) A name of ŚIVA.
 E. कपर्द्द his braided hair, and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=154-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपाट|कपाटं|कपाटः
कपाट mfn. (-टः-टी-टं) A door, the leaf or pannel of a door.
 E. क the
the head or wind, पट् to go, अण् affix; also कवाट.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=154-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपाटघ्न
कपाटघ्न m. (-घ्नः) A thief, a housebreaker.
 E. कपाट, and घ्न who breaks.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=154-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपाटसन्धि|कपाटसंधि|कपाटसंधिः
कपाटसन्धि m. (-न्धिः)
	 1. The junction of the leaves of a door.
	 2. A mode
of multiplying, (in arithmetic.)
 E. कपाट, and सन्धि junction.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=154-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपाल|कपालं|कपालः
कपाल mn. (-लः-लं)
	 1. The skull, the cranium.
	 2. Either half of a
water jar.
	 3. Any flat bone.
	 4. A beggar's bowl.
	 5. Multitude as-
semblage, collection.
	 6. A species of leprosy.
	 7. A treaty of peace
on equal terms.
 E. कपि to tremble, and कालन् Uṇādi affix; or क
the head, and पाल what cherishes or protects.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=154-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपालनालिका
कपालनालिका f. (-का) A sort of pin or spindle for winding cotton,
