कपिकन्दुक|कपिकन्दुकं
कपिकन्दुक n. (-कं) The skull, the cranium.
 E. कपि, and कन्दुक a ball.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=155-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

