कपिशित
कपिशित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Embrowned, made brown or dusky red.
 E. कपिश
and इतच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=155-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिशीका
कपिशीका f. (-का) Spirituous liquor.
 E. कपिश, and ईकन् affix: see कपिश.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=155-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
