<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिस्थल
कपिस्थल n. (-लं) A place frequented by monkies.
 E. कपि, and स्थल place.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=155-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपीकच्छु|कपीकच्छुः
कपीकच्छु f. (-च्छुः) Cowach: see कपिकच्छ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=155-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपीज्य|कपीज्यः
कपीज्य m. (-ज्यः) A plant, (a species of mimusops:) see क्षीरिका.
 E. कपि,
and इज्य respected, liked; a favourite plant with the monkies;
also कपीज्यक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=155-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपीतन|कपीतनः
कपीतन m. (-नः)
	 1. A tree bearing an acid fruit, (Spondias mangifera:)
see आम्रातक.
	 2. Another tree, (Hibiscus populneoides:) see गर्द्दभाण्ड.
3. A species of Mimosa, (Mimosa sirisha, Rox.)
	 4. The holy fig
tree, (Ficus religiosa.)
	 5. The betel nut tree, (Areca faufel or
Catechu.)
	 6. The name of another plant, (Cratæva marmelos.) E.
कपि an ape, and तन what spreads; sheltering or feeding monkies;
the vowel is made long irregularly.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=155-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपीन्द्र|कपींद्र|कपीन्द्रः
कपीन्द्र m. (-न्द्रः)
	 1. A name of the celebrated monkey HANUMAN.
	 2. Also
of SUGRĪVA, &c.
 E. कपि, and इन्द्र the chief.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=155-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपुष्टिका
कपुष्टिका f. (-का) A patch of hair on each side of the head.
 E. क the
head, पुष्टि cherishing, कन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=155-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपुच्छल|कपुच्छलं
कपुच्छल n. (-लं) Hair hanging down to the ground.
 E. क the head,
पुच्छ a tail, and ल what resembles.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=155-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपोत|कपोतः
कपोत m. (-तः)
	 1. A dove or pigeon, especially the spotted necked
pigeon.
	 2. A bird in general.
 E. कब to tinge, to be of various hues,
आतच् Uṇādi affix, ब changed to प.
