कपोतक|कपोतकं|कपोतकः
कपोतक n. (-कं) Antimony.
 E. कपोत and कन् affix, implying resemblance,
(in colour.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=155-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपोतचरणा
