कफणि mf. (-णिः-णी) The elbow.
 E. क pleasure, फण् to go, इन् and ङीष्
affixes; also कफोणि
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=156-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
