<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कफवर्द्धन
कफवर्द्धन mfn. (-नः-नी-नं) Exciting phlegm.
	 m. (-नः) The name of a
plant; also पिण्डितगर.
 E. कफ phlegm, वृध् to augment, and ल्युट् aff.
