कफिन्
कफिन् mfn. (-फी-फिनी-फि) Phlegmatic.
	 m. (-फी) An elephant.
 E. कफ and
इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=156-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कफेलू
कफेलू mfn. (-लूः-लूः-लु) Phlegmatic, causing or exciting phlegm.
 E. कफ,
लू from ला to take or give, and कू Uṇādi affix; the deriv. is irr.
