कमनच्छद|कमनच्छदः|कमनछद
कमनच्छद m. (-दः) A heron.
 E. कमन beautiful, and छद plumage.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=156-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमनीय|कमनीयं
कमनीय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Pleasing, beautiful, desirable.
 E. कम् and अनीयर्
affix of the future participle, to be desired.
