<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमनीयता
कमनीयता f. (-ता)
	 1. Loveliness, beauty.
	 2. Desirableness.
 E. तल् added
to the last, or with त्व कमनीयत्वं.
