कमल|कमलं|कमलः
कमल n. (-लं)
	 1. A lotus, (Nelumbium speciosum or Nymphæa nelum-
bo.)
	 2. Water.
	 3. Copper.
	 4. A medicament, a drug.
	 5. The blad-
der.
	 m. (-लः) A species of deer.
	 f. (-ला)
	 1. A name of LAKṢMĪ.
2. An excellent woman.
 E. कम् water, and अल what adorns, or कम्
to desire, with कलच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमलच्छद
कमलच्छद m. (-दः)
	 1. A heron: see कङ्क 2. Petal of the lotus.
 E. कमल,
and छद a leaf.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमलाकर|कमलाकरः
कमलाकर m. (-रः) A lake, &c. where lotuses abound.
 E. कमल, and आकर
a mine.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमलासन|कमलासनः
कमलासन m. (-नः) An epithet of BRAHMĀ.
 E. कमल a lotus, and आसन
seat or abode.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमलिनी
कमलिनी f. (-नी) A number of lotus flowers, or a place abounding with
them.
 E. कमल, इनि and ङीष् affs.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमलोत्तर|कमलोत्तरं
कमलोत्तर n. (-रं) Safflower, (Carthamus tinctorius.)
 E. कमल, and उत्तर
best, excellent.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमा
कमा f. (-मा) Beauty, radiance.
 E. कम् to desire, अङ् and टाप् affs.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमितृ
कमितृ mfn. (-ता-त्री-तृ) Lustful, desirous, cupidinous.
 E. कम् to desire,
तृच् affix; and इ inserted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्प|कंप|कंपः|कम्पः
कम्प m. (-म्पः) Tremour, trembling, shaking.
 E. कपि to shake, and अच्
affix; also कम्पन, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्पन|कंपन|कम्पनं|कम्पनः
कम्पन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Trembling, unsteady, shaken.
	 n. (-नं) Trembling,
quivering.
	 m. (-नः) The dewy season. (Nov.-Dec.)
 E. कपि to
tremble, and युच् or ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्पमान
कम्पमान mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Trembling.
 E. कपि to tremble, शानच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्पलक्ष्मन्|कंपलक्ष्मन्
कम्पलक्ष्मन् m. (-क्ष्मा) Air, wind.
 E. कम्प trembling, and लक्ष्मन् mark or
sign.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्पाक|कंपाक|कंपाकः|कम्पाकः
कम्पाक m. (-कः) Wind, air.
 E. काकुन् affixed to कपि.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्पान्वित
कम्पान्वित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Trembling, agitated.
 E. कम्प, and अन्वित pos-
sessed of.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्पित|कंपित|कम्पितं
कम्पित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Shaking, shaken, trembling.
	 n. (-तं) Trembling,
a trembling, a tremor
 E. कपि and क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्पिल|कम्पिलः
कम्पिल m. (-लः) A plant: see रोचनी; see काम्पिल्ल; also कम्पिल्ल and कम्पील.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्प्र|कंप्र
कम्प्र mfn. (-म्प्रः-म्प्रा-म्प्रं) Trembling, shaken.
 E. कपि, and र aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्ब
कम्ब r. 1st. cl. (कम्बति) To go, to move.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बर|कंबर|कम्बरः
कम्बर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Variegated.
	 m. (-रः) Variegated, (the colour.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बल|कंबल|कम्बलं|कंबलः|कम्बलः
कम्बल m. (-लः)
	 1. A blanket.
	 2. A chief of the Nagas or serpents.
	 3. A
small worm.
	 4. A dewlap.
	 5. An upper cloth or garment.
	 6. A
sort of deer.
	 n. (-लं) Water.
 E. कम् to desire, कल Uṇādi affix,
and ब inserted; or कम् the head, water, &c. and बल् to be strong,
affix अच्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बलकारक
कम्बलकारक m. (-कः) Woollen cloth manufacturer.
 E. कम्बल, and कारक
who makes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बलवाह्यक|कंबलवाह्यक
कम्बलवाह्यक n. (-कं) A kind of carriage, covered with a coarse blanket
or woollen cloth, and drawn by oxen.
 E. कम्बल and वह् to bear,
affixes ण्यत् and कन्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बलायिन्
कम्बलायिन् m. (-यी) A sort of kite.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बि|कंबिः|कम्बिः
कम्बि f. (-म्बिः)
	 1. A ladle or spoon.
	 2. A shoot, a branch or joint of a
bamboo.
 E. कम् to desire, बिन् affix, or with ङीष् added कम्बी.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बु|कंबु|कम्बुः
कम्बु mfn. (-म्बुः-म्बूः-म्बु) Speckled, variegated.
	 mn. (-म्बुः-म्बु)
	 1. A conch,
a shell.
	 m. (-म्बुः)
	 1. A bracelet, a ring.
	 2. A bivalve shell.
	 3. An
elephant.
	 4. The neck.
	 5. A vein or tubular vessel of the body,
&c.
 E. कम्ब् to go, उ affix, or कम् to desire; the form is irr.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बुक|कंबुकः|कम्बुकः
कम्बुक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) A mean person.
	 m. (-कः) A conch.
	 f. (-का) A
tree (Physais flexuosa.)
 E. कन् added to the last.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बुग्रीवा|कंबुग्रीवा
कम्बुग्रीवा f. (-वा) A neck marked with three lines like a shell, and con-
sidered to be indicative of exalted fortune.
 E. कम्बु a shell, and ग्रीवा
the neck.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बू|कंबू
कम्बू mfn. (-म्बूः-म्बूः-म्बु) A thief, a plunderer.
	 m. (-म्बूः) A bracelet. E.
कम् to desire, ऊ Uṇādi affix, and बुक् inserted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बोज|कंबोज|कंबोजः|कम्बोजः
कम्बोज m. (-जः)
	 1. The name of a country in the north of India, Cam-
boja or Camboya.
	 2. A kind of shell.
	 3. A description of
elephant: see काम्बोज.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्भारी
कम्भारी f. (-री) A plant, (Gmelina arborea.)
 E. कम् water, भार a burthen,
ङीष् affix; also गम्भारी.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्भु|कंभु
कम्भु n. (-म्भु) The root of the Andropogon muricatum.
 E. कं water, भू
produced.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्र|कम्रः
कम्र mfn. (-म्रः-म्रा-म्रं)
	 1. Desirous, cupidinous.
	 2. Beautiful, desirable. E.
कम् to desire, रन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कयस्था
कयस्था f. (-स्था) A medicinal plant, commonly Kakoli; also कायस्था, or
more accurately, perhaps, वयस्था.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर|करः
कर mfn. (-रः-रा-री-रं) Who or what does, makes or causes, as किङ्करः a
servant, who does anything; भयङ्करः frightful, what causes fear;
उपकरः who gives aid: अपकरः who does ill, &c.
	 m. (-रः)
	 1. A ray of
light, a sun or moonbeams.
	 2. Royal revenue toll, tax, impost, &c.
3. The hand.
	 4. Hail.
	 5. An elephant's trunk.
 E. कृञ् to do, &c. ट
or अप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करक|करकं|करकः
करक mf. (-कः-का) Hail.
	 mn. (-कः-कं)
	 1. The water-pot of the student
or ascetic.
	 2. The shell of the cocoanut hollowed to form a vessel.
m. (-कः)
	 1. The pomegranate tree.
	 2. Toll, tax.
	 3. A particular
sort of bird.
	 4. A plant, (Galedupa arborea, &c.) See करञ्ज.
	 5. A
tree, (Butea frondosa.)
 E. कन् added to the preceding, or कृ to in-
jure, &c. and वुन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करकण्टक|करकंटक|करकण्टकः
करकण्टक m. (-कः) The finger-nail.
 E. कर the hand, and कण्टक a thorn.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करकमल
करकमल n. (-लं) The hand, especially of a lover, a mistress, &c.
 E. कर,
and कमल a lotus; also similar compounds, as करपद्म, करपङ्कज,
करपल्लव, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करकलश|करकलशः
करकलश m. (-शः) The hand hollowed to receive water.
 E. कर, and कलश a ewer.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करकाम्भस्|करकांभस्
करकाम्भस् m. (-म्भाः) The cocoanut tree, (Cosos nucifera.)
 E. करक the
shell, and अम्भस् the water, the nut containing a serous fluid.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करकुद्मल
करकुद्मल n. (-लं) A finger.
 E. कर, and कुद्मल a bud.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करकोष|करकोषः
करकोष m. (-षः) The hollow of the hand.
 E. कर, and कोष receptacle.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करग्रह|करग्रहः
करग्रह m. (-हः)
	 1. Marriage.
	 2. Levying or gathering a tax.
	 3. A tax-
gatherer.
	 4. Taking the hand.
 E. कर, and ग्रह taking: one part of
the ceremony of marriage is the placing of the right hand of the
bride with the palm uppermost, in the right hand of the bride-
groom; also करग्राह.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करग्रहण
करग्रहण n. (-णं)
	 1. Levying or gathering a tax.
	 2. Taking the hand.
	 3.
Marriage.
 E. कर, and ग्रहण taking.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करग्राहिन्
करग्राहिन् mfn. (-ही-हिणी-हि)
	 1. Levying a tax.
	 2. Taking the hand. E.
कर, and ग्राहिन् who takes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करघर्षण|करघर्षणः
करघर्षण m. (-णः) The churning stick.
	 n. (-णं) Rubbing the hands to-
gether.
 E. कर the hand, and घर्षण rubbing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करघर्षिन्
करघर्षिन् m. (-र्षी) The churning stick.
 E. कर the hand, घृष् to rub,
णिनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करङ्क|करंक|करंकः|करङ्कः
करङ्क m. (-ङ्कः)
	 1. The head.
	 2. A cocoanut hollowed so as to form a cup
or vessel.
	 3. Any bone of the body.
	 4. A kind of sugar-cane.
 E. कॄ
to send or throw, &c. अंक aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करङ्कशालि|करङ्कशालिः
करङ्कशालि m. (-लिः) A sort of sugar-cane.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करङ्गण
करङ्गण n. (-णं) A market or fair.
 E. कर tax, and गण collection, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करच्छद|करच्छदः
करच्छद m. (-दः) The teak tree.
 E. कर, and छद a leaf.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करज|करजं|करजः
करज mfn. (-जः-जा-जं) Produced in or from a hand, a ray, &c.
	 m. (-जः)
1. A finger-nail.
	 2. The name of a timber tree, commonly Karañja,
(Galedupa arborea, Rox.)
	 n. (-जं) A perfume, commonly Nakhi
resembling a nail in appearance.
 E. कर the hand, and ज produced;
or कं pleasure, रञ्ज् to colour, &c. अच् affix; see the next.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करजाल
करजाल n. (-लं) A pencil of rays, a stream of light.
 E. कर, and जाल
multitude.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करञ्ज|करंज|करंजः|करञ्जः
करञ्ज m. (-ञ्जः) The name of a plant, commonly Karañja (Galedupa
arborea, Rox.)
 E. क water, and रञ्ज् to colour, अच् affix: see करज.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करञ्जक|करञ्जकः
करञ्जक m. (-कः)
	 1. Karañja: see the preceding.
	 2. Another plant,
(Verbesina scandens, Rox.) Sea भृङ्गराज.
 E. कन् added to the fore-
going.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करट|करटः
करट m. (-टः)
	 1. A crow.
	 2. An elephant's cheek.
	 3. Safflower or car-
thamus.
	 4. A man of a low or degraded profession.
	 5. The first
Śrāddha or ceremony performed in honour of a deceased relation.
6. An atheist, an unbeliever, an oppugner of the doctrines of
the Vedas.
	 7. A musical instrument, (Castanets?)
	 f. (-टा) A cow
difficult to be milked.
 E. क pleasure, &c. रट् to sound, and अच्
affix; or कृ to do, and अटन् Uṇādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करटक|करटकः
करटक m. (-कः) A crow.
 E. कन् added to the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करटिन्
करटिन् m. (-टी) An elephant.
 E. करट and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करटु|करटुः
करटु m. (-टुः) The numidian crane.
 E. कर् for कुत् bad, अट् to go, and
डु aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करण|करणं|करणः
करण n. (-णं)
	 1. An instrument or means of action.
	 2. Making, doing.
3. Action, act.
	 4. Cause, motive.
	 5. Business, occupation, as trade.
&c.
	 6. An organ of sense.
	 7. The body.
	 8. The mind or heart.
	 9.
A field.
	 10. Grain.
	 11. The posture, abstinence, &c. of an ascetic.
12. Copulation, (seu modus coeundi.)
	 13. The usage or practice of the
writer caste.
	 14. Acting, dramatic action.
	 15. Song, singing.
	 16. The
particular business of any tribe or caste.
	 17. Plaistering, spreading
any thing with the hand.
	 18. A Karana, an astrological division
of time; the Karanas are eleven: 7 moveable and 4 fixed, and
two are equal to a lunar day; or the time during which the moon's
motion from the sun amounts to 6°.
	 19. (In grammar) The instru-
mental case, or noun in that case.
	 m. (-णः) A man of a mixed
class, the son of a Śūdra woman by a Vaiśya; or, according to
some, of an outcaste Kṣatriya, by a Kṣatriya female; the
occupation of this class is writing, accounts, &c. a writer, a scribe.
f. (-णी)
	 1. A woman of the same caste.
	 2. (In arithmetic, &c.) A
surd or irrational quantity.
 E. कृ to do, to act, &c. ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करणत्राण|करणत्राणं
करणत्राण n. (-णं) The head.
 E. करण an organ of sense, and त्राण preserving.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करणत्व
करणत्व n. (-त्वं) Instrumentality, mediate agency.
 E. त्व added to करण.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करणनियम
करणनियम m. (-मः) Suppression or restraint of the organs of sense. E.
करण, and नियम restraint.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करणि
करणि f. (-णिः) Doing, making, effecting.
 E. कृ to do, अमि affix; also with
कन् added करणिका.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करणीय|करणीयं
करणीय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) To be done or made.
 E. कृ to do, अनीयर् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करणीसुता
करणीसुता f. (-ता) An adopted daughter.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करण्ड|करंड|करंडः|करण्डः
करण्ड m. (-ण्डः)
	 1. A basket or covered box of bamboo wicker work.
	 2.
A bee-hive, a honey-comb.
	 3. A sword.
	 4. A sort of duck.
	 5. An
aquatic weed, (Vallisneria.)
 E. कृ to do, अण्डन् Uṇādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करण्डिन्|करंडिन्
करण्डिन् m. (-ण्डी) A fish in general.
 E. करण्ड Vallisneria, and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करतल|करतलः
करतल n. (-लं) The palm of the hand.
 E. कर, and तल lower part.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करतलधृत
करतलधृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Held in the hand.
 E. करतल, and धृत held.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करतलस्थ
करतलस्थ mfn. (-स्थः-स्था-स्थं) Held in the hand, what is in or under the
hand.
 E. करतल, and स्य what is.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करताल|करतालं|करतालः
करताल nf. (-लं-ली)
	 1. A musical instrument, a cymbal.
	 2. Beating time
by clapping the hands.
 E. कर the hand, ताल musical time, and
ङीष् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करतोया
करतोया f. (-या) The Karatoya river, a river in the north-east of Bengal.
E. कर the hand, and तोय water: at the wedding of ŚIVA and
PARVATI, the water which had been poured into the hand of the
former, constituted, upon its being thrown on the ground, the
source of this river.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करद
करद mfn. (-दः-दा-दं)
	 1. Subject to tax or duty.
	 2. Tributary.
	 3. Who
gives his hand, &c.
 E. कर, and द who gives.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करदक्ष
करदक्ष mfn. (-क्षः-क्षा-क्षं) Handy, dexterous, ready.
 E. कर, and दक्ष clever.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करदीकृत
करदीकृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Subjugated, made tributary.
 E. करद, and कृत
made with च्वि augment.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करधृत
करधृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Held, supported by the hand.
 E. कर, and धृत held.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करनिहित
करनिहित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Held in the hand.
 E. कर, and निहित placed.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करपत्र|करपत्रं
करपत्र n. (-त्रं)
	 1. A saw.
	 2. Splashing water about while bathing, playing
or gamboling in water.
 E. कर, and पत्र a leaf; being in the hand
as a leaf.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करपत्रवत्|करपत्त्रवन्त्|करपत्रवन्त्
करपत्रवत् m. (-वान्) The palmyra tree (Borassus flabelliformis.)
 E. करपत्र
a saw, and मतुप् affix, the spatha being compared to a saw.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करपत्रिका
करपत्रिका f. (-का) Playing with water, gamboling in it, splashing it
about; also करपत्र, करपात्र and करपत्रिक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करपर्ण|करपर्णः|करपर्ण्ण
करपर्ण m. (-र्णः) A species of castor oil tree.
 E. कर, and पर्ण a leaf.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करपल्लव|करपल्लवः
करपल्लव m. (-वः) A finger.
 E. कर, and पल्लव a shoot.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करपात्र|करपात्रं
करपात्र n. (-त्रं)
	 1. The hand hollowed so as to hold anything.
	 2. The
throwing of water in sport.
 E. कर, and पात्र a cup.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करपाल|करपालः
करपाल m. (-लः) A sword, a scymitar.
 E. कर the hand, and पल protect-
ing, or with बल to be strong, करबाल.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करपालिका
करपालिका f. (-का)
	 1. A cudgel, a short club or wooden sword.
	 2. A
sword or one edged knife.
 E. कर the hand, पाल to nourish, ण्वुल्
affix, and the fem. termination.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करपुट|करपुटः
करपुट n. (-टं)
	 1. Joining the palms of the hands to show respect.
	 2. The
hands joined and hollowed to receive anything.
 E. कर, and पुट
a bag.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करपृष्ठ
करपृष्ठ n. (-ष्ठं) Back of the hand.
 E. कर, and पृष्ठ back.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करप्रचेय
करप्रचेय mfn. (-यः-या-यं)
	 1. To be held, to be taken hold of.
	 2. To be
collected by taxes.
 E. कर, and प्रचेय to be accumulated.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करप्राप्त
करप्राप्त mfn. (-प्तः-प्ता-प्तं) Held in hand, got, secured.
 E. कर, and प्राप्त obtained.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करबाल|करबालः
करबाल n. (-लं)
	 1. A finger-nail.
	 2. A sword, a scymitar; see करपाल.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करबालिका
करबालिका f. (-का) A small sword, &c. see करपालिका.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करभ|करभः
करभ m. (-भः)
	 1. The metacarpus, the hand from the wrist to the root
of the fingers.
	 2. A young camel or any young animal.
	 3. A young
elephant.
	 4. A perfume, commonly Nakhi.
	 f. (-भी) A she camel. E.
कृ to reject, अभच् Uṇādi affix: see कलभ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करभप्रिया
करभप्रिया f. (-या) A plant, a sort of Hedysarum.
 E. करभ, and प्रिय fond
of; fodder for camels.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करभिन्
करभिन् m. (-भी) An elephant.
 E. करभ and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करभीर|करभीरः
करभीर m. (-रः) A lion.
 E. करभ a young animal, and ईर who destroys.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करभूषण|करभूषणं
करभूषण n. (-णं) A bracelet, an ornament worn round the wrist.
 E. कर
the hand, and भूषण an ornament.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करमट्ट|करमट्टः
करमट्ट m. (-ट्टः) The betel nut tree: see गुवाक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करमरिन्
करमरिन् m. (-री) A prisoner, a captive.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करमर्द्द|करमर्द|करमर्दः|करमर्द्दः
करमर्द्द m. (-र्द्दः) A small tree (bearing an acid fruit, commonly Karonda
or Karinda, (Carissa carondas.)
 E. कर the hand, and मृद् to destroy,
अण् affix; what is pulled by the hand; also with कन् affix,
करमर्द्दक and fem. with ङीष् affix करमर्द्दी.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करमर्द्दक|करमर्दक|करमर्दकः|करमर्द्दकः
करमर्द्दक m. (-कः) See the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करमाल|करमालः
करमाल m. (-लः) Smoke, probably an error or corruption for खतमाल.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करमाला
करमाला f. (-ला) The hand used as a rosary, the joints of the fingers
corresponding to the beads.
 E. कर, and माला a rosary.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करमुक्त|करमुक्तं
करमुक्त n. (-क्तं) A missile weapon, but thrown by the hand, a dart,
javelin, &c.
 E. कर, and मुक्त released.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कराग्रपल्लव
कराग्रपल्लव m. (-वः) A finger.
 E. कर, and अग्र to the point, पल्लव a shoot.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करम्ब|करंब|करंबः|करम्बः
करम्ब mfn. (-म्बः-म्बा-म्बं)
	 1. Mixed, intermingled.
	 2. Set, inlaid.
	 m. (-म्बः)
Flour or meal mixed with curds: see करम्भ.
 E. कृ to do, अम्बच्
Uṇādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करम्बित|करंबित|करम्बितः
करम्बित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Intermingled, mixed, blended, &c.
	 2. Pound-
ed, reduced to grains or dust.
	 3. Set, inlaid.
 E. करम्ब and इतच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करम्भ|करंभ|करंभः|करम्भः
करम्भ m. (-म्भः) A cake, flour or meal mixed with curds.
 E. क water, and
रभि to send. &c. अच् affix; also with कन् added करम्भक; also with
रवि to sound, &c. करम्ब, &c. as above.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कररुद्ध
कररुद्ध mfn. (-द्धः-द्धा-द्धं) Stopped by the hand, held tight or fast.
 E. कर,
and रुद्ध stopped.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कररुह|कररुहः
कररुह m. (-हः) A finger-nail.
 E. कर the hand, and रुह to grow, to rise,
affix क.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करर्द्धि|करर्द्धिः
करर्द्धि m. (-र्द्धिः) A small musical instrument used for marking time,
(a castanet,) or clapping the hands together for that purpose. E.
कर the hand, ऋद्धि property.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करवालिका
करवालिका f. (-का) A small club, &c. see करबालिका.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करवी
करवी f. (-वी) The leaf of the Asafœtida plant, Hingupatri: see कवरी
and कारवी.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करवीर|करवीरः
करवीर m. (-रः)
	 1. A fragrant plant, (Oleander or Nerium odorum.)
	 2. The
name of a demon.
	 3. A sword or scymitar.
	 4. A cemetery, a place
for burning or interring the dead.
	 f. (-रा) Red arsenic.
	 f. (-री)
	 1. A
name of ADITI, the mother of the gods.
	 2. A good cow.
	 3. A wo-
man who has borne a son, a mother.
 E. कर here said to mean a
root, वीर to become evident, and अच् affix; or कर hand, वि prefixed
to ईर् to go, &c. affix क.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करवीरक|करवीरकः
करवीरक m. (-कः)
	 1. A sword.
	 2. A poison, the poisonous root of the
Oleander.
	 3. A tree, (Pentaptera arjuna.)
 E. कन् added to the
preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करशाखा
करशाखा f. (-खा) A finger.
 E. कर the hand, and शाखा a branch.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करशीकर|करशीकरः
करशीकर m. (-रः) Water expelled by an elephant's trunk.
 E. कर his
trunk, and शीकर drizzling rain.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करशूक|करशूकः
करशूक m. (-कः) A finger-nail.
 E. कर the hand, शूक the beard of corn.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करशोथ|करशोथः
करशोथ m. (-थः) Œdematous swelling of the hands.
 E. कर, and शोथ
swelling.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करहाट|करहाटः
करहाट m. (-टः)
	 1. The fibrous root of a lotus.
	 2. A tree, (Vangueria
spinosa.)
 E. क water, and रह् to abandon, करह a lotus, अट what
goes, or by what it goes; or कर the hand, हट् to illuminate or
adorn, and अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करहाटक|करहाटकः
करहाटक m. (-कः) The name of a tree, (Vangueria spinosa.)
 E. कन्
added to the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कराघात|कराघातः
कराघात m. (-तः) A thump, a blow with the hand.
 E. कर, and आघात a blow.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करामर्द्द|करामर्द|करामर्दः|करामर्द्दः
करामर्द्द m. (-र्द्दः) A fruit-tree, (Carissa carondas:) see करमर्द्ध.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कराम्बुक|कराम्बुकः
कराम्बुक m. (-कः) A plant, (Flacourtia cataphracta, Rox.) See कृष्णपाक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कराम्लक|कराम्लकः
कराम्लक m. (-कः) A fruit-tree, (Carissa carondas.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करायिका
करायिका f. (-का) A bird, a small kind of crane.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करारोट|करारोटः
करारोट m. (-टः) A finger ring.
 E. कर the hand, रुट् to shine, with आङ्
prefixed, affix अच्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कराल|करालं|करालः
कराल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं)
	 1. Great, large.
	 2. High, lofty.
	 3. Formidable,
terrible.
	 4. Having projecting teeth.
	 m. (-लः) Resin, pitch, or a
mixture of oil and the resin of the Sal tree.
	 n. (-लं) A dark kind
of Tulasi or Basil.
	 f. (-ला) A kind of swallow wort, commonly
Anantamul, (Hemisdemus Indicus.) See शारिवा.
	 f. (-ली) One of
the seven tongues of AGNI or fire.
 E. कर the hand, &c. ला with आङ्
prefixed to take, and क affix; or कर, and अल् to be able, &c. affix
अण्, fem. do टाप् or ङीष्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करालक|करालकः
करालक m. (-कः) A sort of Basil, the dark kind.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करालकर
करालकर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं)
	 1. Having a large trunk, (an elephant.)
	 2.
Having a powerful arm or hand.
 E. कराल, and कर a hand.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करालम्ब|करालंब|करालम्बः
करालम्ब mfn. (-म्बः-म्बा-म्बं) One who stretches out his hand to support
or pick up another, &c.
 E. कर, and आलम्ब what supports.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करालम्बन
करालम्बन n. (-नं) Extending the hand, taking by the hand, helping,
sustaining.
 E. कर, and आलम्बन supporting.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करालवदन
करालवदन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Of hideous aspect, ugly, frightful.
	 f. (-ना) A
form or emanation of DURGĀ.
 E. कराल, and वदन countenance; also
करालानन, करालमुख, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करालिक|करालिकः
करालिक m. (-कः) A tree.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करालित
करालित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Afraid of, alarmed by or at.
	 2. Rendered
formidable.
	 3. Magnified.
 E. कराल and इतच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करिकणवल्ली
करिकणवल्ली f. (-ल्ली) A species of pepper, (Piper chavya.)
 E. करिकण
elephant-pepper, वल्ली a vine.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करिकुम्भ|करिकुंभ|करिकुम्भः
करिकुम्भ m. (-म्भः) The frontal globe of an elephant.
 E. करि, and कुम्भ the
same.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करिकुसुम्भ|करिकुसुम्भः
करिकुसुम्भ m. (-म्भः) A fragrant powder prepared from the flowers of the
Nāgakesara, (Mesua ferrea;) also करिकुमुम्भक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करिगर्ज्जित|करिगर्जित|करिगर्ज्जितं
करिगर्ज्जित n. (-तं) The roaring of elephants.
 E. करिन् an elephant, and
गर्ज्जित sounding, thundering.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करिचर्म्मन्|करिचर्मन्
करिचर्म्मन् n. (-र्म्म) An elephant's hide.
 E. करिन्, and चर्म्मन् skin.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करिज|करिजः
करिज m. (-जः) A young elephant.
 E. करि an elephant, and ज born.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करिदन्त|करिदंत|करिदन्तः
करिदन्त m. (-न्तः)
	 1. An elephant's tusk.
	 2. Ivory.
 E. करिन्, and दन्त a
tooth.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करिदारक|करिदारकः
करिदारक m. (-कः) A lion.
 E. करिन् an elephant, दॄ to tear or rend, ण्वुल्
affix; or with युच् affix करिदारण.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करिन्
करिन् m. (-री) An elephant.
 E. कर the proboscis of this animal, and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करिनासिका
करिनासिका f. (-का) A musical instrument.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करिपिप्पली
करिपिप्पली f. (-ली) A plant bearing a pungent fruit, (Pothos officinalis,
Rox.)
 E. करि, and पिप्पली long-pepper; Elephant-pepper; consi-
dered by native writers as a large species of that condiment; also
गजपिप्पली, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करिपोत|करिपोतः
करिपोत m. (-तः) A young elephant, one under ten years old.
 E. करि,
and पोत a young animal; also करिशावक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करिबन्ध|करिबंध|करिबन्धः
करिबन्ध m. (-न्धः) The post to which an elephant is tied.
 E. करि, and बन्ध
a binding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करिमाचल|करिमाचलः
करिमाचल m. (-लः) A lion.
 E. करि, मा splendor, and चल् to go; the lion
being considered as the natural enemy and destroyer of the
elephant.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करिमुख|करिमुखः
करिमुख m. (-खः) A title of GANESA.
 E. करि, and मुख a face: this diety
being represented with an elephant's head.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करियादस्
करियादस् n. (-दः) A water-elephant, a hippopotamus.
	 n. करि, and यादस्
any aquatic animal.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करिर|करिरः
करिर m. (-रः) The shoot of a bamboo: see करीर.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करिशावक|करिशावकः
करिशावक m. (-कः) A young elephant under five years old; according
to some, also until ten years. E. See करिपोत, शावक meaning a
young animal.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करिष्ठ
करिष्ठ mfn. (-ष्ठः-ष्ठा-ष्ठं) Doing much.
 E. कर who does, इष्ठन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करिष्यत्|करिष्यन्त्
करिष्यत् mfn. (-ष्यन्-ष्यन्ती-ष्यत्) Doing, (with a future sense,) about to do.
E. कृ to do, शतृ affix of the future.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करिष्यमाण
करिष्यमाण mfn. (-णः-णा-णं) About to do, going to do.
 E. कृ to do, शानच्
affix of the future.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करीन्द्र|करींद्र|करीन्द्रः
करीन्द्र m. (-न्द्रः)
	 1. A large, or a state elephant.
	 2. INDRA'S
elephant.
 E. करि, and इन्द्र chief.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करीयस्
करीयस् mfn. (-यान्-यसी-यः) Who does much.
 E. कर who does, ईथसुन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करीर|करीरः
करीर mn. (-रः-रं) The shoot of a bamboo; also करिर.
	 m. (-रः)
	 1. A
thorny plant, described as growing in deserts, and fed upon by
camels, commonly Karil, (Capparis aphylla, Rox.)
	 2. A water jar.
f. (-रा or -री)
	 1. The root of an elephant's tusk.
	 2. A cricket, a
small grasshopper, &c.
 E. कॄ to injure, to throw or send, &c. and
ईरण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करीरिका
करीरिका f. (-का) The root of an elephant's tusk: see करीरी.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करीष|करीषं|करीषः
करीष mn. (-षः-षं) Dry cowdung.
 E. कॄ to throw, send, &c. and ईषन्
Uṇādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करीषङ्कषा|करीषंकषा
करीषङ्कषा f. (-षा) A strong wind, a gale.
 E. करीष, कष् to disturb, खच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करीषाग्नि|करीषाग्निः
करीषाग्नि m. (-ग्निः) A fire of dry cowdung.
 E. करीष, and अग्नि fire; this
substance is very generally used as fuel in Hindustan.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करुण|करुणः
करुण mf. (-णः-णा) Tenderness, pity, compassion, the feeling or
sentiment. adv. (-णं) Pitifully, in distress.
	 m. (-णः)
	 1. Sorrow,
affliction, one of the eight sentiments.
	 2. The name of a fruit-tree,
the pamplemousse, (Citrus decumana.)
	 3. A Jina or Jaina saint. E.
कॄ to send or cast, उनन् Uṇādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करुणात्मक
करुणात्मक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Compassionate, tender-hearted.
 E. करुणा,
आत्म self, कन् added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करुणापर|करुणापरः
करुणापर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Compassionate, tender.
 E. करुणा, पर excellent.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करुणामल्ली
करुणामल्ली f. (-ल्ली) Double jasmine: see नवमल्ली.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करुणामय
करुणामय mfn. (-यः-यी-यं) Gentle, compassionate.
 E. करुणा and मयट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करुणार्द्र
करुणार्द्र mfn. (-र्द्रः-र्द्रा-र्द्रं) Tender-hearted, soft, sensitive.
 E. करुणा; and
आर्द्र moist.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करुणाविप्रलम्भ
करुणाविप्रलम्भ m. (-म्भः) Grief of separation with the uncertainty of meet-
ing again, fears occurring in absence.
 E. करुणा sorrow, and विप्रलम्भ
separation.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करुणावेदिता
करुणावेदिता f. (-ता) Charitableness, kindliness.
 E. करुणा, वेदिन् who knows,
तल् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करेट|करेटः
करेट m. (-टः) A finger-nail.
 E. कर, and इट् to go, अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करेटव्या
करेटव्या f. (-व्या) The numidian crane.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करेटु|करेटुः
करेटु mf. (-टुः-टुः) The numidian crane.
 E. क for कुत् bad, or क water,
and रेट् to sound, उ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करेणु|करेणुः
करेणु mf. (-णुः-णुः) A male or female elephant.
	 m. (-णुः) A plant: see
कर्णिकार.
 E. कृ to do, &c. एणु Uṇādi affix; also with a final long
vowel, करेणू.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करेणुभू
करेणुभू m. (-भूः) The name of a Muni or saint; also पालकाप्य.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करेणुवर्य्य|करेणुवर्य
करेणुवर्य्य m. (-र्य्यः) A large or powerful elephant.
 E. करेणु, and वर्य्य
excellent.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करेणुसुत|करेणुसुतः
करेणुसुत m. (-तः) The name of a Muni.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करेणू
करेणू mf. (-णूः-णूः) A male or female elephant: see करेणु.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करेनर|करेनरः
करेनर m. (-रः) Benzoin or storax.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करोट|करोटं
करोट mf. (-टः-टिः or -टी) The bones of the head, the scull.
 E. क the
head, रुट् to oppose, to defend, &c. affixes अच् and इन् or ङीष्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करोत्कर
करोत्कर m. (-रः)
	 1. A bundle of rags.
	 2. A heavy tax.
 E. कर, and उत्कर
plenty.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करोदक
करोदक n. (-कं) Water held in, or poured into the hand.
 E. कर, and
उदक water.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्क|कर्कः
कर्क mfn. (-र्कः-र्का-र्कं)
	 1. White.
	 2. Good, excellent.
	 m. (-र्कः)
	 1. A white
horse.
	 2. A mirror.
	 3. A water jar.
	 4. A crab.
	 5. A sign of the
zodiac, (Cancer.)
	 6. A fire.
	 7. A long gourd.
	 8. Beauty.
 E. कृ to do,
&c. क Uṇādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्कचिर्भिटी
कर्कचिर्भिटी f. (-टी) A small cucumber.
 E. कर्क, and चिर्भिटी the same.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्कट|कर्कटः
कर्कट m. (-टः)
	 1. A crab.
	 2. The sign of the zodiac, (Cancer.)
	 3. A kind
of bird, the numidian crane.
	 4. A long gourd: see तुम्बी.
	 5. The
fibrous root of the lotus.
	 6. The curved end of the beam of a
balance, to which the strings supporting the scale are attached.
7. A compass.
	 8. The radius of a circle.
	 f. (-टा) A plant, common-
ly Kurkavali, (Momordica mixta.)
	 f. (-टी)
	 1. A kind of cucumber,
(Cucumis utilatissimus, Rox.)
	 2. The fruit of the silk-cotton
tree.
	 3. A snake.
	 4. A water jar.
 E. कर्क a Sautra root, to laugh or
smile, and अटन् affix, fem. affix टाप् or ङीष्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्कटक|कर्कटकः
कर्कटक m. (-कः) A crab.
 E. कन् added to the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्कटशृङ्गिका
कर्कटशृङ्गिका f. (-का) A plant, commonly Kankarasringi: see the next.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्कटशृङ्गी
कर्कटशृङ्गी f. (-ङ्गी) A plant, the fruit of which is compared to the claw
or feelers of a crab, the horn of a goat, &c. see अजशृङ्गी.
 E. कर्कट,
शृङ्ग a horn, इनि and ङीष् affixes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्कटाख्या
कर्कटाख्या f. (-ख्या) See the preceding.
 E. कर्कट, and आख्या an appellation.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्कटि|कर्कटिः
कर्कटि f. (-टिः) A sort of cucumber, (Cucumis utilatissimus:) see कर्कट.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्कटु|कर्कटुः
कर्कटु m. (-टुः) The numidian crane.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्कन्धु|कर्कंधु|कर्कंधुः|कर्कन्धुः
कर्कन्धु mf. (-न्धुः-न्धूः) A tree, the jujube: see the next.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्कन्धू|कर्कंधू
कर्कन्धू mf. (-न्धूः-न्धूः) The jujube (Zizyphus jujuba.)
 E. कर्क excellent,
धा to have, and कु Uṇādi affix, fem. affix ऊञ्
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्कर|कर्करं|कर्करः
कर्कर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Hard, firm.
	 n. (-रं) Stone, lime-stone, especially
the nodule found in Bengal under the name of Kankar.
	 m. (-रः) A
mirror.
	 f. (-री) A small water-jar.
 E. कर्क beauty, from कर्क to smile,
र from रा to give, fem. affix ङीष्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्कराक्ष|कर्कराक्षः
कर्कराक्ष m. (-क्षः) A wag-tail.
 E. कर्कर a mirror, and अक्ष an eye:
bright-eyed.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्कराङ्ग|कर्करांग|कर्कराङ्गः
कर्कराङ्ग m. (-ङ्गः) A gallinule.
 E. कर्कर firm, and अङ्ग body.
