<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्कराटु|कर्कराटुः
कर्कराटु m. (-टुः) A glance, a side look.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=160-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्कराटुक|कर्कराटुकः
कर्कराटुक m. (-कः) The numidian crane: see कर्करेटु.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=160-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्करान्धक
कर्करान्धक m. (-कः) A blind well, one of which the mouth is overgrown
with grass, &c. so as to be hidden.
