कर्कशच्छद m. (-दः)
	 1. A plant, (Trophis aspera.)
	 2. A kind of gourd,
(Trichosanthes diœca.)
 E. कर्कश hard, and छद a leaf.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=160-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

