<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्कोट|कर्कोटः
कर्कोट m. (-टः) One of the principle serpents or Nagas of Pātāla.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=160-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्कोटक|कर्कोटकः
कर्कोटक m. (-कः)
	 1. A plant, (Ægle marmelos:) see मालूर.
	 2. A Naga
or serpent: see the preceding.
	 3. A kind of gourd, (Momordica
charantia:) in this sense; also कर्कोटिका.
