<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्घ
कर्घ r. 1st. cl. (कर्घति) To go, to move. Probably a variant misreading for 'karba'^1
[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20260702. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/283.
