कर्णसंस्राव|कर्णसंस्रावः|कर्ण्णसंस्राव
कर्णसंस्राव m. (-वः) Discharge of pus from the ear.
 E. कर्ण, and संस्राव
suppuration.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=161-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णस्राव
कर्णस्राव m. (-वः) Discharge of ichorous matter from the ear.
 E. कर्ण,
and स्राव running.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=161-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णस्फोटा|कर्ण्णस्फोटा
कर्णस्फोटा f. (-टा) A sort of creeper.
 E. कर्ण, and स्फोट a boil.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=161-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णाट|कर्णाटः
कर्णाट m. (-टः) A country, Karṇāṭa, whence the modern Karnatic: the
name however was anciently applied to the central districts of the
peninsula, including Mysur.
	 f. (-टी)
	 1. One of the Rāgiṇīs or fe-
male personification of the musical modes, the bride of the Rāga
MĀLAVA.
	 2. A plant.
 E. कर्ण the ear, a prince, &c. and अट् to go,
affix अच्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=161-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णानुज|कर्णानुजः
कर्णानुज m. (-जः) A name of Yudhiṣṭhira, the elder brother of the
five Pandu princes.
 E. कर्ण, and अनुज younger born; the younger
brother of KARṆA.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=161-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णान्तिक|कर्णांतिक
कर्णान्तिक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Near or close to the ear.
 E. कर्ण, and अन्तिक
near.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=161-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णान्दु|कर्णांदु|कर्णान्दुः
कर्णान्दु f. (-न्दुः)
	 1. An ornament of the ear.
	 2. An ear-ring: see the next,
and कर्णेन्दु.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=161-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णान्दू|कर्णांदू
कर्णान्दू f. (-न्दूः) An ornament of the ear, an ear-ring, &c.
 E. कर्ण, and अन्दू
a chain.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=161-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णारा
कर्णारा f. (-रा) An instrument for perforating the ear.
 E. कर्ण the ear, ऋ
to go, अच् and टाप् affs.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=161-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णारि|कर्णारिः
कर्णारि m. (-रिः) A name of ARJUNA.
 E. कर्ण, and अरि an enemy.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=161-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णालङ्कार|कर्णालंकार
कर्णालङ्कार m. (-रः) An ear-ring, an ornament of the ear.
 E. कर्ण, and
अलङ्कार ornament; also कर्णालङ्क्रिया, कर्णालङ्कृति, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=161-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णास्फाल|कर्णास्फालः
कर्णास्फाल m. (-लः) The flapping of an elephant's ear.
 E. कर्ण, and आस्फाल
with the same import.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=161-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णिक|कर्णिकः
कर्णिक mfn. (-कः-का-कं)
	 1. Having large or long ears.
	 2. Having ears.
3. Having a helm.
	 m. (-कः) A steersman.
	 f. (-का)
	 1. An ear-ring or
ornament of the ear.
	 2. The pericarp of a lotus.
	 3. The middle
finger.
	 4. The tip of an elephant's trunk.
	 5. A fruit-stalk.
	 6. A pen
or small brush.
	 7. A plant, (Premna spinosa, &c.) see अग्निमन्थ. E.
कर्ण the ear, &c. इक affix; or कन् and टाप् affs.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=161-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णिकाचल|कर्णिकाचलः|कर्ण्णिकाचल
कर्णिकाचल m. (-लः) The fabulous mountain Sumeru.
 E. कर्णिका the seed
vessel of a lotus, and अचल a mountain, Meru being in the centre of
the world, the divisions of which are delineated as the leaves of a
lotus; also other compounds, as कर्णिकाद्रि, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=161-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णिकार|कर्णिकारः|कर्ण्णिकार
कर्णिकार m. (-रः)
	 1. The name of a tree, commonly Kaniyar, (Pteros-
permum acerifolium.)
	 2. A sort of Cassia, (Cassia fistula.)
	 3. The
pericarp of a lotus.
 E. कर्णिका an ornament of the ear, ऋ to go, अण्
affix; also with कन् added कर्णिकारक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=161-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णिकिन्
कर्णिकिन् m. (-की) An elephant.
 E. कर्णिका the tip of his trunk, and
इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=161-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णिन्
कर्णिन् mfn. (-र्णी-र्णिनी-र्णि)
	 1. Having an ear, relating to the ear, &c.
	 2.
Long-eared.
	 3. Barbed, (as an arrow.)
	 4. Having a helm.
	 m. (-र्णनी)
	 1.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=161-b" target="_blank">Page161-b+ 60</a>]
The name of a mountain, one of the seven principal ranges of the
mountains, dividing the universe.
	 2. The neck, the part near the
ear.
	 3. A steersman.
	 f. (-र्णिनी) A disease of the uterus, prolapsus
or polypus uteri.
 E. कर्ण, and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=161-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णिल
कर्णिल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Long-eared.
 E. कर्ण, and इलच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=161-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णीरथ|कर्णीरथः|कर्ण्णीरथ
कर्णीरथ mf. (-थः-था) A covered car, or according to some, a litter for the
conveyance of woman, &c. borne on men's shoulders.
 E. कर्णी the
part near the ear, and रथ a carriage.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=161-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णीसुत|कर्णीसुतः|कर्ण्णीसुत
कर्णीसुत m. (-तः) A name of KANSA the enemy of KṚṢṆA.
 E. कर्णी the
mother of this prince, and सुत a son.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=161-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णेजप|कर्णेजपः
कर्णेजप mfn. (-पः-पा-पं) An informer, a tale-bearer.
 E. कर्णे in the ear,
and जप् to recite in a low voice, अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=161-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णेन्दु|कर्णेन्दुः|कर्ण्णेन्दु
कर्णेन्दु f. (-न्दुः)
	 1. A semicircular ornament of the ear.
	 2. An ear-ring. E.
कर्ण, and इन्दु the moon, a crescent, &c. see कर्णान्दु.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=161-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्त्त|कर्त|कर्तः|कर्त्तः
कर्त्त r. 10th. cl. (कर्त्तयति) To slacken or unloose, to remove; also कत्र
and कर्त्र.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=161-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्त्तन|कर्तन|कर्त्तनं
कर्त्तन n. (-नं)
	 1. Cutting, cutting off or in pieces.
	 2. Spinning cotton or
thread.
	 f. (-नी) Scissors.
 E. कृत् to cut, ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=161-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्त्तरिका|कर्तरिका
कर्त्तरिका f. (-का)
	 1. A knife.
	 2. A small sword or cutlass.
	 3. A hunter's
knife or sword, a couteau de chasse.
	 4. A scissors.
 E. कर्त्तरी, and
कन् added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=161-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्त्तरी|कर्तरी
कर्त्तरी f. (-री)
	 1. A scissors or shears.
	 2. A knife.
	 3. A small sword or
cutlass.
 E. कृत् to cut, अरन् affix, and ङीप् fem. do.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=161-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्त्तव्य|कर्तव्य|कर्त्तव्यं|कर्त्तव्यः
कर्त्तव्य mfn. (-व्यः-व्या-व्यं)
	 1. To be done or made.
	 2. What ought to be
done.
 E. कृ to make, तव्य aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=161-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्त्तव्यता|कर्तव्यता
कर्त्तव्यता f. (-ता) Necessity, obligation, propriety, fitness.
 E. कर्त्तव्य, and
तल् affix; also with त्व affix कर्त्तव्यत्वं.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=161-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्त्तित|कर्तित
कर्त्तित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Cut, cut off.
 E. कृत् to cut, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=161-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्त्तिष्यत्|कर्तिष्यत्
कर्त्तिष्यत् mfn. (-ष्यन्-ष्यन्ती-ष्यत्) Intending or wishing to cut.
 E. कृत् to
cut, शतृ affix to future participle; also कर्त्तिष्यमाण mfn. (-णः-णा-णं)
with शानच् aff.
