<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्पूरक|कर्पूरकः
कर्पूरक m. (-कः) Zedoary, (Curcuma zerumbet, Rox.) See कर्पूरक and
कर्चूरक.
