कर्म्मनिष्ठ|कर्मनिष्ठ
कर्म्मनिष्ठ mfn. (-ष्ठः-ष्ठा-ष्ठं) Engaged in active duties.
	 m. (-ष्ठः) A Brahman
who performs sacrifices, &c.
 E. कर्म्म, and निष्ठ who stays in.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=163-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
