<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्म्मफलोदय|कर्मफलोदय
कर्म्मफलोदय m. (-यः) The occurrence of consequences.
 E. कर्म्मफल, and
उदय rising.
