<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्म्मबन्धन|कर्मबन्धन|कर्मबंधन
कर्म्मबन्धन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Bound by acts.
	 n. (-नं) Confinement to repeated
existence, as the consequence of acts.
 E. कर्म्म, and बन्धन binding.
