<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्म्मभू|कर्मभू
कर्म्मभू f. (-भूः) Tilled or cultivated ground.
 E. कर्म्म, and भू earth, ground,
&c. it may also mean the same as the next word.
