कर्म्मभूमि|कर्मभूमि|कर्मभूमिः|कर्म्मभूमिः
कर्म्मभूमि f. (-मिः) Āryāvarta or the central part of India, Bharata
Varṣa, the whole of India, or any similar place considered as holy
land.
 E. कर्म्म, and भूमि earth: where men perform the ceremonies
of the Hindu faith.
