<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्म्मयुग|कर्मयुग|कर्म्मयुगं
कर्म्मयुग m. (-गः) The fourth and present age of the world, the iron
age, the Kali-yug: see कलि, and above, कर्म्मज.
 E. कर्म्म, and युग a
Yuga or age.
