<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्म्मवश|कर्मवश|कर्मवशः
कर्म्मवश m. (-शः)
	 1. The necessary influence of acts.
	 2. Fate, considered
as the inevitable consequence of actions done in a former life. E.
कर्म्म, and वश subjection.
