कर्म्मविपर्य्यय|कर्मविपर्यय
कर्म्मविपर्य्यय m. (-यः)
	 1. Succession of office or employment, revolving or
alternating duty.
	 2. Contrariety or reverse of any act or business.
E. कर्म्म, and विपर्य्यय contrariety.
