कर्षयत्
कर्षयत् mfn. (-यन्-यन्ती-यत्)
	 1. Dragging, pulling.
	 2. Attracting.
	 3. Haras-
sing, annoying.
 E. कृष् to attract, causal form, शतृ aff.
