कर्षाह्व
कर्षाह्व n. (-ह्वं) A Tola, a weight of sixteen Mashas.
 E. कर्ष, and आह्वा
appellation.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=164-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्षित
कर्षित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Drawn.
	 2. Attracted.
	 3. Ploughed.
 E. कृष् to
draw, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=164-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्षिन्
कर्षिन् mfn. (-र्षी-र्षिणी-र्षि)
	 1. What pulls or draws.
	 2. What ploughs or
furrows.
	 3. Attractive, what attracts.
	 f. (-र्षिणी)
	 1. A medicinal sort
of moon-plant: see क्षीरिणी.
	 2. The bit of a bridle.
 E. कृष् to plough,
&c. णिनि aff.
