<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्षू
कर्षू m. (-र्षूः)
	 1. A fire of dried cowdung.
	 2. Agriculture, cultivating,
cultivation.
	 3. Livelihood.
	 f. (-र्षूः)
	 1. A river.
	 2. A canal.
	 3. A
shallow trench for receiving the sacrificial fire.
 E. कृष् to plough,
&c. Uṇādi affix ऊ.
