कलधौतलिपि
कलधौतलिपि f. (-पिः)
	 1. A streak of gold.
	 2. Illumination of a manu-
script with gold.
 E. कलधौत, and लिपि writing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=164-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलध्वनि|कलध्वनिः
कलध्वनि m. (-निः)
	 1. The turtle dove.
	 2. The Kokila^1 or Indian cuckoo.
3. A peacock.
	 4. A low sweet tone.
 E. कल, and ध्वनि a sound.
[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20260511. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/217.
