कलन|कलनं|कलनः
कलन n. (-नं)
	 1. A spot, a stain.
	 2. An offence, fault, defect.
	 3. Mur-
muring, sounding.
	 4. An embryo or the first vestige of the fœtus.
m. (-नः) A sort of cane.
	 f. (-ना)
	 1. Subjection, submission.
	 2. Chat-
tering, talking.
	 3. Shedding, emitting.
 E. कल् to count, ल्युट् aff.
