कलन्दर|कलंदरः|कलन्दरः
कलन्दर m. (-रः) A man of a mixed caste.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=164-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलन्दिका|कलंदिका
कलन्दिका f. (-का) Knowledge, intelligence, wisdom in general.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=164-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलभ|कलभः
कलभ m. (-भः)
	 1. A young elephant: see कल.
	 2. The Datura plant. E.
कल् to cast, अभच् Uṇādi affix; or according to some authorities, कृ
to cast, अभच् affix, making करभ, and र is then changed to ल.
