कांस्य mn. (-स्यः-स्यं) A goblet, a drinking vessel.
	 n. (-स्यं)
	 1. White cop-
per or brass, queen's metal, any amalgam zinc and copper.
	 2. A
musical instrument, a sort of gong or plate of bell-metal struck
with a stick or rod.
	 3. A measure: see कंस, &c.
 E. कसि to injure,
ण्यत् aff.
