m. (-क्षः) A glance, a wink or leer.
	 n. (-क्षं) A frown, a look of dis-
pleasure.
 E. का for कु diminutive or depreciative, and अक्षि the eye.
f. (-क्षी)
	 1. A sort of trefoil, (Cytisus cojan.)
	 2. A perfume, a fra-
grant kind of earth.
 E. कक्ष a creeping plant, अण् and ङीप् affs.
