काण्डहीन|काण्डहीनं
काण्डहीन n. (-नं) A fragrant grass, a sort of cyperus: see भद्रमुस्तक. E.
काण्ड a stem, and हीन deprived.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=171-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काण्डीर|कांडीर|कांडीरः|काण्डीरः
काण्डीर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Armed with an arrow, an archer.
	 m. (-रः)
	 1. A
creeping plant, commonly Kanda Bel, (Momordica charantia.)
	 2.
A plant, (Achyranthes aspera.)
	 f. (-रा) Bengal madder, (Rubia
manjith:) see मञ्जिष्ठा.
 E. काण्ड an arrow, a stem, &c. and ईरच् aff.
