कातर|कातरः
कातर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं)
	 1. Confused, perplexed, disordered.
	 2. Timid,
gentle.
	 m. (-रः) A large kind of fish, commonly Katala (Cyprinus
catla, HAM.)
 E. का a little or badly, and तर what crosses.
