<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काथिक|काथिकः
काथिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Belonging to a story, told in it, &c.
	 m. (-कः)
A narrator.
 E. कथा, and ठक् aff.
