<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कादम्बरीवीज|कादम्बरीवीजं
कादम्बरीवीज n. (-जं) Ferment, yeast, whatever occasions fermentation.
E. कादम्बरी, and वीज seed.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=172-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

