<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कादम्बिनी|कादंबिनी
कादम्बिनी f. (-नी) A long line of clouds.
 E. कादम्ब the Kadamba flower,
इनि and ङीप् affixes, implying a multitude; the clouds being com
pared with the large white flowers of the Nauclea cadamba.
