<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कानन|काननं
कानन nf. (-नं-नी)
	 1. A forest, a grove.
	 2. The face of BRAHMĀ.
	 3. A
house.
 E. कनि to shine, in the causal form, and ल्युट् affix, or क
BRAHMĀ, and आनन a face.
