<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कान्तलक|कान्तलकः
कान्तलक m. (-कः) A tree, the wood of which something resembles
mahogany, commonly Toon, (Cedrela tunna, Rox.)
 E. कान्त beauty,
and र what gives, कन् added, and र changed to ल.
