<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कान्तारक|कांतारकः|कान्तारकः
कान्तारक m. (-कः) A sort of sugar-cane.
 E. कान्त good, excellent (juice,)
ऋ to go, to gain, अण् and कन् affixes: see the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=172-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
