	 1. Desirous, libidinous.
	 2. Self-willed.
	 m.
(-री)
	 1. A sparrow.
	 2. A name of GARUḌA the bird of VIṢṆU. E.
काम desire, and चारिन् who goes, from चर् with णिनि affix; also
