कामम्
कामम् ind. A particle, 1. Of reluctant assent, (well, very well.)
	 2. Of
assent, (willingly, readily.)
	 3. Of agreement, (very well, so be it.)
	 4.
Of contempt or invidious remark.
	 5. Agreeably to desire, follow-
ing the inclination: see काम.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=173-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काममह|काममहः
काममह m. (-हः) The day of full moon in the month Chaitra, (March-
April.)
 E. काम the deity, and मह worship; a festival in honour of
KĀMA^1.
[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20260617. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/264.
