काम्पिल्ल m. (-ल्लः)
	 1. Sunda Rochani, a perfume and drug so called.
2. The name of a country said to be in the north-west of India. E.
कपि to tremble or shake, इल्ल affix; also काम्पिल or काम्पील, काम्पिल्य, &c.
