काम्यमरण
काम्यमरण n. (-णं) Voluntary death, suicide.
 E. काम्य, and मरण dying.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=174-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काम्याभिप्राय|काम्याभिप्रायः
काम्याभिप्राय m. (-यः) The purpose of deriving benefit from any act. E.
काम्य, and अभिप्राय intention.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=174-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काम्ल
काम्ल mfn. (-म्लः-म्ला-म्लं) Slightly acid, acidulous.
 E. का dimin, अम्ल sour.
