कारन्धमिन्|कारंधमिन्
कारन्धमिन् m. (-मी)
	 1. A brazier, a worker in mixed or white metal.
	 2. A
mineralogist, an assayer.
 E. कारं work, and धमिन् who blows; from
ध्मा to blow, and इनि aff.
