कारम्भा|कारंभा
कारम्भा f. (-म्भा) A plant bearing a fragrant seed, commonly Priyangu.
का for कु bad, आरम्भ beginning; very diminutive while young.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=175-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कारमिहिका
कारमिहिका f. (-का) Camphor.
