<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कारयत्
कारयत् mfn. (-यन्-यन्ती-यत्) Causing to do, conferring any power or
authority to do, &c. कृ to do, causal form, शतृ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=175-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कारयमाण
कारयमाण mfn. (-णः-णा-णं) Doing what is appointed, carrying into effect
