 E. कृ to do, causal form, शानच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=175-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कारयितृ
कारयितृ mfn. (-ता-त्री-तृ) Causing to act or do.
 E. कृ to do, causal form,
तृच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=175-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कारव|कारवः
कारव m. (-वः) A crow.
 E. का an imitative sound, रव who sounds.
	 f. (-वी)
1. A kind of Anise, (Anethum sowa.)
	 2. Another plant, (Celosia
cristata.)
	 3. The asafœtida plant or its leaf, Hinguparni.
	 4. A kind
of fennel, (Nigella Indica.)
	 4. A small gourd.
 E. क water, आङ् be-
fore रु to go, अण् and ङीप् affs.
