कारवेल्ल m. (-ल्लः) A kind of gourd, (Momordica charantia.)
 E. कार cer-
tainty, and वेल्ल what goes; also with कन् added कारवेल्लक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=175-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
