<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कारि|कारिः
कारि mfn. (-रिः-रिः-रि) An artist, an artificer.
	 f. (-रिः) Action, act,
agency.
 E. कृञ् to do, and इन् Uṇādi aff.
