कारिका
कारिका f. (-का)
	 1. An actress, a dancing woman.
	 2. Action, agency.
	 3.
Comment, gloss.
	 4. An art, a profession.
	 5. Sharp pain.
	 6. Inter-
est at any stipulated rate.
 E. कृञ् to do, and वुन् affix, fem. termina-
tion टाप् and इ substituted for the penultimate vowel.
