कार्षक|कार्षकः
कार्षक m. (-कः) A husbandman.
 E. कृष् to draw furrows, क्वुन् unadi affix,
and the vowel made long.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=177-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
