कालनिर्य्यास|कालनिर्यास|कालनिर्यासः|कालनिर्य्यासः
कालनिर्य्यास m. (-सः) A fragrant and resinous substance, (Bdellium): see
गुग्गुल.
 E. काल black, and निर्य्यास an extract.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालनेमि|कालनेमिः
कालनेमि m. (-मिः)
	 1. A demon, the son of HIRAṆYAKAŚIPU.
	 2. A Rak-
shasa described in the Rāmāyaṇa
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालनेमिन्
कालनेमिन् m. (-मी) A demon: see कालनेमि.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालनेमिरिपु|कालनेमिरिपुः
कालनेमिरिपु m. (-पुः) An epithet of KṚṢṆA.
 E. कालनेमि the name of a
demon who undertook to destroy the deity in his youth, and रिपु
the foe: see similar names.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालनेमिहन्
कालनेमिहन् m. (-हा) KṚṢṆA or VIṢṆU. see the preceding.
 E. कालनेमि,
and हन् who kills or destroys.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालनेम्यरि|कालनेम्यरिः
कालनेम्यरि m. (-रिः) See कालनेमिरिपु. E. As above, अरि a foe.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालपक्व
कालपक्व mfn. (-क्वः-क्वाः-क्वं) Spontaneously ripened.
 E. काल and पक्व matured.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालपर्ण|कालपर्णः|कालपर्ण्ण
कालपर्ण m. (-र्णः) A tree bearing dark coloured leaves, (Tabernæ
montana coronaria,) commonly Tagara: see
 E. गत काल black, and
पर्ण a leaf.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालपरिवास|कालपरिवासः
कालपरिवास m. (-सः) Standing for a time, (as to get stale or fermented,
&c.)
 E. काल and परिवास abiding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालपाश|कालपाशः
कालपाश m. (-शः) The noose of YAMA or death.
 E. काल, and पाश a noose.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालपुरुष|कालपुरुषः
कालपुरुष m. (-षः)
	 1. One of YAMA'S attendants or ministers.
	 2. An as-
trological figure of a man, with the positions of the constella-
tions, &c. inscribed on different parts of the body for the purpose
of predicting his fortunes; also कालनर, &c.
 E. काल black, and पुरुष
a man.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालपृष्ठ|कालपृष्ठं|कालपृष्ठः
कालपृष्ठ n. (-ष्ठं)
	 1. The bow of KARṆA.
	 2. A bow in general.
	 m. (-ष्ठः)
	 1.
The black antelope.
	 2. A heron.
 E. काल black. and पृष्ठ the back;
black-backed.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालप्रभात|कालप्रभातं
कालप्रभात n. (-तं) The sultry season, autumn, the two months follow-
ing the rainy season.
 E. काल time, and प्रभात shining.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालप्ररूढ
कालप्ररूढ mfn. (-ढः-ढा-ढं) Over-blown, over-ripe.
 E. काल, and प्ररूढ
blown.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालबलन
कालबलन m. (-नः) Armour, mail.
 E. काल death, and बलन strengthen-
ing, defending; perhaps a wrong reading for कायबलम, q. v.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालमान|कालमानः
कालमान m. (-नः) Black Tulasi; also read कालमाल.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालमुष्कक|कालमुष्ककः
कालमुष्कक m. (-कः) A plant, (Bignonia Indica.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालमशिका
कालमशिका f. (-का)
	 1. Bengal madder, (Rubia manjith.)
	 2. A black sort
of Teori, a plant so called, a species of convolvulus: see काल-
मेषिका.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालमेशी
कालमेशी f. (-शी) See कालमेषी.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालमेषिका
कालमेषिका f. (-का)
	 1. Bengal madder.
	 2. Black Teori: see त्रिवृता.
 E. काल
black, मिष् to posses, अन् and ङीष् affixes, and कन् added; or with-
out this affix, कालमेषी; also being derived from मिश् to sound.
कालमेशिका and कालमेशी.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालमेषी
कालमेषी f. (-षी)
	 1. A plant, (Serratula anthelmintica.)
	 2. Bengal
madder, (Rubia manjith:) see the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालयवन|कालयवनः
कालयवन m. (-नः) An Asura, an enemy of KṚṢṆA, destroyed by him
by stratagem.
 E. काल black, यवन् a Yavana.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालयाप|कालयापः
कालयाप m. (-पः)
	 1. Procrastination, putting off, delaying.
	 2. Passing
away time.
 E. काल, and या to go, causal form, घञ् affix; also
with ल्युट्, कालयापनं; also यापः and यापनं.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालरात्रि|कालरात्रिः
कालरात्रि m. (-त्रिः)
	 1. A particular night, one which occurs on the 7th
day of the 7th month of every 77th years; after such a period of
life, a man is exempt from attention to the usual ordinances.
	 2.
The last night of a Kalpa 3. A dark night.
	 4. A form of Śakti
or DURGĀ.
 E. काल black, time, and रात्रि a night: see भीमरथी.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काललवण|काललवणं
काललवण n. (-णं) A factitious and purgative salt, commonly Bitlavan
or Bitnaban.
 E. काल black, and लवण salt.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काललौह|काललौहं
काललौह n. (-हं) Iron.
 E. काल black, and लौह a metal.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालवृक्ष
कालवृक्ष m. (-क्षः) A kind of vetch: see कालवृन्त.
 E. काल black, वृक्ष tree.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालवृद्धि|कालवृद्धिः
कालवृद्धि f. (-द्धिः) Periodical interest, payable monthly, &c.
 E. काल, and
वृद्धि interest.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालवृन्त|कालवृन्तः
कालवृन्त m. (-न्तः) A kind of vetch, (Dolichos biflorus.)
	 f. (-न्ती) Trumpet
flower.
 E. काल black, and वृन्त stalk: see कुलथ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालवेला
कालवेला f. (-ला) A season at which any act is improper, half a watch
in every day.
 E. काल and वेला time.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालशाक
कालशाक n. (-कं) A sort of potherb.
 E. काल black, शाक a potherb.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालशेय|कालशेयं
कालशेय n. (-यं) Buttermilk.
 E. कलशी a jar, and ढक् affix; produced in
a jar or pitcher by churning; also कालसेय.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालसंरोध|कालसंरोधः
कालसंरोध m. (-धः) Lapse of a long period of time.
 E. काल time, संरोध
impediment.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालसदृश
कालसदृश mfn. (-शः-शी-शं)
	 1. Opportune, seasonable.
	 2. Deathlike.
 E. काल
and सदृश like.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालसम्पन्न|कालसंपन्न
कालसम्पन्न mfn. (-न्नः-न्ना-न्नं)
	 1. Dated, bearing a date.
	 2. Effected by
time.
 E. काल, and सम्पन्न produced.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालसर्प|कालसर्पः
कालसर्प m. (-र्पः) The black and most deadly variety of the cobra,
(Coluber naga)
 E. काल black, and सर्प a serpent.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालसार|कालसारं|कालसारः
कालसार m. (-रः) The black antelope, n. (-रं) A sort of Sandal.
 E. काल
black, and सार essence.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालसूत्र|कालसूत्रं
कालसूत्र n. (-त्रं) One of the twenty-one hells.
 E. काल from कल् to count,
a reckoning, and सूत्र a thread, a rule; also with कन् added काल-
सूत्रक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=179-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालसेय|कालसेयं
कालसेय n. (-यं) Buttermilk: see कालशेय.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=179-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालस्कन्ध|कालस्कंध|कालस्कन्धः
कालस्कन्ध m. (-न्धः)
	 1. A sort of ebony, (Diospyros melanoxylon, Rox.)
2. The Tamala, a tree bearing dark blossoms.
	 3. Another plant:
see जीवक.
	 4. The glomerous fig tree.
 E. काल black and स्कन्ध the
trunk of a tree.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=179-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालाकृष्ट
कालाकृष्ट mfn. (-ष्टः-ष्टा-ष्टं)
	 1. Led to death or destruction, drawn to or
by one's fate.
	 2. Produced or brought about by time.
 E. काल, and
आकृष्ट attracted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=179-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालाक्षरिक|कालाक्षरिकः
कालाक्षरिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) A scholar, a pupil.
 E. काल time, अक्षर a
letter. and ठक् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=179-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालागुरु
कालागुरु n. (-रु) A black kind of aloe wood or agallochum: see अगुरु. E.
काल black, and अगुरु agallochum.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=179-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालाग्नि|कालाग्निः
कालाग्नि m. (-ग्निः) The fire that is to destroy the world.
 E. काल, and
अग्नि fire.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=179-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालाञ्जनी
कालाञ्जनी f. (-नी) A small shrub, used as a purgative.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=179-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालात्यय|कालात्ययः
कालात्यय m. (-यः) Loss or destruction by lapse of time.
 E. काल, and
अत्यय destruction.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=179-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालानुनादिन्
कालानुनादिन् m. (-दी)
	 1. A large black bee.
	 2. A sparrow.
	 3. The fran-
coline partridge.
 E. काल season, and अनुनादिन् who sings or sounds.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=179-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालानुसारक|कालानुसारकं|कालानुसारकः
कालानुसारक n. (-कं)
	 1. A tree, commonly Tagara 2. Yellow Sandal. E.
काल, and अनुसार being like or conforming to.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=179-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालानुसारि|कालानुसारिः
कालानुसारि m. (-रिः)
	 1. Benzoin or benjamin.
 E. काल black, अनुसार
resembling, being, and कि affix; also कालानुसार्य्य the affix being यत.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=179-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालानुसार्य्य|कालानुसार्य|कालानुसार्यः|कालानुसार्य्यं
कालानुसार्य्य n. (-र्य्यं)
	 1. Gum benjamin or benzoin.
	 2. A yellow fragrant
wood from which a perfume is prepared.
	 3. A timber tree, com-
monly Sisu: see शिंशपा.
	 4. A tree, commonly Tagara. E. See the
preceding; also with कन् added कालानुसार्य्यक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=179-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालान्तक|कालांतक|कालान्तकः
कालान्तक m. (-कः) YAMA, death.
 E. काल and अन्तक destroyer.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=179-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालान्तर|कालांतर
कालान्तर n. (-रं)
	 1. Interval, intermediate time.
	 2. Period, process of
time.
	 3. A former or another time.
 E. काल and अन्तर between &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=179-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालान्तरविष|कालांतरविष|कालान्तरविषः
कालान्तरविष m. (-षः) A poisonous animal, venomous only when enraged
or alarmed, as a rat, &c.
 E. काल time, अन्तर after or at, and विष
poison; having venom only at times.
