कालान्तरावृत|कालांतरावृत
कालान्तरावृत^1 mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Hidden or concealed by times.
 E. कालान्तर,
and आवृत्त covered.
[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20260716. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/305.
