<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालिन्दी|कालिंदी
कालिन्दी f. (-न्दी) The YAMUNĀ or JUMNA river.
 E. कालिन्द. A mountain,
part of the Himālaya range, and the seat of the river's source,
अण् aff.
