कालिन्दीकर्षण|कालिंदीकर्षण|कालिन्दीकर्षणः
कालिन्दीकर्षण m. (-णः) A name of BALARĀMA.
 E. कालिन्दी the YAMUNĀ,
and कर्षण the plougher; having diverted the stream into a new
and devious channel, marked out by his ploughshare.
