काल्प|काल्पः
काल्प mfn. (-ल्पः-ल्पा-ल्पं)
	 1. Preceptive, ritual.
	 2. Relating to a Kalpa or
period so called.
	 m. (-ल्पः) Zedoary, (Curcuma zerumbet.)
 E. कल्प
a precept, and अण् affix; the plant forms a part of oblations
offered upon certain occasions to fire; also with कन् added
