काल्य|काल्यं
काल्य mfn. (-ल्यः-ल्या-ल्यं) Timely, seasonable.
	 n. (-ल्यं) Dawn, day-break,
see कल्य f. (-ल्या)
	 1. A cow fit for the bull.
	 2. (by confusion with kalyā)^1 Pleasant or auspicious
discourse: see कल्या.
 E. काल time, and यत् aff.
