कावार|कावारं
कावार n. (-रं) An aquatic plant, (Vallisneria,)
	 f. (-री) An umbrella,
Chattah, especially one without a stick, and worn like a broad
brimmed hat.
 E. क the head, and आवार what covers or protects,
from वृ to screen, and घञ् aff.
