कावृक|कावृकः
कावृक m. (-कः)
	 1. A gallinaceous fowl 2. The ruddy goose.
	 3. A small
singing bird, (Loxia philippensis:) see पीतमस्तक.
 E. क water, or क
for कु bad, आङ् before वृ to cover, and कक् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=180-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
