कावेर|कावेरं
कावेर n. (-रं) Saffron, (Crocus sativus.)
	 f. (-री)
	 1. A river in the Dekhin,
the Kaveri.
	 2. A courtezan, a harlot.
	 3. Turmeric.
 E. कव to colour
एरक् affix, and the radical vowel made long, fem. affix ङीष्.
