<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काशिकाप्रिय|काशिकाप्रियः
काशिकाप्रिय m. (-यः) A name of DHANWANTARI, as king of Benares E.
काशिका the city Kasi, and प्रिय a friend; also काशिराज.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=180-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
