<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काशीनाथ|काशीनाथः
काशीनाथ m. (-थः) A name of ŚIVA.
 E. काशी Kasi or Benares, and भाव
lord or master.
