काश्मीर|काश्मीरं|काश्मीरः
काश्मीर n. (-रं)
	 1. A plant with a tuberous root, a sort of costus, (Cus-
tus speciosus.)
	 2. A country, Kashmir, or in the plu. (-राः) its
inhabitants.
	 f. (-री) A tree, (Ficus elastica.)
 E. कश्मीर Kashmir,
and अण् affix; produced in that place.
