<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कास|कासः
कास m. (-सः)
	 1. Cough, catarrh.
	 2. A species of reed or long grass,
(Saccharum spontaneum.)
	 3. Morunga, (Hyperanthera, &c.) see
