<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कासमर्द्दन|कासमर्दन|कासमर्द्दनः
कासमर्द्दन m. (-नः) A sort of cucumber, (Trichosanthes dioeca.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कासर|कासरः
कासर m. (-रः) A buffalo.
 E. क water, and आङ् prefixed to सृ to go,
affix अप्; who frequents water, this animal being partial to
marshy places.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कासार|कासारं|कासारः
कासार m. (-रः) A pond, a pool.
 E. क water, सृ to go, आङ् prefix, and
घञ् affix, or कास् to shine, आरन् Uṇādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कासारि|कासारिः
कासारि m. (-रिः) A plant, (Cassia esculenta:) see कासमर्द्द्र
 E. कास cough,
and अरि a foe.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कासालु|कासालुः
कासालु m. (-लुः) An esculent root, a sort of Yam.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कासीस|कासीसं
कासीस n. (-सं) Green vitriol, green sulphate of iron.
 E. कास् to go, ईसण्
aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कासू
कासू f. (-सूः)
	 1. Indistinct speech.
	 2. Speech in general.
	 3. Understand-
ing.
	 4. Devotion.
	 5. Light, lustre.
	 6. A sort of spear or lance.
 E. कस्
to go, to shine, or कास् to make a bad sound, क Uṇādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कासूतरी
कासूतरी f. (-री) A short spear, a javelin.
 E. कासू, and ष्टरच् diminutive
aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काहका
काहका f. (-का) A musical instrument: see काहला.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काहल|काहलं|काहलः
काहल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं)
	 1. Dry, withered.
	 2. Mischievous.
	 3. Large,
excessive.
	 f. (-ली)
	 1. One of the Apsaras or courtezans of INDRA'S
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-b" target="_blank">Page181-b+ 60</a>]
heaven.
	 2. The sound of any tube, pipe or musical instrument. (-ला)
A young woman.
	 mf. (-लः-ला) A horn, either a cow horn, or an
instrument of that shape.
	 m. (-लः)
	 1. A cock.
	 2. Sound in
general.
	 3. A cat.
	 n. (-लं) Indistinct speech. adv. Much, excessive-
ly.
 E. क pleasure, the head, &c. हल् to plough or divide, with आङ्
prefixed, affix अच्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काहलापुष्प|काहलापुष्पः
काहलापुष्प m. (-ष्पः) Thorn apple, (Datura metel.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कि
कि r. 3rd cl. (चिकेति) To know: with निर् prefixed, to attain certainly,
to ascertain positively. किं See किम्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किंशारु|किंशारुः
किंशारु m. (-रुः)
	 1. The beard of corn.
	 2. An arrow.
	 3. A heron.
 E. किं
what, or sometimes, शृ to injure, &c. रुण् Uṇādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किंशुक|किंशुकः
किंशुक m. (-कः) A tree bearing beautiful red blossoms, and hence often
alluded to by the poets, (Butea frondośa;) also पलाश
 E. किं what,
something, शुक a parrot; its red flowers being of the colour of a
parrot's beak.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किंशुलुक|किंशुलुकः
किंशुलुक m. (-कः) A species of the Kiṃśuka. see the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किकि|किकिः
किकि m. (-किः) A blue jay,
 E. कि an imitative sound; the word being
repeated; or कै to emit a sound, and कि affix; also किकीदीवि,
किकी, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किकिदिवि|किकिदिविः
किकिदिवि m. (-विः) The blue jay.
 E. किकि, an imitative sound and दिव् to
play, कि affix; also in other forms किकि, किकिदिव, किकिदीवि,
किकीदिवी.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किकीदिव|किकीदिवः
किकीदिव m. (-वः) See the preceding. E. As before, अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किकीदीवि|किकीदीविः
किकीदीवि m. (-विः) See किकिदिवि.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किखि|किखिः
किखि m. (-खिः) A monkey, an ape.
	 f. (-खिः) A small jackal, a fox.
 E. कु
to sound, डिखि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किङ्कर|किंकर|किङ्करः
किङ्कर mfn. (-रः-रा or -री-रं) A servant.
 E. किं what or something, and
कर who does.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किङ्किणि
किङ्किणि f. (-णिः or -णी)
	 1. A girdle of small bells, or any tinkling orna-
ment.
	 2. An acid sort of grape.
 E. किं some, and किण an imitative
sound, affix क, with इन् or ङीष् fem. affix; also with कन् added
किङ्किणीका.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किङ्किर|किंकिर|किङ्किरं|किंकिरः|किङ्किरः
किङ्किर m. (-रः)
	 1. The Indian cuckoo, the Koil or Kokila.
	 2. A large
black bee.
	 3. A horse.
	 4. KĀMADEVA.
	 f. (-रा) Blood.
	 n. (-रं) The
frontal sinus of an elephant.
 E. किं something, कॄ to scatter, क aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किङ्किरात|किंकिरात|किंकिरातः|किङ्किरातः
किङ्किरात m. (-तः)
	 1. A name of KĀMADEVA.
	 2. A parrot.
	 3. The Koil or
Indian cuckoo.
	 4. A tree, (Jonesia asoka.)
	 5. A species of barleria:
see झिण्टी.
 E. किङ्किर as above, and अत who goes or is.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किङ्किरिन्
किङ्किरिन् m. (-री) A plant, commonly Buinchhi, (Flacourtia sapida,
Rox.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किञ्च|किंच
किञ्च ind.
	 1. An inceptive or continuative particle, (moreover further,
again.)
	 2. A particle of comprehension.
 E. किं what, च and.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किञ्चन|किंचन|किञ्चनः
किञ्चन m. (-नः) A species of the Palasa or Butea frondosa. ind. Some-
what something.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किञ्चनता|किंचनता
किञ्चनता f. (-ता) Somewhat, something.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किञ्चित्|किंचित्
किञ्चित् ind.
	 1. Something somewhat.
	 2. A part, a little.
	 n. किं what,
चित् to think, affix क्विप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किञ्चिलिक|किंचिलिकः|किञ्चिलिकः
किञ्चिलिक m. (-कः) See the following.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किञ्चलुक
किञ्चलुक m. (-कः) A worm.
 E. किञ्चित् a little, and चल् to go, or चुल् to be
high, वुन् affix, deriv. irr.; it is sometimes written किञ्चिलिक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किञ्ज|किंज|किंजं|किञ्जं
किञ्ज n. (-ञ्जं) The filament of a lotus: see किञ्जल्क.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किञ्जल|किंजल|किंजलः|किञ्जलः
किञ्जल m. (-लः) The filament of a lotus: see किञ्जल्क.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किञ्जल्क|किंजल्क|किञ्जल्कं|किंजल्कः|किञ्जल्कः
किञ्जल्क m. (-ल्कः) The filament of a lotus, great numbers of which sur-
round the pericarp.
	 n. (-ल्कं) The flower of the Mesua ferrea. E.
किञ्चित् somewhat, जक् to hide or cover, क affix, and the form irr.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किट
किट r. 1st cl. (केटति)
	 1. To go or approach.
	 2. To alarm or terrify.
	 3. To
dread, to fear.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किटि|किटिः
किटि m. (-टिः) A hog.
 E. किट् to go, and कि affix; also किटि.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किटिभ|किटिभः
किटिभ m. (-भः) A bug.
 E. किटि a hog, भ who resembles, from भा to
shine, affix ड.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=181-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किट्ट|किट्टं
किट्ट n. (-ट्टं) Excrement, excretion, dirt.
 E. किट् to go, here implying to
go out of, (the body, &c.) and क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किट्टवर्जित|किट्टवर्ज्जित|किट्टवर्ज्जितं
किट्टवर्जित n. (-तं) Semen virile.
 E. किट्ट dirt, &c. वर्जित deprived.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किट्टाल|किट्टालः
किट्टाल m. (-लः)
	 1. A copper vessel.
	 2. Scoria, rust of iron, &c.
 E. किट्ट
dirt, अल् to be able, अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किण|किणः
किण m. (-णः)
	 1. A wart, a mole.
	 2. A scar.
	 3. A corn, a callosity.
4. An insect found in wood.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किणि|किणिः
किणि f. (-णिः) A tree, (Achyranthes aspera:) see अपामार्ग.
 E. किण् a
scar, and कि affix; making scars; that is cicatrizing wounds,
sores, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किणिही
किणिही f. (-ही) Achyranthes aspera.
 E. किणि a sore, and ह what re-
moves, fem. affix ङीष्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किण्व|किण्वं|किण्वः
किण्व mn. (-ण्वः-ण्वं) Ferment, a drug or seed used to produce fermenta-
tion, in the manufacture of spirits from sugar, bassia, &c.
	 n. (-ण्वं)
Sin.
 E. कण् to sound, &c. क्वन् Uṇādi affix, and the इ irregularly in-
serted: see कण्व.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कित
कित r. 1st cl. (चिकित्सति)
	 1. To cure, to administer remedies, to practise
physic.
	 2. To remove, to destroy.
	 3. To chastise.
	 4. (Usually with
वि prefixed,) To doubt; this root is regular. r. 3rd cl. (चिकेति) To
know. r. 10th cl. (केतयति)
	 1. To dwell.
	 2. To desire; some authori-
ties make it a regular root of the 1st cl. in these senses, and others
deny its admitting of any conjugation.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कितव|कितवः
कितव mfn. (-वः-वा-वं)
	 1. A gamester, a gambler.
	 2. A cheat, cheating,
fraudulent.
	 3. Mad, crazy.
	 4. Mischievous, malicious.
	 m. (-वः)
	 1.
Thorn apple, (Datura metel.)
	 2. A kind of perfume, commonly
Rochana.
 E. किं what, तव your, (what is your stake or wager?) he
who asks such a question, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किन्तनु|किंतनु|किन्तनुः
किन्तनु m. (-नुः) An insect described as having eight legs and a very
slender body, a species of spider.
 E. किं for किञ्चित् a little, and तनु
the body.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किन्तमाम्|किंतमाम्
किन्तमाम् ind. Whether, either of any.
 E. किं, and तमप् with आमु added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किन्तराम्|किंतराम्
किन्तराम् ind. Whether, either of two.
 E. किं, and तरप् with आमु added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किन्तु|किंतु
किन्तु ind.
	 1. But.
	 2. Moreover, further. E. A compound particle of किं
and तु disjunctive particle.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किन्तुघ्न|किंतुघ्न|किन्तुघ्नः
किन्तुघ्न m. (-घ्नः) One of the eleven periods called Karanas.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किन्धिन्|किंधिन्
किन्धिन् m. (-न्धी) A horse: see किल्किन्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किन्नर|किंनर|किन्नरः
किन्नर m. (-रः)
	 1. A demigod attached to the service of KUVERA, a
celestial chorister or musician.
	 2. A kind of flower or attendant on
a Jina or Jaina saint.
	 f. (-री) A female Kinnara, or chorister.
 E. किं
what, used contemptuously, (what kind of) नर a man: the Kinnara
having, with the human figure, the head of a horse.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किन्नरेश|किंनरेश|किन्नरेशः
किन्नरेश m. (-शः) A name of KUVERA.
 E. किन्नर a Kinnara, and ईश master,
lord; also other similar compounds, as किन्नरेश्वर.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किन्नु|किंनु
किन्नु ind.
	 1. A particle of interrogation, (what?)
	 2. Doubt, (how, what?)
3. Comparison, (thus, as, like, how much less)
	 4. Conjunction,
(again, further.)
	 5. Place, location, and 6. Agency.
 E. किम् and नु
conjoined.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किम्
किम् ind. (-किम् or किं)
	 1. What, how.
	 2. Either, or; a particle of doubt
or interrogation.
	 3. A particle of contempt. The relative pronoun.
mfn. (-कः-का-किं) What, who, which expressing, 1. Doubt.
	 2. In-
terrogation.
	 3. Disdain.
	 4. Reproach, (as in English, Who are you,
&c.)
	 5. Kind, sort.
 E. कै to sound, डिमि Uṇādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किमर्थम्
किमर्थम् ind. What for, wherefore, why.
 E. किम् and अर्थ object.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किमु
किमु ind. Either, or, whether implying doubt or discrimination: see किम्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किमुत
किमुत ind.
	 1. Either, or, whether, implying.
	 2. Doubt or discrimina-
tion.
	 3. Much, exceeding; a particle of magnitude or quantity.
	 4.
An interrogative, how, what, &c. see किम्.
 E. किम् and the particle उत.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किम्पच|किंपच|किम्पचः
किम्पच mfn. (-चः-चा-चं) Miserly, avaricious.
 E. किम् what, (nothing,) पच
who cooks.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किम्पचान|किंपचान|किम्पचानः
किम्पचान mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Miserly, niggardly, avaricious.
 E. किं what,
used contemptuously, पच् to cook, and शानच् affix, or with अच् only,
किम्पचः see मितम्पच, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किम्पाक|किंपाक|किम्पाकः
किम्पाक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Mother-led, infantine, childish.
	 m. (-कः) A cu-
curbitaceous plant, (Trichosanthes palmata; also Cucumis colocyn-
thus.)
 E. किं depreciative, and पाक what is ripe or mature.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किम्पुरुव
किम्पुरुव m. (-षः)
	 1. A heavenly musician: see किन्नर.
	 2. A division of
the universe, one of the nine Khandas or portions into which the
world is divided, and described as the country between the
Himachala and Hemakuta mountains.
	 3. A despicable or low man.
E. किम् what, contemptuously, and पुरुष a man; also with the first
vowel of that word lengthened, किम्पूरुष.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किम्पुरुषेश्वर|किंपुरुषेश्वर|किम्पुरुषेश्वरः
किम्पुरुषेश्वर m. (-रः) An epithet of KUVERA: see किन्नरेश.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किम्पूरुष|किंपूरुष|किम्पूरुषं
किम्पूरुष n. (-षं) The division of the world, called by this name: see
किम्पुरुष.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किम्भरा|किंभरा
किम्भरा f. (-रा) A kind of perfume, commonly Nali: see नली.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किम्भूत|किंभूत
किम्भूत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) or n. only, (-तं) How, in what manner or degree,
like what.
 E. किम्, and भूत become.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किंवत्|किंवन्त्
किंवत् mfn. (-वान्-वती-वत्) Poor, mean, insignificant.
 E. किं a little, मतुप्
possessive aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किंवदन्ति|किंवदंति|किंवदन्तिः
किंवदन्ति f. (-न्तिः) Rumour, report.
 E. किं what, वद् to say, and झिच् Uṇādi
affix, or with झच् and ङीष् affixes किंवदन्ती.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किंवा
किंवा ind. Or, else, moreover.
 E. किं what, वा or.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कियत्|कियन्त्
कियत् mfn. (-यान्-यती-यत्)
	 1. How much, how many, ind. (-यत्)
	 1. A little.
2. How much, used chiefly in composition; as कियत्काल how long,
for a short time; कियदवधि or कियत्पर्य्यन्तं how far, or for a little way.
E. किं and मतुप् affix, and य is substituted for the व.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कियदेतिका
कियदेतिका f. (-का) Effort, vigorous and persevering exertions. E.
कियत् used contemptuously, and इति from इदम् this, affix ठक्; (how
great a task is this, that it should not be effected, &c.) इह here,
being employed in place of इति, the word is written कियदेहिका.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कियद्दूर
कियद्दूर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) For a short distance, a little way.
 E. कियत्, and
दूर far.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कियाह|कियाहः
कियाह m. (-हः) A horse of a red or bay colour.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किर|किरः
किर m. (-रः) A hog.
 E. कॄ to scatter, क affix; also किरि.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किरक|किरकः
किरक m. (-कः) A scribe.
 E. कॄ to scatter, वुन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किरण|किरणः
किरण m. (-णः)
	 1. A ray of light, a sun or moon beam.
	 2. The sun.
E. क to scatter, (light,) and क्यु Uṇādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किरणमय
किरणमय mfn. (-यः-यी-यं) Radiant, bright, refulgent.
 E. किरण and
मयट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किरणमालिन्
किरणमालिन् m. (-ली) The sun.
 E. किरण, माला a garland, and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किरत्
किरत् mfn. (-रन्-रन्ती-रत्)
	 1. Scattering, spreading.
	 2. Lighting, shedd-
ing light.
 E. कॄ to scatter शतृ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किरात|किरातः
किरात m. (-तः)
	 1. A savage, one of the barbarous tribes who inhabit
woods and mountains and live by the chase, the Kirrhadœ of
Arrian.
	 2. ŚIVA as a mountaineer opposed to ARJUNA, the account
of which is the subject of the poem, the Kiratarjuniya.
	 3. A kind
of gentian: see किराततिक्त.
	 4. A pigmy a dwarf.
	 5. A groom, a
horseman.
	 f. (-ती)
	 1. The river GANGES or its goddess.
	 2. A name
of DURGĀ.
	 3. A bawd, a procuress.
	 4. The celestial GANGES or
river of Svarga.
 E. कॄ to scatter, (speech, &c.) and अत who goes;
also किरातक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किराततिक्त|किराततिक्तः
किराततिक्त m. (-क्तः) A kind of gentian, (Gentiana cherayta.)
 E. किरात a
savage, तिक्त pungent, bitter.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किराताशिन्
किराताशिन् m. (-शी) A name of GURUDA the bird of VIṢṆU.
 E. किरात a
pigmy, and अशिन् who eats.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किराति|किरातिः
किराति f. (-तिः) A name of the GANGES.
 E. कॄ to scatter, (sound, &c.)
to make a murmuring noise, अत who goes, and इन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किरातिनी
किरातिनी f. (-नी) Indian spikenard; see जटामांसी.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किरि|किरिः
किरि m. (-रिः) A hog.
 E. कॄ to scatter, (dirt, &c.) and इ Uṇādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किरिटि|किरिटिः
किरिटि n. (-टिः) The fruit of the marshy date tree.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=183-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किरीट|किरीटं|किरीटः
किरीट mn. (-टः-टं) A crest, a diadem.
 E. कॄ to scatter, (pearls, &c.) and
कीटन् Uṇādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=183-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किरीटधारण
किरीटधारण n. (-णं) Wearing a tiara, assuming the crown.
 E. किरीट, and
धारण bearing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=183-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किरीटधारिन्
किरीटधारिन् mfn. (-री-रिणी-रि) Crowned, having a tiara.
	 m. (-री) A king.
E. किरीट, and धारिन् who wears.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=183-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किरीटिन्
किरीटिन् mfn. (-टी-टिनी-टि) Crested, crowned.
	 m. (-टी)
	 1. A king.
	 2. A
name of ARJUNA.
 E. किरीट a crest, and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=183-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किर्म्मी|किर्मी
किर्म्मी f. (-र्म्मी) The Palasa tree: see षलाश.
	 2. A hall, a building, an
apartment.
	 3. An image of gold.
	 4. A figure of iron.
 E. कृ to
make, मन् and ङीप् affixes, deriv. irr.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=183-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किर्म्मीर|किर्मीर|किर्मीरः|किर्म्मीरः
किर्म्मीर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Variegated.
	 m. (-रः)
	 1. The orange tree.
	 2. The
name of a Rākṣasa or goblin.
	 3. A variegated colour.
 E. क to
scatter, ईरन् affix; and मुट् inserted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=183-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किर्म्मीरजित्|किर्मीरजित्
किर्म्मीरजित् m. (-जित्) A name of BHIMA, one of the Pandu princes.
E. किर्म्मीर a demon, and जित् who conquers.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=183-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किर्म्मीरत्वच्|किर्मीरत्वच्
किर्म्मीरत्वच् f. (-त्वक्) The orange tree.
 E. किर्म्मीर variegated, and त्वच्
bark.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=183-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किर्म्मीरभिद्
किर्म्मीरभिद् m. (-भित् or -भिद्) A name of BHIMA: see किर्म्मीरजित्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=183-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किर्म्मीरसूदन|किर्मीरसूदन|किर्मीरसूदनः|किर्म्मीरसूदनः
किर्म्मीरसूदन m. (-नः) A name of BHIMA: see the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=183-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किल|किलः
किल r. 6th cl. (किलति)
	 1. To be or become white.
	 2. To play. r. 10th
cl. (केलयति) To send, to throw or cast.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=183-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किल|किलः
किल ind. An aptote signifying.
	 1. News, (so said, so reported.)
	 2.
Likelihood, (probably, possibly.)
	 3. Conciliatory expression.
	 4.
Assertion, certainty, (indeed, verily, assuredly.)
	 5. Falsehood,
inaccuracy.
 E. किल् to send or order, affix क.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=183-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किलकिञ्चित|किलकिंचित|किलकिञ्चितं
किलकिञ्चित n. (-तं) Armorous agitation, weeping, laughing, being angry,
being pleased, &c. in the society of a lover.
 E. किल play, sport, किं
what, some, and चित collected.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=183-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किलकिला
किलकिला f. (-ला) Sound expressing joy, or the expression or pleasure
by any sound or cry.
 E. किल play, sport, repeated.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=183-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किलाट|किलाटः
किलाट mf. (-टः-टी) Inspissated milk, curds or coagulated milk; it
may be applied to cheese.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=183-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किलाटिन्
किलाटिन् m. (-टी) A bamboo.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=183-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किलास|किलासं
किलास m. (-सः)
	 1. A blotch, a scab.
	 2. A white leprous spot.
 E. किल् to
play, affix क; आस from आस् to reject or throw, with अच् affix; or
अस् to be, with अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=183-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किलासघ्न|किलासघ्नः
किलासघ्न m. (-घ्नः) A sort of gourd, (Momordica mixta:) see काकरोल. E.
किलास a blotch, and घ्न what removes.
