<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किलासिन्
किलासिन् mfn. (-सी-सिनी-सि) Having blotches.
 E. किलास, and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=183-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किलिञ्च|किलिञ्चं
किलिञ्च mn. (-ञ्चः-ञ्चं) A thin plank: see the next.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=183-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किलिञ्ज|किलिंज|किलिंजं|किलिञ्जः
किलिञ्ज mn. (-ञ्जः-ञ्जं)
	 1. A thin plank of green wood.
	 2. A mat: see the
next; also read किलिञ्च.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=183-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किलिञ्जक|किलिंजकः|किलिञ्जकः
किलिञ्जक m. (-कः)
	 1. A mat.
	 2. A screen or twist of grass or straw. E.
किल to be white, इ added किलि, ज what overcomes, from जि with ड
affix, and वुन् added; deriv. irr.
