<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किलिम|किलिमं
किलिम m. (-मः) A tree, a kind of fir or pine, (Pinus deodar.)
	 n. (-मं)
Resin, the extract of the pine.
 E. किल् to cast, किमन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=183-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किल्विन्
किल्विन् m. (-ल्वी) A horse; read also किन्धिन्.
