<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किल्विष|किल्विषं
किल्विष n. (-षं)
	 1. Sin, 2. Fault, offence.
	 3. Disease, sickness.
 E. किल् to
play sport, टिषच् Uṇādi affix, and वुक् inserted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=183-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किल्विषिन्
किल्विषिन् mfn. (-षी-षिणी-षि) Wicked, culpable, criminal.
 E. किल्विष, and
इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=183-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किशल|किशलं
किशल mn. (-लः-लं) A sprout, a shoot: see किसल.
