<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीट|कीटः
कीट r. 11th cl. (कीटयति)
	 1. To tinge or colour.
	 2. To bind.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीट|कीटः
कीट m. (-टः) A worm, an insect.
 E. कीट् to colour or dye, क aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीटक|कीटकः
कीटक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Harsh, hard, unfeeling.
	 m. (-कः)
	 1. A worm, an
insect.
	 2. A bird, panegyrist, descended from a Kṣatriya father
and Vaiśya mother.
 E. कीट a worm, and कन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीटघ्न|कीटघ्नः
कीटघ्न m. (-घ्नः) Sulphur.
 E. कीट a worm, and घ्न what destroys.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीटज
कीटज n. (-जं) Silk.
	 f. (-जा) Lac, an animal dye of a red colour.
 E. कीट a
worm, and ज born.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीटपक्षोद्भव
कीटपक्षोद्भव m. (-वः) The change from the chrysalis or larva to the but-
terfly.
 E. कीट, पक्ष a wing, and उद्भव evolution.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीटपादिका
कीटपादिका f. (-का) A plant, (Cissus pedata.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीदृश्
कीदृश् mfn. (-दृक्) Who or what like.
 E. किम् what, दृश् to see, and क्विन्
affix; also with कञ् affix; कीदृश mfn. (-शः-शी-शं.)
