कीनाश|कीनाशः
कीनाश mfn. (-शः-शी-शं)
	 1. A labourer or cultivator of the soil.
	 2. Small,
little.
	 3. Covetous, niggardly.
	 4. A slayer of cattle.
	 m. (-शः)
	 1. A
name of YAMA.
	 2. A particular monkey.
 E. की for का or कु bad,
vile, नाश who destroy, the causal form of नश् to destroy, with
अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीर|कीरं|कीरः
कीर m. (-रः)
	 1. A parrot.
	 2. Kashmir.
	 m. plu. (-राः) The people of
Kashmir, n. (-रं) Flesh.
 E. की bad, vile, ईर् to send or order, क aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीरक|कीरकः
कीरक m. (-कः)
	 1. A tree.
	 2. A Buddha.
	 3. Obtaining, gaining.
 E. कन्
added to the last.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीरेष्ट|कीरेष्टः
कीरेष्ट m. (-ष्टः)
	 1. A tree, a species of mountain Pilu: see अक्षोड 2. The
mango tree.
 E. कीर a parrot, and इष्ट wished, desired.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीर्ण|कीर्णः|कीर्ण्ण
कीर्ण mfn. (-र्णः-र्णा-र्णं)
	 1. Covered, secreted, hidden.
	 2. Scattered,
thrown, cast.
	 3. Injured, hurt.
	 4. Full.
 E. कॄ to scatter, affix क्त
formation irr.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीर्णि|कीर्णिः|कीर्ण्णि
कीर्णि f. (-र्णिः)
	 1. Scattering, throwing.
	 2. Covering, concealing.
 E. कॄ to
scatter, क्तिन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीर्त्तन|कीर्तन|कीर्तनं|कीर्त्तनं
कीर्त्तन n. (-नं)
	 1. Saying, telling.
	 2. Repeating.
	 3. Celebrating, praising.
f. (-ना) Fame, glory.
 E. कृत् to praise or celebrate, युच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीर्त्तयत्|कीर्तयत्
कीर्त्तयत् mfn. (-यन्-यन्ती-यत्) Praising, celebrating.
 E. कृत् to praise, शतृ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीर्त्ति|कीर्ति|कीर्तिः|कीर्त्तिः
कीर्त्ति f. (-र्त्तिः)
	 1. Fame, renown, glory.
	 2. Favour, approbation.
	 3.
Sound.
	 4. Light, lustre.
	 5. Mud, dirt.
	 6. Diffusing, expansion.
	 7.
One of the Matrikas or personified divine energies of KṚṢṆA. E.
कृत् to celebrate, क्तिन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीर्त्तिकर|कीर्तिकर
कीर्त्तिकर mfn. (-रः-री-रं) Conferring fame.
 E. कीर्त्ति, and कर what
makes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीर्त्तित|कीर्तित|कीर्त्तितः
कीर्त्तित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Said, asserted.
	 2. Known, notorious.
	 3. Cele-
brated; praised.
 E. कृत् to celebrated, affix क्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीर्त्तिभाज्|कीर्तिभाज्
कीर्त्तिभाज् mfn. (भाक्) Celebrated, famous.
	 m. (-भाक्) A name of DRO-
NACHARYA, the military preceptor of the PĀṆḌUS and KURUS.
E. कीर्त्ति fame, and भाज् to serve or honour, affix क्विप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीर्त्तिमत्|कीर्तिमत्|कीर्तिमन्त्
कीर्त्तिमत् mfn. (-मान्-मती-मत्) Praised, famous, celebrated.
	 m. (-मान्) The
elder brother of VASUDEVA.
 E. कीर्त्ति, and मतुप् aff.
