कीर्त्तिशेष|कीर्तिशेष|कीर्तिशेषः|कीर्त्तिशेषः
कीर्त्तिशेष m. (-षः) Death, dying.
 E. कीर्त्ति fame, and शेष end.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीर्त्त्य
कीर्त्त्य mfn. (-र्त्त्यः-र्त्त्या-र्त्त्यं) To be praised or celebrated.
 E. कृत् to praise,
क्यप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीर्म्मी|कीर्मी
कीर्म्मी f. (-र्म्मी) A house for straw; also हेमपुत्री.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीर्य्यमाण|कीर्यमाण
कीर्य्यमाण mfn. (-णः-णाः-णं) Covered, bestrewed.
 E. कॄ to scatter, passive
form, शानच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कील|कीलः
कील r. 10th cl. (कीलयति) To bind, to fasten, to stake, to pin.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कील|कीलः
कील mf. (-लः-ला)
	 1. Flame, lambent flame.
	 2. Small, minute.
	 m. (-लः)
1. A stake, a pin, a bolt, a wedge, &c.
	 2. A lance, a spike.
	 3. A
gnomon.
	 4. A weapon.
	 5. A post, a piller.
	 6. The elbow.
	 7. A
blow or punch with the elbow.
	 8. A blow, a thump; (in the three
last senses some make this also fem.)
	 9. A post in a cow-house;
see the next.
 E. कील् to bind, and क aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीलक|कीलकः
कीलक m. (-कः) A piller for cows, &c. to rub themselves against, or
one to which they are tied.
	 2. A pin, a bolt, a wedge.
 E. कन्
added to the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीलसंस्पर्श|कीलसंस्पर्शः
कीलसंस्पर्श m. (-र्शः) A plant, the fruit of which yields a turpentinous
substance that has been used in India as pitch, &c. commonly
Gab; (Embryopteris glutinifera, Rox.)
 E. कील a bolt, सम् with,
and स्पर्श touch, the fruit being invested with a hard coat.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीलाल|कीलालं|कीलालः
कीलाल n. (-लं)
	 1. Water.
	 2. Blood.
	 3. Amrita, the food of the gods.
	 4.
Honey.
 E. कील flame, and अल what opposes, &c. or कील a stake,
&c. and अल what adorns; from अल् with अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीलालधि|कीलालधिः
कीलालधि m. (-धिः) The ocean.
 E. कीलाल water, and धि what contains.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीलालप|कीलालपः
कीलालप m. (-पः) A Rākṣasa, a sort of goblin or imp.
 E. कीलाल blood,
and प who drinks.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीलित|कीलितः
कीलित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Bound, tied, confined.
	 2. Pierced, transfixed.
3. Staked, impaled.
	 4. Pinned, fastened by a stake, &c.
	 5. Set up
as a stake or pole.
 E. कील् to bind. affix क्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीश|कीशः
कीश mfn. (-शः-शा-शं) Naked.
	 m. (-शः)
	 1. A monkey, an ape.
	 2. The sun.
E. क air, water, &c. ईश who has power over, and क aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीशपर्ण|कीशपर्णः|कीशपर्ण्ण
कीशपर्ण mf. (-र्णः-र्णी) A tree, (Achyranthes aspera:) see अपामार्गः also
कीशपर्णक.
	 m. (-कः)
 E. कीश a monkey, पर्ण a leaf.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कु|कुः
कु r. 1st cl. (ङ) कुङ् (कवते) r. 2nd cl. (टु) टुकु (कौति) r. 6th cl. (शिं) कुशि
(कुवते) r. 9th cl. (ञ) कुञ् (कुनाति, कुनीते) 1. To sound, to sound
indistinctly, to moan, to groan.
	 2. To cry as a bird, to coo, to
hum as a bee, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कु|कुः
कु f. (-कुः) The earth. ind. A particle of depreciation, and implying.
1. Sin, guilt.
	 2. Reproach, contempt.
	 3. Diminution, littleness.
4. Prevention, hindrance, as कुपथ a bad road, &c.
 E. कु to sound,
क्विप् affix, or कुङ् to sound, with the affix ड.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुक
कुक r. 1st cl. (कोकते) To take, to accept.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुक
कुक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Taking, accepting.
 E. कुक and क aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुकभ|कुकभं
कुकभ n. (-भं) Spirituous liquor.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुकर|कुकरः
कुकर mfn. (-रः-रा-री-रं)
	 1. Having a crooked or withered arm.
	 2.
Wicked, acting wickedly.
 E. कु bad, and कर the hand; or कृ to do,
ट aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुकर्म्मन्|कुकर्मन्
कुकर्म्मन् mfn. (-र्म्मा-र्म्मा-र्म्म) Wicked, bad.
	 n. (-र्म्म) Wickedness, depravity,
villainy.
 E. कु bad, कर्म्मन् act.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुकर्म्मकारिन्|कुकर्मकारिन्
कुकर्म्मकारिन् mfn. (-री-रिणी-रि) Wicked, depraved.
 E. कुकर्म्म, and कारिन्
who does.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुकील|कुकीलः
कुकील m. (-लः) A mountain.
 E. कु earth, and कील a pin or bolt.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुकुद|कुकुदः
कुकुद mfn. (-दः-दा-दं) One who gives a girl, decorated with fit orna-
ments and with the prescribed ceremonies, in marriage.
 E. कुक to
take and द who gives: see कूकुद.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुकुन्दर|कुकुंदर|कुकुन्दरं|कुकुंदरः|कुकुन्दरः
कुकुन्दर n. (-रं) or n du. (-रे) the cavities of the loins.
 E. कुन्दर a hollow.
a cave, from कु the earth, and दृ to rend or tear, कु bad, vile, pre-
fixed; it is also written ककुन्दर.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुकुभा
कुकुभा f. (-भा) One of the female personifications of music or Rāgiṇīs.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुकुर|कुकुरः
कुकुर m. (-रः)
	 1. A dog.
	 2. A branch of the Yadu race: see कुक्कुर.
3. A plant and perfume: see ग्रन्थिपर्णी.
	 m. plu. (-राः) A country: see
दशार्ह.
 E. कुक् to take, उरच् Uṇādi affix; also कुक्कुर.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुकुराधिनाथ
कुकुराधिनाथ m. (-थः) KṚṢṆA.
 E. कुकुर a Yadu, and अधिनाथ chief.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुकूणक
कुकूणक m. (-कः) Weakness, of the eyes in infants.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुकूल|कुकूलं|कुकूलः
कुकूल n. (-लं)
	 1. A hole filled with stakes.
	 2. Conflagration of chaff.
	 3.
Armour, mail.
 E. कु the earth, and कूल a bank, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुकृत्य
कुकृत्य n. (-त्यं) Wickedness, evil.
 E. कु, and कृत्य act.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुकोल|कुकोलं
कुकोल n. (-लं) The jujube: see कोलि.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुक्कुट|कुक्कुटः
कुक्कुट m. (-टः)
	 1. A cock.
	 2. A wild cock.
	 3. The offspring of a Śūdra
or man of the fourth caste, by a Chandala woman.
	 4. A whisp of
of lighted straw, a firebrand.
	 5. A spark of fire.
	 f. (-टिः or टी)
Hypocrisy, interested observance of religious duties.
	 f. (-टी)
	 1. A
hen.
	 2. A small house lizard.
	 3. The silk-cotton tree, (Bombax
heptaphyllum.)
 E. कुक् taking, from कुक with क्विप् affix, and कुट् to
cut or scratch, with क affix; scratching up the earth, &c. or कु
bad, कुट् to cut, &c. and क inserted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुक्कुटक|कुक्कुटकः
कुक्कुटक m. (-कः)
	 1. A cock.
	 2. A wild cock.
	 3. A man of a mixed caste,
one sprung from a Śūdra and the female of a barbarian.
 E. कन्
added to the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुक्कुटमण्डप|कुक्कुटमण्डपः
कुक्कुटमण्डप m. (-पः) A place where final emancipation may be attained;
also मुक्तिमण्डप.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुक्कुटमस्तक|कुक्कुटमस्तकं|कुक्कुटमस्तकः
कुक्कुटमस्तक n. (-कं) A sort of pepper, (Piper chavya.)
 E. कुक्कुट, and मस्तक
head; to what the flower may be compared.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुक्कुटव्रत|कुक्कुटव्रतं
कुक्कुटव्रत n. (-तं) A religious observation, (worship of ŚIVA,) on the
seventh of the light fortnight of Bhadra, by women, especially
for the sake of obtaining offspring.
 E. कुक्कुट a howl, and व्रत religious
rite; alluding to the fruitfulness of the hen.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुक्कुटशिख|कुक्कुटशिखः
कुक्कुटशिख m. (-खः) Safflower, (Carthamus tinctorius.)
 E. कुक्कुट a cock, and
शिख a crest; cockscomb.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुक्कुटाण्ड
कुक्कुटाण्ड n. (-ण्डं) A fowl's egg.
 E. कुक्कुटी and अण्ड an egg.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुक्कुटाभ|कुक्कुटाभः
कुक्कुटाभ m. (-भः) A kind of snake, compared to a fowl, in some res-
pects, perhaps from having a crest or comb.
 E. कुक्कुट a cock, and
आभ who is or resembles, from भा to shine, prefix आङ् and affix क.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुक्कुटाहि|कुक्कुटाहिः
कुक्कुटाहि m. (-हिः) A kind of snake: see the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुक्कुभ|कुक्कुभः
कुक्कुभ m. (-भः)
	 1. A wild cock, (Phasianus gallus.)
	 2. Varnish, oiling
or oily gloss; also कुक्कुभक m. (-कः)
 E. कुक् imitative sound, कु to
utter sound, and भक् irr. aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुक्कुर|कुक्कुरं|कुक्कुरः
कुक्कुर m. (-रः) A dog.
	 n. (-रं) A vegetable perfume, commonly Gant-
hiala: see ग्रन्थिपर्णी.
	 f. (-री) A bitch.
 E. कुक् to take. उरन् Uṇādi affix,
and क inserted; also कुकुर.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुक्कुवाच्
कुक्कुवाच् m. (-क) A sort of deer.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुक्ष|कुक्षः
कुक्ष m. (-क्षः) The belly.
 E. कुष् to extract, and स affix; by which the
fœces are excreted; also कुक्षि.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुक्षि|कुक्षिः
कुक्षि m. (-क्षिः) The belly, the cavity of the abdomen.
 E. कुषि to extract,
and क्सि affix; see the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुक्षिम्भरि|कुक्षिंभरि|कुक्षिम्भरिः
कुक्षिम्भरि mfn. (-रिः-रिः-रि) Voracious, gluttonous, filling or pampering
