<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुक्षिरन्ध्र|कुक्षिरन्ध्रः
कुक्षिरन्ध्र m. (-न्ध्रः) A reed.
 E. कुक्षि and रन्ध्र a hole.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुख्याति
कुख्याति f. (-तिः) Evil report, infamy.
 E. कु bad, and ख्याति fame.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुङ्कुम|कुंकुम|कुंकुमं|कुङ्कुमं
कुङ्कुम m. (-मः) Saffron, (Crocus sativus.)
 E. कुकि to take, and उमक् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुङ्कुमताम्र
कुङ्कुमताम्र mfn. (-म्रः-म्रा-म्रं) Red, coppery red.
