कुच|कुचः
कुच r. 1st cl. (कोचति)
	 1. To sound high, to utter a loud, shrill cry, as
a bird.
	 2. To go.
	 3. To polish.
	 4. To touch.
	 5. To furrow or mark
with lines.
	 6. To be crooked.
	 7. To write.
	 8. To oppose.
	 9. To
contend.
	 10. To be restricted or confined, to contract. r. 6th cl. (शि)
शिकुच (कुचति) or with सं prefixed, (संकोचति or संकुचति)
	 1. To straiten,
to narrow or contract.
	 2. To be straitened, to shrink, to contract.
With उत् to bribe; with वि, and आ, to expand.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुच|कुचः
कुच m. (-चः) A breast, a pap.
 E. कुच् to bind or confine, क aff.
