<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुङ्कक
कुटुङ्कक m. (-कः)
	 1. An arbour or bower, formed of creeping plants.
	 2.
A thatch, a roof.
	 3. A hut, a cottage.
	 4. A creeper winding round
a tree.
 E. कुट् to be crooked, क affix, कुट and अङ्ग the body, with
कन् added; the form is irr.; also कुटङ्कक.
