कुटुम्ब|कुटुंब|कुटुंबं|कुटुम्बः
कुटुम्ब r. 10th cl. (कुटुम्बयते) To support a family.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=186-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुम्ब|कुटुंब|कुटुंबं|कुटुम्बः
कुटुम्ब m. (-म्बः)
	 1. A name.
	 2. A kinsman, a relation by descent 3. A
connexion, a relation by the mother's side, by marriage, &c.
	 4.
Offspring, progeny.
	 5. Family, race.
 E. कुटुम्ब to support a family,
and अच् aff.
