कुटुम्बिता
कुटुम्बिता f. (-ता) Family connexion or union, living as one family. E.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=186-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुम्बिन्|कुटुंबिन्
कुटुम्बिन् and तल् affix; also with त्व, कुटुम्बित्व.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=186-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुम्बिन्|कुटुंबिन्
कुटुम्बिन् mfn. (-म्बी-म्बिनी-म्बि)
	 1. A peasant, a cultivator of the soil.
	 2.
One who supports or has a family.
	 m. (-म्बी) A householder, a pater-
familias.
	 f. (-म्बिनी)
	 1. The wife of a householder and mother of a
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=186-b" target="_blank">Page186-b+ 60</a>]
family, a matron.
	 2. A small shrub used in medicine, a kind of
moon plant: see क्षीरिणी.
 E. कुटुम्ब kindred, &c. and इनि poss. aff.
