कुट्ट|कुट्टः
कुट्ट r. 10th cl. (कुट्टयति)
	 1. To cut, to divide.
	 2. To grind or pound.
	 3.
To censure. 1st cl. (कुट्टति) 10th cl. (कुट्टयति) To heat, some make
this root कुट.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=186-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
