कुड
कुड(शि) r. 6th cl. (कुडति)
	 1. To play or act as a child, to trifle.
	 2.
To eat.
	 3. To heap. (इ,) कुडि r. 1st cl. (कुण्डति)
	 1. To confound
or disorder with grief or pain.
	 2. To form, to make.
	 3. (कुण्डते) To
burn, to heat. r. 1st and 10th cls. (कुण्डति, कुण्डयति) To preserve.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=187-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुडप|कुडपः
कुडप m. (-पः) A measure: see the next.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=187-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुडव|कुडवः
कुडव m. (-वः) A measure of grain, wood, iron, &c. the fourth part of a
Prastha, described by some as a vessel four fingers wide, and
as many deep, and containing twelve Prakritis or handfuls: it is
also said to contain thirteen and a half cubic Angulas; or to be a
finger and half deep, and three fingers each length and breadth.
In medicine it is equal to two Prakritis or thirty-two Tolakas. E.
कुड् to heap, कवन् affix; also कुडप and कुटप.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=187-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुडि|कुडिः
कुडि m. (-डि) The body.
 E. कुड् to born, इ Uṇādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=187-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुडिका
कुडिका f. (-का) An earthen or wooden water pot used by ascetics.
