कुण
कुण r. 6th cl. (कुणति)
	 1. To sound.
	 2. To cherish, to support or aid with
gifts, &c.
	 3. To be in pain. r. 10th cl. (कुणयति)
	 1. To converse
with, to speak to or address.
	 2. To counsel or advise.
