 E. क्वण् to sound, कालन् Uṇādi
affix; व becomes उ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=187-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुणि|कुणिः
कुणि m. (-णिः)
	 1. A cripple with a crooked or withered arm, or with
out a hand or finger; कूणि 2. The Tun tree, (Cedrela tunna:) also
तुणि.
	 3. A whitlow.
 E. कुण् to sound. कि aff.
