कुथ|कुथं|कुथः
कुथ mf. (-थः-था) A painted or variegated cloth or blanket, serving as an
elephant's housings.
	 m. (-थः) Sacrificial or Kusa grass, (Poa
cynosuroides.)
 E. कुथ् to be connected, &c. अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=188-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुद
कुद r. 10th cl. (ऋ) कुदृ (कोदयति) To lie, to speak falsely: see कुद्र.
