<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुदाल|कुदालः
कुदाल m. (-लः)
	 1. Mountain ebony.
	 2. A kind of spade: see कुद्दाल.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=188-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

