कुदृष्टि mfn. (-ष्टिः-ष्टिः-ष्टि) Having bad eyes.
	 f. (-ष्टिः)
	 1. Heterodox doc-
trine, as that of the Sankkyas. &c.
	 2. Weak sight.
	 3. Evil eye.
 E. कु
bad, दृष्टि sight.
