कुद्दल
कुद्दल m. (-लः) Mountain ebony.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=188-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुद्दार|कुद्दारः
कुद्दार m. (-रः) See the next; sometimes also written कुदार.
