<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुद्दाल|कुद्दालः
कुद्दाल m. (-लः)
	 1. A mountain ebony, (Bauhinia variegata, &c.) also
काञ्चन.
	 2. A kind of spade or hoe.
 E. कु the earth, and दल to divide,
with उत् prefixed, and अण् affix or with दॄ to divide, कुद्दार; also
कुदाल, &c.
