कुद्रङ्ग m. (-ङ्गः) A dwelling raised on a platform or scaffold. It is some-
times written कुद्रङ्क
 E. कु the earth, and द्रङ्ग what goes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=188-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुद्रव|कुद्रवः
कुद्रव m. (-वः) A kind of grass, the grain of which is eaten by the poor,
(Paspalum scrobiculatum;) also कीद्रव.
 E. कु the earth, and द्रु to be
fixed, अच् aff.
