<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुनट|कुनटः
कुनट m. (-टः) A sort of trumpet flower.
	 f. (-टी)
	 1. Red arsenic.
	 2. Corian-
der.
 E. कु the earth, and नट् to dance, also कुनटी.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=188-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुनलिन्
कुनलिन् m. (-ली) A tree, (Æschynomence grandiflora.)
 E. कु bad, नल a
stalk, and इनि aff.
