<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुनाभि|कुनाभिः
कुनाभि m. (-भिः)
	 1. A whirlwind.
	 2. KUVERA'S aggregate treasure: see
निधि
 E. कु the world, and नाभि the navel.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=188-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
