कुनाशक|कुनाशकः
कुनाशक m. (-कः) A plant, commonly Jawasa: see यवास.
 E. कु the earth,
and नाशक what injures.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=188-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुनीति
कुनीति f. (-तिः)
	 1. Impolicy, misgovernment.
	 2. Ill conduct, mis-
behaviour.
 E. कु bad, नीति policy.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=188-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुन्त|कुंत|कुंतः|कुन्तः
कुन्त mf. (-न्तः-न्ती)
	 1. A bearded dart, a lance.
	 m. (-न्तः)
	 1. A species of
grain, (Coix barbata, Rox.)
	 2. A small animal, an insect.
	 3. Pass-
ionateness.
	 f. (-न्तिः or -न्ती)
	 1. A wife af PĀṆḌU, and mother of the
three elder PANDAVA princes, by as many gods.
	 2. The gum oliba-
num tree, (Boswelia thurifera.)
	 3. Beellium, a fragrant resin.
	 4.
The wife of a Brahman.
 E. कु bad, and अन्त end, destroying ill, ene-
mies, &c. or क the head, and उन्द to give pain, त substituted for द
fem. affix इन् or ङीष्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=188-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुन्तल|कुंतल|कुंतलः|कुन्तलः
कुन्तल m. (-लः)
	 1. Hair.
	 2. A drinking cup.
	 3. Barley.
	 4. A plough 5.
The name of a country in the north-west of the peninsula.
	 m.
plu. (-लाः) The people of the inhabitants of Kuntala.
 E. कुन्त a dart,
and ला to bring or gain, क aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=188-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुन्तलिका|कुंतलिका
कुन्तलिका f. (-का) A butter-knife or scoop.
 E. कुन्तल a cup, &c, and
इकन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=188-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुन्थ
कुन्थ r. 9th cl. (कुथ्नाति)
	 1. To cling to, to twine round or be connected
with.
	 2. To be distressed.
	 3. To suffer pain, want, &c. see कुथ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=188-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुन्थु|कुन्थुः
कुन्थु m. (-न्थुः)
	 1. The seventeenth of the Jinas or deified Jaina saints.
2. One of the Jaina emperors of the world.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=188-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुन्द|कुंद|कुंदं|कुंदः|कुन्दः
कुन्द mn. (-न्दः-न्दं) A kind of jasmine, (J. multiflorum or pubescens.)
	 m.
(-न्दः)
	 1. A turner's lathe.
	 2. Olibanum, the resin of the Boswellia
thurifera: see कुन्दरु 3. One of KUVERA'S nine treasures.
	 4. The
Nerium plant.
 E. कु to sound, दन Uṇādi affix, and नुम् inserted, or
कु the earth, उन्द् to hurt, and अण् affix; also with कन् added कुन्दक.
