कुन्दम|कुंदम|कुंदमः|कुन्दमः
कुन्दम m. (-मः) A cat,
 E. कु vile, (animals, as mice,) and दम who tames.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=188-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुन्दर|कुंदरः|कुन्दरः
कुन्दर m. (-रः) A sort of grass.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=188-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुन्दिनी|कुंदिनी
कुन्दिनी f. (-नी) An assemblage of lotus flowers.
 E. कुन्द the jasmine, and
इनि affix, fem. affix ङीप् an assemblage like that of Kunda flowers,
from the similar whiteness of the lotus.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=188-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुन्दु|कुंदु|कुंदुः|कुन्दुः
कुन्दु f. (-न्दूः) Frankincense or olibanum: see कुन्दुरु.
	 m. (-न्दुः) A rat, a
mouse.
 E. कु the earth, and दृ to tear or divide, डु aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=188-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुन्दुर|कुन्दुरः
कुन्दुर m. (-रः) Olibanum: see कुन्दुरु.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=188-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुन्दुरु|कुन्दुरुः
कुन्दुरु mf. (-रुः) The resin of the Boswellia thurifera, gum olibanum or
frankincense.
 E. क BRAHMĀ, उन्द to moisten, (to bedew with incense
in sacrifice,) रु affix, उक inserted.
	 m. (-रुः) A rat: see कुन्दु.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=188-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुन्दरुक
कुन्दरुक mf. (-कः-की) The olibanum tree, commonly Sali or Sale (Boswel-
lia thurifera.)
	 m. (-कः) The gum.
 E. कन् possessive or pleonastic
added to कुन्दुरु, fem. affix ङीष्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=188-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुप|कुपः
कुप(इर)कुपिर r. 4th cl. (कुप्यति) To be angry, to be flushed with wrath.
With प्र, to be very much enraged. r. 10th cl. (कोपयति)
	 1. To shine:
see कूप.
	 2. To speak. (इ)कुपि r. 1st and 10th cls. (कुम्पति कुम्पयति)
1. To spread.
	 2. To remember.
