कुमेरु|कुमेरुः
कुमेरु m. (-रुः) The southern hemisphere or pole, the region of the
demons and Titans.
 E. कु, and मेरु the mountain where the gods
reside.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=190-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुमोदक|कुमोदकः
कुमोदक m. (-कः) A name of VIṢṆU.
 E. कु the earth, मुद् to delight,
वुन् aff.
