	 2. A kind of wild fowl.
	 f. (-री)
	 1. A min-
eral substance, used as an application to strengthen the eyes
and beautify the eye lashes.
	 2. Red arsenic.
	 3. The wife of a
potter.
 E. कुम्भ a jar, &c. and कार what makes, from कृ to make,
