कुरवक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Having a bad voice, making a disagreeable
sound.
	 m. (-कः)
	 1. A purple sort of Jhinti or Barleria.
	 2. A crim-
son species of amaranth.
 E. कु bad, रव to sound, क्वन् aff.
