कुरस|कुरसः
कुरस mfn. (-सः-सा-सं) Bad-juiced, of bad essence.
	 m. (-सः) Sprituous or
vinous liquor.
	 f. (-सा) A wild creeping plant, a species of hiera-
cium; see गोजिह्वा.
 E. कु bad, and रस juice.
