कुरुविन्द mn. (-न्दः-न्दं)
	 1. A fragrant grass, (Cyperus rotundus.)
	 2. A
kind of barley: see कल्माष.
	 3. A ruby: see कुरुविल्ल.
	 4. Black salt.
5. Vermilion.
	 6. A mirror.
 E. कुरु Kurudesa, विन्द् to gain, and श
affix; found in that country.
