कुलत्थिका
कुलत्थिका f. (-का)
	 1. A blue stone used as a collyrium. &c.
	 2. A sort of
vetch, considered as a wild sort of the Dolichos biflorus. E. See
the preceding, कन् added to कुलत्थ in the fem. form.
