<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलिक|कुलिकः
कुलिक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Of a good family, well-born.
	 m. (-कः) One of
the eight chiefs of the Nagas or serpent race, described as having
a half moon on the top of his head, and being of a monkey hue.
2. An artist or artificer of eminent birth.
	 3. A thorny plant,
(Ruellia longifolia)
	 4. The chief or headman of a tribe or caste.
E. कुल family, &c. कन् affix, and इ substituted for अ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=192-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलिकवेला
कुलिकवेला f. (-ला) Certain portions of each day, on which it is impro-
per to begin any business.
 E. कुलिक, and वेला time.
