<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलिङ्ग|कुलिंग|कुलिंगः|कुलिङ्गः
कुलिङ्ग m. (-ङ्गः)
	 1. The fork-tailed shrike.
	 2. A sparrow; also कलिङ्ग.
