कुवेराद्रि|कुवेराद्रिः
कुवेराद्रि m. (-द्रिः) See the preceding. E. As above, अद्रि being a mountain.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=193-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुवेल|कुवेलं
कुवेल n. (-लं) Any water lily.
 E. कु the earth, वेल् to shake, अच् affix:
see कुवलय.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=193-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुव्र
कुव्र n. (-व्रं) A forest or wood.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=193-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुश|कुशं|कुशः
कुश(इर)कुशिर r. 4th cl. (कुश्यति)
	 1. To embrace, to enfold.
	 2. To take
out or from. (इ)कुशि r. 1st and 10th cls. (कुंशति कुंशयति) To shine:
see कुस.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=193-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुश|कुशं|कुशः
कुश mfn. (-शः-शा-शं)
	 1. Wicked, deprave.
	 2. Mad, inebriate.
	 mn. (-शः-शं)
A species of grass used in many solemn and religious observances,
hence called sacrificial grass, (Poa cynosuroides.)
	 m. (-शः)
	 1. The
yoke of a plough.
	 2. A proper name, one of the sons of RAMA.
	 3.
One of the great Dwipas or divisions of the universe, surrounded
by the sea of spirituous liquor.
	 f. (-शा)
	 1. A rope.
	 2. A plant, com-
monly Maukatha.
	 n. (-शं) Water.
	 f. (-शी)
	 1. A ploughshare.
	 2.
Wrought iron.
	 mf. (-शः-शी) A bridle, a horse's head rope.
 E. कु the
earth. शीञ् to sleep or rest, and ड affix, or कु bad, and शी to des-
troy, again कुश् to embrace or enfold, and क aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=193-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशनामन्
कुशनामन् m. (-मा) A camel.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=193-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशय|कुशयः
कुशय m. (-यः) A drinking vessel, a cup, a goblet.
 E. कुश् to extract,
and अय Uṇādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशपुष्प|कुशपुष्पं
कुशपुष्प n. (-ष्पं) A perfume, commonly Ganthiala.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशल|कुशलं|कुशलः
कुशल mfn. (-लः-ला or -ली-लं)
	 1. Happy, well, right.
	 2. Expert, skilful.
3. Clever.
	 4. Eloquent.
	 n. (-लं)
	 1. Adequacy, ability.
	 2. Virtue,
virtuous action.
	 3. Well-being, happiness.
 E. कु the earth. and शल्
to go, affix अच्; also कुषल and कुसल.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशलता
कुशलता f. (-ता)
	 1. Cleverness, ability.
	 2. Eloquence.
	 3. Well-being. E.
तल् added to the last; also with त्व, कुशलत्वं.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशलप्रश्न|कुशलप्रश्नः
कुशलप्रश्न m. (-श्नः) Salutation, greeting, friendly inquiry respecting a
person's health or welfare.
 E. कुशल well-being, and प्रश्न asking.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशलव
कुशलव du.
	 m. (-वौ) The two sons of RAMA or KUSA, and LAVA.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशलबुद्धि
कुशलबुद्धि mfn. (-द्धिः-द्धिः-द्धि)
	 1. Wise, able, intelligent.
 E. कुशल and बुद्धि
understanding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशलिन्
कुशलिन् mfn. (-ली-लिनी-लि)
	 1. Auspicious, favourable.
	 2. Virtuous,
good.
	 3. Happy, prosperous.
	 4. Clever.
 E. कुशल, and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशवारि
कुशवारि n. (-रिः) Water in which Kusa grass has been boiled.
 E. कुश,
and वारि water.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशस्तव
कुशस्तव m. (-वः) A bundle of Kusa grass.
 E. कुश, and स्तव a cluster.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशस्थल|कुशस्थलं
कुशस्थल nf. (-लं-ली) The country of Kanyakubja or Kanouj.
	 f. (-ली) The
residence of KṚṢṆA: see द्वारका.
	 2. A name of Oujein or Avanti
during the Treta Yug or second age.
 E. कुश sacred grass, and स्थल
place; abounding in Kusa grass.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशाकर|कुशाकरः
कुशाकर m. (-रः) Fire.
 E. कुश the grass, &c. आकर a mine; the sacrifi-
cial fire being made upon a tuft of this grass.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशाक्ष|कुशाक्षः
कुशाक्ष m. (-क्षः) A monkey, an ape.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशाग्र
कुशाग्र mfn. (-ग्रः-ग्रा-ग्रं) Sharp, shrewd, intelligent.
	 n. (-ग्रं) The sharp
point of the Kusa grass.
 E. कुश, and अग्र point.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशाग्रबुद्धि
कुशाग्रबुद्धि mfn. (-द्धिः-द्धिः-द्धि) Sharp, shrewd, intelligent.
	 f. (-द्धिः) Shrewd-
ness, subtlety.
 E. कुशाग्र, and बुद्धि understanding; also similar com-
pounds, कुशाग्रधी, कुशाग्रीयमति, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशाग्रीय
कुशाग्रीय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Subtile, penetrating: see the next.
 E. कुश the
grass, अग्र point, छ affix; implying resemblance.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशाग्रीयमति|कुशाग्रीयमतिः
कुशाग्रीयमति mfn. (-तिः-तिः-ति) Inspecting minutely, subtile, sharp sight-
ed, intelligent, possessing mental acumen.
 E. कुश the grass,
अग्रीय point, and मति mind; also other similar compounds, as
कुशाग्रीयधी, कुशाग्रीयबुद्धि, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
