<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशीद|कुशीदं
कुशीद n. (-दं)
	 1. The profession of usury.
	 2. Red saunders: see कुसीद.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशील
कुशील mfn. (-लः-ला-लं)
	 1. Ill-behaved, rude, wicked.
	 2. Evil disposed,
ill-tempered.
 E. कु and शील temper, conduct.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशीलता
कुशीलता f. (-ता)
	 1. Misbehaviour, misconduct.
	 2. Bad disposition, ill-
temper.
 E. तल् added to the preceding; also with त्व, कुशीलत्वं.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशीलव|कुशीलवः
कुशीलव m. (-वः)
	 1. An actor, a dancer, a mime.
	 2. A bard, a herald.
	 3.
A newsmonger.
 E. कु bad, शील practice, and व affix, from वा to
go, &c. with क affix, du.
	 m. (वौ) The two sons of RAMA: see
कुशलव.
