<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशीवश|कुशीवशः
कुशीवश m. (-शः) A name of VALMIKI: see कुशिन्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशूल|कुशूलः
कुशूल m. (-लः) A granary, a cupboard, a place in which rice or other
grain is kept.
	 2. Conflagration of chaff.
 E. कुश् to enfold, कुल affix;
also कुसूल.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशूलधान्य
कुशूलधान्य m. (-न्यः) Grain stored for three year's consumption.
 E. कुशूल,
and धान्य grain.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशूलधान्यक|कुशूलधान्यकः
कुशूलधान्यक m. (-कः) A householder, &c. who has three year's grain in
