<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशेशय|कुशेशयं|कुशेशयः
कुशेशय n. (-यं) A lotus in general.
	 m. (-यः)
	 1. A tree, commonly Kani-
yar: see कर्णिकार.
	 2. The Indian crane.
 E. कुश water, in the seventh
case, शीञ् to sleep or rest, with the affix अच्.
