<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशेशयकर
कुशेशयकर m. (-रः) The sun.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशोत्तर
कुशोत्तर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Having, or being covered with grass.
 E. कुश
and उत्तर beyond.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशोदक
कुशोदक n. (-कं) Water in which Kusa grass has been infused.
 E. कुश,
and उदक water.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुष
कुष r. 9th cl. (कुष्णाति)
	 1. To expel, to force or draw out, to extract.
	 2.
To test, to assay.
	 3. To shine. With अव to prove, to display; with
निर to extract.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुषल|कुषलः
कुषल mfn. (-लः-ला or -ली-लं) Clever, expert, skilful: see कुशल.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुषाकु|कुषाकुः
कुषाकु mfn. (-कुः-कुः-कु)
	 1. Burning, scorching, inflaming.
	 2. Wicked,
detestable.
	 m. (-कुः)
	 1. A monkey.
	 2. The sun.
	 3. Fire.
 E. कुष् to
shine, काकु Uṇādi affix; also कषाकु.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुषित्
कुषित् ind. Execllently.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुषित|कुषितः
कुषित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Mixed with water, &c. see कुशित.
	 n. (-तं) Happy,
well, right, fortunate, auspicious, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुषीद|कुषीदं
कुषीद mfn. (-दः-दा-दं) Indifferent, apathetic, inert.
	 n. (-दं) Usury: see
कुसीद
 E. कु vile, षद् to move, &c, अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुष्ठ|कुष्ठं|कुष्ठः
कुष्ठ n. (-ष्ठं)
	 1. Leprosy, of which eighteen varieties are enumerated,
seven great or severe, and eleven of minor importance.
	 2. A plant,
a kind of costus, (Costus speciosus:)
	 3. A sort of poison.
 E. कुष्
to extract, and क्थम् Uṇādi affix, or कु bad, ill and स्थ being,
staying.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुष्ठघ्न|कुष्ठघ्नः
कुष्ठघ्न m. (-घ्नः) A medicinal plant, commonly Hiyavali: see हितावली.
	 f.
(-घ्नी)
	 1. An esculent root, (Solanum Indicum:) see काकमाची 2.
Opposite leaved fig tree; also काकोडुम्बरिका.
 E. कुष्ठ the leprosy,
and घ्न what destroys.
