कुष्ठनाशिनी
कुष्ठनाशिनी f. (-नी) A plant, commonly Hakucha, (Psoralia corylifolia.)
E. As above: see कुष्ठनाशन.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुष्ठल|कुष्ठलं
कुष्ठल n. (-लं)
	 1. A bad place or spot.
	 2. The surface of the earth.
 E. कु
bad or the earth, and स्थल place; स becomes ष, and थ is then
changed to ठ.
