<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुष्ठहृत्
कुष्ठहृत् m. (-हृत्) Catechu, (Mimosa catechu:) see खदिर.
 E. कुष्ठ leprosy,
and हृत् what takes away, from हृ to convey, affix क्विप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
