कुष्ठहन्तृ
कुष्ठहन्तृ m. (-न्ता) A large esculent root, described as possessed of
medicinal virtue in leprosy, and other cutaneous affections,
(Arum campanulatum:) see हस्तिकन्द.
 E. कुष्ठ leprosy, and हन्तृ what
kills or destroys.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=194-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुष्ठारि|कुष्ठारिः
कुष्ठारि m. (-रिः)
	 1. A fetid mimosa, (M. Farnesiana.)
	 2. The Khayar or
Catechu: (M. catechu.)
	 3. A kind of Aristolochia: see अर्कपत्र.
	 4.
A sort of gourd, (Trichosanthes diœca.)
	 5. Sulphur.
 E. कुष्ठ the
leprosy, and अरि an enemy.
