	 m.
(-ण्डः)
	 1. One of a class of demigods attached to ŚIVA.
	 2. State of
the womb in gestation.
	 f. (-ण्डी)
	 1. A name of DURGĀ.
	 2. A drug.
A religious ceremony, a certain rite performed as a penance or
expiation; also कुष्माण्डक.
