 E. कु vile, and
हा to leave, affix ड.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=195-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहक|कुहकं|कुहकः
कुहक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) A cheat, a rogue, a juggler.
	 m. (-कः) Juggling,
deception, slight-of-hand, &c.
 E. कुह् to astonish, क्वुन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=195-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहककार
कुहककार mfn. (-रः-री-रं) Juggling, conjuring, cheating.
 E. कुहक, and
कार who makes; also कुहककारक and कुहककारिन्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=195-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहकचकित
कुहकचकित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Suspicious, cautious, wary.
 E. कुहक and
चकित fearful.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=195-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहकजीविन्
कुहकजीविन् mfn. (-वी-विनी-वि) Living by slight-of-hand. a conjuror, a
cheat, &c.
 E. कुहक deception, and जीविन् who lives by.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=195-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहकवृत्ति|कुहकवृत्तिः
कुहकवृत्ति f. (-त्तिः)
	 1. Juggling, conjuring, slight-of-hand.
	 2. Hypocrisy.
E. कुहक, and वृत्ति practice.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=195-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहकस्वन|कुहकस्वनः
कुहकस्वन m. (-नः) A wild cock.
 E. कुहक deception, and स्वन who sounds.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=195-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहकस्वर|कुहकस्वरः
कुहकस्वर m. (-रः) A wild cock: see the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=195-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहन|कुहनं|कुहनः
कुहन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं)
	 1. Envious.
	 2. Hypocritical.
	 m. (-नः)
	 1. A rat.
	 2.
A snake.
	 f. (-ना) Hypocrisy, assumed and false sanctity, the inter-
ested performance of religious austerities.
	 n. (-नं)
	 1. A small earth-
en vessel.
	 2. A glass vessel.
 E. कुह् to surprise, युच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=195-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहनिका
कुहनिका f. (-का) Hypocrisy: see the preceding.
 E. कुहन, and इकन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=195-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहर|कुहरं|कुहरः
कुहर n. (-रं)
	 1. A cavity, a hollow.
	 2. A hole, a rent, &c.
	 3. The ear.
4. A guttural sound.
	 5. The throat or larynx.
	 m. (-रः) A kind of
snake.
 E. कु the earth, &c. and हर what takes, &c. from हृ with the
aff अप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=195-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहरित|कुहरितं
कुहरित n. (-तं)
	 1. The song, or cry of the Kokila, or the Indian cuckoo.
2. Vox congressus in coitu.
	 3. A sound in general.
 E. कुहर, and
इतच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=195-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहलि|कुहलिः
कुहलि m. (-लिः) A Pan the leaf of the Piper betel, with small pieces
of the Areca nut, and Catechu and a little lime, which are chewed
and eaten by the Oriental nations.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=195-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहु|कुहुः
कुहु f. (-हुः) See the next.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=195-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहू
कुहू f. (-हूः)
	 1. New moon; the first day of the first quarter on which
the moon rises invisible.
	 2. The cry of the Kokila or Indian cuckoo.
E. कूह् to astonish, ऊ affix, or with कु affix कुहु.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=195-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहूक
कुहूक m. (-कः) The Indian cuckoo.
 E. कन् added to the last.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=196-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहूकण्ठ|कुहूकंठ|कुहूकण्ठः
कुहूकण्ठ m. (-ण्ठः) The Kokila or Indian cuckoo.
 E. कुहू the Kokila's
cry, and कण्ठ the throat.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=196-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहूपाल
कुहूपाल m. (-लः) The king of turtles, the tortoise supposed to uphold
the world.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=196-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहूमुख|कुहूमुखः
कुहूमुख m. (-खः) The Kokila: see the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=196-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहूरव|कुहूरवः
कुहूरव m. (-वः) The Kokila.
 E. कुहू, and रव sound.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=196-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहूल|कुहूलं
कुहूल n. (-लं) A pit, filled with stakes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=196-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहेडिका
कुहेडिका f. (-का) A fog, a mist, haze, haziness.
 E. कु the earth, हेड्. to
surround, वुन् affix; also कुहेलिक and कुहेडी.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=196-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहेडी
कुहेडी f. (-डी) See the preceding: also कुहेली.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=196-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहेलिका
कुहेलिका f. (-का) Fog, mist: see कुहेडिका ल being changed to ड.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=196-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कू
कू r. 6th cl. (ङ) कूङ् (कुवते) To sound, especially as if in pain, to
moan, to groan, &c. (ञ) कूञ r. 9th cl. (कुनाति-नीते) To sound &c.
As before.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=196-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कू
कू f. (-कूः) A female Pisacha or goblin.
 E. कू to sound, क्विप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=196-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूकुद|कूकुदः
कूकुद mfn. (-दः-दा-दं) One who gives a girl in marriage with due cere-
mony, and suitable decorations.
 E. कुक् to take, deriv. irr.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=196-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूच|कूचः
कूच m. (-चः) A breast, A female breast, especially that of a young or
unmarried woman: see कुच.
	 f. (-ची) A painting brush or pencil. E.
कू to sound, चट् Uṇādi affix, and the vowel made long.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=196-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूचिका
कूचिका f. (-का) A small brush or hair pencil.
 E. कुच् to be curved, and
क्वुन् affix, with the fem. affix टाप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=196-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूज|कूजः
कूज r. 1st cl. (कूजति) To make any inarticulate sound, to utter a cry
as a bird, to coo as a pigeon, to caw as a crow, &c. With परि
prefixed, to moan.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=196-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूजत्
कूजत् mfn. (-जन्-जन्ती-जत्) Cooing.
 E. कूज् to coo, शतृ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=196-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूजन|कूजनं
कूजन n. (-नं) Cooing, moaning, uttering an inarticulate sound.
 E. कूज् and ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=196-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूजित|कूजितं
कूजित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Cooed, uttered inarticulately.
	 n. (-तं) The cry of
a bird, cooing.
 E. कूज् to sound, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=196-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूट|कूटः
कूट r. 10th cl. (कूटयते)
	 1. To avoid or decline giving, to not give.
	 2. To
render indistinct or unintelligible, to muddle or render confused or
foul. (कूटयति)
	 1. To give pain.
	 2. To burn.
	 3. To call or invite, to
counsel or advise.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=196-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूट|कूटः
कूट mf. (-टः-टी) A house, a dwelling: see कुट mn. (-टः-टं)
	 1. The peak or
summit of a mountain.
	 2. A water-jar.
	 3. A heap of grain, &c.
	 4.
Uniform and elementary substance.
	 5. A hammer, a mallet.
	 6. A
plough-share.
	 7. The body of a plough.
	 8. A trap for catching deer.
9. A concealed weapon, as a dagger in a wooden case, a sword-
cane, &c.
	 10. Illusion.
	 11. Fraud, trick, deceit, 12. Untruth,
Falsehood (or attributively,) false, untrue.
	 13. Vile, low.
	 14. An ox
whose horns are broken.
	 m. (-टः) The name of a saint, also named
AGASTYA.
 E. कूट् to confuse, to withhold, अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=196-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटक|कूटकं|कूटकः
कूटक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Unfair, fraudulent.
	 n. (-कः) A ploughshare.
	 m.
(-कः)
	 1. A braid or tress of hair.
	 2. A perfume: see मुरा.
 E. कूट् to
cut, and क्वुन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=196-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटकार|कूटकारः
कूटकार m. (-रः)
	 1. A rogue.
	 2. A cheat, a false witness.
 E. कूट, and कार
who makes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=196-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटकारक|कूटकारकः
कूटकारक m. (-कः)
	 1. A false witness.
	 2. A rogue, a cheat.
 E. कूट, and
कारक who makes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=196-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटकृत्
कूटकृत् mfn. (-कृत्) Fraudulent, dishonest.
	 m. (-कृत्)
	 1. A name of ŚIVA.
2. A Kāyastha or man of the writer caste.
 E. कूट illusion, &c. and
कृत् who makes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=196-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटज|कूटजः
कूटज m. (-जः) A medicinal plant: see कुटज.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=196-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटता
कूटता f. (-ता) falsehood, fraud.
 E. तल् added to कुट; also with त्व,
कुटत्वं.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=196-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटपर्व्व|कूटपर्व|कूटपर्वः
कूटपर्व्व m. (-र्व्वः) Fever occurring in an elephant from vitiation of the
three humors; also read कूटपूर्ब्ब.
