<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटपाकल|कूटपाकलः
कूटपाकल m. (-लः)
	 1. A bilious fever in an elephant.
	 2. A potter's kiln.
E. कूट a heap, and पाक what ripens, लच् aff.
