<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटशासन
कूटशासन n. (-नं) A forged or false grant or decree.
 E. कूट, and शासन a
grant, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=196-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटसाक्षिन्
कूटसाक्षिन् m. (-ची) A false witness.
 E. कूट falsehood, and साक्षिन् a
witness.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=196-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटस्थ|कूटस्थं|कूटस्थः
कूटस्थ mfn. (-स्थः-स्था-स्थं) Uniform, perpetually and universally the same
as spirit, elementary matter, æther &c.
	 n. (-स्थं)
	 1. The soul 2. A
sort of perfume, a species of dried shell fish, commonly Nakhi. E.
कूट fixed, and स्थ what remains.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=196-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटस्वर्ण
कूटस्वर्ण n. (-र्णं) Alloyed or counterfeit gold.
 E. कूट, and स्वर्ण gold.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=196-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटाक्ष|कूटाक्षः
कूटाक्ष m. (-क्षः) Loaded or false dice.
 E. कूट. and अक्ष a die.
