कूर्च्चशीर्ष|कूर्चशीर्ष|कूर्चशीर्षः|कूर्च्चशीर्षः
कूर्च्चशीर्ष m. (-र्षः) A drug, commonly Jivaka, one of the eight principal
medicaments.
 E. कूर्च्च the beard, &c. and शीर्ष the head; being bear-
ded; or from कूर्च्च praise, and शीर्ष chief commendable amongst
medicines; also with कन् added कूर्च्चशीर्षक.
