<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृच्छ्रगत
कृच्छ्रगत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Embarrassed, distressed.
	 2. Pained, suffering
pain.
 E. कृच्छ्र, and गत gone to or in.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=198-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
