कृत|कृतं
कृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Done, made, performed.
	 2. Injured, hurt.
	 3. Fit,
proper.
	 n. (-तं)
	 1. The first of the four ages of the world, the Satya-
yug.
	 2. Fruit, consequence. adv.
	 1. Enough, sufficient.
	 2. Enough,
completely finished.
	 3. Enough, have done, no more.
 E. कृ to do, to
injure, &c. affix क्त.
