	 1. Artificial, factitious, made, not produced spon-
taneously.
	 2. Assumed, simulated, not natural.
	 n. (-कं) Factitious
salt, produced by boiling and evaporating from saline soils.
 E. कृत्
to cut or divide, Uṇādi affix अक.
