कृतान्त|कृतांत|कृतान्तः
कृतान्त m. (-न्तः)
	 1. A name of YAMA, son of SŪRYA, and regent of the
dead, or death personified.
	 2. Destiny, that is, the inevitable
result of actions done in a past existence.
	 3. A demonstrated con-
clusion, proved or established doctrine.
	 4. Sinful or inauspicious
action.
	 5. Saturday, which is considered as an unlucky day.
	 f. (-न्ता)
A perfume: see रेणुका.
 E. कृत act, (actum) done, अन्त end, destruction.
