कृत्तिका
कृत्तिका f. (-का)
	 1. The third of the lunar mansions, or constellations in
the moon's path, consisting of six stars, and corresponding to the
Pleiades.
	 2. (In mythology,) a nymph; one of six, the nurses of
KARTTIKEYA.
 E. कृत् to cut, क्तिन् and कन् affixes; the figure of the
asterism is a razor or knife.
