<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृत्स|कृत्सं|कृत्सः
कृत्स n. (-त्सं)
	 1. Water.
	 2. Entire, whole.
 E. कृत् to surround, and
Uṇādi aff.
