कृप|कृपः
कृप(ऊ, ऌ)ऊकृपॢ r. 1st cl. (कल्पते) to be able. r. 1st and 10th cls.
(कल्पति, कल्पयति)
	 1. To think or imagine.
	 2. To mix.
	 3. To paint or
colour. r. 1st cl. (कृपति) To have pity or mercy. r. 10th cl. (कृपयति)
To be weak. In the first roots ल or ऌ is substituted for ऋ.
