कृपाण|कृपाणः
कृपाण m. (-णः) A sword, a scymitar or sacrificial knife.
	 f. (-णी)
	 1. A
knife.
	 2. A shears or scissors.
	 3. A dagger.
 E. कृपा mercy, नुद् to
destroy, ड aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=200-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
