कृमि|कृमिः
कृमि m. (-मिः)
	 1. A worm, an insect in general.
	 2. Lac, the red dye,
which is in fact an insect.
	 3. An Asura or demon.
	 4. One subject to
worms.
 E. क्रम् to go, इन् Uṇādi affix, and the corresponding vowel
substituted for र; also क्रिमि.
