कृमिकण्टक n. (-कं)
	 1. A plant used in medicine: see विडङ्ग.
	 2. Opposite
leaved fig tree.
	 3. A plant, (Salvinia cucullata:) see मूषिकपर्णी. E.
कृमि a worm, and कण्टक a thorn, a foe; also क्रिमिकण्ठक.
