कृशाश्विन्
कृशाश्विन् m. (-श्वी) A dancer, an actor, a tumbler.
 E. कृशाश्व the name of a
saint, the author of directions to players, and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=201-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
