कृष्टपच्य|कृष्टपच्यः
कृष्टपच्य mfn. (-च्यः-च्या-च्यं) Sown or ripening after ploughing. (rice, &c.)
E. कृष्ट ploughed, पच् to ripen, and क्यप् affix; in some places the
grain is sown without previous ploughing, whence it is called
अकृष्टपच्य.
