कृष्टि|कृष्टिः
कृष्टि m. (ष्टिः) A teacher, a learned man or Pandit.
	 f. (-ष्टिः) ploughing,
cultivating the soil.
	 2. Attracting, drawing.
 E. कृष् to plough, to
trace, ति or क्तिन् aff.
