कृष्णपाक|कृष्णपाकः
कृष्णपाक m. (-कः) A tree bearing a small fruit, which when ripe, is of a
black colour, commonly Carinda or karonda, (Carissa carondas) E.
कृष्ण black and पाक what is ripe, from पच् to ripen, to cook, and
घञ् affix; also कृष्णफल, and कृष्णपाकफल.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=202-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
