कृष्णपाकफल|कृष्णपाकफलः
कृष्णपाकफल m. (-लः) The Karonda: see the preceding.
 E. फल fruit,
added to कृष्णपाक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=202-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

