कृष्णलक|कृष्णलकः
कृष्णलक m. (-कः) A Ratti, the jeweller's weight, the fifth of a Masha.
E. कन् added to the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=202-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
