कृष्णाश्रित|कृष्णाश्रितः
कृष्णाश्रित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Devoted to or the votary of KṚṢṆA.
 E. कृष्ण
and आश्रित attached or devoted to.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृष्णिका
कृष्णिका f. (-का) Black mustard.
 E. कृष्ण black, कन् affix, the fem. form.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृष्णिमन्
कृष्णिमन् m. (-मा) Blackness.
 E. कृष्ण and इमनिच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृष्णीकरण|कृष्णीकरणं
कृष्णीकरण n. (-णं) Blackening, making black.
 E. कृष्ण and करण making,
च्वि augment.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृष्णीकृत
कृष्णीकृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Blackened, made black.
 E. कृष्ण, कृत made, च्वि
augment.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृष्णीभूत
कृष्णीभूत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Being or become black, &c.
 E. कृष्ण भूत become
च्वि augment.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृष्णेक्षु|कृष्णेक्षुः
कृष्णेक्षु m. (-क्षुः) A sort of sugar cane.
 E. कृष्ण black, and इक्षु sugar cane.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृसर|कृसरः
कृसर m. (-रः)
	 1. A dish consisting of sesamum and grain.
	 2. A mix-
ture of rice and peas with a few spices.
 E. कॄ to scatter, सर Uṇādi
affix; also कृशर.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कॄ
कॄ r. 6th cl. (किरति) To throw, to scatter. r. 9th cl. (कृणाति) or (गि, ञ)
गिकॄञ् (कृणाति-कृणीते) To hurt, to injure, r. 10th cl. (कारयते) To
know. With अप prefixed, To draw furrows, to make lines.
	 1.
To disperse.
	 2. With अव, To throw, to cast.
	 3. With आङ्, To fill
up. to cover over.
	 4. With प्रति, To hurt, to injure.
	 5. With वि. To
throw, to cast, to send, to scatter widely.
	 6. With सम, To gather,
to collect.
	 7. With अभि in the passive voice, to be upset, over-
come, or overwhelmed.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कॄत
कॄत r. 10th cl. (कीर्त्तयति) To celebrate, to glorify. to render renowned
or notorious.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कॢप्त|कॢप्तः
कॢप्त mfn. (-प्तः-प्ता-प्तं)
	 1. Made, formed.
	 2. Fixed, appointed.
	 3. Ascertai-
ned, determined.
	 4. Cut, pared, shorn.
 E. कृप् to be able. &c. affix
क्त, and the augment इट् omitted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कॢप्तकीला
कॢप्तकीला f. (-ला) A Tittle-deed, a lease of a house, a document &c. E.
कॢप्त fixed, कील a bolt or pin.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कॢप्तधूप|कॢप्तधूपः
कॢप्तधूप m. (-पः) Frankincense, olibanum.
 E. कॢप्त made, धूप incense.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कॢप्तिक|कॢप्तिकः
कॢप्तिक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Bought, purchased.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केकय|केकयः
केकय m. (-यः) A prince of the lunar race.
	 f. (-यी) daughter of the prece-
ding and one of the wives of DAŚARATHA: the mother of
BHARATA: see केकेयी.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केकर|केकरः
केकर mfn. (-रः-री-रं) Squint-eyed.
 E. के in the head. कृ to make, टच्
affix; also compounded with अक्ष an eye, as केकराक्ष.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केकल
केकल m. (-लः) A dancer.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केका
केका f. (-का) The cry of a peacock.
 E. के an imitative sound and क
what sounds, from कै to sound, affixes ड and टाप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केकाबल|केकाबलः
केकाबल m. (-लः) A peacock.
 E. केका his cry, and बलच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केकिन्
केकिन् m. (-की) A peacock.
 E. केका the cry of the bird, and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केकेयी
केकेयी f. (-यी) One of DASARAT'HA'S three wives, the mother of
BHARATA.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केचन
केचन ind. Some, some or certain persons.
 E. के plural of किम्, and
चन aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केचित्
केचित् ind. Some, some persons. E. See the last; चिति aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केचुक|केचुकं
केचुक m. (-कः) An esculent root, (Arum colocasia:) see कचु.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केणिका
केणिका f. (-का) A tent.
 E. किण् to cover (a Sautra root), ण्वुल् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केत|केतः
केत r. 10th cl. (केतयति)
	 1. To call or invite.
	 2. To counsel or advise;
some authorities substitute सङ्केत for this root.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केत|केतः
केत m. (-तः) A house, an abode.
 E. कित् to abide, affix घञ्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केतक|केतकः
केतक mf. (-कः-की) A fragrant plant, (Pandanus odoratissimus.)
 E. किति
to abide, ण्वुल् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केतन|केतनं
केतन n. (-नं)
	 1. A flag, a banner.
	 2. Business, indispensable act.
	 3.
Invitation.
	 4. A spot or mark, a sign, a symbol.
	 5. A house, an
abode.
	 6. Place, site, situation. &c.
 E. कित् to abide, affix ल्युट्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केतित
केतित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Called, summoned.
	 2. Dwelt, inhabited.
 E. केत्
to call, or कित् to dwell, क्त affix.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केतु|केतुः
केतु m. (-तुः) KETU the dragon's tail or descending node; in astronomy,
the ninth of the planets; in mythology, a demon: the body of
SAINHIKEYA severed from the head (RAHU), by VIṢṆU, at the
churning of the ocean, but immortal, by having tasted the Amrita.
2. A banner, a flag.
	 3. A mark, a sign, a symbol, &c.
	 4. Light.
5. A comet, falling star, &c.
	 6. Disease.
	 7. A pigmy race inhabit-
ing Kusa Dwipa, the progeny of JAIMINI.
 E. चाय् to worship, तु
Uṇādi affix, कि substituted for the root.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केतुतारा
केतुतारा f. (-रा) A comet.
 E. केतु, and तारा a star.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केतुभ|केतुभः
केतुभ m. (-भः) A cloud.
 E. केतु the plant, and भ what resembles it in
darkness.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केतुमाल|केतुमालं|केतुमालः
केतुमाल n. (-लं) One of nine great divisions of the known world, the
western portion or Varṣa of Jambu Dwipa.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केतुयष्टि|केतुयष्टिः
केतुयष्टि f. (-ष्टिः) A flag-staff
 E. केतु, and यष्टि a stick.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केतुरत्न|केतुरत्नं
केतुरत्न n. (-त्नं) Lapis lazuli.
 E. केतु, and रत्न a gem.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केतुवसन
केतुवसन m. (-नः) A flag.
 E. केतु a standard, and वसन cloth.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केदर|केदरः
केदर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Squint-eyed.
	 m. (-रः) The name of a plant.
 E. क
the earth or the head, दृ to divide, affix अच्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केदार|केदारः
केदार m. (-रः)
	 1. A field, a meadow, a plain.
	 2. A mountain.
	 3. A name
of ŚIVA.
	 4. A particular place, the modern Kedar, part of the
Himālaya mountains.
	 5. A basin for water round the root of a
tree.
	 6. A bed in a garden or field.
 E. क water, earth, &c. दृ to
tear or rend, घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केदारखण्ड|केदारखंड
केदारखण्ड n. (-ण्डं) A small dyke or mound, earth raised to keep out
water.
 E. केदार, and खण्ड a portion.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केनार|केनारः
केनार m. (-रः)
	 1. The head.
	 2. The temples, the upper part of the
cheek.
	 3. A joint.
	 4. A division of hell, a hell like a potter's kiln.
E. क the head, &c. नृ to guide, घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केनिपात|केनिपातः
केनिपात m. (-तः) The helm, a rudder, a large oar used as one.
 E. क
water, निपात who goes or falls; also केनिपातक m. (-कः).
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केन्दु|केन्दुः
केन्दु m. (-न्दुः) A sort of ebony, (Diospyros tomentosa, Rox.)
 E. क the
earth, इन्द् to moisten, उ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केन्दुक|केन्दुकः
केन्दुक m. (-कः) A sort of ebony, that yields a species of tar, (Diospyros
glutinosa.)
 E. कन् implying resemblance, affixed to the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केन्द्र|केंद्र|केंद्रं|केन्द्रं
केन्द्र n. (-न्द्रं)
	 1. The centre of a circle.
	 2. The argument of an equation.
3. The distance of a planet from the first point of its orbit in the
fourth, seventh, or tenth degree. (In astronomy.) It is variously
applied in combination, as पतनकेन्द्रं argument of the latitude;
द्वितीयकेन्द्रं the distance of the higher apsis from a planet in any
point of its orbit; शीघ्रकेन्द्रं commutation, the distance of the sun
from a superior planet or of an inferior planet from the sun;
मन्दकेन्द्रं argument of anomaly.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केप
केप r. 1st cl. (ऋ) केपृ (केपते) 1. To shake or tremble.
	 2. To go, to move
or approach.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केयूर|केयूरं|केयूरः
केयूर n. (-रं) A bracelet worn on the upper arm.
 E. क the head, here
implying the head of the arm, यु to join, ऊर aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केरल|केरलः
केरल m. (-लः) The appellation of a country, Keraladesha or the modern
Malabar.
	 f. (-ली)
	 1. Astronomical science.
	 2. Astronomical Sas-
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=204-a" target="_blank">Page204-a+ 60</a>]
tra or treatise.
	 3. A Hora or period of time equal to about one
hour.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=203-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केल
केल r. 1st cl. (ऊ) केलू (केलति) 1. To shake.
	 2. To go or move.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=204-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केलक|केलकः
केलक m. (-कः) A dancer, a tumbler, one who walks or dances on the
edge of a sword.
 E. किल् to sport, ण्वुल् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=204-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केलास|केलासः
केलास m. (-सः) Crystal.
 E. के in water, लस् to shine, अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=204-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केलि|केलिः
केलि mf. (-लिः-लिः or -ली) Play, sport, pastime, amusement.
	 f. (-लिः)
The earth.
 E. किल् to sport, Uṇādi affix इ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=204-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केलिक|केलिकः
केलिक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Sportive, sporting.
	 m. (-कः) The Asoka tree. E.
केलि and कन् added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=204-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केलिकला
केलिकला f. (-ला)
	 1. The Vina or lute of SARASWATI.
	 2. Amorous or
sportive accent or address.
	 3. Sportive skill, wantonness.
 E. केलि
sport, कल् to sound, affix अङ् and टाप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=204-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केलिकिल|केलिकिलः
केलिकिल m. (-लः) One of ŚIVA'S attendant demigods.
	 2. The confiden-
tial companion of the hero of a drama, in general a sort of
buffoon.
	 f. (-ला) A name of RATI the wife of KĀMADEVA.
 E. केलि
sport, किल who plays, from किल् to sport, affix क.
