केश|केशः
केश m. (-शः)
	 1. Hair.
	 2. A name of VARUṆA.
	 3. A kind of perfume:
see वाला, 4. The name of a demon.
	 5. A name of VIṢṆU.
	 f. (-शो)
1. A lock of hair on the crown of the head.
	 2. The indigo plant
3. Indian spikenard.
 E. क्लिश् to bind, अण् affix, and ल rejected;
or क the head, and ईश् to rule, affix अच्; again, क water or hap-
piness, and ईश the lord or master.
