<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=205-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कैवर्त्तमुस्तक|कैवर्तमुस्तक|कैवर्त्तमुस्तकं
कैवर्त्तमुस्तक n. (-कं) A fragrant grass: see the next.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=205-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कैवर्त्तिमुस्तक|कैवर्तिमुस्तक|कैवर्त्तिमुस्तकं
कैवर्त्तिमुस्तक n. (-कं) A fragrant kind of grass, (Cyperus rotundus.) E.
कैवर्त्त as above, water-abiding, and मुस्तक cyperus; also कैवर्त्तीमुस्तक,
कैवर्त्तमुस्त, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=205-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कैवल्य|कैवल्यं
कैवल्य mfn. (-ल्यः-ल्यी-ल्यं) Sole, only.
	 n. (-ल्यं)
	 1. Eternal emancipation,
future happiness.
	 2. Exclusiveness, individuality.
 E. केवल alone,
free from all fetters, ष्यञ् affix of the abstract.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=205-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कैशिक|कैशिकं|कैशिकः
कैशिक m. (-कः) Love, passion, lust.
	 f. (-की) One of the four varieties of
dramatic style, the graceful style, suited especially to the passion
of love.
	 n. (-कं) A quantity of hair, the head of hair.
 E. केशिक hav-
ing much hair. &c. affix अण् fem. affix ङीष्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=205-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कैशोर|कैशोरं
कैशोर n. (-रं) Youth, boyhood, from the age of ten to that of fifteen.
E. किशोर a child, and अञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=205-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कैश्य|कैश्यं
कैश्य n. (-श्यं) A head of hair, much or ornamented hair.
 E. केश hair,
यञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=205-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोक|कोकः
कोक m. (-कः)
	 1. A wolf.
	 2. The ruddy goose.
	 3. A frog.
	 4. A lizard,
a chameleon.
	 5. The wild date tree.
	 6. A name of VIṢṆU.
 E. कुक्
to seize or take, or क water, उक् to go, affix अच्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=205-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोकड|कोकडः
कोकड m. (-डः) An animal said to be a kind of deer, of a brown
colour, with a bushy tail, and lurking in holes, perhaps a hare.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=205-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोकदेव|कोकदेवः
कोकदेव m. (-वः) A pigeon.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=205-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोकनद|कोकनदं
कोकनद n. (-दं)
	 1. The red lotus.
	 2. The red water-lily.
 E. कोक a goose,
and नद् to sound, affix क.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=205-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोकनदच्छवि|कोकनदच्छविः
कोकनदच्छवि mfn. (-विः-विः-वि) Red, the colour, or of that colour. E.
कोकनद the red lotus, and छवि light, splendor.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=205-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोकबन्धु|कोकबन्धुः
कोकबन्धु m. (-न्धुः) The sun.
 E. कोक the ruddy goose, and बन्धु a friend:
see चक्रवाक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=205-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोकाह|कोकाहः
कोकाह m. (-हः) A white horse.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=205-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोकिल|कोकिलः
कोकिल m. (-लः)
	 1. The Kokila or Koil, the black or Indian cuckoo,
(Cuculus Indicus.)
	 2. A firebrand, a lighted coal.
 E. कुक् to seize,
(the heart,) and इलच् affix: the Kokila makes a prominent figure
in Hindu poetry, and is supposed, by his musical cry, to inspire
pleasing and tender emotions.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोकिलनयन|कोकिलनयनः
कोकिलनयन m. (-नः) A plant bearing a dark black flower, (Capparis
spinosa;) it is also applied to Barleria longifolia.
 E. कोकिल the
Koil, and नयन an eye, to which the flower is compared; also other
similar compounds, as कोकिलाक्ष &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोकिलाक्ष|कोकिलाक्षः
कोकिलाक्ष m. (-क्षः) A shrub: see the preceding.
 E. कोकिल, and अक्ष the
eye, or with कन् added, कोकिलाक्षक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोकिलावास|कोकिलावासः
कोकिलावास m. (-सः) The mango tree.
 E. कोकिल, and आवास abode.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोकिलेक्षु|कोकिलेक्षुः
कोकिलेक्षु m. (-क्षुः) The black variety of sugar cane. कोकिल and इक्षु
sugar cane.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोकिलोत्सव|कोकिलोत्सवः
कोकिलोत्सव m. (-वः) The mango tree.
 E. कोकिल and उत्सव festival.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोच|कोचः
कोच m. (-चः) A man of degraded caste, the offspring of a fisherman
by a female of the butcher tribe.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोङ्कण|कोंकण|कोङ्कणं|कोंकणः|कोङ्कणः
कोङ्कण m. (-णः) The name of a country, Konkan in the peninsula. The
hilly strip of land between the Sahyadri and the ocean.
	 n. (-णं) A
kind of weapon.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोङ्कणासुत|कोंकणासुत|कोङ्कणासुतः
कोङ्कणासुत m. (-तः) A name of PARASURAMA.
 E. कोङ्कणा the mother of
the hero, or the woman of Konkan, and सुत a son.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोजागर|कोजागरः
कोजागर m. (-रः) The day of full-moon in the month of Ashwin, (Septm-
ber-October.)
 E. कः who जागर wakeful; who is awake the call of
LAKṢMĪ, who descending on this night, promised wealth to all
that were awake: hence the night is spent in festivity, and
games of chance in honour of the goddess.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोट|कोटः
कोट m. (-टः)
	 1. A fort, a strong hold.
	 2. A shed, a hut.
	 3. Crooked-
ness, (Physical and moral) curvature.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोटक|कोटकः
कोटक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Who or what curves or bends.
	 m. (-कः) A
thatcher, a builder of huts, &c.
 E. कुट् to be crooked, ण्वुल् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोटर|कोटरं|कोटरः
कोटर mn. (-रः-रं) The hollow of a tree.
	 f. (-री)
	 1. A name of the goddess
DURGĀ, 2. A naked woman: see कोटवी.
 E. कोट and र, from रा
to get, to possess, with the affix ड.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोटरावण|कोटरावणं
कोटरावण n. (-णं) A wood in which there are hollow trees.
 E. कोटर the
hollow of a tree, and वन a wood; by special rules, the final vowel
of the first word is made long, and न in the second is changed
to ण.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोटवी
कोटवी f. (-वी)
	 1. A naked woman.
	 2. A name of DURGĀ.
 E. कोट crook-
edness, and वा to get or receive, क and ङीष् affixes; also कोट्टवी,
and कोटरी.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोटि|कोटिः
कोटि f. (-टिः)
	 1. The edge or point of a sword.
	 2. The curved end of a
bow.
	 3. A number, a Krore or ten millions.
	 4. Eminence, excell-
ence.
	 5. The upright side of a triangle.
	 6. The complement of an
arc to 90°.
	 7. A plant, Piring or Asparac, (Medicago esculenta.)
8. A department.
	 9. The horn of the moon 10. one side of a deba-
table question.
 E. कुट् to be crooked, and इण् Uṇādi affix; also
कोटी.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोटिक|कोटिकः
कोटिक m. (-कः) An insect, coccinella of various kinds; this is most
usually read कोटिर.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोटिजित्
कोटिजित् m. (-जित्) A name of the poet KALIDASA.
 E. कोटि a Krore,
(of competitors,) and जित् conqueror.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोटिज्या
कोटिज्या f. (-ज्या) The cosine of an angle in a right-angled triangle. E.
कोटि and ज्या a sine.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोटिपात्र|कोटिपात्रः
कोटिपात्र m. (-त्रः) A rudder or large oar used as one.
 E. कोटि an edge,
and पात्र a plank.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोटिर|कोटिरः
कोटिर m. (-रः)
	 1. An ichneumon, (Viverra ichneumon.)
	 2. An insect,
coccinella of various kinds: see इन्द्रगोप.
	 3. A name of INDRA. E.
कोटि excellence, and र what possesses.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोटिवर्ष|कोटिवर्षं
कोटिवर्ष n. (-र्ष) The name of a city, Vanapuri or Devikote, on the
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-b" target="_blank">Page206-b+ 60</a>]
Koromandel coast.
	 f. (-र्षा) A plant used as a medicinal vegetable.
(Medicago esculenta:) see पिडिङ्ग,
 E. कोटि excellence, वर्ष what
diffuses.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोटश
कोटश m. (-शः) A harrow.
 E. कोटि an edge, शी to cut or pare, क aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोटिशस्
कोटिशस् ind. In multitudes, by millions.
 E. कोटि, and शसि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोटी
कोटी f. (-टी)
	 1. The edge or point of a sword.
	 2. A medicinal plant,
(Medicago esculenta.)
	 3. A Krore, &c.: see कोटि.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोटीर|कोटीरः
कोटीर m. (-रः)
	 1. Long entangled hair.
	 2. A crest, a diadem.
 E. कुट् to
be crooked, इरन् affix and the radical vowel converted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोटीवर्ष|कोटीवर्षं
कोटीवर्ष n. (-र्षं) A name of Vanapura.
	 f. (-र्षा) Piring, a plant: see
कोटिवर्ष.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोटीश|कोटीशः
कोटीश m. (-शः) A harrow: see कोटिश.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोट्ट|कोट्टं|कोट्टः
कोट्ट m. (-ट्टः-ट्टं) A fort, a castle, a stronghold.
 E. कुट्ट् to cut or divide,
affix घञ्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोट्टवी
कोट्टवी f. (-वी)
	 1. A naked woman with dishevelled hair.
	 2. A name of
DURGĀ.
	 3. The mother of Vana, an Asura: see कोटवी.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोट्टवीपुर|कोट्टवीपुरं
कोट्टवीपुर n. (-रं) Vanapur or Devicotta.
 E. कोट्टवी the mother of Vana,
and पुर a city.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोट्टार|कोट्टारः
कोट्टार m. (-रः)
	 1. A well a pond.
	 2. The stairs of a pond.
	 3. A fortified
town, a strong hold.
	 4. A libertine.
 E. कोट्ट a fort, &c. ऋ to go,
affix अप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोठ|कोठः
कोठ m. (-ठः)
	 1. A species of leprosy with large round spots.
	 2. Ring-
worm, impetigo.
 E. कुठ् to surround, affix घञ्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोण|कोणः
कोण m. (-णः)
	 1. A corner, an angle.
	 2. The quill or bow of a lute, a
fiddle-stick, &c.
	 3. A drum stick.
	 4. A sort of stringed musical
instrument.
	 5. The sharp edge of a sword.
	 6. A stick, a staff, a
club.
	 7. A name of Mangala, the planet MARS.
	 8. A name of the
planet SATURN.
	 9. An intermediate point of the compass.
 E. कुण,
to sound, &c. घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोणकुण|कोणकुणः
कोणकुण m. (-णः) A bug.
 E. कुण् to cut, affix क, added to कीण the edge
of a sword.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोणाघात|कोणाघातः
कोणाघात m. (-तः) A mixed sound of several musical instruments “ढक्का-
शतसहस्राणि भेरीशतशतानि च । एकदा यत्र हन्यन्ते कोणाघातः स उच्यते” ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोणि|कोणिः
कोणि mfn. (-णिः-णिः-णि) Having a crooked arm: see कुणि.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोथ|कोथः
कोथ mfn. (-थः-था-थं)
	 1. Afflicted with pain.
	 2. Churned.
	 m. (-थः)
	 1. In-
flamation, and ulceration of the angles of the eyelids.
	 2. Gan-
grene.
	 3. Churning.
 E. कुथ् to afflict or be afflicted. affix घञ्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोदण्ड|कोदंड|कोदंडं|कोदण्डं|कोदंडः|कोदण्डः
कोदण्ड mn. (-ण्डः-ण्डं) A bow.
	 m. (-ण्डः)
	 1. An eyebrow.
	 2. The name of
a country.
 E. कुण् to sound, अण्ड Uṇādi affix, &c. दन inserted; the
final radical consonant is rejected; otherwise, कुद् to speak false,
अण्डच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोद्रव|कोद्रवः
कोद्रव n. (-वं) A species of grain eaten by the poorer people. (Paspalum
kora.)
 E. क wind, उद्रव to go, affix अच्; sown by the wind, or
growing wild in many places.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोप|कोपः
कोप m. (-पः)
	 1. Wrath, rage.
	 2. Morbid irritation or disorder of the
humours of the body.
 E. कुप् to be angry, affix घञ्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोपक्रम|कोपक्रमं|कोपक्रमः
कोपक्रम m. (-मः) An angry or passionate man.
 E. कोप rage, and क्रम who
goes or has.
	 n. (-मं) The creation by BRAHMĀ.
 E. क BRAHMĀ, and
उपक्रम order, method; also similar compounds, as कोपज्ञ, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोपज्वलित
कोपज्वलित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Enraged, inflamed with wrath.
 E. कोप, and
ज्वलित inflamed.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोपदीप्त
कोपदीप्त mfn. (-प्तः-प्ता-प्तं) Incensed, inflamed with anger.
 E. कोप, and दीप्त
shining.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोपन|कोपनः
कोपन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Passionate, wrathful.
	 f. (-ना) A passionate woman.
E. कुप् to be angry, युच् affix, fem. affix टाप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोपपद
कोपपद n. (-दं) Appearance of anger, pretended wrath.
 E. कोप, and पद
place.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोपवत्|कोपवन्त्
कोपवत् mfn. (-वान्-वती-वत्) Passionate, angry.
 E. कोप, and मतुप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोपवेग|कोपवेगः
कोपवेग m. (-गः) Violence, impetuousity of passion.
 E. कोप, and वेग speed.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोपाकुल
कोपाकुल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Furious, enraged.
 E. कोप, and आकुल bewildered.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=206-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोपित
कोपित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Angry, enraged.
 E. कोप, and इतच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=207-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोपिन्
कोपिन् mfn. (-पी-पिनी-पि) Angry, passionate, wrathful.
	 m. (-पी) A bird
called the water-pigeon.
 E. कुप् to be angry, णिनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=207-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोमल|कोमलं|कोमलः
कोमल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं)
	 1. Soft, bland.
	 2. Soft, low, sweet.
	 3. Beautiful,
pleasing, agreeable.
	 f. (-ला) A plant: see क्षीरिका.
	 n. (-लं) Water. E.
कुट् to be curved, कल Uṇādi affix; and मुट् inserted, formative
irregular; or कम् to desire, कलच् affix, and उ inserted with con-
version.
