<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोमलक|कोमलकं
कोमलक n. (-कं) The fibres of the stalk of a lotus.
 E. कोमल soft, कन्
added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=207-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोमलगीत
कोमलगीत n. (-तं) A pleasing song.
 E. कोमल, and गीत a song; also with
कन् added, कोमलगीतकः.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=207-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोमलता
कोमलता f. (-ता) Softness, tenderness, agreeableness; also with त्व, कोमलत्वं.
