कोलम्बक|कोलंबक|कोलंबकः|कोलम्बकः
कोलम्बक m. (-कः) The body of a lute, the whole of it except the
strings.
 E. कुल् to accumulate, अम्बच् and कन् affs.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=207-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
