कोलाञ्च|कोलांच|कोलाञ्चः
कोलाञ्च m. (-ञ्चः) A name of Kalinga the Coromandel coast, from
Cuttack to Madras; according to some, it is in Gangetic Hindu-
stan, with Konouj for the capital.
