कोलाहल|कोलाहलं|कोलाहलः
कोलाहल m. (-लः) A loud and confused sound, an uproar, a great and
indistinct noise.
 E. कोल accumulation, from कुल with घञ्; again,
हल् to make or plough, आङ् prefixed, and अच् aff.
