कोविद|कोविदः
कोविद mfn. (-दः-दा-दं) Wise, learned.
 E. को who sounds or teaches (the
Shastras,) विद divine knowledge from विद् to know, affix क.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=207-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
