कोश|कोशं|कोशः
कोश m. (-शः)
	 1. An egg.
	 2. Wrought or unwrought gold or silver plate,
jewellery.
	 3. An ordeal, &c.
	 f. (-शी)
	 1. shoe, a sandal.
	 2. The bread
of corn.
 E. कुश् or कुष् to issue, घञ् affix, fem. affix ङीष्; see कोष.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=207-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोशकार|कोशकारः
कोशकार m. (-रः) The sugar cane; also कोषकार.
