<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोशफल|कोशफलं
कोशफल n. (-लं) A berry containing a waxy and fragrant substance:
see कक्कोल.
 E. कोश an egg, फल fruit; the berry being egg-shaped.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=207-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोशल|कोशलः
कोशल mf. (-लः-ला)
	 1. A man of the city Ayodhya (Oude), or the
neighbouring district.
	 2. The name of a prince.
 E. कुश् to shine,
अल Uṇādi affix; also कोषल.
