<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोशलात्मजा
कोशलात्मजा f. (-जा) The wife of DAŚARATHA the mother of RAMA. E.
कोशल the name of a king, and आत्मजा a daughter.
