कोशवासिन्
कोशवासिन् mfn. (-सो-सिनी-सि) Wrapped up in a sheathe or shell, &c.
	 m.
(-सी)
	 1. A shelled animal.
	 2. A chrysalis or pupa.
 E. कोश, and वासिन्
what abides.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=207-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
