कोषशुद्धि
कोषशुद्धि f. (-द्धिः) Purification by ordeal.
 E. कोष, and शुद्धि purity; also
कोशशुद्धि.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=208-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोषहीन
कोषहीन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Poor, without treasure.
 E. कोष, and हीन
deprived of.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=208-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोषांश
कोषांश m. (-शः) Part of a treasure, a portion of a person's wealth. E.
कोष, and अंश part.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=208-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोषातक|कोषातकः
कोषातक m. (-कः) Hair.
	 f. (-की)
	 1. A small species of cucumber, (Tri-
chosanthes diæca:)
	 2. A cucurbitaceous plant, commonly called
Turai, (Luffa acutangula.)
	 3. Another kind. (L. pentangula.)
	 4.
A kind of creeper: see घोष.
	 5. A plant, (Achyranthes aspera;)
also अपामार्ग.
	 6. Night.
 E. कोष a sheathe, &c. अत् to go, affixes क्वुन्
and ङीष्; also कोशातक and कोषातकी.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=208-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोषाध्यक्ष
कोषाध्यक्ष m. (-क्षः)
	 1. A treasurer. A minister of finance.
	 2. KUVERA. E.
कोष, and अध्यक्ष superintendent.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=208-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोषापहरण
कोषापहरण n. (-णं) Carrying off treasure.
 E. कोष, and अपहरण taking
away.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=208-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोषिन्
कोषिन् m. (-षी) The mango tree.
 E. कोष a sheathe, and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=208-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोष्ठ|कोष्ठः
कोष्ठ mfn. (-ष्ठः-ष्ठा-ष्ठं) Own.
	 m. (-ष्ठः)
	 1. A granary, a place in which
grain is kept.
	 2. A treasury.
	 3. An apartment.
	 4. Any viscus, as the
heart, lungs, stomach, bowels, &c.
 E. कुष् to issue, थन् Uṇādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=208-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोष्ठक|कोष्ठकः
कोष्ठक n. (-कं)
	 1. A granary 2. A treasury.
	 3. A brick-trough for
watering cattle at.
 E. कन् added to the last.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=208-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोष्ठपाल|कोष्ठपालः
कोष्ठपाल m. (-लः)
	 1. A municipal officer, a constable.
	 2. A watch, a
guard.
	 3. A store-keeper, a treasurer.
 E. कोष, the granary, &c. and
पाल who protects.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=208-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोष्ठागार
कोष्ठागार m. (-रः)
	 1. A store.
	 2. A treasury.
 E. कोष्ठ, and आगार a house.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=208-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोष्ठाग्नि|कोष्ठाग्निः
कोष्ठाग्नि m. (-ग्निः) The digestive faculty, the gastric juice.
 E. कोष्ठ sto-
mach, and अग्नि fire.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=208-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोष्ण|कोष्णं
कोष्ण mfn. (-ष्णः-ष्णा-ष्णं) Warm, moderately warm, tepid.
	 n. (-ष्णं) Warmth.
E. का diminutive, and उष्ण warm.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=208-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोहल|कोहलः
कोहल m. (-लः)
	 1. The name of a saint or Muni, the inventor or first
preceptor of the drama.
	 2. A kind of musical instrument.
	 3. A sort
of spirituous liquor.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=208-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कौकृत्य|कौकृत्यं
कौकृत्य n. (-त्यं)
	 1. Evil doing, wickedness.
	 2. Repentance,
 E. कु bad, कृत्या
action, affix अण.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=208-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कौक्कुटिक|कौक्कुटिकः
कौक्कुटिक m. (-अः)
	 1. A hypocrite.
	 2. A kind of mendicant, one who
does not look far before him, or who proceeds with his eyes fixed
upon the ground, for fear of treading upon insects, &c.
 E. कुक्कुटी
hypocrisy, or a small part, ठक् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=208-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कौक्कुटिकन्दल|कौक्कुटिकन्दलः
कौक्कुटिकन्दल m. (-लः) A species of snake, the Boa or Bor.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=208-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कौक्ष
कौक्ष mfn. (-क्षः-क्षा-क्षं) Abdominal, ventral.
 E. कुक्षि the belly, अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=208-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कौक्षेयक|कौक्षेयकः
कौक्षेयक m. (कः) A sword, scymitar.
 E. कुक्षि the belly, and ढकञ् affix;
in any other sense the affix is अण्, making कौक्ष.
