कौङ्क|कौंक|कौंकः|कौङ्कः
कौङ्क m. (-ङ्कः) the country, the Konkan.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=208-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कौङ्किण|कौङ्किणः
कौङ्किण m. (-णः) The district of Konkan in the peninsula: see कोङ्कन.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=208-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कौञ्च|कौञ्चः
कौञ्च m. (-ञ्चः) The name of a mountain, part of the Himālaya range:
see क्रौञ्च.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=208-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कौञ्जायनी
कौञ्जायनी f. (-नी)
	 1. The wife of a Brahman or any venerable personage.
2. A female descendant of Kunja.
 E. कुञ्ज, and फक् affix, fem. affix
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=208-b" target="_blank">Page208-b+ 60</a>]
ङीष् this word may be masculine, कौञ्जायन m. (-नः) meaning a
male descendant of Kunja; also कौञ्जायन्य formed from कुञ्ज by ष्यञ्
affix m. sing. (-न्यः) sense; also plur. (-नाः.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=208-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कौट|कौटः
कौट mfn. (-टः-टी-टं)
	 1. Fraudulent, dishonest.
	 2. Snared, wired.
	 3.
Domestic, homely, home-born, home bred.
	 4. Independent.
	 n. (-टं)
Fraud, falsehood.
	 m. (-टः) A medicinal shrub, &c. कुटज.
 E. कूट
fraud, or कुटि a house, अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=208-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कौटकिक|कौटकिकः
कौटकिक m. (-कः) A vender of the flesh of birds or beasts, a poacher,
a butcher, &c.; also कौटिक.
 E. कूट or कूटक a snare, a trap, and
ठक् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=208-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कौटज|कौटजः
कौटज m. (-जः) A medicinal shrub, (Echites antidysenterica:) see कुटज.
E. अण् pleonastic affix to कुटज the same.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=208-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कौटतक्ष|कौटतक्षः
कौटतक्ष m. (-क्षः) An independent carpenter, one who works at home on
his own account, and not for the village or the corporation, &c. E.
कौट domestic, and तक्ष a carpenter.
