<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कौटसाक्षिन्
कौटसाक्षिन् m. (-क्षी) A false witness.
 E. कौट fraud, and साक्षिन् a witness.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=208-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कौटसाक्ष्य
कौटसाक्ष्य n. (-क्ष्यं) False evidence.
 E. कौट, and साक्ष्य testimony.
