<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कौटिलिक|कौटिलिकः
कौटिलिक m. (-कः)
	 1. A hunter.
	 2. A blacksmith.
 E. कुटिलिका derived
from कुटिल crooked, said to mean a forge, or the stooping approach
of a hunter on his prey, affix अण.
