<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कौटुम्बिक|कौटुंबिक|कौटुम्बिकः
कौटुम्बिक m. (-कः) The father or master of a family.
 E. कुटुम्ब, and ठञ् aff.
