<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कौणप|कौणपः
कौणप m. (-पः) A Rākṣasa or goblin.
 E. कुणप a corpse, and अण affix;
these beings are supposed to eat human flesh.
