कौतुक|कौतुकं
कौतुक n. (-कं)
	 1. Eagerness, vehemence, impatience.
	 2. Joy, pleasure,
happiness.
	 3. Sport, pastime.
	 4. A festivity.
	 5. Wish, inclination.
6. Curiosity.
	 7. Kind or friendly greeting, civility, salutation.
	 8.
The marriage thread or ring.
	 9. The enjoyment of public diver-
sions.
	 10. Song, dance, show or spectacle.
	 11. Season of enjoyment.
E. कुतुक, and अण् aff.
