<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कौमुदीचार|कौमुदीचारः
कौमुदीचार mn. (-रः-रं) Day of full moon in the month of Aswin. E.
कौमुदी a festival, and चार what proceeds.
