कौलीन|कौलीनं|कौलीनः
कौलीन n. (-नं)
	 1. High birth, family descent.
	 2. Rumour, report.
	 3.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=209-b" target="_blank">Page209-b+ 60</a>]
Evil report, detraction.
	 4. Combat of animals, of birds, snakes, &c.
5. Cock-fighting, &c. contention of animals as a species of gamb-
ling.
	 6. A privity, a privy part.
	 7. An improper act.
	 m. (-नः)
	 1.
The son of a female beggar.
	 2. A follower of the left hand Sakta
ritual.
 E. कुलीन of a good family, affix श्वण्.
