<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रन्द|क्रंदः|क्रन्दः
क्रन्द r. 1st and 10th cls. generally used with आङ prefixed, आक्रन्द
(आक्रन्दति, आक्रन्दयति) 1. To weep, to shed tears.
	 2. To call continu-
ally.
