<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रन्दन|क्रंदन|क्रन्दनं|क्रंदनः|क्रन्दनः
क्रन्दन m. (-नः) A cat n. (-नं)
	 1. Weeping, lamenting, sobbing.
	 2. Crying
out, calling.
	 3. Mutual daring or defiance, challenging, braving. E.
क्रदि to cry out, to call, sob, &c. affix ल्युट्; also with क्र affix क्रन्दित.
