<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियाकार|क्रियाकारः
क्रियाकार mfn. (-रः-री-रं) One who does any act, an agent, a performer.
	 m.
(-रः) A student, a novice, a tyro.
 E. क्रिया study, and कर or कार,
who makes.
