<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियाद्वेषिन्
क्रियाद्वेषिन् mfn. (-षी-षिणी-षि) Opposed or averse to any act.
	 m. (-षी) One
of the five kinds of witnesses, he whose testimony is hurtful to
the cause.
 E. क्रिया a suit, and द्वेषिन् injuring.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=211-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

