क्रियानिर्देश m. (-शः) Evidence
 E. क्रिया, and निर्देश proof.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियानुरुप
क्रियानुरुप mfn. (-पः-पा-पं) Conformably to the act, according to the ac-
tion.
 E. क्रिया, and अनुरूप like to.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियापटु
क्रियापटु mfn. (-टुः-टुः-टु) Clever, dexterous.
 E. क्रिया, and पटु clever.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियापर
क्रियापर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Attentive to or diligent in the performance of
their duties.
 E. क्रिया, and पर engaged in.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियापवर्ग|क्रियापवर्गः
क्रियापवर्ग m. (-र्गः)
	 1. End of an affair.
	 2. Liberation from ceremonial
acts.
 E. क्रिया, and अपवर्ग end.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियापाद|क्रियापादः
क्रियापाद m. (-दः) The third division of a suit at law, the proof or re-
joinder of the plaintiff.
 E. क्रिया an affair, and पाद a fourth part.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियाप्रसङ्ग|क्रियाप्रसंग
क्रियाप्रसङ्ग m. (-ङ्गः) Course of proceeding.
 E. क्रिया, and प्रसङ्ग procedure.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियाफल
क्रियाफल n. (-लं) Result or consequence of acts.
 E. क्रिया, and फल fruit.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियाभ्युपगम|क्रियाभ्युपगमः
क्रियाभ्युपगम m. (-मः) Special compact or agreement.
 E. क्रिया business,
अभि and उप prefixed to गम् to go, affix अच्; going through with
any thing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियालोप|क्रियालोपः
क्रियालोप m. (-पः) Discontinuance or loss of any of the essential cere-
monies of the Hindu religion.
 E. क्रिया, and लोप loss.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
