क्रियावत्|क्रियावन्त्
क्रियावत् mfn. (-वान्-वती-वत्)
	 1. Engaged in business.
	 2. Understanding
business, fit for it, possessed of worldly knowledge.
	 3. Celebrating
religious rites.
 E. क्रिया, and मतुप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियावश|क्रियावशः
क्रियावश mfn. (-शः-शा-शं) Subject to the influence of acts.
	 m. (-शः)
Necessity, necessary influence of acts done or to be done.
 E. क्रिया,
and वश Subjection.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियावसन्न|क्रियावसन्नः
क्रियावसन्न mfn. (-न्नः-न्ना-न्नं) One who loses his cause in a lawsuit.
 E. क्रिया
affair, अवसन्न ended.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियावादिन्
क्रियावादिन् m. (-दी) A plaintiff.
 E. क्रिया affair, and वादिन् who declares.
