<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियाविधि|क्रियाविधिः
क्रियाविधि f. (-धिः)
	 1. Conduct of affairs.
	 2. Mode of performing any rite.
E. क्रिया, and विधि rule.
