क्री
क्री (डु, ङ,) डुक्रीङ r. 9th cl. (क्रीणाति, क्रीणीते) To buy, to barter or ex-
change; with वि prefixed, to sell.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीड|क्रीडः
क्रीड r. 1st cl. (ऋ) क्रीडृ (क्रीडति) To play, to sport; with अनु, अव, आङ्
परि, or सम् prefixed, it is deponent, as अनुक्रीडते, &c. unless अनु
requires the accusative case, and the compound with सम् implies
inarticulate sound, as तमनुक्रीडति सा she plays with him, संक्रीडति
चक्रं the wheel creaks.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीड|क्रीडः
क्रीड mf. (-डः-डा)
	 1. Sport, play, pastime, pleasure, amusement.
	 f. (-डा)
1. Playing, as a ball, &c.
	 2. Disrespect.
 E. क्रीड्. to play, अ affix,
and fem. do टाप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडन|क्रीडनं
क्रीडन n. (-नं) Play, sport, &c.
 E. क्रीड to play, affix युच्.
