<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडारत्न|क्रीडारत्नं
क्रीडारत्न n. (-त्नं) Compulation.
 E. क्रीडा, and रत्न a gem.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडारथ|क्रीडारथः
क्रीडारथ m. (-थः) A car, a carriage.
 E. क्रीडा sport, pleasure, and रथ a car.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडावत्
क्रीडावत् mfn. (-वान्-वती-वत्), Sporting, sportive.
 E. क्रीडा, and मतुप् aff.
