<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीत|क्रीतः
क्रीत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Bought, purchased.
	 m. (-तः) A son, one of the
twelve kinds acknowledged by the ancient Hindu law; he who is
