क्रुञ्च (उ) क्रुञ्चु r. 1st cl. (क्रुञ्चति)
	 1. To go, to approach towards or
arrive at.
	 2. To move crookedly.
	 3. To be crooked.
	 4. To curve or
make crooked.
	 5. To become small, to shrink.
	 6. To make small, to
lessen; also कुञ्च.
