क्रुध्यत्
क्रुध्यत् mfn. (-ध्यन्-ध्यन्ती-ध्यत्) Being angry.
 E. क्रुध, and शतृ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुन्थ
क्रुन्थ r. 9th cl. (क्रुथ्नाति)
	 1. To be connected with, to cling or adhere to
2. To be distressed, to suffer pain.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुश
क्रुश r. 1st cl. (क्रोशति)
	 1. To call.
	 2. To cry, to weep. With अनु prefixed,
To feel for, to sympathise with. With आङ्, To revile, to abuse or
censure. With उप, To reproach. With प्र, To cry aloud, to shout.
