<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुश्वन्
क्रुश्वन् m. (-श्वा) A jackal
 E. कुश्. to cry or howl, Uṇādi affix क्वनिप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुष्ट|क्रुष्टं
क्रुष्ट mfn. (-ष्टः-ष्टा-ष्टं)
	 1. Wept, cried.
	 2. Cried aloud, bawled.
	 n. (-ष्टं)
	 1.
Weeping, sobbing.
	 2. Noise, sound.
 E. क्रुश् to weep, affix क्त
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूर|क्रूरः
क्रूर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं)
	 1. Cruel, pitiless.
	 2. Hard, harsh.
	 3. Hard, solid.
4. Mischievous, destructive.
	 5. Formidable, terrible.
	 6. Hot, sharp.
7. Disagreeable.
	 m. (-रः)
	 1. An odd sign of the zodiac, as the
first, third, fifth, &c. which are, of malignant influences.
	 2. A
hawk.
	 3. A heron.
	 4. Red oleander.
 E. कृत् to cut, रक् Uṇādi affix,
and क्रू substituted for कृत.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूरकर्म्मन्|क्रूरकर्मन्
क्रूरकर्म्मन् mfn. (-र्म्मा-र्म्मा-र्म्म) Fierce, cruel, unrelenting.
 E. क्रूर and
कर्म्मन् act.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूरकोष्ठ
क्रूरकोष्ठ m. (-ष्ठः) Torpid or costive bowels unaffected by strong purga-
tives.
 E. क्रूर, and कोष्ठ the alimentary canal.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूरगन्ध|क्रूरगंध|क्रूरगन्धः
क्रूरगन्ध m. (-न्धः) Sulphur.
 E. क्रूर, and गन्ध smell.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूरचरित
क्रूरचरित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Cruel, ferocious, addicted to cruel practices. E.
क्रूर and चरित who practices.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूरता
क्रूरता f. (-ता) Cruelty, fierceness.
 E. तल् added to the last; also with
त्व, क्रूरत्वं.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूगटृश्
क्रूगटृश् mfn. (-टृक्)
	 1. Mischievous, villainous.
	 2. Evil-eyed.
	 m. (-टृक्)
A name of the planet Sani or Saturn.
 E. क्रूर cruel, &c. and दृश्
who sees, from दृश् to see, affix क्विप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूरराविन्
क्रूरराविन् m. (-वी) A raven.
 E. क्रूर formidable, राविन् who cries.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूरलोचन|क्रूरलोचनः
क्रूरलोचन m. (-नः) A name of Saturn.
 E. क्रूर evil, and लोचन an eye; of
an evil or inauspicious aspect.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूरव
क्रूरव m. (-वः)
	 1. A jackal.
	 2. Any thing bad.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूराकृति|क्रूराकृतिः
क्रूराकृति m. (-तिः) A name of RAVANA, the ruler of Lanka.
 E. क्रूर evil,
and आकृति figure, form.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूराचार
क्रूराचार mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Following barbarous or savage practices.
 E. क्रूर,
and आचार observance.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूर्च्च|क्रूर्च
क्रूर्च्च mn. (-र्च्चः-र्च्च) The beard: see क्रूर्च्च.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रेणि|क्रेणिः
क्रेणि m. (-णिः) Buying, purchase.
 E. क्री to buy, णि Uṇādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रेतव्य|क्रेतव्यं
क्रेतव्य mfn. (-व्यः-व्या-व्यं) Purchasable. E. future participle of क्री to buy,
affix तव्यत्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=212-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रेतृ
क्रेतृ m. (-ता) A purchaser, a buyer,
 E. क्री to buy, affix तृच्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रेय|क्रेयं
क्रेय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Purchasable.
 E. क्री to buy, affix यत्; to be bought.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोञ्च|क्रोंच|क्रोंचः|क्रोञ्चः
