क्रोड|क्रोडं|क्रोडः
क्रोड nf. (-डं-डा)
	 1. The breast, the chest.
	 2. The haunch, the flank, the
hollow above the hip.
	 m. (-डः)
	 1. A name of Sani or Saturn.
	 2. A
hog.
 E. क्रुड्. to be thick, घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
