<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोडपाद|क्रोडपादः
क्रोडपाद m. (-दः) A turtle, a tortoise.
 E. क्रोड the breast, and पाद a foot.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
