<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोडाङ्घ्रि|क्रोडांघ्रि|क्रोडाङ्घ्रिः
क्रोडाङ्घ्रि m. (-ङ्घ्रि) A turtle or tortoise.
 E. क्रोड and अङ्घ्रि a foot.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोडीकरण|क्रोडीकरणं
क्रोडीकरण n. (-णं) Embracing.
 E. क्रोड breast or side, करण making,
and च्वि augment.
