क्रोडीकृति|क्रोडीकृतिः
क्रोडीकृति f. (-तिः) Embracing, mutual embrace. E. See the preceding;
कृति making.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोथ|क्रोथः
क्रोथ m. (-थः) Killing, slaying.
 E. क्रुथ् to kill or hurt, affix घञ्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोध|क्रोधः
क्रोध m. (-धः) Anger, wrath.
 E. क्रुध् to be angry, affix घञ्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोधज|क्रोधजः
क्रोधज mfn. (-जः-जा-जं) Proceeding from or engendered by wrath; it
especially applies to eight vices, hatred, envy, oppression, violence
&c.
 E. क्रोध passion, and ज produced.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोधन|क्रोधनः
क्रोधन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Passionate, angry, wrathful. (-ना) A passionate
woman, a vixen.
 E. क्रुध् to be angry affix युच्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोधनीय
क्रोधनीय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Provocative.
	 n. (-यं) An injury.
 E. क्रुध् to be
angry, (on account of,) अनीयर् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोधमय
क्रोधमय mfn. (-यः-यी-यं) Angry, passionate.
 E. क्रोध and मयट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोधमूर्च्छित
क्रोधमूर्च्छित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Passionate, angry, overcome with rage.
	 m. (-तः)
A kind of perfume, commonly Chor.
 E. क्रोध wrath, and मूर्च्छित
confused, overcome.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोधवर्जित|क्रोधवर्ज्जित
क्रोधवर्जित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Free from wrath, mild, calm.
 E. क्रोध and वर्जित
devoid of.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोधवश
क्रोधवश mfn. (-शः-शा-शं) Passionate, violent.
 E. क्रोध, and वश subject to.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोधिन्
क्रोधिन् mfn. (-धी-धिनी-धि) Angry, passionate.
 E. क्रोध anger, affix इनि.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोधोञ्झित
क्रोधोञ्झित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Calm, composed, free from wrath.
 E. क्रोध,
and उञ्झित abandoned.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोश|क्रोशः
क्रोश m. (-शः) A measure of distance, a league, a Kos, containing 4000
cubits; some double this, and make the Kos 8000 cubits.
 E. क्रुश्
to call, &c, affix घञ्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोशत्
क्रोशत् mfn. (-शन्-शन्ती-शत्) Crying, calling out.
 E. क्रुश् to cry, शत् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोशताल|क्रोशतालः
क्रोशताल m. (-लः) A large or double drum.
 E. क्रोश a Kos, and ताल a
tune; whose sound may be heard for a league.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोशध्वनि|क्रोशध्वनिः
क्रोशध्वनि m. (-निः) A large drum.
 E. क्रोश, and ध्वनि sound: see the
preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोशयुग|क्रोशयुगं
क्रोशयुग n. (-गं) A measure of two Kos, 4000 yards, or about 2(1/2) miles;
this seems to correspond to the modern Kos, but the standard
varies.
 E. क्रोश a Kos, and युग a pair also गव्यूति.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोष्टु
क्रोष्टु mf. (-ष्टा-ष्ट्री) A jackal. क्रुश् to cry or call, and तुन् aff; the noun
declined in many cases like nouns in ऋ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोष्टुकपुच्छिका
क्रोष्टुकपुच्छिका f. (-का) A plant, commonly Chaculiya, (Hemionites
cordifolia, Rox.) or according to some, Ramvasac, a different plant
see क्रोष्टुविन्ना.
 E. क्रोष्टु a jackal, कन् affix, and पुच्छिका tail; the
flower being compared to the tail of the animal.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोष्टुकमेखला
क्रोष्टुकमेखला f. (-ला) The plant Chacaliya; see the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोष्टुपुच्छिका
क्रोष्टुपुच्छिका f. (-का) See क्रोष्टुकपुच्छिका; also क्नोष्टुपुच्छी.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोष्टुविन्ना
क्रोष्टुविन्ना f. (-न्ना) The name of a plant, either Chaculiya, (Hemionites
cordifolia, Rox) or a different plant called Ramvasac.
 E. क्रोष्टु a
jackal, and विन्न known; known by being compared to the animal.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोष्टेक्षु|क्रोष्टेक्षुः
क्रोष्टेक्षु m. (-क्षुः) The white sugar cane.
 E. क्रोष्ट and इक्षु cane.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोष्ट्री
क्रोष्ट्री f. (-ष्ट्री)
	 1. The black or white Bhuincaonra, (Convolvulus pani-
culatus:) see भूमिकुष्माण्डक.
	 2. Chaculiya: see क्रोष्टुविन्ना.
	 3. A she
jackal: see क्रोष्टु.
 E. क्रुश् to cry, affix ष्ट्रन् and fem. ङीप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रौञ्च|क्रौंच|क्रौंचः|क्रौञ्चः
क्रौञ्च m. (-ञ्चः)
	 1. A kind of heron. (Ardea jaculator, BUCH.)
	 2. One of
the Dwipas or principal divisions of the world, surrounded by the
sea of curds.
	 3. A mountain, part of the Himālaya range, situated in
the eastern part of the chain on the north of Asam.
	 4. A Jaina
emblem, the figure of the curlew, used as a symbol.
	 5. The name
of a demon, f. (-ञ्चा) The female of the curlew.
 E. क्रुञ्च to go crook-
edly, affix अण्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रौञ्चदारण|क्रौंचदारण|क्रौञ्चदारणः
क्रौञ्चदारण m. (-णः) A name of KARTIKEYA.
 E. क्रौञ्च the name of a moun-
tain; also of an Asur, and दारण the tearer or destroyer.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रौञ्चादान
क्रौञ्चादान m. (-नः)
	 1. Long pepper.
	 2. The fibres of the stalk of the lotus.
3. An esculent root, commonly Ghenchu.
	 4. An acquatic plant,
commonly Chinchata.
 E. क्रौञ्च the heron, and अदन eating.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रौञ्चाराति|क्रौंचाराति|क्रौञ्चारातिः
क्रौञ्चाराति m. (-तिः) A name of KARTIKEYA.
 E. क्रौञ्च the Asur, and अराति
an enemy.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रौञ्चारि|क्रौंचारि|क्रौञ्चारिः
क्रौञ्चारि m. (-रिः)
	 1. The deity KARTIKEYA.
	 2. The hero and Avatar
PARASURAMA.
 E. क्रौञ्च the Asura or the mountain, and अरि a foe:
PARASU RAMA is said to have made with his arrows a pass or defile
through the Krauncha mountain.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रौर्य्य|क्रौर्य|क्रौर्यं
क्रौर्य्य n. (-र्य्यं) Cruelty, fierceness, passion.
 E. क्रूर cruel. &c. ष्यञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रौशशतिक|क्रौशशतिकः
क्रौशशतिक m. (-कः) One who goes a hundred Kos, or leagues.
 E. क्रोश
a Kos, शत a hundred, and ठञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लथ
क्लथ (म) r. 1st. cl. (क्लथति) To kill or hurt.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लद
क्लद r. 1st cl. (क्लदते) or (इ) क्लदि (क्लन्दते) 1. To be confused, to grieve.
2. To confound; also क्लदि (क्लदडि) 1. To call.
	 2. To shed tears.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लप
क्लप r. 10th cl. (क्लापयति) To speak, to speak barbarously.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लम|क्लमः
क्लम (उ, भ, ञ, इर) क्लमु r. 4th cl. (क्लाम्यति) To be fatigued, to be weary or
exhausted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लम|क्लमः
क्लम m. (-मः) Fatigue, weariness, exhaustion.
 E. क्लम् to be weary, affix
घञ्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लमथ|क्लमथः
क्लमथ m. (-थः) Fatigue, exhaustion.
 E. क्लम् to be weary, Uṇādi affix अथ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लमित्व
क्लमित्व n. (-त्वं) Exhaustion, languor fatigue.
 E. क्लमिन्, and त्व affix; also
with तल्, क्लमिता.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लमिन्
क्लमिन् mfn. (-मी-मिनी मि) Weary, exhausted.
 E. क्लम्, and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लव
क्लव r. 1st cl. (क्लवते) To fear, to be afraid: वि is usually prefixed in this
sense.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लान्त|क्लांत|क्लान्तः
क्लान्त mfn. (-न्तः-न्ता-न्तं)
	 1. Wearied.
	 2. Depressed in spirits or exhausted.
E. क्लम् to be weary, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लान्तमनस्
क्लान्तमनस् mfn. (-नाः-नाः-नः) Low-spirited, languid, melancholy.
 E. क्लान्त,
and मनस् the mind.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लान्ति|क्लांति|क्लांतिः|क्लान्तिः
क्लान्ति f. (-न्तिः) Fatigue, weariness.
 E. क्लम् to be weary, क्तिन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लान्तिच्छिद्|क्लांतिच्छिद्
क्लान्तिच्छिद् mfn. (-च्छित् or च्छिद्) Relieving fatigue, refreshing, invigora-
ting.
 E. क्लान्ति, and च्छिद् what cuts.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लान्तिच्छेद
क्लान्तिच्छेद m. (-दः) Refreshing, restoring, removing fatigue.
 E. क्लान्ति,
and च्छेद cutting.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लिद
क्लिद (इ) क्लिदि r. 1st cl. (क्लिन्दते-ति) To bewail, to lament, to weep. (ऊ, इर;)
इर क्लिदू r. 4th cl. (क्लिद्यति) To be or become wet, damp, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लिन्न|क्लिन्नं
क्लिन्न mfn. (-न्नः-न्ना-न्नं) Wet, moistened.
 E. क्लिद् to be or become wet, irr.
participle.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लिन्नवर्त्मन्
क्लिन्नवर्त्मन् m. (-त्मा) Excess of the lachrymal discharge, watering of the
eyes.
 E. क्लिन्न, and वर्त्मन् the eyelid.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लिन्नाक्ष|क्लिन्नाक्षः
क्लिन्नाक्ष mfn. (-क्षः-क्षा-क्षं) Blear-eyed.
 E. क्लिन्न wet, and अक्ष the eye.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=213-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लिश
क्लिश (उ) क्लिशु r. 4th cl. (क्लिश्यते)
	 1. To suffer distress.
	 2. To inflict or
cause distress; (ऊ,) क्लिशू r. 9th cl. (क्लिश्नाति)
	 1. To oppose 2. To
afflict, to distress.
