<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लेदन|क्लेदनः
क्लेदन n. (-नं)
	 1. Wetting, moistening.
	 2. Oozing, trickling.
	 m. (-नः)
Phlegm, the phlegmatic or watery humor.
 E. क्लिद् to be moist,
ल्युट् aff.
