<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लेदु|क्लेदुः
क्लेदु m. (-दुः)
	 1. The moon.
	 2. Complication of disorders.
 E. क्लिद् to be
wet or damp, उण् Uṇādi aff.
