<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लेश|क्लेशः
क्लेश r. 1st cl. (क्लेशते)
	 1. To speak articulately, 2. To distress.
	 3. To im-
pede or obstruct.
	 4. To kill, to strike.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=214-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लेश|क्लेशः
