क्ष|क्षः
क्ष m. (-क्षः)
	 1. A destruction of the world.
	 2. A demon, a goblin.
	 3. The
third incarnation of VIṢṆU, the Narasinha Avatar.
	 4. Lightning.
5. A field.
	 6. A peasant, a husbandman.
	 7. Loss, disappearance. E.
क्षि or क्षै to waste, &c. affix क.
