क्षण|क्षणं|क्षणः
क्षण m. (-णः)
	 1. A measure of time equal to thirty Kalas or four minu-
tes.
	 2. A moment.
	 3. A festival.
	 4. Vacation from work, state of
being unemployed.
	 5. Leisure, opportunity.
	 6. A certain day of
the fortnight, as the full, change, &c. see पर्ब्बन् 7. Dependence,
servitude.
	 8. The centre, the middle.
	 n. adv. (-णं) For a moment.
E. क्षण् to injure, affix अच्.
