क्षीरकाकोलिका
क्षीरकाकोलिका f. (-का) A drug, and one of the eight principal medica-
ments of the Hindus; it is a root from the Himālaya.
 E. क्षीर milk,
and काकोलि a drug, कन् added; yielding, when fresh, a milky
juice; also क्षीरकाकोली.
