क्षौम mfn. (-मः-मी-मं) Linen, made of linen, coverd with it, &c.
	 f. (-मी)
Lin or flax, (Linum usitatissimum.)
	 mn. (-मः-मं)
	 1. An airy room
on the top of a house.
	 2. An apartment on the top of a hall.
	 3.
The back of an edifice.
	 4. A fortified place in front of a building.
5. A building of a particular form.
	 6. Wove silk: 7. Linen cloth E.
क्षोम q. v. अण् added.
