ख|खं|खः
ख n. (-खं)
	 1. Heaven.
	 2. Sky or ether.
	 3. An organ of sense.
	 4. Know-
ledge.
	 5. Happiness, pleasure.
	 6. vacuity.
	 7. A dot, a cypher.
	 8.
A city, a field.
	 9. Action.
	 10. Auspiciousness.
	 11. Tale.
	 12. The
tenth constellation from any given one, or the sun's entrance in-
to it.
	 13. Brahma the supreme spirit.
	 m. (-खः) A name of the
sun.
 E. खन् to dig, to penetrate, affix ड.
