खण्ड mn. (-ण्डः-ण्डं)
	 1. A piece, a part, a fragment, a portion.
	 2. A chap-
ter, a section.
	 3. A term in an equation.
	 m. (-ण्डः)
	 1. A flaw in a
jewel.
	 2. Treacle or molasses partially dried or candied.
	 n. (-ण्डं)
	 1.
A sort of sugar cane.
	 2. Black salt.
 E. खडि to break, and घञ् affix
or खन् to tear, affix ड, and न changed to ण.
