खरु|खरुः
खरु mfn. (-रुः-रुः or -रूः-रु)
	 1. White.
	 2. Desirous of improper or prohi-
bited things.
	 3. A fool, foolish, idiotic.
	 4. Harsh, cruel.
	 m. (-रुः)
	 1.
A name of ŚIVA.
	 2. A horse.
	 3. A tooth.
	 4. pride.
	 5. Love or the
deity KaMA.
	 6. White, the colour. खन् to dig, &c. Uṇādi affix कु
and र substituted for the final.
