खर्ज्जूर n. (-रं)
	 1. Silver.
	 2. The fruit of the date.
	 3. Yellow orpiment.
	 m.
(-रः)
	 1. The date tree. (Phœnix sylvestris.
	 2. A scorpion.
	 f. (-री)
The wild date tree.
 E. खर्ज् to give pain, &c. Uṇādi affix ऊर.
