खर्ज्जूररस m. (-सः) The juice or extract of the wild date, Tari, used to
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=224-a" target="_blank">Page224-a+ 60</a>]
leaven bread, and as an intoxicating liquor, when in a state of
