<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खुड
खुड r. 6th cl. (-खडति) To cover. r. 1st. and 10th cls. (खोडति खोडयति)
also (इ,) खुडि r. 1st. and 10th cls. (खुण्डति, खुण्डयति) To break
in pieces, to sunder, to divide, tear, rend, &c. (इङ्) खुडिङ् r. 1st cl.
(खुण्डते) To limp, to be lame.
