<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खुराघात|खुराघातः
खुराघात m. (-तः) A kick.
 E. खुर, and आघात a blow.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=225-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

