<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खुरालिक|खुरालिकः
खुरालिक m. (-कः)
	 1. A barber's case.
	 2. An iron arrow.
	 3. A pillow. E.
खुर a razor, &c. अल् to be equal to, affix ठक्; some read this खरा-
लक, but to all appearance erroneously.
