	 1. Low, vile.
	 2. Little, small.
	 3. Poor, indigent.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=226-a" target="_blank">Page226-a+ 60</a>]
4. Cruel, harsh.
	 5. Wicked, mischievous, malignant: see क्षुल्ल.
