खेचर|खेचरः
खेचर mfn. (-रः-री-रं) Aerial, moving in the air.
	 m. (-रः)
	 1. A name of
ŚIVA.
	 2. A Vidyadhara or kind of demigod.
	 3. Quicksilver.
 E. खे
in heaven, and चर who goes.
