<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खेट|खेटं|खेटः
खेट mfn. (-टः-टा-टं)
	 1. Vile, bad, low.
	 2. Armed, having a weapon or
weapons.
	 mn. (-टः-टं) Hunting, the chase; also आखेट m. (-टः)
	 1.
A shield.
	 2. A village, the residence of peasants or farmers.
	 3. A
small town, half the Pura or town.
	 4. The club of BALARĀMA.
	 5.
Phlegm, the phlegmatic or watery humour.
	 6. The ascending node
or RAHU.
	 7. A horse.
	 n. (-टं) Grass.
 E. खिट् to terrify, &c. affix घञ्
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=226-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खेटक|खेटकः
खेटक m. (-कः)
	 1. A village, the residence of agricultural peasants.
	 2. A
shield.
	 3. The club of BALARĀMA.
 E. खिट् to terrify, &c. अच् affix,
and कन् added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=226-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
