 E. खोड्. to be lame, affix अच्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=226-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खोडकशीर्ष
खोडकशीर्ष n. (-र्ष) The arched roof of a house, the coping of a wall, &c.
also खोडकशीर्षक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=226-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खोर|खोरः
खोर (ऋ) खोरृ r. 1st cl. (खोरति) To be lame, to be prevented from
moving.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=226-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खोर|खोरः
खोर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Lame.
 E. खोर् to be lame, affix अच्; also खोड
and खोल.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=226-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खोल|खोलः
खोल (ऋ) खोऌ r. 1st cl. (खोलति) To be lame, to limp, to be prevented
from moving. खोड, खोर, &c. are conceived by some authorities to
be mere variations in the form of this root.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=226-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खोल|खोलः
खोल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Lame.
 E. खोल् to be lame, affix अच्; also खोर, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=226-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खोलक|खोलकः
खोलक m. (-कः)
	 1. A helmet, armour for the head.
	 2. A pot, a sauce-
pan.
	 3. An ant-hill.
	 4. The shell of the betel nut.
 E. खुड्. to cover,
affix ण्वुल्, ड changed to ल.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=226-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खोलि|खोलिः
खोलि f. (-लिः) A quiver.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=226-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खोल्क|खोल्कः
खोल्क m. (-ल्कः)
	 1. A meteor.
	 2. A planet.
 E. ख, and उल्का torch.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=226-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खोल्मुक|खोल्मुकः
खोल्मुक m. (-कः) The planet MARS.
 E. ख heaven, उल्मुक a hot coal.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=226-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ख्या
ख्या r. 2nd cl. (ख्याति)
	 1. To relate, to recount, to say or tell.
	 2. To
celebrate, to make known. With अभि prefixed, To shine or be
glorious. With आ, To be famous. With वि, to celebrate. With सु,
To be approved. With कु, To be infamous. With प्रति and आ, To
reject, to refuse. With सम्, To count, to reckon. With सं and आ to
denominate.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=226-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ख्यात|ख्यातः
ख्यात mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Famous, celebrated, notorious.
 E. ख्या to relate,
affix क्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=226-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ख्यातगर्हण|ख्यातगर्हणः
ख्यातगर्हण mfn. (-णः-णा-णं) Notoriously vile, infamous.
 E. ख्यात famous,
गर्हण abuse; also ख्यातगर्हित.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=226-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ख्यातगर्हित|ख्यातगर्हितः
ख्यातगर्हित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Infamous: see the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=226-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ख्याति|ख्यातिः
ख्याति f. (-तिः) Fame, celebrity.
 E. ख्या to tell, affix क्तिन्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=226-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ख्यापक
ख्यापक mfn. (-कः-का-कं)
	 1. Declaring, making known, one who tells or
declares.
	 2. One who confesses.
 E. ख्या to say, causal form, ण्वुल् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=226-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ख्यापन|ख्यापनं
ख्यापन n. (-नं)
	 1. Declaring, divulging.
	 2. Saying, avowing.
	 3. Confess-
ing.
	 4. Explaining.
 E. ख्या causal form, ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=226-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग|गं|गः
ग The third consonant of the Nagri alphabet, the letter G.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=226-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग|गं|गः
ग mfn. (-गः-गा-गं) Who or what goes, used chiefly in composition: as
अध्वगः a traveller, who goes a road; अपगा what goes down, (a
river, &c.)
	 m. (-गः)
	 1. A name of the deity GANESHA.
	 2. A Gand-
harba or celestial musician.
	 f. (-गा) A song.
	 n. (-गं) Song, singing.
E. गम् to go or गै to sing, affix ड, fem. affix टाप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=226-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगण|गगणं
गगण n. (-णं) Sky, atmosphere, heaven.
 E. गम् to go. Uṇādi affix युच्
and the radical final changed to ग; the word and its derivatives
are also sometimes read गगन.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=226-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगणध्वज
गगणध्वज (-जः) 1. A cloud.
	 2. The sun.
 E. गगण the sky, and ध्वज a stand-
ard or symbol.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=226-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगणाध्वग
गगणाध्वग m. (-गः)
	 1. The sun.
	 2. A planet.
	 3. A heavenly spirit. E.
गगण the sky, अध्वन् a road, and ग who goes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=226-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगणपुष्प
गगणपुष्प m. (-ष्पः) A flower in the sky. i. e. an impossibility.
 E. गगण, and
पुष्प a flower; alse गगणकुसुम, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=226-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगणविहारिन्
गगणविहारिन् mfn. (-री-रिणी-रि) Sporting in heaven.
	 m. (-री)
	 1. The sun.
2. A heavenly luminary.
	 3. A divinity or celestial being,
 E. गगण,
and विहारिन् who sports.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=226-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगणसद्
गगणसद् mf. (-सत् or -सद्) Going in the air.
	 m. (-सद्) A celestial being.
E. गगण, and षद् to go, क्विप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=226-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगणस्थ
गगणस्थ mfn. (-स्थः-स्था-स्थं) Situated in the sky.
 E. गगण and स्थ what stays
in; also गगणस्थित, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=226-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगणस्पर्शन
गगणस्पर्शन m. (-नः) Air, wind.
 E. गगण, and स्पर्शन who touches.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=226-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगणाग्र
गगणाग्र n. (-ग्रं) The highest heavens, the summit or highest part of
heaven.
 E. गगण, and अग्र end.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=226-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगणेचर
गगणेचर m. (-रः)
	 1. A planet 2. An asterism.
	 3. A heavenly spirit. E.
गगणे in the sky, चर who goes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=226-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगणोल्मुक
गगणोल्मुक m. (-कः) The planet Mars.
 E. गगण the sky, and उल्मुका a
torch or coal.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=226-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गग्घ
गग्घ r. 1st cl. (गग्घति) To laugh, to laugh at or deride: see घग्घ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=226-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गङ्गा|गंगा
गङ्गा f. (-ङ्गा) The river Ganges, or its personification as a goddess. E.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=227-a" target="_blank">Page227-a+ 60</a>]
गम् to go, Uṇādi affix गन्, or गां the accusative of गो the earth, and
ग who goes, form irr.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=226-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गङ्गाका|गंगाका
गङ्गाका f. (-का) The river Ganges.
 E. कन् added to the preceding; also
read गङ्गका.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=227-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गङ्गाक्षेत्र|गंगाक्षेत्र
गङ्गाक्षेत्र n. (-त्रं) The river Ganges, and two Krosh on either of its
banks.
 E. गङ्गा, and क्षेत्र holy place; all dying within such limits
going to heaven, whatever their crimes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=227-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गङ्गाचिल्ली|गंगाचिल्ली
गङ्गाचिल्ली f. (-ल्ली) The black headed gull, (Larus ridibundus.)
 E. गङ्गा the
Ganges, and चिल्ली a kite, considered by the Hindus as a species of
that bird; the Gangetic kite.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=227-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गङ्गाज|गंगाज|गङ्गाजः
गङ्गाज m. (-जः)
	 1. A name of BHISHMA.
	 2. A name of the deity KARTI-
KEYA.
 E. गङ्गा the river goddess, and ज born; the son of GANGA.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=227-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गङ्गाजल
गङ्गाजल n. (-लः) The water of the Ganga.
 E. गङ्गा, and जल water.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=227-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गङ्गाटेय|गङ्गाटेयः
गङ्गाटेय mfn. (-यः-यी-यं) Going in or to the Ganges.
	 m. (-यः) A shrimp or
prawn; also गलाविल.
 E. गङ्गा the river, and अट् to go, अच् affix,
गङ्गाट, and ढक् added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=227-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गङ्गाद्बार
गङ्गाद्बार n. (-रं) The place where the Ganga enters the plains; also
Haridwar.
 E. गङ्गा, and द्वार gate.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=227-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गङ्गातीर
गङ्गातीर n. (-रं) The bank of the Ganga.
 E. गङ्गा, and तीर a bank.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=227-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गङ्गाधर|गंगाधर|गङ्गाधरः
गङ्गाधर m. (-रः)
	 1. An epithet of ŚIVA.
	 2. The ocean.
 E. गङ्गा the Ganges,
and धर who possesses or receives; according to the legend, the
Ganges in its descent first alighted on the head of ŚIVA, and con-
tinued for some period entangled in his hair.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=227-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गङ्गापार
गङ्गापार n. (-रं) The bank of the Ganges.
 E. गङ्गा, and पार the bank.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=227-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गङ्गापुत्र|गंगापुत्र|गङ्गापुत्रः
गङ्गापुत्र m. (-त्रः)
	 1. BHISHMA.
	 2. A man of a mixed and vile caste, em-
ployed to remove dead bodies.
	 3. A Brahman who conducts the
ceremonies of pilgrimage at some places on the Ganges, especially
at Benares.
 E. गङ्गा, and पुत्र a son.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=227-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गङ्गामध्य|गंगामध्य
गङ्गामध्य n. (-ध्यं) The bed or stream of the Ganges.
 E. गङ्गा, and मध्य
centre.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=227-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गङ्गाम्बु|गंगांबु
गङ्गाम्बु n. (-म्बु)
	 1. Pure rain water, such as falls in Aswin.
	 2. Ganges
water.
 E. गङ्गा, and अम्बु water.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=227-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गङ्गायात्रा|गंगायात्रा
गङ्गायात्रा f. (-त्रा)
	 1. Pilgrimage to the Ganga.
	 2. Carrying a sick per-
son to the river side to die there.
 E. गङ्गा, and यात्रा going.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=227-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गङ्गासुत|गंगासुत|गङ्गासुतः
गङ्गासुत m. (-तः)
	 1. A name of KARTIKEYA.
	 2. A name of the hero
BHISHMA: see गङ्गाज.
 E. गङ्गा, and सुत a son; the son of GANGA.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=227-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गङ्गिका|गंगिका
गङ्गिका f. (-का) The Ganges.
 E. गङ्गा, and कन् affix fem. from; also गङ्गका,
and गङ्गाका.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=227-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गङ्गीभूत|गंगीभूत
गङ्गीभूत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Become as the Ganges, as sacred, &c.
 E. गङ्गा,
and भूत become, च्वि augment.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=227-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गच्छ|गच्छः
गच्छ m. (-च्छः) A tree.
 E. गम् to go, and स Uṇādi affix, what goes or
grows; also अगच्छ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=227-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गच्छत्
गच्छत् mfn. (-च्छन्-च्छन्ती-च्छत्) Going.
 E. गम् to go, शतृ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=227-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गज|गजः
गज r. 1st cl. (गजति) To be drunk, to be confused or inebriated; r. 1st
and 10th cls. (गजति, गजयति) also (इ) गजि r. 1st cl. (गञ्जति) To
sound.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=227-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गज|गजः
गज m. (-जः)
	 1. An elephant.
	 2. A measure of length, the Gaz, a yard,
a measure of two cubits.
	 3. A mound of earth sloping on both
sides, on which a house may be created.
	 4. A small hole in the
ground for a fire, over which to prepare medicines.
 E. गज् to
sound, to roar, affix अच्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=227-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गजकन्द|गजकंद|गजकन्दः
गजकन्द m. (-न्दः) A large esculent root, a sort of arum.
 E. गज, and
कन्द root.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=227-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
