गजकूर्म्माशिन्|गजकूर्माशिन्
गजकूर्म्माशिन् m. (-शी) A name of GARUḌA the bird and vehicle of
VIṢṆU.
 E. गज an elephant, कूर्म्म a tortoise, and अशिन् who eats;
alluding to a legend of his swallowing both animals whilst engaged
in a contest with each other.
