गजविर्भट
गजविर्भट mf. (-टः-टा) A kind of cucumber, (Cucumis Madraspatanus.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=227-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गजच्छाया
गजच्छाया f. (-या) A portion of time proper for a Sraddha,
 E. गज, and
छाया shadow.
