<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गजदघ्न|गजदघ्नः
गजदघ्न mfn. (-घ्नः-घ्नी-घ्नं) As high or tall as an elephant
 E. गज, and
दघ्नच् aff.
