गजदन्त|गजदंत|गजदन्तः
गजदन्त m. (-न्तः)
	 1. A name of GANESHA.
	 2. Ivory, the elephant's tooth.
3. A bracket or pin projecting from the wall.
 E. गज a elephant,
and दन्त a tooth; GANESHA is represented with an elephant's head.
