<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गजद्वयस|गजद्वयसः
गजद्वयस mfn. (-सः-सी-सं) As high as an elephant.
 E. गज, and द्वयसच् aff.
