गजपिप्पली
गजपिप्पली f. (-ली) A plant bearing a seed which resembles pepper, (Poth-
os officinalis)
 E. गज an elephant, and पिप्पली long pepper; consi-
dered to be a large species of pepper: see similar names, as करि-
पिप्पली, इभकणा, &c.
