<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गजपुट|गजपुटः
गजपुट m. (-टः) A small hollow for a fire, over which to prepare medi-
cal decoctions, extracts, &c.
 E. गज, and पुट a hollow.
