<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गजप्रिया
गजप्रिया f. (-या) The gum olibanum tree, (Boswellia serrata.)
 E. गज an
elephant, and प्रिय beloved; also वल्लकी.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=227-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
