गजबन्धनी|गजबंधनी
गजबन्धनी f. (-नी) A post to which an elephant is bound.
 E. गज, and
बन्धन a binding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=227-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गजभक्षक|गजभक्षकः
गजभक्षक m. (-कः) The sacred fig tree.
 E. गज, and भक्षक eater; the
young branches of the Pipal being the elephant's favourite
food.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=227-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गजभक्षा
गजभक्षा f. (-क्षा) The gum olibanum tree: see गजप्रिय.
 E. गज an ele-
phant and भक्षा food; also गजभक्ष्या.
