<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गजमाचल|गजमाचलः
गजमाचल m. (-लः) A lion.
 E. गज an elephant, मा fortune, and चल
what goes: the destroyer of the elephant.
