गजमात्र|गजमात्रः
गजमात्र mfn. (-त्रः-त्री-त्रं) As tall as an elephant.
 E. गज, and मात्रच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=227-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गजमुक्ता
गजमुक्ता f. (-क्ता) A pearl, supposed to be found in the head of an ele-
