गजसाह्वय|गजसाह्वयं
गजसाह्वय n. (-यं) A famous city, Hastinapur the capital of the KuRUS.
E. गज, स for सम् with, and आह्वय an appellation; named from its
elephants; also गजाह्व, &c.
