<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गड|गडः
गड r. 1st cl. (गडति) To distil or drop, to run as a liquid; also, गल (इ)
गडि r. 1st cl. (गण्डति) To affect the cheek, to be rough as the cheek,
(obsolete.)
