गड|गडः
गड m. (-डः)
	 1. A kind of fish, the young of the Ophiocephaluslata,
Ham.
	 2. Another species, (Cyprinus garra. Ham.) see गल.
	 3. An
impediment, an obstacle.
	 4. A screen, a covering, a fence.
	 5. A
moat, a ditch.
	 6. A country, part of Malwa, Gerha or Gera Men-
dela.
 E. गड्. to drop, affix अच्.
