	 1. A hump
on the back.
	 2. Goitre or Bronchocele.
	 3. A humpbacked man.
	 4.
A Javelin, a spear.
	 5. An earth-worm. 6, A water pot.
 E. गड् to
drop, Uṇādi affix उ.
