गड्डुक|गड्डुकः
गड्डुक m. (-कः) A golden vase.
 E. गड् to sprinkle, डुक Uṇādi affix; also
गड्डूक and occasionally कडूक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=228-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
