<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणचक्रक|गणचक्रकं
गणचक्रक n. (-कं) A dinner in common by a party of virtuous men. E.
गण a number, चक्र a wheel or circle, and कन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=228-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणता
गणता f. (-ता)
	 1. Classification.
	 2. Multitude, assemblage.
	 3. Following
a part or fraction.
	 4. Arithmetic.
 E. गण a class, तल् affix; also
with त्व, गणत्वं.
