गण्डकुसुम|गंडकुसुम|गण्डकुसुमं
गण्डकुसुम n. (-मं) The juice that exudes from the elephant's temples in
time of rut.
 E. गण्ड an elephant's temples, and कुसुम a flower,
from its supposed fragrance.
