गन्ध|गंध|गन्धं|गंधः|गन्धः
गन्ध m. (-न्धः)
	 1. Smell, odour.
	 2. A perfume, a fragrance or fragrant
substance.
	 3. A diffusive fragrance.
	 4. Sulphur.
	 5. Connexion,
relationship.
	 6. A neighbour.
	 7. A plant, (Morunga hyperanthera,
&c.)
	 8. Pride, arrogance.
	 9. Small, diminutive, a little, a small
quantity, &c.
	 10. Pounded Sandal.
	 f. (-न्धा) The bud of the Cham-
paca flower, (Michelia Champaca.)
	 n. (-न्धं) Aloe-wood.
 E. गन्ध् to
hurt, to move, &c. affix अच्.
