गन्धपुष्प|गंधपुष्प|गन्धपुष्पः
गन्धपुष्प m. (-ष्पः)
	 1. A kind of cane, (Calamus rotang.)
	 2. Another plant,
(Alangium hexapetalum:) see अङ्कोट.
	 3. Sebesten. (Cordia myxa.)
f. (-ष्पा)
	 1. The indigo plant.
	 2. Ganiyari, (Premna spinosa, &c.) see
गणिकारी.
	 n. (-ष्पं) Flowers and Sandal presented together at seasons
of worship.
 E. गन्ध smell, and पुष्प flower; having odoriferous flowers.
