	 1. Elephant or wood apple: see कपित्थ.
	 2. The Bel,
(Ægle cratæva.)
	 f. (-ला or -ली)
	 1. A plant bearing a fragrant seed.
see प्रियङ्गु 2. The gum olibanum tree.
	 f. (-ली) The blossom of the
champaca: see चम्पक.
 E. गन्ध smell, and फल a fruit.
