गन्धमादन mn. (-नः-नं) The name of a particular mountain, forming the
division between Ilavritta and Bhadraswa or to the east of Mern.
m. (-नः)
	 1. A large black bee.
	 2. Sulphur.
	 3. The name of one of
the monkey chiefs.
	 f. (-नी) Spirituous liquor; also in some books
read गन्धमादिनी.
 E. गन्ध smell, मद् to inebriate in the causal form and
ल्युट् aff.
