<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर|गरं|गरः
गर mn. (-रः-रं)
	 1. Poison.
	 2. An antidote.
	 m. (-रः) Sickness, disease.
	 n. (-रं)
1. Sprinkling, wetting.
	 2. The fifth of the eleven Karanas.
	 f. (-रा)
Swallowing. (-री) A species of grass, (Andropogon serratus); also
गरागरी.
 E. गर् to hurt, and अच् affix, or गृ to wet or sprinkle, or
again गॄ to swallow, affix अप्.
