	 m.
(-घ्नः) A species of Basil.
	 f. (-घ्नी) A fish (the young of the Ophioce-
phalus lata, HAM.)
 E. गर, and घ्न what destroys.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=233-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
