	 3. A reed, a
large kind of the Saccharum cylindricum.
	 4. A rope.
	 5. A musical
instrument.
	 6. A kind of fish, a small kind of cyprinus, a subgenus
of that class, (Cyprinus garra. HAM.)
 E. गल् to eat, to drop, &c. affix
अच्, or गॄ to swallow, with अच्, गर, and र changed to ल.
