<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गलग्रह|गलग्रहः
गलग्रह m. (-हः)
	 1. A sauce of fish ground up with salt, pepper, Ghee,
&c.
	 2. A day on which a course of study is commenced, but imme-
diately preceding a day on which study is prohibited.
	 3. The fourth
lunation of the dark fortnight, the seventh eighth, and ninth, the
thirteenth and three days following.
	 4. Seizing any one by the
throat, throttling, choking.
 E. गल the throat, and ग्रह what takes,
&c.; also गलग्रहण.
