गाढ|गाढं
गाढ adv.
	 n. (-ढं) adj.
	 mfn. (ढः-ढा-ढं)
	 1. Excessive, much, very much,
heavy, oppressive, &c.
	 2. Firm, strong.
	 3. Hard.
	 4. Close.
 E. गाह्
to agitate, affix क्त, deriv. irr.
