	 m.
(-र्ब्बः) A heavenly chorister: see गन्धर्ब्बं n. र्ब्बं 1. Song; singing.
	 2. A
form of marriage, that which require only mutual and amorous
agreement.
 E. गन्धर्ब्ब a Gandharba, and अण् aff.
