गाम्भीर्य्य n. (-र्य्यं)
	 1. Depth, (of water, sound, &c.)
	 2. The deep sound of
the voice of a jaina saint, like distant thunder or the muttering of
clouds.
 E. गम्भीर deep, affix ष्यञ् or ज्य.
