<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गिरिजामल|गिरिजामलं
गिरिजामल n. (-लं) Talc.
 E. गिरिज mountain-born, and अमल clear, clean;
also गिरिज, and अमल severally.
