गु
गु(ओ, शि) r. 6th cl. (गुवति) To stool, to void excrement. (ङ) गुङ् r. 1st
cl. (गवते) To sound inarticulately.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=238-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

