गुच्छक m. (-कः)
	 1. A cluster of blossoms.
	 2. A clump of grass.
	 3. A kind
of necklace.
	 4. A peacock's plumage, a bundle of peacock's feathers.
E. कन् added to the preceding; also गुत्सक.
