	 2.
Treacle, molasses, the first thickening of the juice of the cane by
boiling.
	 3. An elephant's trappings or armour.
	 4. A mouthful.
	 f. (-डा)
1. A plant, (Euphorbia tirucalli:) see स्नुही 2. Powder, pounded
substance.
 E. गुङ् to sound, affix ड.
