	 2. A clump of grass.
3. A necklace of thirty-six strings.
	 4. A perfume, commonly Gan-
thiala: see ग्रन्थिपर्ण.
	 5. A bundle.
 E. गुध् to enclose or surround,
Uṇādi affix स; also गुत्सक-गुच्छ &c.
