गुपिल|गुपिलः
गुपिल m. (-लः) A king, a prince.
 E. गुप् to protect, Uṇādi affix इलच्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=241-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुप्त|गुप्तं|गुप्तः
गुप्त mfn. (-प्तः-प्ता-प्तं)
	 1. Preserved, protected.
	 2. Hidden, concealed,
secret.
	 3. Joined, combined.
	 4. Invisible, withdrawn from sight.
n. adv (-प्तं) Privately, secretly.
	 m. (-प्तः) An appellation forming
especially the second member of the name of a Vaiśya or man of
the third class.
	 f. (-प्ता)
	 1. Cowach.
	 2. A woman who hides from
her lover's endearments.
 E. गुप् to defend, &c. affix ऊ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=241-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुप्तगति|गुप्तगतिः
गुप्तगति m. (-तिः) A spy or secret emissary.
	 f. (-तिः) Going privately or
secretly.
 E. गुप्त and गति going.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=241-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

