गुप्ति|गुप्तिः
गुप्ति f. (-प्तिः)
	 1. Concealing, hiding, concealment.
	 2. Preserving, protec-
ting.
	 3. Restraint, check.
	 4. A hole in the ground, a cavern, a
sink, a cellar, &c. (a place of concealment.)
	 5. A prison.
	 6. The
well or lower deck of a boat.
	 7. Digging a hole in the ground.
	 8.
Fortification.
 E. गुप् to hide, &c. affix क्तिन्.
