गूढवर्च्चस्|गूढवर्चस्
गूढवर्च्चस् m. (-र्च्चाः) A frog.
 E. गूढ hidden, and वर्च्चस् light, warmth;
perhaps an idea is implied analogous to that of cold blooded
animals: some explain it वर्च्चस् fœces, whose excrement is
unknown.
