गूर
गूर r. 10th cl. (गूरयते)
	 1. To strive, to endeavor to make an effort or
exertion.
	 2. To eat. (ई) गूरी r. 4th cl. (गूर्य्यते)
	 1. To hurt, to injure,
as to wound, to kill, &c.
	 2. To be decayed or old.
