गूर्द|गूर्दः|गूर्द्द
गूर्द r. 1st cl. (गूर्दते) To play. r. 10 cl. (गूर्दयति)
	 1. To dwell or inhabit.
	 2.
invite; these roots are both written more usually with the short
vowel.
