after having finished his studies is married and settled.
	 2. A house
holder of particular merit, giving alms, and performing all the
prescribed ceremonies, &c.
	 3. Maintenance of a sacred and perpe-
tual fire.
	 4. Virtue, especially of a householder, as hospitality, &c.
E. गृह a house. and पति lord or master.
