गोदारण|गोदारणं
गोदारण n. (-णं)
	 1. A plough.
	 2. A spade or hoe,
 E. गो the earth, and
दारण what cuts or tears. गां भूमिं दारयति दृ-णिच्-ल्यु ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=246-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोदावरी
गोदावरी f. (-री) The name of a river in the peninsula, the Godavari.
E, गो water, and द what gives, गोद and आवृ to cover or conceal;
affixes अप् and ङीप्. गां स्वर्गं ददाति स्नानात् दा वनिप् ङीप् ।
