गोमायु|गोमायुः
गोमायु m. (-युः)
	 1. A jackal.
	 2. A kind of Gandharba or celestial mu-
sician.
	 3. The bile or bilious humor of the cow.
 E. गो sound, &c.
मा to measure, and उण् Uṇādi affix, य inserted, or गो a cow, and
मायु bile. गां विकृतां वाचं मिनाति ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=247-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोमिथुन
गोमिथुन n. (-नं) A pair of cattle.
 E. गो, and मिथुन a couple.
