<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोमिन्
गोमिन् mfn. (-मी-मिनी-मि) Rich in herds, &c.
	 m. (-मी)
	 1. The owner of
cattle.
	 2. A jackal.
	 3. A worshipper.
	 4. An attendant on a
Buddha.
 E. गो a cow, &c. मिनि aff. गौरस्ति अस्य मिनि ।
