<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोमेदक|गोमेदकं|गोमेदकः
गोमेदक mn. (-कः-कं)
	 1. A gem or precious stone brought from the
Himālaya and Indus, described as of four sorts, white, pale
yellow, red, and dark blue, perhaps varieties of a gate.
2. A kind of poison: see काकोल.
	 6. Smearing the body with un-
guents.
 E. गो the eye, मिद् to anoint, &c. affix अच् and कन्.
