गोवर्द्धन
गोवर्द्धन m. (-नः) A celebrated hill in Brindaban or the country about
Mathura: it was upheld by KṚṢṆA upon one finger, to shelter
the cowherds from a storm excited by INDRA, as a test of the for-
mer's divinity.
 E. गो a cow, and वर्द्धन increasing; pasturing cattle.
