गोष्ठ|गोष्ठं|गोष्ठः
गोष्ठ mn. (-ष्ठः-ष्ठं)
	 1. A cowpen, a fold for cattle, any place where animals
are kept.
	 2. A station of cow-herds.
	 f. (-ष्ठी)
	 1. An assembly, a meet-
ing.
	 2. Conversation, discourse, dialogue, dispute.
	 3. Family con-
nexions, but especially the dependent or junior branches.
	 4. A
dramatic composition in one act.
 E. गो a cow, and ष्ठ from स्था to
stay, with क affix; here meaning the place of abiding, or गोष्ठ to
assemble, affix अच्.
