गोष्ठश्व|गोष्ठश्वः
गोष्ठश्व mfn. (-श्वः-श्वं-श्व) Malignant, censorious, envious: especially appli-
ed to a person who stays at home, and slanders his neighbours. E.
गोष्ठ a cowpen, in the first case used for abode in general, and श्वि to
increase, affix ड, who magnifies himself in his own house.
	 m. (-श्वः)
A horse in a cowpen.
 E. गोष्ठ, and अश्व a horse, the form is irregular.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=248-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
