गौडिक|गौडिकं|गौडिकः
गौडिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Of or relating to Gur or molasses.
	 n. (-कं)
Rum.
 E. गुड as above, affix of relation ठक्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=249-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गौण|गौणः
गौण mfn. (-णः-णी-णं)
	 1. Having qualities or attributes.
	 2. Relating to
multiplication or enumeration.
	 3. Secondary, subordinate.
	 4.
Secondery as applied to the month, reckoned from full-moon to
full-moon.
 E. गुण, and अण् aff. गुणमधिकृत्य प्रवृत्ता गौणी ततः आगतः अण् ।
