<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गौधेर|गौधेरः
गौधेर m. (-रः) An iguana.
 E. गोधा, and ढक् affix; see गौधारः
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=249-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गौपुच्छिक
गौपुच्छिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Of or belonging to a cow's tail, bought for a
cow's tail, &c.
 E. गो, and पुच्छ a tail, affix ठञ्. गोपुच्छेन क्रीतम् ।
