<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रहण|ग्रहणं
ग्रहण mfn. (-णः-णा-णं) A prisoner, captive, confined.
	 n. (-णं)
	 1. Taking,
seizure.
	 2. Receiving, acceptance.
	 3. Assent, agreement.
	 4. Respect.
5. The hand.
	 6. An eclipse.
	 7. Comprehension, the taking or
receiving of instruction, or the acquirement of any science.
	 8.
Sound.
	 9. An organ of sense.
	 10. In grammar, Exception.
 E. ग्रह्
to take, affix भावे ल्युट्.
