	 1. Diarrhœa, dysentery.
	 2. The vessels diffusing vital
warmth.
	 3. The small intestines, that part of the alimentary
canal where the bile assists digestion.
 E. ग्रह् to seize, अनि Uṇādi
affix; also with ङीप् added ग्रहणी.
