ग्रामयाजक|ग्रामयाजकः
ग्रामयाजक m. (-कः) The village priest, one who conducts the ceremonies
for any or all classes, and is consequently considered as a degrad-
ed Brahman; it also applies to the attendant of an idol.
 E. ग्राम a
village, यज् to sacrifice, in the causal form, affix वुन्; also with
णिनि affix ग्रामयाजिन्.
