ग्राहिन्
ग्राहिन् mfn. (-ही-हिणी-हि)
	 1. Taking, seizing, accepting, who or what
takes.
	 2. Astringent, binding, constipating.
	 m. (-ही)
	 1. A seda-
tive, a narcotic.
	 2. The elephant or wood apple: see कपित्थ.
	 f.
(-णी) A small kind of Jawasa, perhaps a species of Hedysarum.
E. ग्रह् to take, णिनि aff.
