ग्राह्य|ग्राह्यः
ग्राह्य mfn. (-ह्यः-ह्या-ह्यं)
	 1. To be seized, to be taken, to be accepted.
	 2.
To be accepted as a rule or a law, to be acknowledged or assented
to.
	 3. To be attended to or obeyed.
	 4. To be admitted in evidence,
&c.
	 5. To be apprehended or arrested.
 E. ग्रह् to take, ण्यत् aff.
