ग्रीष्मज
ग्रीष्मज mfn. (-जः-जा-जं)
	 1. Produced by heat.
	 2. Produced in the hot
season.
	 f. (-जा) A kind of fruit, (Annona reticulata.)
 E. ग्रीष्म the
hot season, and ज produced.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=252-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रीष्मभव
ग्रीष्मभव mfn. (-वः-वा-वं) Produced by heat or in the hot season.
	 f. (-वा)
Double jasmine: see नवमल्ली.
 E. ग्रीष्म the hot season, and भव being,
flourishing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=252-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रीष्मसुन्दरक|ग्रीष्मसुन्दरकः
ग्रीष्मसुन्दरक m. (-कः) A kind of potherb, (Chironia centauroides; it is
also applied to Pharnaceum mollugo.)
 E. ग्रीष्म the hot season, and
सुन्दर handsome, affix कन्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=252-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रीष्महास|ग्रीष्महासं
ग्रीष्महास n. (-सं) The flocculent seeds, blown down, about in the
air.
 E. ग्रीष्म the hot season, and हास a smile, considered from their
white colour, as the smiles of the season.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=252-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रीष्मोद्भव
ग्रीष्मोद्भव mfn. (-वः-वा-वं) Produced by heat or in the hot season.
	 f. (-वा)
Double jasmine.
 E. ग्रीष्म, and उद्भव produced. ग्रीष्मकाले उद्भवति उद् +
भू-अच् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=252-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रुच
ग्रुच (इर उ) इर ग्रुचु r. 1st. cl. (ग्रोचति) To steal or rob. भ्वा-पर-सक-सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=252-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रैव|ग्रैवं
ग्रैव mfn, (-वः-वी-वं) Belonging to the neck, &c.
	 n. (-वं)
	 1. A necklace, a
close necklace or collar.
	 2. A chain worn round the neck of an
elephant, &c.
 E. ग्रीवा the necklace, and अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=252-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रैवेय|ग्रैवेयं
ग्रैवेय mfn. (-यः-यी-यं) Belonging to the neck.
	 n. (-यं)
	 1. A collar, a neck-
lace.
	 2. A chain on the neck of an elephant or horse.
 E. ग्रीवा, and
ढक् affix; also ग्रैवेयक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=252-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रैवेयक|ग्रैवेयकं
ग्रैवेयक n. (-कं) A collar, an ornament for the neck.
 E. ग्रीवा and ढकङ्
affix: see ग्रैव and ग्रैवेय.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=252-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रैष्म
ग्रैष्म mfn. (-ष्मः-ष्मी-ष्मं) Belonging or relating to, or produced by heat or
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=252-b" target="_blank">Page252-b+ 56</a>]
hot season. of. (-ष्मी) Double jasmine.
 E. ग्रीष्म the hot season, &c.
affix अण्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=252-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्लपित
ग्लपित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Distressed, pained.
	 2. Exhausted, overpower-
ed.
 E. ग्लै to be weary, causal form, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=252-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्लस
ग्लस (उ) ग्लसु r. 1st cl. (ग्लसते) To eat: see ग्रस.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=252-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्लस्त|ग्लस्तः
ग्लस्त mfn. (-स्तः-स्ता-स्तं) Eaten.
 E. ग्लस् to eat, affix क्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=252-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्लह|ग्लहः
ग्लह (उ) ग्लहु r. 1st and 10th cls. (ग्लहति-यति) To take, to receive or ac-
cept: see ग्रह आदाने वा चुरा-उभ पक्षे भ्वा-सक-वेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=252-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्लह|ग्लहः
ग्लह m. (-हः) Gaming, playing with dice.
 E. ग्लह् to take, &c. affix अच्
or it is derived irregularly from ग्रह, and with अप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=252-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्लान|ग्लानः
ग्लान mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Wearied, languid, feeble, exhausted by fatigue,
disease, &c.
 E. ग्लै to be feeble, and कर्त्तरि क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=252-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्लानि|ग्लानिः
ग्लानि f. (-निः) Langour, lassitude, fatigue of body or depression of
mind.
 E. ग्ला or ग्लै to be weary, Uṇādi affix भावे नि.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=252-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्लायत्
ग्लायत् mfn. (-यन्-यन्ती-यत्) Being exhausted, languid, faint, &c.
 E. ग्लै to
be weary, शतृ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=252-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्लास्नु|ग्लास्नुः
ग्लास्नु mfn. (-स्नः-स्नुः-स्नु) Exhausted by disease or fatigue, wearied, lan-
guid.
 E. ग्लै to be weak, affix स्नु.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=252-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्लुच
ग्लुच (इर उ) इर ग्लुचु r. 1st cl. (ग्लोचति)
	 1. To steal, to rob.
	 2. To go;
see ग्रुच. भ्वा-पर-सक-सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=252-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्लुञ्च
ग्लुञ्च (इर उ) इर ग्लुञ्चु r. 1st cl. (ग्लुञ्चति) To go, to move. भ्वा-पर-सक-सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=252-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्लेप
ग्लेप (ऋ) ग्लेपृ r. 1st cl. (ग्लेपते)
	 1. To be poor or dependent.
	 2. To shake
to tremble.
	 3. To move. सक-भ्वा-आ-सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=252-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्लेय|ग्लेयः
ग्लेय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) To be made weary or exhausted, exhaustible,
fatiguable.
 E. ग्ला or ग्लै to be weary, affix यत्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=252-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्लेव
ग्लेव (ऋ) ग्लेवृ r. 1st cl. (ग्लेवते) To serve, to worship, to gratify by
service or devotedness. भ्वा-आ-सक-सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=252-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्लेष
ग्लेष (ऋ) ग्लषृ r. 1st cl (ग्लेषते) To inquire, to search, to investigate.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=252-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्लै
ग्लै r. 1st cl, ग्लायति 1. To be languid or weary, to be exhausted,
faded, &c.
	 2. To yawn, this root is sometimes considered to be
ग्ला. making ग्लायति as above, and in the causal form ग्लपयति or
ग्लापयति. भ्वा-पर-अक-अनिट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=252-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्लैतृ
ग्लैतृ mfn. (-ता-त्री-तृ) Wearied, exhausted.
 E. ग्लै to be weary, तृच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=252-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्लौ
ग्लौ m. (-ग्लौः)
	 1. The moon.
	 2. Camphor.
 E. ग्ला to be weary, Uṇādi
affix डा.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=252-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घ|घः
घ The fourth consonant of the Sanskrit alphabet, being the aspirate
of the preceding letter, and corresponding to Gh.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=252-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घ|घः
घ m. (-घः)
	 1. A bell.
	 2. A rattling or gurgling sound.
	 f. (-घा)
	 1. A tin-
kling ornament worn by women round the waist.
	 2. Strikling, kill-
ing.
	 3. Wetting, sprinkling,
 E. हन् to kill, affix ड, and घ substi-
tuted for the radical letter, or the same affix, with घृ to sprinkle,
&c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=252-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घग्घ
घग्घ r. 1st cl. (घग्घति) To laugh, to laugh at or deride also; घघ
and गग्घ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=252-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घघ
घघ r. 1st cl. (घघति) To laugh or to laugh at: see the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=252-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घट|घटः
घट r. 1st cl. (घटते) To act, to strive or endeavour. r. 10th cl. (घाटयति)
1. To unite or to put together.
	 2. To injure or kill.
	 3. To shine (इ)
घटि r. 10th cl. (घण्टयति) To shine. घट भ्वा-आ-अक-सेट् घटादि ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=252-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घट|घटः
घट m. (-टः)
	 1. A large earthen water jar.
	 2. The sign Aquarius.
	 3. A
measure; see कुम्भ.
	 4. An elephant's frontal sinus.
	 5. Suspending
the breath as a religious exercise.
	 6. A man who makes effort or exer-
tion.
	 f. (-टा)
	 1. A troop of elephants assembled for martial purposes.
2. Effort, endeavour.
	 3. An assembly.
	 4. A number, a collection,
an assemblage.
	 f. (-टी)
	 1. The Ghari or Indian clock, a plate of
iron or mixed metal on which the hours are struck.
	 2. A small
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=253-a" target="_blank">Page253-a+ 60</a>]
water jar, a ewer.
 E. घट् to endeavour, &c. affix अच् or अङ् and fem.
affix टाप् or ङीप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=252-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटक|घटकः
घटक m. (-कः)
	 1. A tree that produces fruit without apparent flowers.
2. A match-maker, an agent who ascertains or invents genealogies,
and negociates matrimonial alliances.
	 3. A genealogist.
 E. घट् to
endeavour, and णिच् ण्वुल् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=253-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटग्रह|घटग्रहः
घटग्रह mfn. (-हः-हा-हं) Who or what takes a water pot.
 E. घट and ग्रह्
to take, अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=253-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटदासी
घटदासी f. (-सी) A bawd or procuress.
 E. घट् effort, and दासी a slave or
servant.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=253-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटन|घटनं
घटन nf. (-नं-ना)
	 1. Effort, exertion.
	 2. Assembling, bringing together.
3. Joining, mixing.
	 4. Occuring.
 E. घट् to strive, &c. affix युच् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=253-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटयोनि|घटयोनिः
घटयोनि m. (-निः) The saint AGASTYA.
 E. घट a water jar, and योनि place
of birth; the saint being born from a water jar. see कुम्भसम्भव.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=253-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटराज|घटराजः
घटराज m. (-जः) A large water jar of baked clay.
 E. घट् a jar, and राज
king, chief. घटेन योजनेन राजते राज-अच् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=253-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटस्थापन
घटस्थापन n. (-नं) Placing a water pot as a type of DURGĀ, an essential
part of various Tantrika ceremonies.
 E. घट, and स्थापन placing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=253-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटाटोप|घटाटोपः
घटाटोप m. (-पः) A covering for a carriage or any article of furniture.
E. घट and आटोप pride.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=253-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटिक|घटिकं|घटिकः
घटिक n. (-कं) The posteriors.
	 f. (-का)
	 1. The ankle; also घटिका.
	 2. A
Muhurta or thirtieth part of a day and night.
	 3. A Danda or
period of twenty-four minutes.
	 m. (-कः) A waterman.
 E. घटी a clock.
&c. affixes कन् and टाप् for the feminine; otherwise घट a jar and ठन्
aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=253-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटित
घटित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Devised, attempted.
	 2. Made of.
	 3. In contact
with, contiguous, joined.
 E. घट् to make effort, णिच् क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=253-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटिन्धम|घटिंधम|घटिंधमः
घटिन्धम mfn. (-मः-मा-मं) Who blows or sounds in a jar.
	 m. (-मः) A potter
E. घटी and ध्मा to blow, खश् aff. मुम् ह्रस्वश्च ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=253-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटिन्धय|घटिंधय
घटिन्धय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Who drinks a Ghati, (in measure.)
 E. घटी and
घै to drink, खश् aff. मुम् ह्रस्वश्च ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=253-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटीकार|घटीकारः
घटीकार m. (-रः) A potter.
 E. घट कार who makes, with अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=253-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटीग्रह
घटीग्रह mfn. (-हः-हा-हं) Who or what takes a small jar, &c.
 E. घटी and
ग्रह who takes. अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=253-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटीयन्त्र|घटीयंत्र|घटीयन्त्रं
घटीयन्त्र n. (-न्त्रं) The rope and bucket of a well, or any machine for rais-
ing water.
 E. घट effort, and यन्त्र machine.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=253-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटोत्कच|घटोत्कचः
घटोत्कच m. (-चः) The son of BHIMA by the Rakshasi, named HIDIMBA.
