घट्ट r. 1st and 10th cls. (घट्टते or घट्टयति-ते) To move. With परि prefixed,
To spread or diffuse. With वि, To rub gently, to scratch. भ्वा-आत्म-
सक-सेट् । वा चुरा-उभ० ।
