out spaces or interstices.
	 m. (-नः)
	 1. A name of INDRA.
	 2. A vici-
ous elephant, or one in rut.
	 3. A rainy cloud.
	 4. Mutual collision.
f. (-ना) A vegetable, (Solanum Indicum;) also काकमाची.
 E. घन as
above, reiterated and the final of the first made long. हन-अच्
निपातने ।
