घर्घर|घर्घरः
घर्घर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) One of the tones or notes in music.
	 m. (-रः)
	 1. The
pass of a mountain.
	 2. A door, a gate.
	 3. An owl.
	 4. The name of
a river, the Gogra or Ghogra.
	 5. Sound.
	 6. Laughter, mirth.
	 7. A
fire of straw or chaff.
	 f. (-रा or -री) A girdle of small bells or tin-
kling ornaments worn by women.
	 f. (-रा) A kind of lute.
 E. घर्घ
here said to said to imply an inarticulate sound, gurgling, &c. and
रा to give or take, affix क also with कन् added घर्घरक. घर्घेत्यनुकरणशब्दं
राति । राक ।
