<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घर्षणाल|घर्षणालः
घर्षणाल m. (-लः) A roller or pestle for grinding, &c.
 E. घर्षण rubbing,
and अल what is fit for. घर्षणाय अलति अल अच् । (नोडा) ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घर्षित
घर्षित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Rubbed.
	 2. Ground.
 E. घृष् to rub, affix क्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घष
घष (इ) घषि r. 1st cl. (घंषते) To render handsome or brilliant. क्षरणे भ्वा-
आत्म-अक-सेट् इदित् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घस|घसः
घस (आ ऌ) औघसॢ r. 1st cl. (घसति) To eat: this root is in many tenses a
substitute for अद and is itself imperfect in others. (इ) घसि r. 1st cl.
(घंसते) To sprinkle or drop; this root is not generally admitted.
भक्षणे भ्वा-पर-सक-अनिट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घसि|घसिः
घसि m. (-सिः) Food, victuals.
 E. घस् to eat, भावे इन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घस्मर|घस्मरः
घस्मर mfn. (-रः-री-रं) Gluttonous, voracious,
 E. घस् to eat, क्मरच् aff. मक्षण-
शीले ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घस्र|घस्रं|घस्रः
घस्र mfn. (-स्रः-स्रा-स्रं) Mischievous, hurtful.
	 m. (-स्रः) A day.
	 n. (-स्रं)
Saffron.
 E. घस् to eat, and रक् aff. घसति अन्धकारम् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घाट|घाटः
घाट mf. (-टः-टी) The nape or back of the neck.
 E. घट् to unite, affix
अच्; the radical is of the 10th class of roots, whence the penul-
timate is long. ग्रीवयोः पश्चाद्भागे अवटौ (घाड्) ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घाटिका
घाटिका f. (-का) The nape of the neck.
 E. स्वाथ क added to the prece-
ding. घाटायाम् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घाण्टिक|घांटिक|घांटिकः|घाण्टिकः
घाण्टिक m. (-कः)
	 1. A bard, who sings in chorus, but especially in
honour of the gods, and rings a bell in presence of their images.
	 2.
Datura fastuosa.
 E. घण्टा a bell affix ठक् घण्टया चरति ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घात|घातः
घात n. (-तं)
	 1. Striking, wounding, killing.
	 2. A bruise, a blow.
	 3. An
arrow.
	 4. Product (of a sum in multiplication.)
 E. हन to
to kill, घञ् affix, and the radical letters changed respectively, to
घ and त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घातक|घातकः
घातक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) A murderer, a maimer, &c.
 E. हन् as above,
with ण्वुल् aff. हननकर्त्तरि.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घातन|घातनं|घातनः
घातन m. (-नं) A murderer, a killer.
	 n. (-नं)
	 1. Killing, slaughter.
	 2. Stri-
king.
	 3. Immolating victims.
 E. हन् to kill, ल्युट् affix, and घात sub-
stituted for the radical. हस्त्यर्थत्वात् स्वार्थे णिच् भावे ल्युट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घातयत्
घातयत् mfn. (-यन्-यन्ती-यत्) Striking, hurting, killing.
 E. हन् to kill,
causal form, शतृ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घातव्य
घातव्य mfn. (-व्यः-व्या-व्यं) To be killed, what may be or ought to be
killed &c.
 E. हन् to kill, तव्य affix, and घा substituted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घातस्थान
घातस्थान n. (-नं)
	 1. A slaughter house.
	 2. A place of execution.
 E. घात,
and स्थान place. श्मशाने ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घाति|घातिः
घाति m. (-तिः)
	 1. Catching or killing birds, fowling.
	 2. killing in gener-
al.
	 3. Striking.
 E. हन् to kill or hurt, affix इण्, and the radical
changed: see घात.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घातिन्
घातिन् mfn. (-ती-तिनी-ति) Murderous, felonious, who or what strikes or
kills.
 E. हन् to kill, णिनि aff. हन-ताच्छील्यार्थे णिन् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घातिपक्षिन्
घातिपक्षिन् mf. (-क्षी-क्षिणी) A hawk or falcon.
 E. घाति fowling, and पक्षिन् a
bird. श्येनखगे ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घातुक|घातुकः
घातुक mfn. (-कः-की-कं)
	 1. Mischievous, hurtful.
	 2. Cruel, savage. vio-
lent, ferocious.
 E. हन् to kill, changed to घात, and उकञ् aff. हिंसे,
क्रूरेच.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घात्य|घात्यं
घात्य mfn. (-त्यः-त्या-त्यं) Proper or fit to be killed.
 E. हन् and ण्यत् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घार|घारः
घार m. (-रः) Sprinkling, wetting.
 E. घॄ to sprinkle, and घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घार्त्तिक|घार्तिक|घार्तिकः|घार्त्तिकः
घार्त्तिक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Pulse ground and fried with clarified butter. E.
घृत ghee, and ठञ् aff. घृतप्रचुरे छिद्रबहुले पक्कान्नभेदे । (घिओड्) ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घास|घासः
घास m. (-सः) Meadow or pasture grass.
 E. घस् to eat. कर्मणि घञ् affix;
what is eaten by animals.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घासि|घासिः
घासि m. (-सिः) Fire or its deity.
 E. घस् to devour, and इण् Uṇādi aff.
भक्ष्ये तृणादौ-त्रि ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घिण
घिण r. 1st cl. (इ) घिणि (घिणते) To take, to seize or accept. ग्रहणे भ्वा-आ-
सक-सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घु|घुः
घु 1st cl. (घवते) To sound. ध्वनौ भ्वा-आ-अक-अनिट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घु|घुः
घु m. (-घुः) Sound.
 E. घु to sound, aff. डु । घु-ध्वनौ वा डु ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुट|घुटः
घुट r. 1st cl. (घोटते)
	 1. To come back, to return.
	 2. To barter or ex-
change. r. 6th cl. (घुटति)
	 1. To strike again or retaliate, to resist
or oppose.
	 2. To prevent.
	 3. To protect or preserve. भ्वा-आत्म-
सक-सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुट|घुटः
घुट m. (-टः) The ankle.
 E. घुट् to resist, and क affix; also घुटि, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुटि|घुटिः
घुटि f. (-टिः-टी) The ankle.
 E. घुट् to resist, affix इन् and वा ङीप् may be
added, also with कन् added घुटिका.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुटिक|घुटिकः
घुटिक mf. (-कः-का) The ankle, &c. see घुट and घुटि; also घुण्ट. घुट अस्त्यर्थे
ठन् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुण|घुणः
घुण r. 1st and 6th cls. (घोणते घुणति) To roll, to whirl, to turn round,
(इ) घुणि r. 1st cl. (घुणते) To take or accept. भ्वा-आ-सक-सेट् । तु-प-अक ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुण|घुणः
घुण m. (-णः)
	 1. An insect that is found in timber.
	 2. The pangolin or
armadillo.
 E. घुण् to turn round, affix क.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुण्ट|घुंट|घुंटः|घुण्टः
घुण्ट m. (-ण्टः) The ankle.
 E. घुट् to resist, affix क and नुम् inserted; also
with कन् added घुण्टक, or without the augment घुट &c. as above.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुण्टिक|घुंटिकं|घुण्टिकं
घुण्टिक n. (-कं) Cowdung found in thickets. घुण्ट-स्तदाकारोऽस्ति अस्य ठन् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुण्ड|घुंड|घुंडः|घुण्डः
घुण्ड m. (-ण्डः) A large black bee.
 E. घुण् to roll, Uṇādi affix ड.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुर
घुर r.
	 6. th cl. (घुरति)
	 1. To be frightful or terrible.
	 2. To sound.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुर
घुर (ई) घुरी r. 4th cl. (घुर्य्यते)
	 1. To be ignorant.
	 2. To inquire.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुर्घुर|घुर्घुरः
घुर्घुर m. (-रः) A kind of worm borrowing in the skin, guinea worm,
Dracunculus.
	 f. (-री) The mole cricket.
	 f. (-रा) Growling, as of
dog or cat.
 E. घुर् imitative sound, and घुर् to sound, with क aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुष
घुष (इ) घुषि r. 1st cl. (घुंषते) To render beautiful or brilliant (इर) घुषिर
r. 1st cl. (घोषति) To do any act except manifest sentiment by
sound. r. 10th cl. (घोषयति)
	 1. To manifest sentiment or thought by
sound, to speak, to affirm, to declare or proclaim.
	 2. To make
various sounds.
	 3. To praise. With आङ् prefixed, To weep in-
cessantly.
