घूर्ण|घूर्णः|घूर्ण्ण
घूर्ण m. (-र्णः)
	 1. A kind of potherb, (Chironia centauroides:) see
ग्रीष्मसुन्दरक 2. Turning round, whirling, rolling, &c.
 E. घूर्ण to roll,
affix अच्.
