<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घूर्णन|घूर्णनं|घूर्ण्णन
घूर्णन n. (-नं) Revolving, whirling turning round.
 E. घूर्ण to whirl, भावे
ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घूर्णायमान|घूर्णायमानः|घूर्ण्णायमान
घूर्णायमान mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Whirling, revolving, rolling, tossing
 E. घूर्ण
and शानच् aff. घूर्णः भ्रान्त इव आचरति भृशा-च्वर्थे वा क्यङ् कर्त्तरि शानच्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घूर्णि|घूर्णिः|घूर्ण्णि
घूर्णि f. (-र्णिः) Rolling, revolving, going round or over.
 E. घूर्ण and भावे
इन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घूर्णित|घूर्णितः|घूर्ण्णित
घूर्णित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Rolling, turning, tossing.
 E. घूर्ण to turn round,
affix कर्त्तरि क्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घूर्ण्यमान|घूर्ण्यमानः
घूर्ण्यमान mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Agitated, set in motion, made to go round. E.
घूर्ण to revolve, pass, voice, शानच् affix also घूर्णमान middle voice.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृ
घृ r. 1st, 3rd and 10th cls. (घरति जिघर्त्ति and घरयति)
	 1. To sprinkle, to
wet or moisten.
	 2. To drop or distil.
	 3. To shine. भासे-अक-सेके-सक-
भ्वा-जु-पर अनिट् घृ सेके छादने च चु-उभ-सक-सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=255-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृण|घृणः
घृण (उ) घृणु r. 8th cl. (घर्णोति घृणोति घर्णुते) To shine. (इ) घृणि r. 1st. cl.
(घृणते) To take or accept. दीप्तौ तना-उभ-अक-सेट्. ग्रहणे भ्वा-आ सक-सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृणा
घृणा f. (-णा)
	 1. Reproach, blame, censure, &c.
	 2. Compassion, tender-
ness, pity.
 E. घृण् to shine, अङ् and टाप् affixes, or घृ to sprinkle,
with नक् and टाप् affs.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृणावास|घृणावासः
घृणावास m. (-सः) A pumpkin gourd. कूष्माण्डे ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृणि|घृणिः
घृणि m. (-णिः)
	 1. A ray of the sun or moon.
	 2. The sun.
	 3. Water. E.
घॄण to shine, affix इन्; or घृ to sprinkle, Uṇādi नि.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृणित
घृणित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Abused, hated.
	 2. Pitied
 E. घृणा pity इतच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृणिन्
घृणिन् mfn. (-णी-णिनी-णि)
	 1. Censorious, abusive.
	 2. Compassionate. E.
घृणा and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृत|घृतः
घृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Sprinkled.
	 2. Illumined.
	 n. (-तं)
	 1. Ghee, clarified
butter, or butter which has been boiled gently, and allowed to
cool: it is then used for culinary and religious purpose and is
highly esteemed by the Hindus.
	 2. Water.
	 f. (-ता) The name of a
tree: see घृतमण्डा.
 E. घृ to sprinkle Uṇādi affix क्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृतकुमारी
घृतकुमारी f. (-री) The aloe, (Aloes perfoliata)
 E. घृत ghee, to which the
extact is compared, and कुमारी a virgin, which the plant is sup-
posed to resemble in delicacy and elegance; also घृतकुमारिका. घुतमिव
कुमारी सुन्दरी ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृतकुम्भ
घृतकुम्भ m. (-म्भः) A jar of ghee.
 E. घृत and कुम्भ a jar.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृतदीधिति|घृतदीधितिः
घृतदीधिति m. (-तिः) The deity of fire.
 E. घृत ghee, and दीधिति light; of-
ferings to fire, always comprehending clarified butter.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृतपशु|घृतपशुः
घृतपशु m. (-शुः) Ghee made into or supposed to resemble an animal to
be offered at a sacrifice or eaten at a meal, for which it is substi-
tuted.
 E. घृत, and पशु an animal.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृतपूर|घृतपूरः
घृतपूर m. (-रः) A sweetmeat composed of flour, milk, cocoanut and
ghee, &c.
 E. घृत ghee, and पूर what is full of.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृतपूर्णक|घृतपूर्णकः|घृतपूर्ण्णक
घृतपूर्णक m. (-कः) A tree. (Caledupa arborea, &c.) see करञ्ज
 E. घृत ghee,
and पूर्ण full, कप् added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृतप्राश|घृतप्राशः
घृतप्राश m. (-शः) Swallowing ghee.
 E. घृत and प्राश eating.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृतप्राशन
घृतप्राशन n. (-नं) Tasting or swallowing ghee.
 E. घृत and प्राश eating.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृतप्लुत
घृतप्लुत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Sprinkled or smeared with ghee,.
 E. घृत, and प्लुत
bathed.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृतमण्डा
घृतमण्डा f. (-ण्डा) A tree; also वायसोली.
 E. घृत, and मण्ड scum; the scum
of its infusion resembling ghee.
