घृतलोलीकृत
घृतलोलीकृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Mixed with ghee, steeped in it or wet with
it, &c.
 E. घृत लोल desirous. कृत made, च्वि augment.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृतवर|घृतवरः
घृतवर m. (-रः) A sweetmeat, or flour, &c. baked with ghee, and sugar.
E. घृत and वर what excels.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृतविक्रयिन्
घृतविक्रयिन् m. (-यी) A vender of ghee.
 E. घृत विक्रय to sell, इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृतस्पृश्
घृतस्पृश् mfn. (-स्पृक्) Who or what touches ghee.
 E. घृत स्पृश to touch, क्विन्
aff.
