घृताची
घृताची f. (-ची) One of the Apsaras or courtezans of Svarga.
 E. घृत ghee,
अञ्च to worship, क्विप् and ङीप् affs.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
