घृताभ्यक्त
घृताभ्यक्त mfn. (-क्तः-क्ता-क्तं) Smeared or anointed with ghee.
 E. घृत and
अभ्यक्त anointed.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृताह्व|घृताह्वः
घृताह्व m. (-ह्वः) Turpentine.
 E. घृत ghee, and आह्वा and appellation, named
from ghee.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
