घृतोदङ्कः|घृतोदङ्क
घृतोदङ्कः m. (-ङ्कः) A leather vessel holding ghee.
 E. घृत उद up, अञ्च् to
go, affix घञ्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृष
घृष (उ) घृषु r. 1st cl. (घर्षति) To grind or pound. सक-पर-सेट् ।
