<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृष्ट|घृष्टः
घृष्ट mfn. (-ष्टः-ष्टा-ष्टं)
	 1. Ground, rubbed, pounded.
	 2. Frayed, grazed,
rubbed off.
 E. घृष् to rub, कर्मणि क्त aff.
