घोर|घोरं|घोरः
घोर r. 1st cl. (घोरति) To go as a horse.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोर|घोरं|घोरः
घोर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Frightful, horrible, terrific.
	 m. (-रः) A name of
SHIVA.
	 f. (-रा) Night.
	 n. (-रं)
	 1. Horror, horribleness.
	 2. Poison. E.
घुर् to be frightful, affix अच or गुर् substituted for हन् to injure or
kill, and अच् Uṇādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोरदर्शन|घोरदर्शनः
घोरदर्शन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Terrific, of horrid or frightful appearance.
	 m.
(-नः) An owl.
 E. घोर as above, and दर्शन sight.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोरपुष्प|घोरपुष्पं
घोरपुष्प m. (-ष्पः) Bellmetal.
 E. घोर and पुष्प a flower.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोररासन|घोररासनः
घोररासन m. (-नः) A jackal.
 E. घोर frightful, and रासन cry or sound,
from रास् to sound, affix ल्युट.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोररासिन्
घोररासिन् m. (-सी) A jackal. E. See the last, णिनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोररूप|घोररूपः
घोररूप mfn. (-पः-पी-पं) Frightful, hideous.
	 n. (-पं) A hideous. appearance.
E. घोर and रूप form.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोररूपिन्
घोररूपिन् mfn. (-पी-पिणी-पि) Frightful, horrible, hideous.
 E. घोररूप and
णिनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोरसङ्काश|घोरसंकाश
घोरसङ्काश mfn. (-शः-शा-शं) Dreadful, horrible.
 E. घोर, and सङ्काश like.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोराकृति
घोराकृति mfn. (-तिः-तिः-ति) Frightful, hideous, of horrible aspect or
form.
 E. घोर, and आकृति form.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोल|घोलं|घोलः
घोल n. (-लं) Buttelmilk.
 E. घुड substituted for हन् to strike, (i. e. with
the churn,) and घञ् affix, ड changed to ल.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोष|घोषं|घोषः
घोष m. (-षः)
	 1. A station of herdsmen.
	 2. A herdsman.
	 3. A creeping
plant, commonly called by the same name Ghosha, and bearing
white or yellow flowers, (Luffa pentandra and acutangula.)
	 4.
Bellmetal, tutenague, &c.
	 5. Low thunder or the muttering of
clouds.
	 6. Sound.
	 7. A proclamation.
	 8. A gnat, a musquito 9. A
term proper for the name of a Kayastha.
	 f. (-षा) A kind of fennel,
(Anethum sowa:) see मधुरिका.
 E. घुषि to shine, to sound, &c. affix.
आधारे घञ्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोषक|घोषकः
घोषक m. (-कः)
	 1. A cryer, a proclaimer.
	 2. Ghosha, described as a cree-
king plant, (Luffa pentangula, &c.)
 E. कन् added to the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोषकाकृति|घोषकाकृतिः
घोषकाकृति f. (-तिः) A plant commonly called Hatighosha, and perhaps
a species of the preceding.
 E. घोषक Ghosha, and आकृति shape, ap-
appearance of similar appearance.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोषण|घोषणं
घोषण nf. (-णं-णा)
	 1. Speaking loud, making a great noise.
	 2. Crying,
proclaiming.
 E. घुष् to sound, affixes णिच् भावे ल्युट् and टाप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोषयित्नु|घोषयित्नुः
घोषयित्नु m. (-त्नुः)
	 1. A Brahman.
	 2. The Kokila or Indian cuckoo.
	 3. A
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=257-a" target="_blank">Page257-a+ 50</a>]
captive.
	 5. A cryer, a herald.
 E. घोष sound, इत्नुच् affix, and य
inserted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=256-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोषवती
घोषवती f. (-ती) A lute, a Vina.
 E. घोष sound, and मतुप् poss. aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=257-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घौर
घौर n. (-रं) Horror, horribleness.
 E. घोर and अण् aff.
