<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घ्नत्|घ्नन्त्
घ्नत् mfn. (-घ्नत्-घ्नन्ती-घ्नत्) Striking, beating, hurting.
 E. हन् to strike,
&c. शतृ aff.
