घ्राणतर्पण m. (-णः) Fragrance, odour, a fragrance, a perfume.
 E. घ्राण the
smell, and तर्पण what satisfies.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=257-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घ्राणदुःखदा
घ्राणदुःखदा f. (-दा) Sneezing.
 E. घ्राण, and दुःखदा paining.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=257-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घ्रात|घ्रातः
घ्रात mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Smelled.
 E. घ्रा to smell, affix क्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=257-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घ्रात्वा
घ्रात्वा ind. Having smelled.
 E. घ्रा to smell, क्त्वाच् aff.
