चक्रजीवक|चक्रजीवकः
चक्रजीवक m. (-कः) A potter.
 E. चक्र a wheel, and जीवक who lives by;
also चक्रजीविन्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=257-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्रदंष्ट्र|चक्रदंष्ट्रः
चक्रदंष्ट्र m. (-ष्ट्रः) A hog.
 E. चक्र and दंष्ट्र a tusk, having a curved tusk.
