चक्षुर्दान
चक्षुर्दान n. (-नं) The ceremony of anointing the eyes of the image at
the time of consecration.
 E. चक्षुस् and दान giving.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=258-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षुर्विषय|चक्षुर्विषयः
चक्षुर्विषय m. (-यः)
	 1. Presence, sight.
	 2. An object of sight, any visible
object.
	 3. Visibility
 E. चक्षुस् and विषय object.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=258-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षुष्मान्
चक्षुष्मान् mfn. (-ष्मान्-ष्मन्ती-ष्मत्)
	 1. Having eyes, seeing.
	 2. Having fine
eyes.
 E. चक्षुस् and मतुप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=258-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षुष्य|चक्षुष्यं|चक्षुष्यः
चक्षुष्य mfn. (-ष्यः-ष्या-ष्यं)
	 1. Beautiful, pleasing or well looking.
	 2. Fit
or agreeable for the eyes.
	 m. (-ष्यः)
	 1. A flower, (Pandanus odora-
tissimus.)
	 2. A plant: see पुण्डरीक.
	 3. collyrium or application to
the eyes, extracted from the Amomum anthorhiza.
	 f. (-ष्या)
	 1. A
blue stone, or according to some, the calx of brass used as coll-
yrium.
	 2. A pleasing or interesting woman.
 E. चक्षुस् the eye, affix
यत् । चक्षुषे हितः यत् ।
