<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षुस्
चक्षुस् n. (-क्षुः) The eye.
 E. चक्ष् to speak, and करणे उसि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=258-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
