चङ्ग mfn. (-ङ्गः-ङ्गा-ङ्गं)
	 1. Handsome, beautiful.
	 2. Dexterous, clever.
3. Sound, healthy.
 E. चं the moon, and ग what goes; what
resembles the moon in beauty, &c.
