चञ्चरीक|चंचरीक|चंचरीकः|चञ्चरीकः
चञ्चरीक m. (-कः) A large black bee.
 E. चर् to go, reduplicated, नुम् in-
serted, ईकन् Uṇādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=259-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
