चञ्चल|चंचल|चञ्चलं|चञ्चलः
चञ्चल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं)
	 1. Trembling, Shaking, moving, unsteady.
	 2. Fickle,
inconsiderate, inconstant, (unsteady, metaphorically.)
	 m. (-लः)
1. The wind.
	 2. A lecher, a libertine, a lover.
	 f. (-ला)
	 1. Lightning.
2. LAKṢMĪ or the goddess of the fortune.
	 3. Long pepper.
 E. चल
to go, in the reiterative form, नुम् inserted. चन्च अलच् । चञ्चं गतिं
लाति ला क वा ।
