चण्डातक|चंडातक|चंडातकं|चण्डातकं|चंडातकः|चण्डातकः
चण्डातक mn. (-कः-कं) A short petticoat.
 E. चण्डा an angry woman, अत् to
go, and ण्वुल् affix; it being described as the garb of women of some
consequence, and therefore privileged to give themselves airs.
