चण्डाल|चंडाल|चण्डालः
चण्डाल m. (-लः) An outcaste, a Chandala, the generic name for a man
of the lowest of the mixed tribes, born from a Śūdra father and
Brahman mother.
 E. चण्ड angry, and अल able, or चण्ड् to be angry.
and आलच् Uṇādi affix; proper to execute all vile or barbarous
acts; also चाण्डाल
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=259-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
