चतुष्पद nf. (-दं-दी) Verse, a metre of stanzas especially consisting of four
Padas or lines.
	 m. (-दः) An animal with four legs, a quadruped. E.
चतुर् four, and पद for पाद a foot also read चतुष्पाद चत्वारि पदानि
चरणा अस्य.
