चन
चन r. 1st. and 10th cls. (चनति, चानयति) To hurt, to injure in any man-
ner, to wound or kill, &c.
	 2. To believe, to confide.
	 3. To make
a sound. भ्वा-पर सक-सेट् । चुरा-पर-सक-सेट् ।
