चन्द्रभागा|चंद्रभागा
चन्द्रभागा f. (-गा-गी) The name of a river, the Chennab, one of the five
streams of the Punjab.
 E. चन्द्रभाग the name of a mountain, part
of the Himālaya range, where the river is said to have its source,
affix of derivation अण् hence also it may be read चान्द्रभागा-गी ।
