चप
चप r. 1st cl. (चपति) To caress, to coax, to soothe or console, r. 10th.
cl. (चपयति-ते) To grind or pound. (इ) चपि r. 1st and 10th cls.
(चम्पति, चम्पयति) To go, to move. भ्वा-पर-सक-सेट् चुरा-उभ-सक-सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=262-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
