<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चमूचर|चमूचरः
चमूचर m. (-रः) A soldier, a warrior.
 E. चमू, and चर who marches.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=262-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चमूपति|चमूपतिः
चमूपति m. (-तिः) A general of division, any general.
 E. चमू, and पति
master.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=262-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चमूरु|चमूरुः
चमूरु m. (-रुः) A kind of deer.
 E. चम् to be eaten, ऊरच् affix, and उ
final added. पृषोदरादित्वात् अत उत्त्वम् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=262-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चम्प|चंपः|चम्पः
चम्प r. 1st cl. (चम्पति) To go or move.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=262-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चम्प|चंपः|चम्पः
चम्प m. (-म्प्रः) Mountain ebony, (Bauhinia variegata.)
	 f. (-म्पा) The
capital of KARṆA, the modern Bhagalpur, or a place in its vicini-
ty.
 E. चपि to go &c. अच् and टाप् aff.
