चम्पक|चंपक|चम्पकं|चंपकः|चम्पकः
चम्पक m. (-कः)
	 1. A tree bearing a yellow fragrant flower, (Michelia
champaca.)
	 2. A division of the jack fruit.
	 n. (-कं) The flower of
the Champa.
	 2. A variety of the banana or plantain, (the fruit.)
E. चपि to shine, &c. affix ण्वुल्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=262-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
