चम्पेश|चम्पेशः
चम्पेश m. (-शः) KARṆA the natural brother of the Pāṇḍus.
 E. चम्पा the
city Champa, and ईश sovereign.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=262-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चम्पोपलक्षित|चम्पोपलक्षितः
चम्पोपलक्षित m. (-तः) The district of champa or Bhāgulpnr, or m. plu.
(-ताः) The inhabitants.
 E. चम्प the ebony, and उपलक्षित designated:
see चम्पावती.
