चरणास्कन्दन|चरणास्कंदन
चरणास्कन्दन n. (-नं) Trampling, trading on.
 E. चरण and आस्कन्दन going.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=263-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरणोदक
चरणोदक n. (-कं) Water in which the feet of a venerable Brahman or
spiritual teacher have been washed.
 E. चरण and उदक water.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=263-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरणोपग
चरणोपग mfn. (-गः-गा-गं) In contact with the feet, at the feet.
 E. चरण.
and उपग approached.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=263-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरत्
चरत् mfn. (-रन्-रन्ती रत्) Going, going. to.
 E. चर् to go, शतृ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=263-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
