<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरम|चरमः
चरम mfn. (-मः-मा-मं)
	 1. Last, ultimate, final.
	 2. West, western. चर् to
go, अमच् Uṇādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=263-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरमक्ष्माभृत्
चरमक्ष्माभृत् m. (-भृत्) The western mountain behind which the sun is
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=263-b" target="_blank">Page263-b+ 60</a>]
supposed to set.
 E. चरम western, and क्ष्माभृत् a mountain; also
चरमाचल, &c.
