<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरमाद्रि|चरमाद्रिः
चरमाद्रि m. (-द्रिः) See चरमक्ष्मामृत्; also other similar compounds.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=263-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चराचर|चराचरं|चराचरः
चराचर mfn. (-रः-रा-री-रं)
	 1. Moveable, locomotive.
	 2. Shaking, trem-
bling, unsteady.
	 3. Wished, desired.
	 4. Moveable and immove-
able.
	 n. (-रं)
	 1. The world.
	 2. Sky, atmosphere.
	 3. Heaven, paradise.
4. The aggregate of all things, whether inanimate or animate. E.
चर् to go, affix अच् and the derivative reiterated, आङ् inserted;
or चर what goes and अचर what does not go.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=263-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरि|चरिः
चरि m. (-रिः) An animal in general.
 E. चर locomotive, and इ Uṇādi
aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=263-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरित|चरितं
चरित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Gone, gone to, attained.
	 n. (-तं) Fixed institute,
proper or peculiar observance: see चरण.
	 2. Story, adventures.
	 3.
Practice, behaviour.
	 4. Nature.
 E. चर् to go, affix क्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=263-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरितव्य
चरितव्य mfn. (-व्यः-व्या-व्यं) To be followed or observed.
 E. चर and तव्य aff
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=263-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरितार्थ|चरितार्थः
चरितार्थ mfn. (-र्थः-र्था-र्थं)
	 1. Effected, accomplished.
	 2. Successful. E.
चरित and अर्थ object.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=263-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरितगुणत्व
चरितगुणत्व n. (-त्वं)
	 1. Accompaniment, assistance.
	 2. Meritorious con-
duct.
 E. चरित and गुणत्व faculty.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=263-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरित्र|चरित्रं
चरित्र n. (-त्रं)
	 1. Instituted and peculiar observance or conduct.
	 2.
Story, adventures 3. Practice, habit, behaviour.
	 4. Nature, dispo-
sition.
	 f. (-त्रा) The tamarind tree.
 E. चर् to go, इत्र Uṇādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=263-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरित्रबन्धक|चरित्रबन्धकः
चरित्रबन्धक n. (-कं) A friendly pledge, one of unequal value to the loan.
E. चरित्र and बन्धक a pledge.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=263-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरिष्णु|चरिष्णुः
चरिष्णु mfn. (-ष्णुः-ष्णुः-ष्णु)
	 1. Moveable, locomotive.
	 2. Wandering about.
E. चर् to go, and इष्णुच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=263-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरीत्र|चरीत्रं
चरीत्र n. (-त्रं) Practice conduct behaviour: see चरित्र.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=263-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरु|चरुः
चरु m. (-रुः)
	 1. An oblation of rice barley, and pulse, boiled with
butter and milk for presentation to the gods or manes.
	 2. The
vessel in which such an oblation is prepared.
 E. चर् to eat, उण्
Uṇādi affix, what the gods feed upon.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=263-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरुव्रण|चरुव्रणः
चरुव्रण m. (-णः) A kind of cake.
 E. चर् to eat, उ affix, edible, and व्रण
what is ground or pounded.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=263-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरुश्रपण
चरुश्रपण n. (-णं) Sprinkling an oblation of milk and ghee.
 E. चरु and
श्रपण scattering.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=263-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरुस्थाली
चरुस्थाली f. (-ली) The vessel in which an oblation is prepared.
 E. चरु
and स्थाली a pot.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=263-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्घ
चर्घ r. 1st cl. (चर्घति) To go or move.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=263-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्च|चर्चः|चर्च्च
चर्च r. 6th cl. (चर्चति)
	 1. To speak or say.
	 2. To abuse, to reprove,
to censure or condemn.
	 3. To injure or hurt.
	 4. To inquire,
r. 10th cl. (चर्चयति-ते) To read over, to peruse carefully, to study;
also read चर्च्च. चुरा-उभ-सक-सेट् । तु-पर ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=263-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्चरी|चर्च्चरी
चर्चरी f. (-री)
	 1. A festival, festive sport.
	 2. A kind of song.
	 3. Striking
the hands to beat time. (In music).
	 4. Curled or woolly hair.
5. Musical symphony or, the recitation of scholars.
	 6. The noise
made at festivals, &c 7. Flattery, dishonest praise.
 E. चर्च् to
speak, or say to sound, &c. अरन् and ङीष् affs.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=263-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्चरीक|चर्चरीकः|चर्च्चरीकः
चर्चरीक m. (-कः)
	 1. A form of ŚIVA.
	 2. A potherb.
	 3. Decorating or
curling the hair.
 E. चर्चरी noise, &c. and क who utters, from कै to
sound, affix ड; or चर्च ईकन् some authorities substitute बर्चरीक for
this word.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=263-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्चा|चर्च्चा
चर्चा f. (-र्चा)
	 1. Reflexion, consideration, the exercise of judgment or
deliberation.
	 2. Cleaning the person with fragrant unguents, 3.
Inquiry, investigation.
	 4. A name of the goddess DURGĀ.
 E. चर्च्
to read, &c. affixes अच् and टाप् also चर्चिका &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=263-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्चिका|चर्च्चिका
चर्चिका f. (-का)
	 1. The goddess DURGĀ. or CHAMUNDA.
	 2. Cleaning the
person with perfumes.
	 3. Deliberation, inquiry.
 E. चर्च् to ask,
affix ण्वुल्; also चर्चा as above.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=263-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्चित|चर्च्चितं
चर्चित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Perfumed, anointed, smeared with sandal, &c.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=264-a" target="_blank">Page264-a+ 60</a>]
2. Sought, desired.
	 3. Inquired into or after, investigated.
 E. चर्चा
smearing, &c. and कर्मणि क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=263-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्च्च|चर्च|चर्चः
चर्च्च r. 1st and 10th cls. (चर्च्चते चर्च्चयते)
	 1. To speak, to tell.
	 2. To re-
prove.
	 3. To study: see चर्च.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=264-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्त्त्य
चर्त्त्य mfn. (-र्त्त्यः-र्त्त्या-र्त्त्यं)
	 1. To be hurt or injured.
	 2. To be strung or
tied in order.
 E. चृत् to hurt, &c. and कर्मणि यत् affix from special.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=264-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्पट|चर्पटः
चर्पट m. (-टः)
	 1. The open palm of the hand with fingers extended.
	 2.
A plant, (Mollugo pentaphylla.)
	 3. A quantity of bubbles or specks
(स्फारविपुल)
	 f. (-टी) A thin cake or biscuit of flour.
 E. चर्प a Sautra
root, to be low or flat, or चप् दीप्तौ; affix अटन् also चपट and चपेट.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=264-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्ब|चर्ब्ब
चर्ब r. 1st cl. (चर्बति) To go to move. भ्वा-पर-सक-सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=264-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्भट|चर्भटः
चर्भट m. (-टः) A kind of cucumber, (C. utilatissimus:) see इर्व्वारु.
	 f. (-टी)
The noise of merriment or festivity: see चर्च्चरी.
 E. चारु agreeable
sound, and भट what makes, deriv. irr. चर क्विप् भट अच् कर्मधारय ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=264-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्म्म|चर्म|चर्मं|चर्म्मं
चर्म्म n. (-र्म्मं) A shield: see चर्म्मन्. चर्म साधनतया अस्ति अस्य अच् टिलोपः ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=264-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्म्मकरण|चर्मकरण
चर्म्मकरण n. (-णं) Working in skins or leather.
 E. चर्म्म and करण making.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=264-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्म्मकषा|चर्मकषा
चर्म्मकषा f. (-षा) A plant, commonly called by a similar name Charmra-
ksha or Charmagha.
 E. चर्म्म the skin, and कष what injures;
also चर्म्मकसा. चर्म कषति कष-अच्
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=264-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्म्मकार|चर्मकार|चर्मकारः|चर्म्मकारः
चर्म्मकार mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) The shoe-maker, a currier or worker in leather, the
offspring of the Chandala woman by a man of the fisherman caste,
or of a Vaideha female by a Nishadha.
	 f. (-री)
	 1. The plant Char-
maghas: see the preceding.
	 3. The wife of a Chamar.
 E. चर्म्म skin
or leather, and कार who does or makes. चर्म तन्निमित्तं पादुकादि करोति
कृ-अण् उपमित समासः ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=264-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्म्मकारक|चर्मकारक|चर्मकारकः
चर्म्मकारक m. (-कः) A worker in leather.
 E. चर्म्म and कारक making.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=264-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्म्मकारिन्|चर्मकारिन्
चर्म्मकारिन् m. (-री) A currier, a worker in hides or leather.
 E. चर्म्म and
कारिन् who makes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=264-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्म्मकार्य्य|चर्मकार्य
चर्म्मकार्य्य n. (-र्य्यं) Working in leather or skins.
 E. चर्म्म and कार्य्य
business.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=264-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्म्मकील|चर्मकील|चर्मकीलः|चर्म्मकीलः
चर्म्मकील n. (-लं) A wart.
 E. चर्म्म and कील a bolt. चर्मणि कील इव ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=264-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्म्मकृत्|चर्मकृत्
चर्म्मकृत् n. (-कृत्) A shoe-maker: see चर्म्मकार.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=264-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्म्मचटका|चर्मचटका
चर्म्मचटका f. (-का) A bat.
 E. चर्म्म leather, and चटका a sparrow, the
leather-winged sparrow; also चर्म्मचटिका चर्म्मचटी &c. चर्मणा चटका इव
(चाम्चिका) ।
