चर्म्मण्वती|चर्मण्वती
चर्म्मण्वती f. (-ती)
	 1. A river that runs across Bundelkhand into the
Ganges, the modern Chambal.
	 2. The plantain tree, (Musa sapien-
tum.)
 E. चर्म्मन् skin, and मतुप् poss. affix; न is changed to ण it may
also be dropped, and the word may be written चर्म्मवती.
