<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलदल|चलदलः
चलदल m. (-लः) The holy fig tree.
 E. चल shaking, and दल a leaf. चलानि
दलानि अस्य । अश्वत्थ-वृक्षे ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलद्विष|चलद्विषः
चलद्विष m. (-षः) The Kokila or Indian cuckoo.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलन|चलनं|चलनः
चलन mfn. (-नः-ना-नी-नं)
	 1. Who or what goes or moves.
	 2. Trembling,
tremulous, shaking.
	 m. (-नः)
	 1. A foot.
	 2. A deer, an antelope.
	 f.
(-नी)
	 1. A short petticoat worn by common women.
	 2. The tye of
an elephant.
	 n. (-नं)
	 1. Wandering, roaming.
	 2. Trembling, shak-
ing.
	 3. Going.
 E. चल् to go, affix भावे or करणे ल्युट् or युच् or कर्त्तरि ल्यु ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलनक|चलनकं|चलनकः
चलनक n. (-कं) A short petticoat worn by women of some rank,
 E. चलन
and कन् added. संज्ञायां कन् । चण्डातके ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलमान
चलमान mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Going, moving, proceding.
 E. चल् to go शानच्
aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलस्
चलस् n. (-लः) Wood sorrel; see अम्ल.
 E. चल् to go, असुन् Uṇādi affi.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलसन्धि|चलसंधि|चलसन्धिः
चलसन्धि m. (-न्धिः) Moveable articulation of the bones, Diarthrosis. E.
चल and सन्धि a joint.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलाचल|चलाचलः
चलाचल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं)
	 1. Tremulous, unsteady, unfixed.
	 2. Moveable
and stationary.
	 m. (-लः) A cow.
 E. चल् to go, affix अच् deriv. re-
iterated, and the first final vowel made long, or चल and अचल
immoveable.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलि|चलिः
चलि m. (-लिः) A cover, a wrapper, a surtout: see निचोल.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलित|चलितं
चलित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Shaking, trembling.
	 2. Gone, departed.
	 3.
Went, proceeded.
 E. चल् to go, affix क्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलु|चलुः
चलु m. (-लुः) A handful of water, water taken up in the hollowed
palm of the hand for rincing the mouth, &c.
 E. चल् to go, affix
उन्, गण्डूषे ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलुक|चलुकः
चलुक m. (-कः)
	 1. The hand hollowed as for holding a little water, &c.
2. A small pot, a gallipot, &c.
	 n. (-कं) A handful of water: see चलु
E. चल् to go कन् affix: see चुलक । चलुना मीयते कन् । प्रसृतौ, भाण्डभेदे च ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलेन्द्रिय|चलेंद्रिय
चलेन्द्रिय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Sensitive, sensual, not having subdued senses
or passions.
 E. चल and इन्द्रिय organ of sense.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चवि|चविः
चवि f. (-विः-वी) The pepper plant or a kind of it.
 E. चर्व् to eat इन् affix;
also sometimes ङीष्, deriv. irr. also चव्य and चविका.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चविक|चविकं
चविक mf. (-कः-का or -की) A plant that yields a sort of long pepper,
(Piper chavya.)
 E. चर्व् to eat, and क्कुन् affix, र rejected.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चव्य|चव्यं
चव्य nf. (-व्यं-व्या) A variety of pepper, (Piper chavya, Rox.)
	 f. (-व्या)
Orris root.
 E. चर्व् to be eaten, कर्मणि ण्यत् affix and deriv. irr.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चष
चष r. 1st cl. (चषति) To kill or hurt, (चषति-ते) To eat. भ्वा-उभ-सक-सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चषक|चषकं|चषकः
चषक mn. (-कः-कं)
	 1. A vessel for drinking spirits with, a wine glass,
&c.
	 2. Any drinking vessel.
	 3. Spirituous liquor.
	 4. Honey.
 E. चष्
to eat, करणे क्वुन् Uṇādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चषति|चषतिः
चषति m. (-तिः) Decay, infirmity.
 E. कृष् to plough, ति Uṇādi affix, and
च substituted for the radical initials. चष-भक्षे बधे वा भावे अति ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चषाल|चषालः
चषाल m. (-लः)
	 1. A wooden ring on the top of a sacrificial post.
	 2. An
iron ring at the base of the post.
	 3. A hive.
 E. चष् to eat, &c. आलच्
Uṇādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चह
चह r. 1st and 10th cls. (चहति, चहयति-ते)
	 1. To be wicked, to commit
wickedness.
	 2. To cheat.
	 3. To be proud, &c. r. 10th cl. (चहयति-ते)
To grind or pound. भ्वा-पर-सक-सेट् । चुरा-उभ-सक-सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाक्रिक|चाक्रिकः
चाक्रिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं)
	 1. Circular.
	 2. Belonging to a wheel or discus.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-b" target="_blank">Page265-b+ 60</a>]
3. Relating to a company or circle.
	 m. (-कः)
	 1. A chorister, a
bard who chants in chorus the praises of kings heroes, gods, &c.
2. An oil maker.
	 3. A coach-man, a driver.
 E. चक्र a multitude, &c.
and ठक् aff. चक्रेण समूहेन यन्त्रभेदेन चक्रयुक्तशकटेन वा चरति ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाक्षुष|चाक्षुषं|चाक्षुषः
चाक्षुष mfn. (-षः-षी-षं) Visible, perceptible, seen.
	 m. (-षः) The sixth Manu.
E. चक्षुष the eye, अण् aff. चक्षुषा गृह्यते ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाङ्ग|चांग|चांगः|चाङ्गः
चाङ्ग m. (-ङ्गः) Whiteness or beauty of the teeth.
 E. चङ्ग handsome, affix
ड । ची-ड चमङ्गमस्य । चाङ्गेय्याम् दन्तपटुत्वे च ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाङ्गेरी
चाङ्गेरी f. (-री) Wood sorrel, (Oxalis monadelpha, Rox.)
 E. चाङ्ग as
above, and इर् to send or cause, affixes अण् and ङीष्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाचलि
चाचलि mfn. (-लिः-लिः-लि) Moving much or repeatedly.
 E. चल् to go,
intents from, कि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाञ्चल्य|चांचल्य|चांचल्यं|चाञ्चल्यं
चाञ्चल्य n. (-ल्यं)
	 1. Tremulousness, unsteadiness.
	 2. Transitoriness. E.
चञ्चल, and ष्यञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाट|चाटः
चाट m. (-टः) A cheat, a rogue, a peculator, one who makes away with
money &c. entrusted to him.
 E. चट् to injure, affix अच् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाटकैर|चाटकैरः
चाटकैर m. (-रः) A young sparrow.
 E. चटक a sparrow, and ऐरक् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाटु|चाटुः
चाटु mn. (-टुः-टु)
	 1. Pleasing or grateful discourse.
	 2. Distinct speech.
3. Flattery.
 E. चट् to break, (anger,) Uṇādi affix ञुण्; also चटु.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाटुकार
चाटुकार mfn. (-रः-री-रं) Speaking agreeably or kindly.
	 m. (-रः) A flat-
terer.
 E. चाटु and कार who makes. चाटुं करोति ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाटुपटु|चाटुपटुः
चाटुपटु m. (-टुः) A jester, a buffoon.
 E. चाटु agreeable speech, and पटु
clever; also चाटुवटु. भण्डे । (भांँड) ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाटुलोल|चाटुलोलः
चाटुलोल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Elegantly tremulous.
 E. चाटु for चटु beautiful,
and लोल trembling.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाटुवटु|चाटुवटुः
चाटुवटु m. (-टुः) A jester.
 E. चाटु wit and वटु who utters: see चाटुपटु.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाटुशत
चाटुशत n. (-तं) Repeated coaxing, a hundred entreaties.
 E. चाटु and शत
a hundred.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाटूक्ति|चाटूक्तिः
चाटूक्ति f. (-क्तिः)
	 1. Service.
	 2. Agreeable language.
	 3. Flattery.
 E. चाटु
agreeable speech, and उक्ति saying.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाणकीन|चाणकीनं
चाणकीन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Fit for or sown with the chickpea, (a field, &c.)
E. चणक chickpea, and खञ् aff. चणकस्य भवनं क्षेत्रम् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाणक्य|चाणक्यः
चाणक्य m. (-क्यः)
	 1. A name of the sage VATSYAYANA.
	 2. Name of a
Brahman, the reputed author of a work on polity, and minister of
CHANDRAGUPTA.
	 n. (-क्यं) The work of Chanakya, detached stanzas
original or compiled, on morals and polity.
 E. चणक a saint, and यञ्
affix of descent. चणकस्य मुनेः गोत्रापत्यम् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाणूर|चाणूरः
चाणूर m. (-रः) A wrestler in the service of KANSA.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाणूरसूदन|चाणूरसूदनः
चाणूरसूदन m. (-नः) KṚṢṆA.
 E. चाणूर and सूदन destroyer.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाण्डाल|चांडाल|चांडालः|चाण्डालः
चाण्डाल m. (-लः) A name of an impure or degraded tribe, a Chandala,
a Pariah, an outcaste.
	 f. (-ली) A woman of the same tribe.
 E. चडि
to be angry, Uṇādi affix आलञ् and according to some अण् added
also चण्डाल.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाण्डालिका|चांडालिका
चाण्डालिका f. (-का)
	 1. A vulgar lute.
	 2. A name of DURGĀ.
	 3. A kind
of herb: see चण्डालिका.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातक|चातकः
चातक m. (-कः) A bird, a kind of cuckoo, (Cuculus melanoleucus.) E.
चत् to beg, affix कर्त्तरि ण्वुल्; begging water from the clouds, the
supposed sole source of the fluid which this bird drinks.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातकानन्दन|चातकानंदन|चातकानन्दनः
चातकानन्दन m. (-नः) The rainy season.
 E. चातक and आनन्दन delighting.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुर|चातुरः
चातुर mfn. (-रः-री-रं)
	 1. Perceptible, visible.
	 2. Speaking well or amiably.
3. Driving, one who drives, a driver, a charioteer, &c.
	 4. Clever,
able, ingenious.
	 5. Relating to four.
	 f. (-री) Dexterity, ability,
cleverness.
	 m. (-रः) A small round pillow for resting the cheek
upon.
	 n. (-रं) a four-wheeled carriage, a cart holding four people.
E. चतुर dexterous, or चतुर् four, अण् affix; also with कन् added
चातुरक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुरक|चातुरकः
चातुरक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) See the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुराश्रम्य|चातुराश्रम्यं
चातुराश्रम्य n. (-म्यं) The aggregate of the four orders of a Brahmana
such as religious studentship, house-holder, mendicant and
ascetic.
 E. चतुर् four, आश्रम order, ष्यञ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=265-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुरिक|चातुरिकः
चातुरिक m. (-कः) A charioteer, a coachman.
 E. चातुर a carriage, and
ठक् aff.
