चातुर्विध्य|चातुर्विध्यं
चातुर्विध्य n. (-ध्यं) Four kinds collectively.
 E. चतुर्विध and ञ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=266-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुर्वैद्य|चातुर्व्वैद्यः
चातुर्वैद्य m. (-द्यः) A priest, &c. versed in the four Vedas.
 E. चतुर four,
वेद a Veda, and ष्यञ् affix; it is also derived from विद्या Know-
ledge, and is optionally as here given, or चातर्विद्य.
