चान्दनिक|चांदनिक
चान्दनिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Made of or derived form Sandal, perfumed
with it, &c.
 E. चन्दन, and ठक् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=266-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चान्द्र|चांद्र|चान्द्रं|चान्द्रः
चान्द्र mfn. (-न्द्रः-न्द्री-न्द्रं) Lunar, relating to the moon, regulated by it,
&c.
	 m. (-न्द्रः)
	 1. The Chandrakanta or moongem.
	 2. A month, a
lunar month.
	 3. The light fortnight or half month, during which
the moon is on the increase. (-न्द्रं) The Chandrayana observance:
see चान्द्रायण f. (-न्द्री) Moonlight.
 E. चन्द्र the moon, and अण् affix of
relation. चन्द्रस्य इदम् ।
