चाप|चापं|चापः
चाप m. (-पः)
	 1. A bow.
	 2. (In Geometry,) An arc or portion of a circle.
3. Sagittarius, the ninth sign of the Zodiac.
 E. चप् to cast,
(arrows,) affix अण्.
