	 1. The betel-nut tree, (Areca faufel or catechu.)
	 2. A
kind of grass, (Saccharum cylindricum.)
	 3. The mango tree.
	 4. A
flower, (Pandanus odoratissimus.)
	 5. Ketaka plant.
 E. चामर a
Chowri, and पुष्प a flower; whose flowers grow in clusters like the
Indian chowri.
