<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चामरिन्
चामरिन् m. (-री) A horse.
 E. चामर a Chowri, and इनि affix. Either allud-
ing to his bushy tail, or the custom of whisking off flies, &c. from
the animal.
