चामीकर|चामीकरं
चामीकर n. (-रं)
	 1. Gold.
	 2. The Dhutura plant. Gold.
 E. चमीकर said to
mean a kind of mine, and अण् affix implying production.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=266-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
