चामुण्डा|चामुंडा
चामुण्डा f. (ण्डा)
	 1. A terrific form of DURGĀ.
	 2. One of the Matrikas.
E. च the moon, and मुण्ड the head, having a head like the moon;
or चा for चण्ड the name of a demon, and मुण्ड the skull; having
seized the decapitated head of the demon: in either case the deriv.
