	 1. The Champaca, (Michelia champaca.)
	 2. A plant
commonly Nageshwar, or Naga kesara (Mesua ferrea.)
	 3. The
filament of flower.
	 4. gold.
	 5. Dhutura plant.
 E. चम्पा the district,
and ढक् aff.
