चार|चारं|चारः
चार m. (-रः)
	 1. Going in motion.
	 2. A spy, a secret agent or emissary.
3. Binding, a binding, a fetter, &c.
	 4. A prison, a house of confine-
ment.
	 5. A kind of tree, the Piyal, (Buchanania latifolia, Rox.)
see पियाल 6. Wandering about, travelling.
	 n. (-रं) A factitious
poison.
 E. चर going, &c. affix अण्.
