चारक|चारकः
चारक m. (-कः)
	 1. A groom, a horseman, a cavalier.
	 2. A binding, a
fetter.
	 3. An associate, a companion.
	 4. A spy.
	 5. A herdsman
E. चर् to go, in the causal form, and णिच्-ण्वुल् aff.
