चारण|चारणः
चारण m. (-णः)
	 1. A dancer, a mime.
	 2. An actor of note.
	 3. A reader of
scripture.
	 4. A panegyrist of the gods.
	 5. A bard, a herald.
	 6. A
celestial singer.
	 7. A spy.
	 8. A pilgrim.
 E. चर in the causal,
to cause to go, to diffuse, (fame, &c.) and णिच् ल्युट् aff.
