चारयित्वा
चारयित्वा ind.
	 1. Having enjoined or prescribed, having caused to
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=267-a" target="_blank">Page267-a+ 60</a>]
observe.
	 2. Having made to go.
 E. चर् to go, causal form, क्त्वा aff.
