चार्म mfn. (-र्म-र्मी-र्मं)
	 1. Covered with leather, (a car, &c.)
	 2. Defended
by a hide or skin.
	 3. Shielded, having a shield.
 E. चर्म leather, and
अण् aff. चर्मणा परिवृतो रथः ।
