 E. चर्मिन् A shield-
bearer, and अण् aff. चर्मिणां समूहः ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=267-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

