<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चार्व्वी|चार्वी
चार्व्वी f. (-र्व्वी)
	 1. A beautiful woman, a beauty.
	 2. The wife of KUVERA.
3. Understanding, intellect.
	 4. Moonlight.
	 5. Light, splendour. E.
चारु beautiful, fem. affix ङीप्. चारु + गुणवचनत्वात् स्त्रियां ङीप् ।
