<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चालन|चालनं
चालन nf. (-नं-नी) A sieve, a strainer.
	 n. (नं)
	 1. Causing to move or go.
2. Muscular action.
 E. चल in the causal, to make go, (grain, &c.
through its pores,) णिच् भावे ल्युट् and ङीप् affs.
