 E. कित् to cure,
affix स्वार्थे सन् ण्वुल् and the root reiterated.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=267-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिकित्मन
