<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिट
चिट r. 1st and 10th cls. (चेटति चेटयति-ते)
	 1. To be another's messenger
or servant.
	 2. To order as a servant भ्वा-पर-सक-चुरा-उभ वा सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=268-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
