<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्
चित् f. (-चित्) Intellect, understanding. ind. A particle and affix to
words giving them an indefinite signification, as कश्चित् some one,
कस्यचित् of some one, &c. see चन.
 E. चित् to remember, affix भावे क्विप्
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=268-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित|चितः
चित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Covered, veiled, concealed.
	 2. Collected, accum-
ulated.
	 3. Piled, heaped.
	 f. (-ता)
	 1. A funeral pile.
	 2. A heap, an
assemblage.
 E. चि to collect, &c. affix कर्मणि क्त; also चिति and चिती
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=268-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिताग्नि|चिताग्निः
चिताग्नि m. (-ग्निः) The funeral fire.
 E. चिता the pile, and अग्नि fire.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=268-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिताचूडक|चिताचूडकं
चिताचूडक n. (-कं) A mark where funeral pile has been, a mausoleum, a
monument, &c.
 E. चिता a pile, and चूडक a crest.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=268-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिति|चितिः
चिति f. (-तिः) Collecting, gathering. (-तिः-ती)
	 1. funeral pile.
	 2. A heap,
a quantity.
	 3. A pile, a stack.
	 4. An oblong with quadrangular
sides.
 E. चि to collect, affix आधारे क्तिन् and optionally ङीष् is
added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=268-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चितिका
चितिका f. (-का)
	 1. A funeral pile.
	 2. A small chain worn as an
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=268-b" target="_blank">Page268-b+ 60</a>]
ornament round the loins.
 E. चित् to think of, इकन् affix and fem.
form. चितिरिव कायति कै क वा चिति स्वार्थे क ।
