चित्कारशब्द m. (-ब्दः) A cry, a scream.
 E. चित्कार the same, and शब्द sound.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=268-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्त|चित्तं
चित्त n. (-त्तं) The mind or faculty of reasoning, the heart considered as
