<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्तकलित
चित्तकलित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Anticipated, expected, calculated.
	 2.
Known
 E. चित्त and कलित computed.
