चिन्तयित्वा
चिन्तयित्वा ind. Having thought or considered,
 E. चिति to think, (10th cl.)
क्त्वा aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=270-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्ता|चिंता
चिन्ता f. (-न्ता) Reflexion, consideration, recollection.
 E. चिति to reflect,
affixes अङ् and टाप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=270-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्ताकुल|चिंताकुल
चिन्ताकुल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Disturbed in thought or distracted by any
idea.
 E. चिन्ता, and आकुल agitated.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=270-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्तापर|चिंतापर
चिन्तापर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Thoughtful, anxious.
 E. चिन्ता, and पर engaged in.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=270-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्तामणि|चिंतामणि|चिन्तामणिः
चिन्तामणि m. (-णिः)
	 1. A fabulous gem, supposed to yield its possessor
whatever may be required.
	 2. A name of BRAHMĀ.
	 3. A Jina or
Jaina saint.
 E. चिन्ता, reflexion, and मणि a jewel.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=270-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्त्यमान
चिन्त्यमान mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Reflecting, considering, meditating.
 E. चिति
to think, शानच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=270-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्तावत्|चिन्तावन्त्
चिन्तावत् mfn. (-वान्-वती-वत्) Thinking, thoughtful.
 E. चिन्ता, and मतुप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=270-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्तावेश्मन्|चिंतावेश्मन्
चिन्तावेश्मन् n. (-श्म) Council house or room.
 E. चिन्ता reflection, and वेश्मन्
a house.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=270-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्तिडी|चिंतिडी
चिन्तिडी f. (-डी) The tamarind tree. E. Irregularly changed from तिन्तिडी,
q. v. also चिन्तिडीका, कन् being added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=270-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्तित|चिंतित|चिन्तितं
चिन्तित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Thought, considered.
	 2. Reflecting, consider-
ing.
	 n. (-तं) Reflexion: see चिन्ता.
 E. चिति to think, affix क्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=270-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्तिति|चिंतिति|चिंतितिः|चिन्तितिः
चिन्तिति f. (-तिः) Consideration, reflexion.
 E. चिति to think, क्तिन् aff.
चिति-क्तिन् वा इट् णिलोपश्च । चिन्तायाम् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=270-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्तिया|चिंतिया
चिन्तिया f. (-या) Reflexion, consideration, thinking.
 E. चिति, and इय
aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=270-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्तोक्ति
चिन्तोक्ति f. (-क्तिः) Midnight cry or alarm.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=270-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्त्य|चिंत्य
चिन्त्य mfn. (-न्त्यः-न्त्या-न्त्यं)
	 1. To be considered.
	 2. To be appreciated or
conceived.
	 3. To be thought of or meditated upon.
 E. चित् to think,
कर्मणि यत् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=270-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्न|चिन्नः
चिन्न m. (-न्नः) A kind of grain, (Panicum miliaceum.) A various reading
of चीन, q. v.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=270-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्वत्
चिन्वत् mfn. (-न्वन्-न्वन्ती-न्वत्) Gathering, collecting.
 E. चि to gather,
(5th cl.) शतृ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=270-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिपिट|चिपिटः
चिपिट mfn. (-टः-टा-टं) Flat-nosed.
 E. नि preposition, पिटच् किच्च affix
in this sense, and नि changed to चि.
	 m. (-टः) Rice or grain
flattened.
 E. पिट् to flatten, क affix, the derivative reduplicated, and
and ल substituted for the radical; also with कन् added चिपिटक;
also the pen becoming उ, चिपुट.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=270-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिपिटक|चिपिटकः
चिपिटक m. (-कः) See the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=270-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिपुट|चिपुटः
चिपुट m. (-टः) See चिपिट.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=270-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिप्य
चिप्य n. (-प्यं) A whitlow. नखमांसमधिष्ठाय वातं पित्तं च देहिनाम् । करोति दाह-
पाकौ च तं व्याधिं चिप्यमादिशेत् ॥ इत्युक्ते नखरोगभेदे ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=270-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिमि|चिमिः
चिमि m. (-मिः)
	 1. A parrot.
	 2. A plant, from the fibres of which coarse
cloth and rope are made: see पट्ट.
 E. चि imitative sound, and मि to
utter, affix क्विप्, with कन् added चिमिक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=270-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिमिक|चिमिकः
चिमिक m. (-कः) A parrot: see the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=270-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिर|चिरं
चिर n. (-रं)
 E. चि-रक् । दीर्घकाले, तद्वर्त्तिनि पदार्थे । त्रि० लघ्वादौ त्रि कले गणे ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=270-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरकारिन्
चिरकारिन् mfn. (-री-रिणी-रि) Dilatory, tedious, slow.
 E. चिर, and कारिन्
who acts. चिरेण करोति कृ-णिनि । दीर्घसूत्रे, गौतमपुत्रभेदे च ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=270-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरकाल|चिरकालः
चिरकाल n. (-लं) A long period.
 E. चिर long, and काल time.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=270-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरकालपालित
चिरकालपालित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Protected for a long time.
 E. चिरकाल, and
पालित nourished.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=270-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिकालोपार्ज्जित
चिकालोपार्ज्जित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Accumulated slowly or after a long time.
E. चिरकाल, and उपार्ज्जित gained.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=270-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरक्रिय|चिरक्रियः
चिरक्रिय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Dilatory, tedious, slow.
 E. चिर long, and क्रिया
business.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=270-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरगत
चिरगत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Long absent, a long time gone.
 E. चिर, and गत
gone.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=270-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरचेष्टित
चिरचेष्टित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Long sought for, of rare occurence.
 E. चिर,
and चेष्टित sought.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=270-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरजीवक|चिरजीवकः
चिरजीवक m. (-कः) A tree: see जीवक
 E. चिर long, and जीवक lived.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=270-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरचीविन्
चिरचीविन् mfn. (-वी-विनी-वि) Long-lived.
	 m. (-वी)
	 1. A name of VIṢṆU.
2. A crow.
	 3. The Jivaka: see the preceding.
	 4. An epithet applied
especially to eight chiefs or saints, viz. MARKANDEYA, ASWATTHAMA,
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=271-a" target="_blank">Page271-a+ 60</a>]
BALI, VYASA, HANUMANA, VIBHISHANA, KRIPA, and PARASURAMA.
E. चिर for चिरम् long, and जीविन् living or lived; also चिरञ्जीविन्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=270-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरञ्जीविन्|चिरंजीविन्
चिरञ्जीविन् mfn. (-वी-विनी-वि) Long-lived.
	 m. (-वी)
	 1. A crow.
	 2. VIṢṆU.
E. See the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=271-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरण्डी
चिरण्डी f. (-ण्डी)
	 1. A woman married or single, who continues to reside
after maturity in her father's house.
	 2. A young woman.
 E. चिरम्
long or late, and अट् to go, (from home,) affix अच् and deriv. irr.;
also चिरिण्टी. चिरेण अटति पितृगृहात् भर्तृ गेहम् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=271-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरतिक्त|चिरतिक्तः
चिरतिक्त m. (-क्तः) A kind of gentian, (Gentiana cherayta.)
 E. चिर long,
and तिक्त bitter. चिरः तिक्तः रसो यत्र (चिराता) मूनिम्बे ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=271-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरत्न|चिरत्नः
चिरत्न mfn. (-त्नः-त्नी-त्नं) Old, ancient, what has been or lasted long. E.
चिर long, and त्न aff. चिरन्तने, पुराणे ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=271-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरदिवसं
चिरदिवसं ind. For a long time.
 E. चिर. and दिवस a day.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=271-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरनिविष्ट
चिरनिविष्ट mfn. (-ष्टः-ष्टा-ष्टं) Long rested, long abided.
 E. चिर, and निविष्ट
rested.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=271-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरन्तन|चिरंतन|चिरन्तनः
चिरन्तन mfn. (-नः-नी-नं) Old, ancient, antiquated, long lasting.
 E. चिरम्
long, and ट्युल् affix, with तुट् augment. चिरं भवार्थे ट्युल् तुट् च ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=271-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरम्
चिरम् ind. A long time.
 E. चिर् to injure, and क affix: वा रमुक् । this
word, and others evidently derived from it, are now considered as
particles, and have accordingly appropriate, though strained ety-
mologies; the derivatives however corresponding with the inflec-
tions of the singular number of nouns masculine or neuter, it may
have been originally an imperfect noun of the 1st declension, thus;
nom. चिरः or चिरं acc. चिरं 1st abl. चिरेण dat. चिराय, 2nd abl. चिरात्,
gen. चिरस्य, 3rd abl. चिरे; see these words severally.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=271-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरप्रवासिन्
चिरप्रवासिन् mfn. (-सी-सिनी-सि) Dwelling a long time abroad.
 E. चिर and
प्रवासिन् who is away from home.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=271-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरमित्र
चिरमित्र n. (-त्रं) An old friend.
 E. चिर and मित्र a friend.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=271-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरमेहिन्
चिरमेहिन् m. (-ही) An ass.
 E. चिर a long time, and मिह् to sprinkle or
urine, affix णिनि.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=271-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरम्भण|चिरम्भणः
चिरम्भण m. (-णः) A kite.
 E. चि imitative cry, and रभि to commence,
affix ल्युट्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=271-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिररात्र|चिररात्रं
चिररात्र n. (-त्रं) A period of very many nights, a long time
 E. चिर long,
and रात्र a night.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=271-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिररात्राय
चिररात्राय ind. A long time
 E. चिररात्र as above, and अय् to go, affix अण्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=271-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरलब्ध
चिरलब्ध mfn. (-ब्धः-ब्धा-ब्धं) Obtained after a long time, (as a son in old
age.)
 E. चिर, and लब्ध gained.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=271-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरविल्व|चिरविल्वः
चिरविल्व m. (-ल्वः) The name of a plant: see करञ्ज.
 E. चिर a long time, विल
to divide, and व affix; also चिरिविल्व. चिरं विलति विलभेदने वा । करञ्जवृक्षे ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=271-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरसूता
चिरसूता f. (-ता) A cow that has borne many calves.
 E. चिर for a long
time, and सूता prolific; also चिरसूतिका.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=271-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरसेवक|चिरसेवकः
चिरसेवक m. (-कः) An old servant.
 E. चिर, and सेवक who serves.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=271-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरस्थ
चिरस्थ mfn. (-स्थः-स्था-स्थं) Long continuing, enduring, lasting.
 E. चिर,
and स्थ what is; also चिरस्थायिन्. चिरं तिष्ठति स्था-क ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=271-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
