<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरि|चिरिः
चिरि r. 5th cl. (चिरिणोति) To hurt, to injure, to wound or kill. स्वा-प
सक-सेट् ।
