<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरे
चिरे ind. A long time: see चिरम्. चिरयति इ-विच् । दीर्घकाले ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=271-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरेण
चिरेण ind. A long time: see चिरम्. चिर-अव्य-श वा एनप् ।
