<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिल्लाभ|चिल्लाभः
चिल्लाभ m. (-भः) A petty thief, a shoplifter, a pick-pocket, &c.
 E. चिल्ल
kite, and आभ resembling, from भा to shine, with आङ् prefix and
ड affix, pouncing on his prize like a kite on its prey.
