चिह्नधारिणी f. (-णी) A plant, (Echites frutescens.)
 E. चिह्न a mark, and
धारिणी possessing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=271-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिह्नित|चिह्नितः
चिह्नित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Marked, spotted, stained, stamped.
	 2. Desig-
nated.
	 3. Known.
 E. चिह्न् to mark, and कर्मणि क्त aff.
