<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीक
चीक r. 1st and 10th cls. (चीकति चीकयति-ते)
	 1. To be patient, to suffer
or endure.
	 2. To be impatient.
	 3. To touch.
 E. मर्षणे वा चु-उ पक्षे
भ्वा-प-सक-सेट् ।
