चीर|चीरं
चीर n. (-रं)
	 1. Cloth, clothes.
	 2. A rag, old and torn cloth.
	 3. Bark,
rind.
	 4. A crest.
	 5. A kind of garland.
	 6. Lead.
	 7. A line, a stroke.
8. Writing.
	 9. The dress of a Bouddha priest.
	 f. (-री)
	 1. A cricket.
2. The ends or hem of a garment.
 E. चि to collect, Uṇādi affix क्रन्
दीर्घश्च deriv. irr.
