<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीरि|चीरिः
चीरि f. (-रिः) An eye cloth, a veil covering the eyes.
 E. चिर to hurt, and
क्रि affix; the radical vowel lengthened. चि-वा क्रि दीर्घश्च ।
