<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुत|चुतः
चुत (इर) चुतिर r. 1st cl. (चोतति) To wet, to be wet or moist. भ्वा-प-अक-सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=272-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुत|चुतः
चुत m. (-तः) The anus.
 E. चुत् to be moist, affix क; also च्युत and चुति.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=272-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुति|चुतिः
चुति f. (-तिः) The anus.
 E. चुत् to be wet. क्तिन् affix; also च्युति.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=272-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
