<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुन्दी|चुंदी
चुन्दी f. (-न्दी) A procuress, a bawd.
 E. चुद् to inquire, affixes की and
ङीष्, and नुम् inserted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=272-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुप
चुप r. 1st cl. (चोपति) To move slowly, to creep or steal along. भ्वा-प-सक-सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=272-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुब
चुब (इ) चुबि r. 1st cl. (चुम्बति) or implying reciprocity, To kiss
r. 10th cl. (चुम्बयति-ते) To kill or hurt. भ्वा-प-सक-सेट् । पक्षे चुरादि उभ ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=272-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुब्र|चुब्रं
चुब्र n. (-ब्रं) The face.
 E. चुब् to kiss, इन् Uṇādi aff.
