<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुम्बक|चुंबक|चुंबकः|चुम्बकः
चुम्बक m. (-कः)
	 1. A kisser, a lecher.
	 2. A rogue, a cheat.
	 3. The load-
stone.
	 4. A general scholar, one who knows parts in a variety of
books.
	 5. The upper part or middle of a balance.
 E. चुबि to kiss,
affix ण्वुल्.
