चूडाल|चूडालं
चूडाल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Crested, having a lock of hair on the crown of
the head, &c.
	 f. (-ला) A kind of grass, (Kyllinga monocephala.)
n. (-लं) The head.
 E. चूडा a crest, and ल what has, from ला with ड
affix, or लच् poss. aff.
