चूडालक्षण
चूडालक्षण n. (-णं) Tonsure.
 E. चूडा, and लक्षण mark.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=273-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूडावत्|चूडावन्त्
चूडावत् mfn. (-वान्-वती-वत्) Crested, having a lock of hair, &c. on the
top of the head.
 E. चूडा a crest, and मतुप् aff.
