चूर्ण|चूर्णं|चूर्णः|चूर्ण्ण
चूर्ण r. 1st cl. (चूर्णयति-ते)
	 1. To contract, to shrink, to close as an eye,
to wink.
	 2. Throw, to send or direct.
	 3. To grind or pound. E.
चुरा-उभ-सक-सेट् ।
