चूर्ण|चूर्णं|चूर्णः|चूर्ण्ण
चूर्ण mn. (-र्णः-र्णं)
	 1. Powder, any pulverulent or minute division of
substance.
	 2. Chalk, lime.
	 3. Aromatic powder, pounded Sandal,
&c.
	 4. Pounded camphor.
	 f. (-र्णी)
	 1. A Cowri, the shell used as a
coin.
	 2. Selection of an unanswerable argument.
	 3. A river in
Bengal.
	 4. The red powder scattered at the Holi festival.
	 5. Dust:
see चूर्णि
 E. चूर्ण् to pound, &c. affix. कर्मणि अच् । भावे अच् पेषणे ।
