चूर्णक|चूर्णकं|चूर्णकः
चूर्णक m. (-कः) Grain fried and pounded.
	 n. (-कं) Expounding in prose
the purport of a foregoing verse, an order or interpretation in
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=273-b" target="_blank">Page273-b+ 60</a>]
prose not abounding in compound words.
 E. कन् added to the
preceding.
