चूर्णि|चूर्णिः
चूर्णि m. (-र्णिः) A sum of 100 Cowries, the small shells used as coin.
	 2.
A selection or picking out of an unanswerable argument.
	 2. The
grammar of PATANJALA, a comment on PĀṆINI'S grammar.
 E. चर्
to go, to pass, (current,) नि Uṇādi affix, and उ substituted for the
radical vowel, or चूर्ण् to direct, &c. affix इन् । अशेषविदुषां तर्कं
चूर्णयति । पतञ्जलिकृते महाभाष्ये ।
