चेटक|चेटकः
चेटक m. (-कः)
	 1. A slave. A gallant: see the last.
	 3. A servant, a
minister, one who fulfils an appointed duty.
 E. चिट् to serve, ण्वुल्
affix, or चेट with कन् added.
