चेतन|चेतनः
चेतन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Alive, living, feeling.
	 m. (-नः)
	 1. Soul, self.
	 2. A
man.
	 3. A living and sentient being.
	 f. (-ना) Understanding, in-
telligence, wisdom, reflection.
 E. चित् to reflect, affix ल्युट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=274-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेतनावत्|चेतनावन्त्
चेतनावत् mfn. (-वान्-वती-वत्) Living, sentient.
 E. चेतना, and मतुप् aff.
