<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेष्टा
चेष्टा f. (-ष्टा) Effort, exertion, bodily effort.
 E. चेष्ट् to act, अङ् and टाप्
affs.
