 E. चैत्य as above, and द्रुम a tree.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=274-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चैत्यमुख|चैत्यमुखः
चैत्यमुख m. (-खः) A student's water pot.
 E. चैत्य place of sacrifice, and
मुख principal. कमण्डलौ ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=274-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चैत्यवृक्ष|चैत्यवृक्षः
चैत्यवृक्ष m. (-क्षः)
	 1. The religious fig tree.
	 2. A large tree in a village.
E. चैत्य and वृक्ष a tree: see चैत्य.
