चैत्र|चैत्रं|चैत्रः
चैत्र m. (-त्रः)
	 1. The month Chaitra or Cheyte, (March-April.)
	 2. One
of the ranges of mountains dividing the continent into portions
or Varṣas: see वर्ष.
	 3. A Bauddha or Jaina religious mendicant.
4. The son BUDHA by CHITRA.
	 n. (-त्रं)
	 1. A monument erected to
the dead, a column or block of wood, a tree, &c. so considered.
	 2.
2. A small temple.
 E. चित्रा the star, or चित्र wonderful, &c. affix
अण्, or चि-ष्ट्रन् ।
