चोदित
चोदित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Informed, apprised.
	 2. Ordered, directed.
	 3.
Appointed.
	 4. Urged, impelled.
	 5. Thrown, cast.
 E. चुद् to direct,
क्त aff.
