<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोलक|चोलकं|चोलकः
चोलक m. (-कः) A breastplate, a cuirass.
	 n. (-कं) Bark, rind.
 E. चुल to
elevate, affix वुन्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=275-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोलकिन्
चोलकिन् m. (-की)
	 1. The shoot of the bambu.
	 2. The wrist.
	 3. The
orange.
	 4. A cuirassier, a soldier armed with a breastplate. E.
चोलक armour, rind, &c. and इनि aff.
