<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोष|चोषः
चोष m. (-षः)
	 1. Suction, sucking.
	 2. Burning, (of the skin,) inflam-
mation.
	 3. Drying up.
 E. चूष् to suck, घञ् aff.
