<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चौक्ष|चौक्षं
चौक्ष mfn. (-क्षः-क्षी-क्षं) Agreeable, pleasant.
 E. चोक्ष the same, अण् aff.
