<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चौर|चौरः
चौर mf. (-रः-री)
	 1. A thief, a robber, a pilferer.
	 2. A plant: see चोरपुष्पी
3. A perfume.
	 f. (-री) Stealing, theft.
 E. चोर a thief, affix अण्.
