<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

च्युत|च्युतं
च्युत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Fallen, dropped, oozed out, &c.
	 2. Fallen, from
or off.
	 3. Deviated from, erred, strayed.
	 4. Broken, disordered.
	 5.
Lost.
 E. च्यु to go, affix क्त.
