<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

च्युताधिकार
च्युताधिकार mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Dismissed, (from an office, &c.) deprived of,
(as a right.)
 E. च्युत lost, and अधिकार function.
