<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

च्युतोत्साह
च्युतोत्साह mfn. (-हः-हा-हं) Spent, exhausted, incapable of effort.
 E. च्युत
and उत्माह exertion.
