<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

च्युस
च्युस r. 10th cl. (च्वोसयति-ते)
	 1. To laugh.
	 2. To bear.
	 3. To loose.
	 4. To
hurt or kill. चु-उभ-अक-सेट् ।
