(C. aegenteus,) or more probably (C. pes-capræ;) see ऋक्षगन्धा.
	 n.
(-लं) Blue cloth or garment.
 E. छो to cut or tear, Uṇādi affixes
कलच् and गुक्, or ग substituted for क, ह्रस्वश्च ।
