<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छत्र|छत्त्रं|छत्त्रः|छत्रं|छत्रः
छत्र n. (-त्रं) A parasol, and umbrella, the Indian chattah.
	 f. (-त्रा)
	 1.
A kind of fennel, (Anethum sowa.)
	 2. A pungent seed, coriander.
3. A mushroom.
	 4. Anise.
 E. छद् to cover, and णिच् and ष्ट्रन्
Uṇādi affixes ह्रस्वश्च; hence the word and its derivatives are also
written with a double त, छत्र &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=275-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छत्रक|छत्त्रकः|छत्रकः
छत्रक m. (-कः) A king-fisher 2. A mushroom.
	 3. A shrub, commonly
Kuliya-khara.
	 4. A small vaulted temple, in honour of a deity.
5. A beehive of a conical or umbrella form.
 E. कन् added to the
preceding.
 E. छत्रम् इव कायति कै-क ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=275-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छत्रचक्र|छत्त्रचक्रं
छत्रचक्र n. (-क्रं) An astrological diagram.
 E. छत्र, and चक्र a circle.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=275-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छत्रधार|छत्त्रधारः|छत्रधारः
छत्रधार mfn. (-रः-री-रं) Bearing a parasol, having or possessing one. E.
छत्र and धर who has or holds, affix अच् or अण्; also छत्रधर, छत्र-
धारक, and छत्रधारिन् । छत्रं धरति धारयति वा अच् अण् वा ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=275-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छत्रधारण
छत्रधारण n. (-णं)
	 1. Carrying a chatra.
	 2. The carrying of one as a
type of authority.
 E. छत्र, and धारण having.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=275-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छत्रपत्र|छत्त्रपत्त्रं|छत्त्रपत्त्रः|छत्त्रपत्र
छत्रपत्र n. (-त्रं) A plant, (Hibiscus mutabilis.)
 E. छत्र, and पत्र a leaf, um-
brella-leaved; also छत्रपत्रक । छत्रम् इव पत्रम् अस्य । स्थलपाद्मे, भूर्जपत्रवृक्षे
च ।
