छत्वर|छत्वरः
छत्वर m. (-रः)
	 1. A house, a dwelling.
	 2. A bower, an arbour.
 E. छद् to
cover, ष्वरच् Uṇādi affix, and त substituted for द.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=276-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
