छन्दपातन|छन्दपातनः
छन्दपातन m. (-नः) A hypocrite, a pretended and false ascetic.
 E. छन्द
subjection, (of all human beings,) and पातन obtaining, from पत् to
go, affix ल्युट्; also छन्दकपातन.
