छलिन् m. (-ली) A cheat.
 E. छल, and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=276-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छल्लि|छल्लिः
छल्लि f. (-ल्लिः) Skin, bark, rind, &c.
 E. छद a cover, ला to give or get;
with affix कि, द becomes ल; also with ङीप् added छल्ली.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=276-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छल्ली
छल्ली f. (-ल्ली)
	 1. Skin, bark, rind, &c.
	 2. Offspring, posterity.
	 3. A
spreading creeper.
	 4. A kind of flower. E. See the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=276-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छवि|छविः
छवि f. (-विः)
	 1. Beauty, splendor, brilliance.
	 2. Light, lustre.
 E. छो to
divide, (darkness, &c.) इन् affix, and the deriv. irr. or कित् च वा
Uṇādi affix; also with ङीष् added छवी.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=276-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छा
छा f. (छा) A young animal.
 E. छो to cut, डा aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=276-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छाग|छागः
छाग f. (-गः) A goat.
	 f. (-गी) A she goat.
 E. छो to cut, Uṇādi affix गन्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=276-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छागण|छागणः
छागण m. (-णः) A fire of dried cowdung.
 E. कर्मणि अच् affix of relation
added to छगण् । छया छादनेन गण्यते गण कर्मणि अच् । छगण-स्वार्थे अण्
वा करीषाग्नौ ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=276-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छागभोजिन्
छागभोजिन् m. (-जी) A wolf.
 E. छाग, and भोजिन् who eats.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=276-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छागरथ|छागरथः
छागरथ m. (-थः) AGNI or the deity of fire.
 E. छाग a goat, and रथ a car
or any vehicle.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=276-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छागल|छागलः
छागल m. (-लः)
	 1. A goat: see छगल; also with कन् added छागलक.
	 2. A
proper name, the son of CHHAGALA or ATRI.
 E. छगल, and अण्
affix; also with इञ् aff. छागलि or कन् added छागलक.
