<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छागलान्त्री
छागलान्त्री f. (-न्त्री) A plant, (Convolvulus pes-capræ:) see छगलान्त्री.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=276-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छागवाहन|छागवाहनः
छागवाहन m. (-नः) A name of AGNI or the deity of fire.
 E. छाग a goat,
and वाहन a vehicle, the goat-born.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=276-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छागिका
छागिका f. (-का) A she goat.
 E. कन् added to छागी.
