<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छात|छातः
छात mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Cut, divided.
	 2. Thin, feeble, emaciated.
 E. छो
to cut, affix क्त; also छित.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=276-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छात्र|छात्त्रः|छात्रं|छात्रः
छात्र m. (-त्रः) A scholar, a pupil, a disciple, a tyro or novice.
	 n. (-त्रं)
Honey.
 E. छत्र an umbrella, a screen or cover, affix ण । छत्रं गुरोः
वैगुण्यावरणं शीलमस्य छत्रा० ण ।
