<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छायासुत|छायासुतः
छायासुत m. (-तः) SATURN: see छायातनय.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=277-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छि|छिः
छि m. (छिः) Abuse, reproach.
 E. छो to cut, कि aff. गर्हायाम् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=277-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छिक्कन
छिक्कन n. (-नं) Sneezing.
	 f. (-नी) A small plant, (Artemisia sternutato-
ria.)
 E. छिक्क nominal verb, to sneeze, ल्युट् aff. or छिक् इति अव्यक्तं
नासिकाशब्दं कनति शब्दायते कन-अच् गौरा-ङीष् ।
