<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छिक्का
छिक्का f. (-क्का) Sneezing.
 E. छिक् imitative sound, and क what utters,
from कै with ड and टाप् affs. छिक् इति अव्यक्तं शब्दं करोति कृ-ड । क्षुते ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=277-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छिक्कक
छिक्कक mfn. (-कः-का-कं)
	 1. Sternutatory.
	 2. Sneezing.
	 f. (-का) A plant,
(Artemisia sternutatoria.)
 E. छिक्क nominal verb, to sneeze, वुन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=277-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छित|छितं
छित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Cut, divided.
 E. छो to cut, affix क्त deriv. irr.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=277-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छित्ति|छित्तिः
छित्ति f. (-त्तिः)
	 1. Cutting, division.
	 2. A plant, (Galedupa arborea:)
see करज.
 E. छिद् to cut, affix कर्त्तरि क्तिच्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=277-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छित्वर|छित्वरः
छित्वर mfn. (-रः-री-रं)
	 1. Roguish, fraudulent, knavish, a knave.
	 2. Hos-
tile, inimical, a foe.
	 3. Cutting or fit for cutting, (a weapon, &c.)
E. छिद् to cut, ष्वरप् Uṇādi affix, and त optionally substituted for the
radical final, otherwise छिद्वर.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=277-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छित्वा
छित्वा ind. Having cut or divided.
 E. छिद् to cut, क्त्वा aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=277-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छिद
छिद (औ, इर) औ छिदिर r. 7th cl. (छिनत्ति, छिन्ते) To divide to split, to cut,
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=277-b" target="_blank">Page277-b+ 60</a>]
&c. With the prefix आङ्, To seize, to lay hold of. With the prefix
उत्, To slay or kill. रुधा-उभ-सक-अनिट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=277-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छिद्
छिद् mfn. (-द् or -त्) Cutting, destroying, who or what cuts.
 E. छिद् to
cut, affix क्विप्. छेदनकर्त्तरि ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=277-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छिदक|छिदकं
छिदक n. (-कं) INDRA'S thunderbolt.
 E. छिद् to cut or split, affix क्वुन्; also
छिदिक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=277-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छिदा
छिदा f. (-दा) Cutting, dividing.
 E. छिद as above, affixes भावे अङ् and टाप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=277-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छिदि|छिदिः
छिदि f. (-दिः) An axe.
 E. छिद् to cut, इन् Uṇādi affix and the radical
vowel unchanged.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=277-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छिदिर|छिदिरः
छिदिर m. (-रः)
	 1. Fire.
	 2. A rope, a cord.
	 3. A sword.
	 4. An axe, a
hatchet.
 E. छिद् to cut, किरच् Uṇādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=277-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छिदुर|छिदुरः
छिदुर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं)
	 1. Cutting, dividing, what cuts or divides.
	 2. A
knave.
	 3. Hostile, a foe.
 E. छिद् to cut, and कुरच् aff.
