<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छिद्र|छिद्रं
छिद्र r. 10th cl. (छिद्रयति-ते)
	 1. To pierce, to bore, to perforate, to
make openings or holes.
	 2. To perforate the ear for rings &c. चु-
उभ-सक-सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=277-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छिद्र|छिद्रं
छिद्र n. (-द्रं)
	 1. A hole, a vacuity, a perforation, &c.
	 2. Fault, defect,
flaw (moral or physical.)
	 3. A weak side.
	 4. Infirmity.
 E. छिद् to
pierce, Uṇādi affix रक्, or छिद्र अच्-वा ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=277-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छिद्रकर्ण
छिद्रकर्ण mfn. (-र्णः-र्णी-र्णं) Having the ears pierced.
 E. छिद्र, and कर्ण the
ear, छिद्रयुक्तः कर्णः अस्य ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=277-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छिद्रानुसारिन्
छिद्रानुसारिन् mfn. (-री-रिणी-रि) Looking out for faults or flaws.
 E. छिद्र,
and अनुसारिन् who pursues.
