<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छिन्नकर्ण
छिन्नकर्ण mfn. (-र्णः-र्णी-र्णं) Having the ears cut off.
 E. छिन्न, and कर्ण the
ear. छिन्नः कर्णोऽस्य ।
