<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छिन्नधन्वन्
छिन्नधन्वन् m. (-न्वा) A warrior whose bow has been cut or broken by his
enemy's arrow.
 E. छिन्न, and धन्वन् a bow.
