<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छिन्ननासिक
छिन्ननासिक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Noseless, having had the nose cut off. E.
छिन्न, and नासिका the nose.
