<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छिन्ननास्य
छिन्ननास्य mfn. (-स्यः-स्या-स्यं) Having the rope that passes through the
nose of a draft ox broken.
 E. छिन्न, and नास्य the nose-rein.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=277-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छिन्नबन्धन
छिन्नबन्धन mfn. (-नः-नी-नं) Loosed, liberated.
 E. छिन्न, and बन्धन binding.
