<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छिन्नभिन्न
छिन्नभिन्न mfn. (-न्नः-न्ना-न्नं) Cut up, destroyed, scattered.
 E. छिन्न, and भिन्न
broken.
