<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छिन्नमस्त
छिन्नमस्त mfn. (-स्तः-स्ता-स्तं) Decapitated.
	 f. (-स्ता) A form of DURGĀ with-
out her head.
 E. छिन्न, and मस्त the head; also with कन् added छिन्न
मस्तक, छिन्नमस्तका.
