छिन्नरुहा
छिन्नरुहा f. (-हा) A tree, (Menispermum glabrum:) see गुडूची.
 E. छन्न cut,
and रुहा what grows; growing again after being cut. छिन्नः सन्
रोहति रुह-क.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=277-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छिन्नवत्
छिन्नवत् mfn. (-वान्-वती-वत्) Having cut or cut off.
 E. छिन्न, and मतुप् aff.
