<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छुड
छुड r. 1st and 6th cls. (-छोडति, छुडति) to cover.
 E. तुदा० पर० सक० सेट् ।
भ्वा० पर० ।
