छुप|छुपः
छुप (औ) औछुप r. 6th cl. (छुपति) To touch. तुदा-पर-सक-अनिट्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=278-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छुप|छुपः
छुप m. (-पः)
	 1. A small tree, a shrub, a bush.
	 2. Touch, touching.
	 3.
Air, wind.
	 4. War, combat.
 E. छुप् to touch, affix कर्त्तरि क, घञर्घेक
वा । आधारे-क, युद्धे ।
