<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छुरिका
छुरिका f. (-का) A knife.
 E. छुर् to cut, क्वुन् affix, and the fem form; also
with क and ङीष् affixes, छुरी.
