<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छुरितोदर
छुरितोदर mfn. (-रः-री-रं)
	 1. Pierced, transpierced.
	 2. Run through the
belly.
 E. छुरित, and उदर the belly.
