<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज|जः
ज mfn. (जः-जा-जं)
	 1. Speedy, swift.
	 2. Eaten.
	 3. Victorious, triumph-
ant, conquering or a conqueror. (जः)
	 1. A name of Siva.
	 2. A
name of VIṢṆU.
	 3. Birth, production.
	 4. A parent, a progenitor.
5. Poison.
	 6. Enjoyment.
	 7. Light, Iustre.
	 8. Speed.
	 9. An imp-
a goblin.
 E. जन् to bear or to born, जि to conquer, or other roots,
and ड aff.
