<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जकुट|जकुटं|जकुटः
जकुट m. (-टः)
	 1. The Malaya mountain.
	 2. A dog.
	 n. (-टं) The egg-
plant. (Solanum melongena.) जं जातं कटति कुट-क ।
