जगत्
जगत् mfn. (-गन्-गती-गत्) Moveable, loco-motive, transitory, nf. (-त्-ती)
The world, the universe.
	 m. (-त्) Air, wind.
	 f. (-ती)
	 1. The earth.
	 2.
people, mankind.
	 3. A sort of metre, a stanza of forty-eight syl-
lables variously disposed so as to form thirty varieties.
	 4. A field
of Jambu flowers.
 E. गम् to go, Uṇādi affix अति, जग substituted for
the root, and ङीप् fem. affix, or गम् as before, and शतृ aff.
