<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जग्धि|जग्धिः
जग्धि f. (-ग्धिः)
	 1. Eating.
	 2. Eating together or in company.
	 3. Food,
victuals.
 E. अद् to eat, क्तिन् affix, and जग्धि substituted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=279-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जग्मि|जग्मिः
जग्मि f. (-ग्मिः) Air, wind.
 E. गम् to go, किन् द्बित्वम् affix, root reiterated,
and form irr.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=279-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जग्मिवस्
जग्मिवस् mfn. (-वान्-ग्मुषी-वत्) Who or what goes.
 E. गम् to go, वसु affix,
इट् inserted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=279-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जघन|जघनं
जघन n. (-नं)
	 1. Mons veneris.
	 2. The hip and loins.
 E. हन् to kill or hurt,
जघन substituted for the radical, and अच् Uṇādi aff. वक्र हन्ति हन-यङ्
अच् पृषो० ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=279-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जघनकूपक
जघनकूपक m. du. (-कौ) The hollows of the loins of a handsome woman.
E. जघन the loins, and कूपक a well or pit. जघनस्य कूपः इव कायति कै-क ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=279-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जघनचपला
जघनचपला f. (-ला)
	 1. A woman active as in dancing.
	 2. A species of
the Aryaya metre.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=279-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जघनेफला
जघनेफला f. (-ला) Opposite leaved fig tree, (Ficus oppositi-folia, Rox.)
E. जघन the haunch, &c. here put for the stem, and फल fruit;
growing round the stem.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=279-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जघन्य|जघन्यः
जघन्य mfn. (-न्यः-न्या-न्यं)
	 1. Last, hindmost.
	 2. Low, vile, base.
	 3. Worst,
vilest, lowest.
	 n. (-न्यं) The penis.
	 m. (-न्यः) A Śūdra or man of the
fourth tribe.
 E. जघन tke loins, &c. and यत् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=279-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जघन्यगुणवृत्तिस्थ
जघन्यगुणवृत्तिस्थ mfn. (-स्थः-स्था-स्थं) Vile, addicted to low pursuits.
 E. जघन्य
vile, गुण quality, वृत्ति practice, and स्थ standing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=279-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जघन्यज|जघन्यजः
जघन्यज m. (-जः)
	 1. A Śūdra.
	 2. A younger brother or younger born. E.
जघन्य last, and ज born. जघन्ये चरमे जायते जन-ड ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=279-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जघन्वस्
जघन्वस् mfn. (-न्वान्-नुषी-न्वत्) Who or what kills.
 E. हन् to kill वसु affix,
root repeated.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जघ्नि|जघ्निः
जघ्नि m. (-घ्निः) A sharp or offensive weapon.
 E. हन् to kill, affix किन्, द्वित्वञ्च, form irr.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जघ्नु|जघ्नुः
जघ्नु mfn. (-घ्नुः-घ्नुः-घ्नु) Striking, beating, injuring, one who does so. E.
हन् to hurt or kill, कु द्वित्वञ्च affix, and the radical reiterated.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जघ्मिवस्
जघ्मिवस् mfn. (-वान्-घ्मुषी-वत्) Killing, who or what kills.
 E. हन to kill, वसु
affix, root repeated, इट् inserted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जङ्गपूग
जङ्गपूग n. (-गं) Wickedness, sin.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जङ्गम|जंगम|जङ्गमः
जङ्गम mfn. (-मः-मा-मं) Locomotive, moveable, that which has motion as
opposed to that which is stationary.
 E. गम् to go affix यङ्-अच्
the radical reduplicated.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जङ्गमकुटी|जंगमकुटी
जङ्गमकुटी f. (-टी) A parasol, a Chattah or umbrella.
 E. जङ्गम moveable,
and कुटी a house. जङ्गमा कुटी इव । छत्रे ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जङ्गल|जंगल|जङ्गलं|जङ्गलः
जङ्गल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Desert, solitary, waste, jungle, wild, &c.
	 n. (-लं)
Flesh.
 E. जङ्ग for जङ्गम moveable, and ल what brings, or takes, i. e.
appertaining to moveable beings, as beasts birds, &c. गल-यङ्-अच्
पृषोदरादित्वात् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जङ्गाल|जंगाल|जंगालः|जङ्गालः
जङ्गाल m. (-लः) A land mark, a limit, a boundary, a ridge of earth run-
ning along the edge of a field for collecting water and forming a
passage over it.
 E. जङ्ग locomotion, and ल what makes, आङ् pre-
fixed, with the sense of limitation. गम-यङ् लुक् वा ड । जङ्गं कुटिलगतिं
अलति वारयति अल् अण् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जङ्गुल|जंगुल|जंगुलं
जङ्गुल n. (-लं) Poison, venom.
 E. जङ्गु locomotive, (an animal), and ल
what destroys, from लु to cut, affix ड । गम यङ् लुक् वा डुल । विषे ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जङ्घा|जंघा
जङ्घा f. (-ङ्घा) The leg.
 E. जन् to be born, जङ्घ substituted for the radical,
and अच् aff. जङ्घन्यते कुटिलं गच्छति गत्यर्थकस्य हन्तेः कौटिल्ये यङ्लुकि अच्
पृषो० ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जङ्घाकारिक|जंघाकारिक|जङ्घाकारिकः
जङ्घाकारिक m. (-कः) A courier, a runner, an express.
 E. जङ्घा a leg, and
कर a toll, affix ठन्; who levies a toll by his legs.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जङ्घात्राण|जंघात्राण|जङ्घात्राणं
जङ्घात्राण n. (-णं) Cuisses or greaves.
 E. जङ्घा the leg, and त्राण what pre-
serves. त्रायते अनेन त्रै करणे ल्युट् । जङ्घासन्नाहे ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जङ्घाल|जंघाल|जङ्घालः
जङ्घाल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Quick, rapid, going quickly.
	 m. (-लः)
	 1. A
courier.
	 2. A deer, an antelope.
 E. जङ्घा the leg, and अल able, stout,
or जङ्घा वेगवती अस्ति अस्य लच् । धावके ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जज|जजं|जजः
जज r. 1st cl. (जजति) also (इ) जजि (जंजति) To fight. भ्वा० पर० अक-सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जज|जजं|जजः
जज m. (-जः) A warrior.
 E. जज् to fight, and अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जजौजस्
जजौजस् n. (-जः) Prowess, valour.
 E. जज, and ओजस् power.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जञ्जपूक|जंजपूक|जञ्जपूकः
जञ्जपूक mfn. (-कः-का-कं)
	 1. Muttering repeatedly.
	 2. Muttering evil
prayers or charms.
	 m. (-कः) An ascetic, a devotee, one who does so.
E. जप् to mutter, reiterative form ऊक aff. जप-यङ् ऊक । अतिशयजपशीले
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जट
जट r. 1st cl. (जटति) To clot, to be entangled, as hair. भ्वा-प-अक सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटा
जटा f. (-टा)
	 1. The hair matted as worn by the god ŚIVA, and by
ascetics; the long hairs occasionally clotted together, and brought
over the head so as to project like a horn from the forehead, at
other times allowed to fall carelessly over the back and shoulders.
2. The root of a tree, a fibrous root.
	 3. Spikenard: see जटामांसी.
	 4.
A plant, (Asparagus racemosa.)
	 5. Cowach.
	 6. Hedysarum, vari-
ous species.
 E. जट् to entangle, अच् affix; or जन् to be produced,
टन् Uṇādi affix, and the radical final rejected.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटाजूट|जटाजूटः
जटाजूट m. (-टः)
	 1. A quantity of clotted hair.
	 2. ŚIVA'S hair.
 E. जटा,
and जूट the same. जटानां जूटः बन्धः ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटाज्वाल|जटाज्वालः
जटाज्वाल m. (-लः) A lamp.
 E. जटा entangled hair, and ज्वाला flame.
जटा इव ज्वाला अस्य । प्रदीपे ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटाटङ्क|जटाटंक|जटाटङ्कः
जटाटङ्क m. (-ङ्कः) ŚIVA.
 E. जटा as above, टकि to bind, affix अच्, जटा टङ्कः
इव अस्य । महादेवे ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटाटीर|जटाटीरः
जटाटीर m. (-रः) ŚIVA.
 E. जटा as above, अट् to go, and ईरन् affix; some
copies read जटाचीर । जटाम् अटति ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटाधर|जटाधरः
जटाधर m. (-रः)
	 1. A name of ŚIVA.
	 2. A Jina or Jaina deified saint.
3. Any mendicant wearing the braid of hair.
 E. जटा entangled
hair, and धर possessor; also with धारिन्, जटाधारिन् (-री)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटामांसी
जटामांसी f. (-सी) Indian spikenard, (Valeriana jatamansi.)
 E. जटा entan-
gled hair or root, and मांसी the same plant. जटां मन्यते ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=280-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटायु|जटायुः
जटायु m. (-युः)
	 1. A fabulous bird, the son of ARUṆA, killed by
RAVANA.
	 2. Bdellium.
 E. जटा accumulation, आयु or आयुस् life;
long-lived; hence also जटायुस् m. (-युः) जटां याति या-कु-जटा-ऊर्णा
युच् वा, जट संहतौ अच्, जटं संहतम् आयुः अस्य वा ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=280-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटाल|जटालः
जटाल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Wearing clotted hair.
	 m. (-लः) The Indian fig
tree.
	 2. Zedoary.
	 3. Bdellium.
	 f. (-ला) Spikenard: see जटामांसी. E.
जाट as above, and लच् affix of possession.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=280-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटावत्|जटावन्त्
जटावत् mfn. (-वान्-वती-वत्) Having clotted hair.
	 f. (-ती) Spikenard,
(Valeriana jatamansi.)
 E. जटा, and मतुप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=280-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटि|जटिः
जटि f. (-टिः)
	 1. Waved-leaf fig tree, (F. venosa:) see जटिन्.
	 2. Assem-
blage, multitude.
	 3. Clotted hair: see जटा.
 E. जट् to collect,
affix इन्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=280-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटिन्
जटिन् mfn. (-टी-टिनी-टि) Having clotted hair, m. (-टी) Waved-leaf fig
tree: see जटि.
 E. जटा as above, and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=280-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटिल|जटिलः
जटिल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Having any clotted or entangled hair.
	 m. (-लः) A
lion.
	 f. (-ला)
	 1. Indian spikenard.
	 2. Long pepper.
	 3. Orris.
 E. जटा,
and अस्त्यर्थे इलच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=280-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटी
जटी f. (-टी) Waved-leaf fig tree: see जटि.
 E. जट् to entangle, इ Uṇādi
affix, and ङीष् added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=280-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटुल|जटुलः
जटुल m. (-लः) A freckle, a mark.
 E. जट् to accumulate, उलच् affix;
also जडुल.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=280-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जठर|जठरं|जठरः
जठर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं)
	 1. Hard, firm.
	 2. Bound, tied.
	 mn. (-रः-रं) The bel-
ly.
 E. जम् to eat, अर् Uṇādi affix, and ठच् substituted for the radi-
cal final.
