<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जनङ्गम|जनंगम|जनंगमः
जनङ्गम m. (-मः) A Chandala, a man of low or degraded tribe.
 E. जन
a mean man, and गम् to go, खच् युम् च aff. जनेभ्यो गच्छति वहिः ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=280-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
