<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जनन|जननं|जननः
जनन n. (-नं)
	 1. Birth, production.
	 2. Family, race, lineage.
	 f. (-नी)
	 1.
A mother.
	 2. Tenderness, compassion.
	 3. A plant, commonly Chak-
wat; also जननि and जनी.
	 4. A bat.
	 5. Arabian jasmine.
	 6. Vale-
rian.
	 mf. (-नः-नी) A parent, a progenitor.
 E. जन् to bear or be born,
affix भावे ल्युट्, and ङीष्.
