जनप्रिय|जनप्रियः
जनप्रिय mfn. (-यः-या-यं)
	 1. Agreeable to mankind.
	 2. Philanthropic.
	 m.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=280-b" target="_blank">Page280-b+ 60</a>]
(-यः)
	 1. Coriander seed.
	 2. A tree, (Morunga hyperanthera.)
 E. जन,
and प्रिय fond of. शोभाञ्जनबृक्षे, धन्याके, लोक प्रियमात्रे च ।
