<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जरायु|जरायुः
जरायु m. (-युः) The womb, the uterus.
 E. जरा infirmity, इण् to obtain,
Uṇādi affix ञुण्, also with a final स, जरायुस् m. (-युः.)
