जरायुज|जरायुजः
जरायुज mfn. (-जः-जा-जं) Viviparous, born from the womb, as man and
other animals.
 E. जरायु the womb, ज born. जरायौ जायते जन-ड ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=283-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जरासन्ध|जरासंध|जरासन्धः
जरासन्ध m. (-न्धः) A proper name, a celebrated king and warrior, sover-
eign of Magadha, father-in-law to KANSA, and foe to KṚṢṆA;
he was slain in single combat by BHIMA.
 E. जरा a female demon,
and सन्ध connection, union; he was born in two halves, which
were put together by the Rakshasi JARA.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=283-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जरासन्धजित्|जरासंधजित्
जरासन्धजित् m. (-जित्) BHIMASENA, the third of the Pandu princes. E.
जरासन्ध and जित् conqueror: see the last.
