जल|जलं|जलः
जल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Cold stupid, apathetic, idiotic, &c.
	 n. (-लं)
	 1.
Water.
	 2. A kind of perfume: see ह्रीवेर.
	 3. The uterus of a cow.
	 4.
Frigidity, (moral, mental, or physical.)
	 5. The constellation called
Purvashada.
 E. जल् to hide, to encompass, &c. affix अच्; also ल
being changed to its congener ड, जड q. v.
