<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जलक्रीडा
जलक्रीडा f. (-डा) Sporting or gamboling in water, bathing for pleasure
or amusement. Splashing one another with water.
 E. जल, and
क्रीडा pastime, play.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=283-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जलगुल्म|जलगुल्मः
जलगुल्म m. (-ल्मः)
	 1. A whirlpool.
	 2. A turtle, a tortoise.
	 2. A piece of
water.
	 3. A quadrangular tank, a lake.
 E. जल water, and गुल्म a
lump like the spleen, or a cluster. जलस्य गल्मः इव । जलावर्त्ते (घुर्णो)
कमठे जलचत्वरे च ।
