<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जलङ्ग|जलंग|जलङ्गः
जलङ्ग mfn. (-ङ्गः-ङ्गा-ङ्गं) Aquatic, frequenting or going to water.
	 m. (-ङ्गः)
The colocynth.
 E. जल and ग what goes. जलं गच्छति गम-ड नि-मुम् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=283-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
