जलङ्गम|जलंगम|जलङ्गमः
जलङ्गम m. (-मः) A Chandala, an outcaste.
 E. जल water, and गम who
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=284-a" target="_blank">Page284-a+ 60</a>]
goes; who goes to fish for his subsistence; also जनङ्गम q. v.
 E. जलं
गमयति स्पर्शात् गामि वा-ख । चण्डाले ।
