<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जलचर|जलचरः
जलचर mfn. (-रः-री-रं) Aquatic, amphibious, going in or into water. E.
जल and, and चर what goes. जले चरति चर-ठक् ।
