	 2. Any
aquatic animal.
	 n. (-जं)
	 1. A lotus.
	 2. A shell.
	 f. (-जा) A plant;
said to be a sort of bassia growing in or near water.
 E. जल, and ज
produced. जले जायते जल-ड ।
