जलरङ्क m. (-ङ्कः) A kind of crane, (Ardea nivea.)
 E. जल, and रङ्क
miserly, greedy of water; feeding on small fish chiefly, and
therefore haunting swamps, &c. जले रङ्कः इव । वकपक्षिणि ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=285-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
