<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जल्प|जल्पः
जल्प r. 1st cl. (जल्पते)
	 1. To speak articulately, to say or tell.
	 2. To
prattle, to talk much or idly. (भ्वा-पर-सक-सेट् ।)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=286-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जल्प|जल्पः
जल्प m. (-ल्पः)
	 1. Dissention, wrangling.
	 2. Prate, babble.
	 3. (In Logic.)
Refutation of an advesary's arguments, and assertion of one's own.
E. जल्प to speak, affix भाव घञ् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=286-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जल्पक
जल्पक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) A chatterer, one who talks much or idly. E.
जल्प to prate, ण्वुल् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=286-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जल्पन|जल्पनं
जल्पन n. (-नं)
	 1. Talking, saying.
	 2. Chattering, prattling.
 E. जल्प, and
भावे ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=286-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जल्पाक|जल्पाकः
जल्पाक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) A chatterer, talking much and foolishly, or
improperly.
 E. जल्प to talk idly, षाक affix; also जल्पक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=286-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जल्पित|जल्पितं
जल्पित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Said, told, spoken.
	 n. (-तं) Talking, babbling,
gossiping.
 E. जल्प to talk, affix कर्मणि क्त । कथिते । भावे कथने ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=286-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जव|जवः
जव (इ) जवि r. 10th cl. (जंवयति) To shine.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=286-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जव|जवः
जव mfn. (-वः-वा-वं) Swift, quick, expeditious.
	 m. (-वः)
	 1. Speed, velo-
city.
	 2. A runner, an express.
	 f. (-वा) The China rose, (Hibiscus
rosa sinensis;) also जपा.
 E. जु to move quickly, भावे अप् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=286-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जवन|जवनं|जवनः
जवन mfn. (-नः-ना-नी-नं) Quick, fleet.
	 m. (-नः)
	 1. A courser, a fleet
horse.
	 2. A country, Ionia Greece: see यवन.
	 3. A native of that
country.
	 4. A sort of deer.
	 n. (-नं) Speed, velocity.
	 f. (-नी)
	 1. A
screen surrounding a tent, a Kanat.
	 2. A drug.
 E. जु to be quick
affix ल्युट् or युच्, and fem. ङीष् or टाप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=286-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जवनाल|जवनालं
जवनाल n. (-लं) A sort of grain, (Andropogon bicolor:) see यवनाल.
जवनाय अलति पर्य्याप्नोति अल-अच् । (जनार.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=286-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जवनिका
जवनिका f. (-का)
	 1. A wall or screen of cloth surrounding a tent, an
outer tent, &c.
	 2. A curtain, a screen in general.
 E. कन् added to
जवनि सौ-जु करणे ल्युट् संज्ञायां कन् । (कानात्, चिक्) प्रभृतिव्यवधायकवस्त्रादौ ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=286-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जवस|जवसं|जवसः
जवस m. (-सः) Meadow or pasture grass. जु to grow quick, असच् affix:
see यवस.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=286-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जवादि
जवादि m. (-दिः) A perfume. मृगघर्मजाते कृत्रिमे गन्धद्रव्ये ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=286-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जवाधिक|जवाधिकः
जवाधिक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Very quick.
	 m. (-कः) A fleet horse, a courser.
E. जव speed, and अधिक exceeding. जवेन अधिकः ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=286-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जवानिल|जवानिलः
जवानिल m. (-लः) A gale, a hurricane.
 E. जव fleet, अनिल wind.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=286-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जवापुष्प|जवापुष्पं
जवापुष्प m. (-ष्पः) The China rose, the plant or its flower.
 E. जवा as
above, and पुष्प a flower.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=286-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जविन्
जविन् mfn. (-वी-विनी-वि) Quick or fleet expeditious.
	 m. (-वी)
	 1. A camel.
2. A horse.
 E. जव speed, अस्त्र्यर्थे इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=286-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जष
जष r. 1st cl. (जषति-ते) To kill, to wound, to hurt or injure. भ्वा-उभ-सक-
सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=286-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जस
जस (इर उ) इर् जसु r. 4th cl. (जस्यति) To liberate, to set free, to let loose.
r. 1st and 10th cls. (जसति, जासयति-ते)
	 1. To kill or injure.
	 2. To
slight or disregard, to treat irreverently.
	 3. To strike, to punish
with blows. (इ) जसि r. 1st and 10th cls. (जंसति जंसयति-ते) To pre-
serve, to protect. मोक्षणे दिवा-पर-सक-सेट् । गतौ भ्वा-पर-सक-सेट् ।
बधे अनादरे च चुरा-उभ-सक-सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=286-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जसुरि|जसुरिः
जसुरि m. (-रिः) INDRA'S thunderbolt.
 E. जस् to kill or hurt, Uṇādi
affix उरिन्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=286-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जहक|जहकः
जहक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Abandoning, who leaves or abandons.
	 m. (-कः)
1. Time.
	 2. A child.
	 3. The slough of a snake.
 E. हा to quit, or
abandon, क्वुन् Uṇādi aff. द्वित्वञ्च ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=286-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जहत्
जहत् mfn. (-हन्-हन्ती-हत्) Leaving, quitting, foregoing.
 E. हा to quit,
शतृ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=286-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जहत्स्वार्था
जहत्स्वार्था f. (र्था) The use of a word in a sense different from its ordi-
nary one.
 E. जहत्, and स्वार्थ own meaning. जहन् स्वार्थः याम् । लक्षणाभेदे ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=287-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जहा
जहा f. (-हा) A plant, commonly Mundiri; also कदम्बपुष्पी, &c.
 E. हा to
abandon, affixes ड and टाप्; shedding its leaves in spring.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=287-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जहानक|जहानकः
जहानक m. (-कः) The period of the total destruction of the world E.
हा to abandon, शानच् affix. and कन् added; also इ being substi-
tuted for the vowel of reduplication, जिहानक as it is sometimes
read.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=287-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जह्नु|जह्नुः
जह्नु m. (-ह्नुः)
	 1. The name of a king or saint, son of KURU: see the
next.
	 2. A name of VIṢṆU.
 E. हा to abandon, (the world for devo-
tion.) नु Uṇādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=287-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जह्नुतनया
जह्नुतनया f. (-या) The Ganges.
 E. जह्नु and तनया the daughter: the
river in its course disturbed the devotions of the saint JANNHU,
upon which he drank up its waters; having released them at the
intercession of BHAGIRATHA, he is thus considered as the
parent of the stream: see जाह्नवी; also जह्नुसुता, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=287-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जागर|जागरः
जागर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Walking, awake.
	 mf. (-रः-रा) Waking, wakeful-
ness, vigilance, &c.
	 m. (-रः) Mail, armour.
 E. जागृ to wake, affix
भावे घञ् गुणश्च ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=287-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जागरण|जागरणं
जागरण n. (-णं)
	 1. Waking, watchfulness.
	 2. Keeping watch, sitting
up at night as part of a religious ceremony.
 E. जागृ to be awake,
affix ण्वुल् गुणश्च ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=287-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जागरितृ
जागरितृ mfn. (-ता-त्री-तृ) Wakeful, awake, vigilant.
 E. जागृ to wake,
तृच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=287-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जागरिन्
जागरिन् mfn. (-री-रिणी-रि) Wakeful, awake.
 E. जागृ to wake, णिनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=287-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जागरूक|जागरूकः
जागरूक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Wakeful, waking, watchful.
 E. जागृ to wake,
ऊक aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=287-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जागर्त्ति|जागर्ति|जागर्तिः|जागर्त्तिः
जागर्त्ति f. (-र्त्तिः)
	 1. Waking, vigilance.
	 2. Keeping watch.
 E. जागृ to
wake, भावे क्तिन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=287-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जागर्य्या|जागर्या
जागर्य्या f. (-र्य्या) Wakefulness, waking, watching.
 E. जागृ as above,
भावे क्यप् aff. गुणश्च ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=287-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जागुड|जागुडं|जागुडः
जागुड n. (-डं)
	 1. Saffron.
	 2. A country so named. देशभेदे । सः अभिजन.
अस्य अण् । तद्देशवासिनित्रि तत्र भवः अण् तद्देशभवेत्रि कुङ्कुमेन ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=287-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जागृ
जागृ r. 2nd cl. (जागर्त्ति) To wake, to be awake, or watchful. अदा-पर-
अक-सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=287-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जागृवि|जागृविः
जागृवि m. (-विः) Fire or its deity.
 E. जागृ to wake. Uṇādi affix क्विन्, न
गुणः । नृपे, तस्य स्वकार्य्ये अप्रमत्तत्वात् तथात्वम् । अग्नौ जागरणशीले च त्रि ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=287-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जाग्रत्
जाग्रत् mfn. (-ग्रन्-ग्रती-ग्रत्) Watching, being awake.
 E. जागृ to wake,
Uṇādi affix शतृ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=287-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जाग्रिया
जाग्रिया f. (-या) Waking, watching.
 E. जागृ to wake, यत् affix, ऋ changed
to its congener रि.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=287-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जाङ्गल|जांगल|जाङ्गलं|जाङ्गलः
जाङ्गल mfn. (-लः-ली-लं)
	 1. Rural, picturesque, diversified with hill, vale,
wood, and water, (country)
	 2. Wild, jangali, barbarous, savage.
3. Wild, (not tame, as an animal, &c.)
	 m. (-लः) The francoline
partridge.
	 f. (-ली) Cowach, (Carpopogon pruriens.)
	 n. (-लं)
	 1. Flesh
2. Game, the flesh of deer, &c.
 E. जङ्गल a wilderness, and अण् aff.
जङ्गले भवः जङ्गलप्रायो वा ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=287-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जाङ्गलि|जांगलिः|जाङ्गलिः
जाङ्गलि m. (-लिः) A snake-catcher.
 E. जङ्गल a wilderness, and इञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=287-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जाङ्गुल|जांगुल|जांगुलं|जाङ्गुलं
जाङ्गुल n. (-लं) Poison, venom.
	 f. (-ली)
	 1. Knowledge of poisons, the
possession of charms or drugs, and employment of them as anti-
dotes.
	 2. A potherb, (Luffa acutangula.)
 E. जङ्गुल poison, affix अण्
or गम-यङ् लुक् वा डल् पृषो० दीर्घः ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=287-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जाङ्गुलि|जांगुलि|जांगुलिः|जाङ्गुलिः
जाङ्गुलि m. (-लिः) A snake-catcher, a dealer in antidotes.
 E. जङ्गुल, and
इञ् aff. or गम-यङ् लुक् वा डुलि । विषवैद्ये ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=287-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जाङ्गुलिक|जांगुलिक|जांगुलिकः|जाङ्गुलिकः
जाङ्गुलिक m. (-कः) A snake-catcher, a snake-doctor, one who pretends,
chiefly by charms, to cure the bite of snakes or other venomous
animals, a dealer in antidotes, &c.
 E. जङ्गुल poison, and ठञ् aff.
जाङ्गुली विषविद्या ताम् अधीते वेद वा तया दीव्यति वा ठञ् । विषवैद्ये ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=287-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जाङ्घनी
जाङ्घनी f. (-नी) The thigh.
 E. जङ्घा the leg, affixes अण् and ङीष्, नुम्
augment.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=287-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जाङ्घिक|जांघिक|जाङ्घिकः
जाङ्घिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Relating or belonging to the leg.
	 m. (-कः)
	 1.
A courier, a running footman, an express.
	 2. A camel.
 E. जङ्घा a
leg, and ठञ् aff. जङ्घाभ्यां जीवति ठञ् । धावके उष्ट्रे च ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=287-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जाजिन्
जाजिन् m. (-जी) A warrior, a combatant.
 E. जज् to fight, and णिनि aff.
जजो योधे ताच्छील्ये णिनि । योधशीले ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=287-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जाज्वल्यमान|जाज्वल्यमानः
जाज्वल्यमान mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Shining, flaming, blazing.
 E. ज्वल् to burn,
intensitive form, शानच् aff.
