जाड्य|जाड्यं
जाड्य n. (-ड्यं)
	 1. Coldness, apathy.
	 2. Folly, stupidity, dulness or cold-
ness of intellect.
	 3. Coldness, frigidity.
 E. जड cold, &c. ष्यञ् aff.
