जात|जातं|जातः
जात mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Born, engendered.
	 2. A child, offspring.
	 3. Ap-
parent, manifest.
	 4. Produced, caused, occasioned.
	 5. Felt, enter-
tained.
	 6. Inspired with, affected by.
	 n. (-तं)
	 1. Kind, sort, class,
species.
	 2. Multitude, collection.
	 3. Individuality, specific condi-
tion.
	 4. Birth, production.
 E. जन् to be born, aff. कर्त्तरि भावे वा क्त ।
