<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जापन|जापनं
जापन n. (-नं)
	 1. Declining, rejection, dissent.
	 2. Dismissing, complet-
ing, finishing.
 E. जप् to speak, causal form भावे ल्युट् aff.
