<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जामातृ
जामातृ m. (-ता)
	 1. A daughter's husband, a son-in law.
	 2. A husband,
a lord or master.
	 3. A friend.
	 4. The sunflower, (Helianthus
annus.)
 E. जा for जाया a wife, मा to take, तृच् Uṇādi aff. जायां याति
मिनोति मिमीते वा निपा ।
