<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जाल|जालं|जालः
जाल n. (-लं)
	 1. A net.
	 2. A window, a lattice, an eyelet or loophole.
3. A multitude, an assemblage.
	 4. An unblown flower.
	 5. Pride,
arrogance.
	 6. Magic, conjuring, illusion, supernatural deception
m. (-लः)
	 1. The Kadamba-tree.
	 2. The young fruit of a gourd or
cucumber.
	 f. (-ली)
	 1. A small cucumber, (Trichosanthes diœca,
Rox.)
	 2. Any medicament or drug.
 E. जल् to encompass, to hide
or screen, affix अण्.
