<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जालक|जालकं|जालकः
जालक n. (-कं)
	 1. A bud, a germ.
	 2. An unblown flower.
	 3. A nest.
	 4. A
net.
	 5. Pride.
	 6. A plantain, the fruit.
	 7. Multitude, assemblage.
m. (-कः) A window, a lattice, a loop or eyelet-hole.
	 f. (-लिका)
	 1.
Armour, chain armour.
	 2. A kind of cloth or raiment, woollen
cloth.
	 3. A leech.
	 4. A window.
	 5. Iron.
 E. जाल, and कन् added, or
जल् to enclose, वुन् aff.
