जालिक|जालिकः
जालिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) A cheat, a rogue, a vagabond, a conjuror or
juggler.
	 2. One who employs nets, &c. for a livelihood.
	 m. (-कः) A
spider.
	 2. A fisherman.
	 3. A hunter using nets.
 E. जाल a net, &c.
affix ठक् ।
