जालिन्
जालिन् mfn. (-ली-लिनी-लि)
	 1. Having a net.
	 2. Having a window. Illu-
sory, deceptive.
	 m. (-ली)
	 1. A fisherman.
	 2. a hunter using nets.
3. A juggler.
	 f. (-नी) A painting room.
 E. जाल a net, &c इनि aff.
