जाल्म|जाल्मः
जाल्म mfn. (-ल्मः-ल्मा-ल्मं)
	 1. Cruel, harsh, severe.
	 2. Inconsiderate, rash,
acting without thinking.
	 m. (-ल्मः) A low man, one of a degraded
tribe or business.
 E. जल् to screen or hide, affix मक्.
