<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जाषक|जाषकं
जाषक n. (-कं) A yellow fragrant wood.
 E. जष् to hurt, affix ण्वुल्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=289-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जाह|जाहं
जाह m. (-हः) A termination affixed to nouns denoting parts of the
body, such as कर्ण, अक्षि, &c. in the sense of “the root of” com-
pare कर्णजाह.
