<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जाहक|जाहकः
जाहक m. (-कः)
	 1. A cat 2. A pole-cat.
	 3. A bed, a cot.
	 4. A leech. E.
हा to quit, affix ण्वुल्; radical initial doubled.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=289-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जाह्नवी
जाह्नवी f. (-वी) GANGA or the Ganges personified.
 E. जह्नु a saint, अण्
affix of descent, fem. affix ङीष्, the daughter of JANHU: see
जह्नुतनया.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=289-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जि|जिः
जि r. 1st cl. (जयति)
	 1. To excel, to be pre-eminent, to surpass.
	 2. To
conquer, to reduce or overcome. With वि or परा prefixed, (विजयते
पराजयते) To overcome, to conquer. भ्वा-पर-सक-अनिट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=289-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जि|जिः
जि mfn. (जिः-जिः-जि) Victorious, conquering, a victor.
	 m. (-जिः) A
demon.
 E. जि to conquer, कि aff. जयशीले पिशाचे च ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=289-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जिगत्नु|जिगत्नुः
जिगत्नु m. (-त्रुः) Breath, life.
 E. गम् to go, to depart, कत्नुच् Uṇādi affix,
and the radical repeated. प्राणवायौ ।
