जितकाशि|जितकाशिः
जितकाशि m. (-शिः) The fist doubled. जित conquered, काश to shine,
इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=289-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जितकाशिन्
जितकाशिन् mfn. (-शी-शिनी-शि) Victorious.
 E. जित conquered, and काशिन्
who shines, from काशृ, with णिनि aff. जितेन जयेन काशते प्रकाशते ।
