जीवञ्जीव m. (-वः)
	 1. A kind of bird, supposed to be a pheasant.
	 2. The
Chakora or Greek partridge.
	 3. A kind of tree.
 E. जीव life, and जीव
who lives, from जीव् with खच् affix, long lived.
