जीवथ|जीवथः
जीवथ mfn. (-थः-था-थं)
	 1. Virtuous, pious.
	 2. Long-lived.
	 m. (-थः)
1. Virtue, piety.
	 2. Life, existence.
	 3. A cloud.
	 4. A peacock.
5. A tortoise.
 E. जीव् to live, अथ Uṇādi aff.
