जीवद|जीवदः
जीवद mfn. (-दः-दा-दं) Life-giving, who or what gives life.
	 m. (-दः)
1. A physician, a practitioner of medicine.
	 2. An enemy.
 E. जीव
life, and द in the first sense, from दा to give, in the second, from
दो to destroy, affix क, जीवं जीवनं ददाति द्यति वा ।
