see गुडूची.
	 3. The Sami or Saen tree, (Mimosa albida.)
	 4. A para-
site plant.
	 5. Yellow myrobalan, (Terminalia chebula, Rox.)
 E. जीव्
to live, affix कर्त्तरि, fem. affix ङीप्; also with कन् added जीवन्तिका, &c.
