ज्ञाति|ज्ञातिः
ज्ञाति m. (-तिः)
	 1. A father.
	 2. A kinsman in general.
	 3. A distant kins-
man, one who does not participate in the oblations of food or water
offered to deceased ancestors.
 E. ज्ञा to know, affix कर्त्तरि करणे वा
क्तिच्; who is known, an acquaintance.
