<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वलत्|ज्वलन्त्
ज्वलत् mfn. (-लन्-लन्ती-लत्)
	 1. Burning, blazing.
	 2. Shining, radient,
brilliant.
 E. ज्वल् to burn, शतृ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=295-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वलन|ज्वलनः
ज्वलन n. (-नं)
	 1. Burning, blazing.
	 2. The fire.
	 m. (-नः) AGNI, or fire.
3. The number “Three.”
 E. ज्वल् to blaze, affix ताच्छील्यादौ युच् ।
