<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वलनाश्मन्
ज्वलनाश्मन् m. (-श्मा) The sun-stone.
 E. ज्वलन, and अश्मन् a stone.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=295-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वलन्मणि
ज्वलन्मणि mfn. (-णिः-णिः-णि) Blazing with jewels.
	 m. (-णिः) A brilli-
ant gem.
 E. ज्वलत्, and मणि a jewel.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=295-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वलयत्
