<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वलित|ज्वलितः
ज्वलित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Burnt.
	 2. Blazing, flaming.
 E. ज्वल् to flame, affix क्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=295-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वलितनयन
ज्वलितनयन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Fiery-eyed, looking angrily or fiercely. E.
ज्वलित, and नयन the eye; also ज्वलितचक्षुस्, ज्वलितनेच, &c.
