<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वलिन्
ज्वलिन् mfn. (-ली-लिनी-लि)
	 1. Burning, flaming.
	 2. Shining.
 E. ज्वल, and
इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=296-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वाल|ज्वालः
ज्वाल mfn. (-लः-ली-लं) Burning, blazing.
	 mf. (लः-ला) Flame, blaze.
	 f.
(-ला) Burnt rice.
 E. ज्वल् to blaze, affix अण्, fem. affix टाप् or ङीप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=296-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वालाग्नि
ज्वालाग्नि m. (-ग्निः) Flame.
 E. ज्वाल, and अग्नि fire.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=296-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वालजिह्व
ज्वालजिह्व m. (-ह्वः) AGNI, or fire.
 E. जाला, and जिह्वा a tongue; whose
tongue is flame.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=296-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वालामुखी
ज्वालामुखी f. (-खी) A place where subterraneous fires break forth; an
object of veneration to the Hindus: a celebrated Jwalamukhi
exists in Punjab, to which pilgrimages are made; the soil abound-
ing with carburetted hydrogen, which takes fire upon coming in
contact with the external air; otherwise vents being made, a
light is applied to the orifice, and flame being kindled, is fed by
the stream of gas that escapes. The tongue of PARVATI is said to
have fallen at this place.
 E. ज्वाला flame, and मुख chief, principal,
fem. affix ङीष् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=296-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वालिन्
ज्वालिन् mfn. (-ली-लिनी-लि)
	 1. Flaming, blazing.
	 2. An Epithet of Siva.
E. ज्वल्, and णिनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=296-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झ|झः
झ The ninth consonant of the Deva Nagara alphabet; the aspirate
of the preceding letter, and corresponding in power to Jh.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=296-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झ|झः
झ mfn. (झः झा झं)
	 1. Asleep, sleeping.
	 2. Lost, destroyed.
	 m. (झः)
1. A name of VṚHASPATI, preceptor of the gods.
	 2. A
name of the chief of the Daityas or demons.
	 3. Sound or a sort
of sound like the splashing of water, or the clashing of cymbals,
jangling, clanging, &c.
	 4. High wind.
	 5. A stray, a thing lost or
mislaid.
	 6. Playing a tune, beating time.
	 f. (झा) The descent of
a cascade, a water fall.
 E. झट to collect, affix ड.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=296-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झङ्कार|झंकार|झंकारः|झङ्कारः
झङ्कार m. (-रः) A low inarticulate sound, as the buzzing of bees, &c.
E. झ, and कार a making. कृ-घञ् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=296-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झञ्झन|झंझन|झंझनं
झञ्झन n. (-नं) An indistinct noise, like the jangling of metallic orna-
ments, a ringing, a rattling, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=296-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झञ्झा|झंझा
झञ्झा f. (-ञ्झा)
	 1. Wind, wind and rain, a hurricane, a gale.
	 2. A sharp
clanging sound, jangling.
	 3. Raining in large drops.
	 4. A stray,
any thing lost. झमिति कृत्वा झटति झट-ड ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=296-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झञ्झानिल|झंझानिल|झञ्झानिलः
झञ्झानिल m. (-लः) Wind with rain, a high wind in the rainy season,
a typhoon or the sort of tempest frequent during the south-west
monsoon.
 E. झञ्झा heavy rain, and अनिल wind; also झञ्झा-
मरुत्, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=296-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झञ्झावात|झंझावात|झञ्झावातः
झञ्झावात m. (-तः) Wind with rain, a storm, a squall.
 E. झञ्झा heavy
rain, and वात wind.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=296-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झट
झट r. 1st. cl. (झटति) To clot, to be entangled, (as hair:) see जट. E.
भ्वा-पर-अक-सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=296-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झटा
झटा f. (-टा) A plant, (Flacourtia cataphracta.)
 E. झट् to entangled,
affix अत्र्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=296-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झटि|झटिः
झटि m. (-टिः) A small tree, a shrub, a bush.
 E. जट् to be entangled, इन्
Uṇādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=296-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झटिति
झटिति ind. Quickly, speedily, instantly.
 E. झटि entangling, confusing,
affix इन् क्तिन्; also जटिति.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=296-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झनत्कार|झनत्कारः
झनत्कार m. (-रः) The clanging of metallic ornaments, &c.
 E. झनत् imi-
tative sound, &c. कार making.
