<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झर्ज
झर्ज r. 6th cl. (झर्जति)
	 1. To say, to speak.
	 2. To censure, to blame.
E. तुदा-पर-सक-सेट् ।
