झर्झर|झर्झरः
झर्झर mf. (-रः-री) A sort of drum.
	 m. (-रः)
	 1. The Kaliyuga, the pre-
sent Yug or age of the world.
	 2. The name of a river.
	 3. A cane-
staff.
	 4. A cymbal f. (-रा) A whore.
	 n. (-रं) A sound as of splashing
or dropping.
 E. झर्झ an imitative sound like that of water splash-
ing, &c. and र what makes, from रा with ड affix, or झर्झ to cen-
sure, and करच् Uṇādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=296-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झर्झरक|झर्झरकः
झर्झरक m. (-कः) The Kaliyug.
 E. कन् added to the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=296-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झर्झरीक|झर्झरीकः
झर्झरीक m. (-कः)
	 1. The body.
	 2. A country.
	 3. A picture.
 E. झर्झ to
injure or destroy, ईकन् affix, and र inserted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=296-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झलञ्झला
