<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झलरी
झलरी f. (-री)
	 1. A sort of drum.
	 2. A curl.
 E. झल imitative sound, र
from रा to get or make, affixes ड and ङीप्; also झल्लरी and झल्ली.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=296-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झला
झला f. (-ला)
	 1. A daughter, a girl.
	 2. Sunshine, splendour, brilliant or
glistering light.
	 3. A cricket; also झाला.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=296-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झलि|झलिः
झलि f. (-लिः) The areca nut.
