<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झल्लकण्ठ|झल्लकंठ|झल्लकंठः|झल्लकण्ठः
झल्लकण्ठ m. (-ण्ठः) A pigeon.
 E. झल्ल imitative sound, and कण्ठ a throat.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=296-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झल्लरी
झल्लरी f. (-री)
	 1. A sort of drum.
	 2. A curl, a lock of hair: see झलरी.
	 3.
A ball, &c. of perfumed substances used for cleaning the hair.
	 4.
Moisture.
	 5. Purity.
