<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झष|झषं|झषः
झष r. 1st. cl. (झषति-ते)
	 1. To kill or hurt.
	 2. To take.
	 3. To put on,
to wear.
 E. भ्वा-पर-सक-सेट् । ग्रहणे पिधाने च भ्वा-उभ-सक-सेट् ।
