	 1. A cricket.
	 2. Sunshine, light, lustre.
	 3. The wick of
a lamp.
	 4. A cloth or rag for applying unguents, colour, &c.
	 5. A
musical instrument, cymbals.
	 6. Membrane. E. See the preceding.
