टङ्कपति|टङ्कपतिः
टङ्कपति m. (-तिः) The master of the mint.
 E. टङ्क a weight of silver put
for a coin, and पति master.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=298-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टङ्कशाला
टङ्कशाला f. (-ला) A mint.
 E. टङ्क see the last, and शाला a house or hall.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=298-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टङ्कानक|टङ्कानकः
टङ्कानक m. (-कः) The mulberry, (Morus Indica.) (वामन गाछा)
 E. टङ्कं
कोपमानयति उद्दीपयति अन-णिच् ण्वुल ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=298-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टङ्कार|टंकार|टंकारः|टङ्कारः
टङ्कार m. (-रः)
	 1. Surprise, wonder.
	 2. Fame, notoriety.
	 3. The twang
of a bow string.
	 4. A howl, a cry.
 E. टकि to bind, &c. affix आरक्;
or ट twang, in the second case, कृ to make, affix घञ्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=298-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टङ्ग|टंग|टंगं|टंगः|टङ्गः
टङ्ग m. (-ङ्गः)
	 1. A spade or hoe.
	 2. An axe.
	 3. The leg.
	 4. Borax.
	 5. A
weight of four māṣas.
 E. टकि to bind, affix अच्. क changed to ग,
otherwise टङ्क् as above; also with ल्युट् affix, टङ्गन n. (-नं)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=298-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टङ्गिनी
टङ्गिनी f. (-नी) A plant, (Cissampelos hexandra.) टकि णिनि-पृ आकनादौ ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=298-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टट्टनी
टट्टनी f. (-नी) A house lizard.
 E. टट्ट imitative sound, and न what makes,
from नी, affixes ड and ङीष्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=298-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टट्टरी
टट्टरी f. (-री)
	 1. A joke, a jest.
	 2. A kettle drum.
	 3. Any musical ins-
trument.
 E. टट्ट imitative sound, and र what makes sound, and रा,
with ड and ङीष् affs.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=298-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
