टट्टुर|टट्टुरः
टट्टुर m. (-रः) The sound of a drum.
 E. टट्टु imitative sound, tattoo,
and र what gets or has.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=298-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टल|टलः
टल r. 1st cl. (टलति) To be confused, to be disturbed by fear, anxie-
ty, &c. भ्वा० पर० अक० सेट्-ज्वला० । विप्लवे ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=298-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टलन|टलनं
टलन n. (-नं) Anxiety, Perturbation.
 E. टल् to be disturbed, ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=298-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टाङ्कर|टांकर|टांकरः|टाङ्करः
टाङ्कर m. (-रः) A black-guard, a lecher, a libertine.
 E. टां an oath, and
कर who takes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=298-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टाङ्कार|टांकारः|टाङ्कारः
टाङ्कार m. (-रः) A clang, a twang.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=298-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टार|टारः
टार m. (-रः)
	 1. horse.
	 2. A catamite.
 E. टां पृथ्वीमृच्छति ऋ-अण् ।
