<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टिप
टिप r. 10th cl. (टेपयति-ते) To direct, to send, to throw or cast: the
act of throwing being considered analogous to that of sending or
ordering. चुरा० उभ० सक० सेट् ।
