ठक्कुर|ठक्कुरः
ठक्कुर m. (-रः)
	 1. An idol, a deity, an object of reverence or worship.
	 2.
An honorific title after the name of a distinguished person.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=298-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ठठम्
ठठम् ind. An imitative sound.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=298-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
