<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ड|डः
ड The third letter of the cerebral class of consonants, having the
sound of D, pronounced far back in the “head”: it is often con-
founded in pronounciation with a hard R, or L, sounded as in
the Northumbrian bur; it is written in the Roman character D.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=298-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ड|डः
ड m. (-डः)
	 1. A name of ŚIVA.
	 2. Fear.
	 3. Sound.
	 4. Submarine fire.
5. A kind of drum or tabor.
	 6. A kind of bird.
	 f. (-डा)
	 1. A kind
of female imp or goblin.
	 2. A basket, &c. carried by a sling: see
डलक.
 E. डप to collect, affix, ड.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=298-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डङ्गरी
डङ्गरी f. (-री) A kind of gourd; also read डङ्गारी
 E. डं त्रासं गिरति गॄ-अच्
गौरा ङीष् । कर्कटीभेदे ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=298-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डप
डप r. 10th cl (डापयते) (इ) डपि r. 1st and 10th cls. (डम्प-ते डम्पयते) To
collect, to accumulate, to heap together. संहतौ वा-चुरा-आत्म-अक-सक-
सेट् पक्षे भ्वा ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=298-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डब
डब r. 10th cl. (इ) डबि (डम्बयति-ते) To throw, to send, to order. With वि
prefixed, to deceive, to disgrace. चुरा-उभ-प-आत्मप्रेरणे राशिकरणे
च । सक-सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=298-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डभ
डभ (इ) डभि r. 1st and 10th cls. (डम्भति डम्भययि-ते) To collect, to heap.
together. चुरा-उभ-पस-सक-सेट् पक्षे भ्वा । इदित् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=298-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डम|डमः
डम m. (-मः) A man of low caste, employed to clear away filth, &c. E.
डं तासं माति मा-क । (डोम्)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=298-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डमर|डमरं|डमरः
डमर mf. (-रः-रा)
	 1. An affray, a conflict without weapons.
	 2. Terri-
fying an enemy by shouts and gestures.
	 3. Petty or predatory
warfare, war carried on by detachments or by villagers, one in
which kings are not engaged.
	 4. Rout, riot.
	 n. (-रं) Flight, running
away through fear.
 E. डम् imitative sound, and अर what occasions,
from ऋ to go, affix घञर्थे क ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=298-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डमरु|डमरुः
डमरु m. (-रुः)
	 1. A musical instrument, a sort of small drum, shaped
like an hour-glass, and held in one hand usually carried by Kapa-
likas.
	 2. Any thing surprising, any strange occurence, &c.
 E. डम
imitative sound, ऋ to go or get उण् affix and the vowel changed.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=298-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डम्बर|डंबर|डम्बरः
डम्बर adj.
	 f. (-रा)
	 1. Famous, Renowned.
	 2. (m) An assemblage, a mass.
as in गेघडम्वर ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=298-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डयन|डयनं
डयन n. (-नं)
	 1. A car or litter carried upon men's shoulders, a Palan-
quin, a Duli.
	 2. Flying in the air, the flight of a bird.
 E. डी to fly
aff ल्युट्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=298-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डवित्थ|डवित्थः
डवित्थ m. (-त्थः) A wooden antelope.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=298-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डलक|डलकं
डलक n. (-कं) A sling, a basket, a duli carried on mens’ shoulders
by means of a stick and ropes like the beam and strings of a
balance; presents of fruit, sweetmeats, &c. are usually sent in
this manner; also read डल्लक. (डालि)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=298-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डहु|डहुः
डहु m. (-हुः) A tree, (Artocarpus lacucha.)
 E. दह् to burn, affix उ, and
deriv. irr.; also with ऊ affix डहू m. (-हूः).
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=299-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डाकिनी
डाकिनी f. (-नी) A kind of female imp or evil being. डाकानां समूहः इनि ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=299-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डाङ्कृति|डांकृतिः
डाङ्कृति f. (-तिः) The clang of a bell, ding-dong.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=299-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डामर|डामरः
डामर m. (-रः)
	 1. Affray, conflict without weapons, &c. See डमर.
	 2.
Rout, uproar, the bustle and the confusion of festivity or strife.
3. Any surprising thing, sight or occurrence.
	 4. A name common
to six Tantras, as the Sivadamara, Yogadamara, Durgada mara,
f. (-रा)
	 1. Terrific.
	 2. Beautiful.
	 3. Variegated &c.
 E. डमर q. v. and
अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=299-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डालिम|डालिमः
डालिम m. (-मः) A pomegranate: see दाडिम.
