<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डिम्प्र
डिम्प्र m. (-म्भः)
	 1. Any young animal.
	 2. A fool, an idiot, a blockhead.
f. (-म्भा) An infant.
 E. डिभि to collect, affix अच्; कन् being added;
also डिम्भक.
