णिक्ष
णिक्ष r. 1st cl. (निक्षति प्रणिक्षति) To kiss: the change of the ण after a
preposition is optional in the derivatives of this root. भ्वा-पर-सक-सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=300-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

णिज
णिज (इ) णिजि r. 2nd cl. (निंक्ते प्रणिंक्ते) To kiss; the cleanse, (औ, इर)
औणिजिर r. 3rd cl. (नेनेक्ति नेनिक्ते)
	 1. To nurture, to cherish or
maintain.
	 2. To purify, to cleanse.
