<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तञ्ज
तञ्ज (ऊ) तञ्जू r. 7th cl. (तनक्ति) To shrink or contract.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तट|तटं|तटः
तट r. 1st cl. (तटति) To be elevated or high, to rise. r. 10th cl. (ताटयतिते) To beat.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तट|तटं|तटः
तट mfn. sub. (-टः-टा-टी-टं) A shore or bank.
	 n. (-टं) A field.
 E. तट to
to rise or be high, affix अच्, fem. aff. ङीप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तटस्थ|तटस्थं|तटस्थः
तटस्थ mfn. (-स्थः-स्था-स्थं)
	 1. Indifferent, alien, neuter.
	 2. Situated on
the bank or shore.
	 m. (-स्थः) An indifferent person, one neither a
friend nor a foe.
	 n. (-स्थं) That property which is distinct from
the nature of any thing, yet is the faculty by which it is known:
in other words, spiritual essence unconnected with bodily wants or
passions.
 E. तट a bank, a weight, and स्थ who stands. तटे ममीपे तिष्ठति
स्था-क ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तटाक|तटाकं|तटाकः
तटाक m. (-कः) A pond deep enough for the lotus and other aquatic
flowers.
 E. तट a band, and अक् to go, affix अच्; or तट-आकन् also
तडाक; also ताटाक and तटीक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तटिनी
तटिनी f. (-नी) A river.
 E. तट a bank, and इनि poss. aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तड
तड r. 10th cl. (ताडयतिते)
	 1. To beat, to strike.
	 2. To shine: (इ) तडि.
r. 1st cl. (तण्डते) To strike or beat. चु० उभ० सेट । दीप्तौ अक० आहतौ
सक० आहतौ भ्वा० आ० सक० सेट् इदित् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडग|तडगः
तडग m. (-गः) A pond, a tank: see तडाग.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडाक|तडाकः
तडाक m. (-कः) A pond or pool, one deep enough for the lotus.
	 f.
(-क्रा)
	 1. A bank, a shore.
	 2. A blow.
 E. तड् to beat, Uṇādi affix
आक; also तटाक and तडाग.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडाग|तडागं|तडागः
तडाग m. (-गः)
	 1. A pond, a pool, deep enough for the growth of the
lotus, &c. See the preceding.
	 2. A trap for catching deer. E.
तड् to beat, affix आग, deriv. irr.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडाघात|तडाघातः
तडाघात m. (-तः) A blow from an elephant's uplifted trunk.
 E. तडा a
beating, and आघात a blow.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडित्
तडित् f. (-डित्) Lightning.
 E. तड् to strike or beat, Uṇādi affix इति striking the earth, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडित्वत्|तडित्वन्त्
तडित्वत् mfn. (-त्वान्-त्वती-त्वत्) Lightning, emitting lightning, flashing.
m. (-त्वान्) A cloud.
 E. तडित् lightning, and मतुप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडिल्लता
तडिल्लता f. (-ता) Forked lightning.
 E. तडित्, and लता a creeper.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तण्डक|तंडक|तंडकः|तण्डकः
तण्डक mn. (-कः-कं) Complete performance or preparation.
	 m. (-कः)
1. A wag-tail.
	 2. Froth, foam.
	 3. The trunk of a tree.
	 4. The up-
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-b" target="_blank">Page301-b+ 60</a>]
right post of a house.
	 5. A compound word.
	 6. A juggler. a
cheat.
 E. तडि to beat or kill, affix ण्वुल्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तण्डु|तण्डुः
तण्डु m. (-ण्डुः) One of ŚIVA'S doorkeepers, and one of the original
teachers of the arts of dancing and mimicry.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तण्डुरीण|तंडुरीणः|तण्डुरीणः
तण्डुरीण m. (-णः)
	 1. A worm, an insect.
	 2. A fool, a blockhead.
	 3. The
water in which rice has been soaked or steeped.
 E. तण्डुल rice, &c.
ख affix, and ल changed to र. or तण्डा अस्त्यर्थे उरच् तढ भवः खः ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तण्डुल|तंडुल|तंडुलः|तण्डुलः
तण्डुल m. (-लः)
	 1. Grain after threshing and winnowing, especially rice.
2. A vermifuge plant: see विडङ्ग.
	 3. A potherb, a sort of Ama-
ranth, (A. polygonoides.)
 E. तड् to beat, Uṇādi affix उलच्, and नुम्
inserted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तण्डुजाम्बु
तण्डुजाम्बु f. (-म्बुः) Rice water or gruel.
 E. तण्डुल, and अम्बु water.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तण्डुलीक|तण्डुलीकः
तण्डुलीक m. (-कः) A sort of Amaranth.
 E. ईकन् added to the preceding;
also तण्डुलीय.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तण्डुलीय|तण्डुलीयः
तण्डुलीय m. (-यः)
	 1. A kind of Amaranth. (A. polygonoides.)
	 2. Bidanga
a vermifuge.
	 3. A mineral, iron pyrites.
 E. तण्डुल grain, (to which
the seeds, &c. are compared. and छ affix; also तण्डुलीयक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तण्डुलु|तण्डुलुः
तण्डुलु f. (-लुः) A plant of which the seeds are used as a vermifuge:
see विडङ्ग.
 E. तडि to beat, affix उलु.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तण्डुलेर|तण्डुलेरः
तण्डुलेर m. (-रः) A sort of Amaranth: see तण्डुलीय, &c.
 E. तण्डुल, and
एरक् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तण्डुलोदक|तण्डुलोदकं
तण्डुलोदक n. (-कं) Water in which rice has been boiled, rice gruel. E.
तण्डुल, and उदक water.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तण्डुलौघ|तण्डुलौघः
तण्डुलौघ m. (-घः) A prickly sort of bamboo, (Bambusa spinosa.)
	 2. A
heap of grain.
 E. तण्डुल grain &c. or (as derived from तडि to bent,
to tear,) a thorn, ओघ a heap or quantity.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्
तत् ind. Therefore, thence, the consequent or correlative to यत्.
 E. तन्
to spread, or extend, affix क्विप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ततःप्रभृति
ततःप्रभृति ind. Thenceforth.
 E. ततस्, and प्रभृति the rest.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत|ततं|ततः
तत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Spread, diffused, expanded.
	 2. Stretched, extend-
ed.
	 m. (-तः) Air, wind.
	 n. (-तं) Any stringed instrument.
 E. तन् to
spread, &c. क्त affix, or Uṇādi aff. तन्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ततचिह्न
ततचिह्न mfn. (-ह्नः-ह्ना-ह्नं) Distinctly marked.
 E. तत, and चिह्न a mark.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ततपत्री
ततपत्री f. (-त्री) The plantain tree.
 E. तत spread, and पत्री leaf, broad-
leaved.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ततम|ततमः
ततम mfn. (-मः-मा-मं) That one, (of many.)
 E. तद् that, and डतमच् affix
of the superlative degree.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ततर|ततरः
ततर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) That one, (of two.)
 E. तद् that, and डतरच् affix of
the comparative degree.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ततस्
ततस् ind.
	 1. Therefore, thence, consequently.
	 2. From that, then.
3. Then, how, (asking.)
	 4. Then, further, after that (continuation.)
5. Afterwards, subsequently.
	 6. Thither, there.
 E. तद् that, affix
तसि.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ततस्ततस्
ततस्ततस् ind.
	 1. Hither and thither.
	 2. Then after that, what next;
(asking impatiently.)
 E. ततस् reiterated.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ततस्त्य|ततस्त्यं
ततस्त्य mfn. (-स्त्यः-स्त्या-स्त्यं) Of or relating to that, &c.
 E. ततस् as above,
त्यप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तति|ततिः
तति mfn. plu. (ततयः ततयः ततीनि) So many.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तति|ततिः
तति f. (-तिः)
	 1. A line, a row or range.
	 2. A number, a crowd.
 E. तन् to
spread, affix क्तिन्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्कर
तत्कर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Obeying, serving, a servant.
 E. तत्, and कर who
does.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्काल|तत्कालः
तत्काल m. (-लः) Present time, time being, or the time when an act
occurs.
 E. तत् that, काल time.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्कालधी
तत्कालधी m. (-धीः) A man wise or intelligent for the time being, one
having presence of mind, &c.
 E. तत्काल time being, and धी under
standing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्क्रिय|तत्क्रियः
तत्क्रिय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Working without hire or wages.
 E. तत् thence,
क्रिया business.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्क्षण|तत्क्षणः
तत्क्षण n. (-णं) Time present, time being.
 E. तद् that, and क्षण moment.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=301-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्त्व|तत्त्वं
तत्त्व n. (-त्त्वं)
	 1. Essential nature, the real nature of the human soul,
considered as one and the same with the divine spirit
animating the universe: the philosophical etymology of this
word best explains its meaning, तद् that, that divine being, and त्व
thou, that very God art thou.
	 2. The Supreme being, or BRAMHA.
3. Truth, reality, substance, opposed to what is illusory or
fallacious.
	 4. An element or elementary property, differently
enumerated in different system from the three which are
the same with the three Gunas, to twenty-seven, which in-
clude the elements, organs, faculties, matter, spirit, life, and God.
5. A first principle, an axiom.
	 6. Mind, intellect.
	 7. Slow time in
music.
	 8. A musical instrument. E. As above, or तद् that, then &c.
affix त्व; the word is properly, therefore, written तत्त्व, but in books
one त is commonly rejected.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्त्वज्ञान|तत्त्वज्ञानं
तत्त्वज्ञान n. (-नं) Knowledge of divine truth.
 E. तत्त्व as above, and ज्ञान
knowledge.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्त्वतस्
तत्त्वतस् ind. Truly, accurately, fully.
 E. तत्त्व, and तसिल् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्त्वन्यास|तत्त्वन्यासः
तत्त्वन्यास m. (-सः) Touching different parts of the body in the worship
of VIṢṆU.
 E. तत्त्व, and न्यास gesticulation.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्त्वविद्
तत्त्वविद् mfn. (-वित्) Knowing the truth, knowing things as they are.
E. तत्त्व, and विद् who knows.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्त्वावबोध
तत्त्वावबोध m. (-धः) Knowledge of spirit.
 E. तत्त्व, and अवबोध ascertain-
ment.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्त्वाभियोग|तत्त्वाभियोगः
तत्त्वाभियोग m. (-गः) A positive charge or declaration.
 E. तत्त्व, and अमि-
योग accusation.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्पर|तत्परः
तत्पर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं)
	 1. Diligent, attending to any thing closely and an-
xiously.
	 2. Belonging to a principal object or intent of.
	 m. (-रः)
The thirtieth part of the time of the twinkling of the eye.
 E. तत्
that, पर addicted to.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्परायण|तत्परायणः
तत्परायण mfn. (-णः-णा-णं) Attached or addicted to some particular thing
or person.
 E. तद् that, परायण attached to.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्पूर्व|तत्पूर्व्व
तत्पूर्व mfn. (-र्वः-र्वा-र्वं) Prior, former.
 E. तत्, and पूर्व before.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्पुरुष|तत्पुरुषः
तत्पुरुष m. (-षः)
	 1. That or a certain person.
	 2. A form of composition,
(in Grammar,) usually consisting of two nouns, the first of which
was in any case except the nominative or vocative; sometimes
the inflection of the case is retained.
 E. तत् that, and पुरुष man or
person.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्फल|तत्फलः
तत्फल mfn. (-लः-ली-लं) Resulting from any particular act, &c.
	 m. (-लः)
1. The white water lily.
	 2. A fragrant grass.
 E. तद्, and फल fruit.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्र
तत्र (इ) तत्रि r. 10th cl. (तन्त्रयते)
	 1. To spread, to extend or expand.
2. To nourish or support a family, &c. चु० आ० सक० सेट् इदित् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्र
तत्र ind. There, therein, the relative to अत्र.
 E. तद् that, त्रल् affix, in lieu
of the proper seventh case.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्रत्य|तत्रत्यः
तत्रत्य mfn. (-त्यः-त्या-त्यं) Produced there or in a certain place.
 E. तत्र, and
त्यप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्रभवत्|तत्रभवन्त्
तत्रभवत् mfn. (-वान्-वती-वत्) Venerable, respectable, reverend.
 E. तत्र
therein. (in all things) भवत् pre-eminent: see अत्रभवत्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्व|तत्वं
तत्व n. (-त्वं) See तत्त्व.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथा
तथा ind.
	 1. So, like, correlative to यथा as, &c.
	 2. Thus, (implying certain-
ty.)
	 3. So, so be it, (implying assent or promise.)
	 4. Thus, then,
therefore, (or reply.)
	 5. And, so, in (conjunction.)
 E. तद् in that,
थाल् affix, implying manner.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथागत|तथागतः
तथागत m. (-तः) A Jina or Buddha.
 E. तथा thus, (what really is,) and
गत known, obtained.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथाच
तथाच ind. And so, thus, even so likewise.
 E. तथा with च and.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथात्व|तथात्वं
तथात्व n. (-त्वं) Being so; the case or circumstance being admitted to be
as stated.
 E. तथा, and त्व aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथापि
तथापि ind. Nevertheless, yet, even.
 E. तथा, and अपि even.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथाविध
तथाविध mfn. (-धः-धा-धं) Of such a sort or kind.
 E. तथा and विध sort.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथाराज|तथाराजः
तथाराज m. (-जः) A Jina or Buddha.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथैव
तथैव ind. So, even so, in the same manner.
 E. तथा, and एव thus.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथ्य|तथ्यं
तथ्य mfn. (-थ्यः-थ्या-थ्यं) True.
	 n. (-थ्यं) Truth.
 E. तथा thus, (what is really
so,) and यत् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्
तद् Relative or third personal pronoun. (सः सा तद्) He, she, it, that
man, that woman, that thing.
 E. तन् to extend or spread, Uṇādi
affix अदि. डिच्च.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्
तद् (इ) तदि r. 1st cl. (तन्दते) To be content or happy.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदतिपात
तदतिपात mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Transgressing, going beyond the bounds.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदनन्तर
तदनन्तर n. adv. (-रं) Next, afterwards.
 E. तत् that, अनन्तर after.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदन्त|तदंत
तदन्त n. adv. (-न्तं) To that end, just so far.
 E. तद्, and अन्त end.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदर्थ
तदर्थ mfn. (-र्थः-र्था-र्थं)
	 1. On that account, with that object.
	 2. Hav-
ing such a meaning.
 E. तद्, and अर्थ sense.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदर्पण
तदर्पण n. (-णं)
	 1. A thing returned.
	 2. Delivering any article.
 E. तद्,
and अर्पण delivery.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदा
तदा ind. Then, at that time.
 E. तद् that, दाच् affix, implying time.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदात्व|तदात्वं
तदात्व n. (-त्वं) Time being, time present.
 E. तदा then, त्व affix of the
abstract.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदानीम्
तदानीम् ind. Then, at that time.
 E. तद् that, दानीम् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदाप्रभृति
तदाप्रभृति ind. Thenceforward.
 E. तदा, and प्रभृति the rest.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदामुख|तदामुखं
तदामुख n. (-खं) Commencement, beginning.
 E. तदा, and मुख beginning.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदीय
तदीय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) That, that person, that thing.
 E. तद्, and छ aff.
