<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्दिनम्
तद्दिनम् ind.
	 1. In the course of the day.
	 2. Day by day.
	 n. (-नं) On a
certain day.
 E. तद् that, and दिन a day.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्धन|तद्धनः
तद्धन mfn. (-नः-ना-न) Miserly, niggardly.
 E. तत् thence, धन wealth.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्वत्|तद्वन्त्
तद्वत् ind. So, in like manner, the correlative to यद्वत् as.
 E. तद् that,
वति aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्वला
तद्वला f. (-ला) A sort of arrow.
 E. तत् thence, वल strong.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्विध
तद्विध mfn. (-धः-धा-धं) In that manner, in such a manner, of such a
kind or sort.
 E. तद्, and विध way.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्धित|तद्धितः
तद्धित m. (-तः) A derivative noun, as a patronymic or attributive of vari-
ous kinds, &c.
	 n. (-तं) The formation of such nouns.
 E. तत् that,
(original noun,) हित what relates to or suits.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तन|तनः
तन (उ) तनु r. 8th cl. (तनोति-तनुते) To expand, to spread, to extend, to
diffuse, to dilate, &c. physically or morally. r. 1st and 10th cls.
(तनति तानयतिते)
	 1. To confide, to believe or have faith in.
	 2. To aid,
to assist.
	 3. To be harmless.
	 4. To sound.
	 5. To pain or afflict with
disease.
	 6. (With a preposition,) To lengthen, to stretch, to expand,
&c. as in the 8th cl.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तनय|तनयः
तनय m. (-यः)
	 1. A son.
	 2. A male descendant.
	 f. (-या)
	 1. A daughter.
2. A plant: see चक्रकुल्या.
 E. तन् to spread, (to extend the family or
name,) कयन् Uṇādi aff. तनोति कुलम् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तनिष्ठ|तनिष्ठः
तनिष्ठ mfn. (-ष्ठः-ष्ठा-ष्ठं)
	 1. Smaller, less.
	 2. Minute, delicate, small. E.
तनु, and इष्ठन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तनीयस्
तनीयस् mfn. (-यान्-यसी-यः)
	 1. Smallest, least.
	 2. Very small or delicate,
&c.
 E. तनु, and ईयसुन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तनु|तनुः
तनु mfn. (-नुः-नुः or -न्वी or -नूः-नु)
	 1. Small, minute.
	 2. Delicate, fine, but
with interestics.
	 3. Thin, slender, emaciated.
	 4. Little.
	 f. (-नु
नूः)
	 1. The body.
	 2. The skin.
	 f. (-नुः)
	 1. A woman.
	 2. Point of
conjunction, or sun's entrance into a new sign.
	 f. (-नी)
	 1. A deli-
cate or slender woman.
	 2. A stanza of four lines, and twenty-four
syllables in each: a variety of the Sankriti metre.
 E. तन् to
stretch or spread, Uṇādi affix उ; also तनू and तनुस्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तनुकूप|तनुकूपः
तनुकूप n. (-पः) A pore of skin.
 E. तनु, and कूप a well.
