तनुज|तनुजः
तनुज m. (-जः) A son.
	 f. (-जा) A daughter.
 E. तनु body, and ज born.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=302-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

