cony or terrace.
 E. तम् to desire, अङ्गक affix; pleasant, desirable.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तमत|तमतः
तमत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Desirous, cupidinous, longing or hankering after.
2. Wished, desired.
 E. तम् to desire, affix अतच्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तमःप्रभ
तमःप्रभ mf. (-भः-भा) A hell, one of the lowermost divisions of the infer-
nal regions.
 E. तम darkness, add प्रभ what is manifested.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तमर|तमरं
तमर n. (रं) Lead.
 E. तम् to be disturbed, affix अरन्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तमराज|तमराजः
तमराज m. (-जः) A kind of sugar.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तमस्
तमस् n. (-मः)
	 1. Third of the qualities incident to the state of humani-
ty, the Tama guna, or property of darkness, whence proceed folly,
ignorance, mental blindness, worldly delusion, &c.
	 2. Darkness,
gloom.
	 3. Sin.
	 4. Sorrow, grief.
	 mn. (-माः-मः) Rahu or the personi-
fied ascending node: see राहु.
 E. तम् to be disturbed, and असुन्
Uṇādi affix; that property by which the mind is troubled, the
world perplexed, &c.; also तमस and तम.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तमस|तमसं|तमसः
तमस n. (-सं)
	 1. Darkness.
	 2. A city.
	 f. (-सा) A river, the Tamasa or
Tonse.
 E. तम् to be disturbed, (daylight, &c.) and असच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तमस्कल्प
तमस्कल्प mfn. (-ल्पः-ल्पा-ल्पं) Like darkness, black, gloomy.
 E. तमस्, and
कल्प aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तमस्तति|तमस्ततिः
तमस्तति f. (-तिः) Great or diffusive darkness.
 E. तमस् darkness, and तति a spreading.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तमस्विन्
तमस्विन् mfn. (-स्वी-स्विनी-स्वि) Dark, gloomy.
	 f. (-नी)
	 1. Night.
	 2. Tur-
meric.
 E. तमस् darkness, and विनि affix, fem. affix ङीष्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तमाल|तमालं|तमालः
तमाल m. (-लः)
	 1. The sectarial mark made with Sandal, &c. upon the
forehead.
	 2. The name of a tree bearing black blossoms, (Xantho-)
cymus pictorios, Rox.)
	 3. A sword, a scymitar or large sacrificial
knife.
	 4. A plant: see वरुण.
	 5. A black kind of Mimosa.
	 6. The
bark of the bambu.
	 n. (-लं) The leaf of the Laurus cassia. The bark
or troubled, leaf of the Luarus cassia.
 E. तम् to be dark or troubled,
Uṇādi affix कालन्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तमालक|तमालकं|तमालकः
तमालक n. (-कं)
	 1. A sort of potherb, (Marsilea dentata, Rox.)
	 2. The
leaf of the Laurus cassia.
	 mn. (-कः-कं)
	 1. The bark of a bambu.
	 2.
The Tamala tree: see the preceding.
 E. कन् pleonasm, or implying
some resemblance, added to तमाल.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तमालपत्र|तमालपत्रं
तमालपत्र n. (-त्रं)
	 1. The Tamala tree: see तमाल.
	 2. The Tilaka or sec-
tarial mark on the forehead.
	 3. The leaf of the Laurus cassia. E.
तमाल, and पत्र a leaf: the leaf of the Tamala, either in fact or
resemblance.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तमालिका
तमालिका f. (-का) A district of Bengal, the modern Tamluk.
 E. तमाल a
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-b" target="_blank">Page305-b+ 60</a>]
Tamala tree, कन् affix, implying possession; also with an analo-
gous affix इनि, तमालिनी abounding in Tamala trees.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तमाली
तमाली f. (-ली) A medicinal plant: see ताम्रवल्ली.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तमि|तमिः
तमि f. (-मिः) Night.
 E. तम् to be weary, इन् affix: see तम and तमी.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तमिन्
तमिन् mfn. (-मी-मिनी-मि) Desiring, desirous, wishing.
 E. तम् to desire,
इन् or ङीप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तमिस्र|तमिस्रं|तमिस्रः
तमिस्र m. (-स्रः) The dark half of the month, from the full to the change.
f. (-स्रा)
	 1. A dark night, or one during the wane of the moon.
2. Great or extensive darkness.
	 3. The night of the new moon.
	 4.
Any night.
	 n. (-स्रं)
	 1. Darkness.
	 2. Anger, wrath.
 E. तमस् dark-
ness, र added, and इ substituted for the penultimate.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तमिस्रपक्ष|तमिस्रपक्षः
तमिस्रपक्ष m. (-क्षः) The fortnight of the moon's wane.
 E. तमिस्र, and पक्ष
a fortnight.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तमोगुण|तमोगुणः
तमोगुण m. (-णः) The quality of darkness or ignorance.
 E. तमस्, and गुण
property.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तमोघ्न|तमोघ्नः
तमोघ्न m. (-घ्नः)
	 1. Fire.
	 2. The sun.
	 3. The moon.
	 4. The legislator
BUDDHA.
	 5. VIṢṆU.
	 6. ŚIVA.
 E. तमस् darkness, (physical or
moral,) and घ्न destroyer. तमोऽन्धकारं मोहमज्ञानं वा हन्ति तम-ठक् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तमोज्योतिस्
तमोज्योतिस् m. (-तिः) A fire-fly.
 E. तमस् darkness, and ज्योतिस् light.
तमसि अन्धकारे ज्योतिरस्य । खद्योते ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तमोनुद्
तमोनुद् mfn. (-नुद्) Dispersing darkness.
	 m. (-नुद् or -नुत्)
	 1. Fire.
	 2. The
sun.
	 3. The moon.
	 4. A lamp.
 E. तमस darkness, नुद् to send away
or disperse, affix क्विप्; also with क affix तमोनुद । तमो नुदति खण्डयति
नुद्-क्विप् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तमोनुद|तमोनुदः
तमोनुद mfn. (-दः-दा-दं) See the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तमोपह|तमोपहः
तमोऽपह mfn. (-हः-हा-हं) Lightening, enlightening, removing darkness
physical or moral.
	 m. (-हः)
	 1. The sun.
	 2. The moon.
	 3. Fire.
	 4.
A name of Buddha, the founder of Buddha sect.
 E. तमस् dark-
ness, अपह removing, from the अप prefixed to हन् to kill or destroy,
affix ड; also तमोहन्तृ mfn. (-न्ता-न्त्री-न्तृ) तमोऽपहन्ति अप-हन ड ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तमोभिद्
तमोभिद् m. (-भिद् or -भित्) A fire-fly.
 E. तमस् darkness, and भिद् what pene-
trates. तमो भिनत्ति भिद-क्विप् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तमोभूत
तमोभूत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Dark.
	 2. Ignorant.
 E. तमस्, and भूत become.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तमोमय|तमोमयः
तमोमय mfn. (-यः-यी-यं) Consisting of or composed of darkness, derived
from it.
 E. तमस्, and मयट् aff. तम आत्मकं प्रचुरं वा ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तमोमणि|तमोमणिः
तमोमणि m. (-णिः) A fire-fly.
 E. तमस् darkness, मणि a gem. तमसि
मणिरिव ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तमोलिप्ती
तमोलिप्ती f. (-प्ती) The district of Tumlook in Bengal.
 E. तमस् darkness
or sin, and लिप्त soiled, affix ङीष्; a country of which the inhabi-
tants are notoriously depraved.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तमोविकार|तमोविकारः
तमोविकार m. (-रः) Disease, sickness.
 E. तमस्, and विकार changed, pro-
ceeding from the Tama guna.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तमोवृत
तमोवृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Overcome with or influenced by rage, fear, &c.
or any of the effects of the property of darkness.
	 2. Obscured,
clouded.
 E. तमस् as above, and वृत surrounded.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तमोहर|तमोहरः
तमोहर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Removing darkness, lightening.
	 m. (-रः) The
moon.
 E. तमस् darkness, and हर who removes. तमो हरति ह-
अच् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तम्पा
तम्पा f. (-म्पा) A cow.
 E. तम् to desire, अप् affix; also प being changed
to ब, तम्बा.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तम्ब
तम्ब r. 1st cl. (तम्बति) To go or move.
 E. भ्वा-प-सक-सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तम्बा|तंबा
तम्बा f. (-म्बा) A cow: see तम्पा.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तय|तयः
तय r. 1st cl. (तयते) To go or move.
	 2. To guard or preserve.
 E. भ्वा-आ-
सक-सेट्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तय|तयः
तय mfn. (-यः-यी-यं) Who or what protects.
	 m. (-यः) Protection.
 E. तय,
and अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर|तरः
तर mfn. (-रः-रा-री-रं) Who or what passes over or beyond.
	 m. (-रः)
	 1.
Passing over, crossing.
	 2. A float, a raft.
	 3. A road.
	 4. A tree.
	 f.
(-री)
	 1. A boat.
	 2. A club.
	 3. A clothes basket, a Pitara.
	 4. Smoke.
5. A small wooden baling vessel.
	 6. The end of a garment.
 E. तॄ
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-a" target="_blank">Page306-a+ 60</a>]
to cross, affix भावे अप्, fem. affix ङीष्; also with इन् affix तरि, q. v.
कर्त्तरि अच् । कृशानौ पु० तरति अनेन करणे अप् । आतरे पणादौ ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=305-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरक्षु|तरक्षुः
तरक्षु m. (-क्षुः) A hyena.
 E. तर a road, and क्षि to annoy, affix डु infesting
the road; also with कन् added तरक्षुक m. (-कः) or with ड affix तरक्ष
m. (-क्षः) but not common. तरं गतिं मार्गं वा क्षिणोति ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरङ्ग|तरंग|तरंगः|तरङ्गः
तरङ्ग m. (-ङ्गः)
	 1. Wave.
	 2. Cloth or clothes.
	 3. The gallop of a horse. E.
तॄ to pass over or cross, Uṇādi affix अङ्गच्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरङ्गिणी|तरंगिणी
तरङ्गिणी f. (णी) A river.
 E. तरङ्ग a wave, इनि and ङीष् affs.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरङ्गित|तरंगित
तरङ्गित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Wavy, billowy, tossing with waves.
 E. तरङ्ग, and
इतच् aff. तरङ्गः सञ्जातः अस्य ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरण|तरणं|तरणः
तरण m. (-णः)
	 1. A raft, a float.
	 2. Svarga or paradise.
	 n. (-णं)
1. Crossing over, passing, going across.
	 2. Removing from an in-
undation.
 E. तॄ to cross, affix ल्युट्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरणि|तरणिः
तरणि m. (-णिः)
	 1. The sun.
	 2. A ray of light.
	 3. A float or raft.
	 f. (-णिः-
or -णी)
	 1. A boat.
	 2. The Socotrine aloe, (A perfoliata.)
	 3. A plant,
(Hibiscus mutabilis.)
 E. तॄ to cross, Uṇādi affix करणे कर्मणि भावे वा
ल्युट्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरणिपेटक|तरणिपेटकः
तरणिपेटक m. (-कः) An oval bowl or basin of wood, for baling a boat.
E. तरणि, and पेटक a basket, the boat's basket.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरणिरत्न|तरणिरत्नं
तरणिरत्न n. (-त्नं) A ruby.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरण्ड|तरंड|तरंडं|तरंडः|तरण्डः
तरण्ड mfn. (-ण्डः-ण्डा or -ण्डी-ण्डं) A boat, a vessel.
	 mn. (-ण्डः-ण्डं)
	 1. A
raft or float, made of bamboos, &c. tied together, and sometimes
floated upon jars or hollow gourds inverted.
	 2. The float of a finish-
ing line.
	 3. An oar.
	 m. (-ण्डः) A country.
 E. तॄ to cross, अण्डन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरण्डपादा|तरंडपादा
तरण्डपादा f. (-दा) A boat.
 E. तरण्ड an oar, and पाद a foot, having oars
for feet.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरत्
तरत् mfn. (-रन्-रन्ती-रत्) Crossing, passing over.
	 n. (-रत् or -रद्)
	 1. A
float or raft.
	 2. A kind of duck.
 E. तॄ to cross, शतृ affix of the
active participle.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरत्सल
तरत्सल m. (-लः) Conflagration of chaff: see तृणाग्नि.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरन्त|तरंत|तरंतः|तरन्तः
तरन्त m. (-न्तः)
	 1. A fog.
	 2. A hard shower, a torrent of rain.
	 3. The
ocean.
	 f. (-न्ती) A boat.
 E. तॄ to cross, झच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरम्बुज|तरम्बुजं
तरम्बुज n. (-जं) A watermelon, (most probably borrowed from a Persian
word.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरपण्य|तरपण्यं
तरपण्य n. (-ण्यं) Fare, freight.
 E. तर passing (a river), and पण्य price.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरल|तरलः
तरल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं)
	 1. Trembling, tremulous.
	 2. Libidinous, lech-
erous, wanton.
	 3. Luminous, splendid.
	 4. Hollow.
	 5. Liquid,
liquefied m. (-लः)
	 1. The central gem of a necklace.
	 2. A necklace.
3. Bottom, depth, lower or under part.
	 f. (-ला)
	 1. Rice gruel.
	 2.
Wine, vinous or spirituous liquor.
	 3. A bee.
 E. तॄ to pass, to go or
move, affix अलच्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरलता
तरलता f. (-ता) Tremulousness, unsteadiness.
 E. तल् added to the last;
also with त्व, तरलत्वं.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरललोचना
तरललोचना f. (-ना) A woman with rolling or tremulous eyes.
 E. तरल
trembling, and लोचन an eye.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरलायित|तरलायितः
तरलायित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Caused to tremble, agitated, undulating.
	 m.
(-तः)
	 1. A large wave or surf.
	 2. Fickleness.
 E. तरल used as a verb,
क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरलित|तरलितं
तरलित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Shaken, trembling, tremulous.
 E. तरल trembling,
and इतच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरवारि|तरवारिः
तरवारि m. (-रिः) A sword, a scymitar.
 E. तर passing, वॄ to effect, इन्
affix; making its pass through the enemy, &c. also तरवारिक m. (कः)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरस्
तरस् n. (-रः)
	 1. Speed, velocity.
	 2. Strength.
	 3. A bank.
	 4. A float,
a raft.
 E. तॄ to go, to go quick, &c. असुन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरस|तरसं
तरस n. (-सं) Flesh.
 E. तरस् strength, affix अच्; in which there is
strength.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरस्थान|तरस्थानं
तरस्थान n. (-नं) A landing place, a wharf or stairs.
 E. तर passing, ferry-
ing, and स्थान place.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरस्वत्|तरस्वन्त्
तरस्वत् mfn. (-स्वान्-स्वती-स्वत्)
	 1. Quick, swift.
	 2. Valiant.
 E. तरस्, and
वतुप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरस्विन्
तरस्विन् mfn. (-स्वी-स्विनी-स्वि)
	 1. Quick, swift.
	 2. Strong, valiant.
	 m. (-स्वी)
1. A courier, an express, a runner.
	 2. A hero.
	 3. The bird of
VIṢṆU.
	 4. Air, wind.
 E. तरस् speed, &c. विनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरान्धु|तरांधु|तरांधुः|तरान्धुः
तरान्धु m. (-न्धुः) A large flat bottomed boat.
 E. तर crossing., अन्धु water;
perhaps a various reading of the next.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरालु|तरालुः
तरालु m. (-लुः) A flat bottomed boat.
 E. तर passing over, आलुच् affix: see
the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरि|तरिः
तरि f. (-रिः)
	 1. A boat.
	 2. A clothe's basket.
	 3. The end of a cloth.
 E. तॄ
to pass, Uṇādi affix इन्; also with ङीष् affix तरीः see तर, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरिक|तरिकः
तरिक n. (-कं) A raft, a float.
	 m. (-कः) A ferry-man.
	 f. (-का) A boat.
E. तरि a boat, कन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरिकिन्
तरिकिन् m. (-की) A ferry-man.
 E. तरिक a raft, इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरित
तरित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Carried over or across.
	 f. (-ता)
	 1. The fore finger.
2. Garlic, or perhaps hemp: see गृञ्जन.
 E. तॄ to cross, इतच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरिन्
तरिन् mfn. (-री-रिणी-णि) Who or what crosses.
	 f. (-णी) a boat.
 E. तॄ to
go, in the causal, affix इनि.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरितृ
तरितृ mfn. (-ता-त्री-तृ) What crosses, passes or carries over.
	 f. (-त्री) A
boat, a raft.
 E. तॄ to cross, तृच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरिरथ|तरिरथः
तरिरथ m. (-थः) An oar, a paddle.
 E. तरि a boat, and रथ a car.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरीष|तरीषः
तरीष m. (-षः)
	 1. The ocean.
	 2. Heaven or paradise.
	 3. Decorating,
ornamenting.
	 4. A raft, a float.
	 5. Practice, business, profession.
	 f.
(-षी) The daughter of INDRA.
 E. तॄ to cross or cause to cross, Uṇādi
affix ईषन्, in some of its senses this word and तबिष seem to be
confounded; see तबिष and ताविष.
