<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुणास्थि
तरुणास्थि n. (-स्थि) Cartilage, gristle.
 E. तरुण, and अस्थि bone.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुणीगण
तरुणीगण m. (-णः) A number of young woman.
 E. तरुणी, and गण a troop.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुणीजन
तरुणीजन m. (-नः) A young woman.
 E. तरुणी, and जन person.
