<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुपङ्क्ति
तरुपङ्क्ति f. (-क्तिः) A row of trees, an avenue.
 E. तरु, and पङ्क्ति a line.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=306-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुभुज्
तरुभुज् m. (-क्) A parasite plant.
 E. तरु, and भुज् what enjoys.
