तरुस्थ
तरुस्थ mfn. (-स्थः-स्था-स्थं) Staying or being in a tree.
	 f. (-स्था) A para-
site plant.
 E. तरु, and स्थ what stays.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुट|तरुटः
