<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्क|तर्कः
तर्क r. 10th cl. (तर्कयति-ते)
	 1. To shine.
	 2. To speak.
	 3. To reason, to
discuss.
	 4. To doubt or apprehend. दीप्तौ अक० आकाङ्क्षायां वितर्के च सक०
चुरा० उभ० सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्क|तर्कः
तर्क m. (-र्कः)
	 1. Doubt or disputation, discussion, reasoning.
	 2. Wish.
desire.
	 3. Supplying an ellipsis.
	 4. Cause, motive.
	 5. The science
of reasoning, logic.
	 6. (In logic,) Reduction to absurdity, a con-
clusion opposed to or disproving the premises.
 E. तर्क to infer, to
reason, &c. affix भावे अच्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्कक|तर्ककः
तर्कक m. (-कः)
	 1. A supplicant, a petitioner, an asker.
	 2. A logician. E.
तर्क to reason, and affix ण्वुल्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्कयत्
तर्कयत् mfn. (-यन्-यन्ती-यत्)
	 1. Expecting, anticipating.
	 2. Doubting. E.
तर्क to doubt, शतृ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्कविद्या
तर्कविद्या f. (-द्या) The science of reasoning or logic.
 E. तर्क as above, and
विद्या knowledge.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्काभास|तर्काभासः
तर्काभास m. (-सः) Apparent reduction to absurdity, or seeming not real,
incompatibility of the conclusion with the premises.
 E. तर्क, and
आभास fallacy.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्कारी
तर्कारी f. (-री) A tree, (Æschynomene sesban.)
 E. तर्क reasoning, ऋ to
go or affect, affixes अण् and ङीप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्कित
तर्कित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Doubted, apprehended.
	 2. Discussed.
 E. तर्क, to
doubt, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्किन्
तर्किन् m. (-र्की) A logician, a disputant, a follower of the Tarka Śāstra.
E. तर्क as above, इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्किल
तर्किल m. (-लः) Cassia tora.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्कु|तर्कुः
तर्कु f. (-र्कुः) A spindle, an iron pin upon which the cotton is first
drawn out; it also serves as the distaff, the cotton being next
transferred from it to the wheel.
 E. कृत् to cut, Uṇādi affix उ, and
the radical letters transposed.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्कुट|तर्कुटं
तर्कुट n. (-टं) Drawing out the cotton upon the distaff or upon the
wheel.
	 f. (-टी) A spindle or a distaff: see तर्कु.
 E. कृत् to cut, &c.
उटच् affix, and the radical letters transposed.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्कुपिण्ड|तर्कुपिंड|तर्कुपिण्डः
तर्कुपिण्ड m. (-ण्डः) A ball of clay, &c. upon the lower end of the spin-
dle to assist in giving it a rotatory motion.
 E. तर्कु as above, पिण्ड
a lump.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्कुपीठी
तर्कुपीठी f. (-ठी) A ball at the lower end of a spindle: see the preced-
ing.
 E. तर्कु a spindle, and पीठ a stool.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्कुलासक|तर्कुलासकः
तर्कुलासक m. (-कः) A concave shell or saucer in which the lower end
of the spindle is placed, and whirled round.
 E. तर्कु a spindle, लस्
to go, णिच् and ण्वुल् affs. तर्कुं लासयति चालयति । चरका ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्कुशाण|तर्कुशाणः
तर्कुशाण m. (-णः) A small whetstone, for sharpening spindles, &c.
 E. तर्कु
a spindle, and शाण whetstone.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्क्षु|तर्क्षुः
तर्क्षु m. (-र्क्षुः) A hyena.
 E. तर्ज् to give pain, affix कु; also तरक्षु.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्क्ष्य|तर्क्ष्यः
तर्क्ष्य m. (-र्क्ष्यः) Nitre, saltpetre.
 E. तृक्ष-यत् वा गुणः । यवक्षारे ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्ज|तर्ज्ज
तर्ज r. 1st and 10th cls. (तर्जति तर्जयते) To blame, to censure, to reprove.
भ्वा-प-सक-सेट् । चुर-आ-सक-सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्जन|तर्जनं|तर्ज्जन|तर्ज्जनं
तर्जन n. (-नं)
	 1. Blaming, censuring.
	 2. Pointing at, in ridicule, or
contempt.
	 3. Putting to shame, surpassing.
	 4. Wrath, anger.
	 f.
(-नी) The forefinger.
 E. तर्ज् to abuse, to injure, affixes भावे ल्युट्
and ङीप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्जिक|तर्ज्जिक|तर्ज्जिकः
तर्जिक m. (-कः) The name of a country, perhaps to the north-west of
India or Bokhara, &c. the country of the Tajics: also तायिक. E.
तर्जलर्जनमस्ति अत्र ठन् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्जित|तर्ज्जित
तर्जित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Blamed, reviled.
	 2. Shamed, disgraced.
 E. तर्ज्
to blame, affix क्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्ण|तर्णः
तर्ण m. (-र्णः) A calf.
 E. तृण to go, अच् affix; also with ण्वुल् added, तर्णक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्णक|तर्णकः
तर्णक m. (-कः) A calf: see the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्णि|तर्णिः
तर्णि m. (-र्णिः)
	 1. A raft, a float.
	 2. The sun.
 E. तरति आकाशपद्धतिं तॄ-नि
करणे नि वा ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्त्तरीक|तर्तरीक|तर्त्तरीकं
तर्त्तरीक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) A passenger, one who passes or crosses.
	 n. (-कं)
A boat, a raft, a vessel.
 E. तॄ to cross over, ईक aff. and deriv. irr.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्द|तर्द्द
तर्द r. 1st cl. (तर्दति) To kill or hurt.
 E. भ्वा-प-सक-सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्दू
तर्दू m. (-र्दूः) A wooden ladle.
 E. तर्द or तृद to go, Uṇādi affix ऊ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्पण|तर्पणं
तर्पण n. (-णं)
	 1. Satisfaction given or received; either the act of
pleasing, or the state of being pleased.
	 2. Satiety, fulness.
	 3. A
religious rite, presenting water to the manes of the deceased or to
the Pitṛs collectively; also to the gods either generally or in-
dividually.
	 4. Fuel used on sacrificial occasions.
	 f. (-णी) A plant;
also गुरुस्कन्ध.
 E. तृप् to satisfy or be satisfied, affixes णिच् and ल्युट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्पणेच्छु|तर्पणेच्छुः
तर्पणेच्छु mfn. (-च्छुः-च्छुः-च्छु) Desirous of satisfaction, or of receiving
after death the presentation of water called Tarpana.
	 m. (-च्छुः) A
name of BHISHMA.
 E. तर्पण as above, इच्छु to wish, and उ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्पित
तर्पित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Pleased, satisfied.
 E. तृप् to be pleased, क्त affix,
with इट्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्पिन्
तर्पिन् mfn. (-र्पी-र्पिणी-र्पि)
	 1. Giving pleasure or satisfaction.
	 2. Offering
oblations to the manes, (who does so.)
	 f. (-णी) A plant, (Hibiscus
mutabilis.)
 E. तृप् to give pleasure, णिच्, णिनि and ङीप् affs.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्ब|तर्ब्ब
तर्ब r. 1st cl. (तर्बति) To go or move.
 E. भ्वा-प-सक-सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्बट|तर्बटः|तर्ब्बट
तर्बट m. (-टः) A year.
 E. तर्ब to go, अटन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्मन्|तर्म्मन्
तर्मन् n. (-र्म) The top or term of the sacrificial post.
 E. तॄ to pass up,
and मनिन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्ष|तर्षः
तर्ष m. (-र्षः)
	 1. Thirst.
	 2. Wish, desire.
	 3. The ocean.
	 4. A raft or
float.
	 5. The sun.
 E. तृष् to thirst, affix भावे घञ् or तॄ to pass over,
कर्मणि करणे वा स । समुद्रे भेलके च ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्षण|तर्षणं
तर्षण n. (-णं) Thirst, thirsting: it is also used metaphorically.
 E. तृष्
to thirst, affix भावे ल्युट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्षित|तर्षितः
तर्षित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Thirsting, a thirst, thirsty.
	 2. Desiring, wish-
ing for.
 E. तर्षो जातोऽस्य तारका० इतच् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्हि
तर्हि ind. Therefore.
 E. तद् that, and र्हिल् aff. तस्मिन् काले.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तल|तलं|तलः
तल r. 1st and 10th cls. (तलति तालयति-ते)
	 1. To be full or complete to.
2. To fix, to found.
	 3. To establish.
 E. चुरा० उभ० पक्षे भ्वा-पर-सक-सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तल|तलं|तलः
तल n. (-लं)
	 1. Essential nature, (in composition especially, as महीतलं
the earth itself, the very earth.)
	 2. Depth, bottom, lowness, in-
feriority of position, the place under or underneath.
	 3. A wood,
a forest.
	 4. A hole, a pit, a chasm.
	 5. Cause, origin, motive, the
root or seed of events.
	 6. Sole of the foot.
	 7. A slap with the
hand.
	 nf. (-लं-ला) A leathern fence worn by archers on the left
arm.
	 m. (-लः)
	 1. The palmyra tree.
	 2. The palm with extended
fingers.
	 3. The hilt or handle of a sword, &c.
	 4. Pressing the
strings of a lute with the left hand.
	 5. The stand or support of
any thing, that which is under or below it.
	 6. The fore arm.
	 7. A
span.
 E. तल् to fix, affix अच्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलक|तलकं|तलकः
तलक n. (-कं) A large pond.
 E. तल a hole, a hollow, and कन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलप्रहार|तलप्रहारः
तलप्रहार m. (-रः) A slap or blow with the palm of the hand.
 E. तल the
open palm, प्रहार striking.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलवारण|तलवारणं
तलवारण n. (-णं) A sword.
 E. तल, and वारण opposing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलसारक|तलसारकं
तलसारक n. (-कं) A martingale.
	 2. A vessel from which horses are fed.
E. तल below, सृ to go, in the causal form, कप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलहृदय|तलहृदयं
तलहृदय n. (-यं) The centre of the sole of the foot.
 E. तल below, and हृदय
heart.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलाची
तलाची f. (-ची) A mat, one made of reeds or bamboos.
 E. तल below,
अञ्च् to go, क्विप् affix, fem. form.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलातल|तलातलं
तलातल n. (-लं) One of the seventh divisions of the infernal regions.
E. तल below, reiterated, as down-adown.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलिका
तलिका f. (-का) A martingale.
 E. तल् to fix, and ठन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलित|तलितं
तलित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Fixed, placed, having a bottom.
	 n. (-तं) Fried
meat.
 E. तल् to be fixed or to satisfy, इतच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलिन|तलिनं|तलिनः
तलिन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं)
	 1. Separate, having spaces or interstices.
2. Clear, clean.
	 3. Small, little.
	 4. Delicate, thin, spare.
	 5. below,
situated under or underneath.
	 n. (-नं) A bed, a couch or cot. E.
तन् to fix or be fixed, Uṇādi affix इनन्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलिम|तलिमं
तलिम n. (-मं)
	 1. Ground prepared for the site of a dwelling, &c. see
कुट्टिम.
	 2. A bed, a couch or cot.
	 3. An awning.
	 4. A scymitar, a
large sacrificial sword or knife.
 E. तल् to fix, इमन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलुन|तलुनः
तलुन m. (-नः)
	 1. Air, wind.
	 2. A youth.
	 f. (-नी) A young woman.
 E. तल
to fix, उनन् affix: see तरुण.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलेक्षण|तलेक्षणः
तलेक्षण m. (-णः) A hog.
 E. तल down, and ईक्षण looking. तले ईक्षणमस्य ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलोदरी
तलोदरी f. (-री) A mistress or wife.
 E. कृशोदर्य्यां भार्य्यायाम् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलोदा
तलोदा f. (-दा) A river.
 E. तल steep, down, उद water. तले उदकं यस्यां
उदकस्य उदादेशः ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तल्क|तल्कं
तल्क n. (-ल्कं) A wood, a forest.
 E. तल् to fix, कन् Uṇādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तल्प|तल्पं|तल्पः
तल्प mfn. (-ल्पः-ल्पा-ल्पं)
	 1. A bed.
	 2. An upper story, a room on the top of
a house, a turret, a tower or keep.
	 3. A wife.
 E. तल् to fix, Uṇādi
affix पक्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तल्पकीट|तल्पकीटः
तल्पकीट m. (-टः) A bug.
 E. तल्प a bed, and कीट an insect.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तल्पज
तल्पज mfn. (-जः-जा-जं)
	 1. Born of a wife, (as a son by an appointed
substituted.)
	 2. Produced in or from a bed, &c.
 E. तल्प and ज born.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तल्पन|तल्पनं
तल्पन n. (-नं) An elephant's back.
	 2. The exterior muscles of the back.
E. तल्प a nominal verb, to be as a bed, to be broad, &c. क्विप् and
कर्त्तरि ल्यु affs.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तल्ल|तल्लं|तल्लः
तल्ल m. (-ल्लः) A reservoir, a large pond, a tank or Talao.
	 f. (-ल्ला)
	 1. A
young woman.
	 2. A boat.
	 3. The wife of VARUṆA.
	 n. (-ल्लं) A pit,
a hole.
 E. तल deep, depth, and ल to be or have, from ली with ड aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तल्लज|तल्लजः
तल्लज m. (-जः) Excellence, happiness; also attributively, Excellent,
happy: used in apposition as an epithet, the gender is not chang-
ed, as कुमारीतल्लजः an excellent maiden.
 E. तत् that, (that which is
every thing,) and लज् to attain, affix अच् । तत् प्रसिद्धं यथा तथा लजति
लज कान्तौ अच् । प्रशस्ते ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तल्लिका
तल्लिका f. (-का) A key.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तल्व|तल्वं
तल्व n. (-ल्वं) Scent arising from the rubbing of fragrant substances.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तवक|तवकः
तवक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Thine.
 E. कन् added to तव to poss. case of त्वं.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तवक्षीर|तवक्षीरं
तवक्षीर n. (-रं) Milk and water.
 E. तु-अच् । नित्यकर्म० ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तवराज|तवराजः
तवराज m. (-जः) A sort of sugar prepared from a species of Hedysa-
rum.
 E. तु-अच् । तवः पूर्णः सन् राजते राज-अच् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तविष|तविषः
तविष m. (-षः)
	 1. Heaven, paradise.
	 2. The ocean.
	 f. (-षी)
	 1. A river.
	 2.
The daughter of INDRA.
	 3. Strength, (in the dialect of the Vedas.)
E. तव a Sautra root, टिषच् Uṇādi affix; also ताविष and तवीष.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तवीष|तवीषः
तवीष m. (-षः)
	 1. Heaven.
	 2. The ocean.
	 3. Gold. E. See the last.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तष्ट|तष्टः
तष्ट mfn. (-ष्टः-ष्टा-ष्टं) Pared, made thin.
 E. तक्ष् to pare, affix क्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तष्टृ
तष्टृ m. (-ष्टा)
	 1. A carpenter.
	 2. A name of VISWAKARMA.
	 3. One of
the twelve Adityas or suns; also तष्टृ.
 E. तक्ष् to pare, तृच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तस
तस (इर उ) इरतसु r. 4th cl. (तस्यति) To throw, to toss, to direct, to send,
(इ) तसि r. 1st and 10th cls. (तंसति तंसयति-ते) or with अव prefixed
(अवतंसति अवतंसयति) To adorn to dress or decorate.
 E. चु० उभ० पक्षे
भ्वादि० पर० सक० सेट् इदित् । दिवा-पर-सक-सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तसर|तसरः
तसर m. (-रः) A shuttle.
 E. तन् to stretch, क्सरन् Uṇādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तस्कर|तस्करः
तस्कर m. (-रः)
	 1. A thief, a robber.
	 2. The ear.
	 3. A kind of potherb,
(Medicago esculenta.)
	 3. A tree, (Vangueria spinosa:) see मदन.
	 f.
(-री) A passionate woman.
 E. तत् that, used depreciatingly, and कर
who does, सुट् substituted for the final of तत्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तस्करता
तस्करता f. (-ता)
	 1. Thievishness, thieving.
	 2. Hearing, catching by the
ear.
 E. तल् added to the last; also with त्व, तस्करत्वं.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताटङ्क|ताटंक|ताटंकः|ताटङ्कः
ताटङ्क m. (-ङ्कः) An ornament of the ear, a large sort of ear-ring: see
ताडङ्क and तालपत्र.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताटस्थ्य|ताटस्थ्यं
ताटस्थ्य n. (-स्थ्यं)
	 1. Indifference, disregard, exemption from attachment
or aversion.
	 2. Proximity.
 E. तटस्थ, and ष्यञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताड|ताडः
ताड m. (-डः)
	 1. Beating, whipping, inflicting bodily chastisement.
	 2.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-b" target="_blank">Page308-b+ 60</a>]
Sound, noise.
	 3. A handful of grass, corn, &c. a sheaf.
	 4. A moun-
tain.
	 5. A kind of grass, (Andropogon serratus.)
	 f. (-डि or -डी) A
kind of palm, (Coripha talliera, Rox.) See ताली.
 E. तड् to give
pain, to beat, &c. affix भावे अच् कर्मणि अच् वा ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताडका
ताडका f. (-का) A female demon, killed by RAMA.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताडकाफल|ताडकाफलं
ताडकाफल n. (-लं) Large cardamoms.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताडङ्क|ताडंक|ताडंकः|ताडङ्कः
ताडङ्क m. (-ङ्कः) A kind of ear-ring: see तालपत्र.
 E. तड् to shine, अङ्कन्
affix; also ड being changed to ट, ताटङ्क.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताडघ|ताडघः
ताडघ mfn. (-घः-घा-घं) Beating with a whip or with strokes of any kind.
E. ताड, and घ who strikes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताडघात|ताडघातः
ताडघात m. (-तः) An artificer who beats or hammers any thing.
 E. ताड,
and घात a blow.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताडन|ताडनं
ताडन n. (-नं) Beating, whipping, &c.
	 f. (-नी) A whip.
 E. तड् to beat,
भावे ल्युट् affix, fem. affix ङीष् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताडनीय
ताडनीय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) To be beaten, punishable.
 E. तड् to beat, अनी-
यर् affix; also ताड्य and ताडयितव्य.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताडपत्र|ताडपत्रं
ताडपत्र n. (-त्रं) An ornament of the ear.
 E. ताड the Tal tree, and पत्र
a leaf, an earring resembling this: see तालपत्र.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताडयितृ
ताडयितृ mfn. (-ता-त्री-तृ) Who or what beats or strikes.
 E. तड् to beat,
तृच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताडयित्वा
ताडयित्वा ind. Having beaten.
 E. तड् to beat, क्त्वा aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताडित
ताडित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Struck, beaten.
 E. तड् to beat, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताडुल|ताडुलः
ताडुल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Beating, who or what beats or strikes.
 E. तड् to
give pain, उल Uṇādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताड्य
ताड्य mfn. (-ड्यः-ड्या-ड्यं) To be beaten or chastised, what may or ought
to be punished, punishable.
 E. तड् to beat, ण्यत् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताड्यमान|ताड्यमानः
ताड्यमान mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Being beaten or struck.
	 m. (-नः) A musical
instrument, which is struck, as a drum, &c.
 E. तड् to beat or strike,
शानच् affix, यक् inserted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताण्डव|तांडव|तांडवं|ताण्डवं|तांडवः|ताण्डवः
ताण्डव mn. (-वः-वं)
	 1. Dancing, especially with violent gesticulation,
and particularly applied to the frantic dance of the god ŚIVA,
and his votaries.
	 2. A sort of grass, (Saccharum procerum.)
	 m.
(-वः) In prosody, a tribrach or foot of three sort syllables.
 E. तण्डु
the name of the Muni, by whom the style of dancing was first
taught, affix अण्, or तडि to beat, and अव aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताण्डवतालिक|ताण्डवतालिकः
ताण्डवतालिक m. (-कः) A name of NANDI, one of ŚIVA'S principal
attendants.
 E. ताण्डव ŚIVA'S dancing. and तालिक accompanied with
music, from ताल tune or time, and ठञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताण्डवप्रिय|तांडवप्रिय|ताण्डवप्रियः
ताण्डवप्रिय m. (-यः) A name of ŚIVA.
 E. ताण्डव dancing, and प्रिय
fond of.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताण्डि|तांडिः|ताण्डिः
ताण्डि f. (-ण्डिः) The science of dancing.
 E. तण्डु the teacher of this art,
and इञ् off.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तात|तातः
तात mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Venerable, reverend, respectable.
	 m. (-तः)
	 1. A
father.
	 2. A term of affection addressed to any person, but especi-
ally to a junior or inferior, as हे तात oh! child, &c.
 E. तन् to extend,
(his race or fame,) क्त affix, and the vowel made long.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तातगु|तातगुः
तातगु mfn. (-गुः-गुः-गु) Paternal, relating or belonging to the father.
	 m.
(-गुः) A paternal uncle.
 E. तात a father, गु who goes or is, from गम्
to go, with डु aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तातजनयित्री
तातजनयित्री f. du. always (-त्र्यौ) Father and mother, parents.
 E. तात
father, and जनयितृ mother.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताततुल्य|ताततुल्यः
ताततुल्य m. (-ल्यः) A paternal uncle, or the most respectable of the
male relations.
 E. तात a father, and तुल्य like, equal to.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तातन|तातनः
तातन m. (-नः) A wagtail. तातं प्रशस्तं नृत्यति नृत-ड । खञ्चनखगे ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तातल|तातलः
तातल m. (-लः)
	 1. A fatherly relative, one who may be considered as a
father.
	 2. Sickness, disease.
	 3. An iron club or spike.
	 4. Cooking
or maturing.
	 5. Heat, physical or morbid.
 E. तापं लाति ला-क पृषो० ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताति|तातिः
ताति m. (-तिः) A son.
 E. ताय to spread, (the race,) क्तिच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तात्कालिक|तात्कालिकः
तात्कालिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Relating to any particular moment of time.
E. तत्काल and ठङ् aff. ञिठ वा ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=308-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तात्पर्य्य|तात्पर्य|तात्पर्यं|तात्पर्य्यं
तात्पर्य्य n. (-र्य्यं)
	 1. Object, purpose, intent, design.
	 2. Meaning, purport.
3. Explanation.
 E. तत्पर intent, ष्यञ् aff. तत्परस्य भावः ।
