<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तादृश्
तादृश् mfn. (-दृक्) Such like, like him or it, &c.
 E. तद् that, दृश् to see,
affix क्विप्; also with ट affix तादृश mfn. (-शः-शी-शं) or with क्स affix,
तादृक्ष mfn. (-क्षः-क्षा-क्षं.)
