<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तानूर|तानूरः
तानूर m. (-रः) A whirlpool.
 E. तन् to spread, ऊरण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=309-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तान्त|तांत|तान्तः
तान्त mfn. (-न्तः-न्ता-न्तं)
	 1. Wearied, fatigued, distressed.
	 2. Languid, lan-
guishing.
	 3. Faded, withered, blighted.
 E. तम् to be distressed,
affix क्त.
