<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तान्त्र
तान्त्र mfn. (-न्त्रः-न्त्री-न्त्रं)
	 1. Stringed, having wires or strings, (as a
musical instrument.)
	 2. Relating to the Tantras, &c.
 E. तन्त्र, and
अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=309-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तान्त्रिक|तांत्रिक|तान्त्रिकः
तान्त्रिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं)
	 1. Relating to the Tantras, taught by them,
following them, &c.
	 2. Relating to a thread, &c.
	 m. (-कः)
	 1. A
scholar, a man completely versed in any science.
	 2. A follower
of the doctrine taught by the Tantras.
 E. तन्त्र truth, &c. and ठक् aff.
तन्त्रं सिद्धान्तं वेत्ति शास्त्रमधीते वा ।
