तापहर
तापहर mfn. (-रः-री-रं)
	 1. Cooling, removing heat.
	 2. Consoling, alle-
viating distress.
	 f. (-री) A dish, a sort of soup, of pulse and grain,
first fried with ghee and turmeric, and afterwards boiled with salt
and sugar.
 E. ताप, and हर what removes. तापं हरति हृ-ट ।
