<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तापिच्छ|तापिच्छः
तापिच्छ m. (-च्छः) A tree bearing dark blossoms, the Tamala: see the
next, तापिनं छादयति छद-ड पृषो० । तमालवृक्षे ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=309-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तापिञ्छ|तापिञ्छः
तापिञ्छ m. (ञ्छः) The Tamala tree, (Xanthocymus pictorius.)
 E. तापिन्
a person heated, and छद what covers or shelters, ड affix, deriv.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=309-b" target="_blank">Page309-b+ 60</a>]
irr. also the final being dropped तापिच्छ, and with जि to conquer
or remove तापिञ्ज ।
