<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तापिन्
तापिन् mfn. (-पी-पिनी-पि) Oppressed by heat, morbid, moral or physical;
any thing heated or growing.
	 m. (-पी) One of the defied saints
of the BAUDDHA.
 E. तप् to heat, affix णिनि.
