<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताप्य|ताप्यं
ताप्य mn. (-प्यः-प्यं) A mineral substance, sulphate of iron.
 E. तापी the
river, and यत् affix; said to be procured from the Tapi river;
also with कन् added ताप्यकम् ।
