<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम|तामः
ताम m. (-मः) An object of terror.
	 2. Fault, defect, vice.
	 3. Anxiety,
distress.
	 4. Desire.
 E. तम् to be distressed, affix करणे भावे वा घञ् ।
