<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तामर|तामरं
तामर n. (-रं)
	 1. Water.
	 2. Ghee or oiled butter.
 E. ताम desire, and र
from रा to get or have; desirable for drinking, &c. तामं ग्लानिं रवते
हिनस्ति रुङ् बधे वा ड ।
