<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तामरस|तामरसं
तामरस n. (-सं)
	 1. A lotus, (Nymphæa nelumbo.)
	 2. Copper.
	 3. Gold.
4. A species of the Jagati metre.
 E. तामर water, सम् to abide, and
ड affix; or ताम desire, and रस here implying object. तामरे जले सलि
सस-ड ।
