<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तामलिप्त|तामलिप्तं
तामलिप्त nf. (-प्तं-प्ती) A district in the south of Bengal, commonly Tam-
look.
 E. ताम distress, trouble, and लिप्त smeared, affected.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=309-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तामस|तामसं|तामसः
तामस mfn. (-सः-सी-सं)
	 1. Affected by or appertaining to the third qua-
lity, that of darkness or vice: belonging to it as a Purana, a sys-
tem of philosophy, a ceremonial rite, &c.
	 2. Dark, of or belong-
ing to darkness.
	 m. (-सः)
	 1. A snake.
	 2. An incendiary, a malignant
and mischievous man, a villain.
	 3. An owl.
	 4. The fourth Menu.
	 f.
(-सी) A dark night.
	 2. A name of the goddess DURGĀ.
	 n. (-सं) The
quality of darkness.
 E. तमस् the quality of drakness, &c. affix
अण् । तमः अस्ति अस्य ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=309-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तामसिक|तामसिकं
तामसिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं)
	 1. Of belonging to the quality of darkness,
derived from it, teaching lessons so characterised, &c.
	 2. Of or be-
longing to physical drakness.
 E. तमस्, and ठञ् aff. तमसा निर्वृत्तम् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=309-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तामिस्र|तामिस्रं|तामिस्रः
तामिस्र n. (-स्रं)
	 1. Great darkness.
	 2. A hell, that of deep gloom.
	 m.
(-स्रः) Indignation at being disappointed or slighted.
 E. तमिस्र, and
अण् added. तमिस्रा तमस्ततिः अस्ति अत्र ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=309-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्बूल|तांबूल|तांबूलं|ताम्बूलं
ताम्बूल nf. (-ल-ली)
	 1. Areca, (Areca faufel or catechu.)
	 2. Betel, (Piber
betel,) or its pungent leaf, which together with the areca nut and
catechu, and sometimes caustic lime and spices, is eaten very
generally by the natives of the east.
	 n. (-लं) The areca nut.
	 m.
(-लः) San, a plant, (Crotolaria juncea.)
 E. तम् to desire, affix ऊलच्
and वुक् augment, the radical vowel made long.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=309-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्बूलकरङ्क|तांबूलकरंक|ताम्बूलकरङ्कः
ताम्बूलकरङ्क m. (-ङ्कः) The Pan-dan or betel-box.
 E. ताम्बूल as above, and
करङ्क a hollowed cocoanut, &c. which the Pan-box usually resem-
bles. (पानेर डिपा) ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=309-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्बूलद|तांबूलद|ताम्बूलदः
ताम्बूलद m. (-दः) The betel-bearer; kings and great men being attended
by an officer of this description.
 E. ताम्बूल betel, and द who gives.
ताम्बूलं ददाति दा-क ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=309-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्बूलपेटिका|तांबूलपेटिका
ताम्बूलपेटिका f. (-का) A betel-box.
 E. ताम्बूल, and पेटिका a casket.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=309-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्बूलराग|ताम्बूलरागः
ताम्बूलराग m. (-गः) A kind of pulse, (Ervum lens.)
 E. ताम्बूल betel, and
राग colour. ताम्बूलकृतो रागः ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=309-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्बूलवल्ली|तांबूलवल्ली
ताम्बूलवल्ली f. (-ल्ली) A small plant bearing a pungent leaf, which with
the areca nut, a small quantity of caustic lime (or Chunam) and
catechu, and occasionally cloves, cardamoms, &c. form the Pan or
betel of the Asiatic, (Piper betel.)
 E. ताम्बूल the same, and वल्ली root-
stalk; also with कन् added ताम्बूलवल्लिका.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=309-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्बूलवाहक|तांबूलवाहक|ताम्बूलवाहकः
ताम्बूलवाहक m. (-कः) A betel-bearer, a servant attached to men of rank
to prepare the Pan, and carry the betel-box.
 E. ताम्बूल, and वाहक
who carries; also ताम्बूलवाहिन् m. (-ही.)
