ताय
ताय (ऋ) तायृ r. 1st cl. (तायते)
	 1. To spread, to extend, to proceed in a
continuous stream or line.
	 2. To cherish or protect.
 E. भ्वा-आ-सक-
सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=310-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तायिक|तायिकः
तायिक m. (-कः) A country; or plu.
	 m. (-काः) 1ts inhabitants.
 E. ताय् to
cherish, ठञ् aff. ताये वृद्धौ साधु ठञ् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=310-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तार|तारं|तारः
तार mfn. adj. (-रः-रा-रं)
	 1. High, as a note in music.
	 2. Radiant, shin-
ing, radiating.
	 3. Clean, clear.
	 4. Good, excellent, well flavoured,
&c.
	 m. (-रः)
	 1. A high note or tone in music.
	 2. Elegance of a
pearl.
	 3. A clear or beautiful pearl.
	 4. Crossing, passing over, &c.
5. A wire, a cord.
	 6. The mystic monosyllable Om.
	 7. A mystical
monosyllable in the Tantras.
	 7. The name of a monkey chief, the
son BALI. N. (-रं)
	 1. Silver.
	 2. A pearl.
	 mfn. subst. (-रः-रा-रं)
	 1.
The pupil of the eye.
	 2. A star in general, a planet, as asterism,
&c.
	 f. (-रा) A female deity peculiar to the Bauddha sect.
	 2. The
wife of VṚHASPATI.
	 3. The wife of the monkey king BALI.
	 4.
A name of the goddes DURGĀ.
 E. तॄ to pass or proceed; also in
the causal, to cause to pass, and णिच्, अच् or घञ् aff. संसारार्णवात्
तारयति स्वजापकान् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=310-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारक|तारकं|तारकः
तारक mfn. (-कः-का-कं)
	 1. A protector, a preserver.
	 2. One who causes or
enables to pass or go over.
	 n. (-कं)
	 1. The eye.
	 2. A Mantra, a
formula addressed to Rama, as Ramaya namah.
	 nf. (-कं-का)
	 1. The
pupil of the eye.
	 2. A star.
	 mn. (-कः-कं) A float or raft.
	 m.
(-कः) A pilot, a helmsman or steersman.
	 2. The man of a demon
or evil spirit destroyed by KARTIKEYA.
 E. तॄ to pass or cause to
pass, and णिच् and ण्वुल् affixes; or कन् added to the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=310-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारकजित्
तारकजित् m. (-जित्) A name of KARTIKEYA.
 E. तारक a demon, and जित्
conqueror: also similar names, as तारकारि, तारकहन्, तारकरिपु,
&c. तारकं दैत्यं जयति जि-क्विप् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=310-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारकारि|तारकारिः
तारकारि m. (-रिः) The deity KARTIKEYA.
 E. तारक and अरि a foe: see
the preceding.
