<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालीश|तालीशं
तालीश n. (-शं) A tree, commonly Talis or its leaf.
 E. ताल the corypha,
ईश what resembles. तालीव रीगान् शवति शो-ड ।
