<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तितउ|तितउः
तितउ mn. (-उः-उ) A sieve, a cribble.
 E. तन् to spread or scatter, (grain,
&c.) उउ Uṇādi affix, and the radical reiterated.
