<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तितिक्षा
तितिक्षा f. (-क्षा) Patience, resignation, sufferance, endurance.
 E. तिज् to
bear, भावे अ and टाप् affixes, and the root repeated. स्वार्थे सन् भावे अ ।
