<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तितिक्षित|तितिक्षितः
तितिक्षित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Patient, resigned.
 E. तिज् to bear, affix इतच्,
and the root reduplicate.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=312-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तितिक्षु|तितिक्षुः
तितिक्षु mfn. (-क्षुः-क्षुः-क्षु) Patient, resigned.
 E. तिज् to bear, reduplicated,
and स्वार्थे सन् and उ affs.
