<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तितिभ|तितिभः
तितिभ m. (-भः) An insect, coccinella.
 E. तितीति भणति भण-ड । इन्द्रगोपकीटे ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=312-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तितिल|तितिलं
तितिल n. (-लं)
	 1. One of the seven Karanas, or astronomical periods so
called.
	 2. A bowl or bucket.
	 3. A sort of sweetmeat made of sesa-
mum, ground and baked with sugar.
 E. तिल to go, affix क, and the
radical reiterated: see तैतिल.
