	 1. Wish to cross.
	 2. Wish to be freed from life.
 E. तॄ to
cross, desid. form, अङ् and टाप् affs.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=313-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तितीर्षु
तितीर्षु mfn. (-र्षुः-र्षुः-र्षु)
	 1. Desirous of crossing.
	 2. Desirous of emancipa-
tion from existence.
 E. तॄ to cross, desid. form affix उ.
