<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तित्तिरि|तित्तिरिः
तित्तिरि m. (रिः)
	 1. The francoline parridge.
	 2. The name of a Muni,
and one of the early teachers of the Taittiri or Black Yajur Veda.
3. The Yajur Veda named after its teachers.
 E. तित्ति an imitative
sound, रा to make, affix कि; also with क affix तित्तिर.
