तिन्तिड|तिंतिड|तिंतिडः|तिन्तिडः
तिन्तिड mf. (-डः-डी) The tamarind tree, (Tamarindous Indica.)
	 m. (-डः)
1. The name of a demon.
	 2. Acid seasoning, sour sauce.
	 3. An
inauspicious period, the evil aspect of planets, &c.
	 f. (-डी) Emblic
myrobalan.
 E. तिम् to be damp or moist, अच् affix, the root redu-
plicated, and ड substituted for the final म.
