तिन्दु|तिंदु|तिंदुः|तिन्दुः
तिन्दु m. (-न्तुः) A species of ebony, from the fruit of which a kind of
resin is obtained, that is used in India as pitch for caulking vessels,
&c. (Diospyros glutinosa.)
 E. तिम् to be wet or moist, affix कु;
also with कन् added, तिन्दुक ।
