तिन्दुक|तिंदुक|तिंदुकं|तिन्दुकं|तिंदुकः|तिन्दुकः
तिन्दुक mf. (-कः-की) A sort of ebony, (Diospyros glutinosa.)
	 f. (-की) The
resinous fruit of this tree: see the preceding. Also with इ substi-
tuted for the final तिन्दुकि.
	 n. (-कं) A Karṣa, the measure.
 E. तिन्दु,
and कन् added.
