<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिरस्करिणी
तिरस्करिणी f. (-णी)
	 1. An outer tent, a Kanat, a wall or screen of cloth
surrounding the principal tent.
	 2. A veil.
	 3. A curtain.
 E. तिरस्
secret, and करिणी making; also with the antepen. vowel long,
तिरस्कारिणी.
