तिरोधान|तिरोधानं
तिरोधान n. (-नं)
	 1. A cover or concealment, a sheath, a veil, a cloth or
cloak, any thing which withholds another from sight.
	 2. Disap-
pearance, the being hidden or the act of hiding or vanishing. E.
तिरस् concealing, and धान having or holding. तिर + धा-भावे ल्युट् ।
