तिर्य्यग्योन्यन्वय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Of the brute kind.
	 m. (-यः) The race or
kind of animals, birds, &c.
 E. तिर्य्यग्योनि, and अन्वय race.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=314-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिर्य्यच्|तिर्यच्
तिर्य्यच् or तिर्य्यञ्च् mfn. (तिर्य्यङ् तिरश्ची तिर्य्यक्) Moving tortuously, going
crookedly or awry, (the neuter is also used adverbially: see
तिर्य्यक् m. (-र्य्यङ्)
	 1. An animal, a quadruped.
	 2. A bird, or any
animal moving tortuously.
	 f. (-र्य्यञ्ची) The female of an animal, a
beast or bird.
 E. तिरस् crookedly, अञ्च् to go, affix क्विप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=314-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिर्य्यञ्च्|तिर्यञ्च्
तिर्य्यच् or तिर्य्यञ्च् mfn. (तिर्य्यङ् तिरश्ची तिर्य्यक्) Moving tortuously, going
crookedly or awry, (the neuter is also used adverbially: see
तिर्य्यक् m. (-र्य्यङ्)
	 1. An animal, a quadruped.
	 2. A bird, or any
animal moving tortuously.
	 f. (-र्य्यञ्ची) The female of an animal, a
beast or bird.
 E. तिरस् crookedly, अञ्च् to go, affix क्विप्.
