तिष्य|तिष्यः
तिष्य mfn. (-ष्यः-ष्या-ष्यं) Auspicious, fortunate, lucky.
	 m. (-ष्यः)
	 1. The
eighth Nakshatra or lunar mansion, an asterism figured by an
arrow, and containing three stars, of which one is Cancri.
	 2. The
month Pausha, (December-January.)
	 3. The Kali Yuga, the fourth
and present age.
	 f. (-ष्या) Emblic myrobalan, (Phyllanthus emblica.)
E. तुष् to please er delight, affix क्यप्, and इत् substituted for the
penultimate.
