तीव्रवेदना
तीव्रवेदना f. (-ना) Agony, excessive pain, the pain of damnation.
 E. तीव्र
exceeding, and वेदना pain.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=315-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तु
तु r. 2nd cl. (तौति or तवति)
	 1. To go or move.
	 2. To thrive or increase.
3. To injure, to hurt or kill.
	 4. To become full. According to some
authorities this is merely a Sautra root. वृत्तौ, वृद्धौ अक० हिंसायां जेतरि
सक० अदा० प० अनिट् ।
