<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तु
तु ind. A particle, implying.
	 1. Difference, (but, or.)
	 2. Disjunction,
(but, again, further, other.)
	 3. Connection, (and, moreover.)
	 4. As-
severation, (indeed.)
	 4. An expletive.
 E. तुद्-डु ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=315-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
