तुङ्ग|तुंग|तुङ्गः
तुङ्ग mfn. (-ङ्गः-ङ्गा-ङ्गं)
	 1. High, elevated, lofty.
	 2. Chief, principal.
	 3.
Passionate, hot.
	 m. (-ङ्गः)
	 1. A tree, (Rottleria tinctoria.)
	 2. A
mountain.
	 3. The planet Mercury.
	 4. The superior apsis or aphe-
lion of a planet.
	 5. Top, vertex, altitude.
	 6. The cocoanut tree.
	 f.
(-ङ्गी)
	 1. A kind of basil, (Ocymum gratissimum.)
	 2. Turmeric.
	 3.
Night.
	 f. (-ङ्गा) Bamboo manna.
 E. तुजि to guard, to dwell, to hurt,
&c. affix घञ् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=315-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुङ्गक|तुङ्गकः
तुङ्गक m. (-कः) A tree, (Rottleria tinctoria.)
 E. स्वार्थे कन् added to the
preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=315-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुङ्गता
