<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुरङ्गवक्त्र|तुरंगवक्त्र|तुरङ्गवक्त्रः
तुरङ्गवक्त्र m. (-क्त्रः) A Kinnara or chorister of INDRA'S heaven.
 E. तुरङ्ग a
horse, and वक्त्र a face.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=317-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुरङ्गवदन|तुरंगवदन|तुरङ्गवदनः
तुरङ्गवदन m. (-नः) A celestial chorister.
 E. तुरङ्ग a horse, and वदन a face;
these beings are described as having the bodies of men, and the
heads of horse; also similar compounds, as तुरङ्गानन, तुरङ्गवक्त्र,
तुरङ्गास्य, अश्ववक्त्र, &c.
