<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुष|तुषः
तुष r. 4th cl. (ञि, औ) ञिऔतुष (तुष्यति) To be satisfied or content, to be
pleased or delighted.
 E. दिवा-प-ऌदित् अक-सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=318-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुष|तुषः
तुष mf. (-षः-षा)
	 1. The husk or chaff of rice, &c.
	 2. Beleric myrobalan.
E. तुष् to please or be pleased, affix क.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=318-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुषग्रह|तुषग्रहः
तुषग्रह m. (-हः) Agni or fire.
 E. तुष chaff, and ग्रह who seizes. तुषेण गृह्यते
गृह-कर्मणि अप् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=318-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुषसार|तुषसारः
तुषसार m. (-रः) Agni or fire.
 E. तुष chaff, and सार who embraces, from
सृ to go, with अण् aff. तुषं सरति अनुसरति ।
