<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुषानल|तुषानलः
तुषानल m. (-लः)
	 1. A conflagration of chaff, or of the husk of corn.
	 2.
A capital punishment, burning; twisting dry straw, &c. round
the limbs of a criminal, and setting it on fire.
 E. तुष, and अनल fire.
