<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुषार|तुषारः
तुषार mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Cold, frigid, frosty.
	 m. (-रः)
	 1. Frost.
	 2. Cold.
	 3.
Thin rain, mist.
	 4. Ice or snow.
	 5. The name of a country.
 E. तुष्
to please, Uṇādi affix आरन्.
