<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुषारकण|तुषारकणः
तुषारकण m. (-णः)
	 1. A dew drop.
	 2. An icicle.
	 3. Hoar frost.
 E. तुषार,
and कण a particle.
