तुष्टिकर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Pleasing, satisfying.
 E. तुष्टि, and कर what makes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=318-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

