तूल|तूलं|तूलः
तूल r. 1st cl. (तूलति)
	 1. To dismiss, to send forth or turn out.
	 2. To
ascertain quantity or weight; some make this a root of the tenth
class (तूलयते.)
 E. भ्वा-पर-सक-सेट् । चु-आ-सक-सेट् ।
