तूल|तूलं|तूलः
तूल n. (-लं)
	 1. The mulberry. (Morus Indica.)
	 2. Æther, the heaven or
atmosphere.
	 mn. (-लः-लं) Cotton.
	 f. (-ला-ली) The wick of a lamp, or
cotton twisted into a similar form for applying unguents, &c.
	 f.
(-ली)
	 1. Indigo.
	 2. A weaver's fibrous stick or brush.
	 3. A painter's
brush, &c. see तुली and तुरी; also तूलि.
 E. तूल् to dismiss, to send
forth, affix अच्, fem. affixes टाप् and ङीष् ।
