<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूलकार्म्मुक|तूलकार्मुक|तूलकार्म्मुकं
तूलकार्म्मुक n. (-कं) A bow which is used for cleaning cotton.
 E. तूल
cotton, and कार्म्मुक bow; also similar compounds, as तूलचाप,
तूलधनुः, &c.
