तूलिका
तूलिका f. (-का) A pencil, a painter's brush, or a stick with a fibrous
extremity used as one.
	 2. A mattress or quilt, a bed, a down or cot-
ton bed.
	 3. An ingot mould.
	 4. A rod, &c. dipped into crucibles to
try if their contents are in fusion.
	 5. A wick or twist of cotton
either for a lamp or for applying unguents, &c.
 E. तूली as above,
and कन् added.
