<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूवर|तूवरः
तूवर m. (-रः)
	 1. A bull without horns, though of an age to have them.
2. A beardless man.
	 3. A eunuch.
	 4. An astringent taste.
	 f. (-री)
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=319-a" target="_blank">Page319-a+ 60</a>]
A fragrant earth.
 E. तू to injure, वरच् affix, and the vowel option-
ally long, hence also तुवर and तुवरी; with कन् added तूवरिका and
तूवरीका.
