	 2. Wish, desire.
	 3. The daughter of KĀMA^1: see the
preceding.
	 4. A plant, (Commelina salicifolia:) see लाङ्गलिकी.
 E. तृष्
to thirst, affixes क and टाप्; also तृष्णा, तर्षा, &c.
[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20260617. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/264.
