तेजस्
तेजस् m. (-जाः) A name of Agni or fire.
	 n. (-जः)
	 1. Splendour, light,
lustre.
	 2. Dignity, consequence.
	 3. Srength, power.
	 4. Ardour,
spirit, energy.
	 5. Semen virile.
	 6. Fresh butter.
	 7. Impatience, in-
ability to bear or put up with.
	 8. Gold.
	 9. Bile, the bilious hu-
mour.
	 10. Marrow, the brain, &c.
	 11. Fame, glory.
	 12. Sharpness,
(metallic.)
	 13. Pungency.
	 14. Heat.
	 15. Bodily vigour.
	 16. Viva-
city.
 E. तिज् to sharpen or polish, affix भावे करणादौ असुन् ।
