त्रय nf. (-यं-यी)
	 1. The third.
	 2. (In composition) Tree, as गुणत्रयं the
three properties.
 E. त्रि, अयच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=322-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रयी
त्रयी f. (-यी)
	 1. The three Vedas collectively, that is, omitting the
Atharvan, which not being a text book for the customary reli-
gious rites of the Hindus, is considered very commonly rather as
an appendix to the other three, than a fourth work of equal
authority.
	 2. A matron, a married woman who has children living.
3. Intellect, understanding.
	 4. A plant, (Conyza serratula.)
 E. त्रि
three, अयच् or टयप् substituted for the final, fem. affix ङीप् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=322-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रयीतनु|त्रयीतनुः
त्रयीतनु m. (-नुः) The sun.
 E. त्रयी the three Vedas, and तनु diffusion;
celebrated through these sacred books, or because the Sama Veda,
and portions of the other Vedas, are said to have proceeded from
the sun.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=322-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रयीधर्म्म|त्रयीधर्म|त्रयीधर्मः|त्रयीधर्म्मः
त्रयीधर्म्म m. (-र्म्मः) Duty enjoined by the Vedas, modes of sacrifice, &c.
prescribed by them.
 E. त्रयी the three Vedas, and धर्म्म virtue.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=322-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रयीमुख|त्रयीमुखः
त्रयीमुख m. (-खः) A Bramhan.
 E. त्रयी the Vedas, and मुख the mouth.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=322-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रयोदश|त्रयोदशः
त्रयोदश mfn. (-शः-शी-शं) Thirteenth.
	 f. (-शी) The thirteenth day of the
lunar fortnight: see the next.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=323-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रयोदशन्
त्रयोदशन् mfn. plu. (-श) Thirteen.
 E. त्रयस् for त्रि three, and दशन् ten.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=323-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रस|त्रसं|त्रसः
त्रस (ई) त्रसी r. 1st and 4th cls. (त्रसति त्रस्यति)
	 1. To fear, to be afraid.
	 2.
To run, to go quickly. (इ) त्रसि r. 1st and 10th cls. (त्रंसति त्रंसयति-ते)
1. To speak.
	 2. To shine. Also त्रस r. 10th cl. (त्रसयति-ते)
	 1. To hold.
2. To seize or take.
	 3. To oppose to prevent or forbid.
	 4. To
frighten. भ्वा० दिवा० प० अक० सेट् । क्षुरा० उभ० अक० सेट् इदित् ।
