<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रस|त्रसं|त्रसः
त्रस mfn. (-सः-सा-सं) Moveable, loco-motive.
	 n. (-सं) A wood, a forest. E.
त्रस् to go, affix अच् or आधारे घञर्थे क ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=323-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रसर|त्रसरः
त्रसर m. (-रः)
	 1. A shuttle.
	 2. Weaving.
 E. त्रस् to go, affix अरन् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=323-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रसरेणु|त्रसरेणुः
त्रसरेणु mf. (-णुः) An atom or mote visible in a sunbeam, especially con-
sidered as an ideal weight, either of the lowest of nomination, or
equal to three, or according to some, thirty invisible atoms.
	 f.
(-णुः) A wife of the sun.
 E. त्रस move, and रेणु dust; also read त्र्यसरेणु ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=323-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रसुर|त्रसुरः
त्रसुर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Timid, fearful.
 E. त्रस् to fear, उरच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=323-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रस्त|त्रस्तः
त्रस्त mfn. (-स्तः-स्ता-स्तं)
	 1. Timid, fearful.
	 2. Frighted, alarmed.
	 3. Quick.
E. त्रस् to fear, affix क्त; also त्रस्नु.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=323-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रस्तरूप
त्रस्तरूप mfn. (-पः-पा-पं) Fearful, terrified.
 E. त्रस्त; and रूप form.
