<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिधामन्
त्रिधामन् mfn. (-मा-मा-म) Having three residences, &c.
	 m. (-मा)
	 1. A
name of VIṢṆU.
	 2. An appellation of ŚIVA.
	 3. Agni or fire.
	 4.
Death.
 E. त्रि three (worlds,) and धामन् abode.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=324-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिनयन|त्रिनयनः
त्रिनयन mfn. (-नः-नी-नं) Three-eyed, tri-ocular.
