 E. त्रिनेत्र ŚIVA, चूडा a crest, and मणि
a gem; being worn by that deity as his crest.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=324-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिपक्ष
त्रिपक्ष n. (-क्षं) A period of six weeks.
 E. त्रि, and पक्ष a fortnight.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=324-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिषताक
त्रिषताक m. (-कः)
