<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिपथगा
त्रिपथगा f. (-गा) The Ganges.
 E. त्रिपथ three roads, and गा who goes,
flowing through earth, heaven, and hell.
