<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिपिष्टप|त्रिपिष्टपं
त्रिपिष्टप n. (-पं)
	 1. Heaven, Svarga or paradise.
	 2. Sky, æther.
 E. पिष्टप
a world, and त्रि three, or the third; also त्रिविष्टप ।
