त्रिपुट|त्रिपुटः
त्रिपुट m. (-टः)
	 1. Pulse, pease of three kinds.
	 2. A bank or shore.
	 3.
A kind of vetch, (Cicer arietinum.)
	 4. A cubit.
	 5. A plant,
(Ruellia longifolia)
	 f. (-टा-टी) A plant, (Convolvulus turpethum.)
f. (-टा) Small cardamoms.
	 2. Arabian jasmine.
	 3. A goddess. E.
त्रि three, and पुट skin or coat of a seed, &c.
