त्रिपुरदहन|त्रिपुरदहनः
त्रिपुरदहन m. (-नः) A name of ŚIVA.
 E. त्रिपुर the country of Tripura,
and दहन burning, consuming; the Asura and his three cities
being destroyed by MAHADEVA; also similar names, as त्रिपुरजित्,
त्रिपुरसूदन, &c.
