त्रैवर्गिक
त्रैवर्गिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Relating to the three objects of life.
 E. त्रिवर्ग,
and ठञ् aff. त्रिवर्गाय हितम् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=326-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रैवर्णिक
त्रैवर्णिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Relating or belonging to three castes, the first
