	 nf. (-ष्ट्रं-ष्ट्री)
One of the lunar mansions, the fourteenth or Chitra.
	 f. (-ष्ट्री)
	 1. A
wife of SŪRYA, or the sun; also called SANJNA, the daughter of
VISWAKARMA.
	 2. A small car.
 E. त्वष्टृ the sun, or a carpenter, अण्
