त्सर
त्सर r. 1st cl. (त्सरति) To proceed fraudulently or crookedly. भ्वा-पर-
सक-सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्सरु|त्सरुः
त्सरु m. (-रुः) The hilt or handle of a sword, &c.
 E. त्सर् to go, Uṇādi
affix उन् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

थ|थं|थः
थ The seventeenth consonant of the Deva Nagri alphabet, and second
of the dental class; the aspirate of the preceding letter, and express-
ed by Th.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

थ|थं|थः
थ n. (थं)
	 1. Auspiciousness.
	 2. Fear, terror, 3. Preserving, preservation.
m. (थः)
	 1. A mountain.
	 2. Eating.
	 3. A disease.
 E. स्था to stand,
affix ड.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

थुड
थुड r. 6th cl. (थुडति) To cover, to screen, to clothe or hide. तुदा-पर-
सक-सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

थुत्कार|थुत्कारः
थुत्कार m. (-रः) The sound made in spitting.
