<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

थुथु
थुथु ind. Imitative sound of spitting.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

थुध
थुध r. 4th cl. (थुध्यति-ते) To become pure.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
