 E. दक्षिण south, and अचल mountain.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=329-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दक्षिणाचार|दक्षिणाचारः
दक्षिणाचार m. (-रः) A worshipper of Śakti according to the purer or
right-hand ritual.
 E. दक्षिण, and आचार observance.
