दण्डप्रणयन
दण्डप्रणयन n. (-नं) Inflicting punishment.
 E. दण्ड, and प्रणयन leading.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=330-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डभीति
दण्डभीति f. (-तिः) Fear of punishment.
 E. दण्ड, and भीति fear.
