<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डभृत्|दंडभृत्
दण्डभृत् mfn. (-भृत्)
	 1. Having a staff or stick.
	 2. Inflicting punishment.
m. (-भृत्)
	 1. A potter.
	 2. An epithet of Yama.
 E. दण्ड the stick or
handle of his wheel, and भृत् who possesses or works with.
