<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डमानव|दण्डमानवः
दण्डमानव m. (-वः)
	 1. An ascetic, one who used a staff.
	 2. A leader. E.
दण्ड, and मानव a man.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=330-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डयत्
दण्डयत् mfn. (-यन्-यन्ती-यत्) Punishing, amercing, chastising.
 E. दण्ड to
punish, शतृ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=330-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डयात्रा|दंडयात्रा
दण्डयात्रा f. (-त्रा)
	 1. Subjection or conquest of a region or quarter.
	 2. A
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=330-b" target="_blank">Page330-b+ 60</a>]
bridal procession.
	 3. Procession, moving in state or with attend-
ants.
 E. दण्ड punishment, &c. and यात्रा going.
