<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डलेश
दण्डलेश n. (-शं) A small fine.
 E. दण्ड, and लेश a little.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=330-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डवत्|दंडवत्|दण्डवन्त्
दण्डवत् ind. Prostrate, falling or lying prostrate.
 E. दण्ड a stick, and
वति aff.
