दण्डवादिन्|दंडवादिन्
दण्डवादिन् m. (-दी)
	 1. A doorkeeper or a warder.
	 2. One who threatens
another with punishment or castigation.
 E. दण्ड castigation, and
वद् to speak, to threaten, affix णिनि.
