<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डिक|दंडिक|दंडिकः|दण्डिकः
दण्डिक m. (-कः)
	 1. A mace-bearer, &c. one carrying a stick or staff.
	 2.
A fish, (Cyprinus dankena, HAM.)
 E. दण्ड a staff, and ठन् aff.
