<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दत्ताप्रदानिक|दत्ताप्रदानिकं
दत्ताप्रदानिक n. (-कं) Resumption of gifts; one of the eighteen titles of
