 E. दत्त, and अप्रदानिक not giving.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=331-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दत्तावधान
दत्तावधान mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Attentive.
 E. दत्त and अवधान attention.
