<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दत्तासन
दत्तासन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Having a seat given, requested to sit.
 E. दत्त,
and आसन a seat.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=331-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दत्ति|दत्तिः
दत्ति f. (-त्तिः) Gift, donation.
 E. दा to give, क्तिन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=331-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दत्त्रिम
दत्त्रिम mfn. (-मः-मा-मं)
	 1. Given.
	 2. Produced or effected by gifts.
