<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दद
दद mfn. (-दः-दा-दं) Who gives or bestows.
 E. दद to give, and श aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=331-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ददन|ददनं
ददन n. (-नं) Gift, giving, donation.
 E. दद to give, affix भावे ल्युट् ।
