दन्त|दंत|दंतः|दन्तः
दन्त m. (-न्तः)
	 1. A tooth.
	 2. The peak of a mountain.
	 3. The side or
ridge of a mountain.
	 4. An arbour.
	 5. Ivory, elephant's tooth.
	 f.
(-न्ती) A medicinal plant, commonly known by the same name Dan-
ti, (Croton polyandrum.)
 E. दम् to subdue, तन् Uṇādi aff.
