दन्तपत्रक|दंतपत्रक|दन्तपत्रकं
दन्तपत्रक n. (-कं) A kind of jasmine, (J. pubescens.)
 E. दन्त a tooth, and
पत्र a leaf: the petals or leaves of the flower resembling teeth in
colour and shape; this comparison is frequent among the poets.
