<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दन्तपुष्प|दंतपुष्प|दन्तपुष्पं
दन्तपुष्प m. (-प्पः) A plant, the flower of which is compared to a tooth,
(Strychnos potatorum.)
 E. दन्त a tooth, and पुप्प a flower. कुन्दे ।
