दन्तशठ|दंतशठ|दन्तशठः
दन्तशठ m. (-ठः)
	 1. Elephant or wood-apple: see कपित्थ.
	 2. Common
lime, (Citrus acida.)
	 3. A plant bearing an acid fruit, (Averhoa
carambola,)
	 4. An orange.
	 5. Sourness, acidity.
