<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दमन|दमनं|दमनः
दमन m. (-नः)
	 1. A hero.
	 2. A philosopher.
	 3. A kind of flower, common-
ly Dona, (Artemisia.)
	 n. (-नं) Taming, subduing.
 E. दम् to tame,
भावे ल्युट् aff.
