दर्ब्बिक
दर्ब्बिक m. (-कः) A ladle, a spoon.
	 f. (-का) A potherb: see दार्ब्बिका. E.
कन् added to the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=334-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दर्ब्बीकर
दर्ब्बीकर m. (-रः) A snake.
 E. दर्ब्बी the hood expanded, and कर who
makes.
