दर्भ m. (-र्भः)
	 1. Kusa or sacrificial grass, (Poa cynosuroides.)
	 2. A kind
of reed, (Saccharum spontaneum.)
	 3. Another species, (S.
cylindricum.)
 E. दृभि to collect, to arrange, affix घञ्; or दॄ to
tear, Uṇādi affix भ.
