<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दर्भपत्र|दर्भपत्रः
दर्भपत्र m. (-त्रः) A kind of grass, (Saccharum spontaneum.)
 E. दर्भ, and
पत्र a leaf.
