दर्श|दर्शः
दर्श m. (-र्शः)
	 1. Sight, seeing.
	 2. Day of new moon when it rises in-
visible.
	 3. Half monthly sacrifice, performed at the change of the
moon, by persons maintaining a perpetual fire.
 E. दृश् to see, affix
आधारे घञ्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=334-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
