<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दलेगन्धि|दलेगन्धिः
दलेगन्धि m. (-न्धिः) A plant, (Echites scholaris:) see सप्तपर्ण.
 E. दल in
the seventh case दले, in the leaf, and गन्धि fragrance.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=334-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दल्भ|दल्भः
दल्भ m. (-ल्भः)
	 1. Fraud, dishonesty.
	 2. Sin.
	 3. The name of a Muni or
saint.
	 4. A wheel.
 E. दल् to divide, and भ Uṇādi affix.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=334-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दल्मि|दल्मिः
दल्मि m. (-ल्मिः)
	 1. A name of INDRA.
	 2. INDRA'S thunderbolt.
 E. दल् to
break or split, Uṇādi affix मि ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=334-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दव|दवः
दव (इ) दवि r. 1st cl. (दन्वति) To go, to move. भ्वा० प० सक० सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=335-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दव|दवः
दव m. (-वः)
	 1. A wood on fire, a forest conflagration.
	 2. A wood, a
forest.
	 3. Fire in general.
	 4. Heat, (general or physical.)
 E. दु to
agitate, affix अच्; also दाव ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=335-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दवथु|दवथुः
दवथु m. (-थुः)
	 1. Anxiety, vexation, distress.
	 2. Inflammation of the
eye, &c.
 E. दु to be agitated, अथुच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=335-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दवयत्
दवयत् mfn. (-यन्-यन्ती-यत्) Removing, making remote, placing at a dis-
tance.
 E. दव for दूर used as a verb, शतृ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=335-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दवाग्नि|दवाग्निः
दवाग्नि m. (-ग्निः) A wood on fire, or the conflagration of a forest.
 E. दव
a wood, and अग्नि a fire; also दव and दाव ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=335-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दविष्ठ|दविष्ठः
दविष्ठ mfn. (-ष्ठः-ष्ठा-ष्ठं) Very remote, very distant.
 E. दूर् far, affix इष्ठन्,
and दव substituted for दूर्; also दवीयस् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=335-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दवीयस्
दवीयस् mfn. (-यान्-यसी-यः) Very remote or distant: see the preced-
ing, the affix being the superlative affix ईयसुन् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=335-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दश
दश (इ) दशि r. 1st and 10th cls. (दशति दंशयति-ते)
	 1. To bite or sting.
2. To arm, to put on armour.
	 3. To see. r. 10th cl. (दंशयते) To
shine. With उप, to be in trouble, to be reduced in circumstances.
With सम्, to pinch, to nip, to bite. दीप्तौ चु० उभ० अक० सेट् इदित् ।
दंशनार्थे चु० आत्म० and भ्वा० प० ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=335-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशक
दशक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Ten.
 E. कन् added to दश ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=335-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशकण्ठ|दशकंठ|दशकण्ठः
दशकण्ठ m. (-ण्ठः) A name of RAVANA.
 E. दश ten, and कण्ठ a neck: the
ten-necked: also similar names, as दशग्रीव, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=335-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशकण्ठजित्|दशकंठजित्
दशकण्ठजित् m. (-जित्) A name of RAMA.
 E. दशकण्ठ RAVANA, and जित्
the conqueror.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=335-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशकन्धर|दशकंधर|दशकन्धरः
दशकन्धर m. (-रः) RAVANA: see दशकण्ठ ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=335-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशकामजव्यसन
दशकामजव्यसन n. (-नं) The aggregate of ten vices, proceeding from the
the quality of desire, viz. hunting, gambling, sleeping during
the day, abusiveness, lechery, drunkenness, dancing, singing, play-
ing, and hypocrisy.
 E. दश ten, काम desire, ज born, व्यसन calamity.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=335-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशगुण
दशगुण adv.
	 n. (-णं) Ten times, ten-fold.
 E. दश, and गुण a time.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=335-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशग्राम
दशग्राम n. (-मं) A district or collection of ten villages.
 E. दश, and ग्राम a
village.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=335-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशग्रामपति|दशग्रामपतिः
दशग्रामपति m. (-तिः) A magistrate or chief of ten villages.
 E. दश, and
ग्राम a village, पति master.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=335-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशग्रामिन्
दशग्रामिन् m. (-मी)
	 1. The head man of ten villages.
	 2. Municipality
or corporation of the same.
 E. दशग्राम, and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=335-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशग्रीव|दशग्रीवः
दशग्रीव m. (-वः) RAVANA: see दशकण्ठ ।
