<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशधा
दशधा ind. In ten ways.
 E. दश, and धाच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=335-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशन्
दशन् mfn. plu. (-श) Ten.
 E. दश् to bite, Uṇādi affix अन्, the nasal
rejected.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=335-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
