दशन|दशनं|दशनः
दशन mn. (-नः-नं) A tooth.
	 m. (-नः) The peak of a mountain.
	 n. (-नं)
Armour, mail.
 E. दंश् to bite, affix भावे करणादौ ल्युट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=335-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशनवासस्
दशनवासस् n. (-सः) A lip.
 E. दशन tooth, and वासस् vesture.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=335-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशनांशु|दशनांशुः
दशनांशु m. (-शुः) The whiteness or brightness of the teeth.
 E. दशन,
and अंशु a ray.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=335-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशनाङ्क|दशनांक|दशनाङ्कः
दशनाङ्क m. (-ङ्कः) A bite, the mark of the teeth.
 E. दशन, and अङ्क a mark.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=335-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशनाढ्या
दशनाढ्या f. (-ढ्या) A kind of sorrel.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=335-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशनोच्छिष्ठ
दशनोच्छिष्ठ mfn. (-ष्ठः-ष्ठा-ष्ठं) Toothless.
	 m. (-ष्ठः)
	 1. Breathing, breathing
out, expiration.
	 2. A lip.
	 3. Kissing, a kiss.
 E. दशन a tooth, and
उच्छिष्ठ expelled, ejected.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=335-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
