<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशलक्षण
दशलक्षण n. (-णं) Ten marks or attributes.
 E. दश, and लक्षण a mark.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=335-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशवाजिन्
दशवाजिन् m. (-जी) The moon.
 E. दश ten, and वाजिन् a horse, whose car
is drawn by ten horses.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=335-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशशत
दशशत n. (-तं) A thousand.
 E. दश, and शत a hundred.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=335-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशसहस्र
दशसहस्र n. (-स्रं) A myriad.
 E. दश, and सहस्र a thousand.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=335-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशा
दशा f. (-शा) or m. plu. (-शाः)
	 1. The ends of a piece of cloth, the end
of a garment.
	 2. A state, a condition, a period or time of life,
as youth, age, manhood, &c.
	 3. The wick of a lamp.
	 4. The mind
or faculty, of understanding.
	 5. Aspect or position of the planets
at birth.
 E. दश् to bite, to cut or divide, or be cut or divided,
अङ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=335-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशाकर्ष|दशाकर्षः
दशाकर्ष m. (-र्षः) A lamp.
 E. दशा a wick, आकर्ष what possesses.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=335-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशाकर्षिन्
दशाकर्षिन् m. (-र्षी) A lamp.
 E. दशा a wick, आङ् before, कृष् to make
lines, affix इनि.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=335-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशानन|दशाननः
दशानन m. (-नः) The giant RAVANA.
 E. दश ten, and आनन a face.
