<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दाभ्य
दाभ्य mfn. (-भ्यः-भ्या-भ्यं) To be ordered, to be governed or ruled.
 E. दम् to
order, ण्यत् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=337-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दामन्
दामन् nf. (-म-मा) A string, a cord, a thread or rope.
 E. दो to cut or
divide, &c. affix भावे करणे वा मनिन् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=337-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दामन
दामन mfn. (-नः-नी-नं) Relating to the Dona or Artemisia flower. E.
दामन, and अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=337-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दामनपर्व्वन्|दामनपर्वन्
दामनपर्व्वन् n. (-र्व्व) The fourteenth of the light half of Chaitra, when
the Dona flower is worshipped.
 E. दामन, and पर्व्व a holiday.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=337-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दामनी
दामनी f. (-नी) A string, a rope, especially for tying cattle.
 E. दामन् as
above, अण् and ङीष् affs.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=337-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दामलिप्त|दामलिप्तं
दामलिप्त n. (-प्तं) A country, the modern district of Tumlook. E. See
तामलित, त being changed to द.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=337-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दामा
दामा f. (-मा) A rope, a string, a cord. E. See दामन्.
