<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दामाञ्जन|दामांजन
दामाञ्जन n. (-नं) A foot-rope for horses, &c.
 E. दामा, and अञ्ज् to go,
affix ल्युट्; also दामा, and अञ्चल end, दामाञ्चल, n. (-लं).
