दामोदर|दामोदरः
दामोदर m. (-रः)
	 1. A name of KṚṢṆA.
	 2. A Jina of the past age. E.
दाम a rope, and उदर a belly; YASODHA his foster mother having
in vain passed the folds of a rope round his body, whilst a child,
to keep him in confinement. दाम बन्धनसाधनं उदरे यस्य ।
