दास|दासः
दास (ऋ) दासृ r. 1st cl. (दासति-ते) To give; also दाश r. 5th cl. (दास्नोति)
To hurt, to injure, to wound or kill: this and दाश, in the last
sense, are restricted by some authorities to the Vedas. भ्वा० उभ०
