<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिनमणि|दिनमणिः
दिनमणि m. (-णिः) The sun.
 E. दिन day, and मणि jewel or gem.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=340-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिनमूर्द्धन्
दिनमूर्द्धन् m. (-र्द्धा) The eastern mountain, behind which the sun is sup-
posed to rise.
 E. दिन day, and मूर्द्धन् the forehead.
