<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिनान्त|दिनांत|दिनान्तः
दिनान्त m. (-न्तः) Evening, sunset, close of day.
 E. दिन day, and अन्त
end.
