<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिनान्तक|दिनान्तकः
दिनान्तक m. (-कः) Darkness.
 E. दिन day, and अन्तक ender.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=340-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिनारम्भ|दिनारंभ|दिनारम्भः
दिनारम्भ m. (-म्भः) Morning.
 E. दिन, and आरम्भ beginning.
