<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिवाकर|दिवाकरः
दिवाकर m. (-रः)
	 1. The sun.
	 2. A crow.
	 3. A flower, the sun-flower. E.
दिवा the day, and कर who makes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=341-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
