	 1. Divine, celestial.
	 2. Beautiful, agreeable,
charming.
	 m. (-व्यः)
	 1. Barley.
	 2. A fragrant resin, (Bdelliun.)
	 3.
The divine character or property.
	 f. (-व्या) Emblic myrobalan.
	 n.
(-व्यं)
	 1. Cloves.
	 2. A sort of Sandal.
	 3. An ordeal.
	 4. An oath. E.
द्यु the sky or heaven, and यत् aff. दिवि भवः ।
