दिव्यचक्षुस्
दिव्यचक्षुस् mfn. (-क्षुः-क्षुः-क्षुः)
	 1. Beautiful-eyed.
	 2. Blind.
	 m. (-क्षुः)
	 1. A
sort of perfume.
	 2. A monkey.
	 n. (-क्षुः) The faculty of seeing what
is invisible by the human eye.
 E. दिव्य divine, and चक्षुस् an eye.
दिव्यं चक्षुः यस्मात् ५ ब० ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=341-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
