दिष्ट|दिष्टं|दिष्टः
दिष्ट mfn. (-ष्टः-ष्टा-ष्टं)
	 1. Shown, pointed out.
	 2. Delineated, described.
3. Counselled, advised, enjoined.
	 m. (-ष्टः)
	 1. Time.
	 2. A sort of
Curcuma: see दारुहरिद्रा.
	 n. (-ष्टं) Fate, destiny, fortune, good or
ill luck.
 E. दिश् to show, affix कर्मणि क्त ।
