<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिष्णु|दिष्णुः
दिष्णु mfn. (-ष्णुः-ष्णुः-ष्णु) Giving, one who gives, a donor.
 E. दा to give.
