दीक्षणीयेष्टि|दीक्षणीयेष्टिः
दीक्षणीयेष्टि f. (-ष्टिः) A particular sacrifice, that preceded by the Diksha;
see the next.
 E. दीक्षा as below, छ affix, and इष्टि a sacrifice.
