<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दौदिवि
दौदिवि mfn. (-विः-विः-वि) Risen, ascended.
	 mn. (-विः-वि) Boiled rice.
	 m.
(-विः) A name of VṚHASPATI.
 E. दिव् to play, Uṇādi affix क्विन्, the
radical reduplicate, deriv. irr.
