दीन|दीनं|दीनः
दीन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं)
	 1. Poor, indigent, needy, distressed.
	 2. Afraid,
frightened, timid.
	 f. (-ना) A mouse or shrew.
 E. दी to waste or
decay, affix क्त, deriv. irr. or दी as before, Uṇādi affix नक् ।
