<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दीपशिखा
दीपशिखा f. (-खा)
	 1. Lamp black, especially considered as applicable to
the eyes, to darken the lashes, &c.
	 2. The flame of a lamp.
 E. दीप
a lamp, and शिखा a crest.
