<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दीपशृङ्खला|दीपशृंखला
दीपशृङ्खला f. (-ला) A row or string of lamps.
 E. दीप, and शृङ्खला a chain.
