<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दीपान्विता
दीपान्विता f. (-ता) A festival: see the next.
 E. दीप, and अन्वित having.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=342-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दीपाली
दीपाली f. (-ली)
	 1. The day of new moon in the month Aswin or Kartik,
(September-October,) a festival with nocturnal illuminations in
honor of KARTIKEYA; the Diwali, as it usually termed.
	 2. A row
or range of lamps.
 E. दीप a lamp, and आली a line; also दीपावली
the same.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=342-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दीपित
दीपित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Illuminated, irradiated.
	 2. Excited, inflamed.
3. Manifested.
 E. दीप् to kindle, causal form, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=342-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दीपितृ
दीपितृ mfn. (-ता-त्री-तृ) An illuminator, an enlightener, shining, irradiat-
ing.
 E. दीप् to kindle, &c. तृच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=342-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
