दीप्ति|दीप्तिः
दीप्ति f. (-प्तिः)
	 1. Light, lustre, splendour.
	 2. Beauty.
	 3. The swift
flight of an arrow.
	 4. A property of women, extreme loveliness,
brilliant beauty.
	 5. Lac.
	 5. Bell metal.
 E. दीप् to shine, affix भावे
क्तिन् ।
