दुरासद|दुरासदः
दुरासद mfn. (-दः-दा-दं)
	 1. Difficult of attainment.
	 2. Difficult of access.
3. Unequalled, unrivalled.
	 4. Intolerable.
 E. दुर् with difficulty,
आङ् implying to or up to, सद् to go, affix कर्मणि खल् ।
