दुर्ब
दुर्ब r. 1st cl. (इ) दुर्बी (दूर्बति) To hurt, to injure, to wound, to kill दूर्ब, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=347-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
