दुर्बुद्धि
दुर्बुद्धि mfn. (-द्धिः-द्धिः-द्धि) Silly, ignorant.
 E. दुर्, and बुद्धि under-
standing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=347-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुर्भक्ष्य
दुर्भक्ष्य mfn. (-क्ष्यः-क्ष्या-क्ष्यं) To be eaten with difficulty.
 E. दुर्, and भक्ष्य
eating.
