दुर्भगा
दुर्भगा f. (-गा)
	 1. A wife not loved or liked by her husband.
	 2. A
bad or ill tempered woman.
 E. दुर् little or ill, भग affection.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=347-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुर्भर
दुर्भर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Burdensome, troublesome, hard to be supported.
E. दुर्, and भर what bears.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=347-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
