दुर्मनस् mfn. (-नाः-नाः-नः) Sad, distressed, meditating or thinking sor-
rowfully.
 E. दुर् distress, मनस् the mind.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=347-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
