दुर्मुख mfn. (-खः-खा-खी-खं)
	 1. Scurrilous, foul-mouthed.
	 2. Hideous
ugly.
	 m. (खः)
	 1. One of the monkey chiefs.
	 2. One of the principal
Nagas or serpents.
	 3. A horse.
	 4. An Asura.
 E. दुर् bad, ill, मुख
mouth or face.
