<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुर्मेधस्|दुर्म्मेधस्
दुर्मेधस् mfn. (-धाः-धाः-धः) Of little or contemptible understanding, dull,
stupid, ignorant, uninformed.
 E. दुर् bad, मेधस् understanding.
