<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुर्लभ|दुर्लभः|दुर्ल्लभ
दुर्लभ mfn. (-भः-भा-भं)
	 1. Difficult of attainment.
	 2. Excellent, eminent.
3. Dear, beloved.
	 m. (-भः) A plant, (a sort of Hedysarum:) see
