दुरालभा
दुरालभा f. (-भा) A prickly nightshade.
 E. दुर् difficult, लभ् to gain,
affix खल् but without any nasal.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=347-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुर्वच|दुर्व्वच|दुर्व्वचं|दुर्व्वचः
दुर्वच mfn. (-चः-चा-चं)
	 1. Speaking ill or improperly.
	 1. Speaking in
pain.
	 3. Difficult of utterance or articulation.
	 4. What ought not
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=347-b" target="_blank">Page347-b+ 60</a>]
to be spoken.
	 n. (-चं)
	 1. Abuse, censure.
	 2. Evil or unlucky
speech.
 E. दुर्, वच् to speak. दुःखेन उच्यते दुर् + वच्-कर्मणि खल् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=347-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुर्वचस्|दुर्व्वचस्
दुर्वचस् n. (-चः) Abuse, bad language.
 E. दुर् bad, वचस् speech.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=347-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुर्वर्ण|दुर्वर्णः|दुर्व्वर्ण|दुर्व्वर्णं
दुर्वर्ण mfn. (-र्णः-र्णा-र्णं) Of a bad species or class.
	 n. (-र्णं)
	 1. Silver.
	 2. A
sort of perfume, commonly Elabāluka: see एलवालुक.
 E. दुर् bad,
vile, and वर्ण species; the reduplication of the व is optional in
this and the following words. हेमापेक्षया निकृष्टो वर्णोऽस्य । रजते ।
