<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुर्वर्णक|दुर्व्वर्णक|दुर्व्वर्णकं
दुर्वर्णक n. (-कं) Silver.
 E. दुर् inferior, वर्ण species, कन् pleonasm; in-
ferior as compared with gold.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=347-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुर्वह|दुर्व्वह
दुर्वह mfn. (-हः-हा-हं) Difficult to be borne or supported.
 E. दुर्, and वह
bearing. दुःखेन उह्यते असौ दुर् + वह-कर्मणि खल् ।
