<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुर्वासस्|दुर्व्वासस्
दुर्वासस् mfn. (-साः-साः-सः) Ill dressed.
	 m. (-साः) The name of a Ṛṣi
or saint, the son of ATRI, and an incarnation or portion of ŚIVA,
famous for his choleric temperament.
 E. दुर्, and वासस् vesture.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=347-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुर्विध|दुर्व्विध|दुर्व्विधः
दुर्विध mfn. (-धः-धा-धं)
	 1. Poor, pauper, indigent.
	 2. Wicked, melevo-
lent.
