दुष्प्रलम्भ
दुष्प्रलम्भ mfn. (-म्भः-म्भा-म्भं) Difficult of attainment.
 E. दुर्, and प्र before,
लभ् to gain, खल् affix, नुम् inserted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=348-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुष्प्राप
दुष्प्राप mfn. (-पः-पा-पं) Difficult of attainment, difficult to be got or
reached.
 E. दुर्, and प्राप obtaining.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=348-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुष्प्राप्य
दुष्प्राप्य mfn. (-प्यः-प्या-प्यं) Remote, unattainable, difficult of approach
or attainment.
 E. दुर्, and प्राप्य obtainable.
