<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुष्मन्त|दुष्मन्तः
दुष्मन्त m. (-न्तः) A prince of the lunar line, the husband of SAKUNTALĀ.
E. दुर्, and झ affix, मुम्, aug; also read दुष्यन्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=348-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुष्यन्त|दुष्यंतः|दुष्यन्तः
दुष्यन्त m. (-न्तः) A prince: see that last.
 E. दुष् to do wrong, झ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=348-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुस्तर
दुस्तर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Difficult to be crossed.
 E. दुर्, and तर crossing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=348-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुस्त्यज
दुस्त्यज mfn. (-जः-जा-जं) Difficult to be relinquished or parted with. E.
दुर् and त्यज abandoning.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=348-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुस्सथ
दुस्सथ m. (-थः)
	 1. A dog.
	 2. A cock.
