<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुह
दुह m. (धुक्) A milker.
 E. दुह्, and क्विप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=348-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुहत्
दुहत् mfn. (-हन्-हन्ती-हत्)
	 1. Relinquishing, parting with.
	 2. Milking. E.
दुह to milk, शतृ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=348-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
