दुहितुःपति|दुहितुःपतिः
दुहितुःपति m. (-तिः) A son-in-law, a daughter's husband.
 E. दुहितृ a
daughter, in the possessive case, and पति a husband.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=348-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुहितृ
दुहितृ(-ता) A daughter.
 E. दुह् to milk, (the mother,) Uṇādi affix तृच्,
and इट् inserted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=348-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुह्य|दुह्यं
दुह्य mfn. (-ह्यः-ह्या-ह्यं) To be milked, milkable.
 E. दुह् to milk, affix क्यप्;
also ण्यत्प्रत्ययं कृत्वा दोह्य ।
