दूत|दूतः
दूत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Sent, despatched.
	 m. (-तः)
	 1. A messenger or envoy,
a news-carrier.
	 2. An ambassador.
	 f. (-तिः-ती) A female messenger,
a confidante, a procuress, a go-between. &c.
 E. दु to go, Uṇādi affix
क्त, and the vowel made long; or दू to suffer, affix क्त fem. affix क्तिन्
or क्तिच् and optionally ङीप् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=348-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूतघ्नी
दूतघ्नी f. (-घ्नी) A plant, resembling the Kadamba: see कदम्बपुष्पी.
 E. दूत
a messenger, घ्नी what destroys. दूतं खेदं हन्ति हन-टक् । ङीप् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=348-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूति|दूतिः
दूति f. (-तिः) See दूत दु-वा ति दीर्घश्च ।
