<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूतिका
दूतिका f. (-का) A female messenger, a confidante, &c. see दूत, &c.
 E. कन्
added to दूति; also with the penultimate, vowel made long, दूतीका ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=348-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूत्य|दूत्यं
दूत्य n. (-त्यं)
	 1. An embassy, a message.
	 2. The abstract state or condi-
tion of a message or a messenger.
 E. दूत a messenger, and यत् aff.
