दूप्र mfn. (-प्रः-प्रा-प्रं) Strong.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=349-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूर|दूरं
दूर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Distant, remote.
	 n. adv. (-रं) Far, far off.
	 2. Widely.
deeply.
 E. दुर with difficulty, इण् to go, Uṇādi affix रक्, deriv. irr.
or दैप् शुद्धौ वा कू ।
