<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरगामिन्
दूरगामिन् mfn. (-मी-मिनी-मि) Going far.
	 m. (-मी) An arrow, &c.
 E. दूर,
and गामिन् what goes.
