दूरदर्शिन् mfn. (-र्शी-र्शिनी-र्शि) Long-sighted, far-seeing, (literally or
metaphorically.)
	 m. (-र्शी)
	 1. A Pandit, a learned man, a teacher.
2. A prophet, a seer.
	 3. A vulture.
 E. दूर far, and दर्शिन् who sees,
from दृश् to see, with णिनि affix; also with क्विप् affix दूरदृश् ।
