	 1. Blame,
fault, defect, offence.
	 2. Spoiling, ruining, vitiating. defiling.
	 3.
Violating, (as a girl.)
	 4. Breaking, (as an agreement.)
 E. दूष् to
become vile or wicked. affix भावे ल्युट् ।
