दृढसन्धि|दृढसंधि|दृढसन्धिः
दृढसन्धि mfn. (-न्धिः-न्थिः-न्धि)
	 1. Strong knit, well fixed or compact, (the
person, &c.)
	 2. Close, compact, free from interstices.
	 3. Closely
connected or allied.
 E. दृढ firm, and सन्धि union, a joint, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृढसूत्रिका
दृढसूत्रिका f. (-का) A plant from the fibres of which bow strings are made:
see सूर्व्वा.
 E. दृढ firm, and सूत्र a thread, a fibre, affix क ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृढसौहृद
दृढसौहृद mfn. (-दः-दी-दं) Firm in friendship, constant.
 E. दृढ, and सौहृद
friendship.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृढस्कन्ध|दृढस्कन्धः
दृढस्कन्ध m. (-न्धः) A plant, a sort of Mimusops: see क्षीरिका.
 E. दृढ firm,
and स्कन्ध stem.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृढाङ्ग|दृढांग|दृढाङ्गं
दृढाङ्ग mfn. (-ङ्गः-ङ्गा-ङ्गी-ङ्गं) Firm-bodied, hard, strong.
	 n. (-ङ्गं) A dia-
mond.
 E. दृढ, and अङ्ग body.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृढार्त्ति
दृढार्त्ति f. (-र्त्तिः)
	 1. The end of a bow.
	 2. Great pain.
 E. दृढ, and आर्त्ति
end of a bow, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृढाभक्ति
दृढाभक्ति f. (-क्तिः) A faithful mistress or wife.
 E. दृढा fem. form, and भक्ति
attachment.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृढायुध|दृढायुधः
दृढायुध m. (-धः) A hero, one firm in battle.
 E. दृढ, and आयुध war.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृत|दृतः
दृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Respected, honoured.
	 f. (-ता) Cumin.
 E. दृ to res-
pect, affix क्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृति|दृतिः
दृति f. (-तिः)
	 1. A bellows.
	 2. A fish.
	 3. A skin of leather, or a leather
bag for holding water.
	 4. Skin, hide.
 E. दृ to divide, क्तिन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृतिधारक|दृतिधारकः
दृतिधारक m. (-कः) A plant, commonly Acanpātā.
 E. दृति a bellows, and
धारक having; having leaved compared to a leather bellows.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृतिहरि|दृतिहरिः
दृतिहरि m. (-रिः) A dog.
 E. दृति here said to mean skin in general, and
हरि who steals, from हृ with इन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृतिहार|दृतिहारः
दृतिहार m. (-रः) A carrier of skins or bags, a water carrier, &c.
 E. दृति,
and हृ to take, अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृन्भू
दृन्भू m. (-न्भूः)
	 1. The thunderbolt.
	 2. The sun.
	 f. (-न्भूः)
	 1. A snake in
general.
	 2. A wheel.
 E. दृभ् to fear, Uṇādi affix कू, क्विप् and नुम्
inserted; न being optionally changed to म, before भ, the word is
also read दृम्भू ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृप
दृप r. 4th cl. (ञि ईर ऊ) ञि ईरदृपू (दृप्यति) 1. To be glad, to rejoice.
	 2.
To be arrogant. to be vain or proud. r. 6th cl. (दृपति) To pain,
to inflict pain, to torture. r. 1st and 10th cls. (दर्पति दर्पयति-ते) To
light, to kindle or inflame. हर्षे गर्वे च अक० दिवा० वेट् । तुदा० पर०
सक० सेट्० । भ्वा० पर० । चुरा० उभ० ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृप्त|दृप्तः
दृप्त mfn. (-प्तः-प्ता-प्तं) Proud, arrogant.
 E. दृप् to be proud, affix क्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृप्यत्
दृप्यत् mfn. (-प्यन्-प्यती-प्यत्) Being proud or arrogant.
 E. दृप् to be proud,
शतृ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृप्र|दृप्रः
दृप्र mfn. (-प्रः-प्रा-प्रं)
	 1. Strong, powerful.
	 2. Proud, arrogant.
 E. दृप् to
be proud Uṇādi affix रक् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृफ
दृफ r. 6th cl. (दृम्फति) To pain, to hurt. तुदा० मुचादि० अक० पर० सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृब्ध|दृब्धः
दृब्ध mfn. (-ब्धः-ब्धा-ब्धं)
	 1. Strung, tied.
	 2. Afraid, frightened.
	 3. Pained,
tortured.
 E. दृभ् to pain, to string, affix कर्मणि कर्त्तरि वा क्त ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृभ
दृभ (ई) दृभी r. 6th cl. (दृभति)
	 1. To string, to arrange.
	 2. To give pain.
r. 1st and 10th cls. (दर्भति दर्भयति-ते) To fear, to be afraid. तुदा० पर०
सक० सेट् । भ्वा० पर० अक० । चुरा० उभ० ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृम्प
दृम्प r. 6th cl. (दृम्पति) To inflict pain, to torture. तुदा० पर० अक० सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृम्फ
दृम्फ r. 6th cl. (दृम्फति) To pain, to torture. तुदा० पर० अक० सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृम्फू|दृंफू
दृम्फू f. (-म्फूः) A snake, in general.
 E. दृम्फ to give pain, affix कूः see
दृन्भू ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृम्भू
दृम्भू f. (-म्भूः) A snake, &c.: see दृन्भू ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृश
दृश (औ ईर) औदृशीर r. 1st cl. (पश्यति) To see. With उत् prefixed, 1. To
see, to observe.
	 2. To anticipate, to foresee.
	 3. To doubt, to think
doubtingly. भ्वा० पर० सक० अनिट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृश्
दृश् mfn. (दृक्)
	 1. A seer, a looker.
	 2. Wise, possessed of knowledge
f. (-दृक्)
	 1. The eye.
	 2. Sight, seeing.
 E. दृश् to see, affix क्विप्ः
also दृशा and दृशि, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृशद्
दृशद् f. (-शद्-शत्)
	 1. A stone, a rock.
	 2. A flat stone for grinding
condiments upon.
 E. दॄ to divide, Uṇādi affix अदि, augment षुक्,
and ष changed to श; the crude form may also be दृषत् or दृषद्, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृशद्वती
दृशद्वती f. (-ती)
	 1. The name of a river which forms the eastern bound-
ary of the Āryāvarta or holy land of the Hindus, running on
the north-east of Delhi.
	 2. A name of the goddess DURGĀ. E.
दृशद् a stone or rock, and मतुप् poss. aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृशा
दृशा f. (-शा) The eye. E. See दृश, टाप् being here added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृशाकाङ्क्ष्य|दृशाकांक्ष्य|दृशाकाङ्क्ष्यं
दृशाकाङ्क्ष्य n. (-ङ्क्ष्यं) A lotus, or rather a kind of nelumbium.
E. दृश् the eye, काङ्क्ष्य to desire, with आङ् prefix, and यत् affix;
desirable as an object of comparison to the eye.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृशान|दृशानं|दृशानः
दृशान n. (-नं) Light.
	 m. (-नः)
	 1. The name of an Asura; also VIROCHANA
2. A holy or spiritual teacher.
	 3. A king, a ruler, a protector or
cherisher of the world.
	 4. A Brāmhan.
 E. दृश् to see, आनच् Unādi
affix; by whom or which, sight, &c. is enjoyed.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृशि|दृशिः
दृशि f. (-शिः or -शी) The eye.
	 2. A Sāstra.
 E. दृश् to see, affix कि, ङीष् is
optionally added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृशोपम|दृशोपमं
दृशोपम n. (-मं) The white lotus, (Nelumbium speciosum.)
 E. दृशा the eye,
उपमा resemblance; what resembles the eye.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृश्य|दृश्यं|दृश्यः
दृश्य mfn. (-श्यः-श्या-श्यं)
	 1. Visible, to be seen.
	 2. Beautiful, pleasing.
	 m.
(-श्यः) (In Arithmetic,) A given quantity or number.
 E. दृश् to
see, क्यप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृश्यत्व
दृश्यत्व n. (-त्वं) Vision, sight.
 E. त्व added to the last.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृषद्
दृषद् f. (-पद् or -षत्)
	 1. A stone or rock.
	 2. A flat stone or plate on
which spices, &c. are ground.
 E. दॄ to divide, Uṇādi affix अदि, and
षुक् augment; also दृशद्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृष्ट|दृष्टं
दृष्ट mfn. (-ष्टः-ष्टा-ष्टं) Seen, visible, apparent.
	 n. (-ष्टं) Obvious danger
or calamity.
 E. दृश् to see, affix क्त ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृष्टकूट
दृष्टकूट n. (-टं) A riddle, an enigma.
 E. दृष्ट seen, कूट trick.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृष्टदोष
दृष्टदोष mfn. (-षः-षा-षं) Found out, exposed detected.
 E. दृष्ट, and दोष fault.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृष्टरजस्
दृष्टरजस् f. (-जाः) A girl arrived at puberty.
 E. दृष्ट seen, (by whom,)
and रजस् the menstrual discharge.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृष्टवन्
दृष्टवन् mfn. (-वान्-वती-वत्) Seeing, beholding, having seen.
 E. दृश् to see,
क्तवतु aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृष्टान्त|दृष्टांत|दृष्टान्तः
दृष्टान्त m. (-न्तः)
	 1. A science, a Sāstra.
	 2. An example, an illustration.
3. Death, dying.
 E. दृष्ट obvious or seen, and अन्त end.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृष्टि|दृष्टिः
दृष्टि f. (-ष्टिः)
	 1. The eye.
	 2. Sight, seeing.
	 3. Knowledge, wisdom.
	 4.
The sight of the eye, the pupil.
	 5. Aspect, (of the stars.)
 E. दृश् to
see, affix भावे क्तिन्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृष्टिकृत्
दृष्टिकृत् n. (-कृत्) A flower, (Hibiscus mutabilis.)
 E. दृष्टि the eye, कृ to
make, affix क्विप् and तुक् added; also with क्त affix दृष्टिकृत n. (-तं)
दृष्टिं करोति ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=351-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृष्टिगुण|दृष्टिगुणः
दृष्टिगुण m. (-णः) A butt, a mark for archers, &c.
 E. दृष्टि the eye, and गुण
object.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=351-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृष्टिनिपात
दृष्टिनिपात m. (-तः) A look, a look at or on.
 E. दृष्टि, and निपात alighting.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=351-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृष्टिपात|दृष्टिपातः
दृष्टिपात m. (-तः) A look, a glance.
 E. दृष्टि, and पात falling.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=351-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृष्टिपूत
दृष्टिपूत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Kept pure by the sight, i. e. watched, that no
impropriety is committed, or impurity contracted.
 E. दृष्टि, and पूत
purified.
