दृह
दृह r. 1st cl. (दर्हति) also (इ) दृहि r. 1st cl. (दृंहति) To grow, to increase,
to prosper. भ्वा० पर० अक० सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=351-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृहित|दृहितः
दृहित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Grown, increased, thriven.
 E. दृह् to grow, affix क्त
with इट् inserted; also from दृहि, दृंहित ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=351-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दॄ
दॄ r. 9th cl. (दृणाति) To tear, to rend, to divide or pull to pieces. r. 1st
cl. (दरति) To fear, to dread. क्या-प्वा० पर० अक० सेट् । भ्वा० पर० सक० सेट् ।
दिवा० पर० सक० सेट् । दीर्य्यति ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=351-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दे
दे (ङ) देङ् r. 1st cl. (दयते) To preserve, to cherish or protect. भ्वा० आ०
सक० अनिट् ।
