<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देदीप्यमान|देदीप्यमानः
देदीप्यमान mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Shining repeatedly or intensely, glowing,
blazing.
 E. दोप to kindle, intense, form, शानच् aff.
