देवदानी f. (-नी) A sort of creeper, commonly Hātighoshā.
 E. देव a deity,
and दान a gift, भावे ल्युठ् । fem. affix ङीष् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=352-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवदारु|देवदारुः
देवदारु mn. (-रुः-रु) A species of pine, (Pinus devadaru;) in Bengal it is
usually applied to the Uvaria longifolia, and in the Peninsula to
another tree, (Erythroxylon sideroxylloides.)
 E. देव a deity, and
दारु timber.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=352-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवदासी
देवदासी f. (-सी) A courtezan, especially one employed as a dancer, &c.
in a temple.
 E. देव a deity, and दासी a female slave.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=352-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवदीप|देवदीपः
देवदीप m. (-पः) An eye.
 E. देव an organ of sense, and दीप a lamp.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=352-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवदूती
देवदूती f. (-ती)
	 1. A female messenger of the gods.
	 2. A sort of plant;
also मधुकुक्कुटी.
 E. देव, and दूती a messenger.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=352-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवदेव|देवदेवः
देवदेव m. (-वः)
	 1. A name of BRAMHĀ.
	 2. A name of ŚIVA.
 E. देव god,
repeated; god of gods.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=352-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवद्रोणी
देवद्रोणी f. (-णी) The procession of a deity or idol.
 E. देव a deity, द्रुण्,
to go, affixes घञ् and ङीप् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=352-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवद्र्यञ्च्|देवद्र्यंच्
देवद्र्यञ्च् mfn. (-द्र्यङ्-द्रीची-द्र्यक्) Approaching or adoring a deity.
 E. देव
an idol, अञ्च् to go to or to worship, affix क्विप्, and द्रि inserted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=352-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवधान्य|देवधान्यं
देवधान्य n. (-न्यं) A sort of grain cultivated in many parts of Hindustan,
(Andropogon saccharatus.)
 E. देव a deity, and धान्य corn.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=352-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवधूप|देवधूपः
देवधूप m. (-पः) A fragrant resin, (Bdellium,) used in the incense.
 E. देव
a deity, and धूप incense.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=352-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवन्
देवन् m. (-वा) A husband's brother.
 E. दिव् to play. अन् Unādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=352-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवन|देवनं|देवनः
देवन n. (-नं)
	 1. Sport, play, pastime, &c.
	 2. Emulation, desire to excel
or overcome.
	 3. Affair, business, profession.
	 4. Gaming.
	 5. Splen-
dour, lustre, beauty.
	 6. Light.
	 7. Praise.
	 8. Motion.
	 9. Grief,
sorrow.
	 10. A garden, a play or pleasure ground.
	 11. A lotus.
	 m.
(-नः) A die or dice.
	 f. (-ना)
	 1. Service.
	 2. Sport, wanton sport or
pastime.
 E. दिव् to play, &c. affix ल्युट्, or युच्, fem. aff टाप् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=352-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवनन्दिन्|देवनंदिन्
देवनन्दिन् m. (-न्दी) One of INDRA'S doorkeepers.
 E. देव a deity, and
नन्दिन् who pleases.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=352-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवनल|देवनलः
देवनल m. (-लः) A kind of reed, (Arundo bengalensis)
 E. देव, and नल a
reed; also read देवनाल ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=352-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवनारक
देवनारक m. (-कः) A superhuman being, also देवनामक ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=352-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवनिकाय|देवनिकायः
देवनिकाय m. (-यः) A heaven, a paradise, the residence of a divinity.
E. देव, and निकाय abode.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=352-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवनिन्दक|देवनिंदक|देवनिन्दकः
देवनिन्दक m. (-कः) A heretic, an unbeliever, a reviler of the gods. E.
देव, and निन्दक a calumniator.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=352-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवनिन्दा
देवनिन्दा f. (-न्दा) Heresy, atheism.
 E. देव, and निन्दा abuse.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=352-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवनिर्मित|देवनिर्म्मित
देवनिर्मित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Natural, created.
 E. देव, and निर्मित made by.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=352-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवपति|देवपतिः
देवपति m. (-तिः) A name of INDRA.
 E. देव a deity, and पति master.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=352-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवपत्नी
देवपत्नी f. (-त्नी)
	 1. The wife of a deity.
	 2. Sweet potato.
 E. देव a deity,
&c. and पत्नी wife.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=352-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवपथ|देवपथः
देवपथ f. (-थः) Heaven, the firmament, the celestial path or way.
 E. देव
a deity, and पथिन् a road, final affix अ ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=352-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवपद
देवपद n. (-दं) The royal presence.
 E. देव, and पद for पाद a foot; also
देवपाद ।
