<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवपर
देवपर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं)
	 1. Addicted to play.
	 2. Future, what will be,
(predestined, &c.) see दैवपर ।
