 E. देव a deity, and बल्लभ a friend.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=352-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवब्रह्मन्
देवब्रह्मन् m. (-ह्मा) A name of the Muni NĀRADA.
 E. देव a deity, ब्रह्मन्
BRAMHĀ; BRAMHĀ amongst the saints and demigods.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=352-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
