देवब्राह्मण|देवब्राह्मणः
देवब्राह्मण m. (-णः) A venerable Brahman, one esteemed by deities. E.
देव, and ब्राह्मण a Brahman or देवपूजकः ब्राह्यणः । देवले ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=352-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवभवन|देवभवनं
देवभवन n. (-नं)
	 1. The holy fig tree.
	 2. Paradise.
	 3. A temple.
 E. देव a
deity, and भवन a dwelling.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=352-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवभाज्
देवभाज् mfn. (-क् or -ग्) Belonging to a god.
 E. देब, and भाज् what has.
