<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवभू
देवभू m. (-भूः)
	 1. A deity.
	 2. Svarga or paradise.
 E. देव divine, and भू
being.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=352-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवभूति|देवभूतिः
देवभूति f. (-तिः) The Ganges of heaven.
 E. देव a deity, and भूति being,
abiding. देवानामैश्वर्य्येच ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=352-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवभूय|देवभूयं
देवभूय n. (-यं)
	 1. Divinity, godhead.
	 2. Inferior deification or identifica-
tion with a deity.
 E. देव a deity, and भूय being, becoming.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=352-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवमञ्जर
देवमञ्जर n. (-रं) The jewel of KṚṢṆA suspended on his breast.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=352-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवमणि|देवमणिः
देवमणि m. (-णिः)
	 1. A name of ŚIVA.
	 2. The jewel of KṚṢṆA.
	 3. A
twist of hair on a horse's neck.
 E. देव a deity, मणि a jewel.
