<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवायतन|देवायतनं
देवायतन n. (-नं) A temple.
 E. देव, and आयतन abode.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=353-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवायुध|देवायुधं
देवायुध n. (-धं) The rainbow.
 E. देव, and आयुध a weapon.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=353-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवालय|देवालयः
देवालय n. (-यं)
	 1. A division of heaven, the residence of the gods.
	 2. A
temple.
 E. देव, and आलय an asylum.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=353-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
