<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दोषैकदृश्
दोषैकदृश् mfn. (-दृक्) Malevolent, censorious, discovering defects only.
E. दोष a fault. एक one, alone, and दृष् seeing.
