<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दोहदलक्षण|दोहदलक्षणं
दोहदलक्षण n. (-णं)
	 1. The fœtus, the embryo, sometimes confounded
with womb.
	 1. The period of passing from one season of life to
another, as from childhood to youth from youth to manhood. E.
दोहद longing, and लक्षण a sign.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=355-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दोहदवती
दोहदवती f. (-ती) A pregnant woman longing for any thing.
 E. दोहद as
above, and मतुप् aff.
