द्युनिवासिन्
द्युनिवासिन् m. (-सी)
	 1. A deity.
	 2. A pious person.
 E. द्यु, and निवासिन्
who abides.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=356-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्युनिश|द्युनिशं
द्युनिश n. (-शं) Day and night.
 E. द्यु a day, निशा night.
