द्यूत|द्यूतं|द्यूतः
द्यूत mn. (-तः-तं) Gaming, playing with dice, or any thing not possess-
ing life.
 E. दिव् to play, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=356-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्यूतकर|द्यूतकरः
द्यूतकर m. (-रः) A gambler.
 E. द्यूत and कर who practises.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=356-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्यूतकार|द्यूतकारः
द्यूतकार m. (-रः)
	 1. The keeper of a gaming house.
	 2. A gambler. E.
द्यूत gaming, and कार who practises, also with कन् added,
द्यूतकारक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=356-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्यूतकृत्
द्यूतकृत् m. (-कृत्) A gambler.
 E. द्यूत, and कृत् who practises: see the
last.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=356-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्यूतपूर्णिमा
द्यूतपूर्णिमा f. (-मा) The day of full moon in the month Kartic,
(October-November,) the night of which is spent in games of
chance, in honour of the goddess of fortune, LAKṢMĪ.
 E. द्यूत
gaming, and पूर्णिमा day of full moon; also with अण् pleonastic
affix added, and ङीष् fem. affix द्यूतपौर्णिमा, f. (-मी).
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=356-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्यूतप्रतिपत्
द्यूतप्रतिपत् f. (-पत्) The first day of the moon's increase in Kartic.
when BALI is to be venerated.
 E. द्यूत, and प्रतिपद् the first lunation.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=356-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्यूतवीज
द्यूतवीज n. (-जं) A Couri, a small shell used as a coin in most parts
of India.
 E. द्यूत, gaming, and वीज seed.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=356-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्यूतवृत्ति|द्यूतवृत्तिः
द्यूतवृत्ति m. (-त्तिः) A gambler.
 E. द्यूत
 E. वृत्ति, subsistence.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=356-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्यूतसभा
द्यूतसभा f. (-भा) A gaming house or assembly.
 E. द्यूत and सभा an
assembly.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=356-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्यूताधिकारिन्
