<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्यो
द्यो f. (-द्यौ)
	 1. Heaven, paradise.
	 2. Heaven, sky.
 E. दिव् to sport,
Unādi affix डो आधारे; where the gods, &c. sport. द्योतन्ते देवा अत्र ।
