<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रम
द्रम r. 1st cl. (द्रमति) To go, to move. भ्वा० प० सक० सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=357-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रव|द्रवः
द्रव mfn. (-वः-वा-वं)
	 1. Dropping, oozing.
	 2. Flowing.
	 3. Fluid, liquid.
4. Fused, liquefied, melted.
	 m. (-वः)
	 1. Going, motion.
	 2. Flight,
retreat.
	 3. Sport, amusement.
	 4. Juice, essence, exudation.
	 5.
Fusion, liquefaction.
	 6. Decoction.
	 7. Dropping, distilling, trickl-
ing.
 E. द्रु to go, to go out of, to drop, affix भावे अप् ।
