<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रबज
द्रबज m. (-जः) Treacle.
 E. द्रव, and ज born. द्रवात् जायते जन-ड ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=357-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रवण|द्रवणं
द्रवण n. (-णं)
	 1. Going.
	 2. Dropping, exuding.
	 3. Heat.
 E. द्रु to go,
affix ल्युट् ।
