<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रवत्|द्रवन्त्
द्रवत् mfn. (-वन्-वन्ती-वत्)
	 1. Trickling, oozing.
	 2. Running, flowing.
	 3.
Going.
	 f. (-न्ती)
	 1. A river in general.
	 2. A medicinal plant, (An-
thericum tuberosum.)
 E. द्रु to go, affix शतृ ।
