<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रवत्व|द्रवत्वं
द्रवत्व n. (-त्वं)
	 1. Fluidity, natural or artificial.
	 2. Distillation.
	 3. Fusion.
