<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रविण|द्रविणं
द्रविण n. (-णं)
	 1. Wealth, property, thing, substance.
	 2. Gold.
	 3.
Strength, power.
 E. द्रु to go, इनन् Unādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=357-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रविणनाशन|द्रविणनाशनः
द्रविणनाशन m. (-नः) A plant, (Hyperanthera morunga.)
 E. द्रविण
strength, and नाशन destroying.
