द्रुकिलिम|द्रुकिलिमं
द्रुकिलिम n. (-मं) A tree, a sort of pine: (Pinus devadāru.)
 E. द्रु a tree,
किलिम the fir or pine, derived from किल् to send or cast, to give
out (resin), and किमच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=358-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुघण|द्रुघणः
द्रुघण m. (-णः)
	 1. A mace, a mallet, an iron weapon made like a carpen-
ter's hammer.
	 2. An axe, a hatchet.
	 3. A name of BRAMHĀ.
	 4. A
plant: see भूमिचम्पक.
 E. द्रु a tree, हन् to injure or demolish, affix
अप्, and घन substituted for the radical; न is usually changed to ण,
but the word is also written द्रुघन । द्रुः वृक्षः संसारगतिर्वा हन्यते अनेन ।
