द्रुण|द्रुणं|द्रुणः
द्रुण r. 6th cl. (द्रुणति)
	 1. To hurt, to injure.
	 2. To go, to move, to ap-
proach.
	 3. To bind, to make crooked or curved. तुदा० कुटा० प० अक०
सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=358-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुण|द्रुणं|द्रुणः
द्रुण m. (-णः)
	 1. A scorpion.
	 2. A bee.
	 3. A rogue, a cheat.
	 f. (-णा) A
bow-string.
	 n. (-णं)
	 1. A bow.
	 2. A sword, a scimitar.
 E. द्रुण् to in-
jure, affix क । द्रुणति हिनस्ति कुटिलीभवति वा द्रुण-क ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=358-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुणस|द्रुणसः
द्रुणस mfn. (-सः-सी-सं) Large-nosed.
 E. द्रु a tree, and नस for नास a nose.
द्रुरिव दीर्घा नासिका अस्य अच् समा० नसादेशः पूर्वपदात् संज्ञायां णत्वम् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=358-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुणह|द्रुणहः
द्रुणह m. (-हः) A scabbard, a sword sheath.
 E. द्रुण a sword, हा to kill
or remove, affix क; the word is also द्रुनह ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=358-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुणि|द्रुणिः
द्रुणि f. (-णिः-णी)
	 1. An oval water basin of wood or stone, &c. shaped
like a boat, and used for pouring water.
	 2. A bucket, a basket.
	 f.
(-णी)
	 1. A centipede.
	 2. A small of female tortoise.
 E. द्रुण् to go,
to hurt, affixes कि and ङीष् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=358-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुत|द्रुतं|द्रुतः
द्रुत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Quick or swift.
	 2. Melted, fused.
	 3. Liquid, fluid.
4. Flown, escaped, run away.
	 5. Scattered, diffused.
	 m. (-तः) A tree.
n. (-तं) Quick time, (in music.) adv.
	 n. (-तं) Quickly, swiftly.
 E. द्रु
to go, affix क्त ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=358-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुतपद
द्रुतपद n. subs. (-दं) A quick pace or step. adv. Quickly.
 E. द्रुत, and
पद a step.
