<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रूण|द्रूणः
द्रूण m. (-णः) A scorpion; also द्रुण and द्रोण ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=358-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रेक
द्रेक r. 1st cl. (ऋ) द्रेकृ (द्रेकते) 1. To sound.
	 2. To grow or increase.
	 3.
To manifest joy or elevation by noise. भ्वा० आ० अक० सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=358-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रेक्क|द्रेक्कः
द्रेक्क m. (-क्कः) The regent of one-third of a planetary sign.
