द्वि|द्विः
द्वि dual only.
	 mf. (-द्वौ)
	 n. (-द्वे) Two.
	 m. (-द्विः) Two, (of times, &c.) is
only used in composition, as अतिद्वि a thing more than two, and
inflected like other nouns in इः in composition with other nume-
rals, it is changed to द्वा, as द्वादश twelve, द्वाविंशति twenty-two,
द्वात्रिंशत् thirty-two, &c.
