द्विक m. (-कः)
	 1. A crow.
	 2. The ruddy goose.
 E. द्वि two, and क the
letter क, as in काक mfn. (-कः-का-कं)
	 1. Two.
	 2. Twice.
	 3. Two-fold.
E. द्वि two, कन् pleonastic aff.
