द्विजन्मन् mfn. (-न्मा-न्मा-न्म)
	 1. Twice born, regenerate.
	 2. Oviparous m.
(-न्मा)
	 1. A tooth.
	 2. A Brahman.
	 3. A bird.
	 4. A man of the three
first classes.
	 5. Any oviparous animal: see द्विज.
 E. द्वि twice, जन्मन्
birth.
