<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्विजोत्तम|द्विजोत्तमः
द्विजोत्तम m. (-लः)
	 1. A Brahman.
	 2. A superior or excellent Brahman.
E. द्विज the twice-born, (three first classes,) and उत्तम best.
