द्वितीय|द्वितीयं|द्वितीयः
द्वितीय mfn. (-यः-या-यं)
	 1. Second.
	 2. Two.
	 m. (-यः) A son, a second or
successor.
	 f. (-या)
	 1. A wife, according to the ritual, a woman
wedded after the ceremony prescribed by the Vedas, a second self
as it were.
	 2. The second day of the fortnight.
 E. द्वि two, and तीय
affix, fem. affix टाप्; also with कन् added, द्वितीयक ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=361-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
