द्वितीयत्व
द्वितीयत्व n. (-त्वं) The circumstance or state of second.
 E. द्वितीय, and त्व
affix; also with तल्, द्वितीयता ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=361-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

