	 mf. (-वान्-वती) A river.
	 f. (-वती) The earth.
E. द्वीप an island, मतुप् possessive aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=362-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वीपिन्
द्वीपिन् mfn. (-पी-पिनी-पि) Island, islander.
	 m. (-पी)
	 1. A tiger.
	 2. An
ounce or panther.
 E. द्वीप an Island, इनि affix; haunting the small
woody islands that abound in the rivers in India, or द्वीप a tiger's
spotted skin, derived from द्वि two; इ to go or be, प affix: and
इनि as before.
