	 2. Duality, in
philosophy, the assertion of two principles, as the distinctness of
life and soul, spirit and matter, god and the universe.
 E. द्वि two
तल् affix, द्वित double, two-fold, abstract affix अण्. द्विधा इतं द्वीतं तस्य
भावः स्वार्थे वा अण् ।
