धनञ्जय m. (-यः)
	 1. The deity of fire.
	 2. A name of ARJUNA.
	 3. One of
the Nāgas or infernal serpents.
	 4. One of the five vital airs, that
which is supposed to fatten.
	 5. A tree, (Pentaptera arjuna.)
 E. धन
wealth, जि to conquer or possess, affix खच् मुम् च ।
