धनुःपट|धनुःपटः
धनुःपट m. (-टः) The Piyasal tree, (Buchanania latifolia, Rox.)
 E. धनुस् a
bow, and पट width; bending like a bow. धनुष इव पटो विस्तारो दले यस्य ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=364-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धनुःशाखा
धनुःशाखा f. (-खा) A plant, from the leaves of which a tough thread is
extracted, of which bow strings were formerly made: see मूर्व्वा,
(Sanseviera zeylanica, Rox. but called by Sir WM. JONES, Aletris
hyacinthoides.)
 E. धनुस् a bow, शाखा a branch. धनुरवयव इव शाखा
यस्याः । पियालतरौ, मूर्ब्बायाम् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=364-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धनुःश्रेणी
धनुःश्रेणी f. (-णी) A plant: see the last.
 E. धनुस् a bow, and श्रेणी a line.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=364-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धनुर्गुण|धनुर्गुणः
धनुर्गुण mf. (-णः-णा) A bow string.
	 f. (-णा) A plant, from which bow
strings are made: see the two last.
 E. धनुस् a bow, and गुण a string.
धनुषो गुणो यस्याः सकाशात् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=364-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धनुर्द्रुम|धनुर्द्रुमः
धनुर्द्रुम m. (-मः) A bamboo.
 E. धनुस् and द्रुम a tree. धनुषः साधनं द्रुमः ।
वंशवृक्षे । ततएव धनुषो जननात् ।
