<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धनुर्धर|धनुर्धरः
धनुर्धर m. (-रः) An archer, a bowyer, one armed with a bow.
 E. धनुस् a
bow, and धर who possesses. धनुर्धारयति धृ-अच् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=364-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धनुर्धारिन्
धनुर्धारिन् m. (-री) An archer, a bowyer.
 E. धनुस् and धारिन् who has.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=364-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
