धनुर्वृक्ष|धनुर्वृक्षः
धनुर्वृक्ष m. (-क्षः)
	 1. A plant; also called Dhāminiya.
	 2. A bamboo.
	 3.
A measure of four cubits.
	 4. An are, a portion of the circum-
ference of a circle.
 E. धनुस् bow, and वृक्ष a tree.
