	 1. A. bow.
	 2.
Sagittarius, the sign.
	 m. (-नुः) The piyal tree, (Buchanania
latifolia, Rox.)
 E. धन to produce, (as grain,) to throw forth,
(darts, &c.) Unādi affix उसि; also with उ affix धनु, and with ऊ
affix, धनू.
