धन्य|धन्यः
धन्य mfn. (-न्य-न्या-न्यं)
	 1. Fortunate, well fated, lucky.
	 2. Good, virtuous.
m. (-न्यः)
	 1. An infidel, an atheist.
	 2. A virtuous or fortunate man.
f. (-न्या)
	 1. Emblic myrobalan.
	 2. A nurse.
	 3. Coriander.
	 n. (-न्यं)
Wealth.
 E. धन to produce, (grain, &c.) or धन wealth, and यत् affix
of fitness.
