<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धम्मल|धम्मलः
धम्मल m. (-लः) The breast ornamented with gold or jewels: see धम्मिल्ल.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=365-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धम्मिल्ल|धम्मिल्लः
धम्मिल्ल m. (-ल्लः) Braided and ornamented hair, tied round the head,
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=365-b" target="_blank">Page365-b+ 60</a>]
and intermixed with flowers, pearls, &c.
 E. धम a Sautra root, to
breathe, affix विच्, मिल to meet, लच् or क affix, and the two
conjoined.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=365-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धया
धया mfn. (-यः-या-यी-यं) Who or what drinks.
	 f. (-या) A little girl, female
infant.
 E. धे to drink, affix श ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=365-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धर|धरः
धर mfn. (-रः-रा-री-रं) Who or what has or holds.
	 m. (-रः)
	 1. A mountain.
2. A flock of cotton.
	 3. The tortoise Avatāra.
	 4. One of the demi-
gods called VASUS.
	 f. (-रा)
	 1. The earth.
	 2. The uterus or womb.
3. Marrow.
	 4. A vessel of the body.
	 5. A golden globe or heap of
valuables, representing the earth, and given to Brāhmans.
 E. धृञ्
to have or hold, to contain or support. &c. affix अच्, or ट fem.
affix टाप् or ङीष्.
