<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धरणि|धरणिः
धरणि f. (-णिः) The earth.
 E. धृ to be contained, (animals, &c.) Unādi
affix अणि; also धरणी as above.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=365-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धरणिधर|धरणिधरः
धरणिधर m. (-रः) A name of VIṢṆU.
 E. धरणि the earth and धर who
sustains; also धरणीधर, धरणीं धरति धृ-अच् ।
