धरणीपूर|धरणीपूरः
धरणीपूर m. (-रः) The ocean.
 E. धरणी the earth, पूर to surround com-
pletely, affix अच्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=365-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धरणीप्लव|धरणीप्लवः
धरणीप्लव m. (-वः) The ocean.
 E. धरणी the earth, and प्लव what swims; in
which the earth floats. धरण्याः प्लवः यस्मात् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=365-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धरणीश्वर|धरणीश्वरः
धरणीश्वर m. (-रः) A name of ŚIVA.
 E. धरणी, and ईश्वर lord; lord of the
world. शिवे, भूमिपतौ, विष्णौ च ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=365-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
