धरणीसुता
धरणीसुता f. (-ता) A name of SĪTĀ, the wife of RĀMA.
 E. धरणी the
earth, and सुता daughter; the earth-born; being turned up from
the soil by a plough, as JANAKA was ploughing a spot to prepare
it for a sacrifice.
