धरिमन्
धरिमन् m. (-मा)
	 1. Form, figure, semblance.
	 2. A balance, a pair of
scales.
 E. धृ to have or hold, Unādi affix इमनिच्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=365-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धरिममेय
धरिममेय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Measurable by weight.
 E. धरिम, and मेय to be
measured.
