धर्त्तव्य|धर्तव्य|धर्त्तव्यं
धर्त्तव्य mfn. (-व्यः-व्या-व्यं)
	 1. To be uphold or supported.
	 2. To be had or
possessed.
	 3. To be placed or fixed.
	 4. To be fallen or alighted by.
E. धृ to hold, तव्य aff.
