धर्म्मकाय m. (-यः) A jina or jaina deified saint.
 E. धर्म्म virtue, and काय
body; virtue personified. धर्मार्थं कायोऽस्य, बुद्धे ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=366-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धर्म्मकार्य्य|धर्मकार्य
धर्म्मकार्य्य n. (-र्य्यं)
	 1. Any indispensable act of religion, &c.
	 2. Religious
or virtuous conduct.
 E. धर्म्म piety, and कार्य्य act.
