<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धर्म्मक्षेत्र|धर्मक्षेत्र|धर्मक्षेत्रः|धर्म्मक्षेत्रं
धर्म्मक्षेत्र n. (-त्रं) A plain in the north west of India near Delhi, the
scene of the great battle between the Kurus and Paṇḍus.
	 m.
(-त्रः) A man of piety and virtue.
 E. धर्म्म. virtue, holiness, and क्षेत्र
a field, literally or figuratively.
