<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धर्म्मघ्न|धर्मघ्न
धर्म्मघ्न mfn. (-घ्नः-घ्नी-घ्नं) immoral, unlawful, contrary to law or duty. E.
धर्म्म, and घ्न what destroys.
