<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धातुघ्न|धातुघ्नं
धातुघ्न n. (-घ्नं) Sour gruel, prepared from the fermentation of rice-water.
E. धात chyle, and घ्न destroying; also similar compounds.
