धामन्
धामन् n. (-मः)
	 1. The body.
	 2. A house, a dwelling.
	 3. Dignity, conse-
quence, eminence.
	 4. Spirit, pride, especially martial pride, hero-
ism.
	 5. Light, splendour, radiance.
	 6. A ray of light.
	 7. A place,
a spot, a country.
	 8. Birth.
 E. धा to contain, (life, a tenant, &c.)
and मनिन् aff.
