नकुलेष्टा
नकुलेष्टा f. (-ष्टा) A plant: see रास्ना.
 E. नकुल an ichneumon, and इष्ट wished;
the mungoose, if wounded in a conflict with a poisonous snake, is
supposed to prevent the effects of the venom by the use of this
plant; also नकुलेष्टका.
