	 m. (-रः)
	 1. A goblin, a demon.
2. A tree, the Bdellium tree: see गुग्गुल.
	 3. An owl, 4. A thief. E.
नक्त by night, and चर who goes. नक्तं रात्रौ चरति चर-ट ।
