नग्निका
नग्निका f. (-का)
	 1. A girl before menstruation or about ten years old.
2. A naked woman.
 E. नग्न naked, संज्ञायां कन् added: and the fem.
from, see नग्नक ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=376-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नग्नीकरण
नग्नीकरण n. (-णं) Stripping, undressing.
 E. नग्न, and करण making, च्वि
augment.
