<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नग्नीकृत
नग्नीकृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Undressed, stripped, naked.
 E. नग्न, and कृत
made, च्वि aff.
