<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नज
नज (ओ ई) ओनजी r. 6th cl. (नजते) also (इ, ओ) (ओनजि) r. 1st cl. (नञ्जते)
To be ashamed, to be modest or bashful. तुदा० आ० अक० सेट् भ्वा०
इदित् च ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=376-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नज्
नज् ind. A particle of negation, prohibition, &c. (no, not:) see अ and न ।
