	 1. A son.
	 2. A frog.
	 3. VIṢṆU.
	 n. (-नं) INDRA'S pleasure
ground, elysium.
	 2. A species of the Dhritti metre.
	 f. (-ना) A
daughter.
 E. नदि to be or make happy, affix ल्यु ।
