नन्दि|नंदि|नंदिः|नन्दिः
नन्दि mn. (-न्दिः-न्दि)
	 1. Gambling, gaming.
	 2. Happiness.
	 m. (-न्दिः)
	 1.
One of ŚIVA'S principal attendants.
	 2. The speaker of the prologue
or prelude to a drama.
	 3. One who pronounces a benediction. E.
नदि to make happy, and इन् Unādi aff.
