नन्दिनीतनय|नन्दिनीतनयः
नन्दिनीतनय m. (-यः) A name of VYĀRI, author of a vocabulary.
 E. नन्दिनी
as above, and तनय a son; also similar compounds, as नन्दिनीसुत,
नन्दिनीपुत्त्र, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=378-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
