	 1. name of NANDĪ, ŚIVA'S attendant.
	 2. A name of
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=378-b" target="_blank">Page378-b+ 60</a>]
ŚIVA.
	 3. A species of musical rhythm.
 E. नन्दी INDRA'S garden,
