नन्नम्यमान
नन्नम्यमान mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Bending or bowing very low.
 E. नम् to bow,
intens. form, शानच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नपुंसक|नपुंसकं|नपुंसकः
नपुंसक mn. (-कः-कं)
	 1. A eunuch.
	 2. An impotent or imbecile man.
	 3.
The neuter gender.
 E. न not. पुंसक male.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नप्तृ
नप्तृ m. (-प्ता) A grandson.
	 f. (-प्त्री) A grand daughter.
 E. न not, पत् to fall,
तृच् Unādi affix; propping or sustaining the family.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभ|नभः
नभ m. (-भः)
	 1. The month Srāvana.
	 2. Æther, atmosphere.
	 f. (-भा)
	 1.
A spitting pot.
	 2. The city of the sun.
 E. नह् to bind, affix भ; see
नभस ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभःक्रान्तिन्|नभःक्रांतिन्
नभःक्रान्तिन् m. (-न्ती) A lion.
 E. नभस् a cloud, and क्रान्तिन् who goes;
whose shape is seen in the clouds.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभःप्राण|नभःप्राणः
नभःप्राण m. (-णः) Air, wind.
 E. नभस् atmosphere and प्राण life or
breath.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभःसद्
नभःसद् m. (-सद्) A deity.
 E. नभस् heaven, and सद who travels, from सद्
to go, with क्विप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभःसरित्
नभःसरित् f. (-रित्) The celestial Ganges.
 E. नभस् heaven, and सरित् a
river.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभःस्थ
नभःस्थ mfn. (-स्थः-स्था-स्थं) Celestial, ærial, heavenly, ethereal,
 E. नभस्,
and स्थ what stays; also नभस्स्थ ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभःस्थित|नभःस्थितः
नभःस्थित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Abiding in heaven or in the sky.
	 m. (-तः) A
division of the infernal regions, a hell.
 E. नभस् atmosphere, and
स्थित a staying; also नभस्स्थित ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभश्चक्षुस्
नभश्चक्षुस् m. (-क्षुः) The sun.
 E. नभस् heaven, and चक्षुस् the eye.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभश्चमस|नभश्चमसः
नभश्चमस m. (-सः)
	 1. The moon.
	 2. A variegated cake.
	 3. Conjuring. E.
नभस् heaven, and चमस a short of ladle, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभश्चर|नभश्चरः
नभश्चर mfn. (-रः-री-रं) going in the air or heaven.
	 m. (-रः)
	 1. A bird.
2. A Vidyādhara or demi-god so called.
	 3. A cloud.
	 4. Air, wind.
E. नभस् heaven, and चर who goes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभस्
नभस् m. (-भाः)
	 1. The month Srāvana, (July-August)
	 2. A cloud.
	 3.
The rains, rainy season.
	 4. Smell.
	 5. The fibres in the root of the
lotus.
	 6. A bird.
	 7. A grey-headed man.
	 n. (-भः) sky, atmosphere,
ether or heaven.
 E. नभ् to injure, to be annihilated, (at the end of
the world,) Unādi affix असुन्, or नह् to bind, and भ substituted
for ह.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभस|नभसं|नभसः
नभस n. (-सं) Heaven, sky, &c. see the last.
 E. नभ as above, Unādi affix
असच् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभसङ्गम|नभसंगम|नभसंगमः|नभसङ्गमः
नभसङ्गम m. (-मः) A bird.
 E. नभस heaven, गम् to go, affix खच् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभस्तल|नभस्तलं
नभस्तल m. (-लः) The atmosphere.
 E. नभस् sky, and तल below.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभस्य|नभस्यः
नभस्य m. (-स्यः) The month Bhādra, (August-September.)
 E. नभस् a
cloud or rain, and यत् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभस्वत्|नभस्वन्त्
नभस्वत् m. (-स्वान्) Air, wind.
 E. नभस्, and मतुप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभाक|नभाकं|नभाकः
नभाक n. (-कं) Darkness.
 E. नभ् to injure, आक Unādi aff.
