<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभोगज|नभोगजः
नभोगज m. (-जः) A cloud.
 E. नभस् sky, and गज an elephant.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभोगति|नभोगतिः
नभोगति f. (-तिः) Flying, soaring, going in the air.
 E. नभस् sky, and
