<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभोदुह|नभोदुहः
नभोदुह m. (-हः) A cloud.
 E. नभस् rain, दुह् to milk, affix क.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभोद्वीप|नभोद्वीपः
नभोद्वीप m. (-पः) A cloud.
 E. नभस् rain, द्वीप an island.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभोधूम|नभोधूमः
नभोधूम m. (-मः) A cloud.
 E. नभस् sky, and धूम smoke.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभोनदी
नभोनदी f. (-दी) The celestial Ganges.
 E. नभस् heaven, and नदी a river.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभोमणि|नभोमणिः
नभोमणि m. (-णिः) The sun.
 E. नभस् sky, मणि a gem.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभोम्बुप|नभोंबुप|नभोम्बुपः
नभोऽम्बुप m. (-पः) The Chātaka, (Cuculus melanoleucos.)
 E. नभस् sky,
अम्बु water, and प who drinks.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभोरजस
नभोरजस n. (-जः) Darkness.
 E. नभस् sky, and रजस् dust.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभोरेणु|नभोरेणुः
नभोरेणु f. (-णुः) Fog, mist, vapour.
 E. नभस् sky, and रेणु thin dust.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभोलय|नभोलयः
नभोलय m. (-यः) Smoke.
 E. नभस् sky, and लय abode.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभोलिह्
नभोलिह् mfn. (-लिट्) Lofty, towering, rising to the clouds.
 E. नभस्,
and लिह् what touches.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभ्य|नभ्यं
नभ्य mfn. (-भ्यः-भ्या-भ्यं) Relating to the nave of a wheel, resembling it,
&c.
 E. नभ for नाभि, and यत् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभ्राज्
नभ्राज् m. (-भ्राट्) A cloud.
 E. न negative, भ्राज् to shine, affix क्विप् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नम|नमः
नम r. 1st cl. (नमति) To bow, to pay obeisance. r. 10th cl. (नमयति-
नामयति) To bend, to bow: see णम ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नमत्
नमत् mfn. (-मन्-मन्ती-मत्) Bending, stooping, bowed.
 E. नम् to bow, शतृ
aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नमत|नमतः
नमत m. (-तः)
	 1. A master, a lord.
	 2. An actor, a mime.
	 3. A cloud. E.
नम to bow or bend, Unādi affix कर्मणि अतच् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नमयत्
नमयत् mfn. (-यन्-यन्ती-यत्) Bending, directing downward, declining. E.
नम् to bow. r. 10th cl. शतृ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नमस्
नमस् ind.
	 1. Gift, present.
	 2. Bowing, bending, salutation, obeisance.
3. An inarticulate cry.
	 4. The term used in connexion with the
name of a deity in the fourth case to signify veneration, as रामाय नमः
salutation, glory or reverence to RĀMA.
 E. नम् to bend, and affix
असुन-सच् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नमस|नमसः
नमस m. (-सः) Agreement, concord.
 E. नम् to bow, affix असच् । अनुकूले च ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नमसित|नमसितः
नमसित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Reverenced, respected, worshipped.
 E. नमस्
bowing, क्यप् affix, and क्त added, य rejected: see नमस्यित ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नमस्कार|नमस्कारः
नमस्कार m. (-रः)
	 1. Respectful or reverential address or salutation.
	 2.
A sort of poison.
	 f. (-री) A sensitive plant.
 E. नमस् bowing, and
कार making, fem. affix अच० गौरा० ङीष्; or नमस् + कृ + घञ् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नमस्कृत्वा
नमस्कृत्वा ind. Having saluted reverentially.
 E. नमस्, and कृत्वा having
made.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नमस्य|नमस्यः
नमस्य mfn. (-स्यः-स्या-स्यं) Venerable, respectable, entitled to salutation
or civility.
	 f. (-स्या) Reverence, respect, worship, adoration.
 E. नमस्
respect, क्यच् aff or नामधातुः नमस्य कर्मणि यत् अल्लोपयल्लोपौ ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नमस्यत्
नमस्यत् mfn. (-स्यन्-स्यन्ती-स्यत्) Saluting reverentially, bowing to, paying
adoration.
 E. नमस् nominal verb, to bow, शतृ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नमस्यित|नमस्यितः
नमस्यित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Reverenced, respected. worshipped.
 E. नमस् res-
pect, affix क्यप्, and the participial affix क्त; also नमसित ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नमित|नमितः
नमित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Bowed, making salutation or obeisance.
	 2.
Bowed, bent down.
 E. नम् to bend, causal form, affix णिच् क्त वा
ह्रस्वः ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नमुचि|नमुचिः
नमुचि m. (-चिः)
	 1. The deity of love.
	 2. A demon so named.
 E. न nega-
tive, मुच् to loose, and कि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नमुचिमूदन
नमुचिमूदन m. (-नः) A name of INDRA.
 E. नमुचि the demon, and सूदन des-
troyer; also similar names, as नमुचिद्विष्, &c. नमुचिं सूदयति हिनस्ति
सूदि-ल्यु ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नमेरु|नमेरुः
नमेरु m. (-रुः) The seed of the Elæocarpus.
 E. न not, मेरु the mountain
Meru, or नम वा एरु ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नमोगुरु|नमोगुरुः
नमोगुरु m. (-रुः) A spiritual teacher.
 E. नमस् reverence, and गुरु a
teacher.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नम्ब
नम्ब r. 1st cl. (नम्बति) To go, to move.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नम्र|नम्रः
नम्र mfn. (-म्रः-म्रा-म्रं) Crooked, curved, bent, bowed.
 E. नम् to bow, affix र.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नम्रक|नम्रकः
नम्रक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Bent or bowed, stooping.
 E. कत् added to the
last. नम्र इव कायति कै-क ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नम्रमुख
नम्रमुख mfn. (-खः-खी-खं) Looking down, having the head bent.
 E. नम्र,
and मुख the face.
