 E. नम्र, and
मूर्त्ति form.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नम्राङ्ग
नम्राङ्ग mfn. (-ङ्गः-ङ्गी-ङ्गं) Bent, bowed, stooping.
 E. नम्र, and अङ्ग the
body.
