<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नयनवारि
नयनवारि n. (-रि) Tears.
 E. नयन, and वारि water.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=379-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नयनामोषिन्
नयनामोषिन् mfn. (-षी-षिणी-षि) Sight-stealing, blinding.
 E. नयन, and
आमोषिन् what steals.
