नयसिद्धि
नयसिद्धि f. (-द्धिः) Political success, accomplishing any thing by good
management.
 E. नय, and सिद्धि success.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=379-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नर|नरं|नरः
नर m. (-रः)
	 1. Man, individually or generally.
	 2. The Eternal, the
divine imperishable spirit pervading the universe.
	 3. A name of
ARJUNA.
	 4. VIṢṆU.
	 5. A gnomon.
	 6. A man or piece at chess,
draughts, &c.
	 7. A Muni, an incarnation of VIṢṆU.
	 n. (-रं) A
fragrant grass, commonly Rāmkappur.
	 f. (-रौ) Woman in general:
see नारी.
 E. नॄ or नृ to lead or guide, affix नये-अच् । गणितशास्त्रोक्ते
छायाप्रमाण ज्ञानोपयोगिनि शङ्कौ च ।
