नरक|नरकं|नरकः
नरक mn. (-कः-कं) Hell, the infernal regions, including a number of
places of torture of various descriptions.
	 m. (-कः) The name of a
Daitya or demon.
 E. नृ to guide or lead, affix वुन्, whither the
wicked are conducted: It is sometimes read नारक ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=379-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
