<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरकस्थ
नरकस्थ mfn. (-स्थः-स्था-स्थं) Living or being in Tartarus, who or what is
there.
	 f. (-स्था) The river of hell named “Baitarany”.
 E. नरक hell,
स्थ who stays or abides, fem. affix टाप् ।
