	 3. A bard, a herald.
	 4. An elephant.
	 5. A reed,
(Arundo karka, Rox.)
	 6. A peacock.
	 f. (-की)
	 1. An actress, female
dancer or singing girl.
	 2. A female elephant.
	 3. A peahen.
 E. नृत्
to dance or act, ष्वुन् aff.
