नर्म्मद्युति mfn. (-तिः-तिः-ति) Happy, merry.
	 f. (-तिः) Enjoyment of a joke
or any amusement.
 E. नर्म्म, and द्युति lustre.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=380-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नर्म्मन्|नर्मन्
नर्म्मन् n. (-र्म्म)
	 1. Sport, amusement, pastime, diversion.
	 2. Jest, joke.
3. Wit, humour.
 E. नृ to guide, affix मनिन् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=380-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

