नागवारिक|नागवारिकः
नागवारिक m. (-कः) Garuda, the bird of VIṢṆU.
	 2. A peacock.
	 3. A
royal elephant.
	 4. An elephant driver or keeper.
	 5. The chief
person in a court or assembly.
 E. नाग an elephant, वृ to cherish,
&c. affix ठक् ।
