नागाञ्चला
नागाञ्चला f. (-ला) A stick or pole driven into a square piece of earth
in the centre of a newly dug pond, a boring rod.
 E. नाग a snake,
and अञ्चला end of a garment; it is also written नागाञ्चना f. (-ना)
see नागयष्टि ।
