नाटक|नाटकं|नाटकः
नाटक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) An actor, acting, dancing, &c.
	 m. (-कः) a play,
a drama: the first of the ten species of dramatic compositions of
the first order.
	 f. (-की) The court of INDRA.
 E. नट् to act or per-
form, ण्वुल् aff.
