नाडीकेल m. (-लः) The cocoanut: see नाडिकेल.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=384-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाडीच|नाडीचः
नाडीच n. (-चं) An esculent root, (Arum colocasia.)
 E. नाडी a tube, चर्
