नादेय|नादेयं|नादेयः
नादेय mfn. (-यः-यी-यं) Ocean or river-born, marine, aquatic.
	 n. (-यं)
	 1.
Sea salt.
	 2. Antimony.
	 f. (-यी)
	 1. A sort of reed growing usually
near water, (Calamus fasciculatus. Rox.)
	 2. A plant, (Premna
herbacea, Rox.)
	 3. The orange.
	 4. A tree see जयन्ती 5. The China
rose.
 E. नद a river or the sea, and ढक् affix, fem. affix ङीप्; also
with कन् added, in the fem. form नादेयिका f. (-का ।)
