नाम ind. A particle implying.
	 1. Certainty.
	 2. Possibility.
	 3. Anger.
4. Reproach.
	 5. Consent, promise.
	 6. Recollection.
	 7. Surprise.
	 8.
Pretence, &c. as हिमालयो नाम नगाधिपः Himālaya, evidently the
king of mountains, इह नाम सीता भविष्यति SITĀ will perhaps be
here, &c.
 E. णम् to call or address, affix ड. deriv. irr. नाम्यते नामि-ड ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=385-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
