नामकरण|नामकरणं
नामकरण n. (-णं) Naming a child first after birth.
 E. नाम, and करण
making.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=385-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नामग्रह|नामग्रहः
