नाय|नायः
नाय m. (-यः)
	 1. Guiding, directing, (morally or physically.)
	 2. Policy.
3. Obtaining.
	 4. Means, expedient.
 E. णी to guide, &c. affix ण or
घञ्; also with अच् affix नय.
