नायक|नायकः
नायक m. (-कः)
	 1. A guide, a leader, a conductor.
	 2. A chief, a head,
pre-eminent, principal.
	 3. A general, a commander, 4. The cen-
tral gem of a necklace.
	 5. (In Erotic poetry,) The man, the
husband or lover.
	 f. (-यिका)
	 1. mistress, a wife, the female in the
amatory poetry of the Hindūs.
	 2. A sort of goddess, an inferior
form of DURGĀ, and attendant upon her: there are eight Nā-
yikās.
 E. णी to guide, ण्वुल् aff.
