नारक|नारकः
नारक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Infernal, hellish.
	 m. (-कः) Hell or the infernal
regions.
 E. नरक hell. अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=385-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नारकिन्
नारकिन् mfn. (-की-किनी-कि) Infernal, being in hell, condemned to or
deserving it.
 E. नारक, and इनि aff.
