नाल|नालं|नालः
नाल mfn. (-लः-ला or -ली-लं)
	 1. A hollow or tubular stalk, the stalk of
the water lily, &c.
	 2. Any pipe or tube.
	 3. A handle.
	 n. (-लं) Yellow
orpiment.
	 f. (-ली)
	 1. A stalk or culm..
	 2. An instrument for perfora-
ting an elephant's ear.
	 3. A period of time, a Ghati, twenty-four
minutes.
	 4. Any tubular vessel of the body.
	 5. The pulse.
 E. णल्
to bind, affix ण, fem. affix टाप्, and ङीष्, &c.
