<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नालिक|नालिकः
नालिक m. (-कः) A buffalo.
	 n. (-कं) A lotus.
	 f. (-का)
	 1. A tubular stalk.
2. An instrument for piercing an elephant's ear.
	 3. A plant,
commonly Charmaghās.
	 4. A sort of potherb, (Hibiscus canna-
binus.)
	 5. Any plant growing on a hollow stem, as San, safflower,
a mushroom, &c.
	 6. A flute.
 E. नाली as above, and कन् aff. or नाल्या
कायति कै-क ।
