<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाविक|नाविकः
नाविक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Belonging to a vessel, or a boat, &c.
	 m. (-कः)
	 1.
The helmsman of a vessel, the steersman, the pilot.
	 2. A. sailor.
E. नौ a boat, affix ठन्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाव्य|नाव्यं
नाव्य mfn. (-व्यः-व्या-व्यं)
	 1. Navigable.
	 2. Belonging to a boat.
	 n. (-व्यं)
Newness, novelty.
 E. नौ a boat or vessel, and यत् affix; or नव new,
ष्यञ् aff. नावा तीर्य्यते असौ, नवस्य भावः वा ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाश|नाशः
नाश m. (-शः)
	 1. Annihilation, loss, destruction, disappearance, ruin.
	 2.
Death.
	 3. Flight, retreat.
	 4. Abandonment, desertion. (In Arith-
metic.)
	 5. Elimination.
 E. णश् to cease to be, affix भावे घञ्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाशन
नाशन n. (-नं)
	 1. Destruction, perishing.
	 2. Removal, expulsion.
 E. णश्
to perish, affix णिच्. ल्युट्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाशयत्
नाशयत् mfn. (-यन्-यन्ती-यत्) destroying annihilating.
 E. णश् to perish,
causal form, शतृ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाशित
नाशित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Destroyed.
 E. नश् to perish, causal form. क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाशिन्
नाशिन् mfn. (-शी-शिनी-शि)
	 1. Destructive, destroying, a destroyer.
	 2.
Perishing, being lost or destroyed.
 E. नश् to cease to be, in the
causal from, affix इनि; or नाश, and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाष्टिक|नाष्टिकः
नाष्टिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Belonging or relating to any thing lost.
	 m.
(-कः) The owner of any thing lost.
 E. नष्ट, and ठक् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नासत्य
नासत्य m. du. (-त्यौ) The two sons of AŚHWINĪ, and physicians of
Svarga.
	 f. (-त्या) The constellation AŚHWINĪ.
 E. न not, असत्य
impure.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नासा
नासा f. (-सा)
	 1. The nose.
	 2. The upper timber of a door.
	 3. The trunk
of an elephant.
 E. णस् to sound, to stand, अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नासाछिन्नी|नासाच्छिन्नी
नासाछिन्नी f. (-न्नी) A sort of bird; also पूर्णिका.
 E. नासा the nose, छिन्न
cut, fem. affix ङीप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नासादक्षिणावर्त्त|नासादक्षिणावर्त
नासादक्षिणावर्त्त m. (-र्त्तः) Wearing the nose-ring in the right nostril by
women who have money and children.
 E. नासा the nose, दक्षिण
the right, and आवर्त्त a turning.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नासादारु|नासादारुः
नासादारु m. (-रुः) The upper timber of a door: see नासा.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नासानाह|नासानाहः
नासानाह m. (-हः) Thickening of the membrance of the nose, stoppage
of the nostrils.
 E. नासा, and नाह binding
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नासापरिस्राव|नासापरिस्रावः
नासापरिस्राव m. (-वः)
	 1. Running at the nose.
	 2. A running cold.
 E. नासा
and परिस्राव flow.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नासारन्ध्र|नासारंध्र
नासारन्ध्र n. (-न्ध्रं) The nostril.
 E. नासा, and रन्ध्र a hole.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नासालु|नासालुः
नासालु m. (-लुः) A plant, commonly Kāyaphal: see कट्फल.
 E. नासा
the nose, and लु to cut, affix डु.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नासावंश|नासावंशः
नासावंश m. (-शः) The bridge of the nose.
 E. नासा and वंश bamboo.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नासावामावर्त्त|नासावामावर्त|नासावामावर्तः
नासावामावर्त्त m. (-र्त्तः) Wearing the nose-ring in the left nostril, a
mark of sorrow or distress.
 E. नासा the nose. वाम the left side,
आवर्त्त a turning.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नासाशोष
नासाशोष m. (-षः) Dryness of the nostrils.
 E. नासा and शोष drying.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नासिकन्धम|नासिकंधम|नासिकन्धमः
नासिकन्धम mfn. (-मः-मा-मं) Blowing or breathing through the nose,
snoring, &c.
 E. नासिका the nose, ध्मा to blow &c. affix खश्. मुम्
ह्रस्वश्च ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नासिकन्धय|नासिकंधय|नासिकन्धयः
नासिकन्धय mfn. (-यः-यी-यं) Drinking through the nose.
 E. नासिका, and घेट् to drink, affix. खञ् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नासिका
नासिका f. (-का)
	 1. The nose.
	 2. The upper timber, or nose as it
were, of a door.
	 3. A name of the nymph AŚHwini.
 E. नासा as
above, affix कन् fem. form. or नास शब्दे ण्वुल् । The same as नासा ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नासिकाग्र
नासिकाग्र m. (-ग्रं) The tip of the nose.
 E. नासिका, and अग्र end.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नासिकामल|नासिकामलं|नासिकामलः
नासिकामल n. (-लं) The mucus of the nose, snot.
 E. नासिका, and मल
excrement; it may also be नासामल । शिङ्घाणे ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नासिक्य|नासिक्यं|नासिक्यः
नासिक्य m. du. (-क्यौ)
	 1. The two sons of Aśhwini.
	 2. A nasal sound.
n. (-क्यं) The nose.
 E. नासिका, and यत् affix of identity or descent.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नासिक्यक|नासिक्यकं
नासिक्यक n. (-कं) The nose.
 E. कन् added to the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नासीर|नासीरं
नासीर n. (-रं) Advancing or skirmishing in front of an army, leaving
the line, and defying the enemy by shouts and gestures.
	 m. (-रः)
The van, or a champion who advances before the line.
 E. णास् to
sound, affix ईरन्; or नासाय शब्दाय इर्त्ते इर-क ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नास्ति
नास्ति ind. Nonexistence, not so, it is not.
 E. न negative, and अस्ति is,
third person, singular, present tense of अस् to be.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नास्तिक|नास्तिकः
नास्तिक m. (-कः) An atheist, but applied by the orthodox Hindūs, to
any one who denies the divine authority of the Vedas, or doubts
the legends of the Purānas, or a future life or the existence of a
ruler, or creator of the universe.
 E. नास्ति there is not (a god &c.)
and ठन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नास्तिकता
नास्तिकता f. (-ता) Atheism, denial of the deity, of a future state, of
the divinity of the Vedas; Buddhism, heresy, &c.
 E. तल् abs-
tract affix added to the preceding: also with त्व नास्तिकत्व, or with
यत् affix नास्तिक्य ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नास्तिक्य|नास्तिक्यं
नास्तिक्य n. (-क्यं) Infidelity, atheism, heresy.
 E. नास्तिक, and यत् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नास्तित्व
नास्तित्व n. (-त्वं) Nonexistence.
 E. त्व added to नास्ति; also with तल् affix
नास्तिता; ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नास्तिद|नास्तिदः
नास्तिद m. (-दः) The mango tree.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नास्य|नास्यं
नास्य n. (-स्यं) The rein of an ox passed through the septum of the
nostrils.
 E. नासा the nose, शरीरावयवत्वात् यत् aff. नासायां भवम् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाह|नाहः
नाह m. (-हः)
	 1. Binding, confinement.
	 2. A trap, a snare for catching
deer, &c.
	 3. Obstruction in any organ or secretion of the body,
as costiveness, &c.
 E. णह् to bind, affix भावे घञ् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाहल|नाहलः
नाहल m. (-लः) A man of a barbarous or outcast tribe.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाहुषि|नाहुषिः
नाहुषि m. (-षिः) The name of a king; also YAYĀTI.
 E. नहुष, and इञ्
affix of descent. Also नाहुष ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=386-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःकारण
निःकारण mfn. (-णः-णा-णं) Causeless, unfounded.
 E. निर् neg. कारण
cause.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःकासन
निःकासन n. (-नं) Expulsion, exile, turning out.
 E. निर्, and कस् to go,
causal form, ल्युट् affix; also निःकाशन ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःकासित|निःकासितः
निःकासित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Turned out or forth, expelled, removed. E.
निर् out, कस् to go, in the causal form, affix क्त; also निष्कासित,
निःकाशित and निष्काशित ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःक्रामित|निःक्रामितः
निःक्रामित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Expelled, turned out.
 E. निः for निर् out,
क्रामित caused to go, also निष्क्रामित ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःक्षत्र
निःक्षत्र mfn. (-त्रः-त्रा-त्रं) Having none of the military tribe, (in a city,
&c.)
 E. निर् not, चत्र a Kṣatriya.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःक्षिप्त
निःक्षिप्त mfn. (-प्तः-प्ता-प्तं)
	 1. Thrown or sent away.
	 2. Spent.
	 3. Passed. E.
निर् before, क्षिप्त to throw, &c. affix क्त ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःक्षिप्य
निःक्षिप्य ind.
	 1. Having thrown or sent away.
	 2. Having spent, (as
time.)
	 3. Having wiped away, (as tears,) &c.
 E. निर् before, क्षिप्
to throw, and ल्यप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःक्षेप|निःक्षेपः
निःक्षेप m. (-पः)
	 1. Throwing, sending, putting away.
	 2. Spending. 3
Passing, (as time.)
	 4. Wiping away, (as tears)
 E. निर् and क्षिप् to
throw, घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःप्रभ|निःप्रभः
निःप्रभ mfn. (-भः-भा-भं) Gloomy, dark, obscured.
 E. निः for निर् priva-
tive, and प्रभा light; also निष्प्रभ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःफल
निःफल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Fruitless, barren.
 E. निर् neg. फल fruit, more
commonly निष्फल.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःशंसय
निःशंसय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Undoubted.
 E. निः for निर्, शंसय doubt.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःशङ्क
निःशङ्क mfn. (-ङ्कः-ङ्का-ङ्कं) Fearless.
 E. निर् and शङ्का apprehension.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःशलाक|निःशलाकः
निःशलाक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Solitary, private.
 E. निः for निर् privative, and
शलाका the maina; not even frequented by birds; also निश्शलाक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःशब्द|निःशब्दः
निःशब्द mfn. (-ब्दः-ब्दा-ब्दं) Silent, voiceless.
 E. निः for निर्, and शब्द sound.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःशूक|निःशूकः
निःशूक m. (-कः) Rice without any awn or beard.
 E. निः for निर् and
शूक beard of corn.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःशेष|निःशेषं
निःशेष mfn. (-षः-षा-षं) Complete, entire.
 E. निः for निर् negative, and शेष
remainder; also निश्शेष.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःशोध्य|निःशोध्यं
निःशोध्य mfn. (-ध्यः-ध्या-ध्यं) Cleansed, cleared, purified.
 E. निः for निर्
implying completion, and शोध्य pure; also निश्शोध्य.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःश्रयणी
निःश्रयणी f. (-णी) Wooden steps, a ladder, a staircase.
 E. निः for निर्
out, forth, श्रि to go, affix ल्युट्; also with अच् affix, and इनि added,
निःश्रयिणी.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःश्रेणि|निःश्रेणिः
निःश्रेणि f. (-णिः-णी)
	 1. A ladder or staircase, a flight of steps.
	 2. The
wild date tree.
 E. निः for निर् implying certainty, and श्रेणी a line
also निश्श्रेणी.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निश्रेयसः
निश्रेयसः n. (-यः)
	 1. Final beatitude, the release of the soul from the
body, and its reunion with the primary and universal spirit.
	 2.
Happiness, welfare.
	 3. Knowledge, learning.
	 4. Belief, faith,
devotedness.
	 5. Apprehension, conception.
	 m. (-याः) A name of
ŚIVA.
 E. निः for निर् implying eternity or certainty, श्रेयस् best, अच्
added; also निश्श्रेयस.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःश्वसन|निःश्वसनं
निःश्वसन n. (-नं)
	 1. Sighing, &c.
	 2. Breathing out.
 E. निर् and श्वसन
breathing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःश्वसित
निःश्वसित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Sighed, sig hing.
	 2. Breathing out.
	 n.
(-तं)
	 1. Expiration.
	 2. Sighing.
 E. निर् and श्वस् to breathe, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःश्वस्य
निःश्वस्य ind. Having sighed.
 E. निर् and श्वस् to breathe, affix ल्यप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःश्वास|निःश्वासः
निःश्वास m. (-सः)
	 1. Breathing out, expiration.
	 2. Sighing.
 E. निर्, and
श्वस् to breathe, भावे घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःश्वासपरम
निःश्वासपरम mfn. (-मः-मा-मं) Sorrowful.
 E. निःश्वास and परम best.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःषमम्
निःषमम् ind.
	 1. A particle of reproof, (improperly, unseasonably.) 2
A term of regret, (das!)
 E. निर् not, सम equal to, र is changed to
Visarga, and स becomes ष.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःसङ्ग|निःसंग|निःसंगः|निःसङ्गः
निःसङ्ग mfn. (-ङ्गः-ङ्गा-ङ्गं)
	 1. Separated, unconnected.
	 2. Regardless,
indifferent, free from attachment or desire.
 E. निर् not, सङ्ग associa-
tion.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःसंज्ञ
निःसंज्ञ mfn. (-ज्ञः-ज्ञा-ज्ञं) Senseless, insensible.
 E. निर् not, संज्ञा sign of
life.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःसत्य
निःसत्य mfn. (-त्यः-त्या-त्यं) False, untrue.
 E. निर् neg. सत्य true.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःसत्यता
निःसत्यता f. (-ता) Insincerity, falsehood.
 E. निर् neg. सत्यता truth.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःसत्व
निःसत्व mfn. (-त्वः-त्वा-त्वं)
	 1. Weak, impotent.
	 2. Insignificant, mean,
low.
	 3. Nonexistent.
	 4. Insubstantial.
	 n. (-त्वं)
	 1. Insignificance,
absence of power or consideration.
	 2. Nonexistence.
 E. निर् neg.
सत्व substance, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःस
निःस(ष)न्धि mfn. (-न्धिः-न्धिः-न्धि) Firm, well-knit, compact.
 E. निर् not, सन्धि
junction; the joints of which are not perceivable. निष्क्रान्तः सन्धेः
सुश्लिष्टित्वात् निरादिस० सुषमा-षत्वम् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःसम्पात|निःसंपात|निःसंपातः|निःसम्पातः
निःसम्पात m. (-तः)
	 1. Without motion.
	 2. Midnight.
 E. निर् neg. सम्पात
going, from पत् to go, with सम् prefix, and घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःसरण|निःसरणं
निःसरण n. (-णं)
	 1. Death, dying.
	 2. A means or expedient.
	 3. Exit, a
going forth or out.
	 4. Final beatitude.
	 5. The entrance into a house
or town, &c. the gate, the gate-way.
 E. निर् forth or out, सृ, to go,
भावे ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःसह
निःसह mfn. (-हः-हा-हं)
	 1. Intolerable, unbearable.
	 2. Irresistible.
	 3.
Unable to support or bear.
 E. निर् neg. सह bearing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःसहत्व
निःसहत्व n. (-त्वं)
	 1. Inability to bear or support.
	 2. Impatience, unen-
durance.
 E. निःसह, and त्व affix; also with तल् निःसहता.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःसाध्वस
निःसाध्वस mfn. (-सः-सा-सं) Bold, fearless.
 E. निर् and साध्वस fear.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःसार|निःसारः
निःसार mfn. (-रः-रा-रं)
	 1. Sapless, pithless.
	 2. Worthless, vain, insubs-
tantial.
	 m. (-रः)
	 1. A plant, (Trophis aspera.)
	 2. Going forth.
	 f. (-रा)
The plantain.
 E. निर् privative, सार essence, pith; or निर् out, सृ
to go, घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःसारण|निःसारणं
निःसारण n. (-णं)
	 1. Going forth or out.
	 2. The entrance of a house or
town, &c. the passage, the road of ingress and egress.
 E. निर् forth
or out, and सृ to go णिच्ल्युट् aff; see निःसरण.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःसारित|निःसारितः
निःसारित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Turned forth or out, expelled, dismissed. E.
निर् out, and सारित caused to go. निर सृ-णिच् कर्मणि क्त ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःसुख
निःसुख mfn. (-खः-खा-खं)
	 1. Disagreeable, distressing.
	 2. Unhappy. E.
निर् neg. सुख pleasure.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःसृत
निःसृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Gone forth or out.
 E. निर्, and सृ to go, affix क्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःस्नेह|निःस्नेहः
निःस्नेह mfn. (-हः-हा-हं)
	 1. Dry, not greasy or unctuous.
	 2. Cold, in-
sensible, unfeeling.
	 f. (-हा) Linseed, (Linum utilitissimum.) E.
निर् forth, out, and स्नेह oil; whence oil is extracted or expressed,
&c. or निर् privative, स्नेह oil or affection.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःस्पृह
निःस्पृह mfn. (-हः-हा-हं)
	 1. Free from desire.
	 2. Disregarding, indiffer-
ent to.
 E. निर् neg. स्पृहा wish.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःस्राव|निःस्रावः
निःस्राव m. (-वः) The moisture or water of boiled rice.
 E. निर forth, and
स्राव what is oozing or निर-स्रु-ण (फेन) ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःस्व|निःस्वः
निःस्व mfn. (-स्वः-स्वा-स्वं) Poor, indigent.
 E. निर् not, nothing, स्व own property.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःस्वादु
निःस्वादु mfn. (-दुः-दुः-दु) Insipid, tasteless.
 E. निर् neg. स्वादु sweet.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नि|निः
नि ind.
	 1. In, within; on, upon: a particle and prefix.
	 2. A negative
or prohibitive particle.
	 3. A particle implying certainty, affirma-
tion, proximity, continuance, doubt, intensity, fulness, Lowness,
order, skill, wrong, group, &c. see the following compounds.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निकट|निकटं|निकटः
निकट mfn. (-टः-टा-टं)
	 1. Near, proximate.
	 2. Kinless, solitary.
 E. नि,
and कटच् affix; or नि prefixed to कट् to go to or towards, affix अच्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निकर|निकरः
निकर m. (-रः)
	 1. A flock or multitude.
	 2. A heap, a bundle.
	 3. Pith,
sap, essence.
	 4. Suitable or proper gift.
	 5. A treasure, especially
belonging to KUVERA: see निधि.
 E. नि in or upon, कॄ to throw,
affix अप् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निकर्षण|निकर्षणं
निकर्षण m. (-णः)
	 1. An open space or sort of play-ground in or near
a town.
	 2. A court at the entrance to a house.
	 3. A neighbourhood.
4. A plot of ground not ploughed.
 E. नि, with कर्षण ploughing; so
prepared.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निकष|निकषः
निकष(स) m. (-षः-सः) The touch-stone.
	 f. (-षा) The mother of the imps or
goblins.
 E. नि prefixed to कष् to injure, affix घ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=387-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निकषा
निकषा ind.
	 1. Near, proximate.
	 2. In the middle, betwixt, between.
	 3.
The mother of a Rākshasha.
 E. नि prefixed to कष् to hurt, UNĀDI
affix आ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=388-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निकषात्मज|निकषात्मजः
निकषात्मज m. (-जः) A Rākshasa, a sort of goblin.
 E. निकषा the mother
of the race, and आत्मज a son.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=388-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निकस|निकसः
निकस m. (-सः) A touch-stone: see निकष.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=388-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निकाम|निकामं|निकामः
निकाम n. adv. (-मं) Voluntarily, willingly, implying certainty.
 E. नि, काम
will.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=388-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निकाय|निकायः
निकाय m. (-यः) An assemblage of persons performing like duties, a
congregation, an audience.
	 2. A flock, a multitude.
	 3. A butt, a
mark.
	 4. A house, habitation.
	 5. The Supreme Being.
	 6. The body.
E. नि in or within, चि to collect, affix घञ्, and क substituted
for the radical initial.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=388-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निकाय्य|निकाय्यः
निकाय्य m. (-य्यः) A house.
 E. नि in or within, चि to collect, affix ण्यत्
कुत्वम् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=388-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निकार|निकारः
निकार m. (-रः)
	 1. Opposition, contradiction.
	 2. Injury, wrong, offence.
3. wickedness; malice.
	 4. Abuse, reproach, disrespect.
	 5. Raising,
tossing or lifting up.
	 6. Piling or winnowing corn.
	 7. Killing. E.
नि depreciative prefix, कृ to make, or कॄ to throw, affix भावे घञ्
or अप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=388-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निकारण|निकारणं
निकारण n. (-णं) Killing, slaughter.
 E. नि prefixed to कॄ to injure, affix
ल्युट्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=388-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निकाष|निकाषः
निकाष m. (-षः) Rubbing, Scratching.
 E. नि before, कष् to hurt, घञ् aff
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=388-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निकास|निकासः
निकास(श) mfn. (-सः-सा-सं)
	 1. Likeness. (in composition:)
	 2. Proximity
3. Appearance. See नीकास.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=388-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
