	 4. A road, a market road.
	 5. Trade, traffic.
	 6.
A camp or caravan of itinerant dealers, as Bazaris, &c.
	 7.
Certainty, assurance.
	 8. Logic.
 E. नि affirmative prefix, गम to go,
