निच्छिवि m. (-विः) A man of one of the degraded classes, born from the
outcast Kṣatriya; the occupation of this caste is apparently
public exhibition of tricks, prize-fighting, &c. being classed with
the Jhallas, Mallas, and others.
 E. नि privative, छवि light or
credit, इ substituted for the penultimate.
