<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निदर्शन|निदर्शनं
निदर्शन n. (-नं)
	 1. An example or illustration.
	 2. Injunction, precept.
	 3.
Tenour, purport.
	 4. Authority, text.
	 5. A sign.
	 6. A scheme.
	 7.
View.
	 8. Evidence.
 E. नि fully or certainly, दर्शन showing, or नि +
दृश ल्युट् ।
