निदाघ|निदाघः
निदाघ m. (-घः)
	 1. The hot season, (May and June.)
	 2. Heat, warmth.
2. Sweat, perspiration.
 E. नि always, दह् to burn, आधारे घञ् affix,
न्यङ्क्वादि० कुत्वम् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=390-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निदाघकर|निदाघकरः
निदाघकर m. (-रः) The sun.
 E. निदाघ the hot season, and कर who makes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=390-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निदाघकाल|निदाघकालः
निदाघकाल m. (-लः) The hot season, two months previous to rains,
about May and June
 E. निदाघ, and काल time or season.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=390-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निदाघसिन्धु|निदाघसिन्धुः
निदाघसिन्धु m. (-न्धुः) A river in the hot weather, one nearly dry. E.
निदाघ, and सिन्धु a river.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=390-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निदान|निदानं
निदान n. (-नं)
	 1. A first cause, a primary or remote cause.
	 2. Diappear-
ance, cessation or removal of a first cause.
	 3. Purification purity,
correctness.
	 4. Asking for the recompense or objects of austere devo-
tion.
	 5. End, cessation.
	 6. A rope for tying a calf.
	 7. Ascertaining
the causes of disease, study of symptoms with a view to trace the
remote or proximate causes; hence this word is the name of a divi-
sion of all works on medicine.
 E. नि always or certainly, देङ् to
cherish affix पालने ल्युट्; by which all effects are produced.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=390-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निदिग्ध|निदिग्धं
निदिग्ध mfn. (-ग्धः-ग्धा-ग्धं) Smeared, anointed, plastered.
	 f. (-ग्धा)
	 1. Small
cardamoms.
	 2. Increasing.
 E. नि prefixed to दिह् to smear, affix क्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=390-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निदिग्धिका
निदिग्धिका f. (-का) A sort of prickly nightshade, (Solanum jacquini.) E.
कन् added to the preceding. कण्टकारिकायाम् ।
