<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निदिध्यासन|निदिध्यासनं
निदिध्यासन n. (-नं) Deep and repeated consideration, thinking of or
recalling repeatedly.
 E. नि before, ध्यै in the reiterative form, affix ल्यु.
