निधन|निधनं|निधनः
निधन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Poor.
	 mn. (-नः-नं)
	 1. Race, family.
	 2. Loss, dis-
appearance, annihilation, 3. Death, dying.
	 4. The seventh asterism
of the lunar mansions, reckoning from that under which a person
is born.
	 m. (-नः) The head of a family.
 E. नि before धा to cherish,
affix अच्, or नि neg. धन wealth, or नि + धा + क्यु ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=390-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निधनकारिन्
निधनकारिन् mfn. (-री-रिणी-रि) Destroying, destructive.
 E. निधन and
कारिन् making.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=390-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निधनता
निधनता f. (-ता) Poverty.
 E. निधन, and तल् added; also with त्व, निधनत्वं.
