certain, fixed.
	 5. Inevitable.
	 6. Positive, definite.
	 7. Permeable,
what may be spread through or over.
	 n. adv. (-तं) Always, cons-
tantly. subst. Elementary or crude matter, the recipient of attri-
butes or properties.
 E. नि before, यम् to restrain affix क्त.
