निरसन|निरसनं
निरसन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) What removes, expels, subdues, checks, &c.
n. (-नं)
	 n. 1. Rejection, denial, contradiction, disallowance.
	 2.
Suppressing, checking.
	 3. Appeasing.
	 4. Expelling, ejecting, 5.
Spitting, spitting out any thing with sickness or disgust.
	 6. Kill-
ing, destroying.
 E. निर् out or forth. अस् to throw ल्युट् affix or युच्
