<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराकरण|निराकरणं
निराकरण n. (-णं)
	 1. Obstruction, opposition, contradiction. rejection.
2. Refutation, reply.
	 3. Holding in consideration, making light of,
contempt, disesteem.
	 4. Expelling, turning out or away.
	 5.
Throwing out or off.
	 6. Neglecting the chief sacrificial or religious
duties.
 E. निर् privative particle, and आङ् before, कृ to do or make,
affix ल्युट्.
