	 1. Obstructive, obstructing.
	 2. Disdaining,
despising.
 E. निर्, and आङ् before कृ, affix शोलार्थे इष्णुच्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=394-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
