निराकार|निराकारः
निराकार mfn. (-रः-रा-रं)
	 1. Devoid of form or figure.
	 2. Formless. 3
Disguise.
	 m. (-रः)
	 1. Heaven.
	 2. VIṢṆU.
	 3. SĪVA.
	 4. The divine
spirit, God.
	 5. Reproach, censure.
 E. निर. implying negative or
depreciation, and आकार shape, &c.
