<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराकुल
निराकुल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Calm, steady, unperplexed, unconfused.
 E. निर्
neg. आकुल agitated.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=394-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराकृत|निराकृतः
निराकृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Removed, rejected, set aside.
	 2. Refuted,
replied to.
	 3. Made light of, contemned, despised.
	 4. Expelled,
turned out.
	 5. Thrown from or off.
	 6. Divorced.
 E. निरा, and
कृत done, with आङ् prefixed.
