निर्जर|निर्जरं|निर्जरः|निर्ज्जर|निर्ज्जरः
निर्जर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Immortal, imperishable, undecaying.
	 m. (-रः)
A deity, an immortal.
	 n. (-रं) Ambrosia, the food of the gods.
	 f.
(-रा)
	 1. A plant: see गुडुची.
	 2. A sort of perfume, commonly
Mura.
 E. निर् not, जरा decrepitude or decay.
