निर्णय|निर्णयः
निर्णय m. (-यः)
	 1. Certainty, positive conclusion.
	 2. Doubt, discussion,
investigation.
	 3. (In Law,) Sentence, decision.
	 4. (In the Mi-
mānsa.) The application of a conclusive argument.
	 5. (In
Logic,) Complete ascertainment.
 E. निर् affirmative prefix, णी
to guide, affix, भावे अच्.
