<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्द्वन्द्व|निर्द्वंद्व
निर्द्वन्द्व mfn. (-न्दः-न्दा-न्दं)
	 1. Not double.
	 2. Free from either of two
alternatives, neither glad nor sorry, &c.
	 3. Not acknowledging
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=397-a" target="_blank">Page397-a+ 60</a>]
