<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्धारणीय
निर्धारणीय mfn. (-यः-या-यं)
	 1. To be ascertained.
	 2. Acting resolutely,
irresistible.
 E. निर् affir. or neg. धृ to hold, अनीयर् affix; also
निर्धारितव्य, and निर्धार्य्य ।
