निर्धारित|निर्धारितं
निर्धारित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Ascertained, determined.
 E. निर् affirmative,
धृ to have, causal form, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=397-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्धा
निर्धा(र्द्धा)र्य्य mfn. (-र्य्यः-र्य्या-र्य्यं)
	 1. Acting fearlessly.
	 2. Active, energetic.
3. Ascertainable, to be ascertained or determined.
 E. निर् neg.
or affir. धृ to restrain, affix कर्मणि ण्यत्; it may also be written
निर्द्धार्य्य.
