	 1. Ceased, stopped.
	 2. Abstaining from worldy
acts, &c.
	 3. Abstracted from or independent of worldly motives.
4. Desisting from or repenting of any improper conduct.
	 5. Re-
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=400-b" target="_blank">Page400-b+ 60</a>]
