<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निषण्ण|निषण्णः
निषण्ण mfn. (-ण्ण-ण्णा-ण्णं)
	 1. Placed in or on.
	 2. Gone to.
	 3. Rested,
reclined.
 E. नि before, सद् to go, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=402-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निषण्णक|निषण्णकं
निषण्णक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Seating, seated.
	 n. (-कं) A seat.
 E. कन् added
to the last.
