<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निषन्नक
निषन्नक m. (-कः) A sort of potherb, (Marsilea dentata.).
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=402-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निषाद|निषादः
निषाद m. (-दः)
	 1. The last or the seventh note of the Hindu gamut,
or more properly the highest of the scale.
	 2. A man of a
degraded tribe, or an outcaste, especially the son of a Brāhman
by a Śūdra woman.
	 3. A fisherman.
 E. नि before, सद् to go, aff.
आधारे घञ्; pervading the mind, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=402-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निषादिन
निषादिन mf. (-दी-दिनी)
	 1. An elephant-keeper or driver.
	 2. Sitting.
E. नि before, सद् to go, aff. णिच्-णिनि.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=402-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निषिद्ध|निषिद्धं
निषिद्ध mfn. (-द्धः-द्धा-द्धं)
	 1. Prohibited, forbidden.
	 2. Prevented.
 E. नि
priv. सिध् to complete, aff. क.
