<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निषू
निषू(सू)दन n. (-नं) Killing, slaughter.
	 m. (-दः) A killer.
 E. नि before, षद्
to kill, aff. ल्युट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=402-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निषेक|निषेकः
निषेक m. (-कः)
	 1. The ceremony performed upon impregnation taking
place.
	 2. Sprinkling, aspersion.
	 3. Effusion.
	 4. Seminal infusion.
5. Irrigation.
	 6. Dirty water.
 E. नि, and सिच् to sprinkle, aff.
भावे घञ् ।
