<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निषेध|निषेधः
निषेध m. (-धः)
	 1. Prohibition, negation.
	 2. Stop, discontinuance.
	 3.
Contrariety to or deviation from rule, irregularity, exception.
4. Negation.
	 5. A prohibitive rule or precept (In religious law).
E. नि before, सिद to complete, aff. घञ्.
