<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निषेवन
निषेवन n. (-नं)
	 1. Service.
	 2. Observance, practice, adherence to.
3. Worship.
	 4. Enjoying.
	 5. Familiarity with.
 E. नि before, सेव्
to serve, ल्युट् aff.
