<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निषेवणीय
निषेवणीय mfn. (-यः-या-यं)
	 1. To be served, to be obeyed.
	 2. To be
observed or followed.
 E. नि before, सेव् to serve, अनीयर aff.; also
निषेवितव्य, and निषेव्य.
