निषेवित
निषेवित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Observed, practised.
	 2. Served, obeyed.
	 3.
Frequented through respect.
 E. नि before, सेव् to serve, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=402-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्क|निष्कं|निष्कः
निष्क r. 10th cl. (निष्कयते) To measure or weigh.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=402-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्क|निष्कं|निष्कः
निष्क mn. (-ष्कः-ष्कं)
	 1. A weight of gold, applied however to different
quantities: it is considered as synonimous with the Dināra of
thirty-two small, or sixteen large Rattis; with the Karṣa or
Suvarṇa of sixteen Māshās; with the Pala of four or five Suvar-
ṇas; and with the larger Pala or Dināra, which is sometimes
reckoned at 108, and other times at 150 Suvarṇas.
	 2. Gold in
general.
	 3. Any ornament of the breast.
	 4. An ornament of the
neck.
	 5. A weight of four Māshās.
	 6. A weight of silver of four
Suvarṇas.
	 7. A value of sixteen Kāhons or Dramyas.
	 8. A chan-
dāla.
 E. नि before, सद् to go, Unādi aff. कन्, and the radical final
rejected or निस् + कै-क or निष्क-अच् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=402-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्कण्टक|निष्कंटक|निष्कण्टकः
निष्कण्टक mfn. (-कः-का-कं)
	 1. Without thorns.
	 2. Free from trouble. E.
निर् neg. कण्टक a thorn.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=402-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
