निष्कल|निष्कलं|निष्कलः
निष्कल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं)
	 1. Waned, diminished.
	 2. Impotent, seedless,
barren.
	 m. (-लः)
	 1. Pudendum muliebre.
	 2. A name of BRAMHĀ.
3. A fancied personification of BRAMHĀ, for religious cere monies.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=402-b" target="_blank">Page402-b+ 60</a>]
f. (-ला or -ली) A woman past child bearing, in whom menstruation
has ceased.
 E. निर् gone, lost, कल a part &c.
