<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्कारुष
निष्कारुष mfn. (-षः-षा-षं) Of a noble, not degraded.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=402-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

