निष्कासित|निष्कासितः
निष्कासित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Expelled, dismissed, turned out.
	 2. Gone
forth or out, issued.
	 3. Placed, deposited.
	 4. Placed over, appoint-
ed, stationed.
	 5. Reviled, reproached, 6. Opened out, blown,
expanded.
 E. निर् out, कस् to go, in the causal form, aff. क्त, र be-
comes ष or Visarga: see निःकासित; also निष्काशित.
