निष्कुट|निष्कुटः
निष्कुट m. (-टः)
	 1. A pleasure grove near a house.
	 2. A field.
	 3. A door.
4. The private apartments, the Zenana.
	 5. The harem of a king.
E. निर् without, कुट the house.
	 f. (-टा, also -टिः or -टी) Large carda-
moms.
 E. निर् out, कुट the shell or husk, aff. क, with टाप् fem.
aff. or कि with ङीष् optionally added.
