निष्कुम्भ|निष्कुम्भः
निष्कुम्भ m. (-म्भः) A plant, commonly Danti.
 E. निर् forth, ष्कुम्भ a
Sautra root, to spread, aff. अच्; also निःकुम्भ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=402-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

