निष्कृति|निष्कृतिः
निष्कृति f. (-तिः)
	 1. Pardon, absolution.
	 2. Expiration.
	 3. Escaping
from, avoiding the consequence of anything.
	 4. Undoing, doing
away.
	 5. Disregarding, neglecting.
	 6. Acquittance, compensation,
discharge of a debt or obligation.
 E. निर् neg. कृ to do, क्तिन् affix.
