<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्कोषन
निष्कोषन n. (-नं)
	 1. Taking away.
	 2. Extracting, extirpating.
	 3. Hus-
king, shelling.
 E. निर् before, कुष् to expel, aff. ल्युट्.
