<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्कोषितव्य
निष्कोषितव्य mfn. (-व्यः-व्या-व्यं) To be taken away.
 E. निर् out, कुष् to
expel, तव्य aff.; also निष्कोषणीय ।
