निष्क्रम|निष्क्रमः
निष्क्रम m. (-मः)
	 1. Any intellectual faculty, as attention, comprehen-
sion, &c.
	 2. Degradation, baseness, inferiority of tribe, family, &c.
3. Going out, exit.
	 4. Intellectual faculty.
 E. निर् assuredly or
forth, and क्रम going.
