<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्क्रमण|निष्क्रमणं
निष्क्रमण n. (-णं)
	 1. Going forth or out.
	 2. Taking a child for the
first time out of the house, in the fourth month, considered as
an essential ceremony, and accompanied by sacrifice, &c. E.
निर् forth, क्रम to go, ल्युट् aff.
