<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्षक|पक्षकः
पक्षक m. (-क)
	 1. A private or back door.
	 2. A side.
	 3. A sidesman,
an associate, a confederate or partisan.
 E. कन् added to the
preceding.
