	 1. An aquatic plant, (Vallisneria.)
	 2. A bridge or rai-
sed bank, forming a path amidst inundated fields.
	 3. Stairs, steps.
4. An aquatic plant, (Trapa bispinosa, Rox.)
 E. पङ्क mud, ऋ to go,
अण् aff.
