पङ्क्ति|पंक्ति|पंक्तिः|पङ्क्तिः
पङ्क्ति f. (-ङ्क्तिः-ङ्क्ती)
	 1. A line, a row or range.
	 2. A sort of metre, a
stanza of four lines, each line consisting of ten syllables.
	 3. The
number “ten,” (in composition, ut infra.)
	 4. The earth.
	 5. Fame,
celebrity.
	 6. Cooking, maturing.
	 7. Associating with, eating or
sitting with, especially with persons of the same caste.
	 8. A com-
pany, a society, an assembly.
 E. पचि to spread, to extended, to
make evident, and क्तिन् aff. or पच् to cook, deriv. irr.
