पच|पचः
पच (डु, ष्) डुपचस् r. 1st. cl. (पचति) To mature by cooking or ripen-
ing, to boil, to dress, to ripen; (इ) पचि r. 1st. and 10th. cls.
(पचति-ते पचयति)
	 1. To make evident or apparent.
	 2. To represent,
to state fully.
	 3. To spread.
 E. पाके भ्वा० उभ० सक० अनिट् । व्यक्तीकारे
भ्वा० आत्म० अनिट् । विस्तारे चु० उभ० सक० सेट् इदित् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=411-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पच|पचः
पच mfn. (-चः-चा-चं) Who or what cooks, matures, &c.
	 m. (-चः) Cook-
ing, maturing, &c.
 E. पच् to cook, aff. अच्.
