पञ्चक|पंचक|पञ्चकं|पञ्चकः
पञ्चक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Five or relating to five, made of five, bought
with five, &c.
	 m. (-कः) Any collection or aggregate of five, a
five.
	 n. (-कं) A field of battle.
 E. पञ्च five, and कन् aff.
