पञ्चमूल|पञ्चमूलं
पञ्चमूल n. (-लं) The assemblage of five roots, viz:--The Bel, Premna longi-
folia, Cassia, Gmelian arborea, and the Trumpet flower.
	 f. (-ली)
A similar aggregate of five roots, considered as the similar one,
viz:--Hedysarum gangeticum, H. logopodioides, Solanum melon-
gena, S. Jacquini, and Tribulus lanuginosus.
 E. पञ्च five, मूल a
root; the fem. aff. has a diminutive import.
