पञ्चलक्षण n. (-णं) A Purāna or mythological poem.
 E. पञ्च five, and
लक्षण a mark; Puraṇa should comprehend five topics; the
creation of worlds, their destruction and renovation, the genea-
logy of gods and heroes, the reigns of the MANUS, and the ac-
