पञ्चसूना|पंचसूना
पञ्चसूना m. plu. (-नाः) The five things in a house by which animal life may
be accidentally destroyed; viz:--the fire place, the slab on which
condiments are ground, the broom, the pestle and mortar, and
the waterpot.
 E. पञ्च five, and सूना place of slaughter.
