प|पं|पः
प(पि)ञ्जर mn. (-रः-रं) A skeleton.
	 n. (-रं)
	 1. A cage, an aviary, a dove-cot.
2. The ribs.
	 m. (-रः)
	 1. The body.
	 2. The Kali age.
 E. पजि for
पिजि to dwell, &c. Unādi aff. अरच्; also पिञ्जर.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=414-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
