पञ्जराखेट|पंजराखेट|पञ्जराखेटः
पञ्जराखेट m. (-टः) A sort of basket or wicker trap in which fish are
caught.
 E. पञ्जर a cage, आखेट hunting. “पोलो” इति भाषा ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=414-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्जि|पंजि|पंजिः|पञ्जिः
पञ्जि(ञ्जी) f. (-ञ्जिः-ञ्जी)
	 1. The ball or whisp of cotton from which thread is
spun.
	 2. A journal, a register.
	 3. An almanack.
 E. पजि for पिजि
to touch, &c. aff. इन् and ङीष् optionally added; also पिञ्जि.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=414-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्जिका|पंजिका
पञ्जिका f. (-का)
	 1. The ball or skein of cotton from which thread is
spun: see the last.
	 2. A perpetual commentary.
	 3. A calendar,
an almanack.
	 4. A journal, a register.
	 5. The register or journal
of YAMA, the record of human actions.
 E. स्वार्थेक added to पञ्जि;
also पञ्जीका.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=414-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्जिकाकारक|पञ्जिकाकारकः
पञ्जिकाकारक m. (-कः)
	 1. A writer, a man of the Kāyastha tribe.
	 2.
An almanack-maker.
 E. पञ्जिका a journal, &c. and कारक who
makes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=414-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्जीकर|पञ्जीकरः
पञ्जीकर m. (-रः)
	 1. The Kāyastha or scribe.
	 2. An almanack-maker. E.
पञ्जी a journal, &c. कर who makes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=414-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पट|पटं|पटः
पट r. 1st cl. (पटति) To go, to move. r. 10th cl. (पटयति-ते)
	 1. To string.
2. To surround or encompass.
	 3. To share, to portion, to distri-
bute. (पाटयति-ते)
	 1. To speak.
	 2. To shine. With उत् prefixed,
To pluck up, to eradicate, to destroy utterly. With वि, To fly,
to run away. गतौ भ्वा० पर० सक० सेट् । दीप्तौ० चू० उभ० अक० सेट् ।
वेष्टने, अद० चु० उभ० सक० सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=414-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पट|पटं|पटः
पट mn. (-टः-टं)
	 1. Fine cloth.
	 2. Coloured cloth.
	 3. A leaf or sheet
of cloth, &c. on which any figures may be painted.
	 4. A veil or
screen.
	 5. A tablet for writing or painting.
	 m. (-टः)
	 1. A
kind of tree: see पियाल.
	 2. Any thing well made or polished.
	 f.
(-टी)
	 1. A particular sort of cloth, coarse thick cloth, canvas.
	 2.
A screen of cloth surrounding a tent, an outer tent.
	 3. A
coloured or chintz garment.
	 n. (-टं) A thatch, a roof.
 E. पट to sur-
round, aff. अच् fem. aff. ङीप्ः see पटि.
