<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटक|पटकः
पटक m. (-कः) A camp, an encampment.
 E. पट to surround, वुन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=414-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटकार|पटकारः
पटकार m. (-रः)
	 1. A weaver.
	 2. A painter.
 E. पट cloth, and कार
maker.
