	 1. Sandal-wood.
	 2. A field.
	 3. Bamboo manna.
	 4. A
radish.
	 5. The belly.
	 6. A sieve.
	 7. Height.
	 8. Khayar.
	 9. Rheu-
matism.
	 m. (-रः)
	 1. KANDARPA.
	 2. A cloud.
 E. पट् to go, Unādi
