पटु|पटुः
पटु mfn. (-टुः-ट्वी-टु)
	 1. Clever, dexterous, skilful.
	 2. Diligent.
	 3.
Smart, sharp.
	 4. Hale, healthy.
	 5. Warm, hot.
	 6. Blown, ex-
panded.
	 7. Cruel, ferocious, unmerciful, unfeeling.
	 8. Harsh,
contumelious, (speech, &c.)
	 9. Fraudulent, crafty, a rogue or
cheat.
	 10. Loquacious, talkative.
	 m. (-टुः)
	 1. A small kind of
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=415-a" target="_blank">Page415-a+ 60</a>]
cucumber. (Trichosanthes diœca.)
	 2. The leaf of the Trichosanthes.
n. (-टु)
	 1. Salt.
	 2. A mushroom.
 E. पट r. 10th cl. to speak,
&c. Unādi aff. डु, and the radical vowel shortened. or पट-उन् ।
