पट्टशाक n. (-कं) A sort of potherb, commonly called Nālita, (Corchorus
capsularis.)
 E. पट्ट Corchorus, and शाक a potherb; the leaves re-
sembling to those of the Pāt. नालिता, वा पाटशाक् ।
