पण|पणः
पण r. 1st cl. (पणते) also 10th. cl. (पणयति)
	 1. To negociate, to treat or
transact business.
	 2. To bet or stake at play. (पणायति) To praise.
व्यवहारे स्तुतौच भ्वा० आ० सक० सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=415-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पण|पणः
पण m. (-णः)
	 1. Measure of account, in cowries or shells, twenty gandās
or eighty cowries; also a weight of copper of similar value.
	 2.
Wages or hire.
	 3. A stake at play, a bet, a wager.
	 4. Gaming,
playing.
	 5. Playing with dice.
	 6. Price.
	 7. Wealth, property 8.
A commodity for sale.
	 9. Business.
	 10. A distiller.
	 11. A
house, a dwelling.
	 12. A stipulation, a treaty.
	 13. A vendor.
	 14.
A shop.
 E. पण् to do business, aff. अप् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=415-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

