पणाया
पणाया f. (-या) Business, affair, transaction, buying and selling, &c.
2. Profits or receipts of trade.
	 3. A market place.
	 4. Gambling.
5. Praise.
 E. पण् to negotiate, in the causal form, अच् and टाप्
