<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पत्रपाल|पत्रपालः
पत्रपाल m. (-ल) A large knife.
	 f. (-ली) A pair of shears or scissors.
E. पत्र a leaf, पाल् to nourish, aff. अच् (कांचि) ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=417-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पत्रपाश्या
पत्रपाश्या f. (-श्या) An ornament of the forehead, a piece of gold leaf
situated on the forehead, or a painted mark upon it.
 E. पत्र a leaf,
पश् to bind, aff. ण्यत्. (टीका) ।
