<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पत्रपुष्पक|पत्रपुष्पकः
पत्रपुष्पक m. (-कः) A kind of birch, from the bark of which Hukka
snakes, &c. are made: see भूर्ज्जपत्र
 E. पत्र a leaf, and पुष्प a flower,
कन् added.
