<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पत्रपूग
पत्रपूग m. (-गः) A shower of arrows.
 E. पत्र, and पूग a heap.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=417-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पत्रबन्ध|पत्रबन्धः
पत्रबन्ध m. (-न्धः) Adorning with leaves, flowers, &c. decorating with
