<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पत्रबाल|पत्रबालः
पत्रबाल m. (-लः) An oar, especially a large one used as a rudder.
 E. पत्र
a leaf, बल् to be strong, aff. घञ्.
