<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पत्रयौवन|पत्रयौवनं
पत्रयौवन n. (-नं) A new leaf, a sprout.
 E. पत्र a leaf, यौवन youth.
