<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पत्ररथ|पत्ररथः
पत्ररथ m. (-थः) A bird.
 E. पत्र a wing, and रथ a vehicle.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=417-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पत्ररञ्जन
पत्ररञ्जन n. (-नं) Embellishing a page, illuminating, gilding, &c.
 E. पत्र,
and रञ्जन colouring.
