<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पत्रवल्ली
पत्रवल्ली f. (-ल्ली) Staining the person with Sandal, &c. by way of
ornament.
 E. पत्र a leaf, and वल्ली a creeper; also पत्रावली, पत्रलेखा, &c.
