<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पत्रवाह|पत्रवाहः
पत्रवाह m. (-हः)
	 1. An arrow.
	 2. A bird.
	 3. A postman, a letter
carrier.
 E. पत्र a feather or a letter, and वाह bearing.
