पत्राङ्ग n. (-ङ्गं)
	 1. Red sanders (Pterocarpus santolinus)
	 2. Red or
sappan wood, (Cæsalpinia sappan.)
	 3. Bhūrjapatra, a tree so
called, a kind of Birch.
	 4. Another plant: see पद्मक.
 E. पत्र a leaf,
