पत्रावली
पत्रावली f. (-ली)
	 1. Drawing lines along the form; staining some
parts of the body with coloured and fragrant pigments, as with
saffron, sandal, &c.
	 2. A mixture of young Aswattha leaves with
barley and honey.
 E. पत्र a leaf, and आवली a line: see पत्रलेखा,
पत्रक, &c.
