<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पत्रिन्
पत्रिन् mfn. (-त्री-त्रिणी-त्रि)
	 1. Winged.
	 2. Feathered.
	 3. Having a
page or leaf.
	 m. (-त्री)
	 1. An arrow.
	 2. A bird.
	 3. A falcon.
	 4. A
tree.
	 5. A mountain.
	 6. A chariot.
	 7. A rider in a car or car-
riage.
	 f. (-णी) A sprout, a shoot.
 E. पत्र a leaf, &c. इनि aff.
