पथिन्
पथिन् m. (पन्था)
	 1. A road, a way.
	 2. Sect, doctrine, path in morals
or religion.
	 3. A division of hell.
	 4. A journey.
	 5. Course of
manner or action.
 E. पथ् to go, इन् Unādi aff.; the noun is irregu-
larly inflected.
