पथ्य|पथ्यं|पथ्यः
पथ्य mfn. (-थ्यः-थ्या-थ्यं) Proper, fit, suitable, agreeing with, but applied
chiefly medically, with respect to diet, regimen, &c.
	 mf. (-थ्यः-
थ्या) Yellow Myrobalan, (Terminalia chebula.)
	 n. (-थ्यं) Sea salt.
E. पथ् to go, यत् aff.
