<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्धति|पद्धतिः
पद्धति f. (-तिः-ती)
	 1. A road.
	 2. A line, a row or range.
	 3. A ritual, a
manual, a work upon any act or ceremony, detailing the mode
of its performance, and collecting the texts connected with it.
	 4.
A family name, a surname or title.
 E. पद् a foot, हन् to strike,
aff. क्तिन् ।
