पद्मक|पद्मकं
पद्मक n. (-कं)
	 1. Coloured marks or spots on the face and trunk of
an elephant.
	 2. A sort of drug, commonly called पद्मकाष्ठ, 3. A
kind of leprosy.
	 4. An army arrayed in the form of a lotus-flower.
E. कन् added to the preceding.
