	 3. The name of a monkey.
	 f. (-सा)
	 1. A malady,
pustular and phlegmonoid inflammation of the skin or external
organs.
	 2. A she monkey.
	 3. A female demon.
 E. पन् to praise
or be praised, Uṇādi aff. असच्.
