परजित|परजितः
परजित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Nourished by a stranger.
	 2. Conquered,
or subdued by another.
	 3. The kokila. पर another, and जित con-
quered, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परञ्ज|परंज|परंजः|परञ्जः
परञ्ज m. (-ञ्जः)
	 1. An oil press.
	 2. Froth, foam.
	 3. The blade of a
sword or a knife.
	 4. A sword or scimitar.
	 f. (-ञ्जा) The sound of
instruments at a festival.
	 n. (-ञ्जं) The sword of INDRA.
 E. पर in
the second case, another, and जि to conquer, aff. ड; some works
have परज, and others पराञ्ज in place of this word.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परञ्जन|परंजन|परंजनः|परञ्जनः
परञ्जन m. (-नः) A name of VARUṆA, the regent of water.
 E. पर an-
other, जि to conquer, deriv. irr; also परञ्जय.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परञ्जय|परंजय|परंजयः|परञ्जयः
परञ्जय m. (-यः) VARUṆA: see the last.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परतन्त्र|परतंत्र|परतन्त्रः
परतन्त्र mfn. (-न्त्रः-न्त्रा-न्त्रं) Subservient, obedient, dependant.
 E. पर another, तन्त्र will.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परतम
परतम mfn. (-मः-मा-मं) Greatest.
 E. पर, and तरप् aff. of the superlative.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परतर
परतर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Greater, more.
 E. पर more, and तरप aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परतस्
परतस् ind.
	 1. Afterwards.
	 2. Behind.
	 3. Otherwise, differently.
	 4.
From an enemy.
 E. पर or परा, and अतमुच् aff. According to
Vāchaspatya:--1. From another.
	 2. Dependence.
 E. पर + विभक्तर्थे-
तसिल् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परत्र|परत्रं
परत्र ind.
	 1. The next world, futurity.
	 2. Further on, in the sequel.
E. पर another, त्रल् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परत्रभीरु|परत्रभीरुः
परत्रभीरु m. (-रूः) A pious man, one standing in awe of futurity. E.
परत्र the next world, and भीरु timid.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परत्व|परत्वं
परत्व n. (-त्वं)
	 1. Difference, distinction, separateness.
	 2. Hostility.
	 3.
(In Logic,) Priority of place or time, proximity, juvenility.
	 4.
The nature of common or generic property.
 E. त्व added to पर;
also with तल्, परता.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परदार|परदारः
परदार m. (-रः) Plu. Another's wife.
 E. पर, and दार a wife.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परदारगमन
परदारगमन n. (नं) Adultery, adulterous intercourse or intrigue.
 E. पर-
दार, and गमन frequenting.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परदाराभिमर्ष
परदाराभिमर्ष m. (-र्षः) Intriguing with another man's wife.
 E. परदार,
and अभिमर्ष contact.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परदारोपसेवन
परदारोपसेवन n. (-नं) Intriguing with another's wife.
 E. परदार, and उप-
सेवन frequenting; also परदारोपसेवा ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परदुःख|परदुःखं
परदुःख n. (-खं) The pain or sorrow of another.
 E. पर, and दुख pain.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परदेश|परदेशः
परदेश m. (-शः) A foreign country.
 E. पर, and द्रेश place.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परदेशिन्
परदेशिन् mfn. (-शी-शिनी-शि) Foreign, exotic.
	 m. (-शी)
	 1. A foreigner.
	 2.
One residing abroad.
 E. परदेश, and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परदेशसेविन्
परदेशसेविन् mfn. (-वी-विनी-वि) Living abroad, travelling, traveller.
 E. पर
देश, and सेविन् who frequents.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परदोषकीर्त्तन
परदोषकीर्त्तन n. (-नं) Scandal, calumny, censoriousness.
 E. पर, दोष fault,
कीर्त्तन proclaiming.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परद्वेषिन्
परद्वेषिन् mfn. (-षी-षिणी-षि) Hostile, inimical, adverse.
 E. पर another,
द्विष् to hate, घिणुन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परद्रव्य
परद्रव्य n. (-व्यं) Another's property.
 E. पर, and द्रव्य thing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परद्रोहिन्
परद्रोहिन् mfn. (-ही-हिणी-हि) Tyrannising over another.
 E. पर, and
द्रोहिन् injurious.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परधन
परधन n. (-नं) Another's wealth.
 E. पर, and धन wealth.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परधनास्वादनसुख
परधनास्वादनसुख n. (-खं) Feeding luxuriously at another's expense. E.
परधन, आस्वादन eating, सुख pleasure.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परधर्म्म|परधर्म|परधर्मः
परधर्म्म m. (-र्म्मः) Another's duty or business, the occupation of another
caste.
 E. पर, and धर्म्म duty. उत्कृष्ट धर्मेच ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परध्यान|परध्यानं
परध्यान n. (-नं) Intent absorption or abstraction in the subject of medi-
tation.
 E. पर, and ध्यान meditating.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परन्तप|परंतप|परंतपः|परन्तपः
परन्तप mfn. (-पः-पा-पं) Vexing or annoying another, subduing a foe.
	 m.
(-पः) A conqueror.
 E. पर another, तप to heat or inflame, aff. खच् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परपद|परपदं
परपद n. (-दं)
	 1. Eminence, high station.
	 2. Final felicity.
 E. पर
supreme, पद, a place.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परपरिग्रह|परपरिग्रहः
परपरिग्रह m. (-हः) The family or dependants of another.
 E. पर, and
परिग्रह dependants.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परपाक
परपाक m. (-कः) What is dressed or cooked by another, another's food.
E. पर, and पाक cooking.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परपाकनिवृत्त|परपाकनिवृत्तः
परपाकनिवृत्त m. (-त्तः) One who dresses his own food without observing
the expiatory sacrifice for the five Sūnas, or places of destruction
to animal life: see पञ्चसूना.
 E. पर another, पाक cooking, and निवृत्त
ceased.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परपाकरत|परपाकरतः
परपाकरत m. (-तः) One who observes all the due ceremonies prepara-
tory to cooking, but lives upon others.
 E. पर another, पाक cooking,
रत constant.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परपाकरुचि|परपाकरुचिः
परपाकरुचि m. (-चिः) A constant guest at other's tables.
 E. पर another,
पाक cooking, and रुचि shining.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परपिण्ड|परपिंड|परपिण्डः
परपिण्ड n. (-ण्डं) Food given by another.
 E. पर, and पिण्ड a ball of rice or meat.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परपिण्डाद|परपिंडाद|परपिण्डादः
परपिण्डाद mfn. (-दः-दा-दं) Feeding at another's cost.
 E. परपिण्ड, and आद
who takes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परपुरुष|परपुरुषः
परपुरुष m. (-षः)
	 1. A name of VIṢṆU.
	 2. Another man.
 E. पर supreme,
or other, and पुरुष a man.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परपुष्ट|परपुष्टः
परपुष्ट mfn. (-ष्टः-ष्ठा-ष्टं)
	 1. Fostered, nourished, &c. by a stranger.
	 m.
(-ष्टः) The Kokila or Indian cuckoo.
	 f. (-ष्टा)
	 1. A harlot, a whore.
	 2.
A parasite plant.
 E. पर another, पुष्ट cherished.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परपुष्टमहोत्सव|परपुष्टमहोत्सवः
परपुष्टमहोत्सव m. (-वः) The mango.
 E. परपुष्ट the cuckoo, महा great, and
उत्सव festival.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परपूर्व्वा|परपूर्वा
परपूर्व्वा f. (-र्व्वा) A woman formerly married.
 E. पर another, (husband,)
पूर्व्व prior, fem. aff. टाप् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परपूर्व्वापति|परपूर्वापति
परपूर्व्वापति m. (-तिः) The husband of a woman remarried.
 E. परपूर्व्वा,
and पति a husband.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=421-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परप्रतिनप्तृ
परप्रतिनप्तृ m. (-प्ता) A great-great-grandson.
 E. पर subsequent, प्रति after,
नप्तृ a grandson.
