<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परप्रपौत्र|परप्रपौत्रः
परप्रपौत्र m. (-त्रः) A great-great-grandson.
 E. पर, subsequent, प्रपौत्र
great-grandson.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परप्रेष्यत्व
परप्रेष्यत्व n. (-त्वं) Servitude, slavery.
 E. पर, and प्रेष्यत्व service.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परव्रह्मन्
परव्रह्मन् n. (-ह्म) The supreme Being.
 E. पर, and व्रह्म the same.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परभाग|परभागः
परभाग m. (-गः)
	 1. Excellence, superior merit, supremacy.
	 2. Good
fortune, prosperity.
	 3. The last part, residue, remainder.
 E. पर
best, and भाग portion.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परभाग्य
परभाग्य n. (-ग्यं) Another's wealth or prosperity.
 E. पर, and भाग्य good fortune.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परभुक्त
परभुक्त mfn. (-क्तः-क्ता-क्तं) Possessed or enjoyed by another.
 E. पर, and
भुक्त enjoyed.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परभुमि
परभुमि f. (-मिः) A foreign or an enemy's country.
 E. पर, and भूमि land.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परभूमिष्ठ
परभूमिष्ठ mfn. (-ष्ठः-ष्ठा-ष्ठं) Living or being in a foreign or an enemy's
