<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परम|परमः
परम mfn. (-मः-मा-मं)
	 1. Best, most excellent.
	 2. Chief principal, preced-
ing 3. First, chief part.
	 4. Adequate. ind. (-मं)
	 1. A term of
assent, yes 2. A term of command.
 E. पर best, मा to mete, aff. ड
or डम्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमगति|परमगतिः
परमगति f. (-तिः)
	 1. Chief object or refuge, as a god, protector.
	 2.
Final felicity.
 E. परम, and गति going.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमगव|परमगवः
परमगव mf. (-वः-वी) An excellent bull or cow.
 E. परम, and गो a cow.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमगहन
परमगहन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Very mysterious or profound.
 E. परम, and
गहन thick.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमत|परमतः
परमत n. (-तं) A different opinion or doctrine.
 E. पर, and मत thought.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमपद|परमपदः
परमपद n. (-दं)
	 1. Eminence, high station.
	 2. Final felicity
 E. परम, and
पद station.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमब्रह्मन्
परमब्रह्मन् n. (-ह्म) The Supreme Spirit.
 E. परम, and ब्रह्मन् the same.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमराज|परमराजः
परमराज m. (-जः) A supreme monarch.
 E. परम, and राजन् a king, टच्
aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमर्षि|परमर्षिः
परमर्षि m. (-र्षिः) A Ṛṣi or divine sage, of a peculiar order or division,
comprising the Muni BHELA and others.
 E. परम excellent, and
ऋषि a divine sage.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमर्म्मज्ञ|परमर्मज्ञ
परमर्म्मज्ञ m. (-ज्ञः) One who knows another's character or disposition. E.
पर, and मर्म्म a vital point, and ज्ञ who knows.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमस्वधर्म्मन्|परमस्वधर्मन्
परमस्वधर्म्मन् m. (-र्म्मा) A virtuous or pious man, one who attends scrupu-
lously to the proper duties of his tribe or station.
 E. परम best,
स्व own, धर्म्म virtue or duty, and अनिच् added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमहंस|परमहंसः
परमहंस m. (-सः) An ascetic, a religious man who has subdued all his
senses by abstract meditation.
 E. परम best or first, हंस devotee.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमागति
परमागति f. (-तिः) Final beatitude.
 E. परमा best, गति going.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमाङ्गना|परमांगना
परमाङ्गना f. (-ना) A beautiful woman.
 E. परम, and अङ्गना a woman.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमाणु|परमाणुः
परमाणु m. (-णुः)
	 1. An atom, the invisible base of all aggregate bodies;
thirty of them are supposed to form a mote in a sunbeam;
the lowest measure of weight; in Logic, six of them form the
first perceptible object.
	 2. A measure of time, the sun's passage
past an atom of matter.
 E. परम first, and अणु an atom.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमाण्वङ्गक|परमाण्वङ्गकः
परमाण्वङ्गक m. (-कः) A name of VIṢṆU.
 E. परमाणु an atom, अङ्ग the
body, कप् aff., deriv. irr.; smaller than the smallest; as he is
larger than the largest, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमात्मन्
परमात्मन् m. (-त्मा) The Supreme Being, considered as the soul of the
universe.
 E. परम first, आत्मन् spirit or soul.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमाद्वैत|परमाद्वैतः
परमाद्वैत n. (-तं) Pure unitarianism.
	 m. (-तः) VIṢṆU, the only supreme.
E. परम, and अद्वैत without duality.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमान्न|परमान्नं
परमान्न n. (-न्नं) An oblation of rice to progenitors or gods, boiled with
milk and sugar.
 E. परम best, and अन्न boiled rice; or परम the best,
the supreme, (deities, &c.) and अन्न food.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमापम|परमापमः
परमापम m. (-मः)
	 1. The inclination of a planet's orbit to the ecliptic.
2. The sine of the sun's greatest declination.
 E. परम, and अपम
declination.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमायुष|परमायुषः
परमायुष m. (-षः) A particular tree: see असन ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमायुस्
परमायुस् m. (-युः) The longest period of life, either in men or animals.
E. परम and आयुस life.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमार्थ|परमार्थः
परमार्थ m. (-र्थः)
	 1. Truth, fitness.
	 2. Spiritual knowledge.
	 3. Any excel-
lent or important aim or object.
	 4. The best sense.
	 5. The best
kind of wealth
 E. परम, and अर्थ object.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमार्थविद्
परमार्थविद् m. (-वित्) A sage, a philosopher, one who knows the truth.
E. परमार्थ, and विद् who knows.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमार्थविन्द्
परमार्थविन्द् mfn. (-न्दः-न्दा-न्दं) Who or what acquires knowledge of truth,
the best kind of wealth, &c.
 E. परमार्थ, and विद् to acquire, श aff.
मुम् augment.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमावधि
परमावधि f. (-धिः) Utmost term or limit.
 E. परम, and अवधि limit.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमार्हत|परमार्हतः
परमार्हत m. (-तः) A king and holy saint, apparently the same as SĀLI-
BĀHANA.
 E. परम excellent, अर्हत a Jina.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमृत्यु|परमृत्युः
परमृत्यु m. (-त्युः) A crow.
 E. पर another, and मृत्यु death; having many enemies.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमेश्वर|परमेश्वरः
परमेश्वर m. (-रः)
	 1. The Supreme Being.
	 2. SĪVA.
	 3. VIṢṆU.
	 f. (-री)
DURGĀ.
 E. परम best, ईश्वर lord.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमेष्ठ|परमेष्ठः
परमेष्ठ mfn. (-ष्ठः-ष्ठा-ष्ठं) Supreme, superior.
	 m. (-ष्ठः)
	 1. BRAMHĀ.
	 2. A
deity.
 E. परमे, in heaven, and स्थ who stays or is.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमेष्ठिन्
परमेष्ठिन् m. (-ष्ठी)
	 1. A name of BRAMHĀ.
	 2. A Jina or deified teacher
of the Jaina sect.
	 3. A kind of Sālagrām stone.
	 4. A Guru or
spiritual guide.
 E. परमे in the most exalted place, in heaven, स्था
to be, Unādi aff. निन्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परम्पद|परंपदं
परम्पद n. (-दं)
	 1. Eternal felicity.
	 2. The abode of VIṢṆU.
 E. पर् an-
other, पद degree.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परम्पर|परंपर|परंपरः|परम्परः
परम्पर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Successive, proceeding from one to another, from
father to son, &c.
	 m. (-रः)
	 1. A sort of deer.
	 2. A great-great-grand-
son.
	 f. (-रा)
	 1. Race, progeny, lineage.
	 2. Order, method, continu-
ous arrangement, regular series or succession.
	 2. Hurting, killing,
injury.
 E. पर subsequent, repeated, and the nasal augment.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परम्परतस्
परम्परतस् ind. Mutually.
 E. परम्पर, and तसि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परम्पराक|परंपराक|परम्पराकं
परम्पराक n. (-कं) Immolating animals in sacrifice.
 E. परम्पर tradi-
tionary or successive, and अक going or worshipping; or परम्
much, पर the best, and अक going, custom.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परम्परीण|परंपरीण|परम्परीणं
परम्परीण mfn. (-णः-णा-णं)
	 1. Hereditary, what has come by inheritance
or descent.
	 2. Traditional.
 E. परम् another, and पर again, another,
ख aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पररु|पररुः
पररु m. (-रुः) A potherb, (Eclipta prostrata;) also केशराज.
 E. पर much,
रुह् to grow, डु aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पररूप
पररूप mfn. (-पः-पा-पं) परस्य रूपमिव रूपमस्य । स्वोत्तरवर्त्तिपरस्येव रूपवति “एङिपररूपम्” पानिनि ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परलोक|परलोकं|परलोकः
परलोक m. (-कः) Heaven, paradise.
 E. पर another, and लोक world.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परलोकगम|परलोकगमः
परलोकगम m. (-मः) Death, dying.
 E. पर another, लोक world, and गम
going.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परवत्|परवन्त्
परवत् mfn. (-वान्-वती-वत्) Dependent, subject.
 E. पर another, मतुप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परवश|परवशः
परवश mfn. (-शः-शा-शं)
	 1. Subservient, dependant, subject.
	 2. Deceived.
E. पर another, and वश subjection.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परवाच्य
परवाच्य mfn. (-च्यः-च्या-च्यं) Reprehensible, blamable.
	 n. (-च्यं) Fault,
defect.
 E. पर, and वाच्य to be named, not to be spoken of.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परवाणि|परवाणिः
परवाणि m. (-णिः)
	 1. A Judge, a ruler.
	 2. A year.
	 3. The peacock on
which the god KĀRTIKEYA rides.
 E. पर best, वा to go, णि aff,
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परव्रत|परव्रतः
परव्रत m. (-तः) A name of DHRITARĀSHTRA.
 E. पर best, व्रत, religi-
ous observance.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परश|परशं|परशः
परश m. (-शः) A kind of stone, the touch of which turns iron into
gold, the philosopher's stone.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परशव्य|परशव्यं
परशव्य mfn. (-व्यः-व्या-व्यं) Fit or proper for a hatchet.
 E. परशु an axe, यञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परशु|परशुः
परशु m. (-शुः) An axe, a hatchet.
 E. पर another, शु to injure, Unādi
aff. कु, डिच्च ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परशुधर|परशुधरः
परशुधर m. (-रः)
	 1. A soldier armed with an axe.
	 2. A name of GANESA.
3. PARASURĀMA: see the next.
 E. परशु an axe, धर who holds.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परशुराम|परशुरामः
परशुराम m. (-मः) A hero and demigod; the first of the three RĀMAS,
and the sixth Avatāra or descent of the deity VIṢṆU: who
appeared in the world as the saint JAMADAGNI, for the purpose
of repressing the tyranny and punishing the violence of the
Kṣatriya, or military tribe; PARASURĀMA appears to typify
the tribe of Brāmhans and their contests with the Kṣatrityas. E.
परशु an axe, and राम who delights in; also with कन् added,
परशुरामक; and with the first member, पर्शु, पर्शुराम, q. v.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परश्व|परश्वः
परश्व(स्व)ध m. (-धः) An axe, a hatchet.
 E. पर another, an enemy, श्व derived
from श्वि, to grow or thrive; परश्व the prosperity of a foe, धे to
drink, क aff.; what drinks the blood or destroys the life of an
enemy; also पारश्वध and परस्वध.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परश्वस्
परश्वस् ind. The day after tomorrow.
 E. पर after, अवस् tomorrow; also परःश्वस्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परस्
परस् ind. Beyond, further, more than, on the other side of, &c. (Not
used by itself in classical Sanskrit.)
 E. पर, पञ्चम्याद्यर्थे बा असि ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परसङ्गत|परसंगत
परसङ्गत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Associated with another.
	 2. Fighting or
engaged with another.
 E. पर, and सङ्गत gone with.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परसंज्ञक
परसंज्ञक m. (-कः) The soul.
 E. पर best, संज्ञा name or title; aff. कप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परसम्बन्ध
परसम्बन्ध m. (-न्धः) Relation or connexion with another.
 E. पर, and
सम्बन्ध connexion.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परसम्बन्धिन्
परसम्बन्धिन् mfn. (-न्धी-न्धिनी-न्धि)
	 1. Related to another.
	 2. Belonging to
another.
 E. परसम्बन्ध, and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परस्तात्
परस्तात् ind.
	 1. Subsequently, afterwards.
	 2. Behind.
 E. पर, and
अस्ताति aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परस्पर|परस्परं
परस्पर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Mutual, interchanging.
 E. पर another repeated:
from one to another.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परस्परज्ञ|परस्परज्ञः
परस्परज्ञ m. (-ज्ञः) A friend, an intimate.
 E. परस्पर, and ज्ञ who know.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परस्परानुमति
परस्परानुमति f. (-तिः) Mutual concurrence or assent.
 E. परस्पर, and
अनुमति agreement.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परस्पराम
परस्पराम ind. Mutually.
 E. परस्पर, and आम् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परस्परोपकार
परस्परोपकार m. (-रः)
	 1. Mutual assistance.
	 2. Offensive and defensive
alliance.
 E. परस्पर, उपकार aid.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परस्परोपकारिन्
परस्परोपकारिन् m. (-री)
	 1. An ally.
	 2. An associate, a helper.
 E. इनि
added to the last.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परस्मैपद|परस्मैपदं
परस्मैपद n. (-दं) The transitive or active verb.
 E. परस्मै to another, पद
an inflected word.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परस्व
परस्व n. (-स्वं) Another person's property.
 E. पर, and स्व own.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परस्वत्व
परस्वत्व n. (-त्वं) Another's right.
 E. पर, and स्वत्व own right.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परस्वत्वापादन
परस्वत्वापादन n. (-नं) Conferring a right upon another as by gift, &c.
E. परस्वत्व, and आपादन producing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परस्वध|परस्वधः
परस्वध m. (-धः) An axe: see परश्वध.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परस्वादायिन्
परस्वादायिन् mfn. (यी-यिनी-यि) Extortionary, extortioner.
 E. परस्व, and
आदायिन् taking.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परस्वोपजीविक
परस्वोपजीविक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Dependent, living on the property of
others.
 E. परस्व, and उपजीविक subsisting.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परहित
परहित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Friendly, benevolent.
	 2. Good or profitable
form for another.
 E. पर, and हित favourable.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परा
परा ind. A participle and prefix implying, 1. Supremacy.
	 2. Libera-
tion.
	 3. Inverted order.
	 4. Pride, contumely.
	 5. Encounter,
mutual presence.
	 6. Excess, exceeding.
	 7. Overcoming, surpass-
ing.
	 8. Going.
	 9. Killing, destroying, injuring. As पराक्रम supe-
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-b" target="_blank">Page423-b+ 61</a>]
rior power or valour; पराजय defeat; पराभव disgrace; परावर्त्त
turning back, &c. see the following.
 E. पॄ to fill, aff. अप्, and आ
added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराक्
पराक् ind. Crooked, crookedly.
 E. परा away, अच् to go, aff. क्विप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराक|पराकः
पराक m. (-कः)
	 1. A religious obligation of an expiatory kind, fasting
for twelve days and nights, and keeping the mind attentive,
and organs subdued.
	 2. A sacrificial sword or scimitar.
 E. परा
best, अक what goes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराकरण|पराकरणं
पराकरण n. (-णं) Disdaining, disregarding, rejecting.
 E. परा before, कृ to do, ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराकुर्व्वन्
पराकुर्व्वन् mfn. (-र्व्वन्-र्व्वन्ती-र्व्वत्) Throwing off or aside, rejecting, dis-
daining.
 E. परा, and कुर्व्वन् making.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराकृत
पराकृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Rejected, set aside, thrown off, disdained. E.
पर, and कृत made.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराक्रम|पराक्रमः
पराक्रम m. (-मः)
	 1. Power, strength.
	 2. Exertion.
	 3. Valour, prowess.
4. Going out or forth, exit or issue.
	 5. Attacking an enemy.
6. Attempt, enterprise.
	 7. A name of Viṣṇu.
 E. परा supremacy,
opposition, &c. and क्रम going, करणे घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराक्रमज्ञ
पराक्रमज्ञ mfn. (-ज्ञः-ज्ञा-ज्ञं) Knowing the power, (of the enemy.) E.
पराक्रम, and ज्ञ who knows.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराग|परागः
पराग m. (-गः)
	 1. The pollen or farina of a flower.
	 2. Dust.
	 3. Fra-
grant powder used after bathing.
	 4. Sandal.
	 5. The name of a
mountain.
	 6. Fame, celebrity.
	 7. An eclipse of the sun or moon.
8. Following one's own inclinations.
 E. परा implying supremacy,
&c. and ग who goes, ड aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परागवत्
परागवत् mfn. (-वान्-वती-वत्) Laden with pollen.
 E. पराग, and मतुप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परागत
परागत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Spread, expanded.
	 2. Budded, blown.
 E. पर,
and आङ् before, गम् to go, aff. क्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परागिन्
परागिन् mfn. (-गी-गिणी-गि) Laden with pollen.
 E. पराग, and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराङ्गद|परांगद|पराङ्गदः
पराङ्गद m. (-दः) A name of ŚIVA.
 E. पर another, (DURGĀ,) अङ्ग form
and द who gives; forming with the goddess a deity, half male
and half female; or better, पर an enemy, KĀMADEVA, अङ्ग body,
and द who gives; restoring the body of that deity to shape, after
having reduced it to ashes in a rage.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराङ्गव|परांगव|परांगवः|पराङ्गवः
पराङ्गव m. (-वः) Ocean.
 E. पर another, (river,) अङ्ग substance, water,
and व who receives.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराङ्मुख|पराङ्मुखः
पराङ्मुख mfn. (-खः-खी-खं) Turning away, having the face averted. E.
पराञ्च्, and मुख the face.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराङ्मुखता
पराङ्मुखता f. (-ता)
	 1. Turning away.
	 2. Regardless of.
	 3. Adverse
from.
	 4. Unfavourable.
 E. पराङ्मुख, and तल् aff.; also with त्व,
पराङ्मुखत्वं.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराच्
पराच् mfn. (-ङ्ः-ची-क्)
	 1. Situated beyond or on the other side.
	 2. Dis-
tant.
 E. परा + अञ्चति-क्किप्ः see परञ्च् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराचित|पराचितः
पराचित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Cherished or fostered by a stranger.
 E. पर
another, आचित nourished.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराचीन|पराचीनः
पराचीन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Turned away, having the face averted.
	 2.
Not minding, not caring about.
	 3. Happening subsequently.
	 4.
Situated on the other side.
 E. पराञ्च् or पराच् turned away, ख aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराजय|पराजयः
पराजय m. (-यः)
	 1. Defeat.
	 2. Overpowering.
	 3. Loss, failure, (as in law
suit.)
	 4. The being overcome by, (with an ablative.)
 E. परा imply-
ing encounter, contest, and जय victory.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराजयमाण
पराजयमाण mfn. (-णः-णा-णं) Overcoming, surpassing, defeating. E.
पर before, जि to conquer, शानच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराजित|पराजितः
पराजित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Conquered, defeated, overcome.
	 2. Won at
dice, &c.
 E. परा encounter, and जित conquered.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराञ्च्|परांच्
पराञ्च् or पराच् mfn. (पराङ् पराची पराक्) Turned away, inverted,
reversed.
 E. परा away, अञ्च् to go, aff. क्विन्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराच्
परभूमिष्ठ mfn. (-ष्ठः-ष्ठा-ष्ठं) Living or being in a foreign or an enemy's
country.
 E. परभूमि, and स्थ who stays.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=422-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराञ्ज|परांजः|पराञ्जः
पराञ्ज m. (ञ्जः)
	 1. An oil mill.
	 2. Froth or foam.
	 3. The blade of a
sword or knife: see परञ्ज.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परात्पर|परात्परः
परात्पर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Superior to the best.
 E. पर in the fifth case,
and repeated in the first.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परात्प्रिय|परात्प्रियः
परात्प्रिय m. (-यः) A kind of reed, (Saccharum spontaneum.) उल इतिभाषा ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=423-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परादन|परादनः
परादन mf. (-नः-ना) A horse of the Persian breed.
 E. परा exceeding, अदन
food. (अरवी घोडा) ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=424-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराधि|पराधिः
पराधि m. (-धिः) Hunting, the chase. अन्यस्याधौकर्म०, परममानसव्यथायाम्च ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=424-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराधिकार
पराधिकार m. (-रः) Another person's office or post.
 E. पर, and अधिकार
superintendence.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=424-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराधिकारचर्च्चा|पराधिकारचर्चा
पराधिकारचर्च्चा f. (-र्च्चा) Officiousness, interference with another's con-
cerns.
 E. पराघिकार, and चर्च्चा searching.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=424-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराधीन|पराधीनः
पराधीन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Dependant, subject, subservient.
 E. पर another,
and अधीन humble, docile.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=424-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराधीनता
पराधीनता f. (-ता) Subjection, dependence.
 E. तल् added to the last;
with त्य, पराधीनत्व n. (-त्वं)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=424-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परान
परान(ण)सा f. (-सा) The practice of medicine, administering remedies.
E. परान् enemies, (disease,) षो to destroy, aff. ड; form irr; or
correctly: परा + अन-करणे वा अस ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=424-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परान्न|परान्नं|परान्नः
परान्न mfn. (-न्नः-न्ना-न्नं) Living at another's expense.
	 n. (-न्नं)
	 1. Food
supplied by another.
	 2. Food dressed or touched by or belonging
to another.
 E. पर another, अन्न food.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=424-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परान्नभोजिन्
परान्नभोजिन् mfn. (-जी-जिनी-जि) Living at another's cost.
 E. परान्न, and
भोजिन् who eats.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=424-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराप|परापं
पराप mfn. (-पः-पा-पं) A place, &c. whence water has retired.
 E. पर
away, अप water; also परेप.
