परामृष्ट mfn. (-ष्टः-ष्टा-ष्टं)
	 1. Weighed, considered, Judged.
	 2. Con-
nected with.
	 3. Touched or affected by.
	 4. Borne, endured.
	 5.
Roughly handled, violated.
 E. पर, and आङ् before, मृश् to deliber-
ate, or मृष् to bear, क्त aff.
