<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परायण|परायणं
परायण mfn. subst. (-णः-णा-णं)
	 1. Adherence to any pursuit, attachment
to any object.
	 2. Dependence upon.
	 3. Best refuge. adj.
	 1. Adher-
ing or attached to.
	 2. Connected with, depending upon.
	 3. Wish-
ed, desired.
	 n. (-णं) A religious order or division.
 E. पर only,
(one object,) अयन going.
