<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परारित्न|परारित्नः
परारित्न mfn. (-त्नः-त्ना-त्नं) Belonging to the year before last.
 E. परारि as
above, and त्न aff.
