<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परार्थ|परार्थः
परार्थ mfn. (-र्थः-र्था-र्थं)
	 1. Having another object or sense, &c.
	 2.
Designed or purposed by another.
	 3. The highest interest.
	 4.
The chief meaning.
	 n. (-र्थं) For the sake or good of another. E.
पर, and अर्थ object.
