<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परार्द्ध|परार्द्धं
परार्द्ध n. (-र्द्धं)
	 1. A great number, a lack of lacks of crores, or a number
equal to half the term of BRAMHĀ'S life, or as many mortal days
as are equal to fifty of his years.
	 2. The other part, the latter
half.
 E. पर, and अर्द्ध half.
