परावृत्त mfn. (-त्तः-त्ता-त्तं)
	 1. Fled, retreated, turned back.
	 2. Turned
round, revolved.
	 3. Exchanged.
	 4. Reversed, (as a judgment.)
5. Given back, restored. परा before. वृत् to be, क्त aff.
