परावृत्ति f. (-त्तिः)
	 1. Returning, retreating, turning back.
	 2. Revolving.
3. Exchange, barter.
	 4. Reversion of a judgment.
	 5. Restoration
of property.
 E. परा before, वृत् to be, क्तिन् aff.
