<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराशरिन्
पराशरिन् m. (-री) A beggar, a wandering mendicant.
 E. पराशर the
rules of PĀRĀSARA or VYĀSA, the founder of the tribe, and इनि
aff.; also पाराशरिन्.
