<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराहत
पराहत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Assailed, attacked.
	 2. Struck back.
	 3. Re-
pulsed.
	 n. (-तं) A stroke.
 E. पर, आहत struck.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=424-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
