	 1. Decoration, embellishment.
	 2. Cooking, dressing.
3. Finishing, polishing.
	 4. Initiation, purification by essential
rites.
	 5. Surrounding.
	 6. Furniture.
 E. परि implying ornament,
and कार making, स inserted, and changed to ष; also in the same
sense परिस्कार.
