	 1. Harsh, abusive, (speech.)
	 2. Rough, rugged.
3. Severe, cruel, unkind.
	 4. Variegated in colour.
	 5. Shaggy, rough
to the touch.
	 6. Sharp, piercing.
	 n. (-षं)
	 1. Harsh and contume-
lious speech, abuse.
	 2. Yellow Barleria.
	 m. (-षः) A sort of
tree, (Xylocarpus granatum.)
 E. पॄ to fill or satisfy, उषन्
Unādi aff.
