परुस्
परुस् n. (-रुः) The knot or joint of a cane or reed.
 E. पॄ to complete,
Unādi aff. उसि.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=432-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परूष|परूषं
परूष m. (-षः) The Parush tree: see परुष; also with कन् added परूषक.
 E. पॄ-ऊषन् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=432-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परेत्
परेत् mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Dead, defunct.
	 m. (-तः) A kind of goblin, a
ghost, a spirit.
 E. पर another, (world,) इत gone. or परा + इ-क्त ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=432-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परेतर
परेतर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Faithful, friendly.
 E. पर an enemy, इतर other,
opposed to.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=432-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परेतराज्
परेतराज् m. (-राट्) A name of YAMA.
 E. परेत a ghost, and राज who rules.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=432-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परेद्यवि
परेद्यवि ind. Next day, tomorrow.
 E. पर another, एद्यवि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=433-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परेद्युस्
परेद्युस् ind. (-द्युः) Next day.
 E. पर after, एद्युस् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=433-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परेप|परेपं
परेप mfn. (पः-पा-पं) Where water is lodged or retired, whence it has,
(a place, &c.)
 E. पर, and अप water.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=433-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परेष्टि|परेष्टिः
परेष्टि m. (-ष्टिः) BRAMHĀ.
 E. पर best, इष्टि worship.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=433-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परेष्टुका
परेष्टुका f. (-का) A cow bearing many calves.
 E. पर best, इष् to go, तु
aff., and कन् added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=433-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परैवित
परैवित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Nourished by a stranger.
	 m. (-तः) The Kokila
or Indian cuckoo.
 E. पर a stranger, एवित nourished.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=433-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोक्ष|परोक्षं|परोक्षः
परोक्ष mfn. (-क्षः-क्षा-क्षं)
	 1. Invisible, imperceptible.
	 2. Absent.
	 3. Past.
m. (-क्षः) An ascetic, a religious hermit.
	 n. (-क्षं)
	 1. Invisibility,
absence, secrecy.
	 2. (In Grammar,) Past time or tense.
 E. पर
before, उक्ष् to sprinkle, aff. क; or पर away, अक्षि the eye,
form irr.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=433-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोक्षभोग|परोक्षभोगः
परोक्षभोग m. (-गः) Enjoyment or possession of any thing in the
absence of the proprietor.
 E. परोक्ष, and भोग enjoyment.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=433-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोक्षमन्मथ
परोक्षमन्मथ m. (-थः) Not experienced in love matters.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=433-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोक्षवृत्ति|परोक्षवृत्तिः
परोक्षवृत्ति mfn. (-त्तिः-त्तिः-त्ति) One who does any thing whilst absent.
E. परोक्ष, and वृत्ति practice.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=433-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोक्षार्थ
परोक्षार्थ n. (-र्थं) An absent or invisible object.
 E. परोक्ष, and अर्थ object.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=433-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोत्कर्ष|परोत्कर्षः
परोत्कर्ष m. (-र्षः) Another's superiority.
 E. पर, and उत्कर्ष eminence.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=433-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोदित
परोदित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Said by an enemy, &c.
	 n. (-तं) Clamour,
menace.
 E. पर, and उदित said.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=433-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोपकार|परोपकारः
परोपकार m. (-रः) Charity, benevolence, doing good to others. E.
पर another, उपकार assistance.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=433-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोपकारिन्
परोपकारिन् mfn. (-री-रिणी-रि) Benevolent, charitable, good to others.
E. परोपकार, and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=433-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोपकृत
परोपकृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Helped or befriended by another.
	 2.
Brought by another.
 E. पर, and उपकृत assisted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=433-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोपजाप|परोपजापः
परोपजाप n. (-पं) The dissension of enemies.
 E. पर, and उपजाप
dissension.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=433-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोपदेश|परोपदेशः
परोपदेश m. (-शः) Giving advice, counselling, admonishing.
 E. पर, and
उपदेश instruction.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=433-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोपरुद्ध
परोपरुद्ध mfn. (-द्धः-द्धा-द्धं) Invested, besieged, blockaded.
 E. पर, and
उपरुद्ध surrounded.
