<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोवरीण|परोवरीणः
परोवरीण mfn. (-णः-णा-णं) Having both superior and inferior, prior
and subsequent, &c.
 E. पर best, अवर lowest, खश् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=433-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोष्णी
परोष्णी f. (-ष्णी) A cockroach.
 E. पर best, उष्णा warmth; it is also
written परोष्टी.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=433-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्कट|पर्कटः
पर्कट n. (-टं) Regret, anxiety.
	 m. (-टः) A heron.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=433-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्क्कटि|पर्कटि|पर्कटिः
पर्क्कटि f. (-टिः-टी) The waved-leaf fig tree, (Ficus infectiosa.)
 E. पृच्
to touch, अटि aff., ङीष् optionally added; also with इन् added
पर्क्कटिन्. (पाकुड) ।
