	 4. Entireness, fulness, sufficiency.
5. Adequacy, competency, fitness.
	 6. Discrimination or distinction
of objects according to their natural properties.
	 7. Preserving,
guarding.
	 8. Warding off a blow.
 E. परि exceeding, आप्ति obtain-
ing.
