<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पल|पलं|पलः
पल n. (-लं)
	 1. A weight of gold or silver equal to four Karṣas or
Suvarnas; also of four or of eight Tolās, or in common use,
of three Tolās, two Māshas, and eight Rattis.
	 2. A moment, the
sixtieth part of an Indian hour.
	 3. Flesh.
	 m. (-लः) Straw after
threshing, &c.
 E. पल् to go, to move, aff. अच् ।
