<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्यतोहर|पश्यतोहरः
पश्यतोहर m. (-रः) A thief, a pilferer, but one who steals in presence
of the parties, and proverbially applied to the goldsmith, &c. E.
पश्यतस् in presence of, and हर who takes.
