पष
पष r. 10th. cl. (पाषयति पषयति)
	 1. To bind, to tie.
	 2. To move.
	 3. To
oppose, to hinder.
	 4. To touch.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=437-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पस
पस r. 1st. and 10. cls. (पसति-ते पासयति पसयति)
	 1. To bind, to fetter,
to tie, to string.
	 2. To touch.
	 3. To oppose, to obstruct, to hinder.
4. To go, to move.
	 5. To injure or kill. (इ) पसि r. 1st and 10th.
cls. (पंसति पंसयति-ते) To annul, to annihilate or destroy. चु-उभ-सक-
सेट-इदित् ।
