<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पस्त्य|पस्त्यं
पस्त्य n. (स्त्यं) A house,
 E. पस्-भावे क्तिन्, तत्र साधु यत् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=437-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

