पांश(स)न mfn. (-नः-ना-नी-नं)
	 1. Vitiating, spoiling.
	 2. Wicked.
	 f. (ना
or नी; generally used at the end of a compound.)
	 1. Disgraceful,
dishonouring, as in कुलपांशन.
