पांशुचामर|पांशुचामरः
पांशुचामर m. (-रः)
	 1. A tent.
	 2. A bank overgrown with Durbā grass.
3. A Praise.
	 4. A heap of dust.
	 5. A small cucumber.
 E. पांशु
dust, चामर a chowri.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=438-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
