<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पांशुपत्र|पांशुपत्रं
पांशुपत्र n. (-त्रं) A potherb, (Chenopodium.)
 E. पांशु dust, and पत्र leaf.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=438-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पांशुमर्द्दन|पांशुमर्दन|पांशुमर्द्दनः
पांशुमर्द्दन m. (-नः) A channel or basin for water, near or about the
root of a tree.
 E. पांशु dust, and मर्द्दन destroying. “केदारक्षेत्रेच” ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=438-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पांशुव
पांशुव m. (-वः) A cripple: see पीठसर्पिन्.
