<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पांसन|पांसनः
पांसन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं)
	 1. Contemptible, wicked, bad, infamous.
	 2.
Vitiating, spoiling, destructive.
 E. पसि to destroy, &c. aff. ल्युट्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=438-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पांसु|पांसुः
पांसु m. (-सुः)
	 1. Dust.
	 2. Manure.
	 3. A kind of camphor.
 E. पसि to
bind, &c., aff. कु, also पांशु.
