<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पाटित|पाटितं
पाटित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Torn, broken, divided.
	 2. Pierced.
 E. पट् to
divide, in the causal form, aff. क्त.
