<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पाटी
पाटी f. (-टीः)
	 1. Arithmetic.
	 2. A kind of shrub called Bālā.
	 3.
Regular order.
 E. पट to go, इन् or ङीप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=439-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पाटीर|पाटीरः
पाटीर m. (-रः) A field.
	 2. A pungent root, a sort of radish.
	 3. The
pith or manna of the bamboo.
	 4. A cloud.
	 5. A sieve, a cribble.
6. Tin.
	 7. Disease arising from wind.
	 8. Sandal.
 E. पट् to go, &c.
in the causal form, ईरन् aff.; or पटीर + स्वार्थे अण् ।
