पाटूपट
पाटूपट mfn. (-टः-टा-टं) Going, who or what goes.
 E. पट् to go, अच् aff.
and the root repeated, form irr.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=439-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पाठ|पाठः
पाठ m. (-ठः)
	 1. Studying the Vedas scriptures, considered as one of
the five great sacraments of the Hindus.
	 2. Reading, perusal or
study in general.
	 f. (-ठा) A plant, commonly Akanādi.
 E. पठ् to
read, aff. भावे घञ्.
