पात्रभृत्
पात्रभृत् m. (-भृत्) A servant.
 E. पात्र, and भृत् who takes care of.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=441-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

