पाय्य|पाय्यं
पाय्य mfn. (-य्यः-य्या-य्यं) Low, vile, reprehensible, contemptible.
	 n. (-य्यं)
1. Measure.
	 2. Water.
	 3. Drinking.
	 4. Practice, profession.
 E. पा
to drink, ण्यत् aff.
