<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पारक|पारकः
पारक mfn. (-कः-का-की-कं)
	 1. What purifies, protects, cherishes, pleases,
&c.
	 2. What enables one to cross, (a river or the world.)
	 3. Ser-
ving, delivering.
 E. पॄ to please, ण्वुल् aff.
