<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पारक्य|पारक्यं|पारक्यः
पारक्य mfn. (-क्यः-क्या-क्यं)
	 1. An enemy, hostile, inimical.
	 2. Alien,
belonging to another.
	 n. (-क्यं) Pious conduct, doing any thing
for the sake of future happiness.
 E. परक or पारक, and ष्यञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=444-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

