पारग mfn. (-गः-गा-गं)
	 1. Crossing, crossing over.
	 2. Going over or
beyond the world.
	 3. Completely familiar or conversant with.
	 4.
Profoundly learned.
 E. पार the opposite bank, and ग who goes.
