<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पारिणाह्य|पारिणाह्यं
पारिणाह्य n. (-ह्यं) Household furniture and utensils.
 E. परिणाह, and
ष्यञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=445-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पारितथ्या
पारितथ्या f. (-थ्या) A trinket worn on the forehead, where the hair
is parted; or a string of pearls for binding the hair.
 E. परि every
way (splendid), तथा there, ष्यञ् added.
