<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पारिपन्थिक|पारिपंथिक|पारिपंथिकः|पारिपन्थिकः
पारिपन्थिक m. (-कः) A robber, a thief, a highwayman.
 E. परि around,
पथिन् the road, aff. ठक्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=445-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पारिपाठ्य
पारिपाठ्य n. (-ठ्यं) Regularity, methodicalness, successiveness.
 E. परि-
पाटी orderly course, ष्यञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=445-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पारिपात्र|पारिपात्रं|पारिपात्रः
पारिपात्र m. (-त्रः) The name of a mountain, apparently the centrical or
western portion of the “Vindhya” chain, which skirts the province
of Mālwā.
 E. परि every way, पा to cherish, ष्ट्रन् aff.; or with कन्
added, पारिपात्रक; also read पारियात्र.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=445-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पारिपात्रक
पारिपात्रक m. (-कः) A mountain so called: see the last.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=445-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पारिपार्श्विक|पारिपार्श्विकः
पारिपार्श्विक m. (-कः)
	 1. An actor, who serves as a sort of chorus to
the drama, and is one of the interlocutors in the prologue.
	 2. An
attendant.
 E. परि about, पार्श्व the side, (of the manager, &c.) aff.
ठक्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=445-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पारिपार्श्विका
पारिपार्श्विका f. (-का) A chamber-maid.
