पार्ष्णि mf. (-र्ष्णिः)
	 1. The heel.
	 2. The rear of an army.
	 3. The back.
4. Enquiry, asking.
	 5. A kick.
	 f. (-र्ष्णिः)
	 1. A violent or licen-
tious woman, one intoxicated literally or figuratively, &c.
	 2. A
name of KUNTĪ the mother of YUDHIṢṬHIRA.
 E. पृष् to sprin-
kle, &c. Unādi aff. नि.
