पाल|पालः
पाल mfn. (-लः-ली-लं) Who or what guards or preserves.
	 m. (-लः)
	 1. A
nourisher, a protector.
	 2. A spitting-pot.
	 3. A herdsman.
	 4. A
king.
	 f. (-ली)
	 1. The sharp edge of a sword.
	 2. A woman with a
beard.
	 3. A louse.
	 4. A line, a row or range.
	 5. A pot, a boiler.
E. पाल् to nourish, aff. अच्; ङीष् added; also with इ aff. पालि.
