	 m. (-कः)
1. A horse-keeper, a groom.
	 2. A cherisher, a protector, a guar-
dian.
	 3. A prince.
	 4. A horse.
	 5. The chitraka tree.
 E. पाल् to
nourish, aff. ण्वुल् ।
