	 2. A sort
of beet root, (Peta bengalensis.)
	 3. A hawk.
	 f. (-ङ्की) Incense, the
resin of the olibanum; also पालङ्क्या.
 E. पाल nourishing, अङ्क what
goes or gives, aff. घञ् ।
