पालि|पालिः
पालि(ली) f. (-लिः or लीः)
	 1. The sharp edge of a sword, or any cutting
instrument.
	 2. The tip of the ear.
	 3. A line, a row or range.
	 4. A
mark, a spot, a stain.
	 5. A louse.
	 6. A woman with a beard.
7. A boundary, a limit.
	 8. A raised bank, a causeway, a bridge.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=447-b" target="_blank">Page447-b+ 60</a>]
9. A circumference.
	 10. Maintenance of a scholar during the
period of his studies, by his teacher.
	 11. Praise, eulogium.
	 12.
The hip or haunch.
	 13. A Prastha or measure so called.
	 14.
The lap, the bosom.
 E. पाल् to nourish, इण् aff., and in most cases,
ङीप् being optionally added, also पाली: see पाल.
