पावकारणि|पावकारणिः
पावकारणि m. (-णिः) A tree, the wood of which is used to procure fire
by attrition.
 E. पावक fire, अरणि touch-wood.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=447-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

