forms as the supreme deity of the Hindū triad.
	 2. A followers
of the doctrines of Paśupati, an old philosopher. A tree,
(Æschynomene grandiflora.)
	 n. (-तं) The teaching of Paśupati.
E. पशुपति a name of ŚIVA, अण् aff.
