पाषण्ड|पाषंड|पाषण्डः
पाषण्ड m. (-ण्डः)
	 1. A heretic, an impostor, one who not conforming
to the orthodox tenets of Hindu faith, assumes the external
characteristics of tribe or sect, a Jain, a Bauddha &c.
	 2. Any
sect not Hindu.
 E. पाप sin, षण् to give, ड aff., deriv. irr.
