पिवु
पिवु m. (-चुः)
	 1. Cotton.
	 2. The name of an Asura.
	 3. A Karṣa or
weight of two Tolās: see कर्ष.
	 4. A sort of leprosy.
	 5. One of the
eight faces of BHAIRAVA.
 E. पिच Sautra root, means to rub,
Unādi aff. उ; or पच-उ-पृषो० ।
