पिण्डद|पिंडद|पिण्डदः
पिण्डद mfn. (-दः-दा-दं)
	 1. Who or what gives the funeral cake to
deceased ancestors.
	 2. One who supports or feeds another.
	 m.
(-दः)
	 1. The nearest male relation who offers the funeral cake.
	 2.
A patron, a master.
 E. पिण्ड, and द who or what gives.
