<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृव्य|पितृव्यः
पितृव्य m. (-व्यः)
	 1. A paternal uncle.
	 2. Any elderly relation.
 E. पितृ
a father, व्यत् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=451-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृव्रत|पितृव्रतः
पितृव्रत m. (-तः) Who worships the manes.
	 n. (-तं) Worship of
ancestors, obsequial rites.
 E. पितृ, and व्रत obligation.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=451-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृश्राद्ध
पितृश्राद्ध n. (-द्धं) The obsequial ceremony of a father.
 E. पितृ, and
श्राद्ध the rite.
