<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्त|पित्तं
पित्त n. (-त्तं) Bile, the bilious humour.
 E. अपि certainly, दो to des-
troy, or देङ् to nourish, aff. क्त, deriv. irr., or तप् to inflame, aff.
क्त, and the radical letters transposed.
