<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्तरक्त|पित्तरक्तं
पित्तरक्त n. (-क्तं) Plethora. See रक्तपित्त.
 E. पित्त, and रक्त blood.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=452-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्तल|पित्तलं
पित्तल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Bilious, relating to the bilious humour.
	 n.
(-लं)
	 1. Brass.
	 2. The Bhūrjapatra or Birch tree, of which the
bark is used for writing upon, &c.
	 f. (-ला) A plant, (Jussieua
repens.)
 E. पित्त bile, ला to get, to resemble, (in colour,) aff. ड.
