<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्र्य|पित्र्यं|पित्र्यः
पित्र्य mfn. (-त्र्यः-त्र्या-त्र्यं)
	 1. Paternal, ancestral.
	 2. Obsequial, relating
to deceased progenitors.
	 m. (-त्र्यः)
	 1. An elder brother.
	 2. The
month of māgha.
	 n. (-त्र्यं) The part of the hand between the
forefinger and thumb, sacred to the manes.
	 f. (-त्र्या)
	 1. One of
the lunar asterisms, called Maghā.
	 2. Day of full moon.
	 3.
Ceremonies performed in honour of the deceased on the day of full
or new moon.
 E. पितृ a father, and यत् aff., रीङ् substituted for ऋ.
