<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिशाचकिन्
पिशाचकिन् m. (-की) KUVERA, the god of wealth.
 E. पिशाच a demon,
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=453-a" target="_blank">Page453-a+ 60</a>]
इनि aff., and कुक् augment; the treasures of this deity being
guarded by Pīṣāchas, and other malignant beings.
