पिशुन|पिशुनं|पिशुनः
पिशुन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं)
	 1. Cruel, wicked.
	 2. Vile, low, contemptible.
3. Stupid, a fool.
	 n. (-नं) Saffron.
	 m. (-नः)
	 1. A spy, an informer,
a tale-bearer, a slanderer, a traitor.
	 2. A name of NĀRADA.
	 3.
A crow.
	 4. Cotton.
	 f. (-ना) A gramineous plant, “पिडिङ्शाक”
(Trigonella corniculata.)
	 2. Indicating, making known, evincing.
3. Calumniating, back-biting.
	 4. unkind.
 E. पिश् to be a part, उनन्
Unādi aff., and the vowel unchanged.
