पिष
पिष r.
	 7. th cl. (पिनष्टि) To grind, to pound, to bruise or powder. r.
10th cl. (पेषयति-ते)
	 1. To injure.
	 2. To give.
	 3. To be strong.
	 4.
To dwell. r. 1st and 10th cls. (पेषति पेषयति-ते) To go or move.
चूर्णने रु० पर० सक० अनिट् ।
