पिष्टक m. (-कः)
	 1. A cake made of the flour or meal of any grain.
2. A disease of the eyes, opacity of the cornea.
	 n. (-कं) Oil-cake.
E. पिष्ट what is pound, कन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=453-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
