पीडित|पीडितं
पीडित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Bound, tied.
	 2. Pained, suffering pain or dis-
tress.
	 3. Laid waste, destroyed, devastated.
	 4. Rubbed, chafed.
	 5.
Squeezed, pressed.
	 6. Espoused: see पीडन.
	 7. Violated.
	 8. Op-
pressed, harassed.
	 9. Eclipsed.
	 n. (-तं)
	 1. Injuring, harassing.
	 2.
A mode of sexual enjoyment.
