पुट|पुटं|पुटः
पुट r. 1st cl. (पोटति) To rub, to press, to grind or pound. r. 6th cl.
(पुटति) To embrace, to intertwine. r. 10th cl. (पोटयति-ते)
	 1. To
be or become small, or shallow.
	 2. To shine.
	 3. To speak.
	 4. To
reduce to powder, to grind. r. 10th cl. (पुटयति-ते)
	 1. To
fasten, to string, to bind together.
	 2. To be in contact with. दीप्तौ
अक० चूर्णने सक० चुरा० उभ० सेट् । श्लेषे तु० कु० पर० सक० सेट् । संसर्गे अद० चुरा०
