<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुनरुपगम|पुनरुपगमः
पुनरुपगम m. (-मः) Return.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=457-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुनरुपोढा
पुनरुपोढा f. (-ढा) A woman remarried.
