पुनर्भू mfn. (-र्भूः-र्भूः-र्भु) Re-born, regenerated.
	 f. (-र्भूः)
	 1. A virgin widow
re-married.
	 2. Re-existence.
 E. पुनर् again, (a wife, &c.) भू being.
