<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुनर्वसु|पुनर्वसुः|पुनर्व्वसुः
पुनर्वसु m. (-सुः) The seventh of the lunar asterisms, containing accord-
ing to some authorities two, and to others, four stars; (in this
sense it is properly confined to the dual number पुनर्व्वसु, though
in the Vedas it it used in the singular.)
	 2. A name of VIṢṆU.
	 3.
The name of a saint, and grammarian; also KĀTYĀYANA.
	 4. A
name of ŚIVA.
	 5. Commencement of wealth.
	 6. A Loka or
division of the universe.
 E. पनर् again, वस् to dwell, aff. उ.
