<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुन्नक्षत्त्र
पुन्नक्षत्त्र n. (-त्त्रं) An asterism under which males are procreated.
 E. पुं
for पुमस्, and नक्षत्त्र asterism.
