<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुपषत्
पुपषत् mfn. (-षन्-षन्ती-षत्) Wishing to cleanse or purify.
 E. पू to
purify, desid. v., शतृ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=458-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुपूषा
पुपूषा f. (-षा) Wish to cleanse or purify.
 E. पू to purify, desid. v., affs. अङ् and टाप्.
