<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुप्फुस|पुप्फुसः
पुप्फुस m. (-सः)
	 1. The lungs.
	 2. The pericarp of a lotus.
 E. स्फुर् to
swell, deriv. irr. it is also written. फुप्फुस and पुप्पुस.
