पुरःसर mfn. (-रः-री-रं) One who goes first or before.
	 m. (-रः) A
leader, a preceder. Adv.
	 n. (-रं) By or with, i. e. preceded by,
attended with, as कोपपुरःसर with rage.
 E. पुरस् before, सर who goes.
