पुरञ्जन m. (-नः) Life, the living principle.
	 f. (-नी) Understanding. E.
पुर the body, and जन what produces.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=458-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

