	 m. (-यः)
	 1. The
proper name of a king, the third of the race of the sun.
 E. पुर a
city, जी to conquer, aff. खश्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=458-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
