<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरद्विष्
पुरद्विष् m. (-द्विट्) A name of ŚIVA.
 E. पुर a name of Tripura, the
demon, and द्विष् who hates.
