<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरन्दर|पुरंदर|पुरन्दरं|पुरंदरः|पुरन्दरः
पुरन्दर m. (-रः)
	 1. A name of INDRA.
	 2. An epithet of Sīva.
	 3. An
epithet of Agni.
	 4. A thief, a housebreaker.
	 n. (-रं) A sort of
pepper, (Piper chavya.)
	 f. (-रा) A name of the Ganges.
 E. पुर
a city, दॄ to tear or rend, aff. स्वच्, deriv. irr.
