पुरस्
पुरस् Ind.
	 1. Eastward.
	 2. In front, before, in presence of, (with a
genitive); in this sense it is often prefixed to कृ, भू and गम; hence
such forms as पुरस्कत्य &c.
	 3. Prior, first.
	 4. Formerly.
 E. पुर् to
precede, aff. असुक्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=458-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरसंस्कार
पुरसंस्कार m. (-रः) The repairing of a castle.
