<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरस्करण|पुरस्करणं
पुरस्करण n. (-णं) Making perfect, &c.: see पुरस्कार.
 E. पुरस्, and करण doing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=458-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरस्करणीय
पुरस्करणीय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) To be respected, &c.: see पुरस्कर्त्तव्य.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=458-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरस्कर्त्तव्य|पुरस्कर्तव्य
पुरस्कर्त्तव्य mfn. (-व्यः-व्या-व्यं)
	 1. To be made complete or perfect.
	 2. To
be prepared, to be fitted out.
	 3. To be set before.
	 4. To be
treated with deference or respect.
 E. पुरस्, कृ to make, तव्य aff.;
also पुरस्करणीय and पुरस्कार्य्य.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=458-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
