पुरस्कार|पुरस्कारः
पुरस्कार m. (-रः)
	 1. Making perfect or complete, finishing, polishing.
2. Preparing, getting ready.
	 3. Arranging, putting in array.
4. Placing before.
	 5. Honouring, respecting.
	 6. Worshiping.
7. Sprinkling with holy water.
	 8. Promise.
	 9. Accusation.
	 10.
Attacking, assailing.
	 11. Anticipating, expecting.
 E. पुरस्, and
कार making.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=458-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरस्कार्य्य|पुरस्कार्य
पुरस्कार्य्य mfn. (-र्य्यः-र्य्या-र्य्यं) To be prepared, to be fitted out, &c.: see
पुरस्कर्त्तव्य.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=458-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरस्क्रिया
पुरस्क्रिया f. (-याः)
	 1. A preparatory rite.
	 2. Showing respect.
	 3. Making
perfect, &c.: see पुरस्कार.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=459-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरस्कृत|पुरस्कृतः
पुरस्कृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Made perfect, finished, polished.
	 2. Pre-
pared.
	 3. Placed in front.
	 4. Revered, adored, worshiped.
	 5.
Honoured, respected.
	 6. Sprinkled with holy water, initiated,
anointed.
	 7. Promised, agreed.
	 8. Accused, calumniated.
	 9.
Facing, and contending with an enemy.
	 10. Distrest or haras-
sed by an enemy.
	 11. Anticipated.
 E. पुरस् before, and कृत made.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=459-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरस्तात्
पुरस्तात् Ind.
	 1. Eastward.
	 2. In front, before.
	 3. Prior, first, preceding.
4. Formerly.
	 5. Further on, in the sequel.
 E. पुर to go before,
अस्ताति aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=459-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरा
पुरा Ind.
	 1. An ancient story.
	 2. Old.
	 3. Past.
	 4. Long past, of yore.
5. Near.
	 6. Future.
	 7. Proximate future.
 E. पुर् to precede, affs. क
and टाप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=459-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुराकथा
पुराकथा f. (-था) An old legend.
