<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुराकल्प|पुराकल्पः
पुराकल्प m. (-ल्पः)
	 1. A former creation.
	 2. An old story, a story of the past.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=459-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
