<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुलस्ति|पुलस्तिः
पुलस्ति m. (-स्तिः) The name of one of the seven Ṛshis, and mind-
born sons of BRAHMĀ.
 E. पुल् great, अस् to throw or cast down,
Unādi aff. ति; otherwise with स्त्यै to collect, and क aff. पुलस्त्य.
