पुलह|पुलहः
पुलह m. (-हः) One of the seven divine sages, supposed to have born
from the navel of BRAHMĀ.
 E. पुल् great, हा to abandon, aff. क.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=461-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
