पुलिन|पुलिनं|पुलिनः
पुलिन n. (-नं)
	 1. An island of alluvial formation, or one from which
the water has recently withdrawn, or a small island or bank left
in the middle of a river, upon the falling of the waters.
	 2. Any
island.
 E. पुल to be great, इनन् Unādi aff. किच्च ।
