पू
पू(ङ)पूङ् r. 1st cl. (पवते)शोधे भ्वा० आ० सक० सेट् । (ञ)पूञ् r. 9th cl. (पुनाति-
पुनीते)
	 1. To purify, to cleanse, physically or metaphorically.
	 2. To
clean from chaff, to winnow.
	 3. To Discriminate, to discern.
	 4. To
invent, to think out, to contrive. क्र्यादि० प्वा० उभ० सक० सेट् । r. 4th cl.
(पूयते) To grow or become pure. दिवा० आत्म० सक० सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=463-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूग|पूगं|पूगः
पूग m. (-गः)
	 1. The betel-nut tree, (Areca faufel or catechu.)
	 2. A
heap, a quantity, a multitude.
	 3. Disposition, property, nature.
4. The Jack-tree.
	 5. An association, a corporation.
	 n. (-गं) The
fruit of the faufel, the betel-nut.
 E. पू to cleanse, गन् Unādi aff.
