पूर|पूरं|पूरः
पूर r. 4th cl. (ई) पूरी (पूर्य्यते) 1. To satisfy.
	 2. To fill.
	 3. To be satisfied.
4. To be full. दिवा० आत्म० सक० सेट् । r. 10th cl. (पूरयति-ते)
	 1. To
satisfy.
	 2. To fill out.
	 3. To fill with wind, to blow.
	 4. To cover,
to surround.
	 5. To fill with sound, to make resonant.
	 6. To inten-
sify, to strengthen. चु० उभ० सक० सेट् । With आ 1. To fill, to make
full.
	 2. To blow.
	 3. To cover, to envelop, to intertwine. With
परि To fill completely. With प्र, 1. To fill.
	 2. To enrich, to load
with riches. With सम, To fill.
