पूर्णालक|पूर्णालकं
पूर्णालक n. (-कं) A vessel of clothes or ornaments to be scrambled for.
E. पूर्ण full, अल् to ornament, aff. ण्वुल्; also sometimes written
पूर्णानक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=465-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णिमा
पूर्णिमा f. (-मा) Day of full moon.
 E. पूर्ण full, (the moon,) इमक् aff.
