पूर्णोपमा
पूर्णोपमा f. (-मा) A complete simile, in which the four requisites, namely
उपमेय, उपमान, साधारणधर्म्म, and उपमावाचक must all be expressed.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=465-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
