पूर्व्वमीमांसा|पूर्वमीमांसा
पूर्व्वमीमांसा f. (-सा) An inquiry into the ritual portion of the Veda. It is
called पूर्व्वमीमांसा in contradistinction to the Vedānta system which
is considered to be a sequel to Jaimini's system and is styled उत्तर
