<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथक्क्षेत्र
पृथक्क्षेत्र m. plu. (-त्राः) Children of one father by wives of different
classes.
 E. पृथक् separately, and क्षेत्र a wife.
