<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथकत्व
पृथकत्व n. (-त्वं) Individuality, separateness, severalty.
 E. त्व added to
पृथक्; also with तल्, पृथक्ता ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=467-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथक्त्वचा
पृथक्त्वचा f. (-चा) A plant, commonly Mūrvā, (Sanseviera zeylanica.) E.
पृथक् separately, त्वच् skin; having a fibrous bark from which
bows-strings are made.
