पृथगात्मन्
पृथगात्मन् mfn. (-त्मा-त्मा-त्म) Several, separate, individual.
	 m. (-त्मा)
Individualised spirit, or that of an individual, as detached from
universal spirit, or the soul of all.
 E. पृथक्, and आत्मन् self or soul.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=467-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
