पृथग्जन m. (-नः)
	 1. An ignorant man, a fool.
	 2. A man of a low cast.
3. A sinner, a wicked or vicious man.
	 m. plu. (-नाः) Children of
one father by different mothers.
 E. पृथक् separate, away from,
(virtue &c.) and जन a man.
