पृथिवी
पृथिवी f. (-वी) The earth.
 E. प्रथ् to be famous, Unādi aff. षिवन्, fem.
aff. ङीप्, and the vowel substituted for the semi-vowel; also with
the anti-penultimate vowel changed to अ, पृथवी; or dropped alto-
gether, पृथ्वी; or without the fem. aff. पृथिवि ।
