पृथु|पृथुः
पृथु mfn. (-थुः-थुः-थ्वी-थु)
	 1. Large, great.
	 2. Smart, clever.
	 m. (-थुः)
	 1. The
fifth monarch of the solar dynasty in the second age.
	 2. A name
of Agni or fire.
	 f. (-थुः)
	 1. A pungent seed, (Nigella Indica.)
	 2.
A medicinal substance, commonly Hingupatri.
	 3. Opium.
 E. प्रथ्
to be famous, aff. कु, and र changed to ऋ ।
