पृथुक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) The young of any animal.
	 mn. (-कः-कं) Rice or
grain flattened.
	 f. (-का) Hingupatri: see पृथु.
 E. प्रथ् to be famous,
aff. कुकन् or पृथु as above, and कन् added.
