पृषदाज्य|पृषदाज्यं
पृषदाज्य n. (-ज्यं) Ghee mixed with curds, forming an oblation.
 E. पृषत्
sprinkling, and आज्य Ghee.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=467-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृषद्वल|पृषद्वलः
पृषद्वल m. (-लः) A horse of the wind.
 E. पृषत् a deer, वलच् aff.
