पृषन्ति|पृषंति|पृषंतिः|पृषन्तिः
पृषन्ति n. (-न्ति) A drop of water.
 E. पृष् to sprinkle, aff. झिच्; according
to the best authorities, however, this word is the plural inflection
of पृषत् ।
