पृष्टि|पृष्टिः
पृष्टि m. (-ष्टिः)
	 1. A ray of light.
	 2. Touch.
 E. पृष् to touch, &c. aff. क्तिन्.
when it is derived from प्रच्छ्-क्तिन् it means “Inquiry” and when
formed from पृष् कर्तरि क्तिच् it signifies “the back” or “at the
