पेपीयमान
पेपीयमान mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) To be drank repeatedly.
 E. पा to drink, reit. v.,
शानच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=468-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पेय|पेयं
पेय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Drinkable, drink.
	 n. (-यं)
	 1. Water.
	 2. Milk.
	 f. (-या)
1. Rice gruel.
	 2. Decoction of any thing after straining.
	 3. Any
drink with a small quantity of boiled rice.
	 4. Anise, (Pimpinella
anisum.)
 E. पा to drink, aff. यत् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=468-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पेयु|पेयुः
पेयु m. (-युः)
	 1. The sea.
	 2. Fire.
	 3. The sun.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=468-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पेयूष|पेयूषं|पेयूषः
पेयूष mn. (-षः-षं)
	 1. The milk of a cow, which has calved within seven
days.
	 2. Fresh Ghee.
	 3. Amrita or nectar.
 E. पीय Sautra root, for
पा to drink, ऊसुन् Unādi aff., and the vowel changed; otherwise
पीयूष, q. v.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=468-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पेरा
पेरा f. (-रा) A kind of musical instrument.
 E. पि वा रे ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=468-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पेरु|पेरुः
पेरु m. (-रुः)
	 1. The ocean.
	 2. The golden mountain.
	 3. The sun.
	 4. Fire.
E. पा to drink, Unādi aff. रु ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=468-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पेरोज|पेरोजं
पेरोज n. (-जं) The turquoise: it is the Persian word.
