<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पेल|पेलं|पेलः
पेल(ऋ)पेऌ r. 1st cl. (पेलति) To go or move. r. 10th cl. (पेलयति-ते) To
shake, to tremble. कम्पे अक० गतौ सक० भ्वा० पर० सेट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=468-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पेल|पेलं|पेलः
पेल m. (-लः)
	 1. A small part.
	 2. Going.
	 n. (-लं) A testicle.
 E. पिल् to send,
aff. घञ्, or पेल् to go, अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=468-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पेलव|पेलवं
पेलव mfn. (-वः-वा-वं)
	 1. Delicate, fine.
	 2. Thin, slim, slender.
	 3. Soft. E.
पेल, वा to get, aff. ड ।
