<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पेलि|पेलिः
पेलि m. (-लिः)
	 1. One who goes.
	 2. A horse.
 E. पेल, इन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=468-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पेलिन्
पेलिन् m. (-ली)
	 1. A horse.
 E. पेल going, and इनि aff.
