<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पेशल|पेशलः
पेशल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं)
	 1. Dexterous, clever.
	 2. Beautiful, agreeable,
3. Fraudulent, crafty.
	 4. Soft, smooth.
	 5. Tender, delicate.
	 6.
Thin, slender.
 E. पिश् to be a component part, अलच् aff.; also पेषल
and पेसल ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=468-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पेशस्कत्
पेशस्कत् m. (-कृत्) A sort of insect, a kind of wasp.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=468-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पेशि|पेशिः
पेशि m. (-शिः) The thunderbolt.
	 f. (-शिः or -शी)
	 1. An egg.
	 2. Split pease.
E. पिश् to be a part, Unādi aff. इन्; also with ङीप् added in the
fem, form पेशी, as below.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=468-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पेशी
पेशी f. (-शी)
	 1. The egg of a bird.
	 2. A blown bud.
	 3. Spikenard,
(Valeriana jatamansi.)
	 4. A ball of flesh or meat.
	 5. A sheath, a
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=469-a" target="_blank">Page469-a+ 60</a>]
scabbard.
	 6. A muscle.
	 7. The fetus shortly after conception.
8. A kind of musical instrument.
	 9. The name a river.
	 10.
The name of a female imp or demon.
 E. पिश् to be a component
part, aff. इन् and ङीप् added; also पेशि ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=468-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पेशी
पेशी(शि)कोष(श) m. (-षः or शः) A bird's egg. “अण्डकोषेच” ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=469-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पेश्वर
पेश्वर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Who or what grinds.
 E. पिश् to grind, वरच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=469-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पेष|पेषः
पेष(ऋ)पेषृ r. 1st cl. (पेषते) To resolve or endeavour diligently.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=469-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पेषण|पेषणं
पेषण n. (-णं)
	 1. Grinding, pulverising, reducing to dust or powder.
	 2.
A hand mill, a stone and muller, any apparatus for grinding or
pounding.
	 3. A plant, (a sort of Euphorbia with three lobes, com-
monly Teṇkātāsij.)
 E. पिश् to grind, aff. ल्युट्; also पेषणि, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=469-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पेषणि|पेषणिः
पेषणि f. (-णिः or -णी) A stone slab on which condiments, &c. are ground
with a muller.
 E. पिश् to grind, aff. अनि and ङीप् optionally added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=469-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पेषल|पेषलः
पेषल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं)
	 1. Dexterous, clever.
	 2. Beautiful, handsome:
see पेशल ।
