<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पेषाक|पेषाकः
पेषाक m. (-कः) A small slab for grinding any thing upon.
 E. पिष् to grind, Unādi aff. आकन् ।
