<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पेस्वर
पेस्वर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Destructive.
	 2. Moving, going.
	 3. Splendid.
 E. पिस्
to hurt, &c. वरच् aff.
