पैठर|पैठरं
पैठर mfn. (-रः-री-रं) Boiled in a pot, (flesh, &c.)
 E. पिठर a vessel, aff. अण् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=469-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
