पौत्त्र mfn. (-त्त्रः-त्त्री-त्त्रं) Relating to a son.
	 m. (-त्त्रः) A son's son, a grand-
son.
	 f. (-त्त्री) A grand-daughter, either in the male or female line,
though more usually implying a son's daughter.
 E. पुत्त्र or पुत्त्री a son
or daughter, अण् aff. of descent.
