पौत्त्रिक
पौत्त्रिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Belonging to a son or a grandson.
 E. पुत्त्र or
पौत्त्र, and ठञ् or ठञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=470-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पौत्त्रिकेय
पौत्त्रिकेय m. (-यः)
	 1. A daughter's son.
	 2. The son of a daughter
appointed to raise issue for her father.
 E. पुत्त्रिका, and ढक् aff.
