<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पौरस्त्री
पौरस्त्री f. (-स्त्री) A woman residing in a town or city.
 E. पौरा, and स्त्री a
female; also similar compounds, as पौरयोषित, पौराङ्गना, &c.
