पौराणिक|पौराणिकः
पौराणिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Of or belonging to the Purānas, Paurānic.
	 m.
(-कः) A Brāhman, well read in the Purānas, a mythologist. E.
पुराण, and ठक् aff.
