प्रकरण|प्रकरणं
प्रकरण n. (-णं)
	 1. An introduction, a prologue or prelude.
	 2. A poetical
fiction or poem, in which the story and principal persons are
wholly imaginary; the term is especially applied to a dramatic
poem.
	 3. A chapter, a section, a book, a place of pausing or
stopping.
	 4. Treating with respect.
	 5. Doing much or well.
	 6. Op-
pertunity, occasion.
	 7. Subject, topic.
	 f. (-णी) A minor drama of
the same character as the prakarana, but of less extent; also
प्रकरणिका.
 E. प्र before, कृ to make, aff. ल्युट् ।
