3. Asking, begging.
	 4. Affectionate solicitation.
	 5. Final eman-
cipation or beatitude.
	 6. Trust, confidence.
	 7. Reverence, obeisance,
8. Favour, kindness.
 E. प्र before, नी to get, aff. अच् ।
