	 2. A low sound expressive of great
pleasure, a murmur or sigh of rapture.
	 3. A cry for help.
	 4.
Neighing, bringing.
	 5. A disease of the ear, a noise or buzzing in
the ear from thickening of the membranes, &c.
 E. प्र much, and
नाद sound.
