प्रतिषेधोपमा
प्रतिषेधोपमा f. (-मा) A kind of Simile thus explained by Dandin:--
“न जातु शक्तिरिन्दोस्ते मुखेन प्रति गर्जितुम् ।
कलङ्किनो जडस्येति प्रतिषेधोपमैव सा ॥”
But according to modern writers this would be a व्यतिरेक ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=482-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

