	 2. Foundation.
	 3. Celebrity.
	 4. The
capital of the early kings of the lunar dynasty, opposite to Allā-
hābād.
	 5. The capital of SĀLIBĀHANA on the Godāvery, in the
Dakshin.
 E. प्रति and स्थान place.
