प्रतिसर|प्रतिसरः
प्रतिसर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) A servant, servile, dependent.
	 m. (-रः)
	 1. The
rear of an army.
	 2. A garland, a wreath.
	 3. A bracelet.
	 4. Cicatri-
zing or healing, (as a sore.)
	 5. A form of magic or incantation.
	 6.
Daybreak, morning.
	 mn. (-रः-रं)
