प्रतीक|प्रतीकः
प्रतीक mfn. (-कः-का-कं)
	 1. Contrary, adverse.
	 2. Inverted, reversed,
against the natural order or state.
	 3. Directed towards.
	 m. (-कः)
1. A limb, a member.
	 2. A part, a portion n. (-कं)
	 1. the face.
	 2.
The front.
	 3. An image.
	 4. The first word of a verse or sentence. E.
प्रति before, ई to go, ईकन् aff.
