<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रती
प्रती(ति)कार m. (-रः)
	 1. Revenge, retaliation.
	 2. Remedying, obviating,
correcting.
	 3. Remedying, administering medicines.
 E. प्रति against,
(re), and कार making, re-action, the is made long in conse-
quence of the aff. being घञ् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=484-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीकाश|प्रतीकाशः
प्रतीकाश mfn. (-शः-शा-शं) Like, resembling, (in composition.)
	 m. (-शः)
	 1.
Look, appearance.
	 2. Reflection.
 E. प्रति before, काश् to shine, aff.
घञ्; it is also written प्रतिकाश ।
