<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीक्षक
प्रतीक्षक mfn. (-कः-का-कं)
	 1. Expecting.
	 2. Looking at.
 E. प्रति before,
ईक्ष् to see, ण्वुल् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=484-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीक्षण
प्रतीक्षण n. (-णं)
	 1. Looking to or at, considering, referring to.
	 2. Re-
specting.
	 3. Expecting, waiting for.
 E. प्रति before, ईक्ष् to see,
ल्युट् aff.
