<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीक्षणीय
प्रतीक्षणीय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) To be had in view, to be considered or re-
garded.
 E. प्रति before, ईक्ष् to see, अनीयर् aff.
