<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीक्षा
प्रतीक्षा f. (-क्षा)
	 1. Reference, regard to, consideration, looking to or
at.
	 2. Hope, expectation.
	 3. Waiting for.
 E. प्रति before, ईक्ष् to see,
अङ् and टाप् affs.
