<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीक्षित
प्रतीक्षित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Contemplated, considered, had regard to.
2. Respected, honoured.
	 3. Expected, looked for, hoped.
 E. प्रति
before, ईक्ष् to see, क्त aff.
