प्रतीक्ष्य mfn. (-क्ष्यः-क्ष्या-क्ष्यं)
	 1. To be considered, to be had regard to.
2. To be expected. Ind. Having considered, having expected, &c.
3. Venerable, respectable.
 E. प्रति before, ईक्ष् to see, aff. ण्यत् or ल्यप् ।
