<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यक्ष|प्रत्यक्षं
प्रत्यक्ष mfn. (-क्षः-क्षा-क्षं)
	 1. Perceptible, perceivable, present, cognizable
by any of the organs of sense.
	 2. Distinct, clear, evident.
	 3. Direct,
immediate.
	 4. Corporeal.
	 n. (-क्षं) Ocular evidence, apprehension by
the senses, perception, (considered as a mode of proof. In Phil.) E.
अक्ष an organ of sense with प्रति indicative prefix.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यक्षम्
प्रत्यक्षम् It is used as an indeclinable in the sense of:--1. In the pre-
sence of, before, 2. Publicly.
	 3. Immediately, directly, personally:
also similar words as प्रत्यक्षेण and प्रत्यक्षात् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यक्षज्ञान
प्रत्यक्षज्ञान n. (-नं) Knowledge obtained by perception.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यक्षतस्
प्रत्यक्षतस् Ind. Evidently, perceptibly.
 E. प्रत्यक्ष, and तम् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यक्षदर्शन|प्रत्यक्षदर्शनं
प्रत्यक्षदर्शन m. (-नः) A witness, an eye-witness.
 E. प्रत्यक्ष what is present,
and दर्शन seeing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यक्षप्रमा
प्रत्यक्षप्रमा f. (-मा) Correct knowledge obtained through perception by
the senses.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यक्षप्रमाण
प्रत्यक्षप्रमाण n. (-णं)
	 1. Ocular proof, evidence of the senses.
	 2. An organ
or faculty of perception.
 E. प्रत्यक्ष and प्रमाण proof.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यक्षफल
प्रत्यक्षफल Adj. Having visible consequences.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यक्षभूत
प्रत्यक्षभूत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Manifested, become visible.
 E. प्रत्यक्ष and भूत become.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यक्षभोग|प्रत्यक्षभोगः
प्रत्यक्षभोग m. (-गः) Enjoyment or use of any thing with the con-
sciousness of the owner.
 E. प्रत्यक्ष, and भोग enjoyment.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यक्षवादिन्
प्रत्यक्षवादिन् m. (-दी) A Bauddha.
 E. प्रत्यक्ष, and वादिन् who declares;
admitting of no other evidence than actual presence.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यक्षविहित
प्रत्यक्षविहित Adj. Expressly enjoined.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यक्षिन्
प्रत्यक्षिन् mfn. (-क्षी-क्षिणी-क्षि) Seeing, perceiving, conscious of what is
perceptible.
 E. प्रत्यक्ष perceptible, and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यक्षीकरण
प्रत्यक्षीकरण n. (-णं) Making manifest or apparent.
 E. प्रत्यक्ष, करण mak-
ing, च्वि aug.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यक्षीकृत
प्रत्यक्षीकृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Manifested, displayed, made present or
visible.
 E. प्रत्यक्ष and कृत made, च्वि aug.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यक्स्रोतस्
प्रत्यक्स्रोतस् Adj. Flowing towards the west.
	 f. (-तः) An epithet of
Narmadā, the river.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यगक्ष
प्रत्यगक्ष n. (-क्षं) An inner organ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यगात्मन्
प्रत्यगात्मन् m. (-त्मा) The individual soul.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यगाशापति|प्रत्यगाशापतिः
प्रत्यगाशापति m. (-तिः) A name of VARUṆA.
 E. प्रत्यक् west, आशा a quarter,
पति regent or lord.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यगुदच्
प्रत्यगुदच् f. (-दङ्) The north-west.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यग्र|प्रत्यग्रः
प्रत्यग्र mfn. (-ग्रः-ग्रा-ग्रं)
	 1. New, fresh, recent.
	 2. Pre-purified.
	 3. Repea-
ted.
 E. प्रति before, अग्र first.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यग्रता
प्रत्यग्रता f. (-ता) Newness, freshness.
 E. तल् added to प्रत्यग्र; also with
त्व, प्रत्यग्रत्वं ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यग्रथ|प्रत्यग्रथः
प्रत्यग्रथ m. (-थः) A country; also अहिच्छत्र ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यग्रवयस्
प्रत्यग्रवयस् n. (-यः) Youth.
 E. प्रत्यग्र, and वयस् age.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यङ्ग|प्रत्यंग|प्रत्यङ्गं
प्रत्यङ्ग m. (-ङ्गः) An organ of perception.
	 n. Adv. (-ङ्गं) On the body, or
the limbs severally.
	 n. Subst. (-ङ्गं)
	 1. A minor member of the
body, as the chin, nose, ear, &c.
	 2. A subdivision of science, &c.
E. प्रति belonging to, अङ्ग the body.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यङ्गिराः
प्रत्यङ्गिराः f. (-रा) A form of DURGĀ, one of the goddesses of the
Tantrīkas.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यङ्मुख
प्रत्यङ्मुख mfn. (-खः-खी-खं) Facing the west.
 E. प्रत्यञ्च, and मुख face.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यच्
प्रत्यच् or प्रत्यञ्च् mfn. (-प्रत्यङ्-प्रतीची or according to some प्रत्यञ्ची-प्रत्यक्)
1. Behind or subsequent, following in time or place.
	 2. Turned
away.
	 3. West, western.
	 4. Uniform, unmixed.
 E. प्रति before,
अञ्च् to go, aff. क्विप् or विच्; the neuter form is used as a particle:
see प्रत्यक् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यञ्च्|प्रत्यंच्
प्रत्यच् or प्रत्यञ्च् mfn. (-प्रत्यङ्-प्रतीची or according to some प्रत्यञ्ची-प्रत्यक्)
1. Behind or subsequent, following in time or place.
	 2. Turned
away.
	 3. West, western.
	 4. Uniform, unmixed.
 E. प्रति before,
अञ्च् to go, aff. क्विप् or विच्; the neuter form is used as a particle:
see प्रत्यक् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यदन
प्रत्यदन n. (-नं)
	 1. Eating.
	 2. Food.
 E. प्रति before, अदन eating.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यनन्तर|प्रत्यनंतर
प्रत्यनन्तर n. Adv. (-रं) Next in succession.
 E. प्रति, अनन्तर without an
interval.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यनीक|प्रत्यनीकः
प्रत्यनीक m. (-कः) An enemy.
	 n. (-कं) Injuring one who cannot retaliate.
E. प्रति against, अनीक an army.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यन्त|प्रत्यंत|प्रत्यन्तः
प्रत्यन्त mfn. (-न्तः-न्ता-न्त) Bordering, skirting, contiguous.
	 m. (-न्तः) The
country of the Mlecchas or savages.
 E. प्रति about, अन्त the end.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यन्तपर्व्वत|प्रत्यन्तपर्वत|प्रत्यंतपर्वत|प्रत्यन्तपर्व्वतः
प्रत्यन्तपर्व्वत m. (-तः) A small hill near a mountain.
 E. प्रत्यन्त skirting, and
पर्व्वत a mountain.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभिज्ञात
प्रत्यभिज्ञात mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Recognised, known.
 E. प्रति, and अभि before,
ज्ञा to know, aff. क्त ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभिज्ञान|प्रत्यभिज्ञानं
प्रत्यभिज्ञान n. (-नं) Recognition, knowing, recognising.
 E. प्रति and अभि
before, ज्ञा to know, ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभिभूत
प्रत्यभिभूत f. (-ता) Overcome, conquered.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभियुक्त
प्रत्यभियुक्त f. (-क्ता) Accused in return.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभियोग|प्रत्यभियोगः
प्रत्यभियोग m. (-गः) A counter plaint or charge, an accusation brought
against the accuser or plaintiff.
 E. प्रति against, अभियोग accusation.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभिवाद|प्रत्यभिवादः
प्रत्यभिवाद m. (-दः) Returning a salute or obeisance, the benediction
of a teacher.
 E. प्रति (re), अभिवाद salute; also प्रत्यभिवादन ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यय|प्रत्ययः
प्रत्यय m. (-यः)
	 1. Trust, faith, belief, confidence.
	 2. Oath, ordeal.
	 3.
Cause, motive.
	 4. Usage, custom, practice.
	 5. Fame, celebrity.
6. Certainty, ascertainment.
	 7. Knewledge, apprehension.
	 8. A
termination or an affix to roots and words forming derivatives and
inflections, (in Gram.)
	 9. A dependent, a subject, 10. Instrument,
means of agency, a helpmate or associate, applicable either
to persons or things.
	 11. A householder who keeps a sacred fire.
12. Religious contemplation.
	 13. A hole.
 E. प्रति again, against,
to or towards, इण् to go, aff. अच् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्ययकारिणी
प्रत्ययकारिणी f. (-णी) A seal, a signet.
 E. प्रत्यय confidence, and कारिणी causing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्ययित|प्रत्ययितः
प्रत्ययित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Trusted, confidential.
 E. प्रत्यय confidence, and
इतच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्ययिन्
प्रत्ययिन् mfn. (-यी-यिनी-यि) Trusting, believing, having faith in.
 E. प्रत्यय,
and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यर्थ
प्रत्यर्थ n. (-र्थं)
	 1. A reply, an answer, a counter-representation.
	 2. Oppo-
sition, hostility.
	 f. (-र्था) Useful, expedient.
 E. प्रति successive order,
and अर्थ representation.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यर्थक|प्रत्यर्थकः
प्रत्यर्थक m. (-कः) An opponent.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यर्थिन्
प्रत्यर्थिन् mfn. (-र्थी-र्थिनी-र्थि)
	 1. Hostile, inimical.
	 2. Opposing, contra-
dicting, rejecting.
	 m. (-र्थी)
	 1. An enemy.
	 2. (In law,) A defendant.
E. प्रति again, against (re), अर्थ meaning, intention, &c. इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यर्पण|प्रत्यर्पणं
प्रत्यर्पण n. (-णं) The returning of a thing.
 E. प्रति back, अर्पण delivering.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यर्पित|प्रत्यर्पितं
प्रत्यर्पित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Returned, restored, re-delivered.
 E. प्रति again,
अर्पित delivered.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवमर्श|प्रत्यवमर्शः
प्रत्यवमर्श m. (-र्शः)
	 1. Counsel, advice, injunction.
	 2. Profound contem-
plation.
	 3. A counter-conclusion.
 E. प्रति and अव before, मृश् to
advise, घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवमर्ष|प्रत्यवमर्षः
प्रत्यवमर्ष m. (-र्षः) Patience, constant in pursuit or exertion.
 E. प्रति, अव
before, मृष् to bear, aff. घञ् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=485-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवरोधन|प्रत्यवरोधनं
प्रत्यवरोधन n. (-नं) Obstruction, hindrance.
