प्रत्युत्क्रम|प्रत्युत्क्रमः
प्रत्युत्क्रम m. (-मः)
	 1. A subordinate act, or effort tending to a main
object.
	 2. First step or measure in any business.
	 3. Declaration
of war.
	 4. Setting out to assail an enemy.
 E. प्रति and उत् before,
क्रम् to go, aff. अच्; also प्रत्युत्क्रमण and प्रत्युत्क्रान्ति ।
