	 2. To increase.
3. To Spread abroad.
	 4. To appear, to arise. भ्वा० आ० अक० सेट् । r.
10th cl. (प्राथयति-ते)
	 1. To throw or cast.
	 2. To scatter, to spread.
3. To celebrate. ख्यातौ अक० विक्षेपे सक० चुरा० उभ० सेट् घटा ।
