प्रभव|प्रभवः
प्रभव mfn. (-वः-वा-वं)
	 1. Born, produced.
	 2. Superior, powerful.
	 m. (-वः)
	 1.
Generative cause, the basis or root of being or existence.
	 2. The
operative cause, or immediate origin of being, as the father or
mother, &c.
	 3. The place of receiving existence, or where an
object is first perceived, as हिमवान् गङ्गाप्रभवः the Himavāna moun-
tain, (is) the place where Gangā is first seen.
	 4. Birth, production.
5. The basis or origin of water. i. e. “Light.” 6. The name of a
Muni.
	 7. Strength, superiority, power.
	 8. The Creator.
 E. प्र supe-
riority or manifestation, and भव being.
