प्रभा
प्रभा f. (-भा)
	 1. Light, radiance.
	 2. A ray of light.
	 3. The city of
KUVERA.
	 4. One of the wives of the sun.
	 5. A name of DURGĀ.
6. A name of an Apsarā.
 E. प्र exceeding, भा to shine, affs. अङ्
and टाप् ।
