	 1. The sun.
	 2. Fire.
	 3. The moon.
	 4. The ocean.
	 5.
An epithet of Śiva.
	 6. Name of a learned author, the founder of
that school of the Mimānsā philosophy which goes by his name.
E. प्रभा light, and कर what makes. “कुशद्वीपस्थे वर्षभेदेः अष्टममन्वन्तरे च” ।
