eternal.
	 3. A superior, an owner, a proprietor, a master or mistresss,
&c.
	 4. A match for, (with a dat.)
	 m. (-भुः)
	 1. A master, a lord.
2. A name of VIṢṆU.
	 3. Quick silver.
	 4. Sound.
 E. प्र pre-emi-
nent, भू to be, aff. क्विप् and the final vowel made short.
