प्रभृति|प्रभृतिः
प्रभृति f. (-तिः)
	 1. Beginning, commencement, (in this sense the word gene-
rally occurs as the last member of a Bahubrihi compound).
	 2. Man-
ner, kind.
	 3. Etcetera, others, rest, remainder, (in composition;)
as गर्म्मुत्प्रभृतयः तृणं the grass called Germut and other sorts. मुनयः
सोमश्रवः प्रभृतयः the Munis, Somasravas, and the rest; ततः प्रभृति
thence, after. Ind. Beginning with, from, since, (with an abl.)
as “अद्य प्रभृति”.
 E. प्र before, भृ to nourish, aff. क्तिच् ।
