प्रमथित|प्रमथितं
प्रमथित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Well-churned.
	 2. Pained, distressed.
	 3. Tram-
pled down.
	 n. (-तं) Butter-milk without water.
 E. प्र before, मथि to
churn, क्त aff.
