<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमेय
प्रमेय mfn. (-यः-या-यं)
	 1. Proveable, what may or ought to be proved.
	 2.
2. Measurable, finite.
	 n. (-यं)
	 1. The thing to be proved.
	 2. In logic,
the second head, or topic including twelve objects, as the soul,
body, &c. or the form and end of existence.
 E. प्र before, मा to
measure, यत् aff.
