<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमेह|प्रमेहः
प्रमेह m. (-हः) Urinary affection, as change in the colour, quantity, or
consistence of the urine; twenty-one varieties are enumerated,
including diabetes, gonorrhœa, &c.
 E. प्र implying change, मिह् to
pass urine, with घञ् aff.
