<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमोचन|प्रमोचनं
प्रमोचन n. (-नं)
	 1. Liberating, setting free.
	 2. Shedding, emitting.
 E. प्र
before, मुच् to liberate, ल्युट aff.
	 f. (-नी) A sort of cucumber:
see गवाक्षी.
 E. प्र before, मुच् to loose, aff. ल्युट् ।
