<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमोदन|प्रमोदनं|प्रमोदनः
प्रमोदन n. (-नं) Gladdening, making glad.
	 m. (-नः) An epithet of VIṢṆU
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=492-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमोदित|प्रमोदितः
प्रमोदित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Happy, delighted.
	 m. (-तः) A name of KUVERA,
E. प्रमोद happiness, इतच् aff.; or प्र before, मुद् to be happy, क्त aff.
