<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयच्छन्
प्रयच्छन् mfn. (-च्छन्-च्छती-च्छत्) Giving, presenting, bestowing.
 E. प्र be-
fore, दा to give, शतृ aff.
