प्रयात|प्रयातः
प्रयात mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Gone.
	 2. Removed, gone away or to a distance.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=493-a" target="_blank">Page493-a+ 60</a>]
3. Deceased.
	 m. (-तः)
	 1. A name of BHṚGU.
	 2. A sleepy or lazy
fellow.
	 3. An invasion.
	 4. A precipice.
 E. प्र before, यत् to endea-
vour, aff. घञ् ।
