<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयापित
प्रयापित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Driven or sent away, made to go or pass away.
E. प्र before, या to go, causal v., क्त aff.
