<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयास|प्रयासः
प्रयास m. (-सः)
	 1. Trouble, labour, fatigue.
	 2. Desire for or pursuit of
any object.
 E. प्र before, यस् to make exertion, aff. घञ् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=493-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयासभाज्
प्रयासभाज् mfn. (-भाक्) Capable of exertion or fatigue, active, energetic.
E. प्रयास, and भाज् sharing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=493-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयास्यत्
प्रयास्यत् mfn. (-स्यन्-स्यन्ती-स्यत्) Going, about to go or depart.
 E. प्र before,
या to go, शतृ aff. to the fut. tense.
