प्रवृद्ध|प्रवृद्धः
प्रवृद्ध mfn. (-द्धः-द्धा-द्धं)
	 1. Full grown.
	 2. Expanded, diffused, spread
abroad or dispersed.
	 3. Swollen, (as a river.)
	 4. Full, deep, (as a
sigh.)
	 5. Haughty, arrogant.
 E. प्र before, वृद्ध् to increase or grow,
aff. क्त ।
