<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेक|प्रवेकः
प्रवेक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Chief, head, principal.
 E. प्र before, विच् to dis-
tinguish, aff. घञ् ।
