<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेश्य
प्रवेश्य Ind. Having sent in, thrown into, &c.
 E. प्र before, विश् to enter,
causal v., ल्यप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=496-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेश्य
प्रवेश्य mfn. (-श्यः-श्या-श्यं) To be entered, to be pervaded.
