<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशंसितव्य
प्रशंसितव्य mfn. (-व्यः-व्या-व्यं) To be praised, praise-worthy.
 E. प्र before,
शंस् to praise, तव्य aff.
