	 1. Killing, slaughter.
	 2. Pacifying, tranquillising.
	 3.
Quiescence, reposing.
	 4. Soothing, assuaging.
	 5. Ouring, healing.
6. Extinguishing.
	 7. Bestowing fitly.
	 8. Securing, guarding.
	 9.
Cessation, abatement.
 E. प्र before, शम् to pacify, aff. ल्युट् ।
