<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहापण
प्रहापण n. (-णं) Driving away, forced abandonment or departure.
 E. प्र
before, हा to quit, causal v., ल्युट् aff.
