<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहारण|प्रहारणं
प्रहारण n. (-णं) A desirable gift.
 E. प्र before, हृ to take, aff. ल्युट्; also प्रवारण ।
