प्रहारार्त्त mfn. (-र्त्तः-र्त्ता-र्त्तं) Bruised, wounded, hurt by a blow.
	 n. (-र्त्त)
Lasting and acute pain from a wound or maim.
 E. प्रहार striking,
and आर्त्त pained.
