	 2. Ridicule, derision.
	 3. Irony.
	 4.
Blowing, (as a flower).
	 5. Sīva.
	 6. An actor, a dancer.
	 7. A place
of pilgrimage; also सोमतीर्थ.
 E. प्र before, हस् to laugh, aff. घञ् ।
