प्रहित|प्रहितं
प्रहित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Sent, dispatched.
	 2. Appointed, commissioned.
3. Stretched out, extended.
	 4. Placed.
	 5. Discharged as an arrow
from a bow.
	 6. Learned.
	 7. Suitable, appropriate.
	 n. (-तं) Sauce,
gravy, condiment.
 E. प्र before, हित proper.
