प्रह्वीकृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Conquered, won, subjected.
	 2. Bent, bowed.
E. प्रह्व, and कृत made, च्वि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=501-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रा
प्रा r. 2nd cl. (प्राति) To fill. अदा० पर० सक० अनिट् ।
