प्राक्
प्राक् Ind.
	 1. Before, already, prior, preceding, in place or time.
	 2. In
front of.
	 3. As for as, up to.
	 4. Previously.
	 5. East, eastern.
	 6.
Past, gone.
	 7. First.
	 8. Between, amongst, amidst.
	 9. At dawn,
early in the morning. E. See प्राच् ।
