प्राह्णेतन|प्राह्णेतनः
प्राह्णेतन mfn. (-नः-नी-नं) Belonging to the forenoon.
 E. प्राह्णे in the morning, aff. द्यु and तुक् aug.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=505-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राह्णेतमा
प्राह्णेतमा(रा)म् Ind. Early in the day, in the forenoon
 E. प्राह्ले with तमप्
or तरप् aff. and आमु added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=505-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रिय|प्रियः
प्रिय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Beloved, dear, desired.
	 m. (-यः)
	 1. A husband a
lover.
	 2. A sort of drug, commonly Riddhi 3. A sort of deer.
	 f. (-या)
1. A woman.
	 2. A wife or mistress.
	 3. Small cardamoms.
	 4. News,
information.
	 5. Arabian jasmine.
	 6. Spirituous or vinous liquor.
	 7.
A species of the Supratishthā metre.
 E. प्री to please, aff. क, and
the vowel made short.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=505-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियक|प्रियकः
प्रियक m. (-कः)
	 1. A kind of tree, (Nauclea cadamba.)
	 2. A plant, com-
monly Priyangu.
	 3. A tree, (Pentaptera tomentosa.)
	 4. A varie-
gated or spotted deer.
	 5. A bee.
	 6. Saffron.
 E. कन् added to the
preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=505-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियकार
प्रियकार mfn. (-रः-री-रं)
	 1. Kind, favourable, affectionate, doing good
to, or treating kindly.
	 2. Suiting, congenial.
 E. प्रिय, and कृ to do,
अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=505-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियकृत्
प्रियकृत् mfn. (-कृत्त्) Kind, friendly, a friend, a benefactor.
 E. प्रिय, and कृत् who does.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=505-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियङ्कर|प्रियंकर|प्रियङ्करः
प्रियङ्कर mfn. (-रः-री-रं)
	 1. Amiable, exciting or attracting regard.
	 2. Act-
ing kindly or affectionately to.
 E. प्रिय beloved, कृ to make, aff. खच्-
मुम् aug.; also with अण् aff. प्रियकार ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=505-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियङ्करण|प्रियंकरण
प्रियङ्करण mfn. (-णः-णी-णं)
	 1. Acceptable, grateful to.
	 2. Acting kind-
ly to, who or what does so.
	 n. (-णं) Gratifying, treating kindly,
(the act).
 E. प्रिय, कृ to do, ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=505-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियङ्गु|प्रियंगु|प्रियंगुः|प्रियङ्गुः
प्रियङ्गु m. (-ङ्गुः)
	 1. A medicinal plant, and perfume, commonly known
by the name Priyangu, and described in some places as a fra-
grant seed.
	 2. Panick seed, (Panicum italicum.)
	 3. Black mustard
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=506-a" target="_blank">Page506-a+ 60</a>]
seed.
	 4. Long pepper.
	 5. A peculiar tree: see कटुकी.
	 n. (-नं) Saffron.
E. प्रिय desired, गम् to go, aff. डुन् and मुम् aug.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=505-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियतम|प्रियतमः
प्रियतम mfn. (-मः-मा-मं) Dearest, most beloved.
	 m. (-मः) A tree, (Celosia
cristata).
 E. प्रिय desirable, तमप् aff. “मयूरशिखावृक्षे” ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=506-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियतर|प्रियतरः
प्रियतर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Dearer, more dear.
 E. प्रिय, तरप् comparative aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=506-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियता
प्रियता f. (-ता) Love, affection.
 E. प्रिय beloved, तल् aff.; also with त्व aff.
प्रियत्व n. (-त्वं).
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=506-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियदर्शन|प्रियदर्शनः
प्रियदर्शन mfn. (-नः-नी-नं) Handsome, lovely, good-looking.
	 m. (-नः)
	 1. A
parrot.
	 2. A tree, (Mimusops kauki).
 E. प्रिय beloved, and दर्शन
appearance.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=506-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियप्राय|प्रियप्रायं
प्रियप्राय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Eloquent, well-spoken, of pleasing speech.
	 n.
(-यं) Eloquence in language.
 E. प्रिय desired, प्राय abundance.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=506-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियप्रेप्सु|प्रियप्रेप्सुः
प्रियप्रेप्सु mfn. (-प्सुः-प्सुः-प्सु) Lamenting the loss or absence of any beloved
object, wishing or grieving for it.
 E. प्रिय beloved and प्रेप्सु desirous.
