<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियमधु|प्रियमधुः
प्रियमधु m. (-धुः) BALARĀMA, the half-brother of KṚṢṆA
 E. प्रिय fond,
मधु wine.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=506-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियमाण
प्रियमाण mfn. (-णः-णा-णं) Beloved, affectionate.
 E. प्रि to please, शानच् aff.
