<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियसत्य|प्रियसत्यं
प्रियसत्य mfn. (-त्यः-त्या-त्यं) Pleasant and true.
	 n. (-त्यं) Eloquent or pleas-
ing, as well as true, (discourse.)
 E. प्रिय loved, and सत्य true.
