प्रियसन्देश m. (-शः) A tree bearing a fragrant flower, (Michelia cham-
paca.)
 E. प्रिय a friend, and सन्देश intelligence “चम्पकवृक्षे”.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=506-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियाख्य
प्रियाख्य mfn. (-ख्यः-ख्या-ख्यं) Announcing good tidings.
 E. प्रिय, and आख्य who says
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=506-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियाल|प्रियालः
प्रियाल m. (-लः) A tree, commonly Piyāsāl, (Buchanania latifolia, Rox-
BUKGH'S catalogue, but the name is applied to different trees.) E.
प्रि to satisfy, aff. कालन् and the radical vowel changed to रि;
also with कन् added प्रियालक m. (-कः) and with the vowel protract
ed. प्रीयाल m. (-लः) also-as derived from पीय a Sautra root, पीयाल.
or पियाल &c.
