प्रियासु
प्रियासु mfn. (-सुः-सुः-सु) Fond of life.
 E. प्रिय, and असु breath.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=506-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियैषिन्
प्रियैषिन् mfn. (-षी-षिणी-षि) Friendly, affectionate, wishing to please. E.
प्रिय, and एषिन् seeking.
