<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियोदित|प्रियोदितं
प्रियोदित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Well or kindly spoken, pleasingly uttered.
	 n.
(-तं) Kindly or gentle speech.
 E. प्रिय kind, &c. and उदित said.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=506-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्री
प्री (ङ) प्रीङ् r. 4th cl. (प्रीयते) (ञ) प्रीञ् r. 9th cl. (प्रीणाति प्रीणीते) and
1st and 10th cls. (प्रियति-ते प्राययति-ते) or प्रीणयति 1. To please, to
delight, to satisfy.
	 2. To be pleased or satisfied.
	 3. To desire
or love.
