प्रीण|प्रीणः
प्रीण mfn. (-णः-णा-णं)
	 1. Old ancient.
	 2. Pleased, satisfied.
 E. प्री to please, aff. णिच्-क्त ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=506-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीणन|प्रीणनं
प्रीणन n. (-नं) Satisfaction, satisfying, satiety.
 E. प्री to please aff. ल्युट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=506-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीणयित्वा
