<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीत|प्रीतः
प्रीत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Pleased, happy, glad.
	 2. Pleased or satisfied
with.
	 3. Gracicus, kind, affectionate.
	 4. Beloved, dear to.
	 n. (-तं)
Pleasure, delight.
 E. प्री to please, aff. क्त ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=506-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतात्मन्
प्रीतात्मन् mfn. (-त्मा-त्मा-त्म) Pleased, satisfied, content.
 E. प्रीत and आत्मन्
self.
