<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतिद|प्रीतिदः
प्रीतिद mfn. (-दः-दा-दं) Affectionate, inspiring love or regard.
	 m. (-दः) A
