प्रीतिमत् mfn. (-मान्-मती-मत्) Kind, affectionate.
 E. प्रीति and मतुप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=506-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतिमनस
प्रीतिमनस mfn. (-नाः-नाः-नः)
	 1. Content, happy.
	 2. Kind.
 E. प्रीति and
मन्स् the mind.
