	 1. Beautiful to the sight.
	 2. To be seen.
	 3. To be con-
sidered as.
 E. प्र before, ईक्ष् to see, अनीयर् aff. also with कन् added,
प्रेक्षणीयक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) ।
