प्रोष्ठपदा
प्रोष्ठपदा f. (-दा) One of the constellations, the twenty-sixth or twenty-
seventh, containing stars in the wing of Pegasus see भाद्रपदा.
E. प्रोष्ठ here said to mean an ox, and पद a foot.
