प्रो
प्रो(प्रौ)ह mfn. (-हः-हा-हं)
	 1. Skilful, clever.
	 2. Logical, reasoning, a rea-
soner, a disputant.
	 m. (-हः)
	 1. An elephant's foot.
	 2. A joint, a
knot.
	 3. The ancle of an elephant.
 E. प्र before, वह् to bear, or ऊह्
to reason, aff. क ।
