<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रौ
प्रौ(प्रो)ढपाद m. (-दः) One who sits with his feet upon a seat.
 E. प्रौढ raised
and पाद the foot.
