फेनि
फेनि(णि)का f. (-का)
	 1. Froth arising from treacle.
	 2. A kind of sweet-
meat called Patty. “खाजा” ।
 E. फेन foam, कन् added, fem. form.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=512-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
