फेनिल|फेनिलं|फेनिलः
फेनिल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Frothy, foamy.
	 m. (-लः) The soap plant, (Sapin-
dus detergens, Rox.)
	 n. (-लं)
	 1. The fruit of the jujube.
	 2. The
fruit of the Vangueria spinosa.
 E. फेन froth or foam, इलच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=512-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
