बडवाग्नि|बडवाग्निः
बडवाग्नि m. (-ग्निः) Submarine fire: see the next.
 E. बडवा a mare, and अग्नि fire.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=512-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
