बणिज्
बणिज् m. (-णिक्)
	 1. A merchant, a trader.
	 2. The sixth of the astro-
nomical periods called Karanas, corresponding to the half of a
lunar day.
	 f. (-णिक्) Trade, traffic.
 E. पण् to transact business, इजि
Unādi aff. and ब substituted for प; also बणिज ।
