बद
बद r. 1st cl. (बदति) To be steady or firm. r. 1st and 10th cls. (बदति-ते
बादयति-ते)
	 1. To speak.
	 2. To declare or communicate informa-
tion; in these two senses, the root is more commonly and correct-
ly written वद ।
