बदर|बदरं|बदरः
बदर mf. (-रः-री)
	 1. The jujube, (Zizyphus jujuba or scandens.)
	 m. (-रः)
The seed of the cotton pod.
	 f. (-रा-री) Cotton.
	 f. (-रा)
	 1. A plant,
(Mimosa octandra.)
	 2. A medicinal drug, commonly Varāhakrānti.
n. (-रं)
	 1. The fruit of the jujube.
	 2. The berry or pod of the cot-
ton.
 E. बद् to be firm, Unādi aff. अरच्; or if derived from वद् to
give information; it is read by some authorities वदर ।
