<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बलशालिता
बलशालिता f. (-ता) Pride of, or confidence in strength or prowess.
 E. बल-
शालि, and तल् added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=514-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बलशालिन्
बलशालिन् mfn. (-ली-लिनी-लि) Having strength, confident of strength, &c.
E. बल, and शालिन् having.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=514-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बलसूदन|बलसूदनः
बलसूदन m. (-नः) A name of INDRA.
 E. बल the demon, and सूदन destroyer.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=514-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बलस्थिति|बलस्थितिः
बलस्थिति f. (-तिः) A royal residence, a royal camp or quarters.
 E. बल
forces, स्थिति station.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=514-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बलहन्
बलहन् m. (-हा) Phlegm, the phlegmatic humour.
 E. बल strength and हन् destroying.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=514-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बलहीन
बलहीन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Weak, infirm.
 E. बल and हीन void of.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=514-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बलहीनता
बलहीनता f. (-ता) Exhaustion, weakness, prostration of strength, infirm-
ity from fatigue or age, &c.
 E. बलहीन and तल् added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=514-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बलाका
बलाका f. (-का) A sort of crane.
 E. बल strength, अक् to go, aff. अच्; it is
preferably written वलाका.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=514-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बलाञ्चिता|बलांचिता
बलाञ्चिता f. (-ता) A sort of Vina or lute, called also RĀMA'S lute.
