<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बलाट|बलाटः
बलाट m. (-टः) A sort of bean, (Phaseolus mungo.)
 E. बल strength, and
अट what goes or grows. “मुग इति भाषा” ।
