बलात्कार|बलात्कारः
बलात्कार m. (-रः)
	 1. Violence, oppression, exaction.
	 2. (In law.) The de-
tention of the person of a debtor by his creditor, and the violent
measures taken by the latter, (flogging, &c.) to recover his debt.
E. बल strength, अत् to go, aff. क्विप्, बलात्, and कार making, doing.
