<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बलात्मिका
बलात्मिका f. (-का) A sort of sun-flower, (Heliotropium Indicum.)
 E. बल
strength, आत्मन् self, aff. कन्, fem. form.
