<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बलाध्यक्ष|बलाध्यक्षः
बलाध्यक्ष m. (-क्षः) Commander of an army, a general.
 E. बल and अध्यक्ष
superintendent.
