बाध|बाधः
बाध (ऋ) बाधृ r. 1st cl. (बाधते)
	 1. To resist, to oppose.
	 2. To annoy or
afflict.
	 3. To assault.
	 4. To drive.
	 5. To abolish.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=517-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाध|बाधः
बाध m. (-धः)
	 1. Opposing, hindering.
	 2. Annoyance.
	 3. Refutation
arising from incompatibility or contradiction of assigned cause
and effect, (in logic.)
	 4. Danger.
 E. बाध् to oppose, घञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=517-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाधक|बाधकः
बाधक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) What hinders, opposes, pains, &c.
	 f. (-धिका)
	 1.
Tormenting.
	 2. Annulling.
	 3. Vexing.
 E. बाध् and ण्वुल् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=517-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाधन|बाधनं
बाधन n. (-नं)
	 1. Pain.
	 2. Impeding, opposing.
 E. बाध् to oppose, aff. ल्युट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=517-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाधमान
बाधमान mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Painting, annoying.
 E. बाध् to annoy, and
शानच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=517-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाध्यमान
बाध्यमान mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Being harassed or tormented.
 E. बाध् to annoy,
pass. v., शानच् aff.
