बाधित|बाधितः
बाधित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Obstructed, impeded.
	 2. Pained, tormented.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=517-b" target="_blank">Page517-b+ 60</a>]
3. Self-refuted, (in logic.), contradictory, incompatible.
 E. बाध् to
oppose, क्त aff.
