बार्ब्बटीर m. (-रः)
	 1. Tin.
	 2. A shoot of the mango.
	 3. The stone of the
mango fruit.
	 4. The son of an unchaste woman, a bastard.
 E. बर्ब्बटी
a whore, and र aff.
