<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बार्हस्पत|बार्हस्पतं
बार्हस्पत f. (-ती)
	 1. Relating to Brihaspatī.
	 2. Descended from him.
	 3.
Sacred to him.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=517-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
