<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मपद
ब्रह्मपद n. (-दं) The place or nature of spiritual being.
	 2. The station or
rank of a Brahman or of BRAHMĀ.
 E. ब्रह्म, and पद to place.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=520-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
