ब्रह्मपुरी
ब्रह्मपुरी f. (-री) The capital of BRAHMĀ on the mountain Kailasā. E.
ब्रह्मन् and पुरी the city.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=520-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

