<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मभूत
ब्रह्मभूत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Become one with the Supreme spirit.
 E. ब्रह्म
and भूत become.
