<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मभूति|ब्रह्मभूतिः
ब्रह्मभूति f. (-तिः) Twilight.
 E. ब्रह्म BRAHMĀ and भूति being.
