<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मयोनि|ब्रह्मयोनिः
ब्रह्मयोनि m. (-निः) A particular mountain. Adj. Sprung from BRAHMĀ.
