ब्रह्मरात्रि|ब्रह्मरात्रिः
ब्रह्मरात्रि m. (-त्रिः)
	 1. A name of YĀJNYAVALKYA, a saint and legislator.
E. ब्रह्म BRAHMĀ, रा to give, ष्ट्रिन् aff.; conferring the knowledge of
BRAHMĀ upon JANAKA in return for his bounty.
	 2. A night of
BRAHMĀ, equal to a thousand divine ages.
 E. ब्रह्म BRAHMĀ and
रात्रि night.
