<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मरेखा
ब्रह्मरेखा f. (-खा) The lines written by BRAHMĀ on the forehead of a
man indicative of his lot in this world: also ब्रह्मलेखा ।
