ब्रह्मर्षि|ब्रह्मर्षिः
ब्रह्मर्षि m. (-र्षिः) A divine saint, a Ṛṣi of a particular class, including
VĀSISHṬHA, &c.
 E. ब्रह्म a Brāhman, and ऋषि a saint; the saints
of this class are supposed to be of the Brāhminical order.
