ब्रह्मवर्च्चस n. (-सं)
	 1. Holiness, resulting from the study and observance
of the Vedas.
	 2. The sanctity or superhuman power of a Brāh-
man.
 E. ब्रह्म the Velas, and वर्च्चस splendour, aff. अच् ।
