ब्रह्महत्या
ब्रह्महत्या f. (-त्या)
	 1. Brāhminicide, killing a Brāhman.
	 2. Any crime
equally heinous.
 E. ब्रह्म and हत्या killing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=521-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्महन्
ब्रह्महन् m. (-हा) The murderer or slayer of a Brāhman.
 E. ब्रह्मन् and हन्
who kills.
