<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्महुत|ब्रह्महुतं
ब्रह्महुत n. (-तं) The performance of hospitality, &c., that one of the
great sacraments which consists in the veneration of mankind. E.
ब्रह्म a Brāhman हुत worshipped; being the most worthy of res-
pect, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=521-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्माक्षर
ब्रह्माक्षर m. (-रः) The sacred and mysterious name of the deity.
 E. ब्रह्म
GOD, अक्षर a letter, the Omkāra.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=521-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्माग्रभू
ब्रह्माग्रभू m. (-भूः) A horse.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=521-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
