ब्रह्माञ्जलि|ब्रह्मांजलि|ब्रह्माञ्जलिः
ब्रह्माञ्जलि m. (-लिः)
	 1. Joining both hands together, whilst reading the
Vedas, either as an act of humility or to mark the accentuation
of the Sāma-Veda.
	 2. Paying obeisance to the spiritual preceptor
at the beginning or end of a lecture.
 E. ब्रह्म the Vedas and अञ्चलि
the hands joined.
