ब्रह्माणी
ब्रह्माणी f. (-णी)
	 1. The female energy of BRAHMĀ.
	 2. A sort of perfume,
commonly Renukā.
	 3. A kind of brass; “वेङापितल” ।
 E. ब्रह्मन्
BRAHMĀ, fem. aff. ङीप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=521-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

