ब्रह्माण्ड m. (-ण्डः)
	 1. The globe, the world.
	 2. One of the Purānas.
 E. ब्रह्म
BRAHMĀ and अण्ड an egg, to which it is compared; in creation
there are said to have been innumerable Brahmāndas.
