ब्रह्मो
ब्रह्मो f. (-ह्मी)
	 1. A sort of fish, commonly Pāncāl, (Macrognathus Pan-
calus, HAM.)
	 2. A plant, (Siphonanthus Indica.)
 E. वृह् to grow or
increase, affs. मनिन् and ङीप्; also ब्राह्मी.
