	 3. A planet.
	 4. The number
twenty-seven.
	 m. (-भः)
	 1. A name of SUKRA, regent of the planet
VENUS.
	 2. A bee.
	 2. Error, delusion.
	 f. (-भा)
	 1. Light, lustre,
splendour.
	 2. A ray of light.
	 f. (-मी) Fear.
 E. भा to shine, or भी to
fear, aff. ड ।
