भट्ट|भट्टः
भट्ट m. (-ट्टः)
	 1. A philosopher, a learned man, especially one conver-
sant with the philosophical systems.
	 2. An enemy.
	 3. Best excell-
ent.
	 4. Authority.
	 5. A bard in general.
 E. भट-तन् ।
