<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भट्टिनी
भट्टिनी f. (-नी)
	 1. A queen, not crowned.
	 2. The wife of a Brāhman.
In plays the word is often used by maids-in-waiting in addressing
a queen or princess.
 E. भट्ट authority: see etymology of the last
word, इनि and ङीप् affs.
