<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भद्रक|भद्रकं|भद्रकः
भद्रक mfn. (-कः-का-कं)
	 1. Beautiful, pleasing agreeable.
	 2. Respectable,
worthy, estimable.
	 3. Lucky, fortunate.
	 n. (-कं) A sort of grass,
(Cyperus pertenuis.)
	 m. (-कः) A sort of pine, (Pinus Devadāru.) E.
कन् added to the last.
