भर्त्स
भर्त्स r. 10th cl. (भर्त्सयति-ते) To reprove, to reproach, to abuse or menace.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=526-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भर्त्सन|भर्त्सनं
भर्त्सन n. (-नं)
	 1. Threat, menace.
	 2. Reproach, abuse, cursing, re-
viling.
 E. भर्त्स् to abuse, aff. ल्युट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=526-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भर्भ
भर्भ r. 1st cl. (भर्भति) To injure.
