<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भर्म्म|भर्म|भर्मं|भर्म्मं
भर्म्म n. (-र्म्मं)
	 1. Gold.
	 2. Hire, wages.
	 3. The navel.
	 4. A particular
coin.
	 5. Dhūturā.
 E. भृ to nourish, Unādi aff. मन्, whence it is
properly भर्म्मन्, q. v.
