<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भल्
भल् r. 1st and 10th cls. (भलते भालयते)
	 1. To describe, to expound, to
explain.
	 2. To see. r. 1st cl.
	 1. To hurt, to injure.
	 2. To give. r.
10th cl. To throw up.
