भल्लक|भल्लकः
भल्लक m. (-कः) A bear.
 E. कन् added to the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=526-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भल्लपुच्छी
भल्लपुच्छी f. (-च्छी) A plant, (Hedysarum lagopodioides.)
 E. भल्ल a bear,
पुच्छ a tail; to which the flower is compared.
