<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भल्लूक|भल्लूकः
भल्लूक m. (-कः) A bear.
 E. भल्ल् to injure, Unādi aff. ऊक; also भाल्लुक
and भल्लुक ।
