<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भवत्|भवन्त्
भवत् mfn. (-वान्-वती-वत्) Thou; but used as a respectful term of ad-
dress, as Sir or Lord, and governing the verb in the third person.
E. भा to shine, डवतुप् Unādi aff.
	 mfn. (-वन्-वन्ती-वत्)
	 1. Present.
	 2.
Being, existing.
	 f. (-न्ती) A poisoned arrow.
 E. भू to be, participial
aff. शतृ ।
