<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भवन्त|भवंत|भवंतः|भवन्तः
भवन्त m. (-न्तः) Time in general, or time present.
	 f. (-न्ती) A virtuous
wife.
 E. भू to be, Unādi aff. झच् ।
