<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भवितृ
भवितृ mfn. (-ता-त्री-तृ)
	 1. Actually being, or disposed to be.
	 2. Well-be-
ing, wel-faring.
 E. भू to be, तृच् aff.
