<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भविन्
भविन् mfn. (-वी-विनी-वि) Living, being, having life and sensation.
 E. भव being, इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=527-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भविन|भविनः
भविन m. (-नः) A poet, a versifier.
 E. भू to think, इन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=527-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भविल|भविलः
भविल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Being, existing, what is or exists.
	 m. (-लः)
	 1. A
catamite.
	 2. A sensualist.
 E. भू to be, इलच् Unādi aff.
