<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भष|भषः
भष m. (-षः) A dog.
	 f. (-षी) A bitch.
 E. भष् to bark, aff. अच् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=527-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भषक|भषकः
भषक m. (-कः) A dog.
 E. भष् to bark, क्कुन् aff.; it is sometimes written.
भसक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=527-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भषण|भषणं|भषणः
भषण m. (-णः) A dog.
	 n. (-णं) The barking of a dog.
 E. भष् to bark, aff. ल्युट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=527-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भषत्
भषत् n. (-त्)
	 1. The heart.
	 2. Wood.
	 3. The thigh.
