<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भसद
भसद f. (-सद्)
	 1. The sun.
	 2. Pudendum muliebre.
	 3. The mons veneris.
4. Time.
	 5. A sort of duck.
	 6. A float, a raft.
	 7. Flesh.
	 n. (-सत्)
The hinder parts.
 E. भस् to shine, अदि Unādi aff.
