<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भसन्त|भसंत|भसंतः|भसन्तः
भसन्त m. (-न्तः) Time.
 E. भस् to shine, aff. झच् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=527-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भसित|भसितं
भसित n. (-तं) Ashes.
 E. भस् to shine, aff. क्त ।
