<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भस्त्रका
भस्त्रका f. (-का) A bellows.
 E. कन् added to भस्त्रा; also भस्त्रिका and भस्त्रका.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=527-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भस्त्रा
भस्त्रा f. (-स्त्रा) A bellows, a large hide with valves and a clay nozzle,
which is used for this purpose.
 E. भस् to shine, त्रन् Unādi aff.,
fem. aff. टाप्; also with ङीष् aff. भस्त्री and with कन् in the fem.
form being added भस्त्रका or भस्त्रिका optionally; and with the
feminine termination retained also, भस्त्राका.
