<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भस्त्रिक
भस्त्रिक mf. (-कः-की) A bellows-blower, &c.
	 m. (-कः) An inflated skin on
which rafts, &c. are floated.
	 f. (-का) A bellows: see भस्त्र.
 E. भस्त्रन् a
bellows, and ठन् aff.
