<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भस्मक|भस्मकं
भस्मक n. (-कं)
	 1. A disease of the eyes, thickening of the membranes,
and indistinctness of vision.
	 2. Morbid appetite from over-diges-
tion, constant craving for food with general decay.
	 3. An an-
thelmintic plant, commonly Biranga.
	 4. Gold or silver.
 E. भस्मन्
ashes, कन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=527-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भस्मकार|भस्मकारः
भस्मकार m. (-रः) A washerman.
 E. भस्मन् ashes, and कार agent; using
the ashes of wood in place of soap or ley.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=527-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भस्मगन्धिका|भस्मगंधिका
भस्मगन्धिका f. (-का) A perfume, commonly Reṇukā.
 E. भस्मन् ashes, and
गन्ध smell, aff. कन्, and टाप्; also भस्मगन्धिनी ।
