<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भस्मतूल|भस्मतूलं
भस्मतूल n. (-लं)
	 1. A number of villages.
	 2. A shower of dust.
	 3. Frost
or snow.
 E. भस्म ashes, तूल् to weigh, and aff. क ।
