<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भस्मीकरण|भस्मीकरणं
भस्मीकरण n. (-णं)
	 1. Reducing to ashes.
	 2. Calcining.
 E. भस्म, and करण
doing, च्वि aug.
