<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भा
भा f. (भा)
	 1. Light.
	 2. Beauty.
	 3. The shadow of a gnomon.
	 m. (-भाः)
The sun.
 E. भा to shine, affs. अङ् and टाप् ।
