<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाकूट|भाकूटः
भाकूट m. (-टः)
	 1. A mountain, apparently the part of the Himālaya,
called Bhākur.
	 2. A sort of fish. “भेट्की”.
 E. भा light, कूट a peak
or quantity.
