<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाक्त|भाक्तं
भाक्त m. (-क्तः)
	 1. A follower, a dependent, one to whom food is regu-
larly given.
	 2. Grain, edible grain, as rice, &c.
	 f. (-क्ती)
	 1. Fit for
food.
	 2. Inferior, secondary.
	 3. Confined to any science, (as a
term).
	 4. Dependant.
 E. भक्त food, aff. अण् ।
