भाक्तिक|भाक्तिकः
भाक्तिक m. (-कः) One who is fed by another, a dependent, a retainer.
 E. भक्त. food, aff. ठक्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=527-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाक्ष
भाक्ष f. (-क्षी) Gluttonous.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=527-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाग|भागः
भाग m. (-गः)
	 1. A portion, a share, a part.
	 2. Fate, fortune, luck.
	 3.
A half-rupee.
	 4. Part of any thing given as interest.
	 5. A division
of time, the thirtieth part of a Rasi or zodiacal sign.
	 6. A degree,
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=528-a" target="_blank">Page528-a+ 60</a>]
the 360th part of the circumference of a great circle.
	 7. A frac-
tion.
	 8. The quotient, (in math.)
	 9. Place, spot.
	 10. Room.
 E. भज्
to share, aff. घञ् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=527-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागक|भागकः
भागक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Who or what divides.
	 m. (-कः) (In arithmetic.),
A divisor.
 E. भज्, and ण्वुल् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=528-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागजाति|भागजातिः
भागजाति f. (-तिः) Assimilation of fractions.
 E. भाग, and जाति species.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=528-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागण|भागणः
भागण m. (-णः) The whole collection of stars.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=528-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागर्धय
भागर्धय m. (-यः)
	 1. An heir, a co-heir.
	 2. Royal revenue.
	 n. (-यं)
	 1. Fate,
destiny, luck.
	 2. Good-luck.
	 3. Property.
 E. भाग and धेय to be
taken, or धेय aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=528-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागन|भागनं
भागन n. (-नं)
	 1. The period, during which the sun passess through the
twelve signs of the zodiac, thence by ellipsis, the zodiac.
	 2. The
circumference of a great circle.
 E. भाग् to divide, aff. ल्युट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=528-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागलक्षणा
भागलक्षणा f. (-णा) The secondary use of a word in which part of the
primary meaning is retained.
