<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागवत|भागवतं|भागवतः
भागवत f. (-ती) Adj.
	 1. Relating to or worshipping of VIṢṆU or KṚṢṆA.
2. Holy, sacred.
	 m. (-तः) A devotee of the said deity.
	 n. (-तं)
Name of one of the eighteen Purānas.
