<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागशस्
भागशस् Ind. According to a share or portion, in parts or portions. E.
भाग and शसि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=528-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागहर|भागहरः
भागहर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Taking a part, sharing.
	 m. (-रः)
	 1. A co-heir.
	 2.
(In arithmetic,) Division.
 E. भाग and हर who or what takes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=528-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागार्थिन्
भागार्थिन् mfn. (-र्थी-र्थिनी-र्थि) Desirous of a share.
 E. भाग and अर्थिन् who
seeks.
