<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागानुबन्धजाति|भागानुबन्धजातिः
भागानुबन्धजाति f. (-तिः) Assimilation of fractional increase.
 E. भाग, अनुबन्ध
accession, जाति kind.
