	 9. A box, a case, &c.
	 10. A tool.
	 11. The stock of a shop-
keeper, (hence any valued posses sion.)
	 m. (-ण्डः) A tree, (Hibiscus
propulneoides.)
	 m. plu. Mercandise.
 E. भदि to be auspicious,
aff. अच्; or भण् to sound, aff. ड, deriv. irr.; or भण्ड a jester and
