<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भावक|भावकः
भावक m. (-कः) The external expression of amatory sentiments.
	 f. (-का)
Adj.
	 1. Effecting.
	 2. Promoting any one's welfare.
	 3. Imagining.
4. Having a poetical taste.
 E. कन् added to the last.
