<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भावत|भावतः
भावत mfn. (-तः-ती-तं) Yours, your honour's.
 E. भवत् you, and अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=530-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भावत्क|भावत्कः
भावत्क mfn. (-त्कः-त्का-त्कं) Yours, (but used respectfully.) your honour's.
E. भवत् you, and ठक् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=530-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
