[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=530-b" target="_blank">Page530-b+ 60</a>]
feeling.
	 2. A pious or holy man.
	 3. An actor.
	 4. A libidinous man.
5. Dress, decoration.
 E. भाव the sentiment or disposition, अट् to
go with, aff. अण् or अच् ।
