	 1. Occupied with, pervaded by, having as an in-
herent or pervading property.
	 2. Animated, inspired.
	 3. Imagined,
conceived.
	 4. Perfumed, scented.
	 5. Mixed, (with any thing as an
ingredient, as asafœtida or other fragrant substances in curry, &c.)
