भिन्नव्यवकलित
भिन्नव्यवकलित n. (-तं) Subtraction of fractions.
 E. भिन्न, व्यवकलित subtrac-
tion; also भिन्नव्यवकलनं, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=532-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भिन्नसङ्कलित|भिन्नसंकलित
भिन्नसङ्कलित n. (-तं) Addition of fractions.
 E. भिन्न, सङ्कलित addition;
also भिन्नसङ्कलनं, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=532-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भिन्नस्वर
भिन्नस्वर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं)
	 1. Hesitating, (in speech.)
	 2. Hoarse, discordant.
 E. भिन्न, स्वर a note.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=532-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भिया
भिया f. (-या) Fear.
 E. भी to fear, टाप् aff., and इयङ् augment.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=532-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भिल्
भिल् r. 10 cl. (भेलयति-ते) To divide or separate.
