<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भिल्ल्
भिल्ल् m. (-ल्लः) A barbarian of a particular tribe, perhaps the modern
Bheel, a savage race dwelling especially along the course of the
Narmadā, and subsisting chiefly by plunder.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=532-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भिषग्जित|भिषग्जितं
भिषग्जित n. (-तं) A drug, a medicament.
 E. भिषज् a physician, and जित
subdued, (by whom.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=532-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भिषज्
भिषज् m. (-षक्) A Vaidya or physician.
 E. भी to fear, अजि Unādi aff.,
and षुक् augment; or भिषज् a Kanḍwādi root, to overcome,
(disease,) aff. क्विप् ।
