<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भिस्मटा
भिस्मटा f. (-टा) Scorched-rice.
 E. भिस्मा boiled-rice, टीक् to go or re-
semble, ड aff.; this word is variously read भिस्मिटा भिष्मिटा, भिष्मिष्टा,
भिष्मिका ।
