<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भिस्मा
भिस्मा f. (-स्मा) Boiled-rice.
 E. भिद to break, aff. क्विप्, सो to destroy, aff. क,
and the द of भिद् changed irrly. to स; also read भिष्म; see the last.
