भी
भी (ञि) ञिभी r. 3rd cl. (विभेति) To dread, to fear, to be afraid of: also,
r. 1st and 10th cls. (भयति भाययति) but not always admitted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=532-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भी
भी f. (-भीः) Fear, dread.
 E. भी to fear, aff. क्विप् ।
