<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भीत|भीतं
भीत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Afraid, frightened, fearful, timid.
	 2. Imperiled.
n. (-तं) Fear, alarm, apprehension.
 E. भी to fear, aff. क्त ।
