<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भीम|भीमं|भीमः
भीम mfn. (-मः-मा-मं) Horrible, fearful, terrific.
	 n. (-मं) Horror, terror.
m. (-मः)
	 1. A name of ŚIVA.
	 2. One of the five Pāndu princes.
	 3.
A kind of sorrel, (Rumex vesicarius.)
	 f. (-मा)
	 1. A name of DURGĀ.
2. Whip.
	 3. A sort of perfume: see रोचना.
 E. भी to fear, Unādi
aff. मक् ।
