<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भीमरथी
भीमरथी f. (-थी)
	 1. A particular night, supposed to be the ordinary pe-
riod of human life; seventh night, in the seventh month, of the
seventy-seventh year; a person after this period exempt from all
religious or specific observances.
	 2. The name of a river in the
Himālaya mountains.
 E. भीम formidable, रथ a car.
