भीरु|भीरुः
भीरु mfn. (-रुः-रुः or -रुः-रु) Timid, fearful.
	 f. (-रुः-रूः)
	 1. A timid woman.
2. A plant, (Asparagus racemosus.)
	 3. A sort of prickly night-
shade.
	 4. A jackal.
	 5. A centipede.
	 6. A tiger.
	 7. A goat.
	 n. (-रु)
Silver.
 E. भी to fear, Unādi aff. क्रु; also र being changed to
उ, भीलु ।
