भीरुक mfn. (-कः-का-कं)
	 1. Timid, fearful, 2. Formidable.
	 3. Shy.
	 n.
(-कं) A wood, a forest.
	 m. (-कः)
	 1. An owl.
	 2. A bear.
 E. भी to fear,
Unādi aff. क्रुकन्; also ल being substituted for र, भीलुक ।
