भुज्
भुज् r. 7th cl. (भुनक्ति भुंक्ते)
	 1. To save, to cherish or protect.
	 2. To eat.
3. To enjoy, (carnally.)
	 4. To suffer or endure. (ओ, औ) औभुजौ r.
6th. cl. (भुजति) To bend, to make crooked.
