	 1. A sort of gentian, (G. Cherayta.)
	 2. A fragrant grass,
(Andropogon schœnanthus.)
	 3. Another kind of grass.
	 4. A medi-
cinal plant, commonly Kayaphal.
	 5. Ligusticum ajwaen.
	 6.
Camphor.
	 7. Sandal-wood.
 E. भूत being or spirit, &c. aff. ठक्; also
भूतीक ।
