भृतक|भृतकः
भृतक m. (-कः)
	 1. A hired labourer.
	 2. A servant.
 E. भृत hired, कन् added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=536-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भृतकाध्यापक|भृतकाध्यापकः
भृतकाध्यापक m. (-कः) A hired teacher, one who gives instructions for
pay.
 E. भृतक, and अध्यापक a teacher.
