भृतकाध्यापित|भृतकाध्यापितः
भृतकाध्यापित m. (-तः) A student who pays his teacher.
 E. भृतक, and अध्यापित instructed.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=536-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भृतभूति
भृतभूति mfn. (-तिः-तिः-ति)
	 1. Prosperous, powerful, exalted.
	 2. Smeared
with ashes.
 E. भृत possessed, and भूति power, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=536-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भृतरन्ध्र
भृतरन्ध्र mfn. (-न्ध्रः-न्ध्रा-न्ध्रं) Filled up, (as a hole or depression.)
 E. भृत, रन्ध्र a hole.
