<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भृति|भृतिः
भृति f. (-तिः)
	 1. Wages, hire.
	 2. Capital, principal.
	 3. Nourishment,
maintenance.
	 4. Supporting, support.
	 5. Service for wages.
 E. भृ to
nourish, aff. क्तिन् ।
