<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भृत्य|भृत्यः
भृत्य mfn. (-त्यः-त्या-त्य) To be nourished or maintained.
	 m. (-त्यः)
	 1. A
dependent.
	 2. A servant, a slave.
	 3. A minister.
	 f. (-त्या) Hire,
wages.
 E. भृ to nourish, aff. क्यप्, with तुक् augment.
