<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भेकपर्णी
भेकपर्णी f. (-र्णी) A creeper, (Hydrocetyle Asiatica.)
 E. भेक frog, and
पर्ण a leaf; resembling the animal.
