<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भेड|भेडः
भेड m. (-डः)
	 1. A ram, a sheep.
	 2. A raft, a float.
	 3. The name of a
saint.
	 f. (-डी) An ewe.
 E. भिल् a Sautra root, to separate, aff. अच्,
and ल changed to ड; also with कन् added, भेडक ।
