<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भेदित|भेदितः
भेदित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Divided, separated, literally or figuratively. E.
भिद् to break, aff. क्त; also भिन्न.
