भेदिन्
भेदिन् mfn. (-दी-दिनी-दि)
	 1. Who or what divides, &c. Having a dis-
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=537-b" target="_blank">Page537-b+ 60</a>]
tinction or division.
	 m. (-दी) The ratan.
 E. भिद् to divide, घिनुण्
aff. or भेद sort, &c. and इनि aff.
