<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रन्श्
भ्रन्श् r. 1st. cl. (भ्रंशति) To fall; also भ्रंश् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=538-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रम्
भ्रम् (उ) भ्रमु r. 1st cl. (भ्रमति भ्रम्यति) r. 4th cl. (भ्राम्यति)
	 1. To turn round,
to move circularly.
	 2. To be unsteady or unfixed.
	 3. To roam, to
wander; it is also figuratively applicable to mental unsteadiness,
as to err, to wander, to be ignorant or mistaken, &c. With परि,
To wander about. With वि, To play, to wanton. With सम्, 1. To
hurry.
	 2. To honour.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=539-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रम|भ्रमः
भ्रम m. (-मः)
	 1. Whirling, going, round.
	 2. Straying, roaming.
	 3.
Error, ignorance, mistake, misapprehension.
	 4. A whirlpool, an
eddy 5. A drain, a water-course.
	 6. A lathe, a potter's wheel, &c.
E. भ्रम् to go round, aff. घञ् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=539-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रमण|भ्रमणं
भ्रमण n. (-णं)
	 1. Whirling, going round 2. Wandering, literally or
figuratively.
	 3. Erring.
	 4. Giddiness.
	 f. (-णी)
	 1. A leech.
	 2. A
sort of game, performed by women for the amusement of a lover
or husband.
 E. भ्रम् to go round, aff. ल्युट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=539-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रमत्
भ्रमत् mfn. (-मन्-मन्ती-मत्)
	 1. Going round, whirling, revolving.
	 2. Rov-
ing.
	 3. Erring.
 E. भ्रम् to turn round, शतृ aff.
