भ्रामर|भ्रामरं|भ्रामरः
भ्रामर n. (-रं)
	 1. Whirling, going round.
	 2. A dance performed in a
ring round-about.
	 3. A village.
	 4. Epilepsy, 5. A honey.
	 6. A
mode of sexual enjoyment.
	 m. (-रः) A sort of loadstone.
	 f. (-री)
1. A name of PĀRVATĪ from her having assumed the form of
