भ्रास्
भ्रास् r. 1st cl. (भ्रासते, भ्रास्यते) To shine, also म्लास् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=539-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्री
भ्री r. 9th cl. (भ्रीणाति भ्रिणीते)
	 1. To fear.
	 2. To help.
	 3. To cherish, to
maintain or support.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=539-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रुकुंस|भ्रुकुंसः
भ्रुकुंस m. (-सः) An actor in female apparel.
 E. भ्रु for भ्रू an eyebrow,
कुसि or कुशि to shine or speak, aff. अच्; hence also भ्रूकुंस भ्रुकुंश, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=539-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रुकुटि|भ्रुकुटिः
भ्रुकुटि f. (-टिः-टी) A frown.
 E. भ्रु for भ्रू an eyebrow, कुट् to make crook-
ed, इन् aff.: see भ्रूकुटि ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=539-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रुड्
भ्रुड् r. 6th cl. (भ्रुडति)
	 1. To cover.
	 2. To collect.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=539-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रू
भ्रू f. (-भ्रूः) An eyebrow.
 E. भ्रम् to round, Unādi aff. डु ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=539-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रूकुंस|भ्रूकुंसः
भ्रूकुंस m. (-सः) A male actor in female apparel.
 E. भ्रू the eyebrow,
कुसि to speak or shine, aff. अच्; also from कुशि, भ्रूकुंश; this word
is variously written भ्रुकुंश or भ्रुकुंस, भृकुंश or भृकुंस, and भ्रकुंश or
भ्रकुंस ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=539-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रूकुटि|भ्रूकुटिः
भ्रूकुटि f. (-टिः-टी) A frown, a look of displeasure.
 E. भ्रू the brow, कुट् to
be curved, aff. इन् and ङीप् optionally added; it is also written
variously, like the last, and occurs भ्रुकुटि, भृकुटि, or भ्रकुटि.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=539-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रूक्षेप|भ्रूक्षेपः
भ्रूक्षेप m. (-पः) A frown.
 E. भ्रू, and क्षेप throwing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=539-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रूण्
भ्रूण् r. 10th cl. (भ्रूणयते)
	 1. To hope, to trust.
	 2. To confide, to be with-
out doubt.
	 3. To wish for, to desire.
	 4. To fear.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=539-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रूण|भ्रूणः
भ्रूण m. (-णः)
	 1. The embryo or fœtus.
	 2. A child.
 E. भ्रूण to hope, to
fear, aff. घञ् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=540-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रूणघ्न
भ्रूणघ्न mfn. (-घ्नः-घ्नी-घ्नं) Producing or causing abortion, who or what
does so.
 E. भ्रूण, and घ्न what destroys.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=540-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रूणहत्या
भ्रूणहत्या f. (-त्या)
	 1. Murder of the fœtus, procuring or causing abor-
tion.
	 2. Any sin equally heinous.
 E. भ्रूण, and हत्या killing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=540-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रूणहन्
भ्रूणहन् mf. (-हा-घ्नी)
	 1. One who occasions or procures abortion.
	 2.
The murderer of a Brāhman.
 E. भ्रूण the embryo, (or any thing
of which the death is equally heinous.) and हन् who kills.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=540-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रूभङ्ग|भ्रूभंग|भ्रूभङ्गः
भ्रूभङ्ग m. (-ङ्गः) A frown.
 E. भ्रू the brow, भङ्ग a breaking, bending.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=540-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रूविलास|भ्रूविलासः
भ्रूविलास m. (-सः) Playful motion of the eyebrows.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=540-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रेज्
भ्रेज् (ऋ) भ्रेजृ r. 1st cl. (भ्रेजते) To shine.
