<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रेश्
भ्रेश् (ऋ) भ्रेशृ r. 1st cl. (भ्रेशति-ते)
	 1. To go.
	 2. To fall.
	 3. To be angry.
	 4. To fear.
