भ्रेष्
भ्रेष् (ऋ) भ्रेषृ r. 1st cl. (-भ्रेषति-ते) To go, to move, to fear: see भ्रेश् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=540-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रेष|भ्रेषः
भ्रेष m. (-षः)
	 1. Deviation from rectitude, declining or falling from
virtue, &c.
	 2. Going, proceeding.
	 3. Loss.
 E. भ्रेष् to go, aff. घञ् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=540-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रेषण|भ्रेषणं
भ्रेषण n. (-णं) Going, moving.
 E. भ्रेष् to go, aff. ल्युट् ।
