<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्लक्ष्
भ्लक्ष् r. 1st cl. (भ्लक्षति-ते) To eat.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=540-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्लाश्
भ्लाश् (टृ, ऋ) टुम्लाशृ r. 1st cl. (भ्लाश्यते भ्लाशते) To shine; sometimes भ्लास्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=540-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्लेष्
भ्लेष् (ऋ) म्लेषृ r. 1st cl. (भ्लेषति-ते)
