म|मः
म The twenty-fifth consonant of the Nāgari alphabet, corresponding
to the letter M.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=540-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

म|मः
म m. (-मः)
	 1. A name of BRAHMĀ.
	 2. ŚIVA.
	 3. VIṢṆU.
	 4. YAMA.
	 5.
Time, season.
	 6. Poison, venom.
	 7. A magical or mystical verse
or formula.
	 8. The moon.
	 9. The abbreviated name of the fourth
note of the gamut.
	 f. (मा)
	 1. A name of LAKṢMĪ.
	 2. A mother.
3. Measure.
	 4. Light, lustre.
	 5. Knowledge.
	 6. Binding, tying.
	 7.
Death.
	 8. A woman's waist.
	 n. (-मं)
	 1. Good-fortune, auspicious-
ness.
	 2. Water.
 E. मा to measure, क aff.; or मन् to worship, &c.,
aff. ड.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=540-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मक्
मक् (इ) मकि r. 1st cl. (मङ्कते)
	 1. To decorate, to grace or adorn.
	 2. To go, to move.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=540-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मकर|मकरः
मकर m. (-रः)
	 1. A marine monster, confounded usually with the
crocodile and shark, but properly a fabulous animal: as a fish it
might be conjectured to be the horned-shark, or the unicorn fish;
but it is often drawn, as it in the pictured sign Capricornus of the
zodiac, with the head and forelegs of an antelope, and the body
and tail of a fish: it is the emblem of the god of love.
	 2. One of
the signs of zodiac, corresponding with the above, and like
the Greek representation of that sign, being an animal in
the foreparts, and ending in the tail of a fish. One of the nine
treasures of KUVERA.
	 3. A particular array of troops, in the form
of a Makara.
	 4. An ear-ring in that shape.
 E. म for मुख the mouth,
कृ to scatter, aff. अच्; or माङ् prohibitive aff., कृ to do, अच् aff.,
form irr.; grammarians however, sometimes consider this word
as a primitive.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=540-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मकरकेतन|मकरकेतनः
मकरकेतन m. (-नः) KĀMA, the Hindu CUPID.
 E. मकर, a marine monster
and केतन emblem; being painted on KĀMA'S banner.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=540-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मकरकेतु|मकरकेतुः
मकरकेतु m. (-तुः) KĀMA: see the preceding.
 E. मकर, and केतु an emblem.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=540-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मकरध्वज|मकरध्वजः
मकरध्वज m. (-जः)
	 1. KĀMA: see the two last.
	 2. A particular array of
troops.
	 3. A particular medical preparation.
 E. मकर Makara, and
ध्वज emblem.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=540-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मकरन्द|मकरंदः|मकरन्दः
मकरन्द m. (-न्दः)
	 1. The nectar or honey of a flower.
	 2. The Kokila
or Indian cuckoo.
	 3. A bee.
	 4. A fragrant kind of mango.
	 5. A
kind of jasmine, (Jasminum pubescens.)
	 6. The filament of a lotus.
E. मकर the emblem of KĀMA, and दो to destroy, i. e. to surpass,
as an incentive to love, aff. क, form irr.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=540-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मकरन्दवती
मकरन्दवती f. (-ती) The trumpet flower, (Bignonia suave-olens.) E.
मकरन्द honey, and मतुप् aff., fem. form. “पाटला वृक्षे” ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=540-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मकरसप्तमी
मकरसप्तमी f. (-मी) The seventh day in the first half of the month
māgha.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=540-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मकराकर|मकराकरः
मकराकर m. (-रः) The ocean.
 E. मकर a marine monster, and आकर receptacle.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=540-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मकराकार|मकराकारः
मकराकार m. (-रः) A plant, said to be a species of Karañja or Cæsal-
pinia.
 E. मकर a fish, आकार form. “कांँटा करम्जा” ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=540-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मकराङ्क|मकरांक|मकराङ्कः
मकराङ्क m. (-ङ्कः)
	 1. KĀMADEVA.
	 2. The ocean.
 E. मकर a marine mons-
ter. and अङ्क mark, emblem.
