<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मकरालय|मकरालयः
मकरालय m. (-यः) The ocean.
 E. मकर a sort of fish, and आलय abode.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=540-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मकराश्व|मकराश्वः
मकराश्व m. (-श्वः) VARUṆA.
 E. मकर a marine monster, and अश्व a horse;
