<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मकरिन्
मकरिन् m. (-री) The ocean.
 E. मकर a marine monster, and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=540-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मकुट|मकुटं
मकुट n. (-टं) A crest, a head-dress, a crown, a tiara.
 E. मकि to adorn,
aff. उट form irr.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=540-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मकुति|मकुतिः
मकुति f. (-तिः) An edict or order of the government, addressed to the
