<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्कुर|मंकुर|मंकुरः|मङ्कुरः
मङ्कुर m. (-रः) A mirror.
 E. मकि to adorn, उरच् aff., and the nasal re-
tained; also मकुर and मुकुर ।
