मङ्क्षण|मंक्षण|मंक्षणं|मङ्क्षणं
मङ्क्षण n. (-णं) Cuisses or greaves, armour for the thighs or legs.
 E. मङ्क्ष-
ल्युट् aff.; it is sometimes read मङ्क्षुण ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=541-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
