मङ्क्षु|मंक्षु
मङ्क्षु Ind.
	 1. Quickly, Swiftly, instantly.
	 2. Much, exceedingly.
 E. मस्ज्
to purify, सु aff., and नुम् augment; also मङ्खु.
 E. मखि-उन् ।
