<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलपाठक|मंगलपाठक|मङ्गलपाठकः
मङ्गलपाठक m. (-कः) A bard, an encomiast.
 E. मङ्गल good fortune, and पाठक who reads or recites.
