<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलप्रतिसर|मंगलप्रतिसर|मङ्गलप्रतिसरः
मङ्गलप्रतिसर m. (-रः)
	 1. An auspicious string worn by married women
round the neck.
	 2. The cord of an amulet.
