मङ्गलाष्टक|मंगलाष्टक
मङ्गलाष्टक n. (-कं) A benedictory stanza repeated by priests for good
luck on the bride and bridegroom at the time of wedding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=541-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
