मच्
मच् also (इ) मचि r. 1st cl. (मचते मञ्चते)
	 1. To be vain or proud.
	 2. To
be wicked.
	 3. To speak.
	 4. To pound or grind. मचि r. 1st cl. (मञ्चते)
1. To hold or have.
	 2. To be high or tall.
	 3. To revere, to adore,
to worship.
