<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डहारक|मण्डहारकः
मण्डहारक m. (-कः) A distiller of spirits.
 E. मण्ड froth, ferment, and हृ
to take, aff. अण्, and कन् added.
