मतल्लिका
मतल्लिका f. (-का) Excellence, happiness: (also attributively, but un-
varying in gender,) excellent, best, happiest; It is used at the
end of a compound only and there is no etymon of this word,
according to the best authorities; Vāchaspatya defined it thus:
सतिमलति भूषयति ण्वुल्-पृषो० ।
