probably the Saphari, or fish in which VIṢṆU was incarnate in
his Matsya Avatār.
	 2. A name of VIṢṆU, from his incarnation as
a fish.
	 3. A country, enumerated amongst the midland divisions
of India, (Diṇajpur and Rangpur.)
	 4. One of the Purānas.
 E. मदि
to be pleased, Unādi aff. स्यत् ।
