मत्स्यगन्ध
मत्स्यगन्ध f. (-न्धा)
	 1. A plant, commonly Lāngaliya; (the common name
is applied to the Nama zeylanica, and the commelina salicifolia.)
2. Satyavatī, the mother of the sacred poet VYĀSA: see मत्स्योदरी.
E. मत्स्य a fish, and गन्ध smell.
