मत्स्यण्डी|मत्स्यंडी
मत्स्यण्डी f. (-ण्डी) Coarse or unrefined sugar, the juice of the sugar-cane,
either after its first boiling, or after it is partially freed from im-
purities by straining.
 E. मन्द slowly, स्यन्द् to trickle or ooze, अण्
aff., fem. aff. ङीप्, deriv. irr.; also with कन् added, मत्स्यण्डिका ।
