मथ
मथ (ए) मथे r. 1st cl. (मथति)
	 1. The churn.
	 2. To stir or agitate. (इ) मथि
(मन्थति) 1. To hurt or kill.
	 2. To afflict.
	 3. To suffer pain.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
