मथित|मथितं
मथित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Stirred, churned.
	 2. Agitated, (mentally,) dis-
tressed, anxious.
	 3. Crushed, pinched.
	 4. Dislocated.
	 n. (-तं)
Butter-milk, without any watery admixture.
 E. मथ् to churn,
aff. क्त ।
