मद|मदः
मद m. (-दः)
	 1. Joy, pleasure, delight.
	 2. The juice that flows from an
elephant's temples when in rut.
	 3. Spirituous or vinous liquor.
4. Inebriety, intoxication.
	 5. Pride, arrogance.
	 6. Insanity, mad-
ness.
	 7. Semen virile.
	 8. Musk.
	 9. A male river.
	 10. Ardent
passion, desire.
	 11. Love.
	 12. Delight.
	 13. Arrogance.
	 14. Honey.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=545-b" target="_blank">Page545-b+ 60</a>]
15. Any beautiful object.
	 f. (-दी)
	 1. A drinking vessel.
	 2. An
instrument for making furrows.
 E. मद् to be pleased, &c. aff. अच् ।
