sweet lime.
	 6. Marrow.
	 7. The city Mathurā.
	 8. A Medicinal
plant, commonly Kakkoli.
	 9. Asparagus racemosus.
	 10. Bengal
beet.
 E. मधु honey, and रा to get or be, aff. क; to have the
flavour of honey, to be as sweet.
