मध्यदेश|मध्यदेशः
मध्यदेश m. (-शः)
	 1. The middle region; part of India, bounded by Ku-
ruksketra on the north, Allāhābād on the south, the Himālaya
mountains on the east, and the Vindhya mountains on the west;
comprising therefore the modern provinces of Allāhābād, Agrā,
Delhi, Oudh, &c.; the northern limit is elsewhere defined to
be the disappearance of the Saraswatī.
	 2. The middle part of
any thing.
	 3. The waist.
	 4. The Belly.
	 5. The meridian.
 E. मध्य
middle, and देश country.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=548-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

