	 9. Passion, wrath.
	 10. A deer.
11. A fort, a strong-hold.
	 12. The mountain Mandara.
	 13. The
hair of the head.
	 n. (-रं) Safflower.
	 f. (-रा) Name of the favourite
female slave of KAIKEYĪ. the favourite wife of DAŚARATHA. E.
मन्थ् to agitate, &c. aff. अरच् ।
