<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मन्यमान
मन्यमान mfn. (-नः-ना-नं)
	 1. Thinking, considering.
	 2. Respecting, atten-
ding to.
	 3. Praising.
 E. मन् to mind, शानच् aff.
