<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मपष्ट|मपष्टः
मपष्ट m. (-ष्टः) A sort of bean, (Phaseolus mungo;) also मपष्टक, and मपुष्टक ।
