ममतायुक्त mfn. (-क्तः-क्ता-क्तं) Selfish.
	 m. (-क्तः) A miser, a niggard.
 E. ममता
selfishness, and युक्त affected.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=552-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मसापताल
मसापताल m. (-लः) An object of sense.
 E. मव्य to bind, आलन् Unādi aff.,
व rejected, and म substituted for व, and आपतुद् augment.
