<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मय|मयः
मय m. (-यः)
	 1. A camel.
	 2. A mule.
	 3. A demon, and the carpenter
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=552-b" target="_blank">Page552-b+ 60</a>]
or architect of the DAITYAS.
	 4. Hurting, injuring.
	 f. (-या) Adminis-
tering remedies, the practice of physic.
	 f. (-यी) Used as and
affix in the sense of “consisting of” “Made of” Full of.
 E. मय्
to go, or मि to scatter, or मी to hurt, affs. अच or खल् and टाप् ।
