<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मयु|मयुः
मयु m. (-युः)
	 1. A KINNARA or chorister of Svarga, 2. A deer.
 E. मि to
scatter, (sweet sounds, &c.) Unādi aff. उ ।
