	 1. Light, lustre, brightness.
	 2. A ray of light.
	 3.
Flame.
	 4. Beauty.
	 5. The pin or gnomon of a sun-dial.
 E. मा to
measure, (time, &c.,) ऊख Unādi aff., मय substituted for the root.
