3. A plant, (Achyranthes aspera.)
	 f. (-री)
	 1. A pea-hen.
	 2. A
potherb, (Basella rubra, &c.)
 E. मि to scatter, Unādi aff. ऊरन्; or
मही the earth in the seventh case, मह्यां, रु to cry, ड aff. and the
formation irr.
