मर्य्यादा|मर्यादा
मर्य्यादा f. (-दा)
	 1. Continance in the right way, propriety of conduct,
steadiness, rectitude.
	 2. A boundary, a limit.
	 3. An agreement.
4. A bank, a shore.
 E. मर्य्या limitative, आदा to have or take, affs.
अङ् and टाप्; or परि about, round, prefixed to आदा, अङ् aff. and
म substituted for प ।
