मसूर|मसूरः
मसूर mf. (-रः-रा) A sort of pulse or lentil, (Ervum hirsutum, and
Cicer lens.)
	 f. (-रा)
	 1. A whore.
	 2. A lentil.
	 f. (-री)
	 1. Small pox.
2. A small round pillow.
 E. मस् to weigh, Unādi aff. ऊरच्, मसूर,
the pulse; the other meanings refer to this, implying resem-
blance to the pea in figure, &c.
