महाकाव्य n. (-व्यं) A regular and classical poem.
 E. महा great, and काव्य
a poem; the title is applied especially to five works; the Kumāra
Sambhava, and Raghu Vaṃśa of KALIDĀSA; the Kirātārjuniya
of BHĀRABĪ; the Naisadha of SRIHARSHA, and the Sisupāla
Badham of MĀGHA.
