महापक्ष|महापक्षः
महापक्ष m. (-क्षः)
	 1. A sort of duck.
	 2. An epithet of GARUḌA.
	 f. (-क्षी)
An owl.
 E. महा large, and पक्ष a side, a wing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=557-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
