महापथगम|महापथगमः
महापथगम m. (-मः) Dying.
 E. महापथ the great way, (by which all mortals travel,) गम going.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=557-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापद्म|महापद्मः
महापद्म m. (-द्मः)
	 1. One of the principal Nāgas or serpents of Pātāla.
2. One of KUVERA'S Nidhis or treasures.
	 3. A large number, one
hundred thousand millions.
	 4. A Kinnara or attendant on KUVE-
RA.
	 n. (-द्मं) The large white lotus.
 E. महा great, and पद्म a lotus.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=557-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापातक|महापातकं
महापातक n. (-कं)
	 1. A crime of the highest degree, as killing a Brāh-
mana, stealing gold from a priest, drinking spirits, adultery with
the wife of a spiritual teacher, and associating with persons who
have committed these offences.
	 2. Great crime in general.
 E. महा
great, पातक offence: see पञ्चमहापातक ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=557-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापातकिन्
महापातकिन् m. (-की) An offender in the highest degree: see the last.
E. महापातक great sin, and इनि aff.
