<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापाप|महापापं
महापाप n. (-पं)
	 1. A sin of the highest kind. see महापातक.
	 2. Heinous
crime, or sin in general.
 E. महा excessive, and पाप sin.
