<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महायक्ष|महायक्षः
महायक्ष m. (-क्षः) A sort of demi-god, supposed to attend the Jinas or
Jaina saints.
 E. महा great, and यक्ष a divine being, attending
usually on KUVERA.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=558-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महायज्ञ|महायज्ञः
महायज्ञ m. (-ज्ञः) An essential sacrifice, a sacrament of the Hindu
religion; five acts are enumerated of this description, severally
considered as due to the Vedas, to the gods, to man, to the manes,
and to all created beings; they are respectively, study of scrip-
ture, offering of sacrifice to the gods, hospitable treatment of
guests, libation of water, &c. to deceased progenitors, and the
casting of food on the ground or in water as an offering to the
gods, to spirits, &c.
 E. महा great, यज्ञ sacrifice or act of wor-
ship.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=558-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महायन्त्र
