महिला
महिला f. (-ला)
	 1. A woman, a female.
	 2. A woman literally or figura-
tively intoxicated.
	 3. A plant bearing a fragrant seed, commonly
Priyangu.
	 4. A perfume commonly Reṇukā.
 E. मह् to worship or
be worshipped, Unādi aff. इलच्; also महला and महेला ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=560-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महिलाह्वया
महिलाह्वया f. (-या) A plant, commonly Priyangu.
 E. महिला a woman,
and आह्वय appellation.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=560-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महिष|महिषः
महिष m. (-षः)
	 1. A buffalo.
	 2. The emblem of one of the Jaina saints.
3. The emblem and vehicle of YAMA.
	 4. The name of an Asura
or demon slain by DURGĀ.
	 f. (-षी)
	 1. A female buffalo.
	 2. The
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=560-b" target="_blank">Page560-b+ 60</a>]
wife of a king, but especially the one who has been consecrated or
crowned, a queen.
	 3. A drug.
 E. मह् to worship or be worshipped,
Unādi aff. टिषच्, fem. aff. ङीष् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=560-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महिषध्वज|महिषध्वजः
महिषध्वज m. (-जः) YAMA, the sovereign of hell, and judge of the dead.
E. महिष a buffalo, and ध्वज emblem.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=560-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

