मा
मा Ind.
	 1. A prohibitive and negative particle.
	 2. A particle imply-
ing doubt.
 E. मा to measure, aff. क्किप्; this particle is chiefly
prefixed to verbs, in the imperative mood, as माकुरु do not do,
(any act.) &c.; it is also read sometimes, माङ् the final being
redundant.
