माणवक|माणवकः
माणवक m. (-कः)
	 1. A child, a boy not exceeding sixteen years of age,
a manikin.
	 2. A pupil, a scholar, a religious student.
	 3. A man,
an ignorant or ridiculous man, a childish man.
	 4. A necklace of
sixteen or twenty strings.
	 5. A species of the Anushtubh me-
tre.
 E. कन् added to the last.
