मातुलुङ्गक|मातुलुङ्गकः
मातुलुङ्गक m. (-कः) Common citron, (Citrus medica.)
 E. मा prohibitive
prefix, तुला a balance, गम् to go, खच् aff.; with the power of डित्,
and कन् added, not sold by weight; also without the additional
prefix, मतुलुङ्ग ।
