मान्धातृ|मांधातृ
मान्धातृ m. (-ता) A king fostered by INDRA.
 E. मां me, धातृ drinker;
from धे to drink; having on one occasion sucked Amrita from the
finger of INDRA, who then used the exclamation which afterwards
was the name of the prince.
