<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मापन|मापनं|मापनः
मापन m. (-नः) A balance, a pair of scales.
	 n. (-नं)
	 1. Measure, measur-
ing.
	 2. Making, forming,
 E. मा to measure, causal form, aff. ल्युट् ।
