मार्ग्
मार्ग् r. 1st and 10th cls. (मार्गति मार्गयति-ते)
	 1. To make or prepare.
	 2.
To go.
	 3. To prepare the way, to make a road.
	 4. To feather an
arrow.
	 5. To beg.
	 6. To ask in marriage. (मार्गयति-ते)
	 1. To seek.
2. To go.
	 3. To adorn.
