माल|मालं|मालः
माल n. (-लं)
	 1. A field.
	 2. Rising round.
	 3. Fraud, deceit.
	 m. (-लः)
1. A man.
	 2. A mountain, a barbarian, one of a particular
tribe.
	 3. A country, lying west and south-west of Bengal:
Ramghur, &c., or according to WILFORD, Mālbhūm in Midnā-
pur.
