	 1. A line, a row.
	 2. A gar
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=566-a" target="_blank">Page566-a+ 60</a>]
land, a string or wreath of flowers.
	 3. A chaplet of flowers.
	 4.
A string of beads, a rosary.
	 5. (In rhetorical or poetical descrip-
tion,) a series or string of epithets, smiles, &c.
 E. मा fortune, ला to
get or be, affs. अङ् and टाप्; or मा to measure, Unādi aff. र, and
र changed to ल; or मल-संज्ञायां कर्त्तरि घञ् ।
