मालती
मालती f. (-ती)
	 1. Great-flowered jasmine, (Jasminum grandiflorum.)
	 2.
A bud, a blossom.
	 3. A young woman.
	 4. Moon-light.
	 5. Night.
	 6.
A particular river.
	 7. A flower, (Bignonia suave olens.)
	 8. A
shrub, (Echites caryophyllata.)
