माहात्मिक
माहात्मिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं)
	 1. Glorious, majestic.
	 2. Magnanimous.
	 3.
Of great sanctity or honour.
 E. महात्मन्, and ठक् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=567-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
