माहात्म्य|माहात्म्यं
माहात्म्य n. (-त्म्यं)
	 1. Majesty, greatness, might.
	 2. The peculiar efficacy
or virtue of any divinity or sacred shrine, &c.
	 3. A work, giving
an account of the merits of any holy place or object.
 E. महात्मन्
great, ष्यञ् aff.
