मित|मितः
मित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Measured.
	 2. Moderate, limited, few or little.
3. Known, understood.
	 4. Examined.
	 5. Scattered, sprinkled. E.
मा to mete, or मि to scatter, aff. क्त, form irr.
