मित्र|मित्त्रं|मित्रं|मित्रः
मित्र n. (-त्रं)
	 1. A friend.
	 2. An ally; in this form it is always neuter;
but it is convertible into an attributive, and is then of three
genders, (मित्रः-मित्रा-मित्रं) Friendly, a friend.
	 m. (-त्रः)
	 1. The sun.
2. The name of a Vedic deity.
	 f. (-त्रा) One of the wives of DASA-
RAṬHA, the mother of SATRUGHNA.
 E. मिद् to be affectionate, aff.
क्त; hence more properly मित्त्र ।
