मिश्र|मिश्रं|मिश्रः
मिश्र mfn. (-श्रः-श्रा-श्रं) Mixed, mingled, blended.
	 n. (-श्रं) Mixing, mix-
ture.
	 m. (-श्रः)
	 1. An elephant, the fourth of the four classes in
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=568-b" target="_blank">Page568-b+ 60</a>]
which elephants are arranged.
	 2. A respectable person; in which
sense it is a common affix to proper names; or compounded with
आर्य्य, as आर्य्यमिश्राः &c.
 E. मिश्र् to mix, aff. अच् ।
