<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुख|मुखं|मुखः
मुख mfn. (-खः-खा-खं)
	 1. First, initial.
	 2. Chief, pre-eminent, principal.
n. (-खं)
	 1. The mouth.
	 2. The face.
	 3. The entrance to a house.
4. Commencement.
	 5. A means, an expedient.
	 6. Sound.
	 7. The
opening division of a drama, the first act, &c.
	 8. The previous
or preparatory incidents of a drama.
	 9. A direction, a quarter.
10. Opening, entrance.
	 11. The head, the top, the tip.
	 12. The
edge of any sharp instrument.
	 13. Utterance.
	 14. Source, cause,
occasion.
	 15. The Vedas, scripture.
	 m. (-खः) The beak of a bird.
E. खन् to dig, Unādi aff. अच् with the power of ड, by which the
final is rejected, मुट initial augment.
