मुसल|मुसलं|मुसलः
मुसल n. (-लं)
	 1. A pestle, a wooden pestle used for cleaning rice.
	 2. A
club.
	 f. (-ली)
	 1. A plant, (Curculigo orchioides.)
	 2. A house-
lizard.
 E. मुस् to break, aff. कलच्; it is also read with its com-
pounds and derivatives मुषल, मुषली, and sometimes मुशल, &c.
