मूर्च्छन
मूर्च्छन nf. (-नं-नी)
	 1. Fainting syncope, swooning, meeting.
	 2. Vehe-
mence growth, increase.
	 3. Causing insensibility, (applied to one of
the five arrows of KĀMA.)
	 4. Calcining quicksilver with sulphur,
&c.
	 f. (-ना)
	 1. The rise and fall of sounds in music.
	 2. Modula-
tion, melody.
 E. मूर्च्छ् to faint, to become insensible, aff. ल्युट्.
