मूर्च्छा
मूर्च्छा f. (-र्च्छा)
	 1. Fainting, loss of consciousness or sense.
	 2. Delusion.
3. A particular process in calcining metals.
 E. मूर्च्छा to be faint,
affs. अङ् and टाप्.
