मूच्छित
मूच्छित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Fainting, fainted, insensible.
	 2. Stupid, igno-
rant.
	 3. Tall, lofty.
	 4. Grown, increased, augmented.
	 5. Intensi-
fied.
	 6. Filled with.
	 7. Calcined.
 E. मूर्च्छ् to be faint, to grow or
increase, &c., aff. क्त; or मूर्च्छा as above, इतच् aff.
