मूर्त्ति f. (-र्त्तिः)
	 1. Matter, substance, solidity.
	 2. The body.
	 3. Figure,
form, body in general, or any definite shape or image.
	 4. Manifes-
tation.
	 5. Beauty.
	 6. Hardness.
 E. मूर्च्छ् to faint, to become insen-
sible, aff. क्तिन्, form irr.
