 E. मैत्रेय, कन् added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=579-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैत्रेयिका
मैत्रेयिका f. (-का) The contest of friends or allies.
 E. मैत्रेय relating to
friends, वुञ् aff. of animosity.
