	 1. Final and eternal happiness, the liberation of the soul
from the body, and its exemption from further transmigration.
2. Death.
	 3. Libertion, freedom.
	 4. Loosening, untying.
	 5. End of
an eclipse.
	 6. Scattering.
	 7. Shooting.
	 8. A plant commonly
Ghaṇtāpārali.
	 9. Acquittance of an obligation, as by a son
to his father.
 E. मोक्ष् to let loose or free, aff. अच्.
