<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मोहन|मोहनं|मोहनः
मोहन mfn. (-नः-ना or -नी-नं) Fascinating, stupefying, depriving of
sense or understanding.
	 n. (-नं)
	 1. Copulation.
	 2. One of the
arrows of KĀMADEVA.
	 3. Temptation, seduction, the overpower-
ing of reason and reflection by worldly or sensual allurements.
4. A charm employed to bewilder an enemy.
	 m. (-नः) The thorn-
apple, (Dhuturā.)
	 f. (-ना)
	 1. A sort of grass, (Trigonella cornicu-
lata.)
	 2. A kind of jasmine, commonly the Tripura or Tipperāh
jasmine.
 E. मुह् to be foolish, causal form, aff. युच् or ल्युट् ।
