म्लेड्
म्लेड् (ऋ) म्लेडृ r. 1st. cl. (म्लेडति) To be mad.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=581-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

म्लेव्
म्लेव् (ऋ,) म्लेवृ r. 1st cl. (म्लेवते) To serve, to gratify by service.
