<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

म्लै
म्लै r. 1st. cl. (म्लायति)
	 1. To be faint or languid, to yawn with languor
or fatigue.
	 2. To fade, to decay.
	 3. To become thin. With परि, 1.
To be dejected.
	 2. To wither. With प्र, 1. To fade.
	 2. To be dirty.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=581-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

य|यं|यः
य The twenty-six consonant of the Nāgari alphabet, or semi-vowel Y;
in Bengal, it is usually pronounced J.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=581-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

य|यं|यः
य mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Who goes, a goer, a mover.
	 m. (-यः)
	 1. Air, wind.
	 2.
Union, Joining.
	 3. Fame, celebrity.
	 4. Barley.
	 5. Light, lustre.
6. Abandoning.
	 7. YAMA.
	 f. (-या)
	 1. Pudendum muliebre.
	 2. Going,
proceeding.
	 3. A car, a carriage.
	 4. Prohibiting, restraining, check-
ing.
	 5. Religious meditation.
	 6. Getting, obtaining.
 E. यज् to wor-
ship, or यम् to check, &c., aff. ड; or या-ड ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=581-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यक|यकः
यक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Which, (of many.)
 E. यद् which, and अकच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=581-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यकृत्
यकृत् m. (-कृत्) The liver.
 E. य union, (of the parts of the body,) कृ to
make, aff. क्विप् and तुक् augment. यकन् is optionally substituted
for this word in some of the declensions.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=581-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यकृदात्मिका
यकृदात्मिका f. (-का) A cock-roach.
 E. यकृत् the liver, आत्मन् self, कन् aff.,
fem. form; like it in colour.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=581-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यकृद्वैरी
यकृद्वैरी f. (-री) A plant, a sort of tree, (Andersonia rohitaka.)
 E. यकृत् liver, वैर inimical to.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=581-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यक्ष्
यक्ष् r. 10th cl (यक्षयते) To worship, to honour or adore.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=581-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यक्ष|यक्षः
यक्ष m. (-क्षः)
	 1. A demi-god, attendant especially on KUVERA, and em-
ployed in the care of his gardens and treasures.
	 2. A name of
KUVERA.
	 3. The residence of INDRA.
	 f. (-क्षी) The wife of
KUVERA.
 E. यक्ष् to worship, aff. घञ्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=581-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यक्षकर्द्दम|यक्षकर्दम|यक्षकर्दमः|यक्षकर्द्दमः
यक्षकर्द्दम m. (-मः) Perfumed paste, used especially for anointing the
body, and consisting of camphor, agallochum, musk and
Kakkola; or the three first, with saffron and Sandal in equal
proportions.
 E. यक्ष the demi-god, and कर्द्दम clay; a perfume of
which these beings are supposed to be fond.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=581-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यक्षग्रह|यक्षग्रहः
यक्षग्रह m. (-हः) The being possessed by an evil spirit.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=581-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यक्षतरु|यक्षतरुः
यक्षतरु m. (-रुः) The Indian fig-tree. “वटवृक्षे ।”
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=581-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यक्षधूप|यक्षधूपः
यक्षधूप m. (-पः)
	 1. Resin in general.
	 2. Turpentine, the resinous exuda-
tion of the pine.
 E. यक्ष the demi-god, धूप perfume or incense,
अण् aff. “सर्ज्जरसे” धुना इति माषा ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=581-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यक्षरस|यक्षरसः
यक्षरस m. (-सः) Spirituous or vinous liquor.
 E. यक्ष the demi-god, रस taste, fondness.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=581-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यक्षराज्
यक्षराज् m. (-राट्) KUVERA, the deity of wealth, and lord of the demi-
gods called Yakṣas.
	 2. A palæstrum, a place prepared for wrest-
ling or boxing.
 E. यक्ष a Yakṣa, and राज who rules or shines.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=581-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यक्षराज|यक्षराजः
यक्षराज m. (-जः) KUVERA: see the last.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=581-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यक्षराट्पुरी
यक्षराट्पुरी f. (-री) Alakā, the capital of KUVERA, supposed to be seated
on mount Kailāsa.
 E. यक्षराज, पुरी city.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=581-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यक्षरात्रि|यक्षरात्रिः
यक्षरात्रि f. (-त्रिः) The night of the day of full moon in the month
of Kārtika: see दीपाली.
 E. यक्ष the demi-god, रात्रि night; these
spirits being supposed to be then abroad.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=581-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यक्षवित्त|यक्षवित्तः
यक्षवित्त Adj. One who stores up wealth but never uses it.
