यजति|यजतिः
यजति m. (-तिः) A term for those sacrifices to which the verb यजति is
applied, as distinguished from those rites to which the verb जुहोति
applies. Sarvajnya-Nārāyana renders जुहोति by उपविष्टहोम and
यजति by तिष्ठद्धोम्
 E. यज-अतिच ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=582-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
