यज्ञिय|यज्ञियं|यज्ञियः
यज्ञिय mfn. (-यः-या-यं)
	 1. Proper for or suitable to a sacrifice.
	 2. Pious.
3. Sacred.
	 m. (-यः)
	 1. The third Yuga or Dwāpara age.
	 2. A god,
a deity.
 E. यज्ञ sacrifice, and घ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=582-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्ञियदेश|यज्ञियदेशः
यज्ञियदेश f. (-शः) The country of Hindus; those districts in which the
ritual and institutes of the Hindu system are enforced; properly
the country in which the black deer or antelope is native. E.
यज्ञिय sacrificial, and देश a country.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=582-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्ञियशाला
यज्ञियशाला f. (-ला) A temple, a shrine, a place of sacrifice.
 E. यज्ञिय to be
sacrificed, (where,) शाला hall.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=582-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्ञीयब्रह्मपादप|यज्ञीयब्रह्मपादपः
यज्ञीयब्रह्मपादप m. (-पः) The Vikantaka tree. “वंँइचि ।”
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=582-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्ञोडुम्बर|यज्ञोडुम्बरः
यज्ञोडुम्बर m. (-रः) The glomerous fig-tree, (Ficus glomerata, Rox.) E.
यज्ञ sacrifice, उडुम्बर the same.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=582-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्ञोपकरण
यज्ञोपकरण n. (-णं) Any utensil or implement necessary for a sacrifice.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=582-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्ञोपवीत|यज्ञोपवीतं
यज्ञोपवीत n. (-तं) The sacrificial cord, originally worn by the three
principal casts of Hindus: at present from the loss of the pure
Kṣatriya and Vaiśya casts in Bengal, confined to the Brāh-
minical order.
 E. यज्ञ sacrifice, उपवीत thread.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=582-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्ञोपवीतिन्
यज्ञोपवीतिन् m. (-ती) A Brāhmana, &c. invested with the sacred thread.
E. यज्ञोपवीत, इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=582-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्यु|यज्युः
यज्यु m. (-ज्युः) A Brāhmana, conversant with the Yajur-Veda.
 E. यज्
to worship, Unādi aff. युच् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=582-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्वन्
यज्वन् m. (-ज्वा)
	 1. A sacrificer in due form, or agreeably to the ritual
of the Vedas.
	 2. VIṢṆU.
	 f. (-ज्वरी) Sacrificing, worshipping. E.
यज् to worship, वनिप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=582-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्वनापति
यज्वनापति m. (-तिः) The moon.
 E. यज्वन् a sacrificer in the sixth case
plural, पति master.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्|यन्त्
यत् (ई) यती r. 1st cl. (यतते) To resolve or determine in consequence
of a wish or desire, to apply or endeavour strenuously, to energize,
to persevere. r. 10 cl. (यातयति-ते)
	 1. To distress or afflict.
	 2. To
beat.
	 3. To order.
	 4. To collect, to assemble.
	 5. To work, to make
or manufacture.
	 6. To prevent, to remove.
	 7. To return, to give
back, to requite.
	 8. To barter or exchange.
	 9. To purify.
	 10. To
encourage. With निर or वि prefixed, To chastise, to punish, to
inflict pain. With निस् or प्रति, 1. To restore.
	 2. To requite.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्|यन्त्
यत् Ind. Because as, since, wherefore, correlative of तत् thence, there-
fore, &c.
 E. यत् to check, to restrain, क्विप् and तुक् affs.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत|यतः
यत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Governed, controlled.
	 2. Limited, restrained.
	 n.
(-तं) The stirring of an elephant by means of the rider's feet. E.
यम् to check, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतचित्त
यतचित्त mfn. (-त्तः-त्ता-त्तं) Resigned, subdued, one of well-governed
thoughts or feelings.
 E. यत and चित्त the mind.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतचित्तात्मन्
यतचित्तात्मन् mfn. (-त्मा-त्मा-त्म) Having power over the soul and spirit,
of subdued mind.
 E. यतचित्त, आत्मन् self.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतत्
यतत् mfn. (-तन्-तन्ती-तत्) Striving, making effort.
 E. यत् to make effort, शतृ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतन|यतनं
यतन n. (-नं) Making effort or exertion.
 E. यत् to make effort, ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतनीय
यतनीय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) To be exerted, or persevered, to be made as an
effort.
 E. यत् to make effort, अनीयर् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतम|यतमः
यतम mfn. (-मः-मा-मं) Which, (of many.)
 E. यद् which, डतमच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतमान
यतमान mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Making effort, striving, struggling, persevering.
E. यत् to strive, शानच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतमैथुन
यतमैथुन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Disinclined to sexual intercourse, abstaining
from it.
 E. यत, and मैथुन coition.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतर|यतरः
यतर mfn. (-रः-रा-रत्) Which, (of two), whether.
 E. यद् which, डतरच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतव्रत
यतव्रत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Firm to an engagement or vow.
 E. यत, व्रत a vow.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतस्
यतस् Ind. Because, as, since, whence: see यत्
 E. यद् which, what, and
तसिल् substituted for the termination of the 5th case.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतस्ततस्
यतस्ततस् Ind.
	 1. From any place whatsoever.
	 2. From any person.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतात्मत्
यतात्मत् mfn. (-त्मा-त्मा-त्म) Of subdued or well-governed spirit.
 E. यत,
आत्मन् self.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतात्मवत्|यतात्मवन्त्
यतात्मवत् mfn. (-वान्-वती-वत्) Self-subdued, having the mind and all its
powers in subjection.
 E. यतात्म, and मतुप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यताहार
यताहार mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Temperate, abstemious.
 E. यत, and आहार food.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यति|यतिः
यति Pron. How many, as many, (declined only in the plural, nomi-
native and accusative यति).
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यति|यतिः
यति m. (-तिः)
	 1. A sage, whose passions are completely under subjec-
tion.
	 2. A religious mendicant, especially one of the Jaina sect.
	 3.
Stopping, ceasing, rest, term.
	 4. Restraining, controlling, cheek-
ing.
	 f. (-तिः)
	 1. A pause in poetry or metre, a stop, a rest.
	 2. Uni-
on, joining.
	 3. Restraint, check.
	 4. Guidance.
 E. यत् endeavour,
&c., aff. इन्; or यम् to restrain, aff. क्तिन् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतित
यतित f. (-ता) Adj. Attempted, striven after.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतिन्
यतिन् m. (-ती) A sage with subdued passions.
	 f. (-नी) A widow.
 E. यत
restraining, from यम् with क्त aff. and इनि added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतिपात्र
यतिपात्र n. (-त्रं) A vessel for collecting alms, made of wood, or a hol-
low bamboo, an earthen bowl, or a gourd.
 E. यति and पात्र a vessel.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतिमैथुन|यतिमैथुनं
यतिमैथुन n. (-नं) The copulation or cohabitation of holy personages. E.
यति as above, and मैथुन coition.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतु
यतु(तू)का f. (-का) A plant, Chakāwat commonly. “वेतोशाक ।”
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतीन्द्रय
यतीन्द्रय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Chaste, pure, of subdued passions.
 E. यत, इन्द्रिय
an organ of sense.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतेन्द्रिय|यतेंद्रिय
यतेन्द्रिय Adj.
	 m. (-यः) Of subdued passions, pious, pure.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतोयतस्
यतोयतस् Ind.
	 1. From whatever place.
	 2. Wherever.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्कर
यत्कर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Doing what.
 E. यत् and कृ to do, अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्त
यत्त mfn. (-त्तः-त्ता-त्तं) Striven, resolved, exerted.
 E. यत् to resolve, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्न|यत्नः
यत्न m. (-त्नः) Effort, exertion, perseverance, energy.
 E. यत् to endea-
vour strenuously or continuously, aff. नङ् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्नतस्
यत्नतस् Ind. Vigorously, strenuously.
 E. यत्न and तसि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्नवत्|यत्नवन्त्
यत्नवत् mfn. (-वान्-वती-वत्) Persevering, diligent, making effort or exer-
tion.
 E. यत्न effort, मतुप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्य
यत्य mfn. (-त्यः-त्या-त्यं) To be exerted or made as an effort.
 E. यत् to exert, यत् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्र
यत्र Ind.
	 1. Where, in what place.
	 2. When.
	 3. Because, since, as
that.
 E. यद् what, and त्रल् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्र्
यत्र् (इ) यत्रि r. 1st and 10th cls. (यन्त्रति-ते यन्त्रयति-ते) To confine, to res-
train, to subdue or regulate: the root may also be written यन्त्र ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथा
यथा Ind. As, according to; correlative to तथा so: it is also commonly
used in composition to form adverbs; as यथाकालं seasonably, यथा-
क्रमं regularly, यथान्यायं fitly, suitably, यथाशास्त्रं according to scrip-
ture, &c.
 E. यद् what, थाल् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथांशतस्
यथांशतस् Ind. Proportionably, in due proportion.
 E. यथा as, according to, अंश part, तसि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाकथा
यथाकथा Ind. As much as, tantum quantum; it is especially used as
a term of disrespect.
 E. यथा as, and कथा how.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाकथाच
यथाकथाच Ind. Rarely, unfrequently, seldomer than proper.
 E. यथा as
much, कथा how much, with च the particle aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाकर्त्तव्य|यथाकर्तव्य
यथाकर्त्तव्य mfn. (-व्यः-व्या-व्यं) What is right or proper to be done.
 E. यथा
कर्त्तव्य to be done.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाकर्म
यथाकर्म Ind. According to action, duties or circumstances.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाकल्प
यथाकल्प Adv.
	 n. (-ल्पं) As designed.
 E. यथा and कल्प making.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाकाम
यथाकाम Adv.
	 n. (-म) At pleasure, as you please.
 E. यथा, and काम desire.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाकामिन्
यथाकामिन् mfn. (-मी-मिनी-मि) Wilful, independent, uncontrolled, follow-
ing one's own inclinations.
 E. यथा as, according to, काम desire,
इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाकालम्
यथाकालम् Ind. At the right moment.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=583-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
