यन्त्र|यंत्र|यंत्रं|यन्त्रं
यन्त्र n. (-न्त्रं)
	 1. A machine in general, any implement or apparatus.
	 2.
A diagram of a mystical nature, or astrological character.
	 3. A
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=584-b" target="_blank">Page584-b+ 60</a>]
sort of vessel.
	 4. Restraining, checking, controlling.
	 5. A fetter, a
cord.
	 6. A lock, a bolt.
 E. यम् to check, Unādi aff. त्र; or यत्रि-अच् ।
