यन्त्रक m. (-कः) One acquainted with machinery.
	 f. (-का) A wife's
younger sister.
	 n. (-कं)
	 1. A turner's lathe.
	 2. A bandage, (in
medicine.)
 E. यन्त्र a machine or restraining, &c., कन् added.
