यवमध्य|यवमध्यं|यवमध्यः
यवमध्य n. (-ध्यं) A form of penance, diminishing the food daily during
the fortnight, fasting on the new-moon, and gradually aug-
menting the food till the full-moon.
	 f. (-ध्या) A form of metre, a
triplet, the divisions of which are of unequal length, the middle
line having one syllable more than the first or last.
 E. यव barley,
मध्य centrical.
