यष्टि|यष्टिः
यष्टि mf. (-ष्टिः-ष्टिः or ष्टी)
	 1. A staff, a stick.
	 2. A staff armed with iron,
&c. used as a weapon, a club, a mace.
	 3. A necklace.
	 4. Any
creeping plant.
	 5. Liquorice.
	 6. A shrub, (Siphonanthus Indica.)
7. A string, a thread, especially as strung with pearls, &c.
	 8. A
thread in general.
	 m. (-ष्टिः)
	 1. A flag-staff.
	 2. The arm, and fore-
arm.
	 3. A pillar.
	 4. A support.
	 5. A stalk.
	 6. A branch.
 E. यक्ष to
worship, aff. क्तिन्; the क of the compound final rejected; Vāchas-
patya defines it thus:--यज् क्तिन् नि० न सम्प्रसारणम् । This word
implies “thinness” “slenderness” &c. when used at the end of
compounds.
