यस्
यस् (इर्, उ) इर् यसु r. 1st and 10th cls. (यसति यस्यति)
	 1. To endeavour, to
persevere, to make strenuous and presevering exertion.
	 2. To be
afflicted. With आङ् prefixed, To labour. With निर्, To exude. r.
10th cl. (यासयति-ते) With आ, To torment, to trouble.
