युक्त|युक्तं|युक्तः
युक्त mfn. (-क्तः-क्ता-क्तं)
	 1. Joined, combined, united, identified.
	 2. Right,
fit, proper.
	 3. Proved, concluded by inference or argument.
	 4. Mo-
derate, limited.
