engaged in business, &c.
	 8. Occupied in performance of the reli-
gious exercise called Yoga.
	 m. (-क्तः) The sage who has acquired the
command of his feelings and passions, and who performs the cus-
tomary devotional offices without any regard to their result.
	 n.
(-क्तं)
	 1. A measure of four cubits.
	 2. A team, a yoke.
	 f. (-क्ता) A
plant, commonly Elāni.
 E. युज् to join or mix, aff. क्त ।
