Endowed with native or natural strength.
	 m. (Nom. -युवा-वानी-वानः
acc. plu. युनः)
	 1. A younger descendant, the elder being alive.
	 m.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=590-a" target="_blank">Page590-a+ 60</a>]
(-वा) A young man or one of the virile age, or from sixteen to
