	 f. (-तिः-ती or यूनी) A young woman, one from sixteen to
thirty.
	 f. (-तिः) Turmeric.
 E. यु to mix or associate, Unādi aff.
क्वनिन्, the fem. form takes ति, and optionally adds ङीष् in one
form, with which affix the semi-vowel व is changed to its con-
gener उ, and the two short vowels coalesce into one long one,
making यूनी.
