योनल|योनलः
योनल m. (-लः) A sort of grain, (Andropogon or Holcus sorghum.) “दे-
धान”.
 E. यव barley, नल culm or stalk, the व of the first word cha-
nged to उ, and उ with the inherent vowel of य changed to ओ ।
