योनि|योनिः
योनि mfn. (-निः-निः or -नी)
	 1. The vulva.
	 2. A mine.
	 3. Cause, origin.
4. Water.
	 5. Place or site of birth or production in general.
	 6. A
repository, a seat.
	 7. Home, abode, nest.
	 8. A form of existence,
race, birth, as in “देवयोनि,” &c.
 E. यु to join or mix, Unādi aff. नि ।
