<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षिवर्ग|रक्षिवर्गः
रक्षिवर्ग m. (-र्गः) A guard, a sentinel.
 E. रक्षि from रक्षिन् a preserver, वर्ग class.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=594-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षोगण
रक्षोगण m. (-णः) A class or troop of evil spirits.
 E. रक्षस्, गण a troop.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=594-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षोघ्न|रक्षोघ्नं|रक्षोघ्नः
रक्षोघ्न m. (-घ्नः) Marking-nut plant.
	 n. (-घ्न)
	 1. Sour gruel made from
the fermentation of rice-water.
	 2. Asafœtida.
 E. रक्षस् a goblin,
and घ्न destroying, repelling.
