<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्ष्ण|रक्ष्णः
रक्ष्ण m. (-क्ष्णः) Preserving, guarding, protection.
 E. रक्ष् to preserve,
aff. नङ् ।
