<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्ष्य
रक्ष्य mfn. (-क्ष्यः-क्ष्या-क्ष्यं) To be guarded, protected, &c.
 E. रक्ष् to preserve, यत् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=594-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्ष्यमाण
रक्ष्यमाण mfn. (-णः-णा-णं) Preserved.
 E. रक्ष् to preserve, pass. v., शानच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=594-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रख्
रख् r. 1st cl. (रखति) also (इ) रखि r. 1st cl. (रङ्खति) To go, to move.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=594-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रग्
रग् r. 1st cl. (ए) रगे (रगति) To suspect, to doubt, to fear. r. 10th cl.
(रागयति)
	 1. To taste.
	 2. To obtain. (इ) रगि r. 1st cl. (रङ्गति) To go,
to move.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=594-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रघ्
रघ् (इ) रघि r. 1st cl. (रङ्घते) To go, to move. r. 10th cl. (रङ्घयति-ते) To
shine; also without the indicatory letter. r. 10th cl. (रापयति) To
taste. KĀLIDĀSA derives रघु from this root.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=594-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रघु|रघुः
रघु m. (-घुः)
	 1. The name of a sovereign of Oudh, the great grand-father
of RĀMACHANDRA.
	 2. The family or descendants of RAGHU.
 E. लघि
to shine, कु Unādi aff., ल changed to र, nasal augment rejected.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=594-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रघुकार|रघुकारः
रघुकार m. (-रः) The poet KĀLIDĀSA.
 E. रघु the race of RAGHU, which
forms the subject of a poem by this writer, and कार author.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=594-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रघुनन्दन|रघुनन्दनः
रघुनन्दन m. (-नः) RĀMA, the second incarnation of VIṢṆU, under
that appellation.
 E. रघु the king RAGHU, नन्दन a son or descendant.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=594-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रघुनाथ|रघुनाथः
रघुनाथ m. (-थः) A name of RĀMA.
 E. रघु the race of RAGHU, नाथ lord.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=594-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रघुवंश|रघुवंशः
रघुवंश m. (-शः) The race or family of RAGHU; hence also the name of
a poem by KĀLIDĀSA, which treats of the ancestors of RĀMA,
from DILĪPA to that prince, and his descendants to AGNIVARṆA;
nearly one half relates to the history of RAGHU and as much to
that of RĀMA, the remainder is occupied with the remaining
princes.
 E. रघु as above, and वंश race.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=594-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रघुवर|रघुवरः
रघुवर m. (-रः) RĀMA.
 E. रघु the race of RAGHU, and वर eminent.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=594-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रघूद्वह|रघूद्वहः
रघूद्वह m. (-हः) RĀMA.
 E. रघु the race of RAGHU, and उद्वह pre-eminent.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=594-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रङ्क|रंक|रङ्कः
रङ्क mfn. (-ङ्कः-ङ्का-ङ्कं)
	 1. Niggardly, avaricious, a miser.
	 2. Slow, dull.
3. Hungry.
 E. रकि to go, aff. अच् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=594-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रङ्कु|रंकु|रंकुः|रङ्कुः
रङ्कु m. (-ङ्कुः) A sort of deer, (the spotted axis.)
 E. रम् to sport, aff. कु, form irr.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=594-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रङ्ग|रंग|रङ्गं|रंगः|रङ्गः
रङ्ग m. (-ङ्गः)
	 1. Paint, colour, tint, dye.
	 2. Dancing, acting, singing,
&c.
	 3. A field of battle.
	 4. The place where acting, &c. is exhibi-
ted, a stage.
	 5. A place answering to an amphi-theatre.
	 6. An
assembly.
	 7. The nasal modification of a vowel.
	 8. Borax.
	 n. (-ङ्गं)
Tin.
 E. रगि to go, aff. अच्; or रञ्ज् to colour, aff. घञ्, the final
changed, and the nasal rejected.
