	 1. A field.
	 2. A stage, a theatre, a place where danc-
ing is exhibited, or the Indian dramas where represented.
 E. रङ्ग
dancing, &c., and भूमि ground, spot.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=595-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रङ्गमल्ली
रङ्गमल्ली f. (-ल्ली) A lute.
 E. रङ्ग् singing, &c., मल्ल् to hold, affs. अच् and ङीष् ।
