<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रज|रजं|रजः
रज mn. (-जः-जं)
	 1. Dust.
	 2. The pollen of flowers.
	 3. The menstrual
excretion.
	 4. The second property of humanity, the quality of
passion.
 E. रन्ज् to colour, &c., aff. अच्, and the nasal rejected;
this word more commonly occurs रजस्, q. v.
