रजक|रजकः
रजक m. (-कः)
	 1. A washerman.
	 2. Cloth, clothes.
	 f. (-की) A washer-
man's wife or a washer-woman.
 E. रञ्ज् to colour, (clothes,) ष्वुन् or
क्कुन् aff.; or रण्ज्-ण्वुल् न लोपः in the latter case the fem. is रजिका a
washer-woman, and रजकी a washer-woman's wife.
