रजत|रजतं
रजत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) White.
	 n. (-तं)
	 1. A pearl-necklace.
	 2. Silver.
	 3.
Gold.
	 4. Elephant's teeth, ivory.
	 5. The name of a lake.
	 6. The
name of a mountain, perhaps Kailāsa; see रजताद्रि.
	 7. White,
(the colour.)
	 8. Blood.
	 9. An asterism, a constellation.
	 10. An ele-
phant.
 E. रञ्ज् to colour, &c., अतच् Unādi aff.
