रजतप्रस्थ|रजतप्रस्थः
रजतप्रस्थ m. (-स्थः) Mount Kailāsa, the residence of KUVERA and his
attendant demi-gods.
 E. रजत white, (or silver,) and प्रस्थ table-land.
