<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजस्वल|रजस्वलः
रजस्वल m. (-लः)
	 1. A buffalo.
	 2. Quicksilver.
	 f. (-ला)
	 1. A woman during
menstruation.
	 2. A girl, one above ten years of age.
	 3. Dusty.
	 4.
Full of passion.
 E. रजस् dust, &c., and वलच् aff.
