रत्नि|रत्निः
रत्नि mf. (-त्निः-त्नी)
	 1. A sort of cubit, measured from the elbow to the
end of the closed fist; it is also computed at tweenty-one
breadths of the middle of the thumb.
	 2. The closed hand, the fist.
E. ऋ to go, कत्निच् aff., the vowel changed to the semi-vowel, other-
wise अरत्नि, and as derived from मृ to go, सरत्नि ।
