<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमठ|रमठं
रमठ n. (-ठं) Asafœtida. “हिङ्गुनि”.
 E. रम् to sport, अटन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=597-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

