<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसगर्भ|रसगर्भं
रसगर्भ n. (-र्भं)
	 1. A mineral preparation used as a stibium.
	 2. Vermi-
lion.
 E. रस quicksilver, and गर्भ embryo.
