रसज|रसजं|रसजः
रसज mfn. (-जः-जा-जं) Born or produced by or in passion flavour, fluids,
&c.
	 n. (-जं) Blood.
	 m. (-जः)
	 1. Any insect engendered by the
acetous fermentation of liquids.
	 2. Molasses, treacle.
 E. रस juice,
the primary juice or chyle, &c., and ज born.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=598-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
