रससिद्धि|रससिद्धिः
रससिद्धि f. (-द्धिः) The knowledge of alchemy, the possession of peculiar
familiarity with mercury, obtained by the performance of chemi-
cal operations conjoined with certain mystical and magical rites,
and the securing thence to the adept, of happiness, health, and
wealth, the power of transmuting metals, and the art of pro-
longing life.
 E. रस mercury, and सिद्धि accomplishment, especially
of some supernatural object.
