	 m. (-गी)
	 1. A dyer, a painter.
	 2. A
libertine, a lover.
	 f. (-णी)
	 1. A shrewd and intriguing woman.
	 2.
A modification of a musical mode of which five are assigned to
each mode; in mythology, personified as a female, and the wife of
the Rāga.
 E. राग passion, इनि aff., or रञ्ज् to colour, &c., घिनुण् aff.
