	 f. (-त्त्री)
	 1.
Arabian jasmine.
	 2. A bitter gourd.
	 3. The musk-shrew.
	 4. A kind
of brass or bell-metal.
	 5. A princess.
	 6. A woman of the Rājput
tribe.
 E. राज a king or the moon, and पुत्त्र a son, a child.
