<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

री
री r. 9th cl. (रिणाति)
	 1. To hurt, to injure.
	 2. To go, to move.
	 3. To
howl, as a wild beast. (ङ्) रीङ् r. 4th cl. (रीयते)
	 1. To distil, to ooze,
to drop.
	 2. To fall, to alight. r. 2nd cl. (रेति) To bear or conceive,
(as a child.)
