रीढा
रीढा f. (-ढा) Disrespect, irreverence, disregard.
 E. रिह् to kill, &c., aff.
क्त, and the vowel made long.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=605-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रीण|रीणं
रीण mfn. (-णः-णा-णं) Oozing, dripping, leaking, distilling.
 E. री to leak, to run out, aff. क्त ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=605-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रीति|रीतिः
रीति f. (-तिः-ती)
	 1. Usage, custom, practice, local or traditionary ob-
servance.
	 2. Oozing, leaking, distilling.
	 3. Brass, pale-brass, or
prince's metal.
	 4. Rust of iron.
	 5. Calx of brass.
	 6. Scoria of any
metal, or the oxide formed on the surface of metals by their ex-
posure to heat and air.
	 7. Boundary, limit.
	 8. Going, motion.
	 9.
Natural property or disposition.
	 10. A stream, a river.
	 11. Style,
diction; they are:--वैदर्भी, गौडी, पाञ्चाली and लाटिका or मागधी ।
E. री to go, to run out, &c. aff. क्तिच् ।
