	 3. Rough to the
taste or feeling harsh.
	 4. Rugged, uneven.
	 5. Dry, arid.
 E. रुह् to
grow, Unādi aff. क्स; it is more properly written रूक्ष, as derived from
रूक्ष् to be rough.
