रुच्
रुच् f. (-रुक्)
	 1. Light, lustre, splendour.
	 2. Beauty, loveliness.
	 3. Light-
ning.
	 4. Wish, desire.
	 5. The chattering of the parrot or Mainā.
6. The Rig-Veda.
 E. रुच् to shine, aff. क्विप्; also with टाप् added रुचा ।
