	 1. Light, lustre.
	 2. Beauty, appearance, colour.
	 3.
Passion.
	 4. Wish, desire.
	 5. A ray of light.
	 6. Intent application
to any object or undertaking.
	 7. Hunger, appetite.
	 8. Taste, senti-
ment.
 E. रुच् to shine, कि or ङीप् aff.
