रुद्ध|रुद्धं
रुद्ध mfn. (-द्धः-द्धा-द्धं)
	 1. Surrounded, begirt, as with a fence or river,
&c.
	 2. Secured, protected from access.
	 3. Obstructed, stopped,
shut up.
	 4. Opposed, impeded.
	 5. Besieged, invested, blockaded.
f. (-द्धा) A siege.
 E. रुध् to close, &c. aff. क्त ।
