रूढि|रूढिः
रूढि f. (-ढिः)
	 1. Birth, production.
	 2. Growing, growth.
	 3. Fame, noto-
riety.
	 4. Traditional or customary meaning of words, as opposed to
their etymological signification; it is especially applied to words of
foreign or uncertain origin, and incapable of etymological analy-
sis.
 E. रुह् to grow, &c., aff. क्तिन् ।
