<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेरिहाण|रेरिहाणः
रेरिहाण m. (-णः)
	 1. A name of ŚIVA.
	 2. An Asūra; an evil spirit.
	 3. A chief.
