<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेवत|रेवतः
रेवत m. (-तः) A prince, the father of the wife of BALARĀMA.
 E. रेव-अतच् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=609-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेवती
रेवती f. (-ती)
	 1. The wife of BALARĀMA, the half-brother of KṚṢṆA.
	 2.
The last of the Nakshatras or lunar asterisms, containing thirty-
two stars, figured by a tabor; one of the stars is the piscium.
	 3.
One of the MĀTRIS or energies of the gods.
	 4. A cow.
 E. रेवत the
name of a king, the father of BALARĀMA'S wife, and ङीष् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=609-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेवतीभव|रेवतीभवः
रेवतीभव m. (-वः) The planet SATURN.
 E. रेवती the nymph or asterism
personified, and भव born.
