<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेवतीरमण|रेवतीरमणः
रेवतीरमण m. (-णः) BALARĀMA.
 E. रेवती the wife of BALARĀMA, and रमण husband.
