<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेवन्त|रेवन्तः
रेवन्त m. (-न्तः) The fifth MANU of the present Kalpa; also called
RAIVATA.
 E. रेव, झच् aff.
