रोचक|रोचकः
रोचक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) What pleases, brightens, strengthens, &c.
	 m.
(-कः)
	 1. Hunger, appetite.
	 2. The plantain.
	 3. A sort of onion.
4. A stomachic, a carminative, any medicine, fruit or fossil, sup-
posed to strengthen the tone of the stomach and restore lost
appetite.
	 5. A relish.
	 6. A worker in glass or artificial ornaments.
E. रुच् to shine, &c., and ण्वुल्, aff.
