ल|लं|लः
ल The twenty-eighth consonant of the Nāgari alphabet, the letter L.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=611-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ल|लं|लः
ल m. (-लः)
	 1. INDRA.
	 2. Cutting.
	 3. A short syllable, (in prosody.)
4. PĀṆINI'S technical term for all the tenses and modes, (in gram.)
f. (-ला)
	 1. Giving.
	 2. Receiving, taking.
	 f. (-ली)
	 1. Embracing,
adhering or clinging to.
	 2. Liquifying, melting.
 E. ला to give or
take, &c., aff. क or ड, fem. aff. टाप् or ङीष् ।
