<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक|लकः
लक n. (-कं)
	 1. The forehead.
	 2. The ear or spike of wild-rice.
 E. लक्
to taste, &c., aff. अच् ।
