<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लकुच|लकुचः
लकुच m. (-चः) A species of the bread-fruit tree, (Artocarpus Lacucha,
Rox.)
 E. लक् to taste, उचन् aff.; also अ substituted for उ, लकच ।
