लक्ष्
लक्ष् r. 1st cl. (लक्षते) To perceive, to see. r. 10th cl. (लक्षयति-ते)
	 1. To
see, to look at, to notice or inspect.
	 2. To mark, to mark
any mark on.
	 3. To define, to discriminate. With उप prefixed,
To remark. With सम्, To know, to understand. With वि, 1. To ob-
serve.
	 2. To become confused.
	 3. To distinguish.
