लक्ष्मण|लक्ष्मणं|लक्ष्मणः
लक्ष्मण mfn. (-णः-णा-णं) Prosperous fortunate.
	 m. (-णः)
	 1. The son of
DAŚARATHA by SUMITRĀ, the half-brother and faithful compani-
on of RĀMACHANDRA.
	 2. The Sāras or Indian crane.
	 n. (-णं)
	 1. A
mark, a spot or sign.
	 2. A name, an appellation.
	 f. (-णा)
	 1. The
female of the Sāras.
	 2. A kind of drug.
 E. लक्ष् to mark or see,
Unādi aff. न, and मुट् augment. also with अट् augment, लक्षण ।
