लक्ष्मीगृह|लक्ष्मीगृहं
लक्ष्मीगृह n. (-हं) The red lotus.
 E. लक्ष्मी the goddess, and गृह abode,
appearing at the creation, floating over the water on the expand-
ed petals of the lotus.
