लक्ष्मीपति m. (-तिः)
	 1. VIṢṆU.
	 2. A king, a sovereign prince.
	 3. The
clove-tree. “लवङ्गवृक्षे”.
	 4. The betel-nut tree, (Areca faufel.)
 E. लक्ष्मी
the goddess of prosperity and पति master, husband.
