	 1. KĀMADEVA, the god of love.
	 2. A horse.
	 3. Either
of the sons of RAMA and SĪTĀ.
 E. लक्ष्मी the goddess, or SĪTĀ,
(she being LAKṢMĪ incarnate,) and पुत्त्र a son.
