<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लग्निका
लग्निका f. (-का) A girl ten years old, one before menstruation.
 E. लस्ज्
to be ashamed, aff. कन्, fem. form; also नग्निका ।
