लघ्
लघ् r. 10th cl. (लाघयति-ते)
	 1. To taste.
	 2. To obtain. (इ) लघि r. 1st cl.
(लङ्घते)
	 1. To go, to move.
	 2. To go beyond the limit.
	 3. To fast,
to abstain from food. (लङ्घति)
	 1. To dry, to dry up.
	 2. To dimi-
nish, to lessen.
	 3. To sorrow. r. 10th cl. (लङ्घयति-ते) To speak. With
उत् or वि prefixed, To go beyond or over, to cross, to pass, to leap
or spring over; also morally, to exceed, to transgress.
