लज्
लज् r. 1st cl. (लजते) also (इ) लजि (लञ्जति) 1. To fry.
	 2. To affront, to in-
sult.
	 3. To blame. (ओ, ई) ओलजी r. 6th cl. (लजति-ते) To be ashamed,
to be modest or bashful. r. 10th cl. (लजयति-ते) To shine. (लाजयति-ते)
To hide, to cover, to screen or clothe: also (लजति) or (इ) लजि
(लञ्जयति) 1. To be manifest or apparent.
	 2. To shine. (इ) लजि
(लञ्जयति-ते) 1. To give.
	 2. To dwell.
	 3. To injure.
	 4. To be strong.
5. To censure.
	 6. To speak.
