लञ्ज|लंज|लंजः|लञ्जः
लञ्ज m. (-ञ्जः)
	 1. A foot.
	 2. The end of the lower garment tucked into
the waist band.
	 3. A tail.
	 f. (-ञ्जा)
	 1. An adulteress.
	 2. Sleep.
	 3.
LAKṢMĪ.
	 4. A current.
 E. लजि to be strong, &c., or लञ्ज् aff. अच् ।
