लञ्जिका|लंजिका
लञ्जिका f. (-का) A harlot, a whore.
 E. लजि to censure, aff. क्वुन्, fem. form.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=613-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लट्
लट् r. 1st cl. (लटति)
	 1. To be a child, to talk or be like one.
	 2. To
speak a little.
	 3. To cry.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=613-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लट|लटः
लट m. (-टः)
	 1. A blockhead, a fool, one speaking ignorantly or fool-
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=613-b" target="_blank">Page613-b+ 60</a>]
ishly.
	 2. Fault, defect.
	 3. A thief.
 E. लट् to be or talk as a child,
&c., aff. अच् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=613-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लटक|लटकः
लटक m. (-कः) A vile or contemptible man.
 E. लट् to talk as a child, वुन् Unādi aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=613-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लटभ
लटभ f. (-भा) Adj. Handsome, attractive. This word has Prākrita origin
and is not used in classical Sanskrit.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=613-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लट्ट|लट्टः
लट्ट m. (-ट्टः) A vile or bad man, a wretch.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=613-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लट्व|लट्वः
लट्व m. (-ट्वः)
	 1. A horse.
	 2. A division of music.
	 3. A low and wild
tribe, a tribe of mountaineers.
	 4. A dancing boy.
	 f. (-ट्वा)
	 1. A bird
said to be a kind of sparrow.
	 2. A fruit, a variety of the Karañja.
3. A bad or unchaste woman.
	 4. Curls on the forehead or hanging
down on the face.
	 5. Safflower.
	 6. A sweetmeat.
	 7. A kind of
musical instrument.
 E. लट् to be like a child, Unādi aff. क्वन् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=613-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लड्
लड् r. 1st and 10th cls. (लडति लडयति)
	 1. To frolic, to sport or dally.
2. To loll, (the tongue.)
	 3. To use the tongue.
	 4. To stir with the
tongue.
	 5. To stir, to agitate.
	 6. To pain. r. 10th cl. (लाडयति-ते)
	 1.
To nurse, to foster, to attend closely.
	 2. To shake.
	 3. To feel de-
sire.
	 4. To spread. (औ, इ) औलडि r. 1st and 10th cls. (लण्डति लण्ड-
यति-ते)
	 1. To shine.
	 2. The toss or throw up.
	 3. To speak.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=613-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लडह|लडहः
लडह mfn. (-हः-हा-हं) Beautiful, pleasing, charming, (used in Prākrita.)
