ललाटरे
ललाटरे(ले)खा f. (-खा)
	 1. A line on the forehead, supposed to indicate
long life.
	 2. A wrinkled or corrugated brow.
	 3. A coloured
sectarial mark on the forehead.
 E. ललाट the forehead, रेखा a line.
