लस्
लस् r. 1st cl. (लसति)
	 1. To embrace.
	 2. To sport or play.
	 3. To glitter.
4. To arise. With उद्, 1. To glitter.
	 2. To appear.
	 3. To blow, to
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=616-a" target="_blank">Page616-a+ 60</a>]
open. With परि, To appear gaudy. With वि, To sound, to echo. r.
10th cl. (लासयति-ते)
	 1. To be skilful, to do any thing skilfully or
scientifically.
	 2. To work. With उत् prefixed, 1. To shine, to be
brilliant or splendid.
	 2. To be happy or delighted. With वि, To
gambol, to sport, especially amorously.
