bracing, enfolding, surrounding.
	 4. One who sports or gambols.
n. (-कं) A turret, a room on the top of a building.
	 f. (लासिका or
लासकी)
	 1. A female dancer, a Nāutch-girl.
	 2. A wanton, a harlot.
E. लस् to embrace, to be skilful, (in the art of dancing,) aff. ण्वुल् ।
