लिह् r. 2nd cl. (लेढि लीढे Desid, लिलिक्षति-ते) To taste, to taste with
tongue, to lick, to sip. With अव, To chew, to lick. With आ, 1. To
lick.
	 2. To pierce.
	 3. To wound. With उद्, To polish.
