<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुठत्
लुठत् mfn. (-ठन्-ठन्ती-ठत्)
	 1. Rolling on the ground, falling down.
	 2.
Flowing, trickling.
 E. लुठ् to roll, शतृ aff.
