लुठन|लुठनं
लुठन n. (-नं)
	 1. A horse's rolling himself on the ground.
	 2. Rolling on
the ground with sorrow or vexation, &c.
	 3. Wallowing.
 E. लुट् or
ल्युठ् to cast one's self on the ground, aff. क्युच् ।
