लुब्धक|लुब्धकः
लुब्धक m. (-कः)
	 1. A hunter.
	 2. A libertine, a rake, a whore-monger.
	 3.
A covetous or greedy man.
	 4. The star Sirius.
	 5. A tiger.
 E. लुब्ध
desirous, aff. कन् ।
