लेख|लेखः
लेख m. (-खः)
	 1. A letter, an epistle.
	 2. A god, a deity.
	 f. (-खा)
	 1. A
line, a mark or row, &c.
	 2. Writing, hand-writing.
	 3. Delineation,
painting.
	 4. A likeness, an impression.
	 5. Hem, border.
	 6. The
moon's crescent.
 E. लिख् to write, aff. घञ्; it is applied to the
second sense, because the figures of the gods are written or deli-
neated.
