tongue.
	 6. Scarifying, scratching.
	 7. Reducing corpulency, thinning.
m. (-नः) A sort of grass or reed, of which pens are made, (Sac-
charum spontaneum.)
	 f. (-नी) A pen, a style.
 E. लिख् to write, aff.
of the act or instrument ल्युट् ।
