लोक्
लोक्(ऋ)लोकृ r. 1st cl. (लोकते) To see. With अव, To see, to perceive.
With आ, To view. r. 10th cl. (लोकयति-ते)
	 1. To speak.
	 2. To shine.
3. To know.
	 4. To look. With अव, 1. To see.
	 2. To learn.
	 3.
To look after. With आ, 1. To see.
	 2. To know.
	 3. To regard as.
With वि, 1. To perceive.
	 2. To search.
