n. (-तं)
	 1. Blood.
	 2. A red kind of Agallochum.
	 3. Saffron.
	 4.
Red sanders.
	 5. War, battle.
	 6. Copper.
	 7. An imperfect form of
a rainbow.
	 f. (-ता)
	 1. A woman red with anger or with colour,
&c.
