लौह|लौहः
लौह mfn. (-हः-ही-हं)
	 1. Iron, made of iron, copper, &c.
	 2. Red, copper-
coloured.
	 m. (-हः) Iron.
	 f. (-ही) An iron vessel, a pot.
 E. लौह iron,
and अण् deriv. aff.
