ल्पी
ल्पी r. 9th cl. (ल्पिनाति) To unite, to join, to be connected or attached
to: it is also read ल्यी-ह्ली-ल्वी, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=623-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
