ल्वी
ल्वी r. 9th cl. (ल्विनाति or ल्वीनाति)
	 1. To go, to move or approach.
	 2. To
join or be connected with, to mix with, to unite.
	 3. To obtain:
see the last.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=623-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
