वंशीधर|वंशीधरः
वंशीधर m. (-रः)
	 1. A piper.
	 2. A name of KṚṢṆA.
 E. वंशी, धर who holds.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=624-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
