वंश्य|वंश्यः
वंश्य mfn. (-श्यः-श्या-श्यं)
	 1. Of a good family.
	 2. Of the same family.
	 3.
Relating to the back-bone.
	 m. (-श्यः)
	 1. A son.
	 2. A pupil, a scho-
lar.
	 3. A kinsman, from seven generations above and seven below.
4. A bone in the leg or arm.
 E. वंश a family, and यत् aff.
