वंहिष्ठ
वंहिष्ठ mfn. (-ष्ठः-ष्ठा-ष्ठं) Most, very much or great.
 E. वंह substituted
for वृन्दारक great, and इष्ठन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=624-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंहीयस्
वंहीयस् mfn. (-यान्-यसी-यः) Very much or very large.
 E. वंह for वृन्दारक, ईयसुन् aff.
