<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वकव्रतिन्
वकव्रतिन् m. (-ती) A false devotee, a religious hypocrite, or one who as-
sumes the appearance of devotion or meditation, for interested pur-
poses.
 E. वक a crane, व्रत observance, and इनि aff.; compared to
the crane, who stands by a pool demure and sly, and apparently
absorbed in contemplation, till be sees a fish on which to dart;
also with ठक् aff. वकव्रतिक, and derived from वक, and चर who
goes, वकचर; or वकव्रतचर m. (-रः) &c.: see वैडालव्रतिक ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=624-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वकाची
वकाची f. (-ची) A sort of fish.
