वक्तव्य|वक्तव्यः
वक्तव्य mfn. (-व्यः-व्या-व्यं)
	 1. Fit or proper to be said or spoken, to be
spoken or uttered.
	 2. To be spoken about or against.
	 3. Vile, bad,
reprehensible.
	 4. Subject, dependent.
	 5. Low, base.
	 n. (-व्यं)
	 1. A
rule, a dictum, a sentence.
	 2. Speech.
	 3. Reproach.
 E. वच् to
speak, and तव्य aff., of the future participle.
