वक्तृ
वक्तृ mfn. (-क्ता-क्त्री-क्तृ)
	 1. Speaking, a speaker.
	 2. Loquacious, talkative.
3. Speaking well or sensibly, eloquent.
	 4. Wise, learned.
	 5. Speak-
ing truly or truth, honest, sincere.
	 m. (-क्ता)
	 1. An expounder, a
teacher.
	 2. An orator, a speaker.
 E. वच् to speak, तृच् participial aff.
