वट्
वट् r. 1st and 10th cls. (वटति वटयति-ते)
	 1. To surround or encompass.
	 2.
To tie or string, to connect.
	 3. To partition, to divide. r. 1st cl.
causal form (वटयति) To speak. (इ) वटि r. 4th and 10th cls. (वण्टति
वण्टयति) To partition, to separate or divide.
