	 1. The large
Indian fig-tree, (Ficus Indica.)
	 2. A round figure, a circle, a
cipher, a ball or globe.
	 3. Pulse ground and fried with oil or
butter.
	 4. A small shell, a cowrie.
	 5. Equality in shape or dimen-
sion.
 E. वट् to surround, to tie, aff. अच् ।
