<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वतोका
वतोका f. (-का)
	 1. A cow miscarrying from accident.
	 2. A barren wo-
man.
 E. अव before, तोक offspring, and अ rejected; also अवतोका ।
