वत्स|वत्सं|वत्सः
वत्स n. (-त्सं) The breast, the chest.
	 m. (-त्सः)
	 1. A calf.
	 2. A year.
	 mf.
(-त्सः-त्सा) A term of endearment, used to children, scholars, &c. E.
वद् to speak, to speak kindly to, or वस् to love, Unādi aff. स ।
