वत्सकाम
वत्सकाम mfn. (-मः-मा-मं) Fond of or anxious about a child.
	 f. (-मा) A
cow anxious after her calf, a mother anxious after her child, &c.
E. वत्स a calf, &c. and काम् to desire, affs. अङ् and टाप् ।
