वत्सतन्त्री
वत्सतन्त्री f. (-न्त्री) The rope that ties a calf.
 E. वत्स, and तन्त्री a string.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सनाभ|वत्सनाभः
वत्सनाभ m. (-भः) An active poison; also called Mītha Zeher, the root
of the Aconite ferox brought from Nepāl.
 E. वत्स a calf, and नभ्
to injure, अण् aff.; the root is sometimes compared to the nipple
of a cow, whence perhaps this etymology.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
