वत्सल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Afflctionate, kind.
	 n. (-लं) Affection, fondness.
	 f.
(-ला) A cow anxious for her calf.
	 m. (-लः) A fire fed with grass.
E. वत्स a child, and लच् aff.
