<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सादन|वत्सादनः
वत्सादन m. (-नः) A wolf.
	 f. (-नी) A plant, (Menispermum glabrum.) E.
वत्स a calf, अदन food.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
