वप्
वप्(ड)डुवप r. 1st cl. (वपति-ते)
	 1. To sow seed.
	 2. To procreate.
	 3. To
shave.
	 4. To weave. With आ, To scatter. With नि, 1. To scatter
seed.
	 2. To make offerings to the MANES.
	 3. To kill. With निस्, 1.
To scatter.
	 2. To perform.
	 3. To offer.
	 4. To present libations to
the MANES. With प्रति, 1. To sow.
	 2. To pierce, to fix.
