<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वप्रि|वप्रिः
वप्रि m. (-प्रिः)
	 1. A field.
	 2. The ocean.
 E. वप् to sow, Unādi aff. रि ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=630-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वभ्र्
वभ्र् r. 1st cl. (वभ्रति) To go; also बभ्र ।
