<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वमि|वमिः
वमि m. (-मिः or मी)
	 1. Vomiting, sickness.
	 2. An emetic.
	 m. (-मिः)
	 1. A
name of fire.
	 2. A rogue, a cheat.
 E. वम् to vomit, aff. इन् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=630-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वमित|वमितः
वमित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Sickened, made to vomit.
 E. वम् to be sick,
causal v., क्त aff.
