<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वम्री
वम्री f. (-म्री) A small ant burrowing in trees; also वम्रा ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=630-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वम्रीकूट|वम्रीकूटः
वम्रीकूट n. (-टं) An ant-hill, a hillock.
 E. वम्री a sort of ant, कूट a heap.
