<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वरण्डालु|वरंडालुः|वरण्डालुः
वरण्डालु m. (-लुः) The castor oil tree, (Ricinus communis.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=631-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वरतनु|वरतनुः
वरतनु f. (-नुः) An elegant woman.
 E. वर and तनु body.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=631-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वरत्करी
वरत्करी f. (-री) A sort of perfume, commonly Renukā.
