mightiest.
	 3. Best, dearest, most preferable or beloved.
	 n. (-ष्ठं)
	 1.
Copper.
	 2. Pepper.
	 m. (-ष्ठः)
	 1. The Francoline partridge.
	 2. The
orange tree.
 E. वर् substituted for उरु large, or वर best, इष्ठन् aff.
of the irr. superlative.
