वरीयस्
वरीयस् mfn. (-यान्-यसी-यः)
	 1. Very large, largest, most large.
	 2. Best,
most preferable or excellent.
	 3. Extremely young, tender, infan-
tine.
	 m. (-यान्) The eighteenth of the astronomical periods called
Yogas.
 E. वर best, or substituted for उरु large, and ईयसुन् aff. of
the irr. superlative.
