वर्ण्
वर्ण् r. 10th cl. (वर्णयति-ते)
	 1. To colour, to paint, to die.
	 2. To send or
cast, to direct, to order.
	 3. To praise, to extol, to proclaim qua-
lities.
	 4. To describe.
	 5. To spread or extend.
	 6. To grind or
pound.
	 7. To make exertions.
	 8. To shine.
