	 1. Prosperous, thriving.
	 2. Increasing, growing.
3. A house having no entrance on the south-side.
	 m. (-नः)
1. The castor-oil tree.
	 2. A lid, a cover, especially a shallow
earthen platter or saucer, used also as a top to water-jars, &c.
3. A name of VIṢṆU.
	 4. A sort of riddle or charade.
