<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षधर|वर्षधरः
वर्षधर m. (-रः)
	 1. An eunuch or attendant on the women's apartments.
2. A cloud.
 E. वर्ष rain and धर what holds.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=634-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षधर्ष
वर्षधर्ष m. (-र्षः) An eunuch or attendant on the women's apartments.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=634-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
