वर्षपर्व्वत|वर्षपर्वत|वर्षपर्वतः|वर्षपर्व्वतः
वर्षपर्व्वत m. (-तः) A mountainous range, supposed to separate the
various Varṣas or divisions of the globe from each other: six
ranges are enumerated from south to north; viz.:--HIMAVĀN,
HEMAKŪTA, NISĀDHA, NĪLA, ŚWETA, and SRINGĪ or ŚRINGA-
VĀNA; MERU constitutes the seventh; some authorities places
CHAITRA and KARNĪ instead of NĪLA and ŚWETA.
 E. वर्ष as
above, पर्व्वत a mountain; also similar compounds, as वर्षगिरि &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=634-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षपाकिन्
