वल्
वल् r. 1st cl. (वलते)
	 1. To cover.
	 2. To move.
	 3. To surround or en-
close.
	 4. To go, to hasten.
	 5. To be attached to.
	 6. To grow, to
increase. With वि, To move to and fro. r. 10th cl. (वालयति-ते) To
cherish or maintain.
