वल्ह् r. 1st cl. (वल्ह्ते)
	 1. To kill or hurt.
	 2. To cover.
	 3. To give.
	 4.
To be pre-eminent; in which sense it is more properly बल्ह्
r. 10th cl. (वल्ह्यति-ते)
	 1. To shine.
	 2. To speak.
