he is also a Brahmādika, a Prajāpati, and one of the seven
stars of Ursa Major.
 E. अव before, शास् to govern, to instruct, (the
other saints,) aff. क्त; the first vowel of the prefix rejected: also
written वशिष्ट and वसिष्ट । अतिशयेन वशी इष्ठन् इनेर्लुक् ।
