वश्यात्मन्
वश्यात्मन् mfn. (-त्मा-त्मा-त्म) Of subdued mind.
 E. वशी and आत्मन् spirit.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=637-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वष्
वष् r. 1st cl. (वषति) To kill or hurt.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=637-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वषट्
वषट् Ind. An exclamation used on making an oblation to a deity with
fire, (used with a dat.)
 E. वह् to bear or convey, aff. डषट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=637-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वषट्कर्त्तृ|वषट्कर्तृ
वषट्कर्त्तृ m. (-र्त्ता) The priest who pours the oiled butter into the fire
at a sacrifice with the exclamation वषट्.
 E. वषट् an exclamation,
&c., and कर्त्तृ who makes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=637-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वषट्कार|वषट्कारः
वषट्कार m. (-रः)
	 1. The formula वषट्.
	 2. An oblation made with the
exclamation वषट्.
 E. वषट् the exclamation used on this occasion,
and कार making.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=637-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वषटकृत
वषटकृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Offered or sacrificed with fire with the formula
वषट्.
 E. वषट् as above, कृत made.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=637-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वष्क्
वष्क् r. 1st cl. (वष्कते) r. 10th cl. (वष्कयति-ते)
	 1. To see.
	 2. To go, to move.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=637-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वष्कय|वष्कयः
वष्कय m. (-यः) A one year old calf.
 E. वष्क् to go, अयन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=637-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वष्कयणी
वष्कयणी f. (-णी) A cow bearing many calves.
 E. वष्कय a calf, नी to have,
affs. ड and ङीष्; also वष्कय, with इनि and ङीप् affs., वष्कयिणी ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=637-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्
वस्(औ)औवस r. 1st cl. (वसति) To dwell or inhabit. r. 2nd cl. (वस्ते) To
cover with dress, to wear as clothes. r. 10th cl. (वसयति-ते)
	 1. To per-
fume.
	 2. To dwell. (वासयति-ते)
	 1. To be affectionate, to love.
	 2. To
cut or divide.
	 3. To kill.
	 4. To accept. (इर, उ) इरवसु r. 4th cl.
(वस्यति) To be straight, to be unbending; literally or figuratively.
With अधि prefixed, To sit upon, to occupy. With उप, To fast.
With नि, 1. To dwell in or inhabit.
	 2. To dress. With प्र, To
dwell abroad. With सम्, To cohabit. Caus. (वासयति-ते)
	 1. To cause
to live or dwell.
	 2. To put on, to dress. With निस्, To drive away,
to expel, to banish. With प्र, To exile.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=637-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वसत्
वसत् mfn. (-सन्-सन्ती or सती-सत्)
	 1. Dwelling, inhabiting.
	 2. Wearing,
(as clothes.)
 E. वस् to dwell, शतृ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=637-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वसति|वसतिः
वसति f. (-तिः or ती)
	 1. A house, a dwelling.
	 2. Abiding, abode, resi-
dence.
	 3. Night.
 E. वस् to dwell, अति Unādi aff., ङीष् optionally
added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=637-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वसन|वसनं
वसन n. (-नं)
	 1. Cloth or clothes.
	 2. Covering, clothing.
	 3. A dwelling,
a house.
	 4. An ornament worn by women round the loins.
	 5.
Dwelling, residing.
 E. वस् to be clothed, &c., aff. ल्युट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=637-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वसनसद्मन्
वसनसद्मन् n. (-द्म) A tent.
 E. वसन and सद्मन् a dwelling.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=637-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वसन्त|वसंत|वसंतः|वसन्तः
वसन्त m. (-न्तः)
	 1. Vasanta, the season of spring, comprising the month
of Chaitra and Vaisākha, or its deified personification, which is
considered to be a companion of KĀMADEVA.
	 2. Dysentery,
diarrhœa.
	 3. Small-pox.
 E. वस् to dwell, Unādi aff. झच्, as
applied to the season, when love is especially present on earth.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=637-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वसन्तकाल|वसंतकाल|वसन्तकालः
वसन्तकाल m. (-लः) The vernal season.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=637-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वसन्तकुसुम|वसन्तकुसुमः
वसन्तकुसुम m. (-मः) A tree, (Cordia myxa and latifolia.)
 E. वसन्त spring,
कुसुम a flower; blossoming in the spring. “वसन्तफुलेर गाछ ।”
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=637-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वसन्तघोषिन्|वसंतघोषिन्
वसन्तघोषिन् m. (-षी) The Indian cuckoo or Kokila.
 E. वसन्त spring,
घोषिन् who sings.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=637-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वसन्तज
वसन्तज mfn. (-जः-जा-जं) Produced in the spring.
	 f. (-जा)
	 1. A festival in
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=637-b" target="_blank">Page637-b+ 60</a>]
honour of KĀMADEVA, held in the month of Chaitra.
	 2. The
Mādhabi creeper.
 E. वसन्त, ज born.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=637-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वसन्तदूत|वसंतदूत|वसन्तदूतः
वसन्तदूत m. (-तः)
	 1. The Kokila or Indian cuckoo.
	 2. The month Chai-
tra, (March-April.)
	 3. The mango tree.
	 f. (-ती)
	 1. The trumpet
flower.
	 2. A large and beautiful creeper, (Gærtnera racemosa.) E.
वसन्त spring, and दूत the messenger.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=637-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वसन्तद्रु|वसंतद्रु|वसन्तद्रुः
वसन्तद्रु m. (-द्रुः) The mango tree, (Mangifera Indica.)
 E. वसन्त spring,
and द्रु a tree, or वसन्तद्रुम; the mango blossoms in March or April,
and is then an object of great beauty.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=637-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वसन्तपञ्चमी|वसंतपंचमी
वसन्तपञ्चमी f. (-मी) The fifth day of the light-half of Māgha.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=637-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वसन्तसख|वसंतसख|वसन्तसखः
वसन्तसख m. (-खः) KĀMADEVA or CUPID.
 E. वसन्त spring, सखि the friend.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=637-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वसन्तोत्सव|वसंतोत्सव|वसन्तोत्सवः
वसन्तोत्सव n. (-वं) The celebration of the return of spring, formerly held
on the full-moon of Chaitra, but now on the full-moon of Phāl-
guṇa, being identified with the Dola-yātra or Holi.
 E. वसन्त and
उत्सव a festival.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=637-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वसा
वसा f. (-सा)
	 1. The serum or marrow of the flesh, considered by some
authorities as distinct from the marrow of the bones, though
regarded by others as the same substance.
	 2. Adeps, fat, suet. E.
वस् to divide, (in the body,) अङ् and टाप् affs.; or वस्-अच् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=637-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वसाढ्य|वसाढ्यः
वसाढ्य m. (-ढ्यः) The Gangetic porpoise, (Delphinus Gangeticus;) also
वसाढ्यक and वशाढ्यक, the last perhaps incorrectly.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=637-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वसान
वसान mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Wearing, putting on, (as clothes.)
 E. वस् to
clothe, शानच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=637-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वसापायिन्
वसापायिन् m. (-यी) A dog.
 E. वसा and पायिन् who drinks.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=637-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वसार
वसार n. (-रं) Wish, purpose, desire.
