वस्वौकसारा
वस्वौकसारा f. (-रा)
	 1. The capital of INDRA.
	 2. ALAKĀ, the residence of
KUVERA.
	 3. A lake attached to ALAKĀ or AMARĀVATĪ, and
belonging to either deity.
 E. वसु the Vasus, ओकस् a residence, रा
to contain, with आङ् prefixed, and क and टाप् affs., the favourite
haunts of these demi-gods.
