<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वा
वा r. 2nd cl. (वाति)
	 1. To go or move.
	 2. To blow, (as the wind.) With
निर् prefixed, 1. To blow out, to extinguish.
	 2. To cool.
	 3.
To hurt, to injure. Caus. (वापयति-ते) To cause to blow; also
(वाजयति-ते) To shake.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=639-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वा
वा Ind. A particle of,:--1. Comparison, (as, like, so;)
	 2. Alternative or-
option, (or, either, else, sometimes.)
	 3. Doubt and consideration,
(or, whether.)
	 4. Exception, (only, no other;)
	 5. Asseveration or
confirmation, (indeed, even, very.)
	 6. A conjunction, (and,
as well, also.)
	 7. An expletive.
 E. वा to go, aff. क्विप्, the व is some-
times changed to ब, and the word is read बा ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=639-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

