वारक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Opposing, obstructing, an obstacle or agent of
resistance.
	 m. (-कः)
	 1. A horse's paces.
	 2. A horse.
	 n. (-कं)
	 1. The
seat of pain.
	 2. A sort of fragrant grass: see वाल.
 E. वृ to choose,
&c., ण्वुल् aff.
