वारकीर m. (-रः)
	 1. A wife's brother.
	 2. Submarine fire.
	 3. A louse.
	 4. A
small comb.
	 5. A horse of high spirit, a war-horse, a charger.
	 6. A
bearer of burthens, a porter.
 E. वार an obstacle, कॄ to scatter,
aff. अच् ।
