	 2. Defence, protecting, guarding.
	 3. Warding off a blow,
guarding, warding.
	 m. (-णः)
	 1. Armour, a cuirass or mail for the
body.
	 2. An elephant.
 E. वॄ to cover or screen, to defend, aff. ल्युट् ।
