<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाशा
वाशा f. (-शा) A plant, (Justicia ganderussa:) see वास and वासक; also
with कन् added वाशिका । “वाकस गाछ ।”
