<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाशित|वाशितं|वाशितः
वाशित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Perfumed, scented.
	 2. Sung, called, cried.
	 n.
(-तं) The cry of birds or animals.
	 f. (-ता)
	 1. A woman.
	 2. A female-
elephant.
 E. वाष् to call, or वास् to perfume, aff. क्त, and ष or स
changed to श ।
