<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाष्प|वाष्पं|वाष्पः
वाष्प(स्प) m. (-ष्पः or स्पः)
	 1. Vapour, hot mist, steam, &c.
	 2. A tear.
	 3.
Iron.
	 f. (-ष्पी) A drug.
 E. वा to go, or वै to dry, aff. प, form irr.,
also बाष्प, as derived from बाध् to oppose, and ध changed to ष ।
