<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्
वास् r. 10th cl. (वासयति-ते)
	 1. To introduce another quality, but espe-
cially fragrant odors, to perfume, to incense, to fumigate, &c.
	 2.
To steal, to infuse.
	 3. To season, to spice. (ऋ) वासृ r. 4th cl. (वास्यते)
To sound, especially as a bird.
