<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासक|वासकः
वासक mf. (-कः-सका or सिका)
	 1. A shrub, (Justicia ganderussa.)
	 2.
Perfuming.
 E. वास् to perfume, aff. ण्वुल् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=647-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासकसज्जा
वासकसज्जा f. (-ज्जा) A woman dressed with all her ornaments, and hav-
ing her apartments, &c. decorated to receive her lover.
 E. वास clo-
thes, कन् pleonasm, and सज्जा accoutrements; also with कन् added,
वासकसज्जिका ।
