<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासव|वासवः
वासव m. (-वः) INDRA.
	 f. (-वी) The mother of VYĀSA.
 E. वसु a VASU,
अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=648-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
