विंशतीश|विंशतीशः
विंशतीश m. (-शः) A governor of twenty villages.
 E. विंशति, ईश sovereign;
also विंशतीशिन् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=649-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
