<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकङ्कत|विकंकत|विकंकतः|विकङ्कतः
विकङ्कत m. (-तः) A small tree.
 E. वि apart, ककि to go or grow, अतच्
aff.; or वि a bird, ककि, &c. as before; on which the birds roost.
