विकच|विकचः
विकच mfn. (-चः-चा-चं)
	 1. Blown, opened, expanded, (as a flower, &c.)
2. Bald, having little or no hair on the head.
	 m. (-चः)
	 1. A
Bauddha mendicant.
	 2. The planet KETU, or the personified
descending node.
 E. वि apart, separate, कच् to go, aff. अच्; or वि
privative, and कच hair.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=649-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
