विकट|विकटः
विकट mfn. (-टः-टा-टं)
	 1. Large, great, broad.
	 2. Formidable, frightful,
hideous, horrible.
	 3. Large-toothed.
	 4. Beautiful, pleasing.
	 5.
Changed in form or appearance.
	 6. Obscure, obsolete.
	 n. (-टं) A
boil, a tumour.
	 f. (-टा) A female divinity peculiar to the
Bauddhas.
 E. वि implying separation or expansion, कट् to go
or be, aff. अच्, or with कटच् aff.
