विकण्टक|विकण्टकः
विकण्टक m. (-कः) A herbaceous plant, (Hedysarum alhagi.)
 E. वि ex-
panding, कण्ट a thorn, कन् added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=649-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकत्थन|विकत्थनं
विकत्थन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं)
	 1. Speaking idly.
	 2. Praising ironically.
	 3.
Vaunting, boastful.
	 n. (-नं)
	 1. Irony, ironical or unmerited praise.
2. Praise in general.
	 3. Assigning anything to an unreal origin.
4. Boasting.
	 5. Repeating, proclaiming.
 E. वि implying difference
or extension, and कत्थन praising.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=649-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकत्थनीय
विकत्थनीय mfn. (-यः-या-यं)
	 1. To be praised, commendable.
	 2. Ridiculous,
to be praised ironically.
 E. वि before, कत्थ् to praise, अनीयर् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=649-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकत्था
विकत्था f. (-त्था)
	 1. Praise.
	 2. Irony, ironical praise.
	 3. Boasting.
	 4.
Repeating, proclaiming.
 E. वि, कत्थ् to praise, अङ् and टाप् affs.
