<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकम्प|विकंप
विकम्प mfn. (-म्पः-म्पा-म्पं)
	 1. Trembling.
	 2. Heaving.
	 3. Unsteady, not
firm or continued.
	 4. Shrinking from.
 E. वि, and कम्प trembling.
