विकाशिन् mfn. (-शी-शिनी-शि) Expanding, spreading, opening.
 E. वि
before, कश् to go, aff. घिनुण्; or काश, णिनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=650-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकाषिन्
विकाषिन् mfn. (-षी-षिणी-षि) Expanding, &c.
 E. वि before, कष् to go, aff. घिनुण् ।
