<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकासिन्
विकासिन् mfn. (-सी-सिनी-सि) Expanding, opening, budding, blowing.
E. वि before, कस् to go, aff. घिनुण्; also with कश् or कष् the same,
विकाशिन् and विकाषिन् as above.
