विकिर|विकिरः
विकिर m. (-रः)
	 1. A bird in general.
	 2. A well.
	 3. A fallen fragment,
a scattered portion.
	 4. Scattering.
	 5. A tree.
 E. वि apart, &c., कॄ
to scatter, क aff.
