विकृत|विकृतं
विकृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Entertaining the feeling of disgust, averse,
estranged.
	 2. Sick, diseased.
	 3. Altered, changed, either in
form or feeling.
	 4. Imperfect, unfinished, incomplete.
	 5. Over-
come by feeling or passion.
	 6. Strange, extraordinary.
	 7. Loath-
some, hideous.
	 n. (-तं)
	 1. Disgust, aversion.
	 2. Sickness.
	 3. Change.
E. वि implying reverse, and कृत made.
