<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकृताकार
विकृताकार mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Changed in aspect, form, or appearance. E.
विकृत and आकार form; also विकृताकृति ।
