विकृति|विकृतिः
विकृति f. (-तिः-ती)
	 1. Change of any kind, as of purpose, mind, form,
nature, &c., either permanent or temporary.
	 2. Sickness, disease,
change from the natural or healthy state.
	 3. Fear, apprehension.
4. Spirituous liquor.
	 5. A species of metre: the stanza consists of
four lines of two syllables each, variously arranged.
 E. वि implying
alteration or reverse, कृ to make, aff. क्तिन् ।
