<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकोष|विकोषः
विकोष mfn. (-षः-षा-षं) Uncovered, denuded, unsheathed.
 E. वि pri-
vative, and कोष a sheath, a cover; also विकोश ।
