<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रममाण
विक्रममाण mfn. (-णः-णा-णं)
	 1. Going, proceeding.
	 2. Overpowering.
 E. वि
before, क्रम् to go, शानच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=651-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
