विच्
विच्(औइर्)औ विचिर् r. 7th cl. (विनक्ति विंक्ते)
	 1. To differ, to be sepa-
rate or distinct.
	 2. To divide, to separate, especially in judgment.
to discriminate, to judge. With वि, 1. To divide.
	 2. To discrimi-
nate.
	 3. To describe.
	 4. To tear up, to remove.
