विच्छित्ति|विच्छित्तिः
विच्छित्ति f. (-त्तिः)
	 1. Cutting, cutting off, excision.
	 2. Dividing, frac-
ture.
	 3. Separation or absence.
	 4. Loss, disappearance, destruc-
tion.
	 5. Cæsura, pause in a verse.
	 6. The boundary or limits of a
house, &c.
	 7. A property of the Nāyīkā or mistress, carelessness
or irregularity in dress and decoration through flurry and agita-
tion.
	 7. Colouring the body with coloured unguents.
 E. वि before,
छिद् to cut, aff. क्तिन् ।
