	 1. Cut, separated, severed.
	 2. Absent or sepa-
rated from.
	 3. Divided, parted, portioned.
	 4. Shared, divided
equally.
	 5. Crooked, curved.
	 6. Scattered, dispersed.
	 7. Hidden
or cut off from view, intercepted.
	 8. Broken.
	 9. Ceased, ended.
	 10.
Smeared with unguents.
 E. वि apart, छिद् to cut, aff. क्त ।
