विज्
विज्(औ इर)औविजिर r. 3rd cl. (वेवेक्ति, वेविक्ते)
	 1. To be distinct or separate,
to differ.
	 2. To separate or divide, especially by reason; to judge,
to distinguish, to discriminate. (ओ, ई,) ओविजी r. 6th cl. (विजते, or
usually with उद् prefixed उद्विजते) also r. 7th cl. (विनक्ति)
	 1. To fear,
to be afraid.
	 2. To tremble with fear.
	 3. To shake or tremble.
	 4.
To be agitated or distressed. With उद्, 1. To fear.
	 2. To be dis-
gusted.
	 3. To be sorry.
	 4. To frighten.
