विडम्बित|विडंबित|विडम्बितः
विडम्बित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Low, poor, abject, distressed.
	 2. Vexed,
mortified.
	 3. Assumed, put on, (as a borrowed form, &c.) simu-
lated, transformed.
	 4. Copied, imitated.
	 5. Ridiculed, derided.
	 6.
Deceived.
 E. वि before, डिवि to heap, aff. क्त ।
