विडालक n. (-कं)
	 1. Yellow orpiment.
	 m. (-कः)
	 1. Application of oint-
ment to the external part of the eye, especially to the eyelids, of
which the lashes have fallen off or been ulcerated.
	 2. A cat.
 E. कन्
added to the last.
