<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वितान|वितानं|वितानः
वितान mfn. (-नः-ना-नं)
	 1. Empty, pithless, sapless.
	 2. Empty, vacant.
3. Dull, stupid.
	 4. Wicked, abandoned.
	 mn. (-नः-नं)
	 1. Spreading,
expansion.
	 2. An awning, a canopy.
	 3. Sacrifice, offering, oblation.
4. The sacrificial hearth or hole in which the sacred fires are
kept.
	 5. A heap, a quantity.
	 6. Season, opportunity.
	 n. (-नं)
	 1. A
form of the Anuṣṭubh metre or verse of four lines of eight
syllables each; each line of the stanza named Vitāna consists of
two Iambics, one Trochee, and one Spondee.
	 3. Leisure, rest,
interval of occupation.
 E. वि before, तन् to spread, aff. घञ् ।
