वितानक|वितानकं|वितानकः
वितानक n. (-कं)
	 1. An awning, a canopy, especially a cloth spread
over a large open hall or court, or any open space in which dancing
singing, &c. are exhibited, at solemn or religious festivals.
	 2. A
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=656-b" target="_blank">Page656-b+ 60</a>]
heap, a quantity.
	 3. An expanse.
 E. कन् added to the preceeding.
