विदित|विदितं|विदितः
विदित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Known, understood.
	 2. Promised, agreed,
assented.
	 3. Represented, submitted, solicited.
	 4. Apprised, in-
formed, who or what knows.
	 m. (-तः) A sage, a learned man.
	 n.
(-तं) Information, representation.
 E. विद् to know, &c., aff. क्त ।
