विदुर|विदुरः
विदुर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Wise, knowing, intelligent.
	 m. (-रः)
	 1. A liber-
tine, an intriguer.
	 2. A learned or clever man.
	 3. The younger bro-
ther and counsellor of DHRITARĀSHTRA.
 E. विद् to know, कुरच् aff.
