विदूराद्रि|विदूराद्रिः
विदूराद्रि m. (-द्रिः) The name of a mountain.
 E. विदूर remote, and अद्रि a mountain.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=657-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदूषक|विदूषकः
विदूषक mfn. (-कः-षिका-कं)
	 1. Facetious, witty, a wag, a jester.
	 2. Cen-
sorious, detracting, a detractor or abuser of other people.
	 m. (-कः)
1. An actor, especially an interlocutor with the audience between
the acts or scenes, a jester, a buffoon.
	 2. (In dramatic language,)
The humble and jocose companion of the principal character.
	 3.
A catamite.
	 f. (-की) Corrupting, contaminating.
 E. वि before, दूष्
to be or make bad, aff. क्वुन् ।
