विदेह|विदेहः
विदेह mfn. (-हः-हा-हं) Incorporeal, without body.
	 m. (-हः) A sovereign
of the family of JANAKA, king of Mithilā.
	 f. (-हा) A district in
the province of Behār, the same as the ancient Mithilā, or the
modern Tirhut.
 E. वि privative, and देह the body.
