विद्ध|विद्धः
विद्ध mfn. (-द्धः-द्धा-द्धं)
	 1. Pierced, perforated.
	 2. Thrown, cast, directed,
sent.
	 3. Like, resembling.
	 4. Opposed, impeded.
	 5. Beaten, whip-
ped.
	 m. (-द्धः) A tree, (Echites scholaris.)
	 n. (-द्धं) A wound.
 E. विध्
to pierce, or व्यध् to beat, aff. क्त ।
