<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विधाय
विधाय Ind. Having taken, assumed, put on, placed, &c.
 E. वि before,
धा to have, ल्यप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=659-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विधायक|विधायकः
विधायक mfn. (-कः-यिका-कं) Consigning, delivering, one who entrusts or
deposits anything, or causes it to be fixed or secure.
	 2. Arrang-
ing, disposing.
	 3. Doing, performing.
	 4. Enjoining.
 E. वि before, धा
to have, (causal form,) aff. ण्वुल् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=659-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विधायकत्व
विधायकत्व n. (-त्वं)
	 1. Consignment or delivery of anything, making
anything firm or secure.
 E. त्व added to the last.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=659-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विधायिन्
विधायिन् mfn. (-यी-यिनी-यि)
	 1. Causing, occasioning, making.
	 2. Pla-
cing, fixing, securing.
	 3. Delivering, entrusting.
	 4. Establishing
as a rule or law.
 E. वि before, धा to have, causal form, aff. घिनुण् ।
