<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विधिदर्शिन्
विधिदर्शिन् m. (-र्शी) A priest whose business at a sacrifice is to see that
every thing is done according to the prescribed rules, and to
correct any deviation from them.
 E. विधि a sacred precept, and
दर्शिन् who sees; also विधिदर्शक, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=659-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
