<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विधियोग|विधियोगः
विधियोग m. (-गः)
	 1. The occurence of predoomed events.
	 2. Combina-
tion for any act or rite.
 E. विधि and योग union, accession.
