विधूत|विधूतं
विधूत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Shaken.
	 2. Trembling, tremulous.
	 3. Unsteady.
4. Abandoned.
	 5. Tossed, waving.
 E. वि before, धू to agitate, aff. क्त ।
