(-क्षः)
	 1. An enemy, an adversary.
	 2. A disputant, an opponent.
3. Exception, (in grammar, &c.)
	 4. (In logic.) An argument or
syllogism in which the proposition to be maintained is wanting.
E. वि implying opposite, contrary, and पक्ष part or side.
