विपरीत|विपरीतः
विपरीत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Reverse, inverse, opposite, contrary.
	 2.
Wrong, incorrect.
	 3. Crossed.
	 4. Disagreeable, inauspicious.
	 f.
(-ता) A lewd woman, a dishonest wife.
	 m. (-तः) A particular mode
of coitus.
 E. वि and परि implying contrariety or adverse, before
इत gone.
