<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विपरीतता
विपरीतता f. (-ता) Contrariety, reverse or opposite state or condition.
E. विपरीत and तल् aff.; also with त्व, विपरीतत्वं ।
