<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विपव्य|विपव्यं
विपव्य mfn. (-व्यः-व्या-व्यं) To be cleansed or purified.
 E. वि before, पूञ् to purify, aff. क्यप् ।
