<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विपश्चित्
विपश्चित् m. (-श्चित) A Paṇḍit, a learned Brāhman, a teacher.
 E. वि and
प, before चि to collect, affs. क्विप् and तुक् aug.; form irr.
