<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विपश्यिन्
विपश्यिन् m. (-श्यी) A Bauddha saint, the first of the seven principal
Bauddhas.
 E. विपश्य and इनि aff.
