विपाक|विपाकः
विपाक m. (-कः)
	 1. Cooking, dressing.
	 2. Ripening, maturing.
	 3. Fla-
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=663-a" target="_blank">Page663-a+ 60</a>]
vour, taste.
	 4. Unexpected or improbable result.
	 5. Poverty, dis-
tress.
	 6. Change of form or state.
	 7. The consequences of actions,
either in this or in a former birth; the operation or time in ma-
turing their results.
	 8. Assimilation of food, its conversion into
a state differing from its original one, digestion.
 E. वि before, पच्
to ripen, aff. घञ् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=662-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

