विप्लव|विप्लवः
विप्लव m. (-वः)
	 1. Tumult, confusion, trouble.
	 2. Evil, calamity.
	 3. Ra-
pine, extortion.
	 4. Sin, wickedness.
	 5. Predatory or irregular
warfare.
	 6. Affray, scuffle.
	 7. Terrifying an enemy by shouts and
gestures.
	 8. Confusion, perplexity, (of thought or speech.)
	 9.
Floating about.
	 10. The rust, (of a mirror.)
	 11. Loss, destruction.
E. वि before, प्लु to go, aff. अप् ।
