विप्लाव|विप्लावः
विप्लाव m. (-वः)
	 1. Deluging, inundating.
	 2. Devastating.
	 3. Causing
tumult or public disturbance.
	 4. A horse's canter or gallop.
 E. वि,
and प्लु to go, aff. घञ् ।
