	 2. Committing any crime.
	 3. Contrary,
adverse, averse.
	 4. Inundated, immersed.
	 5. Devastated, ravaged.
6. Disturbed, confounded.
	 7. Ruined, disgraced.
	 8. Disappeared.
9. Disfigured, obscured.
 E. वि before, प्लु to go, aff. क्त ।
