विभागपत्रिका
विभागपत्रिका f. (-का) A deed of partition.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=664-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विभागभाक्
विभागभाक् m. (-भाक्) One who shares in a portion of property already
distributed, applied especially to a son by a father and mother of
the same tribe, born subsequent to a distribution of property
amongst his parents and brethren, in which case he inherits the
portion allotted or reserved to the parents.
 E. विभाग a portion, and
भाक् who shares.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=664-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विभागशस्
विभागशस् Ind. Proportionately, according to a part or share.
 E. विभाग, and शसि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=664-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विभाजन|विभाजनं
विभाजन n. (-नं) Distributing.
