<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विभाज्य|विभाज्यं
विभाज्य mfn. (-ज्यः-ज्या-ज्यं) Divisible, portionable, what may be divided
or apportioned.
 E. वि severally, भज् to divide, ण्यत् aff.
