<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विभात्
विभात् mfn. (-भान्-भान्ती or भाती-भात्) Shining, splendid.
 E. वि before, भा
to shine, शतृ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=664-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विभात|विभातं
विभात n. (-तं) Dawn, day-break.
 E. वि before, भा to shine, aff. क्त; also विभातक n. (-कं) ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=664-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विभाव|विभावः
विभाव m. (-वः)
	 1. A friend or acquaintance.
	 2. One of the Bhāyas or
classes of properties into which the objects of poetical composi-
tion are divided; the causative or exciting property, as dress,
perfumes, &c. of amorous desire; extravagant gesture of mirth;
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=665-a" target="_blank">Page665-a+ 60</a>]
distress or pain of tenderness; arms and tumult of wrath or
heroism, &c.
 E. वि various, and भाव property, disposition.
