<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विभावन|विभावनं
विभावन nf. (-नं-ना)
	 1. Discussion, examination, discrimination.
	 2. Per-
ceiving, seeing, distinguishing.
	 3. Conceiving, imagination.
	 4.
Ascertaining or judging of facts.
	 5. Describing effects not arising.
from the usual causes, (in rhetoric.)
 E. वि before, भू in the 10th cl.
to think, &c., aff. युच् ।
