विभीतक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Beleric myrobalan, (Terminalia belerica.) E.
विभीत fearless, कन् aff. “वहेडा इति भाषा ।”
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=665-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
