विभीषण mfn. (-णः-णा-णं) Fearful, formidable, terrific, horrible.
	 nf.
(-णं-णा) The property of exciting fear.
	 m. (-णः) The brother of
RĀVANA.
 E. वि, भी to fear, युच् aff. षुक् augment.
