<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विभीषिका
विभीषिका f. (-का)
	 1. Terror.
	 2. A means of terrifying.
 E. वि + भी-णिच्-सुक्-ण्वुल् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=665-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विभु|विभुः
विभु mfn. (-भुः-भुः or भ्वी-भु)
	 1. Omnipresent, all-pervading.
	 2. Always,
eternal.
	 3. Firm, solid, hard.
	 4. Powerful.
	 m. (-भुः)
	 1. A master,
an owner.
	 2. ŚIVA.
	 3. BRAHMĀ.
	 4. VIṢṆU.
	 5. A servant.
	 6.
Æther.
	 7. Space.
	 8. Time.
	 9. The soul.
 E. वि before भू to be,
aff. डु ।
