विभ्रान्तशील|विभ्रांतशील|विभ्रान्तशीलः
विभ्रान्तशील mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) Mad, drunk, intoxicated or insane.
	 m. (-लः)
1. A monkey.
	 2. The disk of the sun or moon.
 E. विभ्रान्त wander-
ing, and शील disposition.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=665-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विभ्रान्ति|विभ्रांति|विभ्रांतिः|विभ्रान्तिः
विभ्रान्ति f. (-न्तिः)
	 1. Error, confusion.
	 2. Hurry, flurry, precipitation.
3. Whirling, going round.
 E. वि before भ्रम् to err, aff. क्तिन् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=665-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विमत|विमतः
विमत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Disliking, averse or hostile to.
	 2. Disagreeing,
of a different opinion.
	 m. (-तः) An enemy.
 E. वि adverse, and मत
disposed.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=665-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विमति|विमतिः
विमति f. (-तिः)
	 1. Dislike, aversion.
	 2. Difference of opinion, dissent.
3. Stupidity.
 E. वि and मति mind.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=665-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विमत्सर
विमत्सर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Unenvious, unambitious.
 E. वि priv., मत्सर envious.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=665-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विमद
विमद f. (-दा)
	 1. Free from intoxication.
	 2. Joyless.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=665-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विमनस्
विमनस् mfn. (-नाः-नाः-नः)
	 1. Sad, perplexed, disordered, heart-broken.
2. Changed in mind or feeling.
	 3. Averse, disliking, displeased.
4. Absent-minded, thinking of something else.
 E. वि privative and
मनस् the mind; having no mind or heart.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=665-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विमनस्क|विमनस्कः
विमनस्क mfn. (-स्कः-स्का-स्कं) Sad, bewildered, heart-broken, &c.
 E. कन्
added to the preceding.
