<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विमनीकृत
विमनीकृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Altered in mind or feeling.
	 2. Sad, sorrow-
ful.
	 3. Displeased, offended.
 E. विमनस् and कृत made with च्वि aug.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=665-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विमनीभूत
विमनीभूत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Changed in mind or feeling, &c.: see the last.
E. विमनस् and भूत become, च्वि augment.
