<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विमय|विमयः
विमय m. (-यः) Barter, exchange.
 E. वि before मि to scatter, aff. अच् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=666-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विमर्द्द|विमर्द|विमर्दः|विमर्द्दः
विमर्द्द m. (-र्द्दः)
	 1. Rubbing, friction.
	 2. The trituration of perfumes.
3. Touch, contact.
	 4. Destroying, killing.
	 5. Crushing, bruising.
6. Rubbing the body with unguents.
	 7. Conjunction of the sun
and moon.
	 8. War.
	 9. A plant, (Cassia esculenta.)
 E. वि before
मृद् to grind, aff. अच्, कन् or घञ् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=666-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विमर्द्दन|विमर्दन|विमर्दनं|विमर्द्दनं
विमर्द्दन n. (-नं)
	 1. Rubbing, pounding, grinding.
	 2. Killing, destroying.
3. The trituration of perfumes.
	 4. Conjunction of the sun and
moon, or eclipse.
 E. वि before मृद् to rub, &c. aff. ल्युट्; also विम-
र्द्दक m. (-कः) and विमर्द्दना f. (-ना) ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=666-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
