<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विमर्द्दोत्थ|विमर्दोत्थ|विमर्द्दोत्थः
विमर्द्दोत्थ m. (-त्थः) A pleasing scent.
 E. विमर्द्द rubbing, and उत्थ what rises.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=666-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विमर्श|विमर्शः
विमर्श m. (-र्शः)
	 1. Discussion, investigation, reasoning, examination by
reason.
	 2. A conflicting judgment.
	 3. The impression on the
mind of past good or evil actions.
 E. वि implying discrimination,
मृश् to perceive, aff. घञ् ।
