<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विमर्ष|विमर्षः
विमर्ष m. (-र्षः)
	 1. Irritation, impatience.
	 2. Displeasure, dissatisfaction.
3. Interruption of the prosperous course of a dramatic story, (one
