विमल|विमलं|विमलः
विमल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं)
	 1. Clean, pure, (either literally, as clothes, &c.
or figuratively, as the heart or mind.)
	 2. Beautiful.
	 3. White.
	 4.
Transparent.
	 f. (-ला)
	 1. A plant, commonly Charmaghās.
	 2. A sort
of soil.
	 m. (-लः) An Arhat or Jaina deified sage.
	 n. (-लं)
	 1. Silver-
gilt.
	 2. Talc.
 E. वि privative, मल dirt.
