<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विरत|विरतः
विरत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Stopped, ceased, rested.
 E. वि before रम् to stop or rest, aff. क्त ।
