<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विरति|विरतिः
विरति f. (-तिः)
	 1. Stop, cessation, term, rest.
	 2. End, term.
 E. वि be-
fore रम् to play, क्तिन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=667-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विरम|विरमः
विरम m. (-मः)
	 1. Cessation, stop.
	 2. Sunset.
