<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विरस|विरसः
विरस mfn. (-सः-सा-सं)
	 1. Insipid.
	 2. Painful.
	 m. (-सः) Pain.
 E. वि, रस flavour.
