<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विरह|विरहः
विरह m. (-हः)
	 1. Separation, parting, absence, especially the separa-
tion of lovers.
	 2. Forbearance, cessation, relinquishment.
 E. वि be-
fore रह् to abandon, aff. अच् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=667-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विरहज्वर|विरहज्वरः
विरहज्वर m. (-रः) The anguish of separation.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=667-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विरहय्य
विरहय्य Ind. Having abandoned.
 E. वि before, रह् to quit, causal form, ल्यप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=667-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विरहानल|विरहानलः
विरहानल m. (-लः) The fire of separation.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=667-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विरहार्त्त|विरहार्त
विरहार्त्त mfn. (-र्त्तः-र्त्ता-र्त्तं) Pained by the absence of a lover.
 E. विरह, आर्त्त pained.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=667-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विरहित|विरहितः
विरहित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Left, abandoned, deserted, relinquished.
	 2.
Void of, exempt, or free from.
 E. वि before रह् to abandon, aff. क्त ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=667-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विरहिन्
विरहिन् mfn. (-ही-हिणी-हि) Separate, sundered, absent or apart from.
f. (-हिणी)
	 1. Wages, hire.
	 2. A woman absent from her husband
or lover.
 E. विरह absence, णिनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=667-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विरहोत्कण्ठ|विरहोत्कंठ
विरहोत्कण्ठ Adj. Pining away in absence.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=667-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विरहोत्कण्ठिता|विरहोत्कंठिता
विरहोत्कण्ठिता f. (-ता) A woman whose lover or husband is absent. E.
विरह separation, उत्कण्ठित afficted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=667-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विराग|विरागः
विराग m. (-गः)
	 1. The absence of desire or passion, indifference, philoso-
phy, the disregard of all sensual enjoyment either in this world
or the next.
	 2. Change of colour.
	 3. Dissatisfaction.
 E. वि priva-
tive, and राग passion, desire.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=667-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विरागार्ह|विरागार्हः
विरागार्ह mfn. (-र्हः-र्हा-र्हं) Void of passion or desire.
 E. विराग the absence
of desire, and अह worthy.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=667-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विरागिन्
विरागिन् mfn. (-गी-गिणी-गि) Void of passion or desire.
 E. विराग and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=667-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विराज|विराजः
विराज m. (-राट्)
	 1. A man of the regal or military class.
	 2. Splendour,
beauty.
	 3. The body.
	 4. The first progeny of BRAHMĀ, who
having divided himself into male and female, produced from the
female, VIRĀJ; VIRĀJ then by himself produced the first Manu
or SWAYAMBHŪVA who was the progenitor of the Prajāpatis, and
the secondary framer of the visible world: in other places VIRĀJ
is the same as BRAHMĀ, and assumer of the androgynous form
in his own person.
 E. वि severally or separately, &c., राज् to shine,
aff. क्विप् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=667-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विराजत्
विराजत् mfn. (-जन्-जन्ती-जत्) Shining, splendid, handsome.
 E. वि and
राज् to shine, aff. शतृ ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=668-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विराजमान|विराजमानः
विराजमान mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Splendid, brilliant, handsome.
 E. वि before राज् to shine, शानच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=668-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विराजित|विराजितः
विराजित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Illuminated, irradiated, splendid.
	 2. Ma-
nifested, made visible.
 E. वि before राज् to shine, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=668-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विराट|विराटः
विराट m. (-टः)
	 1. A country, one of the midland division of India, pro-
bably Berār.
	 2. A sovereign.
 E. वि before रट् to sound, aff. घञ् ।
