<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विराटज|विराटजः
विराटज m. (-जः) An inferior sort of diamond, said to be found in the
country Virāṭa.
 E. विराट the country, ज produced.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=668-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विराणिन्
विराणिन् m. (-णी) An elephant.
 E. वि before रण battle, aff. अण् and इनि added.
