<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विराद्धृ
विराद्धृ mfn. (-द्धा-द्ध्री-द्धृ)
	 1. Thwarting, opposing.
	 2. Offending, injuring.
3. Abusive, calumnious.
 E. वि before राध् to accomplish, aff. तृच् ।
