<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विराध|विराधः
विराध m. (-धः)
	 1. Opposition, prevention.
	 2. Vexation, annoyance. E.
वि before राध् to accomplish, घञ् aff.
