<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विराधन|विराधनं
विराधन n. (-नं) Pain, agony, anguish.
 E. वि, राध to accomplish, ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=668-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विराध्यत्
विराध्यत् mfn. (-ध्यन्-ध्यन्ती-ध्यत्)
	 1. Opposing, thwarting.
	 2. Offending,
annoying, injuring.
 E. वि before राध् to accomplish, शतृ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=668-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विराम|विरामः
विराम m. (-मः)
	 1. End, conclusion, cessation, term.
	 2. Rest, cessation
from labour.
	 3. Stop, pause of the voice.
	 4. Interval between
words or sentences.
 E. वि before रम् to stop, aff. घञ् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=668-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विराल|विरालः
विराल m. (-लः) A cat.
 E. विडाल as above, and ड changed to र ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=668-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विराव|विरावः
विराव m. (-वः) Sound, noise.
 E. वि before रु to make a noise, aff. घञ् ।
