	 1. A
broom.
	 2. The name of a river.
	 3. Weeping, crying.
 E. विराव noise,
इनि and ङीप् affs.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=668-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विरिक्त|विरिक्तः
विरिक्त mfn. (-क्तः-क्ता-क्तं) Purged.
 E. वि before रिच् to void by stool, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=668-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विरिञ्च|विरिंच|विरिंचः|विरिञ्चः
विरिञ्च m. (-ञ्चः) BRAHMĀ: see विरिञ्चि ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=668-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विरिञ्जन
विरिञ्जन m. (-नः) BRAHMĀ. see the next.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=668-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विरिञ्चि|विरिंचि|विरिंचिः|विरिञ्चिः
विरिञ्चि m. (-ञ्चिः)
	 1. BRAHMĀ.
	 2. VIṢṆU.
	 3. ŚIVA.
 E. वि implying vari-
ous kind, (of beings,) रच् to make or create, इन् aff., the radical
vowel changed to इ and नुम् augment; also with अच् aff. विरिञ्च,
and with युच्, विरिञ्चन; some authorities omit the change of the
radical vowel, and write विरञ्च and विरञ्चि, but these seem to be
less accurate.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=668-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विरिब्ध|विरिब्धः
विरिब्ध m. (-ब्धः) A note, a tone.
 E. वि before रेभ् to sound, क्त aff., इट् aug.; form irr.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=668-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विरुग्न
विरुग्न mfn. (-ग्नः-ग्ना-ग्नं)
	 1. Broken, bent.
	 2. Blunted.
	 3. Destroyed.
 E. वि
before रुज् to be sick, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=668-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विरुत
विरुत f. (-ता)
	 1. Screamed.
	 2. Resounding.
	 n. (-तं)
	 1. Singing, chirp-
ing.
	 2. Din, noise, clamour.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=668-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विरुद|विरुदं|विरुदः
विरुद m. (-दः)
	 1. Crying.
	 2. Proclaiming.
 E. वि, रुद् to cry, क aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=668-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विरुद्ध|विरुद्धः
विरुद्ध mfn. (-द्धः-द्धा-द्धं)
	 1. Opposed, hindered.
	 2. Reverse, contrary, oppo-
site.
	 3. Inconsistent, (in argument,) incongruous, a non sequitur.
4. Opposed in quality. as sweet with sour, &c.
	 5. Disagreeing
with each other, (as articles of medicine or food.)
	 6. Hostile, ad-
verse.
	 7. Excluded, disqualified.
	 8. Surrounded, blockaded.
	 9.
Proving the reverse, as a Hetu, (in logic.)
 E. वि before रुध् to
stop, aff. क्त ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=668-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विरुद्धता
विरुद्धता f. (-ता)
	 1. Opposition, contrariety.
	 2. Incongruity.
	 3. Enmity. E.
तल् added to विरुद्ध; also with त्व, विरुद्धत्वं ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=668-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विरुद्धभुज्
विरुद्धभुज् mfn. (-भुक) Eating incompatible things.
 E. विरुद्ध and भुज् who eats.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=668-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विरुद्धभोजन
विरुद्धभोजन n. (-नं) Incompatible food.
 E. विरुद्ध and भोजन eating.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=668-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विरुद्धान्न
