<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विलोमविधि|विलोमविधिः
विलोमविधि f. (-धिः)
	 1. Inverted or reversed ceremony.
	 2. (In arith-
metic,) Rule of Inversion.
 E. विलोम and विधि rule.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=670-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विलोल|विलोलः
विलोल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं)
	 1. Shaking, trembling, tremulous.
	 2. Fickle,
unsteady.
	 3. Rolling, (as the eyes.)
	 4. Tossing, waving.
 E. वि before
लुल् to agitate, aff. अच् or घञ् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=670-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विलोलता
विलोलता f. (-ता)
	 1. Tremulousness.
	 2. Unsteadiness.
	 3. Rolling, (of
the eyes.)
 E. तल् added to the last; also with त्व, विलोलत्वं ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=670-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विलोलन|विलोलनं
विलोलन n. (-नं) Shaking, stirring, agitating.
 E. वि before लुल् to agitate,
causal v., aff. ल्युट् ।
