<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विल्व|विल्वं|विल्वः
विल्व m. (-ल्वः) A fruit tree, commonly named Bel, (Ægle marmelos.)
n. (-ल्वं)
	 1. The fruit of the Bel.
	 2. A measure, the same as the
Pala.
 E. विल् to divide, Unādi aff. वन् ।
