विवक्षित|विवक्षितः
विवक्षित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Wished, desired.
	 2. Purposed, intended.
	 3.
Literal, not figurative, (a word or phrase.)
	 4. Intended to be
spoken or said.
	 5. Favourite.
	 n. (-तं) An object desired.
	 f. (-ता)
Purpose, wish, what one wishes to declare or speak.
 E. वच् to
speak, desiderative form, क्त aff.
