विवर|विवरं|विवरः
विवर n. (-रं)
	 1. A hole, a chasm, a vacuity.
	 2. Fault, defect.
	 3. Sepa-
ration, disjunction.
	 4. A solitary place.
	 5. The number “nine.”
E. वि before वृञ् to choose, to cover, &c., and अच् aff.
