विवरण|विवरणं
विवरण n. (-णं)
	 1. Explanation, exposition, gloss, comment.
	 2. Inter-
pretation, translation.
	 3. Uncovering, exposing, laying bare or
open.
	 4. Detailing, describing.
 E. वि before वृ to select, (the mean-
ing,) aff. ल्युट् ।
