विवर्ण|विवर्णः
विवर्ण mfn. (-र्णः-र्णा-र्णं)
	 1. Low, vile.
	 2. Bad coloured.
	 3. Wanting
colour.
	 4. Changing colour.
	 m. (-र्णः) A man of a low caste, one of
degrading occupation, an outcaste.
 E. वि privative and वर्ण caste.
