<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विवर्त्त|विवर्त|विवर्तः|विवर्त्तः
विवर्त्त m. (-त्तः)
	 1. Assemblage, collection, heap or multitude.
	 2. Dan-
cing.
	 3. Going or turning round, revolving, returning.
	 4. Human
error, worldly ignorance, the confounding of truth and falsehood,
or the mistaking or unreal objects and conceiving them to be
what they are not, as mirage for water, a rope for a snake, &c.
5. Modification, various or altered state or condition.
 E. वि before
वृत् to be, aff. घञ् ।
