विवर्त्तन n. (-नं)
	 1. Going round, circumambulating, an alter, &c.
	 2. Re-
volving, turning round.
	 3. Whirling, causing to go round.
	 4.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=671-a" target="_blank">Page671-a+ 60</a>]
Returning.
	 5. Passing through in succession, as various lives,
various hells, &c.
	 6. Being, abiding.
	 7. Reverential salutation. E.
वि before वृत् to be, aff. ल्युट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=670-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

