<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विवर्द्धित
विवर्द्धित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Increased, enlarged.
	 2. Furthered, advanced.
3. Gratified.
	 4. Cut, divided.
 E. वि, वृध् to increase, to cut, क्त aff.
