<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विवश|विवशः
विवश mfn. (-शः-शा-शं)
	 1. Subject, subjected.
	 2. Independent.
	 3. Appre-
hensive of death, unwilling though about to die.
	 4. Desirous of
death, sedate at that period, or having the soul free from worldly
cares and fears.
	 5. Uncontrolled, unrestrained, unsubdued.
	 6.
Fainted, unconscious.
 E. वि before वश् to wish, aff. अच् ।
