<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विवादानुगत|विवादानुगतः
विवादानुगत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Disputed, litigated.
 E. विवाद a lawsuit, अनु
according to, and गत gone.
