	 1. Lonely, solitary, desert.
	 2. Pure, faultless.
3. Separated, distinguished, disjoined, detached.
	 4. Discrimina-
tive, judicious, a judge.
	 5. Discriminated, judged.
	 6. Profound,
(as judgment or thought.)
	 7. Intent on.
	 n. (-क्तं)
	 1. Loneliness.
	 2.
A solitary place.
	 f. (-क्ता) A woman disliked by her husband. E.
वि before विच् to be or make separate, aff. क्त ।
