<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्
विश् m. (-विट्)
	 1. A man of the mercantile tribe.
	 2. A man in
general.
	 f. (-विट्)
	 1. Entrance.
	 2. A daughter.
	 3. Feces, ordure.
	 4.
People, subjects.
 E. विश् to enter, aff. क्विप् ।
