	 m. (-द्रुः)
	 1. A dog trained for the
chase.
	 2. Sound, noise.
 E. विश्व all, कन् pleonasm, द्रु to run, to pur-
sue, aff. डु; or विश्व with कदि to cry or call, aff. डु and र augment.
