विषयात्मक
विषयात्मक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Identical with or affecting sensual or
worldly objects.
 E. विषय and आत्मक own.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=676-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषयाभिरति|विषयाभिरतिः
विषयाभिरति f. (-तिः) Attachment to the objects of sense.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=676-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषयायिन्
विषयायिन् m. (-यी)
	 1. A king.
	 2. An organ of sense.
	 3. KĀMADEVA.
	 4.
An epicurean, a sensualist, one heedful of objects of sense or
attentive to worldly objects.
	 5. A materialist, one who disbelieves
the existence of that which is not cognizable by the senses. E.
विषय an object of sense, अय् to go, to follow, and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=676-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषयासक्त
विषयासक्त mfn. (-क्तः-क्ता-क्तं) Attached to objects of sense, devoted to
the world.
 E. विषय and आसक्त attached to.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=676-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषयिन्
विषयिन् mfn. (-यी-यिणी-यि)
	 1. Attached to objects of sense, carnal, sen-
sual.
	 2. Conversant with or interested in worldly occupations or
enjoyments.
	 n. (-यि) An organ of sense.
	 m. (-यी)
	 1. A king.
	 2.
The deity KĀMA.
	 3. A sensualist.
	 4. A materialist, one who
denies the existence of any thing which is not an object of sense.
5. A man of business.
 E. विषय an organ of sense, aff. इन् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=676-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषयोपसेवा
विषयोपसेवा f. (-वा) Sensuality.
 E. विषय and उपसेवा addiction to.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=676-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषल|विषलं|विषलः
विषल m. (-लः) Poison, venom.
 E. विष poison, लच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=676-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषविद्या
विषविद्या f. (-द्या) The administration of antidotes, the cure of poisons
by drugs or charms.
 E. विष poison, विद्या science.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=676-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषविधान
विषविधान n. (-नं) Administering poison judicially, or by way of ordeal.
E. विष, विधान rule.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=676-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषवेग|विषवेगः
विषवेग m. (-गः) Absorption of venom, as shown by some bodily effects
or changes.
 E. विष poison, and वेग natural excretion.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=676-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषवैद्य|विषवैद्यः
विषवैद्य m. (-द्यः) A dealer in antidotes, one professing by charms, &c.
to cure the bite of a snake.
 E. विष poison, and वैद्य physician.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=676-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषशालूक|विषशालूकः
विषशालूक m. (-कः) The root of the lotus.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=676-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषशूक|विषशूकः
विषशूक m. (-कः) A wasp.
 E. विष venom, and शूक a parrot.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=676-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषशृङ्गिन्|विषशृंगिन्
विषशृङ्गिन् m. (-ङ्गी) A wasp.
 E. विष poison, शृङ्ग a horn, and इनि poss. aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=676-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषसूचक|विषसूचकः
विषसूचक m. (-कः) The Greek partridge, (Perdix rufa.) “चकोर खगे” E.
विष poison, and सूचक informer.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=676-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषसृक्कन्
विषसृक्कन् m. (-क्का) A wasp.
 E. विष poison, सृक्कन् the corner of the mouth.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=676-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषहर|विषहरः
विषहर mfn. (-रः-री-रं) An antidote, removing venom.
	 f. (-रा or री) The
goddess of the serpent race, the sister of VĀSUKI, and wife of
JARATKĀRU.
 E. विष venom, हृ to take, aff. अप् or टच् ।
