<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषान्तक|विषांतक|विषान्तकः
विषान्तक m. (-कः) ŚIVA.
 E. विष poison, अन्तक destroyer; having swallow-
ed the poison that was produced at the churning of the ocean.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=677-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषापह|विषापहः
विषापह mfn. (-हः-हा-हं) Antidotic, an antidote.
	 f. (-हा) A kind of birth-
wort, (Aristolochia Indica.)
 E. विष poison, and अपह removing.
