<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषायुध|विषायुधः
विषायुध m. (-धः) A snake.
 E. विष poison, and आयुध a weapon.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=677-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषार|विषारः
विषार m. (-रः) A snake.
 E. विष poison, ऋ to go, aff. अच् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=677-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषालु
विषालु mfn. (-लुः-लुः-लु) Venomous, poisonous.
 E. विष, and आलुच् aff.
