<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषास्य|विषास्यः
विषास्य m. (-स्यः) A snake.
	 f. (-स्या) Marking-nut plant, (Semicarpus
anacardium.)
 E. विष poison, and आस्य face.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=677-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषीदत्
विषीदत् mfn. (-दन्-दन्ती-दत्) Sorrowing, despairing.
 E. वि before षद् to go, शतृ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=677-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषु
विषु Ind.
	 1. Many, various.
	 2. Equally, same, like.
 E. विष, कु aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=677-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषुण|विषुणः
विषुण mfn. (-णः-णा-णं) Having or possessing various or uniform
motion or extension.
 E. विष्वञ्च् going every where, न poss. aff.,
and the final consonant of the primitive rejected.
