<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषुवत्|विषुवन्त्
विषुवत् n. (-वत्) The equinoctial point.
 E. विषु equally, (long, the day
and night,) and मतुप् poss. aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=677-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषुवदिन
विषुवदिन n. (-नं) The day of the equinox.
 E. विषुव and दिन day.
