विष्टब्ध mfn. (-ब्धः-ब्धा-ब्धं)
	 1. Hindered, obstructed.
	 2. Stayed, fixed, firm,
well-supported.
	 3. Placed in or upon.
	 4. Paralysed, made stiff or
motionless.
 E. वि before स्तभि to stop, क्त aff.
