	 3. A
seat, a stool, a chair, a couch, &c.
	 4. The seat of the Brāhman,
either real or in effigy, as presiding at a sacrifice.
	 5. A bed.
	 6. A
seat made of twenty-five straws of Kuśa grass tied up in a sheaf.
E. वि before स्तृ to spread, aff. अप् and स changed to ष ।
