विष्टार|विष्टारः
विष्टार m. (-रः) A form of metre, a species of the order termed Panktī,
consisting of a verse of four lines, the first and last of which
consist of eight syllables each, and the second and third of twelve
each.
 E. वि before स्तृ to spread, aff. घञ्, and स changed to ष ।
