वीटिका
वीटिका f. (-का)
	 1. The betel-plant, (Piper betel.)
	 2. The preparation
of the Areca nut with spices and chunam, and enveloped in the
leaf of the Piper betel, Betel, Pāun.
	 3. A tye, a fastening.
 E. वि,
इट् to go, aff. क्वुन्, fem. form; also with इन् or ङीप् aff. वीटि or वीटी ।
