वीत|वीतं|वीतः
वीत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Gone, departed.
	 2. Exempt or freed from.
	 3.
Loosed, let go, unbound.
	 4. Tranquil, quiet, tame.
	 5. Excepted.
	 6.
Approved, liked, accepted.
	 7. Unfit for war.
	 m. (-तः)
	 1. A horse
or elephant, untrained to or unfit for war.
	 2. Goading an ele-
phant.
 E. वी to go, aff. क्त ।
