वीतंस|वीतंसः
वीतंस m. (-सः)
	 1. A cage, a chain or net, &c. for confining birds or
beasts.
	 2. An enclosure for tranquillising or taming them, an
aviary, a menagerie.
	 3. A place for keeping game, a preserve.
 E. वि
before तसि to adorn, aff. घञ्; the vowel of the prefix made long.
