वीतशोक|वीतशोकः
वीतशोक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Free from care or sorrow.
	 m. (-कः) The Aśoka
tree, (Jonesia Aśoka.)
 E. वीत gone, and शोक sorrow.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=681-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वीतस्पृह
वीतस्पृह mfn. (-हः-हा-हं) Free from desire.
 E. वीत, and स्पृहा desire.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=681-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वीति|वीतिः
वीति f. (-तिः)
	 1. Going, moving, motion.
	 2. Eating.
	 3. Engendering,
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=681-b" target="_blank">Page681-b+ 60</a>]
producing.
	 4. Cleaning, cleansing.
	 5. Light, lustre.
	 6. Enjoyment.
m. (-तिः) A horse.
 E. वी to go, क्तिन् or क्तिच् aff.
