वीरजयन्तिका|वीरजयंतिका
वीरजयन्तिका f. (-का)
	 1. A war-dance, a dance performed by soldiers
after a victory or on going to battle.
	 2. War, battle.
 E. वीर a hero,
जि to conquer, झच् aff., fem. form, and कन् added.
