<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वीरतर|वीरतरं|वीरतरः
वीरतर n. (-र)
	 1. A fragrant grass, (Andropogon muricatum.)
	 m. (-रः)
1. An arrow.
	 2. A great hero.
 E. वीर powerful, तरप् aff.
