वृक|वृकः
वृक m. (-कः)
	 1. A wolf.
	 2. A crow.
	 3. The Vaka-pushpa tree, (Ses-
bana grandiflora.)
	 4. A jackal.
	 5. A hyena.
	 6. A rat, a mouse.
7. A Kṣatriya.
	 8. Name of a demon.
	 9. Name of a fire in the
stomach.
	 10. Turpentine.
	 11. Compounded perfume.
	 f. (-का) A
plant, (Cissampelos hexandra.)
 E. वृक् to take, aff. क; or वृ to hide
or screen, Unādi aff. कक् ।
