वृज्
वृज्(ई)वृजी r. 1st cl. (वर्जति) r. 2nd cl. (वृङ्क्ते) r. 7th cl. (वृणक्ति)
	 1. To
choose.
	 2. To lose, to avoid.
	 3. To purify.
	 4. To cover. With अप,
To relinquish. r. 10th cl. (वर्ज्जयति-ते) To quit, to shun, to avoid,
to except, to abandon. With आ, To bend, to incline.
	 2. To offer.
With वि, 1. To avoid.
	 2. To be destitute of.
