	 1. Sin.
	 2. Sky, atmosphere.
	 3. A
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=683-b" target="_blank">Page683-b+ 60</a>]
field cleared for pasture.
	 m. (-नः) Hair.
 E. वृज् to quit, &c.,
Unādi aff. क्यु ।
