वृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Chosen, selected, preferred.
	 2. Agreed or
assented to.
	 3. Served.
	 4. Covered, screened, defended.
	 5. Affected
by.
	 6. Vitiated, spoiled.
	 7. Hired.
 E. वृ to prefer, and क्त aff.
