वृन्दारक|वृंदारक|वृन्दारकः
वृन्दारक mfn. (-कः-का-कं)
	 1. Handsome, agreeable, pleasing.
	 2. Best,
excellent, chief.
	 3. Much, great.
	 4. Reputable, respectable,
eminent.
	 m. (-कः)
	 1. A deity, an immortal.
	 2. A chief, the head or
leader of a crowd or herd, &c., (at the end of a compound.)
 E. वृन्द
a heap, and आरकन् aff., implying pre-eminence.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=685-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृन्दिष्ठ|वृंदिष्ठ|वृन्दिष्ठः
वृन्दिष्ठ mfn. (-ष्ठः-ष्ठा-ष्ठं) Very beautiful or charming, very excellent or
elevated, very reputable or venerable.
 E. वृन्दारक chief, excellent,
वृन्द substituted, and इष्ठन् aff. of the irr. super.; also with ईयसुन्
the same, वृन्दीयस् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=685-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृन्दीयस्|वृंदीयस्
वृन्दीयस् mfn. (-यान्-यसी-यः) Very eminent or excellent. E. See the last.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=685-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृश्
वृश् r. 4th cl. (वृश्यति) To choose, to prefer, to select.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=685-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृश|वृशः
वृश m. (-शः)
	 1. A rat.
	 2. A flower, (Justicia ganderussa.)
	 f. (-शा) A
drug.
	 n. (-शं) Ginger.
 E. वृ to choose, शक् Uṇādi aff.: see वृष ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=685-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृश्चिक|वृश्चिकः
वृश्चिक m. (-कः)
	 1. A scorpion.
	 2. The sign Scorpio of the zodiac.
	 3.
A hairy caterpillar.
	 4. A crab.
	 5. A sort of beetle found in cow-
dung.
	 6. A centipede.
	 7. A thorny shrub, (Vangueria spinosa.)
8. The month when the sun is in Scorpio.
	 f. (-का) A potherb.
(Basella.)
 E. व्रश्च् to cut, Unādi aff. किकन्, and the semi-vowel
changed to the vowel.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=685-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृश्चिकप्रिया
वृश्चिकप्रिया f. (-या) A potherb, (Basella rubra and lucida.)
 E. वृश्चिक a scorpion, प्रिय found of.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=685-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृश्चिकाली
वृश्चिकाली f. (-ली)
	 1. A line of scorpions.
	 2. A shrub, (Tragia involucra-
ta.)
 E. वृश्चिक a scorpion, and आली a line.
