वेण्
वेण्(ऋ)वेणृ r. 1st cl. (वेणति-ते)
	 1. To go, to move.
	 2. To know.
	 3. To
reflect or remember.
	 4. To discern.
	 5. To hold or take a musical
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=687-b" target="_blank">Page687-b+ 60</a>]
