	 2. Pain, smart, agony.
	 3. Knowledge.
	 4. The ceremony of
holding the ends of a mantle, to be observed by a Śudra female,
on her marriage with a man of either of the first three classes.
5. Presenting, delivering.
	 6. Acquisition, wealth.
	 f. (-नी) The true
skin or cutis.
 E. विद् to know, &c., ल्युट् aff.
