वेध|वेधः
वेध m. (-धः)
	 1. Perforation, piercing.
	 2. Wounding.
	 3. A particular
division of time.
	 4. Depth, (in measurement.)
 E. व्यध् to pierce, aff.
अच्; or विध्-घञ् ।
