वेधक|वेधकं|वेधकः
वेधक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Sharp, piercing, a piercer or perforator.
	 m. (-कः)
1. Name of a division of hell.
	 2. Camphor.
	 n. (-कं) Grain, rice.
in the ear.
 E. व्यध् to pierce, aff. वुन्; or विध्-ण्वुल् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=689-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेधन|वेधनं
वेधन n. (-नं)
	 1. Piercing, perforation.
	 2. Depth, (in measurement.)
	 3.
Excavation.
	 4. Wounding.
	 f. (-नी)
	 1. An instrument for piercing
an elephant's ear.
	 2. A small gimblet or perforating instrument
used to pierce gems, shells, &c.
	 2. An augre, a gimblet, &c., or
any similar instrument.
 E. व्यध् to pierce, ल्युट् aff.; or विध्-ल्युट्-ङीप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=689-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेधनिका
वेधनिका f. (-का) A small-pointed perforating instrument, used espe-
cially to make holes in jewels, pearls, shells, &c., an augre, an
awl, a gimblet, &c.
 E. कन् added to वेधन as above.
