वेधमुख्यक m. (-कः) Zedoary, (Curcuma zerumbet.)
 E. वेध piercing, (fig-
uratively for pervading as by its odour,) मुख्य principal, कन् added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=689-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

