वैदेह|वैदेहः
वैदेह m. (-हः)
	 1. A trader by caste or profession.
	 2. An attendant on
the women's apartments: see the next.
	 f. (-ही)
	 1. ŚITĀ, the
daughter of JANAKA.
	 2. Long-pepper.
	 3. The wife of a trader or
woman of the Vaideha caste.
	 4. A sort of pigment, commonly
Rochanā.
 E. विदेह the country, अण् aff. of origin or production.
