वैदेहक|वैदेहकः
वैदेहक m. (-कः)
	 1. A trader by profession.
	 2. A man of a mixed caste,
the offspring of a Vaiśya father and Brāhman mother, whose
business is attendance in the women's apartments.
 E. विदेह the
country, वुञ्. aff.; or वि various, दिह् to collect, (goods, &c.,) aff. ण्वुल्
and अण् added; or विदेह a king, the supposed author of rules for
merchants, वुञ् aff., or with अण् aff. and ठक् added वैदेहिक ।
