and Tartarus or Naraka, over part of which BALĪ presides. E.
वैरोचन the prince BALĪ, and निकेतन abode; the sovereign of this
name being an incarnate Daitya or hereditary foe of the gods, and
being invested with a sovereignty in the lower regions after his
humiliation by VIṢṆU.
