वैश्वानर|वैश्वानरः
वैश्वानर mfn. (-रः-री-रं) Relating to, fit for, &c., all men.
	 m. (-रः)
	 1. AGNI
or fire.
	 2. The digestive fire.
	 3. The supreme being.
	 f. (-री) A parti-
cular sacrifice to be performed at the beginning of every year. E.
विश्वानर a Muni, or विश्व all, नर mankind, अण् aff. of descent.
