<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैश्वी
वैश्वी f. (-श्वी) The second of the constellations called ĀSHĀDHĀ, and
twenty-first of the whole.
 E. विश्व Viśwadeva, अण् and ङीष् affs.;
those deities presiding over the asterism.
