वैषयिक|वैषयिकः
वैषयिक m. (-कः)
	 1. A sensualist, one addicted to the pleasures of sense.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=693-b" target="_blank">Page693-b+ 60</a>]
2. One occupied with worldly objects or interests.
	 f. (-की)
	 1. Re-
lating to any object.
	 2. Relating to an object of sense.
 E. विषय an
object of sense, and ठक् aff.
