व्यङ्ग्य|व्यंग्य|व्यङ्ग्यः
व्यङ्ग्य m. (-ङ्ग्यः)
	 1. Figurative or poetical speech, elliptical language or
that which conveys something more than the simple meaning of
the words.
	 2. Sarcasm, the covert but intelligible expression of
suspicion or contempt.
 E. वि before अञ्ज् to make clear or manifest,
aff. ण्यत्, or घञ् aff. and यत् added.
