	 2. Celebrated,
famous.
	 3. Filled, full of.
	 4. Placed, fixed.
	 5. Obtained, possessed.
6. Encircled, encompassed, surrounded.
	 7. Open, apart, out-
spread.
	 8. Included.
	 9. Invariably accompanied, (in logic.)
 E. वि
before आप् to pervade, aff. क्त ।
