व्याप्तिग्रह m. (-हः) Induction of universal concomitance, (in logic.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=699-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याप्तिज्ञान
