शकुन्तिका|शकुंतिका
शकुन्तिका f. (-का) A locust, a cricket.
 E. शकुन्त a bird, कन् aff. of comparison.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=702-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शकुल|शकुलः
शकुल mf. (-लः-ली) A kind of fish. “शील”.
 E. शक् to be able, aff. उलच् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=702-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शकुलगण्ड|शकुलगण्डः
शकुलगण्ड m. (-ण्डः) A kind of fish. “शालमाछ ।”
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=702-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शकुलाक्षक|शकुलाक्षकः
शकुलाक्षक m. (-कः) Bent grass, (Panicum dactylon,) with white bloss-
oms.
 E. शकुल a kind of fish, अक्षि the eye, अच् substituted for the
final vowel; the blossoms being compared to the eye of a fish.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=702-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
