शकुलार्भक|शकुलार्भकः
शकुलार्भक m. (-कः) A sort of fish. “गडुइ माछ ।”
 E. शकुल a fish, अर्भक a
young one.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=702-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शकृत्
शकृत् n. (-कृत्) Fæces, excrement.
 E. शक् to be able, (to expel,) Unādi aff. ऋतन् ।
