शक्कर|शक्करः
शक्कर m. (-रः) A bull.
	 f. (-री)
	 1. A river.
	 2. A zone, a girdle.
	 3. A form
of metre, a stanza of four lines of fourteen syllables each.
	 4. A
woman of an impure caste; it is also read शक्वर, q. v.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=703-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्करि|शक्करिः
शक्करि m. (-रिः) A bull: see the last.
