शक्र|शक्रः
शक्र m. (-क्रः)
	 1. INDRA, the chief of the inferior gods, and ruler of
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=703-b" target="_blank">Page703-b+ 60</a>]
Svarga or paradise.
	 2. A plant, (Wrightea antidysenterica.)
	 3. A
tree, (Pentaptera arjuna.)
