शक्वर|शक्वरः
शक्वर m. (-रः) A bull, an ox.
	 f. (-री)
	 1. A finger.
	 2. A river.
	 3. A zone,
a girdle.
	 4. A form of metre, a stanza of four lines of fourteen
syllables each, and comprising many varieties according to the
different Pādas of which the lines are composed.
 E. शक् to be able
or strong, क्वरप् aff., or वनिप् aff. with र augment, and the final
rejected: the feminine form is also derived from शक्वन् with ङीप्
affix, and र augment, and the word is also read शक्कर and शक्करी ।
