शङ्क m. (-ङ्कः) A draft-ox.
	 f. (-ङ्का)
	 1. Fear, terror, apprehension.
	 2.
Doubt, uncertainty.
	 3. An objection started in disputation.
	 4.
Suspicion, expectation.
	 5. Belief, understanding, impression.
	 6. A
species of the Dandaka metre.
 E. शकि to fear, affs. अङ् and टाप् ।
