शटी
शटी f. (-टिः or टी) Zedoary, (Curcuma zerumoot,) otherwise considered
as a synonym of the Ambahaldi, or Carcumt Āmhaldī, the mango-
smelling ginger, so termed because the fresh root possesses the
smell of a green mango.
 E. शट् to divide, (remove disease,) aff. इन्
and ङीष् optionally added.
