<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतानीक|शतानीकः
शतानीक m. (-कः)
	 1. An old man.
	 2. The name of a sovereign, the son
and successor of JANAMEJAYA.
	 3. The name of a saint, the pupil
of VYĀSA.
 E. शत a hundred, आङ् before नी to obtain, कप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=706-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतायुस्
शतायुस् m. (-युः) A man of hundred years old.
 E. शत, and आयुस् life.
