शतिक|शतिकः
शतिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं)
	 1. Indicative of a hundred, (as a sign or omen.)
2. Doing or effecting any thing with a hundred.
	 3. Bearing tax or
interest per hundred.
	 4. Brought with a hundred.
	 5. Changed with
or for a hundred, &c.
	 6. Relating or belonging to a hundred. E.
शत a hundred, ठक्, ठञ् or ठन् aff.; also with यत् aff. शत्य in the same
acceptations.
