<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतेर|शतेरः
शतेर m. (-रः)
	 1. An enemy.
	 2. Injury, detriment, hurt.
 E. शद् to decay,
to go, Unādi aff. एरक्, द changed to त ।
