शत्रुघ्न|शत्रुघ्नः
शत्रुघ्न mfn. (-घ्नः-घ्नी-घ्नं) Killing a foe.
	 m. (-घ्नः) The second brother of
RĀMACHANDRA, the son of DASARATHA by SUMITRĀ, and uterine
brother of LAKSHMAṆA. He slew RĀVAṆA, the demon and colo-
nized MATHURĀ.
 E. शत्रु an enemy, and घ्न destroyer.
