शब्द|शब्दः
शब्द r. 10th cl. (शब्दयति-ते)
	 1. To sound, to make or utter sound.
	 2. To
call out to, to speak; with the prefixes प्र, प्रति, or वि, as well as
uncompounded, this root means also:--1. To promise.
	 2. To make
clear or manifest, to explain.
	 3. To speak.
