शब्द|शब्दः
शब्द m. (-ब्दः)
	 1. Sound in general, (considered as the property of
Ākāsha.)
	 2. A sound, a word.
	 3. A declinable word, as noun,
pronoun, &c., (in gram.)
	 4. The sound of a musical instrument.
	 5.
Verbal authority, (considered as a “proof” by the Naiyāyikas.) E.
शब्द् to sound, aff. घञ् ।
