शमीगर्भ m. (-र्भः)
	 1. A man of the sacerdotal class, a Brāhman.
	 2. A
name of AGNI or fire.
 E. शमी the mimosa, (the wood of which is
essential for certain sacrifice, &c.) and गर्भ embryo.
