<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शमीपत्री
शमीपत्री f. (-त्री) A sort of sensitive plant, (Mimosa pudica.)
 E. शमी
Acacia Suma, and पत्र the leaf; having a similar leaf.
