शमीर|शमीरः
शमीर m. (-रः) A small variety of the Mimosa Suma.
 E. शमी the Śami
tree, and र aff. of diminution; also sometimes read शमिर ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=708-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शम्पा|शंपा
शम्पा f. (-म्पा) Lightning.
 E. शम् happiness, पा to drink, क and टाप् affs.;
destroying pleasure by its awful appearance.
