<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शम्पाक|शंपाक|शम्पाकः
शम्पाक m. (-कः)
	 1. A kind of Cassia, (C. fistula.)
	 2. Bringing to matu-
rity or ripeness, cooking, maturing.
	 3. The lac pigment.
 E. शम्
pleasure and पाक what matures; also सम्पाक ।
