शम्ब्|शंब्
शम्ब् r. 1st cl. (शम्बति) To go. r. 10th cl. (शम्बयति-ते) To accumulate, to
collect or heap together.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=708-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शम्ब|शंब|शम्बः
शम्ब mfn. (-म्बः-म्बा-म्बं)
	 1. Happy, fortunate.
	 2. Poor, indigent.
	 m. (-म्बः)
1. INDRA'S thunderbolt.
	 2. The iron head of a pestle.
	 3. An iron
chain worn round the loins.
	 4. The second ploughing of a field.
E. शम् happiness, and ब possessive aff.; or शम्ब् to accumulate, aff.
अच्; it is also read सव, शंव, and सम्ब ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=708-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
