	 2. A preserver, a protector, what or who
protects or preserves.
	 3. Preservation, protection, defence.
	 4.
Killing, slaying.
	 f. (-णी) A plant, (Celtis.)
 E. शॄ to injure, aff. ल्युट्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=708-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरणागत|शरणागतः
शरणागत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Refuge, appellant, one who comes for protec-
tion or refuge.
 E. शरण protection, and आगत come.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=708-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरणापन्न
शरणापन्न mfn. (-न्नः-न्ना-न्नं) Taken refuge.
 E. शरण and आपन्न obtained.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=708-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरणार्थिन्
शरणार्थिन् mfn. (-र्थी-र्थिनी-र्थि) Unfortunate, wretched, involved in cala-
mity or ruin, and dependent on others for protection or aid. E.
शरण protection, and अर्थिन् soliciting, requiring.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=708-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरणार्पक|शरणार्पकः
शरणार्पक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Unfortunate, calamitous, distressed, ruined:
(see the last.)
 E. शरण protection, अर्पक who causes to be afforded.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=708-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरणि|शरणिः
शरणि mf. (-णिः-णी) A road, a path, a way.
 E. शॄ to hurt, अनि aff.; more
usually सरणि ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=708-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरणैषिन्
शरणैषिन् mfn. (-षी-षिणी-षि) Seeking for an asylum or protection.
 E. शरण, एषिन् who wishes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=708-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरण्ड|शरंड|शरंडः|शरण्डः
शरण्ड m. (-ण्डः)
	 1. A bird in general.
	 2. A lizard, a chamæleon.
	 3. A
kind of ornament.
	 4. A rogue, a cheat.
	 5. A libertine, a lecher.
E. शॄ to injure, (fruit, &c.) अण्डच् Unādi aff.; also सरण्ड ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=708-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरण्य|शरण्यः
शरण्य mfn. (-ण्यः-ण्या-ण्यं) To be protected or aided, poor, miserable,
helpless.
	 n. (-ण्यं)
	 1. A protection, a protector, that which or who
affords refuge and defence.
	 2. A house.
	 3. Protection, defence.
	 4.
Injury, hurt.
 E. शृ to hurt, Unādi aff. अन्य; or शरण protection,
and यत् aff. of fitness.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=708-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरण्यु|शरण्युः
शरण्यु m. (-ण्युः)
	 1. A plough.
	 2. Wind, air.
	 3. A protector, a defender.
4. A cloud.
 E. शृ to injure, अन्यु aff.; also सरण्यु ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=708-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरत्कामिन्
शरत्कामिन् m. (-मी) A dog.
 E. शरद् autumn, and कामिन् uxorious.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=708-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरत्काल|शरत्कालः
शरत्काल n. (-लं) The autumnal season.
 E. शरद् and काल time.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरत्कालीन
शरत्कालीन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Autumnal.
 E. शरत्काल and ख aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरत्पर्व्वन्|शरत्पर्वन्
शरत्पर्व्वन् n. (-र्व्व) A festival, on the full-moon of Āshwin, (September-
October:) see कोजागर.
 E. शरद् autumn, and पर्व्वन् a holy day.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरद्
शरद् f. (-रत् or रद्)
	 1. The season of autumn or the sultry season;
the two months succeeding the rains; according to the VAIDIKAS,
comprising the months BHĀDRA and ĀSHWIN, and according to
the PAURĀNIKAS, ĀSHWIN and KĀRTIKA, fluctuating thus from
AUGUST to NOVEMBER.
	 2. A year.
 E. शॄ to injure, अदि Unādi
aff.; also with टाप् added शरदा ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरदा
शरदा f. (-दा)
	 1. A year.
	 2. The sultry season. E. See the last.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरदिज|शरदिजं
शरदिज mfn. (-जः-जा-जं) Autumnal, produced in Śarat or the season of
autumn.
 E. शरद् as above in the 7th case, and ज born.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरधि|शरधिः
शरधि m. (-धिः) A quiver.
 E. शर an arrow, धा to have or contain, aff. कि ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरन्मुख
शरन्मुख n. (-खं) Commencement of the autumn.
 E. शरद्, मुख beginning.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरपात|शरपातः
शरपात m. (-तः) An arrow's fall or flight.
 E. शर and पात alighting.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरपातस्थान
शरपातस्थान n. (-नं) A bowshot, an arrow's flight.
 E. शरपात, स्थान place.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरपुङ्खा|शरपुंखा
शरपुङ्खा f. (-ङ्खा) The feathered end of an arrow.
 E. शर an arrow, and
पुङ्ख the feathered part of it.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरफल
शरफल n. (-लं) The blade or barb of an arrow.
 E. शर, and फल blade.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरभ|शरभः
शरभ m. (-भः)
	 1. A fabulous animal, supposed to have eight legs, and
to inhabit particularly the snowy mountains.
	 2. A young elephant.
3. A monkey in RĀMA'S army.
	 4. A camel.
	 5. A grasshopper.
	 6.
A locust.
 E. शॄ to injure, Unādi aff. अभच्; or शर an arrow, भा to
shine, aff. क ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरभू
शरभू m. (-भूः) KĀRTIKEYA.
 E. शर the grass, भू born; being reared in this grass.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरमय|शरमयं
शरमय mfn. (-यः-यी-यं) Made of or consisting of Śara grass, &c.
 E. शर
the grass, and मयट् aff., implying in this and other compounds
change of form for any purpose except food or clothing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरमल्ल|शरमल्लः
शरमल्ल m. (-ल्लः) A small bird, considered as a variety of the Sālica or
Mainā, (Turdus gosalica, RUCH, Mss.)
 E. शर the Śara grass, and
मल्ल to hold or occupy, aff. अङ्; some authorities have शरमन्द ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरयु|शरयुः
शरयु f. (-युः-यूः) The Sarajū-river; it is preferably, and more usually
written सरयु, q. v.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरल|शरलः
शरल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं)
	 1. Upright, honest.
	 2. Crooked, fraudulent.
	 m.
(-लः) A tree, a sort of pine.
 E. सृ to go, अलच् aff., and स changed
to श; whence the word is preferably read सरल ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरलक|शरलकं
शरलक n. (-कं) Water.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरलता
शरलता f. (-ता) Uprightness, sincerity.
 E. तल् added to शरल; with त्व,
शरलत्वं; also read सरलता ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरव
शरव m. (-वः)
	 1. ŚIVA.
	 2. A lid, a cover.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरवणोद्भव|शरवणोद्भवः
शरवणोद्भव m. (-वः)
	 1. KĀRTIKEYA.
 E. शर saccharum, वन a thicket or
jungle, and उद्भव born: see शरजन्मन्, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरवर्ष|शरवर्षः
शरवर्ष m. (-र्षः) A flight or shower of arrows.
 E. शर, वर्ष rain.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरवर्षिन्
शरवर्षिन् mfn. (-र्षी-र्षिणी-र्षि) Raining or shooting arrows.
 E. शर, वर्षिन् showering.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरवाणि|शरवाणिः
शरवाणि m. (-णिः)
	 1. The head of an arrow.
	 2. A foot-soldier, an archer.
3. A maker of arrows.
 E. शर an arrow, वण् to sound, aff. इन् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरवृष्टि|शरवृष्टिः
शरवृष्टि f. (-ष्टिः) A heavy fall or shower of arrows.
 E. शर and वृष्टि rain.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरव्य|शरव्यं
शरव्य n. (-व्यं) A mark, a butt.
 E. शरु a weapon, and यत् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरसन्धान
शरसन्धान n. (-नं) Taking aim with an arrow.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शराघात|शराघातः
शराघात m. (-तः) Shooting, (with a bow.)
 E. शर an arrow, आघात striking.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शराटि|शराटिः
शराटि f. (-टिः) A sort of bird, (Turdus ginginianus.)
 E. शर water or
mischief, अट् to go, aff. इन्; or from अत् to go, शराति; and other-
wise derived also शराडि and शरालि ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शराडि|शराडिः
शराडि f. (-डिः) A bird: see शरालि ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शराति|शरातिः
शराति f. (-तिः) A bird: see शराटि, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शराभ्यास|शराभ्यासः
शराभ्यास m. (-सः) Archery, practice with the bow and arrow.
 E. शर an arrow, अभ्यास exercise.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरारि|शरारिः
शरारि f. (-रिः) A sort of bird, commonly the Āli or Sarāli, (Turdus
ginginianus.)
 E. शर water or mischief, ऋ to go, aff. इ; also ल
being substituted, शरालि, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरारीमुखी
शरारीमुखी f. (-खी) Scissars.
 E. शरारी, मुख mouth or beak, ङीष् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरारु|शरारुः
शरारु mfn. (-रुः-रुः-रु) Mischievous, noxious, hurtful.
 E. शृ to hurt, आरु aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरारोप|शरारोपः
शरारोप m. (-पः) A bow.
 E. शर an arrow, आरोप a receptacle.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरालि|शरालिः
शरालि f. (-लिः or ली) Sarāli, a kind of bird, (Turdus ginginianus.)
 E. शर
an arrow, अल् to be equal to, (in speed,) aff. इन्, and ङीष् optionally
added; also शरारि, शराडि, शराटि, &c., and with कन् added, fem.
form शरालिका ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शराव|शरावं|शरावः
शराव m. (-वः)
	 1. A lid, a cover.
	 2. A shallow earthen cup or dish.
	 3.
A platter.
	 4. A measure equal to two Kudavas.
 E. शर mischief,
(from it,) अव् to preserve, aff. अण् or अच् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरावती
शरावती f. (-ती) A river so named.
 E. शर a sort of grass, मतुप् aff., fem.
form, and the final of the first word made long.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शराश्रय|शराश्रयः
शराश्रय m. (-यः) A quiver.
 E. शर an arrow, आश्रय receptacle.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरासन|शरासनं
शरासन n. (-नं)
	 1. A bow.
	 2. Shooting arrows.
 E. शर, अस् to throw, aff. ल्युट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शराहत
शराहत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Struck by an arrow.
 E. शर, and आहत struck.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरिमन्
शरिमन् m. (-मा) Bearing, bringing forth.
 E. शॄ to hurt, इमनिच् Unādi
aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=709-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीर|शरीरं
शरीर n. (-रं)
	 1. The body.
	 2. The body of any inanimate object.
	 3. A
dead body.
