	 1. Excellent, best.
	 2. To be hurt or injured.
	 3.
Desirable, to be wished.
	 n. (-स्यं)
	 1. Fruit.
	 2. Corn, grain in
general.
	 3. Good quantity, merit.
	 4. Grass.
 E. शस् to hurt, aff.
यत्; or शसि to wish, क्यप् aff.
