शान्तनु|शांतनु|शान्तनुः
शान्तनु m. (-नुः) The 21st sovereign of the lunar dynasty in the third
age, the father of BHĪṢMA by Gangā, or the Ganges personified.
E. शं good fortune, (personified,) तनु the body, and the first vowel
made long by special rule.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=713-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शान्तमल
