<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शान्तात्मन्
शान्तात्मन् mfn. (-त्मा-त्मा-त्म) Calm, composed, of resigned or composed
spirit.
 E. शान्त, and आत्मन् self.
