शारद mfn. (-दः-दी-दं)
	 1. Modest, diffident.
	 2. New.
	 3. Produced in the
sultry season.
	 4. Autumnal.
	 m. (-दः)
	 1. A year.
	 2. Grain or rice
ripening in the sultry season.
	 3. A sort of kidney-bean, yellow
Mūng.
