	 f. (-दा)
1. A name of SARASWATĪ.
	 2. A title of DurGĀ.
	 3. A musical
instrument, a sort of lute or guitar.
	 f. (-दी)
	 1. A plant, (Jussieua,
repens.)
	 2. A tree, (Echites scholaris.)
	 3. Day of full-moon in the
month of Kārtika, (October-November.)
	 n. (-दं)
	 1. The white
lotus.
	 2. Corn, grain.
 E. शरद् the autumn, अण् aff.
