शारदिक|शारदिकं|शारदिकः
शारदिक n. (-कं) A particular obsequial ceremony, an annual or
autumnal Śrāddha.
	 m. (-कः)
	 1. Autumnal sickness.
	 2. Heat or
sunshine in autumn.
 E. शारद autumn, and ठञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=714-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शारदिन्
शारदिन् mfn. (-दी-दिनी-दि) Autumnal.
 E. शारद, and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=714-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शारदीय
शारदीय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Autumnal.
 E. शारद, and छण् added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=714-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शारि|शारिः
शारि m. (-रिः)
	 1. A piece or man at chess, draughts Chauper, &c.
	 2.
An elephant's housings or armour.
	 3. Fraud, trick.
	 mf. (-रिः-री) A
bird: see the next.
 E. शॄ to injure, Unādi aff. इञ् or ङीप् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=714-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शारिका
शारिका f. (-का)
	 1. A bird, the proper or hill Mainā, (Gracula religiosa;)
it is also applied to the small bird usually called Mainā in Bengal,
(Turdus salica, BUCH.) of which several varieties are distinguished
by the Hindus.
	 2. A bow or stick that may be used for playing
the Vīṇa or any stringed instrument.
	 3. A man at chess.
 E. शॄ
to injure, aff. वुन् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=714-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शारित
शारित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Variegated, coloured.
 E. शार, and इतच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=714-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शारिफल|शारिफलं
शारिफल n. (-लं) A chequered cloth or table for playing draughts, &c. E.
शारि a piece, फल fruit; also with कन् added शारिफलक mn. (-कः-कं) ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=714-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शारिवा
शारिवा f. (-वा) A plant: as synonimous with Śhyāmā, (Echites frutes-
cens,) but more usually considered synonimous with Ananta-mūla
(Asclepias pseudosarsa,) the broad-leaved variety, the root of
which has been used as a substitute for Sarsaparilla, &c.
 E. शारि
injuring, from शॄ with इञ् aff., and वन् added.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=714-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शारिशृङ्खला
शारिशृङ्खला f. (-ला) A sort of die or dice, used for playing with.
 E. शारि
a man or piece, and शृङ्खला a chain.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=714-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शारीर|शारीरं|शारीरः
शारीर mfn. (-रः-री-रं)
	 1. Corporeal, bodily, belonging to or produced
from the body.
	 2. Spiritual in connection with the body, incorpo-
rate.
	 3. A bull.
	 n. (-रं)
	 1. The soul or spirit whilst incorporate.
	 2.
A drug.
	 3. Excrement, excretion.
	 m. (-रः) Personal chastisement,
corporeal punishment.
 E. शरीर the body, and अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=714-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शारीरक|शारीरकं
शारीरक mfn. (-कः-का-कं)
	 1. Corporeal, relating to what is corporeal.
2. Incorporate.
 E. कन् added to the last.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=714-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शारीरिक|शारीरिकः
शारीरिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Relating to the body, corporeal.
	 2. Contained
in the body, incorporate.
 E. शरीर, ठक् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=714-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शारुक|शारुकः
शारुक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Mischievous, noxious, injurious.
 E. शॄ to hurt, उकञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=714-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शार्क|शार्कः
शार्क m. (-र्कः) Clayed or candied sugar.
 E. शॄ to injure, aff. क.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=714-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शार्कक|शार्ककः
शार्कक m. (-कः)
	 1. The broth of milk, syllabub, cream.
	 2. A ball of
meat, &c.
	 3. Clayed or candied sugar.
 E. कन् added to the last.
