शार्कर|शार्करः
शार्कर mfn. (-रः-री-रं)
	 1. Stony, gravelly.
	 2. Sugary.
	 m. (-रः)
	 1. The
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=715-a" target="_blank">Page715-a+ 60</a>]
froth or skim of milk.
	 2. Cream.
	 3. A gravelly place.
 E. शर्करा
sugar, gravel, &c., aff. अण्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=714-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शार्करक|शार्करकः
शार्करक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Gravelly, stony, &c.
 E. शार्कर the same, and
कक् added; also from शर्कर with ठक् aff. शार्करिक.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=715-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शार्करीय|शार्करीयः
शार्करीय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Stony, gravelly, &c.
 E. शर्करा gravel, &c., and
छ attributive aff.
