शार्दूल|शार्दूलः|शार्द्दूलः
शार्दूल m. (-लः)
	 1. A tiger.
	 2. Another animal.
	 3. A Rākshasa.
	 4. A sort
of bird.
	 5. (In composition,) Pre-eminent, excellent.
	 6. A form
of metre, a variety of the class Dhritī, or stanza of four lines of
18 syllables each; also of the class Atidhritī, in which there are
19 syllables in the line.
 E. शॄ to injure, दूलच् aff.
