शार्दूलललित|शार्द्दूलललितं
शार्दूलललित m. (-तः) A species of the Dhritī metre, of 4 lines of 18
syllables each.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=715-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शार्दूलवाहन|शार्द्दूलवाहनः
शार्दूलवाहन m. (-नः) A Jaina teacher.
 E. शार्दूल a tiger, and वाहन a vehicle.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=715-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
