Atidhritī, or stanza of 4 lines of 19 syllables each.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=715-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शार्वर|शार्व्वरं
शार्वर mfn. (-रः-री-रं)
	 1. Murderous, mischievous.
	 2. Nocturnal.
	 n.
(-रं) Darkness, gloom.
	 f. (-री) Night.
 E. शर्वरी night, अण् aff.
