शालि|शालिः
शालि n. (-लि)
	 1. Rice in general, but especially in two classes; one
like white rice growing in deep water, and the other a red sort,
requiring only a moist soil; there are a great many varieties of
this grain.
	 3. The civet or pole cat.
 E. शाड् to float or swim, aff.
इन्, and ड changed to ल ।
