शालिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Relating or belonging to a hall, to the ŚĀL tree,
&c.
	 m. (-कः)
	 1. A weaver.
	 2. A village of artificers.
	 3. A toll, a tax.
f. (-का) A shrub, (Hedysarum gangeticum.)
 E. शाल the ŚĀL tree,
कन् fem. form, aff. of comparison; or शाला a hall, ठक् aff.
