शालिता
शालिता f. (-ता)
	 1. Possessing, having.
	 2. Confidence in, relying upon. E.
शालिन् and तल् aff.; with त्व, शालित्वं ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=715-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शालिन्
शालिन् mfn. (-ली-लिनी-लि)
	 1. Belonging to a house, domestic, &c.
2. A mistress of the house.
	 3. Name of a metre.
	 4. Possessing,
having.
	 5. Shining or resplendent with, (in the latter two senses
when at the end of a compound.)
 E. शाल a house, and इनि
aff.; in the fourth form it is the same as शील; the इ being chang-
ed to आ when used in composition.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=715-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शालिनीकरण|शालिनीकरणं
शालिनीकरण n. (-णं) Abuse, reproach.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=715-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शालिपिष्ट|शालिपिष्टं
शालिपिष्ट n. (-ष्टं) Crystal.
 E. शालि rice, and पिष्ट ground.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=715-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शालिवाहन|शालिवाहनः
शालिवाहन m. (-नः) A sovereign of India, whose capital was Pratish-
thāna in the Dakshin, and institutor of the era now called Śaka,
beginning 76 or 78 years after CHRIST.
 E. शालि from शाल the ŚĀL
tree, or a proper name, that of a Yakṣa transformed to a lion,
on which the prince rode when an infant, and वाहन vehicle.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=715-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शालिहोत्र|शालिहोत्रः
शालिहोत्र m. (-त्रः)
	 1. A horse.
	 2. Name of a writer on veterinary
science.
 E. शालि rice, corn, and होत्र an oblation; also with इनि
added शालिहोत्रिन् m. (-त्री) ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=715-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शालीन|शालीनः
शालीन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं)
	 1. Ashamed, bashful.
	 2. Like, resembling.
	 m.
(-नः) An opulent house-holder, one who devotes his attention to
worldly affairs.
 E. शाला a house, ख aff, (fit or worthy to enter it.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=715-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शालीनत्व|शालीनत्वं
शालीनत्व n. (-त्वं) Modesty.
 E. त्व added to the last; also with तल्,
शालीनता ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=715-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
