<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शास्त्रतत्त्वज्ञ|शास्त्रतत्त्वज्ञः
शास्त्रतत्त्वज्ञ mfn. (-ज्ञः-ज्ञा-ज्ञं) Understanding the works of sacred science.
m. (-ज्ञः) An astrologer, an astronomer.
 E. शास्त्र sacred or astrono-
mical science, तत्त्व the truth, and ज्ञ who knows.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=716-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
