<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शास्त्रनिन्दा
शास्त्रनिन्दा f. (-न्दा) Reviling or denying the authority of sacred works.
E. शास्त्र, and निन्दा reviling.
