शास्त्रविप्रतिषेध n. (-धं) Any act contrary to the legal and religious
institutes of the Hindus.
 E. शास्त्र an institute, and वि and प्रति
contra-indicative prefixes before षिद्ध् to accomplish, aff. घञ् ।
