शास्त्रविरुद्ध
शास्त्रविरुद्ध mfn. (-द्धः-द्धा-द्धं) Contrary to law or religion.
 E. शास्त्र and
विरुद्ध opposed to.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=716-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शास्त्रविरोध|शास्त्रविरोधः
शास्त्रविरोध m. (-धः)
	 1. Opposition or deviation from sacred authority.
2. Contradiction or incompatibility of different systems.
 E. शास्त्र,
and विरोध contrariety.
