शास्त्राचरण|शास्त्राचरणः
शास्त्राचरण m. (-णः)
	 1. Versed in the scriptures, well read in the works
of sacred science, a Paṇḍit.
	 2. A follower of the Vedas, one
whose conduct is regulated by their precepts.
 E. शास्त्र a sacred
treatise, and आचरण who goes through or studies.
