<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शास्य|शास्यः
शास्य mfn. (-स्यः-स्या-स्यं)
	 1. To be regulated or ordained, to be enforced,
to be provided for by any act of government or judicature.
	 2.
To be advised.
	 3. Punishable, deserving punishment.
 E. शास् to
govern, aff. ण्यत् ।
