<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शि|शिः
शि m. (-शिः)
	 1. ŚIVA.
	 2. Auspiciousness, good fortune.
	 3. Peace, com-
posure, calm.
 E. शि to whet, or शो to destroy, aff. कि ।
