<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिक्य|शिक्यं
शिक्य nf. (-क्यं-क्या)
	 1. The string or loop suspended from either end of a
pole or yoke to receive the burthen.
	 2. The burthen so carried.
	 3.
The strings of a balance.
 E. श्रंस् to fall, Unādi aff. यत्; शि substi-
tuted for the root, and कुट् augment.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=717-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
