<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिक्यित|शिक्यितं
शिक्यित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Suspended or carried in a sort of loop.
 E. शिक्य a loop, and इतच् aff.
