शिखण्डिन्|शिखंडिन्
शिखण्डिन् m. (-ण्डी)
	 1. A peacock.
	 2. A peacock's tail.
	 3. A cock.
	 4. An
arrow.
	 5. A Ṛṣi, either of the seven represented by the stars of the
greater bear: see चित्रशिखण्डिन् । 6. The son of DRUPADA, by metamor-
phosis: see below.
	 f. (-नी)
	 1. A kind of jasmine, (J. auriculatum.)
	 2.
A shrub, (Abrus precatorius.)
	 3. The daughter of DRUPADA, after-
wards changed to a male.
	 4. A peahen.
 E. शिखण्ड a crest, इनि
poss. aff.
