शिथिल|शिथिलं
शिथिल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं)
	 1. Loose, lax, flaccid, flabby.
	 2. Languid, inert,
feeble.
	 3. Ineffective, unenergetic.
	 4. Relaxed, slackened.
	 5. Not
rigidly observed.
	 6. Loosely retained or possessed.
	 7. Abandoned,
got rid of, shaken off.
 E. श्लथ् to be lax or loose, Unādi aff. किलच्;
the form irr.
