[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=719-a" target="_blank">Page719-a+ 60</a>]
a nerve, a tendon, a gut, &c.
	 m. (-रः)
	 1. A bed.
	 2. A large serpent.
E. शॄ to injure, क aff.: see शिरस् ।
