शी
शी(ङ)शीङ् r. 2nd cl. (शेते) To sleep. With अति prefixed, 1. To sleep
longer than.
	 2. To to be profuse or copious, to be much or
more, to exceed. With अधि, 1. To lie down on.
	 2. To abide, to
be. With सम्, To doubt. With उप, To lie near.
