शीत|शीतं|शीतः
शीत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Cold, chilly, frigid.
	 2. Idle, lazy.
	 3. Cold, dull,
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=722-a" target="_blank">Page722-a+ 60</a>]
apathetic, stupid.
	 4. Decocted, boiled.
	 n. (-तं)
	 1. Cold, coldness.
	 2.
Water.
	 3. Cold weather or the six months of the rainy, dewy and
cold seasons.
	 4. Cinnamon.
	 m. (-तः)
	 1. A small tree, (Cordia myxa.)
2. A kind of ratan, (Calamus fasciculatus.)
	 3. A plant, (Marsilea
quadrifolia.)
	 4. The Nimba-tree.
	 5. Camphor.
	 6. The cold season.
f. (-ता)
	 1. The wife of RĀMA.
	 2. A furrow.
 E. श्यै to go, aff. क्त; the
fem. form more usually occurs सीता, q. v.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=721-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीतक|शीतकः
शीतक m. (-कः)
	 1. Cold weather or the cold season, winter.
	 2. A lazy
man, one who is dilatory or dull.
	 3. One devoid of care or anxiety,
a happy man.
	 4. A plant, (Marsilea dentata.)
	 5. A scorpion. E.
कन् added to the preceding.
