<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीतोभाव
शीतोभाव m. (-वः)
	 1. Final emancipation.
	 2. Coolness, composure.
	 3.
Cold, coldness.
 E. शीत cold, भाव nature, च्वि augment.
