<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीत्य|शीत्यं
शीत्य mfn. (-त्यः-त्या-त्यं)
	 1. Ploughed, tilled: more usually सीत्य.
	 2. To be
cooled or chilled.
 E. शीत cold, or शीता a furrow, यत् aff.
