शीर्षक|शीर्षकं|शीर्षकः
शीर्षक n. (-कं)
	 1. A helmet.
	 2. The skull.
	 3. The head.
	 4. Judgment,
award, sentence, the fruit or result of judicial investigation.
	 m.
(-कः) Rāhu, the personified ascending node.
 E. कन् added to the last.
