शीर्षकस्थ
शीर्षकस्थ mfn. (-स्थः-स्था-स्थं)
	 1. Staying in or on the head.
	 2. Abiding
by an award, agreeing to submit to the penalty imposed by it. E.
शीर्षक, and स्थ who stays.
