<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीलवृत्त
शीलवृत्त mfn. (-त्तः-त्ता-त्तं) Noral, steady and uniform in good behaviour.
E. शील, वृत्त practice.
