शीलित|शीलितं
शीलित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Skilled, learned, conversant, exercised.
	 2.
Having, endowed with.
	 3. Made or consisting of.
	 4. Visited. E.
शील् to learn, &c., aff. क्त ।
