<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शुक|शुकं|शुकः
शुक m. (-कः)
	 1. A parrot.
	 2. The son of VYĀSA, the author or narra-
tor of the Bhāgavat.
	 3. The minister of RĀVAṆA.
	 4. The Sirisha
tree.
	 5. A plant, commonly Seyāla kāntā.
	 n. (-कं)
	 1. A drug
and perfume, commonly Ganthiala.
	 2. Cloth, clothes.
	 3. The ends
or hem of a cloth.
	 4. A turban, a helmet.
	 5. A plant, (Bignonia
Indica.)
 E. शुभ् to shine, कक् Unādi aff., and the radical final
rejected.
