<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शुकजिह्वा
शुकजिह्वा f. (-ह्वा) A plant, commonly Sūyā-Thontee or parrot's beak.
E. शुक a parrot, and जिह्वा the tongue.
