शुक्ति|शुक्तिः
शुक्ति f. (-क्तिः)
	 1. A pearl-oyster.
	 2. A conch.
	 3. A small shell.
	 4. A
cockle.
	 5. A sort of perfume, in appearance a dried shell-fish.
	 6.
A portion of the skull used as a cup, &c.
	 7. A curl or feather on
a horse's neck or breast.
	 8. A weight of two Karṣas or half a
Pala.
	 9. A disease of the cornea, formation of specks on it.
 E. शुच्
to sorrow, &c., aff. क्तिन् ।
