शुच्
शुच् r. 1st cl. (शोचति) To regret, to grieve for. (ई, इर) ईशूचिर r. 4th cl.
(शुच्यति-ते)
	 1. To be wet.
	 2. To be clean or pure.
	 3. To stink, to be
fetid.
	 4. To wound.
	 5. To regret.
