<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शुच्
शुच् f. (-शुक्)
	 1. Sorrow, grief, distress, regret.
	 2. Calamity, affliction. E.
शुच् to regret, aff. क्विप्; also with टाप् added, शुचा f. (-चा) ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=724-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शुचा
शुचा f. (-चा) Sorrow, distress: see शुच् ।
