	 n. (-ल्वं)
1. Copper.
	 2. A sacrificial observance.
	 3. An institute, a law.
4. A place near water.
	 5. A rope.
 E. शुल्व् to measure, aff. अच्; or
शुध् to be pure, &c., Unādi aff. वन्, and ध changed to ल.
