<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=727-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूर्म्मि|शूर्मि|शूर्मिः|शूर्म्मिः
शूर्म्मि mf. (-र्म्मिः-र्म्मी)
	 1. An iron image.
	 2. An anvil.
 E. शु for शोभा beauty,
and ऊर्म्मि a wave or line, ङीष् optionally added; deriv. irr.; also
with इ rejected, and कन् added, fem. form शूर्म्मिका; again, as
differently read, सूर्म्मि, स्युर्म्मि, &c.
