शूल्
शूल् r. 1st cl. (शूलति)
	 1. To disorder, to distemper or disease.
	 2. To
make a loud noise.
	 3. To impale, to transfix.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=727-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूल|शूलं|शूलः
शूल mn. (-लः-लं)
	 1. Sharp pain in general, or especially in the belly,
as colic, &c., or in the joints, from rheumatism or gout.
	 2. A
weapon, a pike, a dart.
	 3. An iron pin or spit.
	 4. A banner, an
ensign.
	 5. An astrological Yoga, that of the 9th lunar mansion.
6. Death, dying.
	 7. A stake for impaling criminals.
	 f. (-ला)
	 1. A
whore.
	 2. An instrument used for putting criminals to death, a
stake for impaling them.
 E. शूल् to disease, &c., aff. अच् or क ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=727-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूलक|शूलकः
शूलक m. (-कः) A restive horse.
 E. शूल् to distress, वुन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=727-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूलघातन|शूलघातनं
शूलघातन n. (-नं) Iron rust or filings.
 E. शूल pain, घातन what removes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=727-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूलघ्न|शूलघ्नः
शूलघ्न mfn. (-घ्नः-घ्नी-घ्नं) Removing or allaying sharp pain, sedative,
anodyne.
 E. शूल, and घ्न what destroys.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=727-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूलधन्वन्
शूलधन्वन् m. (-न्वा) ŚIVA.
 E. शूल a pike or the three-pronged one, the
trident of this deity, धन्वन् a bow, put for a weapon.
