शूलिन्
शूलिन् mfn. (-ली-लिनी-लि)
	 1. Suffering sharp pain, having the colic, &c.
2. Armed with a spear.
	 m. (-ली)
	 1. MAHĀDEVA.
	 2. A spearman.
	 3.
A stake-bearer.
	 4. A hare.
 E. शूल a trident, and इनि aff.
