<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शृगाल|शृगालः
शृगाल m. (-लः)
	 1. A shakal or jackal.
	 2. A coward, a poltroon.
	 3. A
rogue, a cheat.
	 4. An ill-natured or harsh-speaking man.
	 5. A
demon so named.
	 6. KṚṢṆA.
	 f. (-ली)
	 1. Flight, retreat.
	 2. A fox.
3. A she-jackal.
 E. सृज् to create or abandon, (deceit, &c.) कालन्
aff.; or शृङ्ग a horn, अ negative prefix, ला to possess, aff. क, deriv.
irr.; also सृगाल, &c.
