 E. शृगाल a jackal, कोलि the jujube.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=727-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शृगालजम्बू|शृगालजंबू
शृगालजम्बू f. (-म्बूः)
	 1. A kind of cucumber, (Cucumis madraspatanus.)
2. The fruit of the jujube.
 E. शृगाल a jackal, जम्बू rose-apple. “गोमुक् ।”
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=727-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शृगालिका
शृगालिका f. (-का)
	 1. The female jackal.
	 2. A fox.
	 3. Running away,
flight, retreat.
	 4. A plant, (Convolvulus paniculatus.)
 E. शृगाली as
above, and कन् added.
