शृङ्खल|शृंखल|शृंखलं|शृंखलः|शृङ्खलः
शृङ्खल Subst.
	 mfn. (-लः-ला-लं)
	 1. A belt or chain worn round a man's
body.
	 2. A chain for confining an elephant.
	 3. A chain, a fetter
in general.
 E. शृङ्ग a horn, here said to mean a link, and खल् to
collect, aff. अच्; or शिञ्जा the tinkling of a chain, and स्खल् to go,
aff. अच्, deriv irr.
