शृङ्खलक|शृंखलक|शृंखलकः|शृङ्खलकः
शृङ्खलक m. (-कः)
	 1. A young camel with wooden rings or clogs on his
feet.
	 2. A chain.
 E. शृङ्खल a chain, and कन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=728-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शृङ्खलता
शृङ्खलता f. (-ता)
	 1. Connexion, concatenation.
	 2. Restraint.
 E. तल् added
to शृङ्खल; also with त्व, शृङ्खलत्वं ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=728-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
