शृङ्खलित|शृंखलित|शृङ्खलितः
शृङ्खलित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Bound, chained, fettered, captive.
 E. शृङ्खला a chain, इतच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=728-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शृङ्ग|शृंग|शृंगं|शृङ्गं|शृङ्गः
शृङ्ग n. (-ङ्गं)
	 1. A horn.
	 2. A mark, a sign.
	 3. The top of a mountain.
4. The summit of a building.
	 5. Any point or projection.
	 6. A
horn of the moon.
	 7. A horn used as a wind-instrument.
	 8. Sover-
eignty, mastership.
	 9. Dignity, elevation.
	 10. A fountain, an
artificial one or jet d'eau.
	 11. A lotus.
	 12. Very sharp.
	 13. Minutely
fine.
	 14. Excess of love.
	 m. (-ङ्गः)
	 1. A medicinal root, commonly
Jivaka.
	 2. A Muni so named.
	 f. (-ङ्गी)
	 1. Gold.
	 2. A fish, (Silurus
Singio, HAM.)
	 3. A plant (Betula.)
	 4. Rishabha, a medicinal root,
sharped like a bull's horn.
	 5. Another plant, a kind of Rhus,
with an excrescence or gall in the bark, compared to a crab's
horn.
 E. शॄ to injure, Unādi aff. गन्, and the vowel made short.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=728-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

