शृङ्गक mn. (-कः-कं)
	 1. A horn.
	 2. Any pointed object.
	 3. A horn of the
moon.
	 m. (-कः) A medicinal root, commonly Jivaka.
 E. कन् added
to the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=728-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

