शृङ्गाट n. (-टं) A place where four roads meet.
	 m. (-टः)
	 1. An aquatic
plant, (Trapa bispinosa.)
	 2. A shrub, (Ruellia or Barleria longifo-
lia.)
 E. शृङ्ग a horn, अट् to go or be, aff. अच् ।
