शृङ्गाटक|शृंगाटक|शृङ्गाटकं|शृंगाटकः|शृङ्गाटकः
शृङ्गाटक n. (-कं)
	 1. A place where four roads meet.
	 2. An aquatic plant,
(Trapa bispinosa.)
	 3. A door.
	 m. (-कः) A collection or mountain
of three peaks.
 E. कन् added to the preceding.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=728-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
