शृङ्गारित|शृंगारित
शृङ्गारित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Stained with red-lead, reddened.
	 2. Deco-
rated.
	 3. Affected with passion.
 E. शृङ्गार, and इतच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=728-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
