शृङ्गारिन्|शृंगारिन्
शृङ्गारिन् mfn. (-री-रिणी-रि)
	 1. Feeling or relating to the passion of
love.
	 2. Stained with red-lead.
	 m. (-री)
	 1. An empassioned lover.
2. Dress, decoration.
	 3. An elephant.
	 4. A ruby.
	 5. The betel-nut
tree, (Areca faufel.)
 E. शृङ्गार love, इनि aff. of relation.
