शृङ्गिन्|शृंगिन्
शृङ्गिन् mfn. (-ङ्गी-ङ्गिणी-ङ्गि)
	 1. Horned.
	 2. Crested, peaked.
	 m. (-ङ्गी)
	 1.
An elephant.
	 2. A mountain.
	 3. A tree.
	 4. An epithet of ŚIVA.
5. Name of an attendant of ŚIVA.
	 f. (-ङ्गिणी)
	 1. A cow.
	 2.
Arabian jasmine.
	 3. Heart-pea.
	 4. Katuki, a medicinal plant. E.
शृङ्ग a horn, &c., इनि poss. aff.
