शृणि|शृणिः
शृणि f. (-णिः) The hook for goading an elephant.
 E. शृ to injure, नि
aff., and the radical vowel made short; also सृणि ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=728-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शृण्वत्
शृण्वत् mfn. (-ण्वन्-ण्वन्ती-ण्वत्) Hearing.
 E. श्रु to hear, शतृ aff.
