शृध्
शृध्(उ)शृधु r. 1st. cl. (शर्द्धते) To fart. (शर्द्धति-ते) To cut. r. 10th cl.
(शर्द्धयति-ते)
	 1. To insult, to ridicule.
	 2. To take, to seize.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=728-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शृधु|शृधुः
शृधु f. (-धुः)
	 1. The anus.
	 2. Intellect.
 E. शृध् to fart, &c., Unādi aff.
कू; also read शृधू ।
