शेव|शेवः
शेव m. (-वः)
	 1. The penis.
	 2. A snake.
	 3. Heighth, elevation.
	 4. Happi-
ness.
	 n. (-वं)
	 1. The penis.
	 2. Happiness. Ind. (-वम्) Hail, homage,
a term of exclamation or salutation addressed to the deities. E.
