शेवधि|शेवधिः
शेवधि m. (-धिः) A treasure as belonging to KUVERA, a Nidhi or
substance of extraordinary rarity and value, possessed only by
the god of wealth.
 E. शेव happiness, धा to have, कि aff.; or शे in
future, अवधि boundary.
