शैल|शैलं|शैलः
शैल mfn. (-लः-ली-लं)
	 1. Mountainous, mountaineer, &c.
	 2. Stony, rocky.
m. (-लः) A mountain.
	 n. (-लं)
	 1. Bitumen.
	 2. Storax.
	 3. A sort of
collyrium: see रसाञ्जन.
	 f. (-ली)
	 1. A concise interpretation of a
grammatical aphorism.
	 2. A mode of interpretation.
	 3. Course,
conduct.
 E. शिला a rock, a stone, अण् aff.
