	 4. A flower, (Bignonia Indica.)
	 5. Fire
or its deity.
	 6. An ocean.
	 7. A red sort of sugar-cane.
	 8. The
planet Mars.
	 n. (-णं)
	 1. Red-lead.
	 2. Blood.
 E. शोण् to be red, aff.
अच्, fem. aff. टाप् or ङीप् ।
