शौक|शौकं
शौक n. (-कं)
	 1. A flock of parrots.
	 2. Sorrowfulness.
 E. शुक a parrot,
अञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=731-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौक्त|शौक्तं
शौक्त mfn. (-क्तः-क्ती-क्तं) Acid, acetic.
 E. शुक्त vinegar, अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=731-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौक्तिक
शौक्तिक mfn. (-कः-की-कं)
	 1. Acid, acetic.
	 2. Relating to a pearl, &c. E.
शुक्त or शुक्ति, and ठक् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=731-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौक्तेय|शौक्तेयं
शौक्तेय n. (-यं) A pearl.
 E. शुक्ति a pearl-oyster, ढक् aff.; also from शुक्तिका
with the same, शौक्तिकेय ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=731-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौक्लिकेय|शौक्लिकेयः
शौक्लिकेय m. (-यः) A sort of poison.
 E. शुक्लिक a country, ढक् aff.:
according to some it is the venom of a snake of the Amphisbœna
kind.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=731-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौक्ल्य|शौक्ल्यं
शौक्ल्य n. (-क्ल्यं) Whiteness, clearness.
 E. शुक्ल white, अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=731-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौच|शौचं
शौच n. (-चं)
	 1. Purification by ablution, &c. from personal defilement.
2. Purification at given periods from defilement caused by the
death of a relation, &c.
	 3. The state or property of freedom from
defilement, purity, cleanness.
 E. शुचि purity, अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=731-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौचकल्प
शौचकल्प m. (-ल्पः) A purificatory rite.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=731-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौचकूप|शौचकूपः
शौचकूप m. (-पः) A privy.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=731-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौचविधि
शौचविधि f. (-धिः) The rules of purification after defilement by the
death of a relation, &c.
 E. शौच. and विधि precept.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=731-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौचाचार|शौचाचारः
शौचाचार m. (-रः) A rule of purification, the mode in which the person
is to be cleansed by ablution, &c., after voiding any excrement or
contracting any impurity.
 E. शौच purification, and आचार rule, rite.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=731-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौचेय|शौचेयः
शौचेय m. (-यः) A washerman.
 E. शुचि cleaning, ढक् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=731-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौचेप्सु
शौचेप्सु mfn. (-प्सुः-प्सुः-प्सु) Wishing or intending to be purified.
 E. शीच, इप्सु desirous.
