शौट्
शौट्(ऋ)शौटृ r. 1st cl. (शौटति) To be proud.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=731-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौटीर|शौटीरः
शौटीर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Proud, haughty.
	 m. (-रः)
	 1. A hero.
	 2. An ascetic,
one who abandons the world.
	 3. A proud or haughty man, but of
low tribe or occupation, an upstart.
 E. शौट् to be proud, and इरन्
Unādi aff.; also as derived from शौड the same, शौडीर; also the
short vowel being substituted for the diphthong, शुटीर ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=731-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौटीर्य्य|शौटीर्य|शौटीर्यं|शौटीर्य्यं
शौटीर्य्य n. (-र्य्यं)
	 1. Heroism, prowess.
	 2. Pride, arrogance.
 E. शौटीर a
hero, and ष्यञ् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=731-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौड्
शौड्(ऋ)शौडृ r. 1st cl. (शौडति) To be proud.
