<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौण्ड|शौंड|शौण्डः
शौण्ड mfn. (-ण्डः-ण्डी-ण्डं)
	 1. Drunk, intoxicated.
	 2. Fond of, addicted
to, (as liquor.)
	 3. Skilful, (with a loc.) as in अक्षशौण्ड । f. (-ण्डी)
	 1.
Long-pepper.
	 2. Another sort, (Piper chavya.)
 E. शुण्डा spirituous
liquor, अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=731-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौण्डय्य
शौण्डय्य n. (-र्य्यं) Pride, arrogance.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=731-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

