<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौण्डिर
शौण्डिर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं)
	 1. Proud, haughty.
	 2. Elevated, looking
upwards; more properly शौडीर, and शौठीर as above.
