<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौद्धोदनि|शौद्धोदनिः
शौद्धोदनि m. (-निः) BUDDHA, the founder of the Bauddha sect.
 E. शुद्धो-
दन a prince of the family of IKSHWĀKU, and इञ् aff. of descent.
