<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौद्र|शौद्रः
शौद्र mfn. (-द्रः-द्री-द्रं) Śūdra, servile, relating or belonging to the last
class.
	 m. (-द्रः) The son of a man of either of the first three classes
by a Śūdra woman, the last of the twelve sons acknowledged in
the ancient Hindu law.
 E. शूद्र a Śūdra, and अण् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=731-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौधिका
शौधिका f. (-का) A white variety of panic-seed.
 E. शोधः शोधन मलविरेकस्तस्मै हितः ठक् ।
