शौभनेय|शौभनेयः
शौभनेय mfn. (-यः-यी-यं)
	 1. Sprung from a handsome mother.
	 2. Relating
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=731-b" target="_blank">Page731-b+ 60</a>]
to anything handsome or brilliant.
 E. शोभना a handsome woman,
aff. ढक् ।
