<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौरि|शौरिः
शौरि m. (-रिः)
	 1. A name of VIṢṆU or KṚṢṆA.
	 2. The planet
SATURN.
 E. शूर a proper name or a hero, इञ् aff.
