श्मशानवासिन् mfn. (-सी-सिनी-सि) A ghost, a goblin, a spirit, male or
female, abiding in cemeteries, &c.
 E. श्मशान a cemetery, and वासिन्
who abides; also श्मशाननिवासिन्, श्मशानवर्त्तिन्, &c.
