	 2. A eunuch.
	 3. A multitude, a
heap.
	 mn. (-ण्डः-ण्डं) A quantity of lotuses.
 E. षण् to give, ड
Unādi aff.; also शण्ड, षण्ढ, and शण्ढ, &c.
