षेव्
षेव्(ऋ)षेवृ r. 1st cl. (सेवति-ते)
	 1. To serve, to gratify by service.
	 2. To
rely or depend on.
	 3. To worship.
	 4. To follow, to practise, to be
addicted to.
	 5. To enjoy, (sexually.)
	 6. To dwell in.
	 7. To watch
over. With आ, 1. To enjoy.
	 2. To practise. With उप, 1. To
practise.
	 2. To perform.
	 3. To enjoy.
	 4. To serve. With नि, 1. To
pursue.
	 2. To employ.
	 3. To enjoy.
	 4. To inhabit.
	 5. To observe.
6. To attend. With परि, To take.
