संज्ञ
संज्ञ mfn. (-ज्ञः-ज्ञा-ज्ञं) Knock-kneed.
	 n. (-ज्ञं) A yellow fragrant wood.
f. (-ज्ञा)
	 1. Name, appellation.
	 2. Thought, mind, intellect.
	 3. Con-
sciousness.
	 4. Gesture, sign, gesticulation.
	 5. The sacred verse
or Gāyatri of the Vedas.
	 6. One of the wives of the sun, and
daughter of VISHWAKARMAN.
	 7. (In grammar,) The technical
name of any affix, &c.
 E. सम् before ज्ञा to know, affs. अङ् and
टाप्; that by which anything is known.
