संस्कारजं mfn. (-जः-जा-जं) Produced from a purificatory ceremony, &c.
E. संस्कार as above, with the power of the fifth case, ज born.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=747-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
