संस्थ|संस्थः
संस्थ mfn. (-स्थः-स्था-स्थं)
	 1. Staying, stopping, fixed, stationary.
	 2. Stay-
ing with, associated, domesticated.
	 m. (-स्थः)
	 1. A spy, a secret
emissary.
	 2. A countryman, a neighbour, a person of the same
country, &c.
	 3. A dweller, an inhabitant.
	 f. (-स्था)
	 1. Continuance
in the right way, correct conduct.
	 2. State or condition of being,
time of life, &c.
	 3. Occupation, business, profession.
	 4. Stop,
stay.
