सकल|सकलं
सकल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं) All, whole, entire.
	 f. (-ला)
	 1. Together with
a part.
	 2. Entire.
	 3. With all the digits, full, (as the moon.)
	 4.
Having a soft or low sound.
 E. स with, कला a part, अच् aff.
