सकुल|सकुलः
सकुल mfn. (-लः-ला-लं)
	 1. Belonging to a noble family.
	 2. Belonging
the same family.
	 m. (-लः)
	 1. A Kinsman.
	 2. A sort of fish; also
शकुल.
 E. स with, कुल a family.
