सक्थि
सक्थि n. (-क्थि)
	 1. The thigh.
	 2. Part of the frame of a cart.
	 3. A bone.
In compound सक्थि is changed to सक्थ after उत्तर, पूर्व, मृग, or a
word denoting an object with which it is compared.
 E. षञ्ज् to
unite, Unādi aff. क्थिन् ।
