सखि
सखि m. (सखा)
	 1. A friend.
	 2. An associate, a companion.
	 f. (-खी) A
woman's female friend or companion, a confidante, &c.
 E. स for
समान all, (the world,) ख्या to celebrate, aff. इन्, and ङीष् fem. aff.;
the masc. noun is irregularly inflected. At the end of compounds
सखि is changed to सख ।
