<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सगोत्र|सगोत्रं|सगोत्रः
सगोत्र mfn. (-त्रः-त्रा-त्रं) Being of one family, of kin, related.
	 m. (-त्रः)
1. A distant kinsman.
	 2. A kinsman of the same family-name,
or one sprung from a common ancestor; one connected by funer-
al oblations of food and water.
	 n. (-त्रं) A family, a race or lineage.
E. स for समान like, common, and गोत्र family.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=749-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सग्धि|सग्धिः
सग्धि f. (-ग्धिः) Eating together.
 E. स for सम् with, अद् to eat, क्तिच् aff.;
घस् is substituted for the root, the स rejected, घ changed to ग ।
