<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्घट
सङ्घट mfn. (-टः-टा-टं)
	 1. Narrow, contracted.
	 2. Crowded.
	 3. Impass-
able, impervious.
	 n. (-टं)
	 1. Difficulty, trouble.
	 2. A defile, a pass.
E. सम् before कटच् aff.
