सङ्कटाक्ष|संकटाक्ष|सङ्कटाक्षः
सङ्कटाक्ष mfn. (-क्षः-क्षी-क्षं) Winking, leering.
	 m. (-क्षः) A tree, (Grislea
tomentosa.)
 E. सङ्कट contracted, अक्षि the eye.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=749-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कथा|संकथा
सङ्कथा f. (-था) Conversation, discourse, talking together.
 E. सम् toge-
ther, कथा speech; also सङ्कथन, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=749-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कर|संकर|संकरः|सङ्करः
सङ्कर m. (-रः)
	 1. Mixing, blending, confounding.
	 2. A mixed caste or
race, one proceeding from the promiscuous intercourse of the
four tribes in the first instance, and again from their commerce
with the descendants of such a connection, or the indiscriminate
cohabitation of those descendants amongst one another; most
Hindus of the present age are of one of the many branches of
this race, the highest of which is impure and inferior to the
Śūdra: under this term two kinds of men are included according
to the Rāmāyana; the one denominated योनिसङ्कर, mixed or
degraded by birth and the other आचारसङ्कर degraded by conduct.
3. The mixing together of two or more dependent figures of speech
in the same passage.
	 4. Dust, sweepings.
	 5. The crackling of
flame.
	 f. (-री) A new bride.
 E. सम् before कॄ to scatter, or कृ to
make, aff. अप्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=749-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्करीकरण|संकरीकरण|सङ्करीकरणं
सङ्करीकरण n. (-णं)
	 1. Reducing to the state of the mixed or outcaste
tribes, causing loss of caste.
	 2. Blending, mixing.
	 3. Confusion,
either in kind, number, arrangement.
 E. सङ्कर a mixed-race, च्वि
augment, करण doing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=749-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्करीकृत
सङ्करीकृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Blended, mixed, confused.
	 2. Outcaste.
 E. सङ्कर, and कृत made, च्वि augment.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=749-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कर्षण|संकर्षण|संकर्षणं|सङ्कर्षणं|संकर्षणः|सङ्कर्षणः
सङ्कर्षण n. (-णं)
	 1. Attracting, drawing.
	 2. Ploughing, making
furrows, &c.
	 m. (-णः) BALADEVA.
 E. सम् before कृष् to plough, &c.,
aff. युच् or ल्युट्. As applied to the demi-god it refers to his re-
moval in embryo from the womb of DEVAKĪ to that of ROHIṆĪ.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=749-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कल|संकल|संकलः|सङ्कलः
सङ्कल m. (-लः)
	 1. Collection, quantity.
	 2. Addition.
 E. सम् together,
कल् to number, aff. अच् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=749-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कलन|संकलन|संकलनं|सङ्कलनं
सङ्कलन nf. (-नं-ना)
	 1. Contact, junction.
	 2. Blending, clinging, twin-
ing, intermixture.
	 3. Heaping as corn, &c.
	 n. (-नं) Addition, (in
arithmetic.)
 E. सम् with or like, कल् to number, aff. युच् or ल्युट् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=749-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कला|संकला
सङ्कला Aptote. Killing, slaughter.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=749-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कलित|संकलित|सङ्कलितः
सङ्कलित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Heaped, piled, arranged.
	 2. Brought in con-
tact, blended, intermixed.
	 3. Laid hold of.
	 4. Added.
	 n. (-तं)
Addition, (in arithmetic.)
 E. सम् before कल् to number, aff. क्त ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=749-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कल्प|संकल्प|संकल्पः|सङ्कल्पः
सङ्कल्प m. (-ल्पः)
	 1. Volition, will, resolve, mental determination.
	 2. A
solemn vow or declaration of purpose.
	 3. Expectation of desired
consequences from any voluntary act.
 E. सम् before कृप् to be able,
aff. घञ्, and the र changed to ल ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=749-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कल्पज|संकल्पज|संकल्पजः
सङ्कल्पज mfn. (-जः-जा-जं) Born of or proceeding from the hope or
expectation of advantage.
	 m. (-जः) KĀMA or love.
