passes, &c.
	 2. The means of effecting such a passage, a causeway
a bridge, &c.
	 m. (-मः)
	 1. Going, moving, travelling.
	 2. The pass-
age of a planetary body through the zodiac.
	 3. Passage from one
point to another, traversing, transit, transition.
	 4. Concurrence. E.
सम् before क्रम् to go, aff. अच् ।
