	 4. Moving, putting in
motion.
	 5. Transmitted, hereditary, (as disease.)
	 6. Contagious.
m. (-री)
	 1. Incense.
	 2. A division of the Bhāvas, the same as the
व्यभिचारिन्, q. v. or the reverse of the स्थायिन् or fixed and steady
sentiments.
	 3. An evanescent feeling which strengthens the per-
vading sentiments.
	 4. Air, wind.
 E. सम् before चर् to go, णिनि aff.
