सत्त्रशाला
सत्त्रशाला f. (-ला) An apartment in which Brāhmans or mendicants, &c.
are presented with food and gifts.
 E. सत्र giving, and शाला a house.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=753-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सत्त्रा
सत्त्रा Ind. With, together with.
 E. स for सह with, त्रा to preserve, aff.
क्विप्; also written, सत्रा ।
