<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सत्त्रि
सत्त्रि m. (-त्त्रिः)
	 1. A cloud.
	 2. An elephant.
	 3. A victor, a conqueror.
E. षद् to go, or waste, to destroy, &c., Unādi aff. त्रि ।
