<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सत्त्रिन्
सत्त्रिन् m. (-त्त्री)
	 1. A liberal house-keeper, one constantly performing
sacrifice and distributing alms.
	 2. An ambassador, an agent
residing in a foreign country.
	 3. A priest superintending or per-
forming a sacrifice.
 E. सत्त्र munificence, &c., इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=753-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
