<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सनातन|सनातनः
सनातन mfn. (-नः-नी-नं)
	 1. Eternal, continual, perpetual.
	 2. Firm, fixed,
permanent.
	 3. Primeval.
	 m. (-नः)
	 1. VIṢṆU.
	 2. ŚIVA.
	 3. BRAHMĀ.
4. A guest of the Manes, or one who is to be fed whenever he
chooses to attend the obsequial ceremonies or Śhrāddhas.
	 f. (-नी)
1. The goddess LAKṢMĪ.
	 2. A name of DURGĀ.
	 3. SARASVATĪ.
E. सना always, and द्यु or द्युत् aff.; or सदा ठ्युल् तुट् च नि० दस्य नः ।
