सभाजित
सभाजित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Treated with courtesy, gratified, pleased.
 E. सभाज् to please, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=760-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभापति|सभापतिः
सभापति m. (-तिः)
	 1. The keeper of a gaming-house.
	 2. The president of
an assembly.
 E. सभा an assembly, (of gamblers, &c.) पति master.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=760-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभावशकर
सभावशकर mfn. (-रः-री-रं) Influencing or fascinating an assembly.
E. सभा, वशकर what subdues.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=760-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभासद्
सभासद् m. (-सत् or सद्) One of a company, an assistant at an assembly
or meeting; (in law, an assessor.)
 E. सभा an assembly, सद् who
goes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=760-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभास्तार|सभास्तारः
सभास्तार m. (-रः) An assistant at an assembly, one of a company. E.
सभा an assembly, स्तृ to cover, aff. अण् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=760-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभिक|सभिकः
सभिक m. (-कः) The keeper of a gaming-house.
 E. सभा an assembly, ठन्
aff; also with the penultimate vowel made long, सभीक ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=760-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभीक|सभीकः
सभीक m. (-कः) The keeper of a gaming-house: see the last.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=760-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभोचित|सभोचितः
सभोचित m. (-तः) A Paṇḍit, a learned Brāhman or teacher.
 E. सभा an
assembly, and उचित fit, proper.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=760-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभ्य|सभ्यः
सभ्य mfn. (-भ्यः-भ्या-भ्यं)
	 1. Trusted, confidential, faithful.
	 2. Relating to
an assembly, fit for or suitable to it.
	 3. Polite.
	 4. Civilized.
	 m.
(-भ्यः)
	 1. An assistant at an assembly.
	 2. An assessor.
	 3. A person
of honourable parentage.
	 4. The keeper of a gambling-house.
	 5.
A servant of the keeper of a gaming-house.
 E. सभा an assembly,
&c., यत् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=760-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभ्यतम
सभ्यतम m. (-मः) A distinguished person, one who is an ornament of
society.
 E. सभ्य, and तमप् affix of superlative.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=760-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभ्यता
सभ्यता f. (-ता) Politeness, refinement in manners.
 E. सभ्य, and तल् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=760-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्
सम् Ind. A particle and prefix implying:--1. Union, junction, (with,
together.)
	 2. Assemblage, collection.
	 3. Beauty or perfection.
	 4.
Intensity. As a prefix it corresponds to con, co, com, &c. Before a
consonant the final of this word is changed to Anuswara, and is
written सं.
 E. सो-वा० कमु ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=760-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम|समः
सम mfn. Pron. (-मः-मा-मं)
	 1. All, whole, entire. (Adj.)
	 1. Like, similar.
2. Good, virtuous.
	 3. Full, complete.
	 4. Same, even, equal.
	 5. In-
different, impartial.
	 6. Mean.
	 f. (-मा)
	 1. A year.
	 2. Even,
plain, level.
	 3. Same.
	 4. Equal.
	 5. Convenient.
	 6. Straight.
	 7.
Indifferent, impartial, fair.
	 8. Common.
	 9. Like, similar.
	 10. Free
from emotion.
	 11. Good, virtuous.
	 12. Honest, just.
	 13. Full,
complete, &c.: see समा: n. (-मं)
	 1. A figure of rhetoric, identity or
sameness of objects compared to one another.
	 2. (In geometry), A
mean; a fourth proportional to the two perpendiculars and the
link or segment.
 E. सम् to be confused or unconfused, aff. अच् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=760-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समकन्या
समकन्या f. (-न्या) A girl fit to be married.
 E. सम complete, कन्या a virgin.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=760-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समकर्ण|समकर्णः
समकर्ण mn. (-र्णः-र्णं) An equidiagonal tetragon.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=760-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समकाल|समकालः
समकाल n. (-लं) The same time, the same moment.
 E. सम and काल time.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=760-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समकालीन
समकालीन Adj. Contemporary.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=760-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समकोल|समकोलः
समकोल n. (-लं) A snake, a serpent.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=760-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समक्न|समक्नः
समक्न mfn. (-क्नः-क्ना-क्नं) Going or moving equally, kept equal or
together.
 E. सम् together, अञ्च् to go, क्त aff.
