<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समक्षम्
समक्षम् Ind. Before, in presence or sight of, visible.
 E. सम् with, अक्षि
the eye, aff. टच् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=760-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समक्षेत्र
समक्षेत्र n. (-त्रं) An epithet of a particular division of the Nakshatras, in astronomy.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=760-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समखात|समखातः
समखात m. (-तः) An oblong excavation, thence also a parallelopipedon,
(in geometry.)
 E. सम equal, खात dug.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=760-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समगन्धक|समगन्धकः
समगन्धक m. (-कः) Compounded perfume.
 E. सम same, even, गन्ध smell, कन् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=760-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समग्र|समग्रः
समग्र mfn. (-ग्रः-ग्रा-ग्रं) All, entire, whole, full, complete.
 E. सम the
whole, ग्रह् to take, ड aff.
