<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समङ्गा|समंगा
समङ्गा f. (-ङ्गा)
	 1. Bengal madder, (Rubia manjith.)
	 2. A sort of fern,
(Lycopodium imbricatum.)
	 3. A sort of sensitive plant.
 E. सम् to-
gether, अगि to go or grow, aff. अच् ।
