समचितत्व
समचितत्व n. (-त्वं)
	 1. Indifference.
	 2. Equanimity.
 E. त्व added to the
last; also with तल्, समचित्तता ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=760-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
