<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समज्या
समज्या f. (-ज्या)
	 1. An assembly, a meeting.
	 2. Fame, celebrity.
 E. सम्
together, अज् to go, क्यप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=760-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समञ्जस|समंजस|समञ्जसं|समञ्जसः
समञ्जस mfn. (-सः-सा-सं)
	 1. Proper, right, fit.
	 2. Exercised, experienced.
3. Correct, accurate, true.
	 4. Virtuous, good.
	 n. (-सं)
	 1. Propriety,
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=761-a" target="_blank">Page761-a+ 60</a>]
fitness.
	 2. Correct evidence.
 E. सम् with, together with, अञ्जसा truly.
