समतिक्रम m. (-मः)
	 1. Deviating from, transgressing.
	 2. Going over or
beyond.
 E. सम् and अति before क्रम् to go, अच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=761-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समतिक्रान्त
समतिक्रान्त mfn. (-न्तः-न्ता-न्तं)
	 1. Surpassed, exceeded.
	 2. Gone over or
beyond.
	 3. Transgressed.
 E. सम्, and अति before क्रम् to go, क्त aff.
