<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समतिरिक्त|समतिरिक्तं
समतिरिक्त mfn. (-क्तः-क्ता-क्तं) Much, exceeding, abundant.
 E. सम् with,
and अतिरिक्त much.
