<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समतीत
समतीत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Past, gone.
 E. सम्, and अतीत past.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=761-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समत्रिभुज|समत्रिभुजः
समत्रिभुज m. (-जः) An equilateral triangle.
 E. सम, and त्रिभुज triangle.
