समाहित|समाहितः
समाहित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Promised, agreed or assented to.
	 2. Absorbed
in meditation, absent, abstracted or having the senses steadily
held in subjection.
	 3. Concluded, demonstrated, following from
what has been said.
	 4. Composed, reconciled, put an end to, (as
a contest or dispute.)
	 5. Placed, deposited, delivered.
	 6. Pure,
purified.
	 7. Finished, completed.
	 8. Cool, collected, firm.
	 9.
Assembled.
	 n. (-तं) (In rhetoric,) The expression or description of
attentiveness.
 E. सम् and आङ् implying collection or perfection, धा
to have or hold, aff. क्त ।
