समूढ|समूढः
समूढ mfn. (-ढः-ढा-ढं)
	 1. Heaped, accumulated, assembled, collected.
2. Crooked, bent.
	 3. Produced quickly.
	 4. Accompanying, associated,
a companion.
	 5. Tamed, tranquillized.
	 6. Married.
	 7. Purified,
cleansed.
	 8. Led, conducted.
	 9. Enveloped.
 E. सम् before वह् to bear,
or ऊह् to reason, aff. क्त ।
