सम्पात|संपात|संपातः|सम्पातः
सम्पात m. (-तः)
	 1. Descending, falling, coming down.
	 2. Alighting, (as
a bird.)
	 3. A special mode of flight, (attributed to birds.)
	 4. Being
removed or displaced.
	 5. Flying of arrows.
	 6. Meeting.
	 7. Con-
currence, butting together.
	 8. Going, moving.
	 9. The son of
GARUḌA.
 E. सम् before पत् to alight, aff. घञ् ।
