सर्पफण
सर्पफण(णि)ज m. (-जः) The snake-stone, a gem or pearl said to resemble
in form the berry of the Abrus precatorius, and to be found in
the head of the snake.
 E. सर्प a snake, फण hood, ज born.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=773-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सर्पभुज्
सर्पभुज् m. (-भुक्)
	 1. A peacock.
	 2. A crane.
	 3. A large snake.
 E. सर्प a
snake, भुज who eats.
