सर्पमणि|सर्पमणिः
सर्पमणि m. (-णिः) The snake-stone or carbuncle, or a jewel said to be
found in the head of a snake, possessing also alexipharmic proper-
ties.
 E. सर्प a snake, and मणि a gem.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=773-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सर्पमाला
सर्पमाला f. (-ला) A plant, commonly SARPA-KANKĀLI.
