साध्
साध्(उ)साधु r. 4th cl. (साध्यति-ते) To be completed. (औ) साधौ r. 5th cl.
(साध्नोति)
	 1. To finish, to perfect, to complete, or accomplish.
	 2. To
conquer. r. 10th cl. (साधयति-ते) To go, to depart; also षाध् ।
