साधक|साधकः
साधक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Completing, perfecting, finishing, who or what
effects or completes.
	 f. (-धका or धिका)
	 1. Fulfilling.
	 2. Effecting by
magic.
	 3. Skilful, adept.
	 4. Aiding, helping.
 E. साध् to finish, ण्वुल् aff.
