साप्तपदीन n. (-नं)
	 1. Friendship.
	 2. Circumambulation of the nuptial fire
by the bride and bridegroom in seven steps, (after which the mar-
riage is complete.)
 E. सप्त seven, पद a step or pace, and खञ् aff.; to
be formed with any with whom seven paces are walked together.
