सामन्त mfn. (-न्तः-न्ती-न्तं)
	 1. Limitative, boundary, bounding.
	 2. Bordering,
neighbouring.
	 3. Universal.
	 m. (-न्तः)
	 1. The chief of a district.
	 2. A
neighbour.
	 3. An attendant or companion of a chieftain.
	 4. A
leader, a captain, a champion.
	 5. A neighbouring prince.
	 n. (-न्तं)
Neighbourhood.
 E. समन्त end, term, अण् aff. of relation.
