suitableness.
	 3. Capacity, adequacy.
	 4. (In grammar,) Mutual
relation of words.
	 5. Sense or force of words.
	 6. Wealth.
	 7. Interest,
advantage.
	 8. Sameness of aim or object.
 E. समर्थ्य able, ष्यञ् aff.
