(-सं)
	 1. A lotus.
	 2. A woman's zone.
	 mf. (-सः-सी) The Sāras or
Indian crane, male and female, (Ardea Sibirica.)
	 m. (-सः)
	 1. The
moon.
	 2. A bird in general.
 E. सरस् a pond, a lake, अण् aff.
