	 3. Significant importing, having meaning.
	 m. (-र्थः)
	 1. A
multitude of similar animals.
	 2. A company of traders, a caravan,
&c.
	 3. A number or multitude in general.
	 4. A wealthy man.
	 f.
(-र्था)
	 1. Having an object.
	 2. Useful, serviceable.
 E. सृ to go, causal
form, थन् Unādi aff.; or स for सह, &c., and अर्थ wealth or meaning.
