	 2. A tree in
general.
	 3. The Śal tree, (Shoroa robusta.)
	 4. A fish, (Ophioce-
phalus Wrahl, HAM.)
	 f. (-ला)
	 1. A house.
	 2. A rampart; more
usually शाला.
 E. षल् to go, घञ् aff.; also शाल ।
