Any fixed or established text-book resting on conclusive argu-
ments.
 E. सिद्ध completed, perfect, and अन्त end, conclusion.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=787-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

