सीतायाःपति|सीतायाःपतिः
सीतायाःपति m. (-तिः) RĀMA.
 E. सीता in the poss. case, पति husband.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=788-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सीतीनक|सीतीनकः
सीतीनक m. (-कः) Pease: see सतीलक, सतीनक, &c.
