<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सीत्कार|सीत्कारः
सीत्कार n. (-रं) Uttering an inarticulate sound, such as is made with
the lips when a person shivers with cold, or in fainting, sighing,
&c.
 E. सीत् imitative sound, and कार making; also सीत्कृत n. (-तं).
