सीत्कृत|सीत्कृतं
सीत्कृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Uttered as an inarticulated sound.
	 n. (-तं) An
inarticulate sound: see the last.
 E. सीत्, and कृत made.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=788-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सीत्य|सीत्यं
सीत्य mfn. (-त्यः-त्या-त्यं) Ploughed, tilled.
	 n. (-त्यं) Corn, grain, rice, &c.
E. सीता a furrow, यत् aff.; also शीत्य ।
