सीदत्
सीदत् mfn. (-दन्-दन्ती-दत्)
	 1. Sorrowing, grieving, desponding.
	 2. Decaying.
3. Suffering from, distressed or pained by.
	 4. Going.
 E. षद् to
wane, शतृ aff.
