<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सीमन्
सीमन् m. (-मा)
	 1. A boundary, a limit, a landmark, or mound, &c. serving
to fix the limits of estates, &c.
	 2. A field.
	 3. The nape of the neck.
4. The scrotum.
 E. षिञ् to bind, इमनिन्, Unādi aff.; also with the
aff. डाष्, or a final vowel, fem. form, सीमा ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=788-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सीमन्त|सीमंत|सीमंतः|सीमन्तः
सीमन्त m. (-न्तः)
	 1. A separation of the hair on each side, so as to leave a
distinct line on the top of the head.
	 2. A boundary line.
	 mn. (-न्तः-न्तं)
The head.
 E. सीमन् limit, (of the hair,) and अन्त end, form irr.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=788-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सीमन्तक|सीमंतक|सीमन्तकं|सीमंतकः|सीमन्तकः
सीमन्तक m. (-कः) An infernal being.
	 n. (-कं) Red lead, a mark with which
is sometimes made along the division of the hair.
 E. कन् added to
the last.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=788-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सीमन्तित|सीमंतित
सीमन्तित f. (-ता)
	 1. Marked by a line.
	 2. Parted, (as hair.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=788-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सीमन्तिनी|सीमंतिनी
सीमन्तिनी f. (-नी) A woman in general.
 E. सीमन्त the separation of the
hair, and इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=788-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सीमन्तोन्नयन|सीमंतोन्नयन|सीमन्तोन्नयनं
सीमन्तोन्नयन n. (-नं) One of the Sanskāras or a purificatory and sacrificial
ceremony, observed by women in the fourth, sixth, or eighth
month of their pregnancy.
 E. सीमन्त partition of the hair, and
उन्नयन arranging; this forming an essential part of the rite.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=788-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सीमन्त्यमान
सीमन्त्यमान mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Being parted or divided.
 E. सीमन्त used as a
passive verb, शानच् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=789-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सीमा
सीमा f. (-मा)
	 1. A boundary, a limit.
	 2. A field.
	 3. A bank, a shore.
4. Rectitude observance of due bounds in morals, &c.
	 5. The nape
of the neck.
	 6. The scrotum.
	 7. A mound or ridge serving to mark
the boundary of a field. village, &c.
	 8. A landmark.
	 9. The horizon.
10. A suture, (of a skull.)
	 11. The utmost limit, last degree, (fig.)
E. सीमन् + ढाप्: see सीमन् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=789-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सीमानिश्चय|सीमानिश्चयः
सीमानिश्चय m. (-यः) A legal decision with respect to boundaries, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=789-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सीमान्त|सीमांत|सीमान्तः
सीमान्त m. (-न्तः) A frontier line, a border.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=789-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सीमालिङ्ग|सीमालिंग
सीमालिङ्ग n. (-ङ्गं) A land or boundary-mark.
 E. सीमा, and लिङ्ग mark.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=789-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सीमावाद|सीमावादः
सीमावाद m. (-दः) A dispute about boundaries; also सीमाविवाद ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=789-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सीमाविवाद|सीमाविवादः
सीमाविवाद m. (-दः) Litigation or dispute respecting boundaries.
 E. सीमा
and विवाद dispute.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=789-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सीमावृक्ष|सीमावृक्षः
सीमावृक्ष m. (-क्षः) A tree serving as a boundary-mark.
 E. सीमा, वृक्ष a tree.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=789-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सीमासन्धि|सीमासंधि|सीमासंधिः
सीमासन्धि m. (-न्धिः) The meeting of two boundaries.
 E. सीमा, सन्धि junction.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=789-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सीमीक
सीमीक m. (-कः)
	 1. A kind of tree.
	 2. An ant-hill.
	 3. An ant or any
similar small insect.
 E. ष्यम् to sound, and कीकन् Unādi aff., य
changed to इ, and that made long.
