<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सीर|सीरः
सीर m. (-रः)
	 1. A plough.
	 2. The sun.
	 3. The Arka plant.
 E. षि to bind,
Unādi aff. रन्, and the vowel made long; also शीर ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=789-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सीरक|सीरकः
सीरक m. (-कः)
	 1. A porpoise.
	 2. A plough.
	 3. The sun.
	 4. The Arka plant.
E. सीर a plough, कन् aff. of comparison.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=789-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सीरध्वज|सीरध्वजः
सीरध्वज m. (-जः) An epithet of JANAKA.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=789-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सीरपाणि|सीरपाणिः
सीरपाणि m. (-णिः) BALADEVA.
 E. सीर a plough, and पाणि the hand.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=789-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सीरयोग|सीरयोगः
सीरयोग m. (-गः) The yoking of cattle to a plough, or a team so yoked.
