सु
सु Ind. A particle and prefix analogous to good, well, or the Greek
Eu, and implying:--1. Reverence, worship, honour.
	 2. Assent.
3. Increase, prosperity.
	 4. Excess, exceeding.
	 5. Pain, distress.
6. Pleasure, delight.
	 7. With ease.
	 8. Beauty.
 E. षु to go, aff. ड ।
