	 2. A plant,
commonly Rāsnā, a kind of Ophiorrhiza, (Ophiorrhiza mangos.)
3. A sort of fennel, (Anethum sowa.)
	 4. The moon-plant,
(Asclepias acida.)
	 5. A name of DURGĀ.
	 6. A species of the
Atidhriti-metre.
	 n. (-सं)
	 1. Gum-myrrh.
	 2. Cassia bark.
	 3. Fragrant
grass.
 E. सु excellent, रस juice or flavour.
