सुवर्ण mfn. (-र्णः-र्णा-र्णं)
	 1. Of a good tribe or caste.
	 2. Brilliant, bright.
3. Of a good colour.
	 4. Praiseworthy.
	 n. (-र्णं)
	 1. Gold.
