	 m. (-र्णः)
	 1. A tree, (Cassia fistula.)
	 2.
A sort of sacrifice.
	 f. (-र्णा)
	 1. Aloe-wood, the black kind.
	 2.
Turmeric.
	 3. A bitter gourd. (Colocynth.)
	 4. Sida, (Cordifolia, &c.)
E. सु excellent, वर्ण tribe or colour, &c.
