सूच्
सूच् r. 10th cl. (सूचयति-ते)
	 1. To give information.
	 2. To espy.
	 3. To
trace out, to ascertain.
	 4. To indicate by gesture.
	 5. To betray,
to reveal, to inform against.
	 6. To point out, to suggest.
	 7. To
pierce. With अभि, To indicate. With सम्, To foreshadow.
