	 f. (-ची) A
needle: see सूचि.
	 f. (-चा)
	 1. Gesticulation.
	 2. Sight, seeing.
	 3. Pier-
cing.
 E. सिव् to sew, चट् Unādi aff., and ऊ substituted for the
final; or सूच् to make known, affs. अच् and टाप् ।
