सूरि|सूरिः
सूरि m. (-रिः)
	 1. A Paṇḍit, a learned man.
	 2. A title commonly
given to Jaina teachers.
	 3. KṚṢṆA.
	 4. The sun.
	 5. A priest.
6. A worshipper.
 E. षू to bear, Unādi aff. क्रिन् ।
