<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूरिन्
सूरिन् mfn. (-री-रिणी-रि) Wise, learned.
	 m. (-री) A Paṇḍit, a scholar,
a learned man.
 E. सूर् to injure, to dispel, (ignorance, &c.) णिनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=801-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूरी
सूरी f. (-री) Name of the wife of the sun.
