सृज्
सृज् r. 4th cl. (सृज्यते) r. 6th cl. (सृजति)
	 1. To leave, to quit.
	 2. To
be left or abandoned.
	 3. To create, to make.
	 4. To let loose.
5. To shed.
	 6. To throw.
	 7. To place on, to apply.
	 8. To
beget.
	 9. To send away. With अति, 1. To leave.
	 2. To give.
3. To remit. With अभि, To give. With अव, 1. To let loose.
	 2. To
cast. With उद्, 1. To shed.
	 2. To let loose.
	 3. To abandon.
	 4. To
shoot.
	 5. To throw away.
	 6. To dismiss.
	 7. To return.
	 8. To repu-
diate.
	 9. To decline. With उप, 1. To pour out or on, to make an
oblation.
	 2. To join.
	 3. To oppress.
	 4. To eclipse. With नि, To
deliver, to set free. With प्र, 1. To abandon.
	 2. To injure. With वि,
1. To shed.
	 2. To abandon.
	 3. To drop.
	 4. To send.
	 5. To let fall.
6. To repudiate.
	 7. To utter.
	 8. To give. With उत् or वि prefixed,
To abandon, to quit, to reject. With सम्, To unite, to be in
alliance or contact with.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=802-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

