सेव्
सेव् (ऋ) सेवृ r. 1st cl. (सेवते)
	 1. To serve, to gratify by service.
	 2.
To follow.
	 3. To use, to enjoy.
	 4. To attend to, to cultivate, to
perform.
	 5. To enjoy, (sexually.)
	 6. To dwell in, to frequent.
	 7. To
watch over. With आ, 1. To enjoy.
	 2. To practise. With उप, 1. To
apply oneself to.
	 2. To perform.
	 3. To enjoy.
	 4. To serve. With
नि, 1. To pursue.
	 2. To practise.
	 3. To employ.
	 4. To enjoy.
	 5. To
inhabit.
	 6. To observe.
	 7. To attend. With परि, To take;
preferably षेवृ ।
