सौम्यकृच्छ्र mn. (-च्छ्रः-च्छ्रं) A religious penance, subsisting for five days,
severally, on sesamum after expression, the water of boiled-rice,
butter-milk mixed with water, water, and parched grain, and fast-
ing on the sixth day.
 E. सौम्य relating to the moon, कृच्छ्र penance.
