सौर|सौरः
सौर mfn. (-रः-री-रं)
	 1. Solar.
	 2. Celestial.
	 3. Spirituous.
	 m. (-रः)
	 1.
The planet SATURN.
	 2. A month, consisting of thirty rising and
settings of the sun, a solar month.
	 3. A solar day, whilst the sun
is in one degree of the ecliptic.
	 4. A worshipper of the sun.
	 f. (-री)
The wife of the sun.
	 n. (-रं) Name of a collection of hymns,
(taken from the Rig-Veda,) addressed to ŚURYA.
 E. सुर a deity, &c.,
or सूर the sun, अण् aff.; or सूर्य्य the sun, ङीष् aff. for the fem. form.
