<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तम्भ्|स्तंभ्
स्तम्भ् (उ) स्तम्भु r. 5th. cl. (स्तभ्नोति) r. 9th. cl. (स्तभ्नाति)
	 1. To stop, to
block, to hinder.
	 2. To be stupid or insensible; also उम्भ् ।
