स्तम्भन|स्तंभन|स्तंभनं|स्तम्भनं|स्तम्भनः
स्तम्भन n. (-नं)
	 1. Stopping, hindering, obstruction.
	 2. Suppression of
any of the bodily faculties by magical incantations.
	 3. Stopping
the flow of blood, &c.
	 4. Any article so employed, a styptic,
an astringent.
	 5. Stunning, benumbing.
	 6. Propping, supporting.
m. (-नः) An epithet of one of the five arrows of KĀMADEVA. E.
ष्टभि to stop, aff. युच् or ल्युट् ।
