tree.
	 2. A town, a city.
	 3. A bubble or a bead on spirits or wine
4. Position, situation.
	 5. A particular point or situation in drama-
tic action.
	 6. A mode of recitation.
	 7. A division or section of the
Taittirīya branch of the Yayur-Veda.
 E. कन् added to the last.
