<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नानीय|स्नानीयं
स्नानीय mfn. (-यः-या-यं) Ablutionary, fit or proper for bathing in, or to
be used at bathing, as perfumed powders, &c.
	 n. (-यं) Water or
any other article, (such as unguents, perfumes, &c.) proper for
