<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नायु|स्नायुः
स्नायु f. (-युः)
	 1. A tendon, a muscle, described as a tubular vessel
attached to the bones at either end, and carrying vital air.
	 2. The
string of a bow.
 E. ष्णा to bathe, उण् Unādi aff., and युक् augment;
also with कन् added, स्नायुक; or स्नाति-शुध्यति दोषोऽनया ।
