<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नाय्वर्मन्|स्नाय्वर्म्मन्
स्नाय्वर्मन् n. (-र्म) A kind of disease of the eyes.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=814-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नाव|स्नावः
स्नाव m. (-वः) A tendon, a muscle; also स्नावन्.
