स्फुट|स्फुटः
स्फुट mfn. (-टः-टा-टं)
	 1. Blown, opened, expanded, (as a flower.)
	 2.
Apparent, manifest, evident.
	 3. Known, understood.
	 4. Plain, dis-
tinct.
	 5. Spread, diffused.
	 6. White, bright.
	 7. Burst, broken.
	 8.
Rent, torn.
	 9. Loud.
	 10. (In astronomy,) True or apparent,
as स्फुटसूर्य्यगतिः true or apparent motion of the sun.
	 f. (-टा) The
expanded hood of a snake.
 E. स्फुट् to blow, as a flower, &c., aff. क.
