स्फुर्
स्फुर् r. 6th cl. (स्फुरति)
	 1. To throb, to beat.
	 2. To move.
	 3. To swell.
	 4.
To struggle.
	 5. To start, to dart.
	 6. To spring back, to rebound.
7. To break forth.
	 8. To start into view.
	 9. To flash, to scintillate.
10. To shine.
	 11. To flash on the mind.
	 12. To go tremulously.
13. To bruise, to destroy. With अभि, 1. To expand.
	 2. To become
known. With प्र, 1. To tremble.
	 2. To expand.
	 3. To spread wide.
With वि, 1. To tremble.
	 2. To struggle.
	 3. To glitter.
	 4. To draw,
to twang, (as a bow.)
