	 1. Trembling, throbbing, pulsation.
	 2. Quivering of
the lips, throbbing of the eyes, &c.
	 3. Expansion of mind.
	 4.
Springing on memory.
	 5. Springing or breaking forth, starting
into view.
	 6. Flashing, twinkling.
 E. स्फुर् to shake, aff. ल्युट् or युच्,
and the radical vowel unchanged; also स्फोरण n. (-णं)
