स्फुरित|स्फुरितं
स्फुरित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Shaken, agitated.
	 2. Trembling, heaving,
throbbing, palpitating.
	 3. Flashing.
	 4. Swelled, swollen.
	 n. (-तं)
1. Trembling or throbbing of the eyelids.
	 2. A throb, tremor.
	 3.
Emotion of the mind.
 E. स्फुर् to move or swell, aff. क्त ।
