स्फुर्ज्ज|स्फुर्ज
स्फुर्ज्ज r. 1st cl. (स्फुर्ज्जति)
	 1. To thunder, to clash, to explode.
	 2. To
burn, to glitter. With वि, 1. To resound.
	 2. To roar, (as wind.)
	 3.
To increase.: more properly स्फूर्ज्ज् ।
