स्फुल्
स्फुल् r. 6th cl. (स्फुलति)
	 1. To throb, to vibrate.
	 2. To heap, to collect.
3. To be manifest or apparent.
	 4. To dart forth.
	 5. To go or
move.
	 6. To kill, to slay.
	 7. To expand.
