स्मार्त्त|स्मार्त|स्मार्तः|स्मार्त्तं|स्मार्त्तः
स्मार्त्त mfn. (-र्त्तः-र्त्ती-र्त्तं)
	 1. Legal, canonical, according to the doctrines
of the Smṛtis or inspired codes of law.
	 2. Following or professing
the doctrine of the law-books.
	 3. Memorial, relating to memory.
4. Within memory, what may be remembered.
	 m. (-र्त्तः)
	 1. A
Brāhman following the revealed law.
	 2. One who knows the tra-
ditional law.
	 3. Name of a peculiar sect.
 E. स्मृति law collectively,
and अण् aff. of reference, &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=818-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मार्त्तकाल|स्मार्तकाल|स्मार्तकालः
स्मार्त्तकाल m. (-लः) Time to which memory may extend; according to
the jurists, as far as a century.
 E. स्मार्त्त, and काल time.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=818-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मि
स्मि r. 10th cl. (स्माययते) To slight, to disregard. (स्माययति) To astonish.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=818-b" target="_blank">Page818-b+ 60</a>]
r. 1st cl. (स्मयते)
	 1. To smile.
	 2. To expand, to bloom. With उद्,
To smile. With वि, 1. To be surprised.
	 2. To admire.
	 3. To be
proud. Caus. (स्माययति-ते, स्मापयते)
	 1. To cause to laugh.
	 2. To mock.
3. To astonish, (in this sense only स्मापयत). Also ष्मिङ् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=818-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मिट्
स्मिट् r. 10th cl. (स्मेटयति-ते)
	 1. To slight, to disregard, to disrespect.
	 2.
To love.
	 3. To go.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=818-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मित|स्मितं
स्मित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Smiling.
	 2. Blown, (as a flower.)
	 n. (-तं) A smile,
a gentle laugh.
 E. ष्मि to smile, aff. क्त.
