<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मृ
स्मृ r. 1st cl. (स्मरति)
	 1. To remember, to recollect, to call to mind.
	 2.
To remember with regret, to miss, (with a genitive.)
	 3. To record
in a Smṛti.
	 4. To recite mentally the name of a deity. r. 5th cl.
(स्मृणोति)
	 1. To please or delight.
	 2. To guard, to protect, to
cherish.
	 3. To breathe or live. With वि prefixed, To forget. With
सम्, To remember. With अप, To forget. With अनु, To remember.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=818-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मृत|स्मृतः
स्मृत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Recollected, remembered, called to mind.
 E. स्मृ to
remember, aff. क्त ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=818-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मृति|स्मृतिः
स्मृति f. (-तिः)
	 1. Recollection, remembrance, memory.
	 2. Law, the
body of law, (civil and religious,) as delivered originally by MANU-
YĀJNAWALKYA and other inspired legislators, to their respective
pupils, and committed by them from recollection to writing,
(as opposed to श्रुति or revelation.)
	 3. A law-book, a code of laws.
4. Wish, desire.
	 5. Understanding.
 E. स्मृ to remember, aff. क्तिन् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=818-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

