स्यन्द्|स्यंद्
स्यन्द् (ऊ) स्यन्दू r. 1st cl. (स्यन्दते)
	 1. To sprinkle, to drop, to ooze or distil.
2. To go.
	 3. To run, to flee. With अनु prefixed, अनुष्यन्दते or अनुस्यन्दते
to drop, &c. With अभि, 1. To rain out.
	 2. To be melted. With
नि, To flow; the sibilant being optionally changed after this and
other prepositions.
