	 2. Going quickly.
	 m.
(-नः)
	 1. A war-chariot.
	 2. A tree, (Dalbergia ougeinensis.) “तिनिश
वृक्षे” । 3. A Jina of the past era.
	 4. Air, wind.
	 n. (-नं)
	 1. Dropping,
oozing, trickling.
	 2. Water.
	 3. Going swiftly.
	 f. (-नी) Saliva. E.
स्यन्द् to go, युच् or ल्युट् aff.
