<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वस्तिवाचन|स्वस्तिवाचनं
स्वस्तिवाचन n. (-नं)
	 1. A religious rite, preparatory to a sacrifice or any
important observance, in which the Brāhmans strew boiled rice
on the ground, and invoke the blessings of the gods on the
ceremony about to commence.
	 2. An offering of flowers, sweet-
meat, &c., to any one intended to secure good wishes and blessings.
E. स्वस्ति inceptive and benedictory particle, वाचन uttering.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=823-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
