<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=826-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हंहो
हंहो Ind.
	 1. An interjection of calling, (ho, hollo!)
	 2. A particle of
haughtiness or arrogance.
	 3. An arrogantly interrogative particle.
In drama it is found used as a form of address in speeches
assigned to characters of the middling class.
 E. हं and हो both
vocative particles.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=826-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हक्क|हक्कः
हक्क m. (-क्कः) The calling of elephants.
 E. हक् imitative sound, कै to utter, ड aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=826-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हक्कार|हक्कारः
हक्कार m. (-रः) Calling, calling to.
 E. हक् sound of calling, कार making.
