हठ|हठः
हठ m. (-ठः)
	 1. Violence.
	 2. Oppression.
	 3. Rapine.
	 mf. (-ठः-ठी) An
aquatic plant, (Pistia stratiotes.)
 E. हठ् to treat with violence,
aff. अच् । The instrumental and ablative singulars, “हठेन” and
“हठात्” are used as indeclinables in the sense of “forcibly,”
“violently,” “suddenly.”
