हनु|हनुः
हनु mfn. (-नुः-नुः or नूः-नु)
	 1. The jaw.
	 2. The chin.
	 f. (-नुः)
	 1. A drug and
perfume: see हट्टविलासिनी.
	 2. A weapon.
	 3. Sickness.
	 4. Death, dying.
5. A prostitute.
 E. हन् to hurt or kill, aff. उत्; also with ऊङ्, हनू ।
