	 2. Pale,
yellowish white, (the colour.)
	 3. White.
	 4. VIṢṆU.
	 5. ŚIVA.
	 6. The
sun.
	 7. A goose.
	 8. A minor division of the world.
	 f. (-णी)
	 1. A
doe.
	 2. A golden image.
	 3. A woman, one of the four kinds, the
same as the CHITRINI, or female of the man termed MRIGA.
