हलाहल|हलाहलं|हलाहलः
हलाहल mn. (-लः-लं)
	 1. A sort of deadly poison produced at the
churning of the ocean.
	 2. A poison in general.
	 m. (-लः)
	 1. A kind
of snake.
	 2. A Jaina or Bauddha deified saint.
	 3. A sort of lizard
or newt.
 E. हल् to plough, अच् aff., अ negative, and हल the same;
also हलहल, हालहल, हालाहल, हहल, हाहल and हाहाल ।
