<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हलिन्
हलिन् m. (-ली)
	 1. BALADEVA.
	 2. A ploughman, a cultivator.
	 f. (-नी)
	 1.
A plant, commonly Lāngaliya.
	 2. A number of ploughs.
 E. हल a
plough, इनि aff.
