	 1. The act of offer-
ing an oblation with fire.
	 2. An oblation so offered.
	 3. Invocation.
4. Calling.
	 f. (-नी) A hole made in the ground for receiving
a sacrificial fire.
 E. हु to sacrifice, ल्युट् or युच् aff.
