हिंसा
हिंसा f. (-सा)
	 1. Injury, mischief, hurt, harm, &c.; it is usually
distinguished as of three sorts,:--mental, (as malice,) verbal, (as
abuse,) personal, (as striking, wounding, &c.)
	 2. Slaughter, killing,
slaying.
	 3. Robbery.
 E. हिस्रि to hurt or kill, affs. अङ् and टाप्.
