हिण्डीर m. (-रः)
	 1. Cuttle-fish-bone, considered to be the indurated
foam of the sea.
	 2. A man, a male.
	 3. The egg-plant, (Solanum
melongena.)
	 4. A tonic or stomachic.
 E. हिडि to go, or despise,
aff. ईरन्; also with इरन्, हिण्डिर ।
