ही
ही Ind.
	 1. An exclamation or interjection of surprise.
	 2. Of fatigue or
despondence.
	 3. Of sorrow.
	 4. A particle implying reason or cause,
(therefore, so.)
 E. हन् to hurt, डी aff., हि substituted for the root.
