हीन|हीनः
हीन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं)
	 1. Deficient, defective.
	 2. Blamable, mean, base,
vile, bad.
	 3. Left, abandoned, quitted.
	 4. Wasted, worn, decayed.
5. Void of, free from.
	 6. Lower, less.
	 m. (-नः) An insufficient or
objectionable witness.
 E. हा to quit, aff. क्त ।
