हृषीक|हृषीकं
हृषीक n. (-कं) Any organ of sense.
 E. हृष् to affirm falsely, ईकक् Unādi
aff, and the radical vowel unchanged.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=836-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हृषीकेश|हृषीकेशः
