हृष्ट|हृष्टः
हृष्ट mfn. (-ष्टः-ष्टा-ष्टं)
	 1. Pleased, glad, delighted.
	 2. Laughing, smiling.
3. Having the hair of the body erect with pleasure.
	 4. Asto-
nished, surprised.
	 5. Disappointed.
 E. हृष् to be pleased, or to
affirm falsely, aff. क्तः see हृषित ।
