हेति|हेतिः
हेति f. (-तिः)
	 1. A weapon.
	 2. A ray of the sun.
	 3. Light, splendour.
	 4.
Flame.
 E. हि to go, or हन् to kill, aff. क्तिन्; the form is irr.
