हेत्वाभास|हेत्वाभासः
हेत्वाभास m. (-सः) (In logic,) Fallacious semblance of reason or argu-
ment, assignment of proof or cause which can be shown to be
incorrect, the faulty reasoning for an inference; it is of five kinds,
viz:--BYABHICHĀRA, VIRUDDHATĀ, ASIDDHI, SATPRATIPAK
SHATĀ, and BĀDHA.
 E. हेतु, and आभास semblance.
