<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होमि|होमिः
होमि m. (-मिः)
	 1. Clarified butter.
	 2. Fire.
	 3. Water.
 E. हु to sacrifice,
मिन् aff., or इन aff, and मुट् augment.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=838-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
