होमिन्
होमिन् m. (-मी) The offerer of an oblation.
 E. हु to sacrifice, मिनि Unādi aff.; or होम, इनि aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=838-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होम्य|होम्यं
होम्य f. (-म्या) Belonging to or fit for an oblation.
 E. होम, यत् aff.; also
होमीय f. (-या).
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=838-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होरा
होरा f. (-रा)
	 1. The rising of a sign of the zodiac.
	 2. Part of the
duration of a sign, the twenty-fourth part of a day, an hour.
	 3.
A mark, a line.
	 4. A science or work in science, (on astrology.) E.
होड् to go, to proceed, affs. अच् and टाप्, and ड changed to र ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=838-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होलाका
होलाका f. (-का)
	 1. The spring-festival held at the approach of the
vernal season, the ceremony of throwing a red powder called Phāg,
(held during the ten days preceding the full-moon-day of the
month of Fālguna.)
	 2. The full-moon-day in the month of
Fālguna; also read होली f. (-ली).
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=838-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होहौ
होहौ Ind.
	 1. An interjection of calling.
	 2. An exclamation of
challenging or defiance.
 E. हो, and हौ both the same.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=838-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हौ
हौ Ind.
	 1. An interjection of defiance or challenge.
	 2. A vocative
particle.
 E. ह्वेञ् to call, डौ aff.
