<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्नु
ह्नु r. 2nd cl. (ह्नुते)
	 1. To take away, to rob.
	 2. To withhold, to conceal.
3. To hide from any one, (with a dative.) With अप prefixed, To
conceal, to hide. With नि, 1. To conceal.
	 2. To deny before any
one, (with a dative.)
