ह्रीजित|ह्रीजितः
ह्रीजित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Modest, ashamed.
 E. ह्री shame, and, जित overcome.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=839-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रीण|ह्रीणः
ह्रीण mfn. (-णः-णा-णं) Ashamed, bashful.
 E. ह्री to be ashamed, aff. क्त,
and त changed to ण; deriv. irr.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=839-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रीत|ह्रीतः
ह्रीत mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Ashamed, bashful, modest.
 E. ह्री to be ashamed, aff. क्त.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=839-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रीनिरास|ह्रीनिरासः
ह्रीनिरास m. (-सः) Shamelessness.
 E. ह्री, and निरास throwing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=839-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रीमत्|ह्रीमन्त्
ह्रीमत् mfn. (-मान्-मती-मत्) Bashful, modest, ashamed.
 E. ह्री, and मतुप् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=839-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रीयन्त्रणा|ह्रीयंत्रणा
ह्रीयन्त्रणा f. (-णा) The constraint of bashfulness.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=839-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रीवेर|ह्रीवेरं
ह्रीवेर n. (-रं) A drug and perfume, Commonly Bālā.
 E. ह्री shame, and
वेर saffron: see the next.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=839-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रीवेल|ह्रीवेलं
ह्रीवेल n. (-लं) A drug and perfume: see the last.
 E. ह्रीवेर as before, र
changed to ल; also with कन् added, ह्रीवेलक ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=839-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रुड्
ह्रुड् (ऋ) ह्रुडृ r. 1st cl. (ह्रोडते)
	 1. To collect.
	 2. To go.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=839-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रूड्
ह्रूड् (ऋ) ह्रूडृ r. 1st cl. (ह्रूडति)
	 1. To collect.
	 2. To go.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=839-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रेप्
ह्रेप् (ऋ) ह्रेपृ r. 1st cl. (ह्रेपते) To go.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=839-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रेपण|ह्रेपणं
ह्रेपण n. (-ण) Putting to shame, excelling, surpassing.
 E. ह्री to be ashamed, causal v., ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=839-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रेपयत्
ह्रेपयत् mfn. (-यन्-यन्ती-यत्) Putting to shame, outvieing, surpassing. E.
ह्री to be ashamed, causal v., शतृ aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=839-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रीपित
ह्रीपित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं)
	 1. Made ashamed, put to shame.
	 2. Excelled,
surpassed.
 E. ह्री to be ashamed, causal v., क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=839-a" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रेष्
ह्रेष् (ऋ) ह्रेषृ r. 1st cl. (ह्रेषते)
	 1. To sound inarticulately, to neigh, (as
horse.)
	 2. To go, to move.
	 3. To creep.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=839-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रेषा
ह्रेषा f. (-षा) Neighing as a horse.
 E. ह्रेष् to neigh, affs. अ and टाप् see हेषा; also read ह्लेषा
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=839-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रोड्
ह्रोड् (ऋ) ह्रोडृ r. 1st cl. (ह्रोडति) To go, to move.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=839-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रौड्
ह्रौड् (ऋ) हौडृ r. 1st cl. (ह्रौडते) To go.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=839-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्लग्
ह्लग् (ए) ह्णगे r. 1st cl. (ह्लगति) To cover.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=839-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्लप्
ह्लप् r. 10th cl. (ह्लापयति-ते) To speak, to speak articulately: also ह्रप् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=839-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्लस्
ह्लस् r. 1st cl. (ह्लसति) To sound.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=839-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्लाद्
ह्लाद् (ई) ह्लादी r. 1st cl. (ह्लादते)
	 1. To gladden, to delight.
	 2. To be glad
or delighted.
	 3. To sound, especially as a musical instrument.
With आ, To be delighted.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=839-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्लाद|ह्लादः
ह्लाद m. (-दः) Pleasure, joy.
 E. ह्लाद् to be glad, aff. अच् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=839-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्लादन|ह्लादनं
ह्लादन n. (-नं) Joy, delight.
 E. ह्लाद् to be glad, and ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=839-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्लादित
ह्लादित mfn. (-तः-ता-तं) Delighted, happy.
 E. ह्लाद् to be happy, क्त aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=839-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्लादिन्
ह्लादिन् mfn. (-दी-दिनी-दि) Happy, glad.
	 f. (-नी)
	 1. Lightning.
	 2. INDRA'S
thunderbolt.
	 3. A river in general.
	 4. The Olibanum tree: see
ह्रादिनी.
 E. ह्लाद् pleasure, इनि and ङीष् affs.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=839-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्लीका
ह्लीका f. (-का) Shame, modesty.
 E. ह्री to be ashamed, कन् Unādi aff. र changed to ल
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=839-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्लीकु|ह्लीकुः
ह्लीकु mfn. (-कुः-कुः-कु) Ashamed, modest.
	 m. (-कुः)
	 1. Lac.
	 2. Tin.
 E. ह्री
to be ashamed, aff. कुक्, र changed to ल; otherwise read ह्रीकु ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=839-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्लेषा
ह्लेषा f. (-षा) Neighing, (as a horse,) braying, (as an ass, &c.)
 E. ह्लेष् for
ह्रेष् to neigh, &c., affs. अ and टाप् ।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=839-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्वल्
ह्वल् r. 1st cl. (-ह्वलति)
	 1. To move.
	 2. To shake.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=839-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्वान|ह्वानं
ह्वान n. (-नं)
	 1. The act of calling.
	 2. A cry.
 E. ह्वे to call, ल्युट् aff.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=839-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्वृ
ह्वृ r. 1st cl. (ह्वरति)
	 1. To bend, to curve, to make crooked.
	 2. To be
crooked in conduct, to deceive.
	 3. To be injured.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=839-b" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्वे
ह्वे r. 1st cl. (ह्वयति-ते)
	 1. To call.
	 2. To invoke, to call upon.
	 3. To
challenge.
	 4. To name.
	 5. To ask, to beg.
	 6. To emulate, to vie
with, to wish to overcome or surpass.
	 7. To struggle or contend
with. With आ, To call, to invite. With सम्, To call out together.
With उप, नि, वि or सम्, the verb is deponent, (उपह्वयते); also with
आङ् if rivalry be signified, (आह्वयते) He challenges.
THE END.
